      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem przestaje się nawet za tym tęsknić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę tak powiedzieć, bo to nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leje jak z cebra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem następuje uzasadnienie, jak zwykle przekonujące, ale nieprawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosna jak o kochanego mężczyznę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Marcinku, trzeba na lekcji uważać — upomina pani łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybrał jedno i zamienił z krzesłem ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, moja droga, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczyłoby sił na gonitwę, sanki, łyżwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otchłań płciowa z hipopotamem włochatym „na blond”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że morderca spełniał akt w stanie na pół przytomnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To on! — zaświtała myśl pewna jak oczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola musiała nim potrząsać, zanim oprzytomniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jednej chwili zamilkł tłum cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, czego nam brak! — zawołał, uderzając się dłonią w czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem nie do rozwiązania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dżungla oddaje to, co zabrała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekanie przyprawiało go zawsze o lekki bół brzucha i potrzebę oddania moczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięcie w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest bardziej swobodne rolnictwo, bardziej swobodni rolnicy i wolny handel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście wystarczy, byśmy pamiętali o decyzji Rosjan o niepodpisywaniu karty energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego potrzebujemy silnej polityki, a zwłaszcza bardziej zdecydowanej i wiarygodnej polityki energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ai Weiwei to artysta światowej sławy, który wzbogacił chińską kulturę i sztukę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda wyjdzie zawsze na jaw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, już znamy, już wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25311353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.476,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brama była żelazna kratowana osadzona mocno pomiędzy dwoma słupkami o heraldycznych upiększeniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25311354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam więc do mojego rozporządzenia przywilej królewski na to mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25311355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówił z trwogą: „Ja nie jestem ten sam...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25311356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak myślisz, Jerzy, czy nie powinniśmy się modlić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego go lubię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszedł tedy do starego sklepikarza na Starym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okej, jaka jest pogoda dzisiaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajko mądrzejsze od kury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka znowu na jego wyznanie — długo, tęsknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jeźdźców rozproszyła się w różne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym kapitanem i gospodarzem był dyrektor różnych towarzystw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38987305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeci i ostatni punkt mojego wystąpienia dotyczy siedziby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38987306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stały wzrost oczekiwanej długości życia obywateli europejskich to doskonała wiadomość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38987307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś, jutro, pojutrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38987308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energia jest dziś przedmiotem wspólnej odpowiedzialności i toruje drogę wspólnej polityce europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz prawo zachować milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zaakcentować tę kwestię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artysta ma prawo wyrażać wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądam na zegar: spałem zaledwie godzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na terenie obiektu obowiązkowe jest zasłanianie nosa i ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Członkowie przyjdą w mundurach i zarzucą miotły na ramiona o samej dziesiątej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25269047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmarzliście w tych fotelach, podczas gdy ja otuliłam się tak ciepło kołdrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25269048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo elegancki bogaty pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25269050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie zadawał sobie takich pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25269051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz mniejsza o to, potrafię zachować to co zdobyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30651233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mutatis mutandis coś podobnego dzieje się dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30651234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lekceważę skali trudności sytuacji i tempa jej zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30651235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontrole weterynaryjne zwierząt wprowadzanych do Wspólnoty z krajów trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30651236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodzenie tych planów zależy tylko i wyłącznie od naszej woli politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień przewalały się chmury, jakby gotując się do walnej rozprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i przestałem się pytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz wyczuwał jeszcze pocieszający uścisk dłoni proboszcza, widział jego zasmucone spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobaw się z nami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wcisnęła go pomiędzy wargi i zanurzyła w jego miąższ swe białe, ostre zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki głową uparcie pokręcił, zaprzeczając z góry wszelkim domniemaniom łatwowiernego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21487323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądził, że przyjętym zostanie bez ceremonii, jako wtajemniczony już w Chicago.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21487325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszny czarny mężczyzna podszedł do kobiety i zaczął związywać jej ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21487330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujęła go za rękę, zmusiła usiąść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21487332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbudziłem go i powiedziałem mu, że nadeszła godzina zemsty za jego dawne zbrodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolała go głowa i oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uśmiecha się raz jeszcze i znika w głębi mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to przy innych mężczyznach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szepty zapełniły mały park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą kto wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27134352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kwestia została już poruszona przez niektórych posłów przemawiających wcześniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27134353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia ta ma tym większe znaczenie, bowiem dotyczy prawodawstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27134354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontynuowanie polityki zerowej tolerancji stanowi zagrożenie dla całego łańcucha produkcji żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27134355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak pozostaje kilka kwestii, które wymagają dyskusji w związku z tą awarią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego nie powiesiłeś, tego nie masz — mówi woźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa była tak chaotyczna, że nic nie można było zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Never more.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynurzymy ją z torby! — rzekł Podlasiak troskliwie i stanowczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się, idąc ulicą, jak mu się nudziło, w kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do fortepianu dziwnie miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34938116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.26,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wykorzystać tę szansę podczas spotkań wysłanników kwartetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34938117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski jest głęboko wstrząśnięty i zasmucony tym zdarzeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34938118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga to ustawodawstwa horyzontalnego, a także ustaw sektorowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34938119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki wsparcia dla inwestycji mających na celu zwiększenie efektywności energetycznej i stosowanie energii odnawialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz cudowny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakaś lekcja odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byliśmy nigdy w życiu tacy bogaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36080070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oczywiste, że jej polityka zmierza we właściwym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36080071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nasze cele są takie same\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36080072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za państwa wysiłki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36080073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nasz punkt wyjścia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam są Anka i Rena i one go poznają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położył się na brzegu lejka i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źródłem wszelkiego zła jest świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kim lubisz być, zbójem czy policjantem? — Lubię być policjantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zachowywał się całkiem zwyczajnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie pisali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miała ta przejażdżka pomiędzy kamienicami szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawiła go ta gra w ciuciubabkę z nie przeczuwającym nic przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jedenastej znowu poszedłem do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalał eteru na chustkę i wdychał go powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale żal!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzałem przez lunetę na księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On sam go zapomniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Własny rozum powinien panu powiedzieć, że nie pozostawało mi nic innego do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi ulicami, zaułkami i placami sunęły barwne tłumy ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy są kolejne wybory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto wronie gniazdo na głowie dziewczynki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli przez miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41649999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym przypomnieć o jednym, ostatnim punkcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41650001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubolewam, iż posłowie Parlamentu Europejskiego odrzucili poprawki zmierzające do zbalansowania raportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41650002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zastosować najwyższą ostrożność w procesie negocjacji, żeby nie popełnić tu żadnych błędów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41650003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gorąco wierzymy, że Białoruś powinna zostać zaangażowana w tę nową inicjatywę od samego początku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40696458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komunistyczna Partia Grecji głosuje przeciwko zarówno sprawozdaniu, jak i wnioskowi Komisji dotyczącemu dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40696462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że wkrótce będziemy mogli rozpocząć negocjacje zmierzające do tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40696464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam zatem nadzieję, że agencja będzie zdolna do zwrócenia na nie uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40696466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wzywam Komisję do opracowania nowej strategii handlu międzynarodowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20889001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podobam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20889002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruch antyszczepionkowy jako przykład teorii spiskowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20889004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy słońce wzeszło uważał za stosowne położyć się i odpocząć po dramatycznych wrażeniach nocnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20889005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też przez pewien czas po wyjeździe czuł się jak zbłąkany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38752113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się Wokulskiemu, że w tej chwili widzi przed sobą trzy światy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38752114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miliony ludzi zarabiających na swoje utrzymanie ciężką codzienną pracą chcą fundamentalnej zmiany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38752115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery lata temu grupy robocze Komisji stanowiły wielką tajemnicę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38752116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włochom także się to nie uda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty tu? — zapytał mistrz zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28647680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich sytuacji nie możemy akceptować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28647681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podatnicy europejscy i pracownicy innych europejskich zakładów spółki Opel nie powinni za to płacić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28647682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że Komisja powinna podjąć ponowną próbę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28647683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klimat Ziemi czekał już wystarczająco długo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wesela się zagoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39571509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postawiono go na stole i... o, dziwo!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39571510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak właśnie zrobimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39571512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście umowa z Mauretanią w sprawie połowów nabiera szczególnego znaczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39571513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gratuluję Serbii wysiłków na rzecz ograniczenia wpływu komunistycznych struktur na jej rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące turbin nerwowych, gdy ktoś już jest chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzi w twoich warkoczykach i śmieje się z ciebie do rozpuku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Las niby się skończył, ale ani szosy, ani rowu przy szosie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gdzież są ludzie, którzy mają spalić jej ciało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jął nasłuchiwać, a szczurze jego serduszko zaczęło bić gwałtownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym — zapewnił tamten badając wylot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj mu tyle zabawek, ma ich już dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25072379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tą śliczną panienką była Blanka, którą wszyscy wykwintnisie podziwiali z zajęciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25072381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz cię załatwię, raz, dwa, trzy i po tobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25072382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już wiem...“ Zdawało jej się, że odgadła Wokulskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25072383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Łęcki i damy starsze winszowały mu; panna Izabela milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem coś, co mam do powiedzenia — obiecała tajemniczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ja jestem tym wszystkim” — można było o niej powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I balon za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szło im trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on to zrobił bez prezerwatywy, zresztą mam już miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała zmęczonym głosem: — Muszę jeszcze powtórzyć łacinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co?! — zawołał pan Ryszard otwierając oczy szeroko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nie znosiła dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Czy widzisz te krowy tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro pójdziemy w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mnie obawy nie ma…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielki kryzys lat trzydziestych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Historia, którą ci chcę opowiedzieć, jest bardzo wesoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak też było i w tej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suknia na twarz rzucona zasłoniła lice\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy można tą ścierką, to wytrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem o parę kroków przed nim i zacząłem go usypiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wierusz odprowadzał chorą materię już ku palcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu stanął na miejscu, opuścił ramię prawe i znieruchomiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wolę pójść na nogach niż autobusem pojechać, żeby się z ludźmi nie spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy w chłopskiej chałupie, był jeszcze taki słaby, że trudno mu było samemu chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kolega Adama, Stach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjawy stają się coraz bardziej nieprzyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracował dla agencji, z którą mamy rozmawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za napój?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25183940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie dopuść aby go zabili!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25183941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Na Koguci zaułek nie mogę jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25183942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże przejdę obok niej, aby mnie nie zatrzymała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25183943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy cały czas tylko internet i smartfony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25183944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że nie lubisz Androida, ale ja po prostu mam inne gusta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to mógł być? — spytałem zdumiony swego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta doskonale: kiedyś przeziębił się — przyszło zapalenie płuc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ona to przeczuwa i dlatego boi się stanowczego kroku?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźcie pod uwagę ilość popularyzujących dzieł w Niemczech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego nie powiesiłeś, tego nie masz — mówi woźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Kochasz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazimy do pokoju przez okienko z łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była już na linii moich schodów i widocznie chciała tu wylądować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby kózka nie skakała, to by nóżki nie złamał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, a teraz, panienko, czas wstawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do drugiej nad ranem posłyszałem nagle szum wody, nadchodziła fala powodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22856328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tem jednak nie było mowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22856329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwyciłem sztabę, wszedłem na stołek, i głową i ramionami przedostałem się przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22856330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach jego przyszła mi nowa myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22856331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przed sobą dziesięć mil równiny, zanim dostanę się do łańcucha gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22856332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak się spóźniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj, że niezależnie od tego kim byłeś, zawsze możesz się zmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale czy książki mówią prawdę? — marszcząc brew zapytał pan Ryszard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to być kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39638670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze istniały dążenia do centralizacji kontroli w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39638671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą mieć charakter globalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39638672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w paszach zwierzęcych jest zbyt dużo antybiotyków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39638673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo dla mnie niezawsze las jest piękny, czasem bywa okropny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39638674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne etapy rozwoju zarządzania granicami w Unii Europejskiej i podobne doświadczenia w krajach trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo powie, jak nad jarem i nad strumieniem! — gardłował kulawiec, podrygując niecałą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Socjopata nie potrafi żyć w społeczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I od razu przypomniała sobie radę staruszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na tę myśl zadygotały pod nim nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukłoniłem się sztywno, co wskazywało, jak sądzę, jakiego nabrałem o nich przekonania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien był się cieszyć, jak gdyby się po raz drugi urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna stanęła nad jego łóżkiem i pochyliła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżby coś podobnego było możliwym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie rozmawialiśmy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem o parę kroków przed nim i zacząłem go usypiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy pokazać, że potrafimy chronić zdrowie obywateli i trwałość środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja zapowiedziała znaczące wysiłki w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją dwie przyczyny, dla których ta reforma była i jest niezbędna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtarzam, to całkowicie niemoralne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie tutaj potrzebne są euroobligacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilowy zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaletą bycia twoim sąsiadem jest to, że mam do dyspozycji dwie kuchnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20741604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20741605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20741606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nago, jestem pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20741607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20741608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obciąć mu ręce i nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest kurze jajko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez szyby dojrzałem wkrótce białe czoło, brwi ciemne, wiśniowe usta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nalewał wody do wanny i robił okręty z papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowita prawda została mu przezna czona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my, niestety, nie możemy czuwać nad nim w owych chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł ręką rozpalone czoło, nowy dreszcz go przeleciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — odrzekł po chwili — o to chodzi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38131190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Producenci mleka nie potrzebują pani współczucia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38131191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zalecam Izbie przyjęcie tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38131192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tybetu w pełni popieram to stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38131193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.972,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego punktu widzenia niezmiernie niepokoi nas pomysł stworzenia europejskiego rynku praw autorskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38131194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzał rytmicznie w bębenek przytupując lewą stopą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że sztuczne, zrobione z jakiejś masy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze wówczas dębem, przykutym do miejsca i do własnego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32974620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio wiele mówiliśmy o kryzysie i sposobach jego przezwyciężenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32974621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomocne byłoby, gdybyśmy wszyscy zdawali sobie z tego sprawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32974622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wielka zdobycz warta wzmożonego wysiłku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32974623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy tu, aby przekazać niepokój, krzyk o przetrwanie kreatywnych sił europejskiej wsi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32974624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez tego, po Guantanamo pojawi się jakieś inne niedobre rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z teczkami pod pachą, rozmawiali o przeczytanych książ kach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zwariowałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ona uszła jeszcze kilka kroków, z uśmiechem zawróciła i znalazła go, bez szukania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wzięto nas za małżeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie jednak musiałem czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny ułatwić korzystanie z tego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w domu okazało się, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No mam nadzieję, że jest w dobrym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy krytyk jest postacią niezwykłą i odmienną od wszystkich śmiertelników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22793746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwiać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22793747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wy, co tak stoicie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22793748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z jednym szwadronem tego pułku zniósłbym tych opryszków w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22793749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokaż ręce, niech założę kajdanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22793750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem już takiego połączenia siły, piękności i wdzięku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zawsze, że on „to” skończy, nie Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawał się już nieraz chodzić tą drogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek chodził na demonstracje, ale wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszych wierszy nie można było pochwycić uchem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie tego nie warto mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stacja jest domkiem z małym ogródkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne stworzenie nie umie stawać dęba i wykonywać skoków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwała się z miejsca i nachyliła nad Cezarym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy od dawna tu leżę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc ja ci udowodnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koty i psy to najpopularniejsze zwierzęta domowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedzcie sami na zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, a teraz, panienko, czas wstawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy raz jestem na żaglówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale czy książki mówią prawdę? — marszcząc brew zapytał pan Ryszard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38388019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te działania bowiem muszą mieć charakter skoordynowany, gdyż byłyby wtedy znacznie bardziej efektywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38388020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ta sprawa dotyczy całego społeczeństwa - ludzi młodych, kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38388021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"słowo honoru, on na to nie zasłużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38388022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardziej refleksja przelana na papier, którą teraz poddaje się przyspieszonej procedurze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38388023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ich potrzebujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagali się od niego, by im wyjaśnił, co mają czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzucał karty i odczytywał urywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy Emil zrobił nieokreśloną minę i rozbeczał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nalegaj, Kazik, dłużej, bo się pogniewamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna żyć, jak ciotka-tancerka, tylko lukiem o wiele wyższym i in nym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22803186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa ręka pańska jest nieco większa niż lewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22803187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwyciłem więc pana na miejscu sam, aby nie stracić zaufania bandy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22803188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz może jakąś dobrą restaurację?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22803189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła potem jego siódemka pikowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22803190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce upaliłem spory kawał drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego wypluć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myć się nie chcieli, a w taką wielką wodę lecą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki głową uparcie pokręcił, zaprzeczając z góry wszelkim domniemaniom łatwowiernego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akcent słów brzmiał trochę obco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to? — zawołał, wskazując na trawę o kilka kroków od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym szedł po niej, woda sięgała mi do kolan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zerwał się jak raniony jeleń, pełen rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cygaro żarzyło się powoli, rozpylając po przedziale obłoczki sinawego dymu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba przyznać, że raz na zawsze nauczył się dużo i dużym kosztem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwarłszy usta, wytrzeszczyły w górę oczy i jęły się naradzać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W piętnastym roku życia urodziła dziecko i odtąd już się nie pokazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Naturalnie z podziękowaniem nie przyjąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołałem ująć tę wizję, mnich na nowo stał się mnichem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to dla mnie cios.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzi do szkoły podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21426616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy oprócz liter nic więcej pan nie zauważył na obwódce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21426617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginął w gorącej walce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21426618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziawszy to, Dola zniknęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21426619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor przybyły znalazł i chorobę wątroby, i różne inne naruszenia organizmu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21426620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utwory te staną się kamieniem węgielnym dla naszej nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela potrząsnęła głową, jakby chcąc odpędzić przykre myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sto pytań huczało mi kołowrotem w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam się zbadaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy czasem nie jest heretykiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dręczył mnie całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hm… szczególne, szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tych bram, i domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hę? — intruz nastawił uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to jest cudowna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy oczekiwałem go na stacji, gdy mnie zobaczył, trzeba było widzieć jego oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu przestał dlatego, że Emil przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — szepnął z uśmiechem i pogardliwie spojrzawszy na jednorękiego, przywołał go ruchem dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak obojętny jest na pozór list Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem tego samego zdania! — zgodził się muł — Widocznie mamy wspólne upodobania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20595585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś siedzi nad morzem, rzuca w wodę kamyki i myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20595586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie udawał, że ma coś załatwić w gabinecie dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20595587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszło, minęło — myślmy o chwili obecnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20595588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmego roku życia nie płakałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20595589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet własne wojsko ciebie nie lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrojem będzie rodzaj miłości, który nie daje żadnych objawów somatycznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdawała sobie sprawy z tego, jak długo spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Honor za honor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30861673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"prawdopodobieństwo sfałszowania jest różne, podobnie jak ryzyko dla zdrowia publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30861708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jeszcze na koniec powiedzieć kilka słów o dyrektywie w sprawie produktów tytoniowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30861745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, czasem mówi się, że brak wiadomości to dobra wiadomość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30861746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy powiedzieliby, że Morze Czarne jest małym morzem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30861747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Petycje odzwierciedlają istotny wizerunek stosowania europejskiego prawodawstwa i jego wpływ na obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładę się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco chorobliwie dokładne mycie genitaliów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciebie już nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż mnie one obchodzić mogą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje, kopalnie, tartaki i przedsiębiorstwa okrętowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro pójdziemy w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci powiem, czego się boisz: Boisz się stężenia, śmierci — jak wosk tężeje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy trochę zaczekać, aż któraś podpłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala zrobiła sarenkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pyskuj! — zawołał z powziętą z góry na wszelki przypadek urazą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotarli wreszcie do pierwszego jaru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest stanowczo ktoś inny — uspokoił ją, wchodząc do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie przypomina kształtem kłącza małego człowieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież to wzruszające widowisko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"miał dziwne oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty — i Mea i Kali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej samej chwili przyjechał wózek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem telefonował na wszystkie strony świata i nikogo nie zastał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż łaskawy pan może jej przeciwstawić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz się ścigać z tramwajem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Emil znikł za rogiem, zaczął biec i biegł tak aż do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napijesz się czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie ulęknę się ciebie, o smoku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owego ranka było coś tajemniczego w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj ładni i mają takie czerwone usta, jakby ciągle się całowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzyliśmy też tymczasem swoje, na szczęście lekkie rany i trochę wypoczęliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewnie ten nowy sąsiad z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem naprzód, aby się dowiedzieć, czy skłonny jesteś go przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostał powideł i wrócił do rysowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez fundację Nowoczesna Polska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jutro rano odbędzie się tutaj konferencja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krys tyna powiedziała: Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23800862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba więcej, ażebyś został jej najlepszym przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23800863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wielką damą, która będzie potrzebowała rozlicznych strojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23800864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mówię ci, bądź spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23800865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślać się, do pioruna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23800866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś ostatni dzień, który mogę z panem spędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie o to chodzi, nie o zdrowie... jakże to powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciała jego wilcy Żarłoczni nie rozszarpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pragnę, muszę jeszcze żyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energii koncentrują się na nowych technologiach i bezpieczeństwie w dziedzinie energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zatrzymywałem go, bo mnie trochę zraził swoją wiarą w skruchę baronowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja zaczęła być zajmującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy skończyłaś już robotę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydkich nóg nie da się ukryć całkowicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy mężczyzna zgubił się gdzieś w tłumie pasażerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekoladowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25049602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczmy jak drzwi te były zbudowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25049603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skrzypienia pod nogami doszedłem do wniosku, że stąpam po suchym piasku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25049605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jeżeli mama nie żyje, więc jej fotografia też powinna być trochę wytarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25049607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kielich do mnie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25049608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Coza szczególny traf!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39600188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaprzeczamy temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39600189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy po prostu sięgnąć po dostępne pieniądze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39600190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście liberalizacja gospodarki jest celem, do którego należy dążyć stopniowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39600191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowanie odbędzie się na zakończenie debat popołudniowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39600192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"brak okupacji, brak interwencji militarnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciekam z siebie powoli, zostaje miękka skorupa, zdeformowany kształt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało mi się, że nad strumieniem wszystko się wyjaśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiadomo foki zapędza się po prostu do rzeźni niby barany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39595956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować Parlamentowi za okazanie swojego wsparcia dla propozycji Komisji z sierpnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39595957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszna to rzecz przyjść na świat nędznym ptakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39595958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że to zobowiązanie zostało bardzo czytelnie sformułowane na poprzednich szczytach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39595959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"konkurujemy zarówno na rynkach Unii Europejskiej, jak i na rynkach światowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39595960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"swobodnego przepływu osób w ramach strefy Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarak wkrótce zjedzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W biały dzień na jawie zdarzały się wypadki niepodobne do wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zaprzeczam ich istnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostry szum maszyny do strzyżenia trawników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest nie do zniesienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23619749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem wpadł mi szczególny pomysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23619750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może guzik metalowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23619751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę milczeliśmy i oddawaliśmy się naszym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23619752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Piszę do Pana ten list w niesłychanym pośpiechu i najwyższej trwodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23619753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo musiałem marudzić, jeżeli nie zauważyłem, że teraz jest już tak późno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24421730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na honor, nie wiem nawet, gdzie uciec przed temi upałami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24421731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już i chłopcy się dziwią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24421732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naród u nas mówi tym samym językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24421733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bo mi się tak podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24421735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemia jęczała i gięła się pod niemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz powiedz hasło ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę pana, tylko na parę godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczała chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przemawiał do siebie: — Emil, uspokój się, głaskam cię po włosach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór z wolna prostował swe drgające jeszcze rozpędnym pośpiechem przeobrażeń członki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze i niebo w oddali spajały się z sobą bez śladu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie brzmi dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu dzieci z domu wybiegły do ogródka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy te bezwiednie stroniły od przepychu zdziwienia, jak od niedostępnych bram zamkniętego pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Rozpoznał w nocy swoje mieszkanie, idąc boso wzdłuż korytarza, w stronę królików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że przyjdzie za pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Halszka wzbraniała się, prosząc o zwłokę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałam się pomacać trochę fotografowi z przeciwka i zdjęcia już są.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy nie znacie miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem tylko człowiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzisz do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze: tresowane konie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem przekonana, że wkrótce zawrzemy przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziesiąta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował nawet trzaskać z bata, ale jakoś mu nie szło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli ona nie wsiądzie po drodze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Całuj! — ryknął dominując nad rechotem wyznawców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzeczywistość, to straszliwa w swej prostocie rzeczywistość!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróć się zaraz, to sama sprawdzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiamy się, że kapitał, który włożyliśmy w ten projekt może być zmarnowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież tu powód do wyrzutów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja je lubię i one mnie lubią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś przemył i przewiązał ranę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś przed nami powinno majaczyć takie światełko, do którego zmierzamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mu położono złoty zegarek, zobaczył orła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, ale to nikt, nie może sobie zdać sprawy z czyjejś śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od kilku lat korzystanie z cmentarza było zabronione ze względu na podtopienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisła, Odra, Warta i Bug to cztery najdłuższe rzeki w Polsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, czas wracać — przyznała zamyślona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego pan nie kupił na stacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on umie pieścić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął z cicha, spuściwszy głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A buteleczka od razu bęc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z dumą pokazał Pukowi ukończony rysunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pokroić wędlinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył pod okno chałupy i nadstawił wielkich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądają jak dołki i rowki, powstałe od nakłucia szpilką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją pod rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ktoś zapytał mnie, czy jestem patriotą lokalnym, odpowiedziałbym, że tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do południa — powtórzył — do południa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żreć, ile wlezie, i spać, choćby co chwila — nic to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym w niektórych miejscach akompaniament o tyle tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tysiąc razy lepszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Winien jestem w ten czy inny sposób poświęcić swe życie dla ojczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i ławka była jeszcze ciepła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza saniami biegło trzydziestu ludzi otulonych w filtra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22081751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22081753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22081754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22081755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22081759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym wstąpiłem do różnych politycznych i społecznych zrzeszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił ją na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma piernik do wiatraka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do dziury myszko, do dziury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże ta ciężarna nieszczęściem chmura miała też swe srebrne obramowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Posłuchaj, dobry panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mała czarna - Kawa a nie spódnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego roku Kongres miał się odbyć w Kalkucie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia przyszedł policjant z wielkim niebieskim papierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz ze mną dalej gadać, to zachowuj się przyzwoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27139454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawozdanie jest bardzo szczegółowe i zawiera mnóstwo konkretnych propozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27139455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to działanie dość uczciwe i bardzo pożądane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27139457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wyjaśnić jedno nieporozumienie, aby rozstrzygnąć tę kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27139459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod drugie, chcę podkreślić, że wniosek ten ma na celu uproszczenie i pomocniczość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27139460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę zapytać, jakie działania podejmie Komisja w celu zintensyfikowania swej pracy z rodzicami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym skończyło się zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pocieszał się, że do jutra Kasia zapomni o swoim gnieździe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próba może jeno dać pojęcie należyte o człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam: niech mi się babcia pokaże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ten dureń Jednouchy zwariował zupełnie - wymówił cicho Bill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej gorąca napływało mu do twarzy i zasłaniało oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25121164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwiłem się, że jestem mały, chciałem pokazać, że mały też potrafi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25121165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie rany, sierżancie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25121166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytał korespondent Times’a.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25121167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego com słyszał, to wspaniała płaca i mało do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25121168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałem, co na to odpowiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wreszcie wyszukał jej męża, odpowiedniego znakomitości domu Łęckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dognaliśmy na odległość strzału do naszych straży przednich, zanim zaprzestali ścigania mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie lubił myśleć o ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłbym na cmentarz, na grób rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być, że mi się śniło na jawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzi do mnie wtedy, gdy w domu są awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za rozpaczliwa posucha bieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia nie wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23818902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwalasz mu więc, spodziewam się, przyjść jutro zmrokiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23818905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się nie szkodzić panu wcale, lecz nie podejmuję się być ci użytecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23818907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ranne godziny wlokły mu się, jakby do nich zaprzężono woły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23818908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka rzuciła się w jego objęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23818909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był tak pochłonięty wyścigiem, że na chwilę zapomniał o pannie Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apetyt rośnie w miarę jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął się mord i rabunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówił o sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie, niesie koszyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi smakuje wyciskany sok z jabłek, kiwi i mango.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę jeszcze przez czas jakiś czuwać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczegóż więc chciałaś, bym spał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nabycie nowych narzędzi przedstawia znaczne trudności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdzie najmniejszego tropu nie wyśledzono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól mi trochę pomyśleć i pogadać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27627115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście nigdy nie paliłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27627116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład w polskim prawie nie istnieje definicja, która pozwoliłaby wyszczególnić cechy leku podrobionego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27627117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak cena rynkowa energii stanowi tylko jeden aspekt problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27627118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję prezydencji za jasne określenie swojego stanowiska w tym względzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27627119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterostopniowe globalne ocieplenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34551458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy również zreformować system podatkowy i sposób funkcjonowania giełd papierów wartościowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34551459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, nie miało tak się stać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34551460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania Unii Europejskiej stanowiły w ostatnich latach ważny wkład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34551461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskazuje się przede wszystkim na takie czynniki jak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34551463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wzajemne połączenia i opodatkowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25238959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukłonił się nam trzem i spokojnie odszedł pod opieką detektywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25238960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa ręka pańska jest nieco większa niż lewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25238961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona nie wiedziała o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25238962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem kładąc się spać, zwołał wszystkich służących, wszystkich stróży i żołnierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25238963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela zwróciła się do niego z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20815161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niebo wytoczyły się małe obłoczki, które zakrywały chwilami księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20815162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, Bogu dzięki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20815163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czułabym się wobec ciebie jak żebraczka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20815164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźcie spokojni, kochani ludzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20815165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śluzem były słowa: — Zgadzam się z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A nie zaśpiewasz nam na pożegnanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilki ledwo dyszały; Bartek również gonił ostatkiem sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była ani trochę ordynarna, ani trochę nieprzyzwoita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostał powideł i wrócił do rysowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero teraz rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty tu? — zapytał mistrz zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdziwiło go to zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę panu zrobić niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiętam — odparł, biorąc skwapliwie do ręki woskowy odlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągłe szycie, cięcie, mierzenie i znowu szycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziedziczka pokiwała znacząco głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27417928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem konieczne jest utrzymanie obecnego systemu kwot mlecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27417930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wielu przypadkach jest to instrument uzależniania ekonomicznego słabych od silnych, biednych od bogatych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27417932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję sprawozdawcy za znakomitą pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27417934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiałem ze wszystkimi głowami państw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27417936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy to czynić, ale nie mamy odwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23586996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnąłem zęby, żeby nie słyszeć ich szczękania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23586997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze gwałtowne trzeszczenie, które się przeraziło samo siebie i gwałtownie się przerwało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23586998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siądź na krzesełku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23586999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23587000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z czego on mógł żyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29793613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolałbym mieć poparcie głównych proeuropejskich rodzin politycznych, ale niektórzy odmawiają mi go\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29793614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddaje się ludziom głos, aby przestawiali swe oświadczenia i zadawali pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29793615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy jednak, że ta kwestia jest bezwzględnie najważniejsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29793617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto Parlament wyraził wolę, by Unia Europejska była bardziej samodzielna w gromadzeniu własnych zasobów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29793619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętajmy też, że wszystko zaczęło się od ataku terrorystycznego i teraz musimy terror wykorzenić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21101933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak radośnie się zadziwi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21101934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadczy ona, że to człowiek bogaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21101935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żona Seweryna Józefa Nasberga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21101936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy nie słyszał pan kapania kropel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21101937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki już on zawsze wrażliwy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32434376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jesteśmy w trakcie procesu współdecyzji, konwergencji i dochodzenia do konsensusu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32434378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W swoim sprawozdaniu postaram się uwydatnić potencjał biogazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32434379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o reklamę, Grupa Socjalistyczna chciała utrzymać zasady przewidziane w obecnej dyrektywie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32434381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Bezpieczeństwo dostaw żywności jest dziś tematem numer jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32434382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ma ona sens\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję bardzo za tę informację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętajcie, że kwas siarkowy jest silnie higroskopijny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy jednak również, że jako Unia Europejska potrafiliśmy znaleźć odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przyjrzeć się lepiej systemowi nadzoru nad jednolitym rynkiem finansowym na szczeblu europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To powinien być fundament naszego myślenia o naszym wspólnym bezpieczeństwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani, że to przede wszystkim osoby starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Króliki wymagają przywiązania, ale potrafią dać w zamian wiele szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24583487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na własną odpowiedzialność odczytuje się symbol.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24583488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasza książęca mość masz w swoim herbie salamandrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24583489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przed upływem pół roku mogę go panu odstąpić na korzystnych warunkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24583490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sztuka odzwierciedla widza, a nie życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24583491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nikt nie zdecyduje się na próbę?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20981464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachwiał się i runął na ceglaną podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20981465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba jakaś omyłka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20981466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego pozbawił tamtych mieszkańców wolności?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20981467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oba wyglądały niesłychanie zmęczone, jakby po długiej drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20981468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejechał na wozie niejedną ulicę, ale jakoś nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden się wymawiał, że śpiący i woli się rano myć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deformacje rzeczywistości przy wpatrywaniu się w ciemnym pokoju bardzo znaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście w tejże chwili nadszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie mówi u cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip był dużym chłopcem, ale nieprzyjemnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za rudera wrzasnął mały chłopiec do dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm — mruknął staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chce mi się pisiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska to kraj w Europie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezadowolenie zmieniło jedynie charakter: wyzwoliła się z nastroju zniechęcenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego wieczora, a raczej tej nocy, słoń był jakoś dziwnie niespokojny i ciągle ryczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce pod pupkę włożył i mocno je złączył\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może raczysz mi powiedzieć, w czym się omyliłam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? Ja nie lubię w klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był piękny w swej barwie, rozległości, ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy się umówić, będziemy walczyli przy świadkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka czyni mistrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie plotkować na całą szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, dokąd idzie, co niesie w koszyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A brzuszek mu pęcznieje…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydkich nóg nie da się ukryć całkowicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21770487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłże to morderca, przybyły o północy, by wykonać krwawy rozkaz tajnego sadu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21770488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj mu rękę, człowieku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21770489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pani wie, jak daleko z Medinet do Chartumu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21770490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie oto snuł myśli biedny młodzieniec, leżąc w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21770491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał o tym w gazecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienaturalne podniecenie wzrasta do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe jego przyjście na świat nie wywarło na nich głębszego wrażenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w obecnej chwili był w stanie jakby zbliżonym do transu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dojść do tego, by móc sobie pozwolić tym zakończyć koncert.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on nie może, dlatego że ja go nie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A za oknem coraz wyższe słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach… widzę obłok… sunie ku księżycowi….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zerwał się jak raniony jeleń, pełen rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mary słuchała jak zahipnotyzowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżby coś podobnego było możliwym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz, pokażę ci teraz króliki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość dużo czytałem w tej materii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strachu i wściekłości bełkotał: — Tylko ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomość była zawarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani nie przypuszcza, z kim jedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocalał guzik i część drutu rozpiętego na parkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadka ta zupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30049187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie spowodowało obecną katastrofę w Sudanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30049188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam także francuską prezydencję, aby zapobiec w imieniu Rady, ograniczeniom swobody wypowiedzi w Chinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30049189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest okazanie tej solidarności poprzez wsparcie finansowe i techniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30049190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba zatem jasno rozstrzygnąć sprawę odpowiedzialności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30049191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wrócić do sprawy New Flame\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20943759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja miałabym nie poznać przyjaciółki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20943760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto ma przyjść, panie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20943761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kali siadł w kucki przy Stasiu i Nel, łowiąc otwartymi ustami powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20943762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowodzi to, aby młota nie użyto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20943763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli dodamy dwa i cztery, to wyjdzie sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan pójdzie tam ze mną, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to stany poprzedzające omdlenie spowodowane nadmiarem narkotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież lekko cuchnąć nie jest rzeczą przykrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz kazał mi zmieniać pozycję, żeby nie zrobił się zakrzep\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu pożegnali się, umówiła się z nim na jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda wyjdzie zawsze na jaw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym coraz częstsze były szantaże kolorowych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku niemiłemu zdumieniu zauważył, że nie jest sam: miał towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało niech pani mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz miał wolną drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony przychodzi refleksja, żeśmy się jednak trochę zagalopowali!!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak ona go tuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nauczycieli musiał dla bezpieczeństwa budynku mieszkać w pobliżu szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wyrzuty sumienia, a taka tylko natrętna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia w sobotę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26791670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę również podziękować sprawozdawczyni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26791671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie musimy bardzo dokładnie zbadać fakty w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26791672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywódcy polityczni w Kosowie muszą podjąć wysiłki zmierzające do realizacji planów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26791673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani komisarz odpowiedziała na kilka z pytań zadanych przez moich kolegów i koleżanki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26791674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grecja, Portugalia i Irlandia nie pasują do strefy euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze i niebo w oddali spajały się z sobą bez śladu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu powiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejnym krokiem zagłębiłem się pomiędzy zaułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ziemi poniewierały się resztki potłuczonych naczyń, kawałki żelaza i szkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31360201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znajduje ono żadnego uzasadnienia - przecież w Brukseli mamy odpowiedni budynek Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31360202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spasione konie niosły ich ostro przez miasto powstałe jakby w ciągu tygodnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31360203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z dużym zainteresowaniem i zrozumieniem wysłuchaliśmy programu szwedzkiej prezydencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31360204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy także uświadomić Komisji nasze zdecydowane przekonanie o konieczności wykorzystania wszystkich dostępnych nam środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31360205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponad sto lat temu noszono fontaź zamiast krawata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniła głowę na znak zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przylgnął do niego zły oddech dwóch tysiącleci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niestety, człowiek ten nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem mi to niepotrzebne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowierzam cudzoziemcom, zarówno żywym jak i umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyślam się, że dokładny plan wyjazdu dostanę jeszcze przed końcem tygodnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oby wszystko było dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy od dawna tu leżę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia! — pochwycił jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Moskwy! — powtórzyła, wszystko mieszcząc w tym słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy wspierać pozyskiwanie i produkcję energii odnawialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja będzie próbowała to maksymalnie ułatwić, w miarę jej możliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wiele problemów długofalowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskaźnik rozwoju społecznego Mołdawii jest jednym z najniższych w regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy europejski obywatel oczekuje od nas wszystkich, Komisji i Parlamentu, wykazania wrażliwości politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27661273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki jest ich obecny status?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27661274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten znany system spotkał się z pozytywną reakcją producentów, importerów i sprzedawców detalicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27661275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim przejdziemy do głosowania nad kalendarzem, chciałbym powiedzieć coś o zaplanowanym na jutro strajku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27661276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o bieżące pytanie, to będziemy nadal stosować prawodawstwo w obecnej formie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27661277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecny kompromis świadczy o tym, że Europa poważnie podchodzi do zmiany klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuła, iż pozwoliła sobie na czyn karygodny!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Najsilniejszy środek wybuchowy w literaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego miłość rycerz Konrad ostanie tu? — spytał jeden z ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho wszędzie, głucho wszędzie. Nudno będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż stanie się z dziewczyną, jeśli ja ją teraz opuszczę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kulawiec zaśmiał się ochryple stłumionym śmiechem, który podkreślił udatność i pożywność smakowitego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykała się na klucz w małym pokoju, który sobie wywalczyła po wielu awanturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za mało się znamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24753841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do drugiego, za chwilę dowiemy się kto on był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24753842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się ku niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24753843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spokojnie, mój kot nie jest agresywny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24753844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24753845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nigdy nie był kochliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali tego przyjaźnią, nie nazywali tego wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma piernik do wiatraka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25483212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że Blanka bardzo nalegała, była to bowiem jedyna, jaka jej pozostała pociecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25483214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wam już, panowie, że przed gospodą ładowano próżne beczki od wina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25483215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam przedstawił się jej straszny widok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25483217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdy starzec upadł martwy, żołnierze moi rzucili się na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25483219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili uprzytomniłem sobie wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocie łby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie słońce zsunęło się nisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze swej strony pragnę powiedzieć, że nie będę uczestniczył w tym przewrotnym planie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak energicznie protestuje sektor motoryzacyjny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Rada jest gotowa zamknąć pewne agencje, jeśli ich funkcjonowanie okaże się nieuzasadnione?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagadnień Atomowych, aby wreszcie zająć się postulatami zgłaszanymi przez Parlament Europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski proponuje zatem rozległą kampanię informacyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27381394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o przekazanie tej wiadomości do sekretariatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27381395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Estonia ma jeden z najniższych współczynników zadłużenia zagranicznego i zdołała zapanować na deficytem budżetowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27381396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zainteresowaniem oczekuję na państwa debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27381397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówią Państwo o urlopach macierzyńskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27381398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pionierem zjednoczenia Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto było to, czego mi było potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś spoważniał, zesmutniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, błagam pana, skróć cierpienia moje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpacz nieszczęsnej kobiety przechodziła wszelkie granice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na cóż umarł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy skończyłaś już robotę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do Sary i wpatrzyła się w nią z uwielbieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bałam się zawsze, że przyjdą na mnie takie ciężkie chwile…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym mieć paniczów w swej kompanii! — westchnął sierżant z głębi duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nas powiadomiono o wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25749757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan mi odsłonił najpiękniejszą rzecz, to czego jeszcze nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25749758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję panom pięć minut na przygotowanie się do drogi, nie więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25749759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ze łzami w oczach wróciła do pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25749761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero jednoręki zoczył uchodzącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25749764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotka cię za to straszliwa kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja wiem, że ona nie lubi żadnego ruszania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A dlaczego się wykręcałaś od tego? — Nie wiem sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne zajęcie z jakimś boskim pierwiastkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26864633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to wiążące zasady prawa wspólnotowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26864634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowa ta będzie po jej zatwierdzeniu przez obie strony przedmiotem przeglądu co trzy lata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26864635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić mi zwrócić uwagę na jeszcze jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26864636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta decyzja opierała się na błędnych prognozach rynkowych Komisji Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26864637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyraża on oczywiście głos regionów, ale też realizuje liczne programy unijne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szewca ani słychu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ulega wątpliwości, że przedmioty, znalezione w kredensie, należą do tej epoki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądza sławy i panowania pożerała go całego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za chwilę usłyszeliśmy jak otwierały się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęściem nie długo pewnie... tęsknić za nim będę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23660154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I spróbował otworzyć drzwi, lecz były zamknięte na klucz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23660155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, niech mi pan powie wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23660170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz przeczytałem list od początku do końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23660171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie to osobliwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23660172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że tandeciarz musiał wskazać na mnie, to było oczywiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krążę uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w klasie, gdzie są okna, wiedziałem, że tylko do dzwonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się tak, aby to mogło na wszelki wypadek wszystko oznaczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór milczał uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie się podobał ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak i jednoręki nic nie odrzekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną, dziewczyco, nie rób żadnych ceregieli — rzekł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A łydka? — pytałem niecierpliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20758878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy mojej pomocy wyszła na marmurowy cokół nabrzeża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20758879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20758880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem trochę znużona przechadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20758881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pyskuj! — zawołał z powziętą z góry na wszelki przypadek urazą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20758882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent miał już otworzony brzuch, w którym było widać tylko żółto- -białą masę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda to, że stary zjada co dzień młodego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby chciało mnie ostrzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za zagadkowy splot wydarzeń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26658609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby to osiągnąć, musimy rozpocząć naprawdę poważny dialog na temat tych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26658610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zawsze tak wszystko dobrze się układało w naszej współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26658611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Libijczycy muszą mieć pierwszeństwo przed wszystkimi innymi do decydowania o przyszłości swojego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26658612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwiej jest bowiem negocjować, mając świadomość, że ma się wsparcie współpracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26658613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu nie możemy pozwolić, aby powstrzymały nas wydarzenia krótkoterminowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas dłużył się okropnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona cię przecież kocha, mówisz, mimo że się do tego nie chce przyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrów Pana swego, jak na cię przystało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wojna nareszcie się skończy?! — zawołałem głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś przed nami powinno majaczyć takie światełko, do którego zmierzamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa wyjdzie ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek miał zawsze pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę uszanować i moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też tak myślę — powiedziała Pola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęli przed nią i zawahali się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Marysi: — Profesora chyba nie ma w Sylwestra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34488403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki tysięcy, a nawet miliony osób należą do tej kategorii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34488404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedopuszczalne jest, aby \\\"demokratyczny\\\" system posiadał urzędników, których nazwiska są nieznane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34488405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym zwycięzcą w takim przypadku byłby prezydent Ahmadineżad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34488406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie będzie łatwa debata w chwili obecnej, w trakcie recesji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34488407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę powiedzieć, że chwilami nasze prace przypominały forsowny marsz pod górę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie doszedł mnie złowrogi trzask przepalonych belek pułapu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił głowę, bo słońce świeciło mu w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, co z tego wyniknie!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jej powiedział: — Chcę spotkać się z tobą, — odpowiedziała: — Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęła ją zgroza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to przy innych mężczyznach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie? — pyta się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałam go, który, czy ten Emil? Nie odpowiedział i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na morzu szaruga…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytrzymaj mu nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25965303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zasady twierdzimy, że silna gospodarka to najlepsza droga do osiągnięcia społecznego postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25965304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwo międzynarodowe jest jedną z największych wartości dla wszystkich podmiotów stosunków międzynarodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25965305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem te obawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25965306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duży obszar, w którym stosowana jest waluta euro jest interesującym celem dla fałszerzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25965307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowisko Komisji wydaje mi się dość mało ambitne pod tym względem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miastem odbyło się wszystko według programu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie do końca są w swoim środowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała katar pęcherza, zmarzła na ławce w parku i chciało jej się bardzo siusiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbytkuj! — pogroził jej palcem na nosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc prawdopodobnie zamieszka w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wy kończony, dopasowany i martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i weszła matka Emila, mówiąc: — Jak ładnie grasz dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przy lądowaniu samolotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale skąd znów ta ranga i mundur naczelnika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie robił z tego tajem nicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A te znaki tu, na obwodzie koła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21479056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmordowany, zbity, z trudem wyswobodził się nieborak z przyjacielskich uścisków niedźwiedzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21479057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udałem się przypadkiem do urzędu telegraficznego i ujrzałem że właśnie stamtąd wychodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21479058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Założyłbym się o tysiąc przeciw jednemu, że temu by nie podołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21479059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu opowiedziała jej całe swe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21479060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobił pasterz tak, jak mu powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21110911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym ci pomogła w odrabianiu lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21110912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko piasku malutkie, ale i głowa mrówki nie większa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21110913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzy, jest ćwiczenie w zeszycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21110914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy wiesz, o co mnie pyta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21110915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem słońce zaszło, i noc pokryła okolicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni na skrawku przestrzeni bez wyjścia wobec zalewającego żywiołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyło się na gadach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem — odparł bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie poradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrój w wartowni był błędny i niewyraźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji, w sali jadalnej, było cicho, bo jedzono kurczęta; to wymagało skupienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip na wpół nieprzytomny od dymu, kicha potężnie i budzi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala zrobiła sarenkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni żyją dla demokracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś szarpnął mnie silnie za rękaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykra to była przygoda z pomylonym panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebracy leżeli w słoneczne dni na trotuarze i spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, cóż mi dacie za wyjawienie sekretu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest nie do zniesienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnął głowę rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwali protokół młodego króla — podpisali, że tak właśnie dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25032987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przepadam za nim!!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25032988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast ocknąć się, coraz głębiej zapadał w opętanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25032989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kieszeni miałem hubkę, kamień i krzesiwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25032990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On Maciuś jest panem swych myśli i rozkazuje i musi mieć silną wolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25032991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż przestraszony kanarek zatrzepotał się w klatce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że byl park, przez który ona musiała przejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26996212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapewnienie dostaw gazu w każdej sytuacji i niezależnie od sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26996214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie działamy jak pionierzy i nie powinniśmy podążać utartą ścieżką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26996215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, że ona również nie przeszła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26996216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę powiedzieć kilka słów na temat procesu i kontekstu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26996217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę powiedzieć kilka słów na temat Europejskiego Instytutu Technologii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30636183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jurand odgadł, że to są mury szczytnowskiego zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30636184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zagłosowaliśmy za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30636185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, pani komisarz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30636186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wnioski i zalecenia dla procesu decyzyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30636187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zwrócić pana uwagę na kilka ważnych aspektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29862479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwo ma pierwszeństwo wobec wszystkich pozostałych rozważań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29862480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to pierwsze uregulowanie prawne na świecie traktujące konkretnie o ochronie pieszych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29862481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Fundusz Społeczny odgrywa najważniejszą rolę w poprawie stanu zatrudnienia i tworzeniu miejsc pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29862482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to problemy, które trzeba uwzględnić w każdej europejskiej strategii na rzecz młodzieży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29862483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcielibyśmy odróżniać tych uchodźców, którzy w myśl prawa międzynarodowego naprawdę ubiegają się o azyl\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nawet rzecz przynosząca dochód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawiła go ta gra w ciuciubabkę z nie przeczuwającym nic przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciszkiem do niej, ciszkiem, żeby nie uciekła! — ostrzegł półgłosem kulawiec, badawczo obzierając dziuplę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie uprzedzajmy wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29792416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz pewne aspekty pozostają nie w pełni zgodne z traktatem lizbońskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29792417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo, że państwo to spełniło kryteria polityczne, pozostaje jeszcze wiele do zrobienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29792418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest powodem naszej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29792419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem, wbrew temu, co mówił pierwotny porządek obrad, nie mamy debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29792420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konie ze stajen wywieść i wozy zaprzęgać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I po co było tak bić szczeniaka? — krzywi się felczer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla siebie odciął również spory kawałek, który pożarł na surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś ciekawie patrzy przez okno samochodu na swoją stolicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do mnie z miną czarnoksiężnika, dotknął mi sutki i też strzeliła iskra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomyślą, że człowiekowi przykro i boi się, że panią rozgniewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze nie skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny dziewczak! — rzekł, pocmokując ze znawstwem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic — pocieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się na to, że jesteśmy pokraczni — rzekł tymczasem zatrwożony nieco Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czego zaczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20931709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie byłoby to zbyt wielkim ciężarem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20931710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony nie chcę dzisiaj ale widzę, że masz rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20931711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd bierze pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20931713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie, że tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20931714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było i ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35178374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.684,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nałożenie sankcji pokazałoby, że nie jesteśmy obojętni i uważam, że jest to niezwykle istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35178375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele faktycznie mają prawo domagać się nienagannego monitorowania groźby terroryzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35178376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to z pewnością użyteczne środki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35178377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam więc, że stanowi to nasz wspólny cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35178378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną z najszerszych grup użytkowników Internetu są dzieci oraz młodzież\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedny, biedny, biedny Maciuś!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi, pomiędzy filarami, przechadzało się kilku mnichów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też zrobię świnkę! — zawołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygnąłem się jak pod ukąszeniem węża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kukułka przez sen kukała w głębinie leśnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie nadeszła godzina wyruszenia w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas gdy biegłem na północ, szukano mnie na południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczeli wszyscy ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego com słyszał, to wspaniała płaca i mało do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę, że wszystko ma się tak, jak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki nie były wydawane w sposób efektywny i nie podlegały wystarczającej ocenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wartość teorii można jedynie sprawdzić w praktyce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Funkcjonują tu dwa systemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo wszystkich tych trudności w wielu obszarach kontynuowane są postępy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego tak surowo podchodzimy do nadzoru w rezolucjach parlamentarnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę, że stanie się to w tym roku, przy aktywnym udziale i wsparciu Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do ograniczenia terroryzmu może w znaczący i decydujący sposób przyczynić się dialog międzyreligijny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować panu komisarzowi za wyjaśnienia złożone w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestią nie mniej ważną jest przyłączenie się Rady do tego rejestru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament dąży do wzmocnienia procedur przekazywania danych dotyczących przelotu pasażera do krajów trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzieli, że będą za pięć minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił powoli swoje przezroczyste oczy i jego usta stały się jeszcze bardziej wąskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Depesza pewno gdzieś tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36496194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy zaś sprzedajemy produkt finansowy, nie płacimy podatku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36496195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel ten jest obecnie bardziej istotny dla konsumentów niż kiedykolwiek wcześniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36496196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyszko spojrzał na niego z zadowoleniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36496197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej decyzji potrzebujemy szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36496198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, panie komisarzu, że Komisja powinna rozważyć podjęcie inicjatywy w tym obszarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeżywam całe tygodnie w ciągu kilku minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24726572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuj w tem schronieniu pod strażą Boga i naszej przyjaźni, skutku moich usiłowań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24726573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś jest głodny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24726574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem jak mi głos zadrżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24726575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu dopiero była ciżba, jakby na jarmarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24726576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje młodych ludzi zostało sam na sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wierzę, Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leczenie: atropina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że problem można rozwiązać i omówić mając na uwadze wyłącznie interesy obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w szczególności zmiany klimatu, gospodarka wodna, energie odnawialne, różnorodność biologiczna i erozja gleb\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźmy raz jeszcze uczciwi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiana gospodarcza i zmiana polityczna, a także zmiana w unijnym rządzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mają Państwo odwagę to zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26976179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponaglam Komisję, aby przedstawiła najszybciej jak to możliwe tę poprawkę, zgodnie z żądaniem Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26976180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięćdziesiąt lat później, podczas uroczystych obchodów rocznicowych, mamy te same odczucia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26976181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki podziałowi ryzyka i instrumentom finansowym przedsiębiorczość staje się dla nich dostępna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26976182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zdecydowanie warunek konieczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26976183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to instrument służący wszystkim regionom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak… — rzekł Hipolit.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba wycierpieć i coś stracić, żeby zyskać więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech dusza powraca do ciała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle strach i boi się do niej podejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może jest to strach o własny portfel, jak niektórzy próbują zauważyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil płynie powoli po własnych zdaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu należy zapewnić szczególną ochronę zarówno dziecku, jak i matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem czują się zapomniane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaglądnij może na Allegro, pewnie coś się znajdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób, jak ci rozkazałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż byłbym inaczej pułkownikiem dziesiątego pułku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze trochę wina, proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziałem, iż nic dostrzec nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my tylko na skargę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd? Nie wiadomo! — odpowiedział Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma piernik do wiatraka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotrzymała słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32395355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawie energii pojawił się teraz inny aspekt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32395356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze - brak uregulowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32395357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmowa pracownika bazowała jedynie na wewnętrznym przepisie określonej wypożyczalni samochodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32395358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaczenie Parlamentu Europejskiego i jego roli w przyjmowaniu europejskiego prawodawstwa jest niepodważalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32395359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co mi zrobisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokornie panu profesorowi dziękuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto, witam cię łaskawie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment operacyjny zaszedł znacznie wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgryźliwy i nieustępliwy kulawiec narzekał wówczas na wściubską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmęczenie po trzech seansach portretowych zniknęło zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40382402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poruszyć trzy lub cztery kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40382403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak umieścić to w kontekście naszej wyraźnej polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40382404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma ona nic wspólnego z aborcją w Polsce lub Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40382405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne też, by w krajowych statystykach różnych państw odnotowywać wkład wniesiony przez ten sektor\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40382406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę przypomnieć, że bycie na dyżurze uniemożliwia pracownikom swobodne organizowanie swojego czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A każdy inaczej opisał, jak Maciuś uciekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrzył, jak się macacie, i brandzlował się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż łaskawy pan może jej przeciwstawić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż miałem mu powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39597912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże to ograniczenie konsumpcji nie jest spowodowane jedynie kryzysem na rynkach finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39597913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja martwi się przede wszystkim o bezrobocie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39597914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy ono modyfikacji określonych zasad, mającej na celu umożliwienie natychmiastowego wprowadzenia serii zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39597915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grecja przyjęła ambitny program ukierunkowany na zmniejszenie deficytu, reformę administracji publicznej oraz gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39597916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zacząć od szczerych wyrazów uznania i podziękowań dla sprawozdawczyni, która wykonała znakomitą pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40314763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie systemowe podejście może wpłynąć również na poprawę dostępu potencjalnych beneficjentów do niezbędnych informacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40314764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półgłówek, skończony półgłówek!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40314765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nad tem myślałam, co się mianowicie we mnie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40314766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście globalnego partnerstwa gospodarki wschodzące powinny również wnieść swój wkład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40314767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął do mnie obie ręce ponad kontuarem i długo ściskaliśmy się, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego duma nie pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś stół, ława, dwa zydle i łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25431295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto i on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25431296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musimy sobie wyobrazić, że on tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25431297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25431298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtórzyłem owe dziwne słowa, zdawało się, pozbawione jakiegokolwiek znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25431299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"słoik pełen ogórków kiszonych - najlepszy deser na dobrej imprezie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myć się nie chcieli, a w taką wielką wodę lecą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko możliwym jest, by letarg trwał tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisując się, kładł kropkę po podpisie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy bardzo bolą cię ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przyznaj się — nastawał wodząc ustami po jej cudnej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja zawsze tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32113562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja bada także aspekt prawa ochrony środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32113563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Demokracja w żadnym razie nie jest czymś niezmiennym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32113564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinienem też przypomnieć, że Portugalia niedawno objęła prezydencję Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32113565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gry wideo dla dzieci niosą ze sobą wiele niepokojących problemów kulturowych i społecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32113566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Francję o uruchomienie środków funduszu w odniesieniu do kataklizmu spowodowanego przez huragan Xynthia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczepiła go pierwsza pod jakimś błahym pozorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamówiłam w sklepie internetowym chleb, ryż, kaszę, dżem wiśniowy i sok jabłkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie ma dość rozumu na to, by rzecz właściwą zrobić w odpowiednim czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy w te bajeczki z „duchami”?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widzi ich też ktoś inny prócz mnie na moście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj mu tyle zabawek, ma ich już dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stole zastał dwa listy i dużą kopertę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona należy do niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I moja miłość do ciebie wplątana w to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to tylko dwa przykłady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energia odnawialna ma podstawowe znaczenie w naszej walce ze zmianami klimatycznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o to mniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ nie wierzę, by emocje były dobrym doradcą, poparłam tę pilną rezolucję Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"reprezentowani są nie tylko producenci, ale również dystrybutorzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam tylko na rozkaz, bym mogła zabrać tacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało mi się, że nad strumieniem wszystko się wyjaśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo w usta, albo tak cię przyciśnie, że żebra bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zużyliśmy osiemdziesiąt naboi, rozdzieliliśmy po połowie moją miesięczną rację żywności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślałem, że dzieci są dobre, tylko nieszczęśliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24670712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dachem tego pokoju był sam taras.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24670713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też bardzo się Maciuś ucieszył, że Felek chce iść do fabryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24670714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24670715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególny zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24670716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanował go pesymizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc aż cały miesiąc leżałem w malignie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jak ty się nie przeprosisz? — To trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego; jest pan wychowankiem miasta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowie się pan po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że go królowie oszukali, że port zabrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej pory przynajmniej nie byłam nigdy samotna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował nawet trzaskać z bata, ale jakoś mu nie szło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką włożyłam? Nie wiem, w jaki sposób, ale na szczęście”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mit-Sah podnosił swój trzydziestostopowy bicz, wiązany z surowych pasków jeleniej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To twoja Ania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście istnieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co mam zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zwykle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo nie było podówczas pośród wszystkich ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie boisz się pana, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Produkuję współczesne zdania. Masowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła urnę brązową stojącą na ziemi, uderzyła się nią w czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kiedy nas dogonią? — spytała po francusku, by Idrys nie mógł ich zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosny, że nie wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ojciec zawołał go i powiedział: — Wiesz Emil, będziesz miał brata albo siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy dostrzegacie ten podwójny odblask?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31183691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejszy dzień ma wartość historyczną z wielu względów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31183692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jako młody oficer, wzbudzał ogólny podziw swoją odwagą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31183693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecne głosowanie to wielkie zwycięstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31183694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowanie odbędzie się niebawem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31183695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymałem projekt rezolucji złożony przez Komisję Rolnictwa i Rozwoju Wsi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię z nikim dzielić się miłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co robi twój papa? - zapytał, bo lubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32459947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostre prześladowania odnotowano również wobec przedstawicieli opozycji, od ruchów studenckich do społeczności mnichów buddyjskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32459948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to teraz nasze największe zmartwienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32459949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, żeby precyzja charakteryzowała także przedmiot sprawozdania, czyli Unię na rzecz Regionu Morza Śródziemnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32459950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również unikać dublowania przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32459951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia jest to istotny pierwszy krok, ale rozwiązanie musi mieć skalę globalną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24467115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"głęboko utkwiły w jego wyobraźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24467116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale widzą, że Felek zanadto sobie pozwala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24467117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź szczerą proszę cię, nieprawdaż, że mnie uważasz za kobietę pozbawioną uczciwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24467118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym nabyć konia dla tej oto panienki..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24467119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten zamiast iść, zbliżył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak trzaskasz drzwiami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, ile w nim papierów i rupieci! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się na to, że jesteśmy pokraczni — rzekł tymczasem zatrwożony nieco Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawy pan kpi sobie ze mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to trudne do przetworzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju jadalnym rozlegał się śmiech kobiecy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyszko zaczął wspominać wszystko, co zaszło w gospodzie tynieckiej i rozczulił się zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kościołach przez cały dzień panował tłok, jak w czasie odpustu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę absolutnie żadnych układów i proszę o ostre warunki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ile daje mi dowodów nieledwie psiego przywiązania!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28471699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym wspólnym obowiązkiem jest reakcja na zmiany w wymiarze światowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28471700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczenie to dotyczyło jednostronnego przywrócenia przez Kanadę obowiązku wizowego względem obywateli Czech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28471703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W razie potrzeby w kolejnych miesiącach będziemy musieli robić więcej - i lepiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28471704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem pańskie zmartwienie, ale wolałabym nie wdawać się w tę rozmowę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28471707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje pytanie jest takie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wiedziała, nie lękałabym się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byle tylko jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden chłopak wiedział, gdzie się pali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ciastka są wyborne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28461709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.892,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oznaczało to tylko wolności dla polityków i równości z innymi politykami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28461710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to uznać za pozytywną oznakę, zwłaszcza w kraju arabskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28461711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym duchu pragnę rozpocząć od życzenia szczęścia wszystkim mieszkańcom Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28461712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo chcę podkreślić z całą mocą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28461713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nie wyjeżdżają wtedy, kiedy zaplanują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o oznaczeniu odpowiednich elementów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazywał moc niezliczoną nowych kiełków, wychylających się przez czarną glebę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I one pewnie pierwsze odpadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęli przed nią i zawahali się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż musi opustoszeć, a wówczas nikt nam nie będzie przeszkadzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała filozofia religijna katolicyzmu i cała cywilizacja łacińska oparte są na personalizmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście wiatru nie było, mróz zatem nie dokuczał zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zróbmy tak: niech każdy doprowadzi do porządku fabrykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"widzę tu przynajmniej coś podobnego w zapiskach, które sobie poczyniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kliknij w guzik aby zacząć pobieranie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjaśniło się dla mnie wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurier dostarczy paczkę dopiero wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile mogę rozumieć, Ligę założył amerykański milioner Ezechiasz Hopkins, który był oryginałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22339055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22339056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22339057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22339058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22339059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby uniknąć zatorów drogowych, Rada Miasta wprowadziła również dodatkowe, bezpłatne przejazdy autobusowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach! — krzyknęła płaczliwym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i zagrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówił o sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy przecież w ogólnikach: teoretyzujemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wchodzi się dwa razy do tej samej rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podnieśli się na nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziemy na toczącej się w przestrzeni kuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30332748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku hazardu on-line, w przeciwieństwie do tradycyjnego, występuje wyraźny problem braku fizycznego nadzoru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30332749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować Radzie za trzymanie się swoich postanowień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30332750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz proszę przyjąć moje gratulacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30332751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dobrze, że Parlament Europejski niedawno, w listopadzie, przyjął odpowiednie rozporządzenie w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30332752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z państwa projektem rezolucji o odblokowaniu porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40090329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro już to powiedziałem - przedmiotowe rozporządzenie jest zwieńczeniem listy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40090330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero nad grobem drogiej nam osoby najszczerzej wierzymy w nieśmiertelność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40090331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W razie potrzeby podczas tych wizyt będą organizowane spotkania z opozycją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40090332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jedynie bardzo niewielka grupa państw członkowskich nie przystąpiła do konsensusu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40090333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już stwierdzono, puste przejazdy nie będą korzystne dla nikogo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wyście to przysłali? — powtórzył staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie są bardzo sceptyczni na ten temat i poniekąd mają rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniję pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnemu we wszystkim ładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory pokpiwa sobie z lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — zauważył pośpiesznie kulawiec i palcem ostrzegawczo pogroził w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem ani Podlasiak, ani jednoręki nie powitali nowej obietnicy radosnymi okrzykami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mała jest biedna i potwornie ambitna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, panie — oznajmił major uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pot z jej czoła lał się strumieniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się opierał o ciebie i o ścianę i podejdę do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścian sączyła się strużkami woda i wsiąkała w grunt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co miałem widzieć? — odezwał się sennym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek miał zawsze pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzała go cały rok: wszystkie pieniądze wydawała na maskotki — same koty, tylko jedna małpa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiała i ona, że niestety ich sytuacja znacznie się pogorszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu potrzebna gimnastyka, musztra, one mogą być dobre albo złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prześwietna sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schludnie ubrany pan zapraszał uroczą panią do tańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Serce ani drgnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tego nie wyrzucę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32106413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dodać kilka słów o dostosowywaniu instrumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32106414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trwałe bezpieczeństwo, stabilność i pokój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32106415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki zatem sposób równoważymy skuteczność i sprawiedliwość?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32106416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jego bogactwa naturalne i odnawialne zasoby naturalne nie zdołały zapewnić prosperity\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32106417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to tylko niepotrzebna konstrukcja, powielająca już istniejące struktury promocji nauki, rozwoju i edukacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał w półmroku, bo bał się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radek sam wyglądał jak obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zło, zdaniem twoim, jest równie wiecznym jak dobro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, jak śmieszna jest ta nadęta buzia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22708683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiało więc być coś poza domem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22708684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz zabronił mi jednak myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22708685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie, tego ryzykować nie można!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22708686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i ono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22708687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpadł w ich ręce i zginął straszną śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiątka rodzinna — objaśniał zadowolony z pochwał właściciel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów wiatr i deszcz prosto w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powitał ich śmiech: wszyscy byli trochę podchmieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Ja wiem, co teraz będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za tymi światłami skręć w lewo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27375552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czasu ostatniego rozszerzenia Unii Morze Czarne jest również morzem unijnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27375553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne jest też, aby dzięki stosowaniu najlepszych praktyk osiągnąć nowe cele dotyczące wydajności zasobów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27375554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co z patentem europejskim, który utknął w Radzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27375555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzależnienie od hazardu stanowi obecnie poważny problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27375556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto zasady, które wszyscy podzielamy i które ułatwiły nam osiągnięcie porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te osoby potrzebują rozmowy, nie wywiadu czy przesłuchania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierś była jędrna i młoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek umiał się dobrze bawić, ale był godny pogardy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa potrafiła być nadzwyczajna tylko w sobie samej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stół Emila: maszyna do pisania, bałagan, papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec przyjdzie tu za jakieś pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, dezaktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mogłem dopuścić do czegoś podobnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gniewa się, że się pomyliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, mieć dach nad głową jest rzeczą bardzo przyjemną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmianę ekspozycji mamy w czerwcu, więc na pół roku można obejrzeć dwie wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miałeś jakiś wybór?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazimy do pokoju przez okienko z łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa odskoczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało rzec można, że w rewolucji francuskiej Pan się odrodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąż istotnie ani się nie ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedźcie noga za nogą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano byle jaką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok urodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21358278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzyj na dolinę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21358279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To twarda sztuka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21358280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bezinteresowne wyznanie, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21358281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj wybierze jednego z nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21358282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wypuścił jej, ale w pewnym momencie zniżył kolbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę nawet dużo pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była tylko w koszuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa, patrząc na pantofle, zupełnie serio: — Zobaczysz, one się jeszcze zrobią ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy człowiek powinien korzystać ze wszystkich praw i swobód wymienionych w deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wcisnęła go pomiędzy wargi i zanurzyła w jego miąższ swe białe, ostre zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysz rozpytywał ciekawie o stosunki w cukrowni i w okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz czas w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To proszę cię, powiedz mi, że się przeprosiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie — odrzekła dziwożona i wspięła się ku niemu na palcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo ty nie leżysz na dnie morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebył pan szczęśliwie nader poważną chorobę; wszelkie wzruszenia mogłyby panu zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyciągnął rękę ku mej papierośnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A potem psa i krowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy opuszczałem restaurację, była godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ona sama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje czekanie jest napięte i wytężone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął jej usta pocałunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dżonki chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechaliśmy jeszcze dość długo głębokim wąwozem lub brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę dnia, złego snu, gdy zanurzam się w noc, jak w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród zamieszania, które wywołała swym nietaktownym finałem, wymknęła się z domu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznawaliśmy ich po głosie, dzięki czemu mogliśmy sprawdzić ich liczbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33198909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"gdzie jest europejska wartość dodana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33198910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak stało się w ubiegłym tygodniu w Portugalii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33198911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można to uznać za przejaw dobrej woli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33198912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczył pan przeciwko Związkowi Radzieckiemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33198913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas czytania konkluzji Rady, zauważyłem coś, co mnie uderzyło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr wieje między twoimi włosami, jak między gałęźmi nadmorskich krzaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do każdej herbaty dodaję kilka kropel cytryny i miód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko, wezwij karetkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28468923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie karty muszą się znaleźć na stole\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28468925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekujemy przestrzegania podstawowych zasad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28468926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę nie pozostawać pod wpływem lobbystów z Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28468927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Perspektywa akcesji Islandii została przyjęta pozytywnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28468928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast przewodnictwa zmieniającego się co sześć miesięcy mamy stałe przewodnictwo Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wiedzie te hordy ku krwawemu dziełu zbrodni, zemsty lub kary?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamilknął na chwilę pan Ryszard i uśmiechnął się smutno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy nie znacie miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ksiądz myślał, że to z trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiadomo Słowenia zalicza się do krajów wykorzystujących energię jądrową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadnicze znaczenie ma również dobra reputacja organizacji i poziom wiedzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodziny i Ochrony Dzieciństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że możliwe jest zapewnienie jednocześnie strukturalnej i natychmiastowej reakcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz ze mną dalej gadać, to zachowuj się przyzwoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna kobieta zniknęła bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się zbliżył, aby zbadać jej puls, poznałem straszliwą prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecie mówiłem, że ci daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowy i żłobkowaty korzeń zabarwił się w słońcu soczystym połyskiem eterycznie wonnej błony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21353474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem je za nim zamknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21353475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie sądzę, aby go znał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21353476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziłem, że były to plotki gazeciarskie i że uda mi się to udowodnić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21353477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczas wiodło mu się wszystko, co tylko zamierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21353478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spędziłem cały wieczór wczorajszy na bezowocnych poszukiwaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czuję, iż ją zobaczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za te monarsze rozrywki władców swoich, robotnicy sowieccy płacą nędzą i potem swoim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale za to zobaczył siebie w lustrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że mięśnie miał cudowne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przepadam za nim!!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26193576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawką jest tutaj technologia przyjazna dla środowiska naturalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26193577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rozczarowujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26193578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka miesięcy temu na tej sali odbywaliśmy debatę na temat sytuacji w Stoczni Gdańskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26193579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to efektem szeregu środków zawartych w kompleksowej polityce rodzinnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26193580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie toczą się dyskusje w sprawie \\\"rozwiązania dwustopniowego\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26682188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwiększona odpowiedzialność producenta w zapewnieniu informacji społeczeństwu odnośnie do powtórnego wykorzystania i recyklingu produktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26682189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie wcześniej niż pod koniec listopada lub na początku grudnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26682190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy przyjąć gwarancje zapewniające długotrwałe zawieszenie broni i umożliwiające otwarcie korytarza z pomocą humanitarną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26682191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę pogratulować sprawozdawczyni jej wyczerpującego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26682192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o bezpieczeństwo, czy urządzenia te rzeczywiście umożliwiają dziś zagwarantowanie warunków bezpieczeństwa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszaj natychmiast! — brzmiała gniewna odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za myśli, co za koncepty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do mnie z miną czarnoksiężnika, dotknął mi sutki i też strzeliła iskra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamilknął na chwilę pan Ryszard i uśmiechnął się smutno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że wszedł do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił powoli swoje przezroczyste oczy i jego usta stały się jeszcze bardziej wąskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy się umówić, będziemy walczyli przy świadkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas dłużył się okropnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałaś: — Dlatego mnie lubisz, bo jestem zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25215934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to potajemny znak wdzięczności, jaki mu składam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25215936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedłem za wzrokiem dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25215937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór aż wrzał cały z oburzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25215943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udowodniłbym to nawet, gdyby Rozyna była podobną do tandeciarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25215948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak potwierdził: „Macie zupełną słuszność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i gramofon z dołu psują powagę wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20926337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczegóż więc chciałaś, bym spał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20926338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawrócili ku miastu, na którego krańcu stała w pobliżu kanału willa pana Rawlisona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20926339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawimy się w dobrego i złego policjanta.Dobra. Ja jestem dobry policjant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20926340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, czemu by miała być wygłodzona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20926341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka dni ostatnich byłaś taka spokojna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21885469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszne były te oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21885470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groza położenia wytrzeźwiła go od razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21885471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo protestuję przeciwko takiemu nachodzeniu mojego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21885472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie widziałem oczu, tak pełnych życia intensywnego, mocnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21885473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej wiem teraz, gdzie jestem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności chciałbym wspomnieć o szczepieniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro tak, to dlaczego zlikwidowaliście to stanowisko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wojska prezydenta Mubaraka spowodowały obecny terror na ulicach Egiptu, a nie demonstranci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to społeczeństwo o charakterze włączającym i wysokiej stopie zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podkreślić, że to mnie naprawdę przeraża\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22202245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22202247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22202251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22202255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22202262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz o tym i wiesz też, że ona cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawiła go ta gra w ciuciubabkę z nie przeczuwającym nic przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bójcie się śmierci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i podnieśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może instynktem kobiety wyczuła przy nim bliskość anioła śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Ty wierzysz we wszystko co przeczytasz w internecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25038846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko lis biegł jeszcze przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25038847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie posiadając się z zachwytu, biegałem bezmyślnie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25038848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracający nad ranem jegomość napił się przy bufecie wódki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25038849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisiało na sznurku jedwabnym, I błyszczało w jutrzni porannej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25038850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie otuliłem się znowu w płaszcz i zacząłem się zastanawiać, co dalej począć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyszczące ucho od filiżanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zachowywał się całkiem zwyczajnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masaż jest relaksujący i zarazem leczniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jem na kolację sałatkę jarzynową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeść, ani uczyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojciec nic o tym nie wie jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona łasa jest na miód i pszczołom go stale wyjada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20876667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezależna od jego wylewów i mająca swój własny system wodny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20876668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszaj mi natychmiast do swego pokoju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20876669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już zapomniałaś, jak ci wrona gniazdo uwiła na głowie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20876670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego czujesz się tym tak upokorzona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20876671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kołdrę na grzbiet naciągnął, po jajach się podrapał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór zawahał się przez chwilę, jakby dla namysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24601887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz co to jest, Izabello, dla czego nam przerywasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24601893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie następnego pochodu Zbyszko począł się niepokoić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24601894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam angielskie polowanie na lisa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24601895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zawołała pani Wąsowska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24601896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nieszczęśliwa ja sierota!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wrażenia po przedwczorajszym filmie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że drzwi nie będą zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili wrócił ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale burza nadeszła: gromadziła się wiekami i naraz wybuchła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda ręki! — odpowiedziała z woru dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24546465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dopiero przychodzi mi na myśl wiele szczegółów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24546466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanów się więc, póki czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24546467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inteligentny, odbiór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24546468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy wyglądał tak na trzy do pięciu tysięcy rubli rocznego dochodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24546469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejście do autobusu jest możliwe tylko środkowymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omiń korek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tatko miał tam warsztat w narożnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej wyrzucały słowa ciemne dla mnie i niezrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę wiedzieć to, czego nie mogę wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi, szedł wolno w piżamie wzdłuż korytarza, wykładanego zielonym linoleum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, wzgórza już opustoszały, a Ludek Górski wywędrował z tych okolic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to są wszystko dzieciństwa, najdroższa — uspokajałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jakże wydaje się prawdziwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy myśleli, że jestem szalony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drugie danie tu ci przyniosą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem dojmujący chłód wilgoci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i kaszel są w pierwszych dniach wykluczone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli woli, niech się w torbie prześpi i sił dla nas nabierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, jak długo jeszcze zdołam w pobok was przebywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25160451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dala już huczy gromkie trąbienie nadjeżdżającej straży ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25160452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25160453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili przyniesiono i Maciusiowi obiad, który Maciuś odesłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25160454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak szeroko i daleko tu wkoło nawet kot nie mieszka“ mówił robotnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25160455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No więc...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39664702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykładowo telefony komórkowe nie są już dla tych osób żadną tajemnicą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39664703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą państwo tego zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39664704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy Trybunał wydaje opinię bez zastrzeżeń, a nie opinię niekorzystną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39664705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien się ożenić, toby mu wyszło na dobre!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39664706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przewodniczący hiszpańskiej rady ministrów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy oczekiwałem go na stacji, gdy mnie zobaczył, trzeba było widzieć jego oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Felek się nie uspokoił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi to patetycznie, brzmi to może trochę na wyrost, ale tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się często zdarza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i zawrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosiliśmy go na lunch w pobliskiej knajpie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjął mnie z chmurą na czole i wyrzutem w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robię po prostu bilans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tysiąc razy lepszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strachu i wściekłości bełkotał: — Tylko ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy mieć grube nieprzyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gówno, czy jest sprzeczna, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też pan mówi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wiesz, dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym kończyło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28491452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowią one lepsze rozwiązanie niż pobrzękiwanie szabelką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28491453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przyciąć drzewo, żeby umożliwić mu wzrost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28491454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich latach producenci dokonali ogromnego postępu technologicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28491455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjednoczona Europa nie jest możliwa bez skoordynowanej i skutecznie działającej transeuropejskiej sieci transportowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28491456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróćmy jednak do rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Weź, Felku, ten pierścień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto rozprysnęło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wiersze miałem kiedyś czytać ludziom, którzy wierzyli w przetrwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24733992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym oczom przez chwilę nawet wierzyć nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24733993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdłuż ogrodów w powabnych liniach wiła się wązka ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24733994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i ostatecznie zdecydował się przestrzelić mu rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24733995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągle jeszcze rozważałem treść listu, tak mię poruszyła głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24733996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pozostaje mi tylko umrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37800330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ dzisiaj jest to niemożliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37800331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem również bardzo wdzięczny pańskim zespołom - proszę przekazać im podziękowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37800332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Komisja jest przygotowana, by wykorzystać impet, jakiego nabrały sprawy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37800333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad tym również należy się na przyszłość zastanowić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37800334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak państwo wiedzą, moją główną domeną jest gospodarka, środowisko naturalne i nasza wspólna polityka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20682464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20682465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20682466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20682467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20682468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jakimś czasie ktoś otworzył drzwi przedziału i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31231916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uniwersytety powinny liczyć na znaczne i dające się przewidzieć wsparcie publiczne i prywatne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31231917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych okolicznościach zbyt wielka była pokusa, by popuścić cugli nieograniczonemu kapitalizmowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31231918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał też, że jak najszybciej opracuje rozporządzenie, które pozwoli rozwiązać te problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31231919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłyśmy w głównej nawie katedry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31231920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontynuowanie działań zmierzających do dalszej demokratyzacji leży w żywotnym interesie tych trzech państw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Symbole siedmiu planet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sposób w jaki Ania opowiada o malowaniu zaintrygował nawet mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Ala da ołówek, bo trzeba narysować latarnię — będzie ładny obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystkie Podlasiaki tak wyglądają, jakby zbytecznej na karku gęby co prędzej pozbyć się chcieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, żeś mądry nad swe lata: tedy posłuchaj moich słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęli przed nią i zawahali się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie otworzył oczu i udawał, że drzemie w dalszym ciągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26982306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zwykła kolej rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26982307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzyści są wielorakie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26982308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy sprawić, by Europa była bardziej atrakcyjna dla imigrantów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26982309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię o tym tak dobitnie, ponieważ nie możemy tylko spokojnie siedzieć i czekać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26982310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedsiębiorstw i Przemysłu w sprawie odpowiedzialności społecznej przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach! — krzyknęła płaczliwym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał jeszcze za sobą zawstydzony głos Filipa: — Przepraszam kolegę na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś ciekawie patrzy przez okno samochodu na swoją stolicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżała nad rzeką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie — odrzekła dziwożona i wspięła się ku niemu na palcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil: — Nosisz dzisiaj wstrętne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok naocznie sprawdzonego sęka napełnił ich jakąś nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Marcinku, trzeba na lekcji uważać — upomina pani łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znać od dawna już nikt nie używał tej ścieżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaludnili więc sam widok lasu, jakby w celu uzupełnienia i ożywienia nieprzynależnego nikomu obrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do każdej herbaty dodaję kilka kropel cytryny i miód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32337899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę przyznać szczerze, że jej nie usłyszałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32337900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że tak będzie nadal\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32337901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymierze zmusza nas do myślenia o wzajemności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32337902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też uważam, że referenda są kluczowym aspektem procesu ratyfikacyjnego Traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32337903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ona może pomóc w przezwyciężeniu konfliktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać: godzinę, dwie, choćby trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdyby chłopiec — byłoby śmiesznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszeliśmy tu jednak wypowiedź, której nie można zaakceptować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aże pachnie po onej dziewce w izbie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W toku negocjacji projektów poprawek osiągnięto kompromis, który uzyskał poparcie całego spektrum politycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bynajmniej: i on także cierpiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zadbać o to, żeby nasze działania były konsekwentne aż do samego końca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna powtórzyła: — Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę tylko powiedzieć, że przeżyliśmy wiele okrutnych dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna stanęła nad jego łóżkiem i pochyliła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same przeszkody i nic ponadto!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — powiedział prędko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36624704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musimy zdecydowanie potępić wydarzenia w Republice Wybrzeża Kości Słoniowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36624705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tematem procedury legislacyjnej jest jednak oczywiście wyłącznie tekst w brzmieniu wspólnie przez nas ustalonym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36624706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim pragnę podziękować liderom grup za ich uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36624707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja chce, żebyśmy zatwierdzili nową umowę z Marokiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36624708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też ocena sieci transeuropejskich z perspektywy finansowej musi być bardziej ambitna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39569727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej sprawie istnieje pełna zgoda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39569729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże gospodarka światowa przeżywa obecnie bardzo głęboki kryzys\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39569730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzi to do oczywistej dyskryminacji kobiet, które otrzymują wyraźnie niższe emerytury niż mężczyźni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39569732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiliśmy znaczny krok naprzód w kierunku wzajemnego uznawania regulacji dotyczących bezpieczeństwa urządzeń elektrycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39569734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tamtej pory zdarzyło się coś, co całkowicie zmieniło strukturę i działanie Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak być nie może!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego nie można osiągnąć z dnia na dzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wierzymy w możliwie najszerszy dostęp do wspólnotowych instrumentów odbudowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowym elementem rozwiązania, którego poszukujemy, jest legalność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dyskryminująca praktyka jest zła i jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przecież panu coś na mnie zależy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała wtedy tak: cierpiała na zanik nosa na perkato.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszła do nieba — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło tylko o zobaczenie tego, co jest na dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy Emil zrobił nieokreśloną minę i rozbeczał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na usta wybiegł uśmiech zadowolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z literatury rosyjskiej uznawał tylko Dostojewskiego i Babla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadarła ogonek i poleciała na płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto tu był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to jednak szczególne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg począł raptownie zwalniać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyżarła — wyznał z westchnieniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie panowała taka wesołość w dziecinnym pokoju Dużej Rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi tam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stali we troje, ale tylko Emil patrzył na trupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem sobie nową konsolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jednak zawsze już bliżej końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz z tym wszystkim koniec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A u żadnej z lalek nie spotkałam takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwariowałaś”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęliby oboje, bez żadnej pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Popatrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pokroić wędlinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił pisać o morzu, o jechaniu okrętem, bo uważał, że to też była wycieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie umrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyraziłby się, że zachowała niezatarte ślady piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę dnia, złego snu, gdy zanurzam się w noc, jak w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzieli, że będą za pięć minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil wykładał spokojnie teorię absurdo- logii, jak zwykle — zbyt serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz szedłem powoli, umyślnie zwolniwszy kroku, by się wewnętrznie opanować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie nie było mu źle — ale ciasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23967850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc to tu miałby być Koguci zaułek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23967851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ależ musiałem przecie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23967852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie wtedy nie mogłem tego zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23967853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisarz przy tych słowach umaczał pióro w atramencie i zaczął bazgrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23967854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytuję półgłosem markiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł ciało do góry, wrzucił do trumny i nakrył wiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radził sobie zuchwale bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to jednak nie czuła się szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mizerny był, żółty i policzki miał wpadłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21445763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek chwilę jeszcze popytał o to i owo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor: Jan Baptysta Porta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On trzyma, a ty zrzuciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli oszczędni w gestach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już idę! — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oszczędź mi pan swych dowcipów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31454639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność zwalczania terroryzmu leży przede wszystkim w gestii rządów krajowych i niezależnych państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31454640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy za to z odwagą i odpowiedzialnością zabrać się do redukowania długów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31454641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachęcam państwa stanowczo do głosowania za tym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31454642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach tego mandatu mogliśmy prowadzić negocjacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31454643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obozie byłem tylko parę godzin, bo musiałem się spieszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37851585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze wierzę, że nie ma takiego ryzyka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37851586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie znam: wczoraj przyjechałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37851587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o to właśnie chodzi w rezolucji Grupy Sojuszu Socjalistów i Demokratów w Parlamencie Europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37851588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza, że jesteśmy za zwiększeniem przepaści między najbogatszymi i najbiedniejszymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37851589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym przyłączyć się do gratulacji wyrażanych dla sprawozdawczyni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wybrał się na polowanie, pozostawiając swym więźniom żywność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślałem nad tym, że społeczeństwo ludzkie to jedna ogromna sieć pomyłek i głupstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież, u licha, mam prawo zajmować się kościołem świętego Barnaby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mrówka myśli, że to wysoka góra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołaliśmy przyjść z pomocą, nieszczęśliwy uległ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27892338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasady te są następujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27892339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27892340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy sobie pogratulować i bez wątpienia powinniśmy pogratulować prezydencji szwedzkiej za osiągniecie takiego wyniku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27892341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliski Wschód ma także swe chrześcijańskie korzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27892342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Europie stworzyliśmy zamożność tworząc bogactwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36969661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.828,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dane tak nieprawdopodobne, że tłumacze podali liczbę kilkuset zamiast kilkuset tysięcy ofiar\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36969662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie musimy być również poważnym partnerem, takim, który nie spisuje jedynie list życzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36969663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym mamy znaczne opóźnienie w stosunku do harmonogramu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36969664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani komisarzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36969665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak przyjdzie nam jeszcze długo poczekać, zanim Hamas okaże taki sam poziom autorefleksji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, dogodził mu, jak się należało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo wysoko ubezpieczony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieczenie gorącej oliwy, ale nie bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniłaś opony w samochodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówił o sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22550504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22550505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22550506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22550507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22550508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto urywki tego, co jej odpowiadano z pląsających łodzi rybackich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnęłam? — zapytała rumieniąc się jak jutrzenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale był jeden robotnik stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po deszczu na ulice i chodniki wychodzą ślimaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęła się samotna i naga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil musiał głęboko oddychać co parę mi nut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać: godzinę, dwie, choćby trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39920694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmocnić siły proeuropejskie możemy wyłącznie przyjmując realistyczne podejście i zachowując się w odpowiedni sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39920695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po północy dopiero uciszyło się nieco, tak, że można było przynajmniej ognie rozpalić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39920696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd serbski należy pochwalić za działania, które podjął do tej pory\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39920697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech teraz księżna przemówi za wami, bo inaczej gorze chłopcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39920698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowa dyrektywa ramowa musi zapewniać ofiarom handlu ludźmi konkretne uprawnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30556783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie niejasne podejście jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30556784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak osiągnięcie tych celów zależy od tego, jak służbę tę zorganizujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30556785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W źródłach alternatywnych surowiec ten jest mniej skoncentrowany niż w tradycyjnych złożach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30556786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest jednak zapewnienie spójności między tymi dwoma wnioskami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30556787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że doprowadzimy do pożytecznej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczynają po południu, po pierwszym obfitszym jedzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem: Alaska… potem wilki, względnie psy… i sanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wbrew zakazowi usiadłem na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To tylko fason jej bucików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał przy mikroskopie, na biurku leżał stos otwartych książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko weszła w swój trans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pierwszy ten lepszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę go wpierw wystawić i obliczyć cenę wraz z karą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — rzuciłem odruchowo pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli tak i nie myśleli o niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakaś lekcja odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zwykle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mów hop, póki nie przeskoczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to jednak szczególne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24637201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast oczu miał dwie czerwone jamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24637204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź podejdź do okna i zobacz czy jego samochód nie stoi na dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24637205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różnorodność zdań o dziele sztuki świadczy, że jest nowe, złożone i żywotne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24637207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O niczym innym nie marzę, jak o powrocie do biura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24637208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czuję, iż ją zobaczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36996482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pan uznawany za gorącego orędownika ochrony środowiska, i gratuluję panu tego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36996483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę poinformować służby techniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36996484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwo powinno zapewnić rodzicom taki wolny czas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36996485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przedstawia się kwestia przyjęcia pakietu środków przedłożonych przez Komisję już pięć lat temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36996486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To musi być naszym celem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał, że będzie przysyłał pieniądze co miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zaręczał, że jej chorej matce nie zabraknie niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to rzeczy zupełnie niewspółmierne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miód jest słodki i zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stara historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszność wisi pod sufitem i kładzie się na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27639370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie są dotychczasowe wyniki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27639371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustępstwo to powinno było stanowić absolutny wyjątek i dotyczyć wyłącznie Papui Nowej Gwinei\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27639372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas przesłuchań kandydatów na komisarzy jednym z najczęściej wypowiadanych słów była \\\"przejrzystość\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27639373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkreślam przy tym słowo \\\"inwestycje\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27639374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie wybuchł konflikt między Unią Trybunałów Islamskich a wojskiem z sąsiedniej Etiopii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszedł wkrótce do palisady, otaczającej cały domek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na fotelu, ona usiadła na poręczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oni przeszli obok niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cóż się właściwie z nami stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26964913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmawianie Parlamentowi materiałów, za pomocą których sprawuje on kompetencje legislacyjne jest rzeczą absurdalną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26964914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pierwsza taka inicjatywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26964916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy bardzo dokładnie przemyśleć samą procedurę absolutorium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26964917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to sprawa o zasadniczym znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26964918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak moje wątpliwości budzi ustawienie priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40178899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one powodem stresu i niepokoju dla wielu koleżanek i kolegów oraz dla urzędników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40178900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Partnerstwo ma wymiar dwustronny, który jest dostosowany do każdego państwa partnerskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40178901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz ostatnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40178902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, mówi się na temat projektu sieci telewizyjnej Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40178903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę zapewnić Pana, że skutek będzie całkowicie przeciwny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23726408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niższa część drzwi ustąpiła; drzewo dębowe zupełnie obróciło się w węgiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23726409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katarzyna powróciła do siebie i nie wychodziła przez cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23726410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągle jeszcze rozważałem treść listu, tak mię poruszyła głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23726411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem jak mi głos zadrżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23726412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gorzki posmak jął mię dusić w gardle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy, kiedy ty ze Stanisławem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znajdowali się blisko gimnazjum, do którego chodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O przenajświętsza Matko Boża!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóżcie mi stanąć na nogach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że przesadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toć go nie mogę gwałtem odebrać rodzicom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24493676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi się podobał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomyślą, że człowiekowi przykro i boi się, że panią rozgniewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty to rozumiesz, przyjacielu „Mostowy”, i zrobisz, jak ja proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ona sama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29367599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sektorach zaawansowanych technologii, gdzie prace są wyższe, kobiety są zdecydowanie niedoreprezentowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29367600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzasadnione podejrzenie to może być za mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29367601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymieniłem tylko kilka przedmiotowych dziedzin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29367602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest dość jasne, jakie podobieństwa istnieją między socjalizmem sowieckim a socjalizmem narodowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29367603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście sensowne jest poszukiwanie środków ochrony przed działaniami Izraela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36738154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Negocjacje między dwoma stronami powinny rozpocząć się możliwie jak najszybciej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36738161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie są państwo-tym komisarzem, co jest zasmucające i nie może dalej trwać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36738179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był bardzo piękny, ale zarazem smutny i żałosny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36738190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowanie sprzeciwiam się dodatkowym celom restrykcyjnym bez kompleksowego, międzynarodowego porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36738207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpracy Organów Regulacji Energetyki powinna funkcjonować zgodnie z zasadą jednego głosu dla każdego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem on odwraca głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny ułatwić korzystanie z tego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28314612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego jest to takie ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28314613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj będę tę sprawę rozwiązywał na przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28314614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sektor rybołówstwa potrzebuje planu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28314615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak konsument może być chroniony i jakie działania zamierzają państwo podjąć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28314616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich pięciu latach byliśmy świadkami ogromnej demokratycznej transformacji w Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież nie był szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artyści, twórcy religii, ludzie niezadowoleni, nienasyceni, metafizycy, wielka różnorodność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnęła, aby jak najprędzej ją zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dżungla oddaje to, co zabrała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej po południu zapaliłem bez wielkiej przyjemności pierwszego papierosa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy naprawdę jestem nieśmiertelna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ci powiedzieć coś złego, jak tamtej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już zupełnie ciemno, gdy zbliżaliśmy się do budynków stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znalazł się u siebie, położył się natychmiast na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawił się na poduszkach, wyciągnął nogi przed siebie i zapalił cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jak możesz żyć z nim pod jednym dachem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepiej, nie najlepiej! — odrzekł ze szczerym smutkiem w głosie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siedzi delegat królów i drzemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten nosek, co się do góry zadzierał, był taki śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — przypominam sobie… złotą czarę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34519768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o rolnictwo, nasze stanowisko jest wyważone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34519769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później musimy omówić perspektywę finansową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34519770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezolucja byłaby właściwa dopiero po nadchodzących wyborach na Ukrainie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34519771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzutuje to bardzo negatywnie na dochodowość gospodarstw, które wyspecjalizowały się w produkcji mleka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34519772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od spełnienia jakich warunków wstępnych Turcja uzależnia swój udział?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie denerwuj mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśń była skończoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bawisz się?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez twoją matkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywa się Stanisław Wokulski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem jeszcze w stanie tego zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pogardzał tymi ludźmi, czasem nienawidził ich nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic panienka nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłem w jego gabinecie, urągał mi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz pospieszył do sieni i niecierpliwie otwarł drzwi wiodące na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale straszne było przebudzenie z upojeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie miałam z kim pojechać kajakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wierzę, Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29808718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie, do tej pory mówcy przestrzegali czasów wystąpień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29808719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśleli, że jestem komisarzem - niech Bóg broni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29808720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, mogę państwu powiedzieć, że odpowiedź brzmi nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29808721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzyskał on poparcie przewodniczącego Komisji i prezydencji francuskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29808723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzymy bowiem o Białorusi demokratycznej, wolnej, dzielącej z nami europejskie wartości i standardy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dżungla oddaje to, co zabrała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka, kiedy zaczną znów rozpytywać, kim jest i skąd przybył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz i ja zauważyłem zmiany u niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak myślę — tak wierzę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27740909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to akceptację sektorów zgłoszonych do wsparcia po dogłębnej dyskusji z krajem partnerskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27740910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wojnie tej nie jesteśmy zakładnikami, ale żołnierzami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27740911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w tym celu zostanie wykorzystany nowy budynek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27740912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostęp do zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27740913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ostatecznie okaże się, że energia wiatrowa stała się opłacalna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej sytuacji są one kluczowe do zrozumienia całej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem do miłego widzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy deszcz minął, poszli po raz pierwszy do Emila do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło mi się przewracać w głowie, patrzyłem poza nią, za okno, miałem półotwarte usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na człeka tak ledwo ledwo zakrawasz, jakbyś go naprędce i od biedy jeno zmałpował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo i prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby — sfora psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dni rozłąki jakże gorzkie, jakie złe są!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on jest liderem fizycznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och, Liza jest bardzo dzielną dziewczyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie znam lepszego sposobu na rozpoczęcie dnia jak czarna, smolista i słodka kawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza chwyciła go i wzięła na rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta pierwsza zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — rzekł prawie surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wy także jesteście książętami i księżniczkami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nagromadzaj przeszkód! — ostrzegł ją zawczasu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, wzgórza już opustoszały, a Ludek Górski wywędrował z tych okolic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mój chłopcze, mama obiecała mi dzisiaj, że pojadę sama na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzą, że ze mną też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się zbliżył, aby zbadać jej puls, poznałem straszliwą prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bo jasny pan lekki jak pióro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl i język są dla artysty narzędziami sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praga w Czerwcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największy mój błąd, że byłem dumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł więc za nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaiste, to była freudowska pomyłka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40279096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto decyduje o tych zatrzymaniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40279097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa członkowskie - i one też załączają wszelkiego rodzaju specjalne wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40279098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety ma rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40279099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małżeństwo jest ową nakrywką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40279100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywistość w Europie wygląda jednak nieco inaczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, czy pan jest Jakub? — powtórzył Ignacy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he! — szydził kolejarz — kochany pan zapewne poeta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale burza nadeszła: gromadziła się wiekami i naraz wybuchła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowałem Ci niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26574402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy zadowoleni, że nasze stanowisko zostało wzięte pod uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26574403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie oni będą spali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26574404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podejmowana jest dziś próba ochrony własnych interesów nie przebierając w środkach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26574405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja kobiet zbliżających się do wieku emerytalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26574406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako honorowy gość, kiedy startował w wyborach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź spokojny; potrafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A tak, oczywiście — przyznałem — oba są zabudowane, zwłaszcza ten we Florencji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąską uliczkę między dwoma rzędami bazarów wypełniał skłębiony malowniczo tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kącie stało składane łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28055356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowodzi to jednego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28055357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym, lecz w tej sprawie całkowicie zależę od Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28055358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słusznie doceniła pani prace organizacji pozarządowych, które osobiście uważam za przykład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28055359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, by zrezygnować z uogólnień i przyjąć praktyczne środki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28055360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy także uznać, że odnawialne źródła energii to nie darmowy posiłek, jak niektórzy uważają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam dla was trzy rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podłodze też nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się, idąc ulicą, jak mu się nudziło, w kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, jak ona, nie tańczył z takim wdziękiem walca, oberka, mazura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37984468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy więc wspólne problemy do rozwiązania, wspólnie też musimy stawić czoła wyzwaniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37984469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem równość szans to unikalna konkurencyjna przewaga Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37984470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że tak się stanie również dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37984471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi dyplomaci w regionie dokładnie śledzą sytuację we Wschodniej Jerozolimie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37984472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trakcie obrad nad przedmiotowym sprawozdaniem nasze obawy skupiały się na kwestii praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do bardzo ciemnego parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duża, trójkątna głowa, biała czupryna w nieładzie, brązo we, błyszczące oczy, wąskie usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy przyszedł mi w pomoc szczęśliwy przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20920810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rządy egipski i angielski działały powolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20920811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeca paliła się na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20920812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piwniczy wydał okrzyk zdziwienia i wskazał na wyciągniętą rękę zmarłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20920813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzeniem jego było polować kiedyś na wielkie zwierzęta w Afryce środkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20920814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na szybowcu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska jest największym dostawcą pomocy humanitarnej i rozwojowej na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten spór graniczny wygląda dokładnie tak samo jak wtedy, gdy Słowenia przystąpiła do Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co my mamy przez tę dżumę!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Irena złapała się za głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem państwu co to oznacza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzekłem się jej dobrowolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lipcowe słońce przypiekało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój ojciec oszczędził to na czas, gdy się obudziliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37576902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powinniśmy iść dalej w kierunku formalnego systemu nadzoru bankowego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37576903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja, w której się obecnie znajdujemy, jest najgorsza z możliwych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37576904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykonaliśmy przyjazne gesty wobec Izraela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37576905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto, kryzys finansowy skomplikował niezmiernie zadania, jakie ma przed sobą Europejski Bank Centralny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37576906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem zadowolony z obniżenia się uprzedniego niedopuszczalnego wskaźnika błędu w obszarze wspólnej polityki rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam czytał po łacinie i grecku tak, jak Emil T.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie ginę bez zasługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Papier jest bezczelnie biały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21071686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O cóż wam tedy chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21071687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było dobrze za grane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21071688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyrzekłem mu, kiedy pisał po raz pierwszy, że go śledzić nie będę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21071689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziesiąta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21071691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to pani nie nasuwa jakiegoś przypuszczenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi się trochę podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani z tej, ani z żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę pana, tylko na parę godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nie znosiła dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia wyszła na podwórko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczegóły oczywista nie wchodzą w zakres naszych rozważań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyprowadziłem go przez ogród na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hę? — intruz nastawił uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz mieć sen zdrowy, panie naczelniku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to w prostej linii dziad Seweryna Baryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale łazienki trzeba też umieć używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne mi się wydało, że mam z chłopakami się gonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzi, że wraca za trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jej kuzynem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21548395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gromkie okrzyki powitały ten wspaniały pochód; radość tłumu przeszła granice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21548396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego rodzaju doświadczenia znane są ludziom prostym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21548397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie może wiedzieć, co mu grozi ze strony tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21548398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dziś rankiem tam weszły, to dotychczas ich nie widać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21548400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpoczęły wesołe igraszki i śpiewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęła je bić po tyłku i biła je długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem tego samego zdania! — zgodził się muł — Widocznie mamy wspólne upodobania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju, gdzie nie było Ewy, duch unosił się nad wodami i niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan może wiedzieć o tym wszystkim? — szeptał na pół przytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchasz mnie w ogóle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Mieliśmy psów sześć - powtórzył z niezmąconym spokojem Bill. - Wyjąłem sześć ryb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie przed czym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szmuglowane i niezdrowe na płuca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewność tę okazywało wyraźnie całe stado. Składało się z dobrych dwudziestu sztuk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tu nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36800107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wzmocnić rolę Europolu, by zapobiegać przedostawaniu się do Europy potencjalnych terrorystów i przestępców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36800108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra współpraca Unii Europejskiej z Ukrainą jest bardzo ważna, zwłaszcza dla krajów sąsiadujących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36800109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Profesjonalizm banku musi zapewnić utrzymanie tego ratingu, który symbolizuje także finanse Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36800110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę spróbować je wyłapać, zakolczykować i śledzić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36800111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to wspaniałe i chciałabym za to podziękować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygnąłem się jak pod ukąszeniem węża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dżungla oddaje to, co zabrała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze nie skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26897328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Komisja przygotuje następnie sprawozdanie z procesu wdrażania przepisów tego rozporządzenia w państwach członkowskich?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26897330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie może opierać się na kryteriach gospodarczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26897341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak wszyscy pracownicy, Romowie walczą przeciwko interesom monopolistycznym i systemowi wyzysku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26897343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.332,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakaz ten miał bardzo traumatyczne konsekwencje dla społeczeństwa rumuńskiego, uświadamiając nam niebezpieczeństwo takiej decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26897344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ludność szczególnie wrażliwa, zagrożone kobiety, dzieci i nieletni bez opieki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powinieneś być w salonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze cmentarze muszą mieć wygląd zupełnie odmienny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądają jak dołki i rowki, powstałe od nakłucia szpilką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poleciał wiatr w górę gonić obłoki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosz, spadając w koziołkach, wysypał całą swą zawartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ciastka są wyborne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba jeszcze głośniej, i pani się rozgniewała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóc ci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie tego cudu zaniedbało się obejrzeć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Samo się bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patelnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszła, cofając się wolno, tyłem, jak teatralny paź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak go lubią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłem sobie wtedy, że widzę ją po raz ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego właściwie pan mi to wszystko przypomina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda to, że stary zjada co dzień młodego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał dużo; szybko, często powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drobnostka, kochany panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa była tak chaotyczna, że nic nie można było zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie strzelam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam jego zwrotu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam go jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płomień wstydu oblał mu czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mi słabo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonałem się teraz, że jestem silniejszy od niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objechała pół świata, ale to jej nie wystarcza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Murzynek Bambo z Afryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeleciał przez mur! — zawołała Maria, śledząca lot ptaszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za długo już siedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora wracać do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie mogą liczyć na pewną dyskrecję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zrywają się od stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymi ojcami byli: wielki pisarz, filozof Joachim i cielesny ojciec Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocie łby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotował się kretyn do tej nocy bohaterskiej jak toreador.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mogę: tak mnie coś ściskało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście trzeba na to woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37273853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jestem zdumiona ilością miejsca, jakie poświęca się w nim węglowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37273854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona konsumentów jest bezwzględnym priorytetem, ale musimy poprawić nasze procedury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37273855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konwergencja pomiędzy krajami często maskuje pogłębianie się różnic między regionami i wewnątrz regionów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37273856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Funkcja sprawozdawcy sprawozdania rocznego Rzecznika Praw Obywatelskich jest dla mnie wielkim zaszczytem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37273857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedsiębiorstwa i pracownicy, a także my domagamy się jednego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się to pisze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba będzie samej wyjechać na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci przy kartach zaczynają się podniecać i krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym bardziej jestem w skórze innych, tym wyżej wznosi się moje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za ten tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz o tym i wiesz też, że ona cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz była to noc nieprzyjemna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewizja robót przy kanałach była sprawą pilną i starsi panowie nie mogli stracić czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrodzony mu akcent dźwięczał, jak kij na szynach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam ją tak przezwał z wdzięczności serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez wiele miesięcy nie pamiętałem nawet, że on pozostawił córkę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chłopiec widocznie nie posłyszał, bo przestał płakać i poszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22472353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22472354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22472355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22472356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22472357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie zapytał, Ewa nie powiedziała mu nic o wyniku oględzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy w domu chleb?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy ani przedtem, ani potem nie widziałem jej tak rozrzewnionej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22390185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22390186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22390188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22390190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22390192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem się rozglądać na wszystkie strony, jak tylko oko sięgało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Normalnie reklama po reklamie na tym kanale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewam się, że w przeciągu godziny sprawa się skończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wracam natychmiast do mego pułku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22795874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy gry, kto najwięcej wygra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja pozostanę tutaj; będę oczekiwał twego powrotu tu w tym fotelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie zabrzmiała trąbka i pociąg ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddałby, oddał na pewno, bo chciałby pozostać uczciwym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy ona jest tu może u pana, w tym domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ujrzałem jej oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się ponad śniegiem i miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mógł wysunąć się na łóżko i wpaść w ręce męża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nakazuje prawo puszczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale twój tato musi mieć kupę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy rozumiecie w polityce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zawsze jeździłem na nartach, ale może w tym roku spróbuję na snowboardzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili do pokoju weszła jakaś Chinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile chodzi o Emila — nie wstydziła się niczego więcej; ani mówić, ani czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz ode mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś goni po przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było świństwo, że mu nie kupiono psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizm żadną miarą nie da się pogodzić z personalizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było po dawnemu zwyczajne, codzienne i przeciętne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał się mniej więcej — cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd się tu wzięły skały pierwotne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie zauważyłeś tego, papo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To są stosy papierów i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym właśnie sęk! — zawołał Podlasiak, wstydliwie obmacując wybitną pozostałość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajcie! — rozlegało się coraz wyżej i coraz ciszej w promiennych od słońca przestworach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27021664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim pragnę podziękować wszystkim posłom za trafne pytania, które zadawali podczas debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27021665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas nadchodzącego szczytu bezsprzecznie będziemy musieli uwzględnić ten istotny cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27021666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażone opinie stanowią użyteczne narzędzie dla naszych negocjacji w sprawie umów o wolnym handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27021667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki środek miałby charakter demagogiczny i byłby zupełnie niedostosowany do obecnej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27021668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosuję przeciwko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40849018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragną Państwo, by dyktatorzy opuścili swoje kraje i mają Państwo rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40849019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta operacja morska przeciwko piractwu jest prowadzona z europejskiej kwatery operacyjnej w Zjednoczonym Królestwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40849020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustawa językowa wprowadza stan nierównowagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40849021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To godne ubolewania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40849022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec prawa i prawdy wszyscy jesteśmy równi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24599519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie masz się czego rumienić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24599520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej dotykały twarzy chłopca, który się wstawił, jak żądała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24599521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba rozumiem o co ci chodziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24599522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie to... Panu Motylkowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24599523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co też pan wygaduje...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23444211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drżenie serca w mej piersi mówiło mi, że nadeszła właśnie chwila rozstrzygająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23444212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również istoty czerwonawego koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23444213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała dzielnica żydowska poruszona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23444214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak, każdej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23444215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zatem, panie Pernat, zechciej mi powiedzieć, co pan tak robi przez cały dzień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba lodówka nam się popsuła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam się co rano w lustrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilkę po wypowiedzeniu tych słów odłożył motykę i powstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytywana o to, odpowiadała wymijająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo chciałem wziąć łódkę i spróbować, czy będę mógł wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część zginęła w boju, część siedzi w obozie dla jeńców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dosięgnął najwyższego tonu, krzepki i tętniący, po czym z wolna rozpłynął się i dogasł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie słuszne tedy, że pragnę go zobaczyć raz jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"odpowiedział, dopóki nie usiadł na skrzyni i nie zabrał się do jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pierwsza córeczka po trzech synach i wszyscy się tak cieszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lasem szła stara kobiecina i zbierała szyszki w szeroki fartuch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Jarmark cieszył się olbrzymią popularnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dniem i nocą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynał odczuwać znużenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostowała się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale potem… będziemy mogli pogadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33280356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gaza znalazła się w centrum zainteresowania, ale okupacja ma miejsce każdego dnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33280357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak, tego, co zrobiono w Gazie, nie można nazwać sprawiedliwością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33280358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest zdania, że przez to umowa może być podważana z prawnego punktu widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33280359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy ogromne doświadczenie w prowadzeniu handlu międzynarodowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33280360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłuższy okres czasu mógłby niekorzystnie wpłynąć na reintegrację kobiet na rynku pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie się wydaje, że ona wyjechała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście w tejże chwili nadszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie doskonale, jak!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę zostawiać tylko cyfr dla statystyki, chcę przyszłą historię wzbogacić w dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to w jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężona ręka lewa wskazywała coś uparcie w dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Proszę pana, czy ja mogę pana pocałować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz muszę stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek był tuż, jak gdyby na wierzchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście im wiek późniejszy, tym bardziej charakter komórek jest inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na salę operacyjną bez słowa, jakby jeszcze spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szum chodził wierzchem lasu, nie przenikając do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prześwietna sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie, co jest najsmutniejsze w tej całej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni na skrawku przestrzeni bez wyjścia wobec zalewającego żywiołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40884215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogromna prędkość przy niewłaściwym kierunku grozi tylko jednym - potęgowaniem skali katastrofy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40884216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On swojej pomsty szuka, ja swojej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40884217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamasz trafił w ścianę i o mało nie zwalił brązowego posążka Sobieskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40884218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam za ogromnie ważne, by oprzeć nasz budżet na argumentach dotyczących bezpieczeństwa żywnościowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40884220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje kilka szczególnie ważnych obszarów, na które pragnę zwrócić konkretnie uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas potopu, pogasły gwiazdy na niebie i znikły światła na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną, dziewczyco, nie rób żadnych ceregieli — rzekł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma powodu do obaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28512905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wszystkich przytoczonych powodów głosowałem za tym sprawozdaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28512906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci dwaj goście są ważnymi przywódcami ruchu demokratycznej opozycji na Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28512907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konserwatyści brytyjscy popierają likwidację różnic płacowych i innych form dyskryminacji ze względu na płeć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28512908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym celem przewodnim jest stopniowe poprawianie jakości wody w rzekach i jeziorach europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28512909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw chciałabym podziękować sprawozdawcom, Komisji Europejskiej i instytucjom Unii Europejskiej, a zwłaszcza prezydencji francuskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko trzeba po kolei powiedzieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pojedziemy dalej gondolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szepty zapełniły mały park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz od początku… — powtórzył ciszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski otworzył okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani Wąsowska była zirytowana, Wokulski sposępniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka jest jak inna, wcale nie ładniejsza”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu posunąłem się dzielnie w kierunku raz obranym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, faktycznie brak jest oceny finansowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawię się w słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeść, ani uczyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z nikotyną, alkoholem i wszelkimi «białymi obłędami».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzyma się za tę cienką nić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ich Eskimosi bardzo obchodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranek był jasny, majowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten dzień zapasy były skończone i zebrani rozeszli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, prawda co do joty — potakiwał Ole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do łazienki i mył się zbyt długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34903453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdźmy za tym przykładem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34903454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest paradoks, ale sytuacja jest dość prosta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34903455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj najgorsze może być już za nami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34903456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To leży w narodowym interesie nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34903457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten temat właściwie tu nie rozmawiamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzem takim jak ja dałby rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myszki nie robią takiego hałasu! — zauważyła Żaneta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy się z czasem wyrabia — przerwałem, cały drżący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym z tobą trochę pogawędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie sądziłem że tak mi się to spodoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi, syn krawca — dziewięcioro małych dzieci — bieda wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23338626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traciły grunt pod nogami, jak mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23338627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydziłem się jej natrętnego śmiechu i tej woskowej twarzy jakby drewnianego konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23338628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu znalazłem siebie, tak się wszystko zjednoczyło we mnie pod naciskiem woli nasłuchiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23338629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro jedziemy na wycieczkę do safari.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23338630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko uczucie osobliwego, lodowatego szkieletu we mnie, trwało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dorożka! — zawołała Janet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co? — Nie wiem za co.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zdziwiona, nie znajdując w niej żadnych zmian.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym słowem, nie obraża się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, gdzie mieszkasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymia, „bezimienna paszcza”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci obiecać, że ten list będzie ostatni, ale gdybym mógł, obiecałbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili do pokoju weszła jakaś Chinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie ona lepiej od nas, co czynić na oczach ludzkich, a co na stronie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór! — poprawił go niewczesny kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była w dalszym ciągu bardzo grzeczna, bardzo dziecinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zdarzało bardzo rzadko, i dlatego była niespokojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jednak zawsze już bliżej końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokuczamy jej czasem, ale dzielna z niej dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza jej epilog nad ranem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi spaść w nocy lub rano, żeby nie zdążyli uprzątnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż bardzo lubiła leżeć w łóżku, wstawała od razu i buch do łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadał szeroko o jej piersiach w swoich wykładach na Universite Perverse.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powiedziałem coś zabawnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny był dziewczak — rzekł wreszcie kulawiec i spojrzał na przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo chciałem wziąć łódkę i spróbować, czy będę mógł wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie polityka spójności nie jest jedynie kwestią solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nowy pomysł, który otwiera pole do debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszanowanie przekonań i praw musi być dla Unii Europejskiej kwestią o zasadniczym znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważny aspekt załatwiania spraw przez Unię Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także w tym względzie powinniśmy zwracać uwagę naszym partnerom, że powinni przestrzegać podjętych zobowiązań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bałwana ulepić, czy wskoczyć z rozmachu obiema nogami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś ty nigdy nie udawała niczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez oka mgnienie zdawał się upajać zdobytą nagle wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem dojmujący chłód wilgoci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął czarować, żeby choć odwrócić role.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stała Ela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wierzę ci, Marku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina jedenasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O! a jak się rozciągnął i jak się rozwija\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę się położyć spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ostatniego zajścia upłynęły trzy tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytała: — Idziesz też do miasta? — Czekam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko oglądał na nowo, jakby dawno nie widziane, jakby na nowo odkrył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszło, minęło — myślmy o chwili obecnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może instynktem kobiety wyczuła przy nim bliskość anioła śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28666167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebny jest nadzór\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28666168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"programach nauczania, zarządzaniu i finansowaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28666169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejny, nieco bardziej długofalowy cel, jest oczywiście związany z igrzyskami olimpijskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28666170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod jednym względem stanowimy wyjątek i mamy ku temu powody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28666171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj zadaję sobie pytanie, co to właściwie oznacza, poza samymi słowami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26822731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego w wykazie składników miałoby nie być odniesienia do nanosubstancji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26822733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daje również możliwość zmniejszenia liczby testów na zwierzętach i przypadków pracy dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26822735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiana sygnatury międzyinstytucyjnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26822737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebny jest także skuteczny i zaktualizowany system monitorowania i oceny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26822740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymagają tego okoliczności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu cytaty z zeznań świadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję przede wszystkim, że odniósł się pan do europejskiej karty społecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga to zmiany priorytetów politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jeszcze, poza nakładaniem sankcji, zrobiła Rada?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, chciałbym podkreślić znaczenie dobrego zarządzania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogromną przyjemnością było goszczenie pana tu po raz pierwszy podczas sesji plenarnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detale na ten temat później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłaby teraz wszystko, czego by chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na palcach podeszliśmy do sztalugi, by śledzić przebieg pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty się boisz ryzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22709027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem się zastanawiać, jak się tu wydostać z beczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22709028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo następnego tygodnia i za dwa tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22709029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tych wszystkich powodów spodziewałem się, że oni przyjdą dziś w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22709030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po mojej misji nie było się już czego spodziewać, zrobiłem, co mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22709031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koniecznie to zobacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wolnym czasie uwielbiam chodzić z przyjaciółmi na spacery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kruk, przelatujący nad lasem, zakrakał nagle na śmierć temu właśnie dębowi, pod którym siedzieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczała chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rany boskie! — wykrzyknął sierżant, siadając ciężko na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Jarmark cieszył się olbrzymią popularnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21098266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarł rękawem zimny pot z czoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21098267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczynka zaraz się usłuchała i usiadła na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21098268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cóż, szlachetna istoto, chcesz zrobić z tym szkieletem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21098269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc naprawdę Ania przyszła wczoraj do mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21098270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor spoglądał osłupiały ze zdziwienia to na jednego, to na drugiego z nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdę mówiąc, nic nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy do świątyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pięć minut nie mógł znaleźć w szafie kapelusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jej dotknąć, podobnie jak lubię dotykać małe koty i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki gatunek filmu lubisz najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rabusie widocznie zamierzali już odjechać, gdyż byli gotowi do drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ujrzałem jej oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej wyrzucały słowa ciemne dla mnie i niezrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tylko to aby pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało jej to dużą przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jakie grzechy mnie to spotyka?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejsi badacze twierdzą, że posługiwał się latarnią magiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak, każdej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumie mnie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria, popróbuj i ty; ja też spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jak woda, która przylega do ścian naczynia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział wolno: - Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wpadli na korytarz, zaczęli przeszukiwać klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj przyjaciele, milcząc, spojrzeli wzajem po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z widoczną troską o wniosek, a kulawiec z niedowierzaniem pogrążyli się w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz cudowny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26818890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem Panu, że musimy być bardzo ostrożni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26818892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"możecie sobie spekulować, jak chcecie, ale nie uda wam się rozbić strefy euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26818893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy działać już teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26818895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Światowe wyzwania budzą niepokój w tle dzisiejszej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26818897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagadnienie dotyczące zwrotu ceł jest moim zdaniem bardzo proste\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale z niej słodziak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połóż się i przykryj się kocykiem, przyniosę ci rosołek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest główna jego wada; ale w ogóle jest to dobry chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadusisz się jeszcze, zrób se przerwę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się zamyka, to nie Afryka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pot z jej czoła lał się strumieniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę poznać się, wiedzieć z góry jakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zobaczyłem jak na dłoni cały klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko głowa ciążyła okropnie, w skroniach pulsowały głośno tętna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne stworzenie nie umie stawać dęba i wykonywać skoków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Pan pozwoli, chciałbym udzielić krótkiej, ale osobistej odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wysoka jest ta cena?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnictwo w dalszym ciągu pozostaje kartą przetargową w negocjacjach porozumień handlowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to podstawowe przedsięwzięcie na rzecz wzmocnienia społecznego dialogu w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39580345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ubiegłym roku rządy prześcigały się w wydatkach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie ci niemiłe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżcie się teraz trochę do mnie! — rozkazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął wydobywać pomału historię swoich wakacji, ale zauważył, że Janek jest zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszli szybko na „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomy jest wiatr, woń zgniłych ryb, wodorostów i muszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41078741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się odnieść do dwóch kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41078742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie Komisja zajmuje się antykonkurencyjnymi działaniami jako priorytetem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41078743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze świetnie Pan się spisał przy tym sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41078744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proporcja niepewnych umów o pracę znacznie wzrosła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41078745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję pani komisarz za odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile minut dziennie powinienem trenować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, że właśnie postąpilibyście tak, a nie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli razem na łóżku i oparli głowy o ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób osłaniali się wzajemnie tarczami noszonymi na lewym przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stała Ela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie stale wrzało życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmy w prawym płucu doc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było świństwo, że mu nie kupiono psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koty i psy to najpopularniejsze zwierzęta domowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21621470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coście znaleźli w jego kieszeniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21621472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przeglądnął Goniec Codzienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21621474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powrócił do swej nędznej izby, mając plan zemsty gotowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21621476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona pierwsza przerwała milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21621477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszny czarny mężczyzna podszedł do kobiety i zaczął związywać jej ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, cóż, zrozumiałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebym miał pieniądze, tobym mu mleka kupił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37210407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.188,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brytyjscy konserwatyści głosowali przeciwko sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37210408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki pakiet jest potrzebny nie tylko jako swego rodzaju dotacja czy pomoc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37210409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często przypomina się, że opinie w Unii Europejskiej na temat statusu Kosowa są podzielone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37210411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, w przededniu upływu nowego terminu, sytuacja przedstawia się całkowicie inaczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37210412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiego rodzaju wspólnotowe systemy finansowania można przewidywać, aby usprawnić prowadzenie szkół akredytowanych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wielkim przeciwnikiem rozwydrzenia sportowego, które się w ostatnich latach rozwinęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz uciekajmy, dopóki zajęte zbieraniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym w niektórych miejscach akompaniament o tyle tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie warto się tedy sprzeczać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to idźże jeszcze raz i dobrze poszukaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzę, kto weselszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaciągnąwszy się parę razy dymem z papierosa, wrócił do Stachy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ich twarzach malowały się głęboki szacunek i przestrach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21266935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czymże to pan duma?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21266936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, chciałbym tych wszystkich łotrów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21266937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje kilogram szynki z kurczaka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21266938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie mamy dalsze wskazówki co do rodzaju tej wielkiej książki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21266939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się jednak, że chodzi o jakieś przestępstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30138325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan mówił o wyborze pewnych komisarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30138326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Priorytet w ramach naszej polityki informacyjnej należy nadać mediom elektronicznym - telewizji i Internetowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30138327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parafrazując prezydenta Clintona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30138328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja była wówczas sprzyjająca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30138329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"konwergencję i ujednolicenie budżetów państw członkowskich z głównymi celami budżetu europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to zgoda…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyszedł z sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toccata C-dur poszła niespodzie wanie łatwo; całuję codziennie adagio na dobranoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam w niej trochę po staroświecku, lecz że tak sobie życzyłeś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem czują się zapomniane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postaci kolejarza zaszła w tej chwili zagadkowa metamorfoza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymi ojcami byli: wielki pisarz, filozof Joachim i cielesny ojciec Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32183773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jeden z najbardziej dynamicznych aspektów Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32183774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ktokolwiek chciałby poprzeć wniosek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32183775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważniejsze jest, aby Parlament Europejski przekazał jasny komunikat poparcia dla programu sztokholmskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32183776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy mieć to na uwadze w trakcie procesu legislacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32183777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczyniono znaczne postępy, jeśli chodzi o prawa pasażerów, i powinno to być kontynuowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same przeszkody i nic ponadto!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobra oznaka, ale mnie to bardzo męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To szeroki temat, ale nie tak trudny, jak się rodzicom wydaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to stany poprzedzające omdlenie spowodowane nadmiarem narkotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20685538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę — odparł po chwili, podając mu cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39198295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do tej kwestii możemy jednak jeszcze powrócić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39198296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzi na to pytanie może zasadniczo udzielić Komisja Europejska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39198298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci mają prawo korzystać z pomocy i usług państw członkowskich oraz Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39198299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doskonale wiemy, że Francja i kraje skandynawskie podjęły pozytywne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39198301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słychać było jakby grzmot nieustanny, wrzask surowy, albo drgający śmiechem prostaczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął ręką po piersi, które począł pieszczotliwie gładzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil próbował zmienić temat rozmowy i powiedział, że był na koncercie znanego pianisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś spojrzał smutnemu królowi prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To, co pan mówi, jest bardzo logiczne, ale w swojej logiczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni żyją dla demokracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31479548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odrzucono w nim \\\"masowe cięcia budżetowe\\\" poczynione w zakresie inwestycji publicznych, spowodowane kryzysem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31479549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo do azylu jest jednym z najważniejszych praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31479550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz przewodniczący w Komisji Wolności Obywatelskich, Sprawiedliwości i Spraw Wewnętrznych powiedział bardzo mądre słowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31479551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby tak wyglądał bardziej efektywny sposób alokacji środków, przegralibyśmy zimną wojnę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31479552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie sprawia, że stajesz się przestępcą czy zdrajcą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz powiedz hasło ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczała chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już jem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21768418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne spędzanie czasu odnawia ludzkiego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21768419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjechali sąsiedzi i przyjaciele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21768420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co mnie to obchodzi! — upierała się żona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21768421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadeusz rad jej więcej rozkoszy użyczyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21768422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilson aż gwizdnął ze zdziwienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23633717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Oczekiwanie na cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23633718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on po tamtej stronie: ja sam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23633719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głos jej drżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23633720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kawaler mówi znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23633721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, czuję, on ma słuszność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30635799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym duchu zostały opracowane poprawki, wraz z technicznymi zmianami wprowadzonymi przez Radę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30635800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"One nie otworzą drogi do przezwyciężenia tego kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30635801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz rzetelnej wiedzy, coraz większego znaczenia nabierają takie kompetencje jak przedsiębiorczość, zrozumienie międzykulturowe, kreatywność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30635802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy wziąć współodpowiedzialność za ten stan rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30635803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym sensie związek strategiczny służyć będzie pogłębieniu stosunków międzyregionalnych, gospodarczych i handlowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczach rosły niebieskawe jodły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na nią z wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była parna, księżycowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To musi zostać zrobione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apelujemy zatem do państw członkowskich o korzystanie z naszych funduszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jedynie działania marketingowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stach jeszcze z nimi nie grał; chodził dopiero około stolików i przypatrywał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39897630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz można wierzyć i żądać obaczyć...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21572060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych złowróżbnych słowach zapadło milczenie, twarze posmutniały i wymieniano niespokojne spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21572061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto i on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21572065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiekolwiek były jego zapatrywania na zasady mormońskie, na tym jednym punkcie pozostał nieugięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21572068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie on mógłby nas wydać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21572069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mówiąc, Artur wziął kapelusz i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie uprzedzajmy wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma żal do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam się co rano w lustrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być woda z kranu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25112530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmizerniał, sposępniał, zdziczał...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25112532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejszy w samochodzie nie jest silnik tylko karoseria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25112533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym roku nie odbył się pokaz sztucznych ogni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25112534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest tak młoda, jak dziś w nocy widziałem ją we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25112536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Resztę opowie panu Wencel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozjaśniły się ciemności od zimnego, migotliwego blasku gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to nie wie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc prawdopodobnie zamieszka w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta rozejrzała się nerwowo i zmrużyła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawialiśmy z nim dosyć długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk tego imienia, szept tego imienia, jego zapach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb? — zaśmiała się nagle dziwożona i napełniła wnętrze wora klaśnięciem drobnych dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Filip nie miał innego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrażała się dziesięć razy na dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nimfy umiały otumanić Fauna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia! — odparł, podnosząc ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wszyscy razem nadzwyczajnie rozpuszczone łobuzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka takich pisemnych relacji udało się już zebrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz: gdzie powiesiłeś, tam wisi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę już przyszłe losy mego dzieła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24728042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję panu na dziś urlop.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24728043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mi się to wszystko przyśniło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24728044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzinę grać będzie na skrzypcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24728045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mówiłeś mi o tem, świętoszku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24728046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwrócili się od Pomarańczarni z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona przebiegła obok niego, myśląc, że zajęty bójką nic nie widzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco chorobliwie dokładne mycie genitaliów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mych oczach, oczach małego barbarzyńcy, piękność niewiele znaczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I bawią się w zabijanie czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był na pogrzebie i nie pokazał się trzy dni w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zakotłowało się w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem byle kto — sucho mówił Ben.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłował się wszakże niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecku należy dać wszelkie możliwości do zabaw i rozrywek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż bardzo lubiła leżeć w łóżku, wstawała od razu i buch do łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle odwróciła się i skierowała kroki ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po pokoju i udaję, że nie wiem, o co chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosi nas pan o pomoc w osiągnięciu konsensusu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zwrócić uwagę na przynajmniej trzy kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwustronne porozumienie z Brazylią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaś wyciągnął nóż i podzielił się jabłkiem z kolegą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kambodża\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pozostanie pan chyba na wieczerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał mi głęboko w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet własne wojsko ciebie nie lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leczenie: atropina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzena zatrzymała się kilka metrów wcześniej i patrzyła w dal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz uśmiech zgubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31219209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był czas, kiedy jedni ludzie działali w imieniu innych, ponieważ pragnęli wolności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31219210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrzymałem się od głosu nad poprawkami wzywającymi do większego wsparcia dla państwa afgańskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31219211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te powtarzające się wysiłki mają przynajmniej jedną korzyść\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31219212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy kontynuować ich osiągnięcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31219213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to rozwiązanie, które uznamy za zadowalające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi się pomieszało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alkohol był jedną z przyczyn kolizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po knajpach robił znajomości i podejmował się różnych niebezpiecznych spraw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szło im trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo nie było podówczas pośród wszystkich ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako najbliżsi jego dostojnej osoby, uważali się za coś lepszego od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho wszędzie, głucho wszędzie. Nudno będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zgrzytanie, to wycie piekielne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze złością pociągnął dym z cygara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście była zajęta wyłącznie sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszych latach życia nie wolno dziecka oddzielać od matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisując się, kładł kropkę po podpisie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna kobieta zniknęła bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32863784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże chorym z nienawiści do osób homoseksualnych nie należy współczuć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32863785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisarz mówił właśnie o oznakowaniu produktów rybołówstwa i zapewnieniu, że ludzie wiedzą, co kupują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32863786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak widzimy, wodór to technologia przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32863787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczam, że ze względu na powyższe przyczyny głosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32863788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymagał wielu negocjacji i debat, więc cieszę się, że problemy zostały ostatecznie rozwiązane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest przez chwilę naciągnięty jak struna, nim się ją puści, nim wyda dźwięk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie doskonale, jak!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37868086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.684,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi europejscy przywódcy raz jeszcze nie zdołali przerwać impasu negocjacyjnego przed konferencją w Kopenhadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37868087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawę tę wielokrotnie szczegółowo omawialiśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37868088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerażające wydarzenia w Gazie w ostatnich dwóch tygodniach ściągnęły na Izrael międzynarodowe potępienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37868089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakt, że Rada dokonuje jeszcze większych cięć w tych skromnych środkach, jest wciąż niezrozumiały\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37868090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ktokolwiek śmie nazywać ten podstęp i nieuczciwość demokracją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jakiż ciężar zdejmujesz mi z serca, panie chirurgu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoniono na trzeci wyścig.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, pisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nocami nawet byłem czujny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski kazał dojechać swemu powozowi bliżej hrabiny i wrócił do pań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jednak zawsze już bliżej końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23657455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa te jeszcze dzwonią mi w uszach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23657456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I biorąc piłkę obaj udali się do ogrodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23657457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I harfa wciąga w siebie swoje dźwięki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23657458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem, że takie zwierzęta są na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23657459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sama wzięłam na siebie całą odpowiedzialność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem zapomniał o swojej biedzie i niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnęłam? — zapytała rumieniąc się jak jutrzenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko drgało w tym szczególnym rytmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil ma stosunkowo małego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ej, panie Michale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Rozpoznał w nocy swoje mieszkanie, idąc boso wzdłuż korytarza, w stronę królików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę nie przeszkadzać! — upomniał go któryś z gości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tam przecie nie ma komfortu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23374786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to dla mnie znaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23374787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zapalić światło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23374788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jeszcze miałem do zrobienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23374789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Barwa włosów: biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23374790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i on wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic się nie stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za złudzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niestety, człowiek ten nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ostatniego zajścia upłynęły trzy tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę pana dowód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę cię mieć wyłącznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mieliśmy czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj ładni i mają takie czerwone usta, jakby ciągle się całowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wpół obłąkany ze strachu Jano budzi Marysię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko spojrzę na dziecko, zaraz wiem, co ono warte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo ty nie leżysz na dnie morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37163833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Demokracja to wartość niezbywalna, podobnie jak niezbywalne są wyniki powszechnego konsensusu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37163834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze dużo pracy trzeba włożyć, aby położyć kres nierównemu traktowaniu kobiet i mężczyzn\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37163835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam zajmowałem się tym jako dziecko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37163836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego z przykrością musimy sprzeciwić się zgłaszaniu kolejnych poprawek, w tym poprawek ustnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37163837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W efekcie sprawozdanie przyjęte przez komisję w formie przyjętej alternatywy zostanie zastąpione nowym tekstem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dolewaj oliwy do ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka osób rzuciło się nawet w pogoń za zbiegłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filozof Joachim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę patologiczne, że siedzimy tu razem i udajemy, że to normalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka czyni mistrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na śniegu spostrzegliśmy duże plamy czerwonej, rdzawej wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi zesłał tę nieznajomą kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyły nań wary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, jeszcze jej stosunek do morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękki! — zawołała, omal nie płacząc ze szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Markowi, jako najstarszemu, dostało się największe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20985168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie wymyśliłem tego, co powiedziałem przed chwilą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20985170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ona złożyła rączki i poczęła go prosić ze łzami, żeby jechali dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20985171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtwarzanie niezależnych komunikatów głosowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20985173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarodzie je wskrzeszają umarłych, którzy odjeżdżają, leżąc, jeden obok drugiego, na ruchomej taśmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20985174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co na Wielkanoc wisi na sznurze w komorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawa jest pięknym miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powraca ta mała, nudna męka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ścisłym znaczeniu może być prawdziwe tylko zdanie, i to w sensie logistyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie żałuję trudu; wyniki przeszły moje oczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi go ze wszystkimi szczegółami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podniósł ją cicho i oddalił się bez pożegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nim stał długi, długi szereg mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo po co pani ma mieć przeze mnie przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz im całą historię, mości Ryszardzie — wtrącił się Puk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko robi zwariowane zachowanie się Emila przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za myśli, co za koncepty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stara historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć piękne, duże lustro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20843576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten pochylał głowę pokornie i przyjmował w milczeniu niezasłużoną naganę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20843577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny włosek nie chciał sterczeć do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20843578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pod pewnym względem naprawdę się poprawił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20843579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przelew internetowy natychmiastowy eliksir.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20843580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak długo to trwa u ciebie? — Piętnaście minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25082751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczność nikogo nie krzywdzi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25082752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może później, kiedy skończymy poncz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25082753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ależ to nie do wytrzymania“ zawołałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25082754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o tem cicho!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25082755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż zeń prostaczek w szarej sukience.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wodą bełkocącą stała drewniana ka wiarenka, w której jadał truskawki ze śmietaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle jest marnych żywotów ludzi o wielkim dziele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał i oczyma wzniesionymi ku sklepieniu śledził ruch dymów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podniósł ją cicho i oddalił się bez pożegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie strzelam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył pod okno chałupy i nadstawił wielkich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38861108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co jest przedmiotem dzisiejszej debaty to jedynie smutne pozostałości po tych działaniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38861110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem mMusimy więc zmienić również zmienić sposób naszego myślenia o polityce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38861111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam uzupełnienie parametrów bezpieczeństwa dokumentów podróży o dane biometryczne za konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38861112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że jest to naprawdę problem europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38861113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem to nasz największy kryzys w historii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „wnętrzności” boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do bardzo ciemnego parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy obydwu przyjaciół zwróciły się ku niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wbijam okrągłym, niewygodnym i uderzyłem się w palec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł do „Revue Philosophique”: „Analiza pojęcia przy padku”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem i mechanicznie obracałem w palcach jakiś przedmiot leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umówiłem się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczę ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, mnie to dobrze robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sięgało w samo dzieciństwo, ta niemożność urwania w środku, zatrzymania się, skończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nakazuje prawo puszczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakaś lekcja odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy dostrzegacie ten podwójny odblask?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomogę pamięci — ciągnąłem, poprawiając się na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25731905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W reszcie mogę wyłożyć karty na stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25731906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu, powróciwszy z połowu, zaraz po wieczerzy, Piotr poszedł nad morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25731907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moskiewska urzędowa „Prawda“ podaje następujący budżet robotników Sowieckiej Ukrainy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25731908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to, co panu już ustnie opowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25731909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na miłość Boską, proszę powiedzieć, co się z panem dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przy sobie ucznia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec torbę swoją poklepał pieszczotliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu potrzebna gimnastyka, musztra, one mogą być dobre albo złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33336225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poruszyć przy okazji tej debaty podstawową kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33336226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służby publiczne znajdują się w samym sercu modelu społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33336227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wzór południowokoreański, wzór europejski, no i oczywiście wzór szwajcarski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33336228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością czekamy, aż się ono urzeczywistni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33336229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odnotowano przypadków oszustw czy przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy do świątyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie rozumiał, każdy czekał jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo daję, przynajmniej dobrze, żem ciebie spotkał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łżesz jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oświadczyła nagle dziwożona, oblizując zwilgotniałe od tataraku wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mieli rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24890520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fotografia bardzo się wytarła, ale się nie martwię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24890521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien człowiek, chcąc zajrzeć do środka, spuścił się z dachu na linie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24890522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walenty uczy mnie grać na skrzypcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24890523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na samym brzegu stoku stała jedna z beczek od wina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24890524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to we Środę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca i mówi: — To był telefon z kliniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dlatego, że teraz już jesteś rybakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim prosto, przy tym szczerze, no i co najważniejsza — przyjaźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obciąć mu ręce i nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubisz kogoś? — Ale skąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszedłem z uczuciem ulgi i wkrótce zasnąłem głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zauważył prezes Banku Światowego problem niedożywienia można uznać za zapomniany milenijny cel rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego sukces zależy od nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Publiczny dostęp powinien stanowić podstawową zasadę, a wyłączenie jawności powinno być wyjątkiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy znaleźć otwartą i konstruktywną procedurę na potrzeby następnych ram finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37066738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jedno, co śpiewał poeta, było prawdą czystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem wegetarianinem, ale nie jem mięsa codziennie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już drugi raz uderzyłem małym palcem o framugę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza krąży jak jastrząb nad miastem; uderza skrzydłami o domy, o niebo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Newton też ułożył swój systemik dedukcyjnie, chociaż powstał on niewątpliwie na podstawie indukcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj mu tyle zabawek, ma ich już dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37300490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcemy powielać naszych zadań w różnych instytucjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37300491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.404,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też wnioski dotyczące utworzenia nowego mechanizmu stabilności europejskiego funduszu walutowego są bezwzględną koniecznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37300492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym spełnione są wszelkie warunki, aby zawrzeć dobre porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37300493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego cieszy nas, że jako agencja zyska nową podstawę prawną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37300494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że uda się tę kwestię rozstrzygnąć polubownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28649848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My możemy im tylko pomagać naszym know-how, naszym doświadczeniem oraz naszą wolą polityczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28649849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, należy zagwarantować niezależny monitoring\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28649850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że pani wybaczam, bo w pełni się z panią zgadzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28649851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedsiębiorcy zdecydowanie mają tu swoją rolę do odegrania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28649852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zatem możemy uważać Unię za wiarygodną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38082747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez euro Islandia przypominałaby dzisiaj Irlandię, albo raczej Irlandia przypominałaby Islandię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38082748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Irytowały mnie jednak liczne przypadki narodowego egoizmu, które niestety znalazły swoje odzwierciedlenie w sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38082750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powszechne wykorzystywanie pestycydów w rolnictwie oraz odpady przemysłowe muszą zostać ograniczone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38082752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno oczywiście być rozwiązanie, ale wymagałoby ono od Ukrainy rezygnacji z udziału w rurociągu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38082754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, jeszcze bardziej niż dotychczas, musimy w tym zakresie wzajemnie sobie pomagać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę uratować tę odrobinę ziarna, jaka jeszcze pozostała pomiędzy kamieniami młyńskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy ani przedtem, ani potem nie widziałem jej tak rozrzewnionej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dziewczęta go znają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym się różni genialność życia od genial- ności twórczości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przez długie lata byłem nieobliczalnie smutną ofiarą nieustannej i niestrudzonej wstydliwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nikt nie ma racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mych oczach, oczach małego barbarzyńcy, piękność niewiele znaczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale dlaczego musiało być właśnie wtedy? — Nie martwisz się, że było wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładziono mu na czoło monetę: zawsze poznawał, którą stroną leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę dzisiaj do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma głowę zanurzoną we krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ma być: „rąk”, napisane: „rak”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nawet byłem zły i nie podobało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na autostradzie utworzył się długi korek, przez co wiele osób spóźniło się do pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32642913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta propozycja nie dyskryminuje żadnego języka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32642914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracamy się o to do państw członkowskich i chcielibyśmy, aby potraktowali tę kwestię poważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32642915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że uzasadniony jest optymizm Komisji w kwestii rynków produktów mlecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32642916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywy te muszą być skutecznie stosowane przez władze w kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32642917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Program sztokholmski jest elementem tworzenia wspólnego systemu prawno-sądowniczego w całej Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca, spokój, zadowolenie wewnętrzne, wesołość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przez trzy dni nie mieliśmy żadnych informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej spokojny, obojętny głos mówił: — De, przepraszam, że rękę źle trzymam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz czytałem tę książkę, ale będę czytał jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie wie i o to chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam byle robociarz wie więcej od naszego niejednego filaru krytyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36637774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczenie przewodniczącego Parlamentu Europejskiego na temat sytuacji w Tunezji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36637775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan komisarz podkreśla, że w pewnym zakresie tak się już teraz dzieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36637776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postęp nie będzie na nas czekał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36637777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jesteśmy na tej wspólnej drodze pojednania już w innym miejscu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36637778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby sprowokować dialog i debatę głosowałem za odrzuceniem temu sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I moja miłość do ciebie wplątana w to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech dusza powraca do ciała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto jest obecnym prezydentem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nawet rzecz przynosząca dochód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21106656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciebie nie obchodzi nic na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21106657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wierzę własnym oczom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21106658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie kazał robić światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21106659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, panie dziedzicu… wózek nie wyjeżdżał wcale… poszli piechotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21106660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początek, to znaczy scena koło krat, była słabsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wjechaliśmy w czeluść wodną pomiędzy Wyspą św. Heleny a Ogrodami Publicznymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napijesz się czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ich Eskimosi bardzo obchodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to, więc tak dużo tu czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dościgną pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściliśmy nasz cienisty przytułek i niebawem znaleźliśmy się na łuku mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miastem odbyło się wszystko według programu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24363185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo jest ładna i nieźle siedzi na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24363186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez trzydzieści lat pracy napatrzył się wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24363187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Błogosławieni którzy płaczą...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24363188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, siedm kufli piwa... Czyżbym naprawdę?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24363189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i tak dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z moich ludzi padł trupem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ujrzałem jej oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja zawsze tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25133702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ci pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25133703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On także dzierży sztylet w ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25133704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylądowałem z tamtej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25133705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krótka była przerwa w burzy i krótko trwało rozjaśnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25133706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu podała mu rękę, którą Wokulski ze czcią ucałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy mieć grube nieprzyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nawet zgadłem, bo ktoś zastukał, ale cicho i tylko raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona wprost tyje… a niedawno wyglądała jak wygłodzony gawron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozgląda się dzikie wiejskie dziecko po ogromnym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ozwij się, ozwij! — powtórzył z kolei Podlasiak, tym samym słowom nadając odcień modlitewny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26863498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właściwe podejście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26863500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26863501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zrobić coś przeciwnego do tego co robiliśmy do tej pory\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26863503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie z nich będą zaangażowane w ten proces\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26863505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W treści motywu brakuje jednego słowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś podobnego jest możliwym? — wyszeptał przecierając drżącą dłonią czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu cytaty z zeznań świadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25378583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym kiedyś zostać pilotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25378584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz wyniknął pomiędzy nimi spór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25378585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy chłopiec wyciągnął topór ze szczeliny i wyswobodził mu brodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25378586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź sędzią między nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25378587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przywiodłeś nas do zguby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastanów się pan — podjął Filip.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, byłem zaślepiony i nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do bardzo ciemnego parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po deszczu na ulice i chodniki wychodzą ślimaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33310159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeśli zysk ma być okupiony osłabieniem praw pracowników, to tak będzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33310160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrym przykładem jest horyzontalna dyrektywa ukierunkowana na zwalczanie dyskryminacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33310161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te spawy również należy wziąć pod rozwagę w kontekście umów o wolnym handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33310162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postąpię zgodnie z pańskim wnioskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33310163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manifestanci nadal skandują to hasło na placu Tahrir i czynię to wraz z nimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38384814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymujemy ok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38384816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten praktyczny przykład raz jeszcze pokazuje, jak niedostateczne były obecne środki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38384817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.108,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy koniecznie przerwać milczenie otaczające wszelkie formy przestępstw, w tym przypadku uwarunkowanych płcią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38384818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszystko dobre, co się dobrze kończy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38384819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za tę pomocną i konstruktywną debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej sytuacji są one kluczowe do zrozumienia całej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo wyraźnie zezwala na to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27307812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"powracają jak bumerang\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27307813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, zbyt rzadko mówimy o tej stronie medalu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27307814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisarz Verheugen opuszcza Komisję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27307815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W serwisach informacyjnych pokazywano rozbitków i tych, którzy zginęli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27307816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czynimy to pod wpływem emocji wywołanych wynikiem referendum w Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak zadbać, aby w wyniku promocji handlowej nie dochodziło do nadmiernej konsumpcji leków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, uwolnienie więźniów politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie dajcie się nabrać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym okresie bardzo aktywny i uważny był także Parlament Europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podzielamy to pragnienie i popieramy zastosowanie procedury przyśpieszonej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec przyjdzie tu za jakieś pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy klął w skrytości serca tych dwu, którzy odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Socjopata nie potrafi żyć w społeczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Referendum w sprawie legalizacji marihuany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ciocia przysłała mi paczkę… i urządziłyśmy sobie przyjęcie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka ta jest próbą odpowiedzi na to wyzwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż może powiedzieć, ile biedny asceta w tych strasznych dniach wycierpiał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy się tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24751273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam dobrze całą rodzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24751275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widząc to, panna Izabela uczuła nieprzepartą chęć pochwycenia tygrysa za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24751276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Indyk myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ścieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24751278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W znikającym mroku biegłem naprzód i ufałem ślepo memu szczęściu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24751279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze nie ruszyliście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnął głowę rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wy także jesteście książętami i księżniczkami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On znał każdy labiryncik jej psychiki i rów nocześnie odkrywał coraz nowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem znów wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Orgazm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Nel spojrzała na niego ze strachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Początek jest nawet niezwykle wesoły!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi się uginają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, ja już mam takie okulary, że różności widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co otrzymałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że on nie bardzo pragnie, bym żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boby od razu poznali, bo się zrobiłem czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40134498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.324,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oczywiste, że kobiety nie mają takich samych możliwości rozwijania swojej kariery jak mężczyźni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40134499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochronę i obronę wolności informacji trzeba zapewnić w każdych warunkach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40134500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym roku dwukrotnie pojawiły się wskazania, że być może dostępne będą nowe odkrycia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40134501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zagwarantowanie wyżywienia ludności, ochrona środowiska naturalnego i produkcja energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40134502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam był stół, przy którym zasiadał starszy sztygar i dozorca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to jednak szczególne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam się nachylić? — spytał pokornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz powiedz hasło ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek był tuż, jak gdyby na wierzchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie! — protestował inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem właśnie Twojego maila dotyczącego naszego wyjazdu służbowego do Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili wszedł Filip zupełnie tak, jakby wchodził po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A u żadnej z lalek nie spotkałam takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nie chciałam, może, może, żebyś ty się zajmował brudną robotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27734408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że pomogą wszyscy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27734409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest poparcie dla tej propozycji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27734410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy temu przeciwdziałać, oferując alternatywę, jaką są sprawdzone informacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27734411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę też, że naszym zadaniem jest promowanie tej kwestii i stawianie takich wymogów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27734412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomina się o planowaniu przyszłych inwestycji i strategicznych osiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20870449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siódma piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20870450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem inni wyciągali na pokład jakiegoś siwego mężczyznę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20870451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szybowcu lata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20870452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś bardzo miłym i dobrym dzieckiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20870453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był bardzo wzruszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on wcale inaczej nie myślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale sama wtedy nie spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdyby chłopiec — byłoby śmiesznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast zauważyła zmieniony wygląd Filipa, co sprawiło jej widoczną przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rabusie widocznie zamierzali już odjechać, gdyż byli gotowi do drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poza tym nie była wstydliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Omijam ją z daleka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miastem odbyło się wszystko według programu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłeś, że bez bójki się usuniesz! — krzyknął jednoręki, grożąc spuchniętą lewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie można było rozróżnić zarysy dzbanka i miski na wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22060851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22060852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22060853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22060854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22060855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30750377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie padły żadne słowa o solidnej europejskiej inicjatywie w zakresie opodatkowania transakcji finansowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30750378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brakuje wobec nich zintegrowanej wizji, której tak bardzo potrzebują, a którą mieli nasi przodkowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30750380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli zima go nie zniszczy, jaskółki ulepią, w nim gniazda na wiosnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30750382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie na temat budżetu Parlamentu odzwierciedla sprzeczności dotyczące większości reprezentowanych tu sił politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30750384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście nie udało im się to całkowicie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wstydź się, ja też nie bardzo umiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę tak powiedzieć, bo to nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż mnie one obchodzić mogą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy te sposoby rozumowania odróżnić od dedukcji naukowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego spotkania można było coś niecoś skorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32851437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Enzymy spożywcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32851438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że odpowiedź na to pytanie jest następująca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32851439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Politycznym i moralnym obowiązkiem jest zawsze stać na straży przestrzegania rządów prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32851440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy mamy świadomość, że wiele jeszcze należy zrobić, aby europejskie strategie rozwoju były skuteczniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32851441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem to jednak, bo jestem przekonany, że to słuszne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27638701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem usłyszeliśmy prawdę od czołowego dziennikarza Financial Times, Martina Wolfa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27638702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak wywierać maksymalną presję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27638703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję mówić krótko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27638704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie większość państw członkowskich dobrowolnie gromadzi te dane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27638705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjemy w nowej erze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — zapytałem, ślizgając się spojrzeniem po rozlewisku wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wy kończony, dopasowany i martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy czterej spoglądaliśmy ku niemu serdecznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Teraz ćwiczę mazurek Chopina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem pewne myśli nadciągają nie wiadomo skąd i dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie wiadomo, czym jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczenie twoje — rzekł — ma dużo cech prawdopodobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil dziwił się, że Janek tyle mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— tak Go zaklinał i prosił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory zmarł jeszcze przed jego przybyciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21712043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Funkcjonalność automatycznego odwoływania rezerwacji dla sal konferencyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21712045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zgadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21712047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie tłum przerzedził się i procesja wraz z dragonami ruszyła na ostatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21712048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeregi bardzo starych drzew w dziwnych figurach otaczały go dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21712049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz ten chłopak wpadnie w złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto liczebniki: jeden, dwa, trzy, cztery, pięć, sześć, siedem, osiem, dziewięć, dziesięć, jedenaście, dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzecia zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże tylko dwie lub trzy schwytał na ustach językiem: resztę zachował dla Nel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta pierwsza czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20848977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brednie, paplanina, zrzędzenie jako czasowniki dotyczące mowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27127983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było go w pierwotnym tekście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27127984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od samego początku uważaliśmy też, że gospodarzami procesu odbudowy powinni być sami Haitańczycy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27127985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy dziś o wspólnym europejskich zarządzaniu gospodarczym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27127986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd pochodzi ten produkt?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27127987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabierając głos w tej debacie, chcę zwrócić uwagę na cztery kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyły go nieprzeniknione ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, to niczego nie dowodzi — odrzekł Tom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jemu pewnie też serce mocno ze strachu biło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umówiłem się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z półotwartych ust wychylał się język długi, wąski, czarny jak węgiel…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty mnie do tego zmusiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam w niej trochę po staroświecku, lecz że tak sobie życzyłeś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi go ze wszystkimi szczegółami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady nieznajomego wiodły właśnie przez wzgórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No… no jednego ogrodu, który twoja matka lubiła — jąkała Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechaliśmy jeszcze dość długo głębokim wąwozem lub brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to jest cudowna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę tylko, ale zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczotka jest na dole w izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara z wolna zaczęła uspokajać się w płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ścisłym znaczeniu może być prawdziwe tylko zdanie, i to w sensie logistyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety o zbyt grubych nogach w kostce wyglądają na plaży całkiem dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zaczęła powstawać przepaść między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się tak wpatrujesz we mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sięgało w samo dzieciństwo, ta niemożność urwania w środku, zatrzymania się, skończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem ramionami i umyślnie przeszedłem do innego tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, co mówię! — odparł jednoręki i spojrzał na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ów woreczek był dla Filipa prawdziwym skarbem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nieoczekiwane zestawienia» i «potworna wyobraźnia», tak mówił Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, przywiązujesz zbyt wielką wagę do tego krążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny dziewczak! — rzekł, pocmokując ze znawstwem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33115926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskutowana dziś umowa nie jest być może idealna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33115927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę również na to, że Izba nie przeszarżuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33115928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to, pozwolę sobie wspomnieć jeszcze o kilku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33115929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli idzie o przepisy dotyczące dobrostanu zwierząt, Unia Europejska znajduje się na czele stawki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33115930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmujemy aktualne poparcie całego Parlamentu dla zakazu stosowania sztucznych kwasów tłuszczowych trans\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam jego zwrotu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za długo już siedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w domu okazało się, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie ginę bez zasługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza jak makiem zasiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem przed willą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30643130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że osiągnęła wiele dobrego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30643131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musieli mu Krzyżacy pół woza pieniędzy za nich nasypać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30643132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech jeno Krzyżacy o tem nie wiedzą, bo się o Maćka będą droczyli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30643133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem aby dane działanie mogło być uznane za przestępstwo, muszą wystąpić dwa podstawowe warunki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30643134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś podpisał: „Czytałem“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy musi robić to, co mnie się podoba — rzekł obojętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokoło chodzą uważnie strażniczki cienia — prostytutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczał przez chwilę wysokim falsetem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Których zazna przez lata małżeńskiego szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj był huragan, a my jesteś porwani i to jest jaskinia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł pomału, pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błogosławiony Wilk dodała sędzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem wrócił więc młynarz do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Ja wiem, co teraz będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, mieć dach nad głową jest rzeczą bardzo przyjemną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czego ty chcesz? — Ja nie wiem, mnie się nudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po knajpach robił znajomości i podejmował się różnych niebezpiecznych spraw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłeś, że bez bójki się usuniesz! — krzyknął jednoręki, grożąc spuchniętą lewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał ją z wyszukaną nonszalancją, oczywiście podnosząc ją momentalnie w dwójnasób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wilki zawyły z trwogi..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22544211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22544212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22544213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22544214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22544215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i poczuł Maciuś pierwsze uderzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie rozumiem, co do mnie mówisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28752648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to w tym obszarze dokonano największych cięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28752649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.108,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nasi obywatele nie są zaangażowani w sprawy europejskie w takim stopniu, jakbyśmy chcieli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28752650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak dotychczas nie ma niestety faktycznych postępów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28752651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postęp nie jest nieodwracalny, jak to wszyscy wiemy dobrze w Europie środkowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28752652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okres trwania i metody zostaną ustalone przez komitet zarządzający\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygotowania skończone — rzekł, wstępując w obręb koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas nam w drogę! — rzekł nagle kulawiec i zajął zwykłe po prawej stronie stanowisko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy odpowiem, że wolę ustrój B, ze względu na moją książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiły wrażenie zbytecznego dodatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się zdecyduję, dam ci jedną dobrą radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj kota w worku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to rzeczy zupełnie niewspółmierne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28064974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również szanować rządy prawa w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28064975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handel ludźmi jest jedną z największych plag początków obecnego stulecia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28064976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo proszę o zachowanie właściwej równowagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28064977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mamy warunki pobytu i masowej naturalizacji w państwach członkowskich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28064978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że założyła znowu słuchawki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37010808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzymy, że dzieli pan z nami te dążenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37010809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest to wielka dyskusja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37010810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością jest ich więcej, niż chcą tego poszczególne państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37010811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym celem jest wspieranie zatrudnienia i pomaganie ludziom w utrzymaniu ich miejsc pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37010812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj to skryta metoda koordynacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może pod wpływem skruchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty, Stefan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąską uliczkę między dwoma rzędami bazarów wypełniał skłębiony malowniczo tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunął ją miękko, aby rozciągnąć tę chwilę jak gumę i głaskał ustami własne ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil płynie powoli po własnych zdaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziwożona wskazała palcem ową stronę, gdzie się znajdował niezbędny dla jej namysłów rozstaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu właśnie tkwi istota symbolu i jedna z zasadniczych zagadek bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mógł prowadzić rozmowy, której przedtem nie obmyślił szczegółowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyj to nos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze nie skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chcę się cofnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na fotelu, ona usiadła na poręczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu — było ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co to panu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko robi zwariowane zachowanie się Emila przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie unoś się — przemówił miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przykra misja — objaśnił po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to coś ważnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze Śródziemne to takie większe jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O mało nie upadł i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdzież jest dom mego teścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąwszy ją za rękę, by się przekonać, czy nie ma gorączki, zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie spokojniejsze od chłopców i więcej staranne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę iść z jakimś gówniarzem na wodę sodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapach łajna jest zapachem życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu cytaty z zeznań świadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż tam u ciebie słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się jak ryba w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna leży zdaje się w wyczerpaniu nerwowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy tam z samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja pozostanę tutaj; będę oczekiwał twego powrotu tu w tym fotelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, zgniecie mu żebra, zdruzgoce klatkę piersiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia w sobotę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz ją tylko widziałem, raz jeden jedyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za człowiek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczegółów nie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak czasu sporo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nowo się odnajdywali — matka i syn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21921549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21921550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21921551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21921552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21921553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25231763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już więcej miejsca we mnie na nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25231764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewnem: ten nędznik musiał umrzeć, aby mnie wypadkiem nie zdradził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25231765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hope uderzył dłonią w rękojeść rewolweru za pasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25231767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie to może bazgroły, ale ktoś wydał na to niezłą sumkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25231768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rysy jej straciły trochę z dawnej surowości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40359136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W liście tym autorzy napisali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40359137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu ktoś poświęcił trochę uwagi kwestii zwanej polityką regionalną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40359138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo naganna sytuacja, której nie mogę poprzeć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40359139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrożenie celów milenijnych jest teraz bardzo zagrożone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40359140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co w kwestii zagrożeń o charakterze moralnym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cóż, szlachetna istoto, chcesz zrobić z tym szkieletem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jakiego łotra musiał mnie poczytywać!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc ciemną nocą, kiedy mieszkańcy fortu posnęli, Biały Kieł zębami spróbował kij.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylu ludzi na świecie, a ty nadal sam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest możliwe, żeby po dwudziestu rzutach monetą za każdym razem wyszedł orzeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie zamierzałam tego powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przewidziane są zniżki dla studentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiem, ale szeptem i każdemu na osobności…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30663069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja jest przekonana, że Parlament również w przyszłości będzie popierał i wspierał ten cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30663070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Europejska złożyła bardzo rozsądny wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30663071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście nad tym ubolewam i mam nadzieję, że nasza instytucja będzie trzymać się razem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30663072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opieszałość jedynie doprowadziła do pogorszenia się sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30663073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiemy, że zapaść kredytowa miała bezpośredni wpływ na projekty strategiczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedział: — Pogadamy o tym dokładnie wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię muzykę klasyczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten był znacznie wyższy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Widzę to, widzę to” — powtarzałem sobie w myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I podał Maciusiowi papier, wciąż stojąc na baczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczy chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tu mało zieleni! — rzekłem tonem skargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napijesz się czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko, mówię ci, albo nie uratuje go już żadna siła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszło, minęło — myślmy o chwili obecnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38773577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z tym wiąże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38773578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrona prawa każdego z państw do zrównoważonej produkcji jest z kolei wymogiem przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38773579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama Pani do tego nawiązała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38773581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagrożone jest nawet bezpieczeństwo kierowców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38773582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego nam teraz potrzeba\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy napełniły oczy słuchaczy, a mury budynku zadrżały od okrzyków zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta nasze spotkały się, a ciała splotły w miłosnym szale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko pozostała osoba: sześćdziesiąta i piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz być tym i tym, albo tam i tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za ten tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla jakiejś tam przyczyny nie rozpoczynaliśmy partii domina\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda? Biedny Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31228612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna z nich jest prostsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31228613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem jest tym dotkliwszy, jeśli przedsiębiorcom pomagają rządy broniące ich interesów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31228614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowy traktat lizboński jest wizją przewodnią demokracji parlamentarnej na szczeblu Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31228615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy robotnicy oczekiwali na niego podług zlecenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31228616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego jest to przede wszystkim problem Amerykanów, który musi zostać rozwiązany przez Waszyngton\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym kończyło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem on odwraca głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiała i ona, że niestety ich sytuacja znacznie się pogorszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna stanęła nad jego łóżkiem i pochyliła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzenie, że w Polsce rządzi burżuazja, nie jest prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeżywam całe tygodnie w ciągu kilku minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko paru obrazki narysowało i położyliśmy na stoliku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bóg nierównowagi, w której wirują nieskończone byty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil odczuwał strach i opór przed posuwaniem się dalej, Janek — ani strachu, ani oporu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szafach leżą tablice gliniane z asyryjskimi hieroglifami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mogę do niego przychodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie wyglądasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz jest spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24798071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedł na parę chwil z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24798072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydałem okrzyk i dałem koniowi ostrogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24798073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ci się podoba?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24798074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamo, pralka się zepsuła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24798075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często nabawiała się kłopotu przez żywy temperament, ostry język i ruchliwy umysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uścisnęli się w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta błyskawica w jednej chwili ukazała jej całą głębię jej upadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłyszę! — odpowiedział radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cmentarz zamykają tu wcześnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Termin dla mnie niezupełnie jasny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze szczególnej ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął w progu, zajrzał w głąb i żachnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie pisali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wojownik musi być śmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich jak ty nie dręczy demon ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, jak w ogóle przy każdym choćby tylko częściowym rozszczepieniu jaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna „deformacja przestrzenna” przy otwartych oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wybrał się na polowanie, pozostawiając swym więźniom żywność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I po co było tak bić szczeniaka? — krzywi się felczer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna jaskółka wiosny nie czyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24986469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przez całe życie cierpią brutalne udręczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24986471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekając, będziesz się modlić za nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24986472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby najmądrzejsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24986474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc go znacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24986475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem pisać taki kajecik: „Błędy mego królowania“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał mi głęboko w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idioto! Idioto! Sprać ją i pójść sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mistrzynią w sztuce kochania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już strasznie znudzili mi się ci mężczyźni z forsą i szykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jednoręki zaniepokoił się pilnie i otarł usta rąbkiem rękawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabić go, czy co? Spytam małego k.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile się nie mylę, przeszedł pan dwukrotnie operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziwny przypadek — powiedział poprzez wiatr Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej, w czym mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21650600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręczę, że kapitan gorąco pragnąłby teraz być już w bezpiecznym porcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21650601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie lata upłynęły na troskach i ciężkiej prący, musiał więc sport zupełnie zarzucić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21650602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, cokolwiek ma związek z boksem, to zawsze znajduje we mnie najzagorzalszego obrońcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21650603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życiorys atlety zajmował całą kolumnę, pośrodku zaś była zamieszczona jego podobizna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21650604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to jednak, był on w wielu razach niebezpiecznym przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożegnali się i Emil wrócił nad rzekę i wrócił do Sokra tesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z rozpaczą załamała dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobra oznaka, ale mnie to bardzo męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40903050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pilnie potrzebujemy ambitnego, prawnie wiążącego traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40903052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potwierdzają to niezbite fakty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40903054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A proszę o czas z dwóch powodów co najmniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40903056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia jest oparta nie tylko na kryteriach gospodarczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40903057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja niemam osobistej woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27642415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jeszcze poważniejszą uważam jednak kwestię zniknięć wnioskodawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27642416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie będą tam na niego mile patrzyli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27642417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że w tym roku będą mogli wykorzystać efekty tych wysiłków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27642418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy bardzo dumni z tego postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27642419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.26,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowe znaczenie ma przestrzeganie zasady niezależności uniwersytetów oraz tradycja wolności badań w każdych okolicznościach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo się mylę, albo trafiłeś w sedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama coś mówi, a on nic, tylko: „aaa!” i płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kali mieć bambus — odpowiedział młody Murzyn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła jej na myśl przyjaciółka lat dziecięcych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21076768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodemu królowi trafiły widocznie do przekonania słowa Stasia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosny, że nie wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wiedziała, nie lękałabym się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się zdobyć na cierpliwość, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co się dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś ludzie mówili gwarą, nie tak jak teraz mówimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w obecnej chwili był w stanie jakby zbliżonym do transu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy ja się przy tobie rozpływam zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczała, płakała, nie dawała się uczesać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się i wyciągnąłem rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21867048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tracąc głowę zawył, wówczas na pomoc pospieszyło mu dwóch przechodniów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21867049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej dla niego, gdy już nie wróci do przytomności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21867050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to dzieckiem w powijakach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21867051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez tereny ówczesnych Świętochłowic wiódł odwieczny szlak z Bytomia do Mikołowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21867052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Królowała, niby dumna władczyni wśród wpatrzonych w każde skinienie, poddanych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu obraz zaczyna wirować, już znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął z cicha, spuściwszy głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko po to, aby nic nie słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to poza goleniem się największy wysiłek z tych codziennych, programowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil tego już nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak aleja śpiewnych drzew… śpiewnych drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś w pobliżu przejechał w tej chwili baron…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem uspokoiłem się trochę i spróbowałem rzecz rozważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten nosek, co się do góry zadzierał, był taki śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgouste ryby, strzelające zielonymi, neonowymi światłami, płynęły sennie przez granatową, gęstą wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak dadzą lody, to mi roztopi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30648426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zmuszamy nikogo do podejmowania żadnych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30648427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie z własnej inicjatywy na temat kobiet w więzieniach jest bardzo symboliczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30648428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałbym jeszcze raz podziękować kontrsprawozdawcom, którzy zaangażowali się w osiągnięcie kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30648429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejny poważny problem dotyczy gromadzenia danych i informacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30648430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne w przy tym jest, że tego rodzaju projekty odczuwalnie przybliżają Unię Europejską obywatelom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Króliki wymagają przywiązania, ale potrafią dać w zamian wiele szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest Anna, matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wesela się zagoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W „pańskiej” Polsce… — zaczął mówca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokuczamy jej czasem, ale dzielna z niej dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy się coś nie stanie?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaspokoiła ona resztki drzemiących w nim właściwości: żądzę złota i złośliwą rozkosz samoudręczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominam sobie najlepsze dzieła starożytności, lecz nic nie sprawiło na mnie większego wrażenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wymyślą jeszcze coś lepszego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wiesz, Angelino, że całą dzisiejszą noc, śniłem o tobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie stale wrzało życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem tegoż wieczora dostałem zaproszenie na występ w prywatnym mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaleźli duży balon sylwestrowy na środku pustej jezdni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę — odparł po chwili, podając mu cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co, do zobaczenia za miesiąc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje, kopalnie, tartaki i przedsiębiorstwa okrętowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie była woda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadał pomału, gdy nagle odczuł nienawiść wobec poko jówki Józi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowy i żłobkowaty korzeń zabarwił się w słońcu soczystym połyskiem eterycznie wonnej błony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A każdy inaczej opisał, jak Maciuś uciekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz istota przejawu pozostaje ta sama: zła, występna i tajemnicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otchłań płciowa z hipopotamem włochatym „na blond”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy przyszedł mi w pomoc szczęśliwy przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go przykre uczucie osamotnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oznajmił z kolei Podlasiak z taką stanowczością, jakby chciał stawić opór wszelkim zaprzeczeniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddać ją żołnierzom ku zabawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powłóczy się, wygłodzi — i wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był też nieprzytomny tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tu mało zieleni! — rzekłem tonem skargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwię się wcale, że wywołuje taki popłoch wśród dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym być jakimś takim dzikim kotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę! — odparła z dąsem dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymia, „bezimienna paszcza”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtarzam: Niech polityką zajmują się przynajmniej specjaliści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdy cię z torby na świat wynurzym, poznasz mnie po głosie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz, teraz, wszystko to wydawało mi się dzieciństwem i marnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ten musi być przerażony, okropnie przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postawił ją wreszcie na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochodzi z szyszaków, przyłbic i z pancerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok okropny, przerażający!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem panu, co on zawiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź do szóstego oddziału i zobacz, czy tam jest globus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz jest spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto trzy kluczowe elementy, potrzebne dziś\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego przede wszystkim musimy szukać alternatywnych źródeł energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"z konia, czy piechtą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy rozpamiętywać przeszłość albo spojrzeć w przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednomyślne porozumienie jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30488959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to całkowicie nieproporcjonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30488960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mogę państwu powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30488963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsi pytania przewodniczącemu Komisji Europejskiej będą zadawać szefowie lub przedstawiciele grup politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30488965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisłym regulacjom oraz nadzorowi powinien również podlegać transport gatunków docelowych i niedocelowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30488967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt oczywiście nie wierzy, że stanie się to z dnia na dzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oficer stał na ulicy i wymyślał komuś ostatnimi słowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za długo już siedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już po tym postępku od razu poznałbym Francuza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy typ ma swoje dwa nieomal przeciwne bieguny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mu było na imię? — spytał ciekawie jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzę się z uśmiechem na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu kobiety nie zbuntują się przeciw tym strojom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbrzydnie im to bardzo prędko i całkiem przestaną się mną zajmować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na powitanie krócej, na pożegnanie - dłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się opierał o ciebie i o ścianę i podejdę do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25018712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jakoś wychodzi, że człowiek musi kłamać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25018713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał o dziesięć lat młodziej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25018714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona urocza, on nieznaczący i tego tylko pragnie, żeby mógł w cieniu pozostawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25018715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i podszedł do buku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25018716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem miejscu załamał mu się głos: Leon dostał spazmów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… — chrząknąłem — mieliście się zejść na moście Św. Floriana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zaręczał, że jej chorej matce nie zabraknie niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu przyszedł z miną pokorną, zbyt pokorną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Snadź powzięła nowe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28023789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jesteśmy dziś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28023790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Józefa w Bukareszcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28023792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był konieczny krok, ale uratowanie banków nie pomogło złagodzić kryzysu później\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28023793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby naprawić tę sytuację, należy uzupełnić rozporządzenie o bardziej szczegółowe przepisy dotyczące inspekcji krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28023794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym etapie fundamentalne pytanie to\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężona ręka lewa wskazywała coś uparcie w dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był też nieprzytomny tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę marnie zdechnąć w mej ciemnej norze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam takiego, a jednak widziałem go nagiego do pasa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ja lubię skakać i biegać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpadł w ich ręce i zginął straszną śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba więcej, ażebyś został jej najlepszym przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak przywiązał też konia i wszedł do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na głowie miał koronę z cierni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24989056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy już tego dobrego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjaśnię ci kiedyś później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest pan wzorowym narzeczonym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, gdyż księżyc skrył się poza chmurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boby od razu poznali, bo się zrobiłem czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecież dawno miniona przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ty się dziś nie obrażasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali nigdy po imieniu tego, co było między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa potrafiła być nadzwyczajna tylko w sobie samej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39562969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy nadzieję, iż zostaną one wdrożone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39562975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łazienka jest tam oto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39562982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym szczerze podziękować posłom, posłankom i wszystkim innym uczestnikom procedury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39562986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim należy powiedzieć, że Parlament pragnie porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39562991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze komisje będą musiały przyjąć na siebie większą odpowiedzialność polegającą na kontrolowaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39563207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolność sumienia i przekonań dotyczy każdego i każde państwo ma obowiązek zapewnić ich poszanowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przy sobie ucznia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oficer stał na ulicy i wymyślał komuś ostatnimi słowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Wierusz wrócił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — przyznał towarzysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nas nie byłoby wojny…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wrażenia po przedwczorajszym filmie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zwariowałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śmiech i groza — szczególne połączenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiesił jej płaszcz w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytali je najczęściej na spotkaniach, rzadziej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzenie, że w Polsce rządzi burżuazja, nie jest prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie była woda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ładnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór najwidoczniej siedział na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszła do nieba — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolała go głowa i oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisując się, kładł kropkę po podpisie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecinny jest człowiek dojrzały, dojrzałe jest dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach programu rozwoju bibliotek zakwalifikowaliśmy się do tego projektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jest dzień wagarowicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem razem z nimi przeglądać ten tomik jako pamiętnik szczęśliwie przebytego koszmarnego okresu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — teraz kontakt częściowo osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz, raku zatracony, baw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był szybki, ale na pewno przemyślany i rozsądny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie cierpię czarnych rzeczy — zawołała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Ewa była zazdrosna, że nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, nie powiesz mi o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczyli się na ganku, gdzie cuchnęło, ale oni nie zauważali tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo dziś jest pierwszy śnieg, a wy nie uważacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął się wielki, żywiołowy strajk krawiecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była podjęta przez Europę próba powiedzenia rynkom światowym \\\"uspokójcie się, moi drodzy\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli tak, to czy możemy poznać te kryteria?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwzględniając powyższe uwagi, mogę zgodzić się z proponowaną strategią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mówię jedynie o tym, jak to widzę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często coś się psuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33335727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do ich sporządzenia i przyjęcia potrzeba znacznego wysiłku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysz rozpytywał ciekawie o stosunki w cukrowni i w okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając lat siedem czuł już, jak należy postępować z lekarzami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bierze dosłownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawia to poważny problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czwórka moich dzieci chodzi do szkoły z dziećmi katolickimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwna, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to ogromne ryzyko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy rozróżniać oba pojęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30708569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.836,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę w Ducha Świętego;\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znajdowali się blisko gimnazjum, do którego chodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, co teraz się z nim stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś — musiałem cię zamienić wprost w piosenkę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idealna pogoda na rower!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przecież panu coś na mnie zależy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda to, że stary zjada co dzień młodego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz nie chciał przestać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi się trochę podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuś się! — pisnął kulawiec i pięścią powahał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo nie chcą słuchać dorośli, ten idzie do dzieciaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni żyją dla demokracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna będzie wielka, a może i nie tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczał przez chwilę wysokim falsetem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała skala uczuć, od najsubtelniejszych do najpotworniejszych, ale jakże dziko spotęgowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwie usiadł, ledwo pani weszła, nowe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niczyja — odparł hardo Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak była czarna, że prawie niebieska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny nie wpadłby na taki pomysł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A młynarz stoi obok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, czy zastałem Jolkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to mała teczka, zawierająca papier, koperty, pióra i atrament.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… to szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie, biedak, co jeszcze go czeka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą na boisko i bawią się piłką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem nagle poskoczył naprzód, uścisnął mi rękę i serdecznie mi pogratulował powodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dyskutuj, bo oberwiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co on mógł oznaczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wydobył księgi, umaczał pióro i, nibyto, zaczął rachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24990185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi Felek, patrzy, patrzy, oczy przeciera, patrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powinieneś być w salonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach naszych sosna skonała…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety w moim wieku są coraz starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w warunkach tak dla jej zdrowia nieodpowiednich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zło, zdaniem twoim, jest równie wiecznym jak dobro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój pan takiej wędliny nie robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen pełen majaków, zmagań i widm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd poszły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są właśnie europejskie interesy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko brak dobrej woli ze strony Komisji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdolność do mówienia o prawdziwej demokracji wymaga czegoś więcej, aniżeli tylko prawa do głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tolerancja nie oznacza obojętności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zastanowić się, w jaki sposób wydajemy pieniądze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27046315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem możemy być z tego dumni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Idź, przyprowadź mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I wcale przez drzwi nie wchodziłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałaś moich skarpetek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stało się chyba nic złego? — szepnęła Hanna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20959933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zastanawiał się przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20959934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obsługa komisyjnego otwarcia pomieszczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20959935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby to spostrzegł, byłoby ze mną krucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20959936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem, żeś ją ty gotowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20959937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A mój szkielet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22939466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko nie bujasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spiesz się, mamy czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam byle robociarz wie więcej od naszego niejednego filaru krytyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dwie głowy, to nie jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci powitały go radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął wydobywać pomału historię swoich wakacji, ale zauważył, że Janek jest zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcale nie wiedziałem, że mam serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niewidziane dawał się odczuwać kulisty i odległy pośpiech nadchodzącego spoza ziemi słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ci już przyniósł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiecień plecień, co przeplata, trochę zimy, trochę lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się i ujrzałem Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W maju jak w gaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim pana nigdy jeszcze nie widziałam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walenty uczy mnie grać na skrzypcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było jeszcze szaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby choć trochę umieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24981541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starszy Pan...... czarno ubrany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hugon również na takie rzeczy nie zważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umawiała się z różnymi chłopcami, dawała się czasami całować; bez przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie idzie mi tu oczywiście o walkę z logiką…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy ocknął się z zamyślenia i spojrzał nań przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i weszła matka Emila, mówiąc: — Jak ładnie grasz dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nachylić się nisko, do ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od miasta do miasta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była w dalszym ciągu bardzo grzeczna, bardzo dziecinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaj z tego, jeżeli ci życie miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wiersze miałem kiedyś czytać ludziom, którzy wierzyli w przetrwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A u żadnej z lalek nie spotkałam takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazimy do pokoju przez okienko z łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uproszczona procedura niemal wyklucza Parlament\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to wskazuje na strategicznie ważną zmianę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragniemy przejrzystości, ale chcemy, żeby była ona prawdziwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jesteście gotowi do bardzo dobrego startu w tym tygodniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę musimy teraz skorzystać z możliwości, jakie daje nam nowy traktat lizboński\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"istnieje także niepewność co do interpretacji przepisów i rozporządzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41036925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w końcu zmieni Pan taktykę w celu rozwiązania problemów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając pokręcił się po podwórzu, ale psy z obu stron zachodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oni przeszli obok niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, co mówię! — odparł jednoręki i spojrzał na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy tam z samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie strony licytują się w obojętności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Macie tupet, żeby się tu pojawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilowy zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś Narcyzem, ja też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy ostatnio z nią rozmawiałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schludnie ubrany pan zapraszał uroczą panią do tańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłeś, że bez bójki się usuniesz! — krzyknął jednoręki, grożąc spuchniętą lewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba udajesz, moja kochana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodziły koło niego kobiety i, jak komety, ciągnęły za sobą smugi zapachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowak nie robił nam żadnych wymówek po powrocie z cyrku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka osób rzuciło się nawet w pogoń za zbiegłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko oglądał na nowo, jakby dawno nie widziane, jakby na nowo odkrył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykładam mu dziesięć razy dziennie, jak się ma zachowywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w domu okazało się, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem smutno: — Ja wcale nie mam własnej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło drugiej nad ranem wyczerpana usnęła mi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą go szukali, może już szukają cichaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak bliska współpraca jest rzadkością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy tutaj o harmonizacji przepisów dotyczących wynagrodzeń w sektorze publicznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję Państwu za cierpliwość i z przyjemnością odpowiem na wszelkie pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejna zmiana Regulaminu reguluje procedurę wspólnych posiedzeń komisji oraz wspólnych głosowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego tak ważne jest, aby nie ignorować sieci pomocy społecznej w tych państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem to bardzo ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41570337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo jak burza w owej nocy, uspokoiła się także walka jej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spostrzegła, że było ich sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez fundację Nowoczesna Polska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zamiast tych głupich żartów, przyślijcie mi ją tutaj na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To moja tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie patrzył nawet, jak się koło niego zabawiał Hannibal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za medalion? — zapytała nagle, sięgając ręką ku mej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mongołowie uczynili to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewniejsze niż stary jeleń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szum chodził wierzchem lasu, nie przenikając do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru, ludzie dobrzy, do jaru! — zawołał z zapałem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała dużo koleżanek, nie miała przyjaciółek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak wyglądasz? — spytała dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Począł zapadać wczesny, zimowy wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki mi opowiadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Snadź powzięła nowe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pewnych rzeczy nie należy nazy wać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną mi dłoń wypuśćcie na swobodę! — napierała się, zerkając błagalnie na Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to w jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystkie Podlasiaki tak wyglądają, jakby zbytecznej na karku gęby co prędzej pozbyć się chcieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez Bibliotekę Narodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie smoki i całe Indie stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za typy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało jej to dużą przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebym miał pieniądze, tobym mu mleka kupił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomniałem o tem twojemu ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję natężenie mózgu, wysiłek nieznośny, ostrzegający mnie, że coś musi runąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto wszystko, cośmy się mogli dowiedzieć z bogatej przeszłości tego tajemniczego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy w życiu wojowniczy nasz towarzysz pozostał głuchy na zaczepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21877541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było wpół do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko otwierała drzwi, wszystko opadało ze mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie każda morda pasuje do forda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi swój rysunek zniszczony i wybucha płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosieńka, tak się bawi, śmieje do rozpuku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” — Uwaga, Pola zaczyna myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrzask nieludzki zagłuszył ostatnie słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustąp mu miejsca, bo widzisz, jaki z niego siłacz! — krzyczał Jan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście są choroby, na które nie ma ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak niespodzianie, tak znienacka, jak bywa nieraz ze szczęściem lub śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ale nie mogłem znaleźć informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zaroślach rozległ się trzask gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam ci do powiedzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosz, spadając w koziołkach, wysypał całą swą zawartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie trzeba mi było pozwalać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tatko miał tam warsztat w narożnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzeczywistość, to straszliwa w swej prostocie rzeczywistość!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście zabieg nie był mi obcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To znów zależy od okoliczności, które go wywołały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany zaszły również na nowej części cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to przecież śmieszny zabobon, Halko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była jedyna rzecz, oprócz Ewy, na którą zwrócił uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem mimowolny dreszcz grozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O psi syn jeden!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dawniej byłam uczennicą… nawet szczególnie wyróżnianą… ale teraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musieli chłopcy coś wsypać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się, że okręt poszedł wprost na dno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śpi Nel — śpi — mówił sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I rzeczywiście Arabowie, którzy przyłączyli się do karawany, niezbyt obawiali się pogoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zobaczył, że jest sucha i surowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubisz kogoś? — Ale skąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi smakuje wyciskany sok z jabłek, kiwi i mango.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest bardzo ważne stwierdzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że to może być nowy krok w kierunku prawdziwego Nowego Zielonego Ładu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania te mają zasadniczo dwa etapy i mówimy o tych dwóch etapach dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odejście Muammara Kaddafiego to sprawa pilna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie o tym tutaj mowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mówi się nawet o zniesieniu wiz dla Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32957481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznaję również, że potrzebne jest wspólne podejście, w którym nie ma zbyt wielu priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest coś całkiem innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co nas obu może łączyć ze sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na nią z wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na cóż tyle zachodów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym punktem porządku dziennego jest przedstawienie rocznego sprawozdania Trybunału Obrachunkowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka była strategia komunikacyjna Komisji i jej członków w okresie poprzedzającym referendum w Irlandii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określiliśmy trzy warunki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ponieważ myślę, że sprawozdawczyni powiedziała, że utknęliśmy, jeśli chodzi o resztę pakietu azylowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzje te miały znaczenie na szczeblu wspólnotowym, co skutkowało przyjęciem kilku dokumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj sytuacja jest inna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36944133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nawiasem mówiąc, jest on wyższy niż w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23811629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski wskoczył do swego powozu i otworzył lornetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23811630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym choć jeszcze raz mógł mu rękę uścisnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23811631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie masz mi nic więcej do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23822092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak dawno posiadł pan ten dar „podróżowania“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23822094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ranne godziny wlokły mu się, jakby do nich zaprzężono woły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23822095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt mi gorzko pisać o tem wszystkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23822096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokoła nich kipiały śmiech i radość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28723884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przyczyni się także do większej spójności wewnętrznej w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28723885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystąpił błąd w numeracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28723886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koncepcja Domu Historii Europejskiej znalazła poparcie w wielu środowiskach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28723948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy doświadczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28723950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy rozmawiałem z kierownikiem tego ośrodka, powiedział\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28724437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę coś dodać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28724439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawmy więc tę kwestię w spokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z pociągu nie wolno strzelać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nakazuje prawo puszczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nauczycieli musiał dla bezpieczeństwa budynku mieszkać w pobliżu szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękki! — zawołała, omal nie płacząc ze szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy się tak dalej spotykać jak dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed świtem mróz brał coraz większy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na każde pytanie jedno tylko powtarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy woda ciebie kąsa? — żartowała z niego Danusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadamy z nią na osobności — rzekł kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie przypuszczasz, kto padł ofiarą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co tam pojedzie z takimi nowinami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ma być: „rąk”, napisane: „rak”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamusia mi zawsze powie: „lustro”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zacisnął znowu ogniwa, kiedy psy przycichły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz następnego rana żar uczy nił się na świecie okropny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chętnie — rzekła Hanna, podchodząc do instrumentu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumiał się tedy młodzian i zwyczajnie zdębiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil odczuwał strach i opór przed posuwaniem się dalej, Janek — ani strachu, ani oporu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda dzisiaj będzie mroźna i wietrzna, należy się ciepło ubrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili furtka już była otwarta na oścież.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierś była jędrna i młoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wielkim przeciwnikiem rozwydrzenia sportowego, które się w ostatnich latach rozwinęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej we wszechświecie lubię dżem porzeczkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po lewej, nad brzegiem urwiska, zamajaczył dom — chata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kogoś ty się udał? — rzekł z niesmakiem po dość mitrężnym namyśle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż, że ze Szkocji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąski sierp ubywającego księżyca siał słabe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaska pańska na pstrym koniu jeździ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nie chciałam, może, może, żebyś ty się zajmował brudną robotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na człeka tak ledwo ledwo zakrawasz, jakbyś go naprędce i od biedy jeno zmałpował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dla mężczyzn życie jest sztuką, gdzie większość z nich zaledwie istnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą więc uwagę skierowałem na konia, widocznie tracącego resztki sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przypomniał sobie i zapragnął mieć blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci powiem, czego się boisz: Boisz się stężenia, śmierci — jak wosk tężeje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trafisz do dziupli? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedy prywatny wagon?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytaj moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Europie narasta problem porzuconych dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"By ją ukarać, mąż oblał ją kwasem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliłoby to na ogromną oszczędność energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, dlaczego tak się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jak pogodzić utrzymanie bioróżnorodności z intensywnym rozwojem infrastrukturalnym i gospodarczym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie była właściwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli na pogrzebie prezydenci Czech, Słowacji, Węgier, Niemiec, Litwy, Łotwy, Rumunii, Słowenii, premier Estonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym rozpocząć od podziękowania wszystkim sprawozdawcom, którzy wnieśli swój wkład w obecną procedurę absolutorium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objąłem dom szybkiem spojrzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego rodzaju uderzenia mają moc decydującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego, że Sara o niej zapomniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co tu się działo jak cię nie było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skutkiem delikatności, jaką jedynie domowy wpływ zdoła zaszczepić, miał obejście miłe i proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po polach szedł chrapliwy, złowrogi, przytłumiony odgłos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie nadszedł dzień wyścigów, pogodny ale nie gorący; właśnie jak potrzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, no… niech się błąka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz ta nie żyła i nie myślała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I na cóż potrzebna wam była woda? — pytano Nowaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno zawsze mieć pierwszeństwo do ochrony i pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały ciąg owych daremnie straconych lat jaśniałeś w sercu moim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spieszyło mi się do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zależało jej na tym, a jednak nie istniał już poza nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że tu w hotelu nie ma nocników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie? — pyta się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty się mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co mi to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero później ocenił, że to było bezczelnie sprytne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego neurologowi było nieco trudno pogłaskać go po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako zbieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No i przypuszczam też, dzielny człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dość dziwne powtórzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne duże, że dwóch może się wozić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całował ją długo, podczas gdy ona patrzyła na niego uważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr wieje między twoimi włosami, jak między gałęźmi nadmorskich krzaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno! — pochwyciła pośpiesznie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możecie nas tu zamknąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy w chłopskiej chałupie, był jeszcze taki słaby, że trudno mu było samemu chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące turbin nerwowych, gdy ktoś już jest chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi o swej rodzinie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądam i segreguję wiersze pisane dla tych, których nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie ma sensu przekonywać, tłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest takie proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oko widziało zawsze jej ciąg dalszy, zatracając w próżni niepochwytną resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisła, Odra, Warta i Bug to cztery najdłuższe rzeki w Polsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogół kobiet, jeśli chodzi o miłość, jest przerażająco niesentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział wolno: - Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbujemy zakrzyczeć prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do południa — powtórzył — do południa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spaceruję po lesie, z duszą na ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26591592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie Turcja nie jest wiarygodnym partnerem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26591593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto krótkie przypomnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26591594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do śmierci będziesz kiełbasą handlował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26591595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cytuję Karela De Guchta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26591633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech ktoś się weźmie w garść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 12.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani baronesso, proszę zatem o odpowiedź na następujące pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 13.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacięta konkurencja w tym sektorze to dobra wiadomość dla konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.044,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia ta była przedmiotem długich i gorących debat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili zdjął słuchawki z uszu i był zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczył na jednym korzeniu, na drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż dystans do Warszawy będzie rósł…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortuna kołem się toczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmy w prawym płucu doc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pomocą swej busoli Filip kontrolował przez godzinę kierunek ich jazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do Sary i wpatrzyła się w nią z uwielbieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu i na dziedziniec osady zaczęły zalatywać kule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiała i ona, że niestety ich sytuacja znacznie się pogorszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie masz plany na dziś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnij pan dalej to nadzwyczaj interesujące opowiadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oczekiwałbym odpowiedzi dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku memu zdumieniu tuż koło mnie stał jakiś człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak przywiązał też konia i wszedł do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem po niej i ukryłem się wygodnie w sianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po upływie trzech godzin cegła zaczęła się poddawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zawiodło mnie ono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22740631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza równiną wznosił się łańcuch wzgórz, z którego wystawał silnie jeden wierzchołek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Relacje handlowe odgrywają dzisiaj olbrzymią rolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecne obustronne porozumienie ramowe nadal będzie rządzić współpracą obustronną i dialogiem politycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą przewidzieć swoje inwestycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, aby ich terminarz oraz płynność zostały zachowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym Państwa zapewnić, że problem ochrony rekinów traktuję niezwykle poważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma lekarstwa na wewnętrzny konflikt między kapitalistami, który będzie stopniowo się pogłębiał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy zachęcać do dalszych przemian w Turkmenistanie poprzez dialog i partnerstwo, a nie izolację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27129922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poważne szkody zostały wyrządzone w tak ważnych branżach, jak turystyka i przemysł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za świństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kukułka przez sen kukała w głębinie leśnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne duże, że dwóch może się wozić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowym głosem przemówiła natura; odezwało się serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krążę uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć gdyż oczekują mnie towarzysze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja myślę — potra fisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil tego już nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ruchem ręki wskazuję ruiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc aż cały miesiąc leżałem w malignie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrośni o siebie wzajemnie, jak dwie głośne piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan nas odwiedzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie zdążył skończyć te przygotowania, wszedł farmer z córką ubraną, gotową do drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszeliśmy jak służąca przeszła przez sień i odsunęła rygiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grobowa cisza panowała dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpię, że panowie pojmą całą doniosłość mojego odkrycia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyznaję, że nie widzę sposobu powiązania tych wszystkich faktów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21347782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że nie przyjechał dla przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle strach i boi się do niej podejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się pan woźny nie zgodzi, to niech sam go wyrzuci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałaś moich skarpetek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważa członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z rozpaczą załamała dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo słaby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle sygnał urwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko oddech jej stał się szybszym i piersi zaczęły silnie falować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za rządów carskich słynęło szpiegostwo policyjne, jako najbardziej udoskonalone i wyrafinowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszak pan nie jest nawet naszym przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest rzeczą absolutnie konieczną, aby powiadomił o niej detektywów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie może stanąć między nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie rozzuchwalili się w tych stronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bardzo zajęty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, albo nikt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rządy terroru w okręgu węglowym i żelaznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja na to pozwolić nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła z plaży w dziewczynkowatej sukni, którą nosiła, gdy miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Hoooo. Jak gwiazdy - uśmiechnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę dzisiaj do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jednej chwili zamilkł tłum cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko narzuciłam ubranie i poszłam do pokoju Wilhelma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedawno przekonaliśmy się, jak niepohamowana żądza zysku może zrujnować gospodarkę światową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagamy się zatem debaty, projektu rezolucji, a następnie głosowania na kolejnym posiedzeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poważna klęska żywiołowa w autonomicznym regionie Madery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, Strasburg już posiada całkiem dobry uniwersytet i nie podobał im się ten pomysł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyną odpowiedzią było to, że Rada nie przedyskutowała tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy pamiętać o tym aspekcie i zbadać, w jaki sposób możemy go dalej rozwijać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto apel, panie przewodniczący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38394835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować moim koleżankom i kolegom z komisji za owocną współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było stanąć w „ogonku” i poczekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoła była dużo lepiej zbudowana jak jej lekki domek letni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mnie na to nie stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to znaczy? Nic nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idioto! Idioto! Sprać ją i pójść sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby to zrobił, nie miałabym pretensji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i łopot serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochanie, wróciłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz od początku… — powtórzył ciszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie był dobry znak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24773002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy kocham rodziców czy nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24773003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dlatego, że się z nich często śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24773004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem tylko rycerzem, ale nie dworakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24773005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stach Wokulski ma podziękowania od petersburskich towarzystw naukowych!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29503904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego jest to nam potrzebne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29503905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten sukces niesie za sobą pewne zobowiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29503906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kompletnego międzynarodowego porozumienia klimatycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29503907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że wlecze się on i że powinien być wznowiony, byśmy doczekali się postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz czas w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż mnie one obchodzić mogą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na całe życie dość mam tej jednej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała komiczne wargi, górną wysuniętą nad dolną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyj to nos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie składa się z samych niedziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jutro rano odbędzie się tutaj konferencja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona cię przecież kocha, mówisz, mimo że się do tego nie chce przyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tutaj wieją dziwne wiatry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie mogę tego teraz zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie słyszał pan dotychczas o nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba udajesz, moja kochana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy uczynić wszystko, co konieczne, aby zagwarantować przezwyciężenie obecnego kryzysu finansowego i przywrócenie zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałem za przyjęciem omawianego sprawozdania ze względu na poważny kryzys, który dotknął sektor mleczarski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.892,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stworzenie wspólnej polityki azylowej i imigracyjnej jest długookresowym celem Unii Europejskiej, który popieramy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łatwością wszędzie można dostrzec przypadki marnotrawienia energii i lekceważenia konsekwencji globalnego ocieplenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie natomiast chciałabym podziękować gorąco członkom Komisji Europejskiej za pomoc, jakiej mi udzielili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pani bez wątpienia kompetentną wiceprzewodniczącą, jest pani także bardzo wpływową osobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwe stosowanie tych instrumentów, które już istnieją, może stanowić ramy służące ich ochronie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30216834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postępowanie to należy przeprowadzić we współpracy z właściwymi instytucjami europejskimi i międzynarodowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24453741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nikt nie zdecyduje się na próbę?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24453742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozweselona ich figlem, zaczęła klaskać w ręce, śmiejąc się serdecznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24453743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc w Zbyszku na myśl, że przytomność wraca chorej, zadrżało z radości serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24453745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas postawić kropkę nad ipsylonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24454001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy panowie znają tego pana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24454003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego one latają tak nisko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24454005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gżegżółka jest cudowna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24454008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minął rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lewica, prawica, średnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniesie śmierć — szepnął młody Murzyn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtąd nie było równie oddanych sobie przyjaciół, jak tych dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam Mickiewicz. Autor Dziadów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosił, abym powróciła do swojego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje tylko: „Ja jestem rzeczywistością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dżungla podrosła przez tę jedną dżdżystą noc bardzo znacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrzebuję! — krzyczy i ciska ołówkiem o ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja nienawidzę tego bydlęcia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawy jej zaczynają przybierać formy bardziej określone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I po co było tak bić szczeniaka? — krzywi się felczer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to włosy z warkocza mej narzeczonej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim kulawiec zdążył powstać z upadku, znikła w rozbłyskanej słońcem zieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając pokręcił się po podwórzu, ale psy z obu stron zachodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie! — protestował inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo leżało takie kółeczko, od zegarka czy czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam czytał po łacinie i grecku tak, jak Emil T.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się teraz Filip cieszył, że puścił się tymi śladami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po jej odejściu uczułam nieokreślony lęk, którego nie mogę opanować dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziemy na toczącej się w przestrzeni kuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie ściany były pokryte literalnie od posadzki po strop książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chodź, odprowadź mnie do zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podaj pan tyły!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karty graficzne są strasznie drogie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jej jednak nie uratowało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej nie mogłem już wymówić ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz jego nagle spoważniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże szybko pędziłem teraz bez ciężkiego płaszcza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał, jak się w tej robocie odznaczali marynarze oraz rozmaite osoby urzędowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22796549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko, jak strzelec składał mi życzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, abyśmy poszli tą drogą o wiele dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest procent kobiet w dziedzinie badań i dlaczego sprawy wyglądają tak źle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzieliśmy od dawna, w jak złym stanie jest Haiti, jak źle funkcjonują tam struktury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o zdrowie reprodukcyjne, chciałabym tylko stwierdzić, co następuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grecja nie prosi o pieniądze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest argumentem także fakt powoływania się na koszty, na środki finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę jest to wielki wynik\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy ma on po czasie możliwość zareagować, największe ugrupowania uchwalają wspólnie pustą rezolucję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39204075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że będzie to udana prezydencja, z trzech powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili wrócił ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwieniem zauważyła, że w jej domu mieszka dwóch starszych chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjął mnie z chmurą na czole i wyrzutem w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podniósł ją cicho i oddalił się bez pożegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego? — Nie gniewaj się, że będę przykry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce krąży wokół Ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomość była zawarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mu było na imię? — spytał ciekawie jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się odwlecze to nie uciecze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyszedł z sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto jak się te nieprzytomne marzenia ziściły w nieprzytomnym losie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jeźdźców rozproszyła się w różne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alkohol był jedną z przyczyn kolizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wpadniemy do mojej siostry na spaghetti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawy pan kpi sobie ze mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże „grupa pięciu” przycichła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz istota przejawu pozostaje ta sama: zła, występna i tajemnicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to sprzyjać jedynie pracy mechanicznej, nie wymagającej twórczego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie porwałem! — odrzekł z namaszczeniem — Sama wyrosła na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem uspokoiłem się trochę i spróbowałem rzecz rozważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Powiesz mi podczas śniadania, czy mamusia ci pozwoliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej spokojny, obojętny głos mówił: — De, przepraszam, że rękę źle trzymam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciśnienie ustępowało, jak powietrze z dziurawego balo nu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem wrzód pękł sam bez przecinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widać się wstydzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyby to nie było przyjemne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"chyba będziemy łowić żaby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy lubisz grać w piłkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę panów, nie zrozumcie mnie fałszywie, co do mego zamiaru na tym punkcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela zwiesiła głowę i cicho przebierając palcami po stole, dumała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawaj, dalej, bo nie mam czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mu za to wdzięczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24748175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co, chyba zostawiłam słuchawki w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów wywołuje, kto jest, kogo nie ma, kto się spóźnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to nowe fale ciemności opadały na nich, jak czarny śnieg; wolno prószyła ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nienormalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz czas w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciszkiem do niej, ciszkiem, żeby nie uciekła! — ostrzegł półgłosem kulawiec, badawczo obzierając dziuplę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nicość jest nieskończonością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment, kiedy ona powiedziała: — To w parku nie sprawiło mi przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaj z tego, jeżeli ci życie miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samoloty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę nosić okulary które mają aż dziesięć dioptrii dla prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek był tuż, jak gdyby na wierzchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, zgniecie mu żebra, zdruzgoce klatkę piersiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto, witam cię łaskawie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Unii Europejskiej idzie o konkurencję, ale również o spójność i solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemoc oraz zbrodnie przeciwko ludności nie mogą być akceptowane przez Unię Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Europy importujemy z Rosji w sumie około jednej czwartej zużywanego przez nas gazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rany zadane naszej historii nie zagoiły się do dzisiejszego dnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywamy Radę do udostępniania wreszcie tych funduszy bez przeszkód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będziesz miał bogów cudzych przede mną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z panią w kwestii budowania pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję wniosek i prezentację i życzę nam wszystkim powodzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26945251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiedliwość dla \\\"kobiet do towarzystwa\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po knajpach robił znajomości i podejmował się różnych niebezpiecznych spraw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ranę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za obraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał mu do powiedzenia tysiące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszło, minęło — myślmy o chwili obecnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faunie, mów, czego się żalisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie pójdzie do niej żebrać o miłość po tamtym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Włoch najlepiej dojechać przez Niemcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze, które wdychałem rozrzedziło się i cięło, jak eter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A idźże idźże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaparło mi oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprężyny moich czynów i myśli spoczywają w innym zapomnianym bycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się wtedy stanie z jej listami w moim pokoju?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażałem też sobie że każdej chwili drzwi się muszą otworzyć i nieznajomy wejdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niechaj to jeszcze nie teraz nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Harmonika urwała swą grę i tylko poświstuje chwilami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23365572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydziłem się jej natrętnego śmiechu i tej woskowej twarzy jakby drewnianego konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip był dużym chłopcem, ale nieprzyjemnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trafisz do dziupli? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahali się chwilę i potem poszli dalej, zostawiając głębokie ślady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecie dziw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil obmacał wszystkie krzesła, na których wierzchu siedziała skóra, a w środku mieszkały sprężyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przebudziłem się… — powtórzył z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Markowi, jako najstarszemu, dostało się największe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny ułatwić korzystanie z tego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Felek się nie uspokoił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślałem, że dzieci są dobre, tylko nieszczęśliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ty robisz, licho zatracone?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłyszę! — odpowiedział radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz najlepiej zrobisz, jak pójdziesz do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stali we troje, ale tylko Emil patrzył na trupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby znał ten dziwny język?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już spała, a on słuchał, czy oddycha, czy nie umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanarek wesoło zaśpiewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny i młodzieńczy, jak ten letni poranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była ani trochę ordynarna, ani trochę nieprzyzwoita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kraj, to obyczaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam za istotne, że po intensywnych debatach Rada Europejska zgodziła się na rolę Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie by świat wyglądał pod rządami Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto uważam, że pozostawienie wytycznych bez zmian było właściwe, ponieważ ogólnie były udane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że wnioskuje się o pewne poprawki po to, aby wciąż zwiększać stopień pomocniczości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że Komisja będzie nadal przyjmować wkład Parlamentu, mając w perspektywie dalsze udoskonalenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, że dyrektywa zawiera minimalne warunki, które muszą być spełnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później każdy może obwiniać drugą osobę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to zbyt fundamentalne wartości, aby przy nich manipulować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29083701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koszty dodatkowej ochrony w ostatecznym rozrachunku powinny pokrywać państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli się wzajem wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okrzyk ten zabrzmiał jakby głos z chmur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- O matko, jakaż to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na boku zaś arkusza znajdował się jeszcze następujący dodatek, wypisany drobniejszemi literami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała się chłopcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiem ci bajkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekł Tadeusz z powagą: Zosiu, to są jaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini nie jest wcale ciemno, gdyż rozświeca ją księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20831617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wędrowałam niegdyś, a tak jeżdżę teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyła pierwszy rok chemii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność ta spada przede wszystkim na rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzili do jednego gimnazjum, do różnych oddziałów tej samej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegli żwawo poprzez gąszczary i przesmyki leśne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętał rozbawiony wyraz oczu ojca, gdy docierał do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym pójść na studia plastyczne i zostać sławną malarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan wojenny bywał dla mnie zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz nas obejrzyj, dziewulinko płochliwa! — szepnął nieśmiało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem na nartach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanarek wesoło zaśpiewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziwożona wskazała palcem ową stronę, gdzie się znajdował niezbędny dla jej namysłów rozstaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ufaj też pięknej jasnowłosej osobie, która chwilowo zdołała cię opętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem on odwraca głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziewczynko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten głos nie był im obcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artyści, twórcy religii, ludzie niezadowoleni, nienasyceni, metafizycy, wielka różnorodność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadła, chudła z dnia na dzień, a nie sypiała wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja już nic nie chcę — nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza toczy się nad nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kozioł obrócił się do niej tyłem i podniósł kitę ogona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofujące się niemieckie oddziały prawdopodobnie planowały podpalenie budynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz powiedz, dlaczego jesteś zły? — Bo on cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak gdyby nigdy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jej koleżanki opowiadały mu o jej pretensjach aktorskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo, czy odchodzisz? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"But się rozpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko w jaki sposób? O mało nie wpadli pod taksówkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za człowiek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I podał Maciusiowi papier, wciąż stojąc na baczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbujemy zakrzyczeć prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypominam, że prosiłem, aby Maciusia nie nazywać królem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziedziczka pokiwała znacząco głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem tylko stwierdzić prawdziwość swoich domysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie mogę sobie przypomnieć, czyli mówił gdzie mieszka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała moja istota była nią nasycona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy obcy nie był czasem gołobrody i czy nie miał oczu skośnych, zezowatych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może włóczyć się po ulicach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ją zaciekawi widok zwalonego mostu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem twarz obcą, bez zarostu, o wystających kościach policzkowych i spoglądałem ukośnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem błądzić sam w stosunku do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem nieruchomo wlepić w nią oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23595931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona chce tajemnicę sama wyjaśnić, zanim tandeciarz ją zdradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja zaś widzę, że jesteś lekarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś z uczucia żegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet kierownik, cała szkoła robi się od razu świąteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto jest obecnym prezydentem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie w chwili samego gimnastykowania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogół kobiet, jeśli chodzi o miłość, jest przerażająco niesentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem obiecuję sobie, że go wyrzucę, że go w ogóle nie wpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropna nuda nic nie robić, tylko wciąż chodzić do budy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą można czasem śnić i na jawie — wtrącił niby od niechcenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo źle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał jeszcze chwilkę, ściskając nerwowo pałkę w dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie spaliły się też dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś spoza płóciennej ściany namiotu bardzo silnie trącał mnie w bok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzę dlaczego miałoby to pana dotknąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozczarowany przerwałem badanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego prawa jeszcze nie korzystałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski kazał dojechać swemu powozowi bliżej hrabiny i wrócił do pań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukląkł młodzieniec, nachylił głowę i wieczną miłość zaprzysiągł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarła łzy cisnące się do oczu... Staszek spojrzał na Maryś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa cylindry są przygotowane do natychmiastowego użytku, tak, że nie będziemy zaskoczeni znienacka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów: „Panie Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25523997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że pora włożyć maski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla siebie odciął również spory kawałek, który pożarł na surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory pokpiwa sobie z lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy płonęły mu dziwnym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna żyć, jak ciotka-tancerka, tylko lukiem o wiele wyższym i in nym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiał tę pozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, co to nie chodzą po ulicy, co siedzą w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmego roku życia nie płakałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak myślę — tak wierzę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę zdać sobie sprawy z odległości, z jakiej je oglądam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20805233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę się połapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowne wizje miniaturowych twarzyczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie łatwość kombinacji znanych elementów daje niedoświadczonemu pijakowi to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powstałem z ławki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten starzec jeszcze śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo wyraźnie zezwala na to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną, dziewczyco, nie rób żadnych ceregieli — rzekł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bądź w gorącej wodzie kąpany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykra to była przygoda z pomylonym panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uważa pan, że możliwe jest wprowadzenie tu identycznych przepisów prawnych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po piąte, uzgodniliśmy, że wkrótce odbędą się w bankach wiarygodne testy warunków skrajnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Efekty są zachęcające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż nie stanowi ona integralnego elementu innych obszarów polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś przemył i przewiązał ranę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utrzymuje się jednak niepewność grożąca wyczerpaniem się środków i wstrzymaniem inwestycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętacie, w Krakowie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30639072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi punkt mówi, do pewnego stopnia, o inkorporacji zasady proporcjonalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie zawdzięczam wszystko, bo moja młodość, moje życie jest twoim dziełem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę na zupę szczawiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi dopiero rozmach, co się zowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A do tego to piekielne wprost wykończenie wykonania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zaiste smutny jest ten świat aż do śmierci”…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wyjaśniono sprawę w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę zawiązać listy w ceratę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi, pomiędzy filarami, przechadzało się kilku mnichów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle lubię podróżować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był to jeden z najtęższych w okolicy „szczurów wodnych”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo nas niech diabli biorą, albo kapitalizm!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była druga w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczynają po południu, po pierwszym obfitszym jedzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że dał się nabrać, że wygłupia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Służę panu — odpowiedział grzecznie, strzepując popiół z cygara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy godzinę i spotkamy się w jadalni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut później pożegnaliśmy się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z radosnym i dzikim krzykiem uchodziła w głąb lasu — wolna, wyśmiewna, niedościgła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielki Pisarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więcej nie wiemy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoła była dużo lepiej zbudowana jak jej lekki domek letni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła, jakie to na nim robi wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już strasznie znudzili mi się ci mężczyźni z forsą i szykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto tu był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ostatniego zajścia upłynęły trzy tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być na granicy normalności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę państwa na czarną kawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt chyba nie zaprzeczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedział: — Pogadamy o tym dokładnie wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uchowaj Boże od takiej niedoli! — wtrącił z zadumą jednoręki i westchnął na wszelki przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach tak, teraz rozumiem — to też rodzaj wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zostawił po sobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci, pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pierwsza rozłąka małżonków od czasu ich ślubu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes stanął nad brzegiem bagna i spojrzał na nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ucieszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"powtórzył markier i zamyślił się głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój towarzysz uśmiechnął się zagadkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Będą sami starsi — tłumaczyła mamusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze to lepiej, gdy się ma dokoła siebie odważnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Koguci zaułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nawet zgadłem, bo ktoś zastukał, ale cicho i tylko raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem — odparł bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co otrzymałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On się urodził w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim prosto, przy tym szczerze, no i co najważniejsza — przyjaźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przy sobie ucznia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdybym był dziewczyną, tobym na pewno był kurwą — pomyślał, ale zaraz wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajcie! — rozlegało się coraz wyżej i coraz ciszej w promiennych od słońca przestworach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tańczyli, wprawdzie na palcach, po cichutku, lecz do upadłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziło się to na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyła nas atmosfera hali targowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed snem zaglądał pod łóżko, czy tam ktoś nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeczuwał, jakie huragany zawiera w sobie to wezwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam określonego tytułu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masaż jest relaksujący i zarazem leczniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — teraz kontakt częściowo osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadł, pił, spał i pracował od świtu do nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominał pilota, który dla marynarza jest wcieleniem tego, co zasługuje na najwyższe zaufanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przykra misja — objaśnił po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, nie bardzo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem podobny do mokrej szmaty, do psów po deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do własnej torby ją złowię, jak niegdyś zająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napięcie w filmie tworzy się na wielu płaszczyznach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłeś, że bez bójki się usuniesz! — krzyknął jednoręki, grożąc spuchniętą lewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On załatwił na mnie szybko swoje sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to proroctwo się sprawdziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tamten jakby naumyślnie wystawiał się na wciąż nowe ciosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę sobie w świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zaległo milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróć się zaraz, to sama sprawdzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym właśnie sęk! — zawołał Podlasiak, wstydliwie obmacując wybitną pozostałość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzbrojony w krótki i ciężki kij czekałem na zdobycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja tu obliczyłem najmniejszy spadek tonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już prawie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ktoś zapalił świecę — pomyślała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem jej zaraz o tobie, ale wybuchnęła tylko śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolni na razie jesteście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie pozwoliłby tu sobie na najmniejszą choćby nieuczciwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że z sufitu pada słaby, zaledwie dostrzegalny promień światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25366616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suknię swej lubej Zosi zarzucił na głowę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z prawej, z prawej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęła gdzieś ze, spowitej w sinawe mgły, dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artysta nie stara się niczego udowadniać. Każda rzecz prawdziwa może być dowiedziona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro ustawa tak rzecze, to niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co mi to za ród!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy panowie znają tego pana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślenie jest moją rzeczą, zrozumiano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starskiego już tam nie było, panna Izabela siedziała sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24745325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Proszę, niech pan opowiada dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz za interes?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba poszli grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — powiedział prędko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten uśmiechnął się blado i zmarszczył czoło, jakby coś sobie przypominając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ci już przyniósł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowierzam cudzoziemcom, zarówno żywym jak i umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi ulicami, zaułkami i placami sunęły barwne tłumy ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To naruszałoby przecież logikę i ekonomię natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem sobie nową konsolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to idźże jeszcze raz i dobrze poszukaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, zgniecie mu żebra, zdruzgoce klatkę piersiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadspodziewanie okazuje się, że tkwi w Kościele sama geneza państwowości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwieniem zauważyła, że w jej domu mieszka dwóch starszych chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na początku jest zdanie: wszystko jest możliwe i wszystko jest prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W perspektywie wyłonił się biały kontur cmentarnego muru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprawdę, za rok jeden takiego szczęścia warto było oddać resztę życia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja zaczęła być zajmującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiłował nie wziąć tego na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc byłam u niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Udzielam głosu młodemu królowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze reakcje są oczywiste i nie wynikają tylko z tego, że boimy się zmian.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca, spokój, zadowolenie wewnętrzne, wesołość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy zbudować drewniany barak dla Maciusia i straży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd się tu wzięły skały pierwotne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzała poprzez podwórze ku piekarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle głupstwo ich zajmie, ale tylko na krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chodzenie po ostrzu brzytwy, fantastycznie wąska via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech tylko jeden drugiemu wręcza ją ostrożnie, żeby nie uciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy te sposoby rozumowania odróżnić od dedukcji naukowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała najwyżej na lat dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to kocham cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciąża byłaby dla Stelli prawdziwą katastrofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet własne wojsko ciebie nie lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąski sierp ubywającego księżyca siał słabe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowy i żłobkowaty korzeń zabarwił się w słońcu soczystym połyskiem eterycznie wonnej błony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz Podlasiaka rozjaśniła się nagłym pomysłem i poszerzyła z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przylgnął do niego zły oddech dwóch tysiącleci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim był Wierusz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczyciel nigdy nie powie, czy lubi, ale się to czuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ale nie mogłem znaleźć informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie przez ciekawość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczegółów nie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja sama wyszłam i udałam się do domu swego mistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę w kącie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to jak starzy przyjaciele, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki spoważniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast my jesteśmy inteligentnymi czytelnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanadto może szkoła pędzi, jakby kto poganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty wobec rozwagi zawsze byłeś w opozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko się odczepili, bo bardzo byli zajęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowita prawda została mu przezna czona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tłumaczyłam ci już sto razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona się denerwuje widać, w sposób specyficzny, i zamknęła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona napisała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ziemi poniewierały się resztki potłuczonych naczyń, kawałki żelaza i szkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież jest w naszych rękach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między sobą nigdy się nie kłócili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zgadzasz się się na nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas Mistrz przystanął, skrzywił usta i pokręcił głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Są najrozmaitsze Jonasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dążył więc do nich, na nic nie zważając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Masz ci los!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor spojrzał zdziwiony i trochę zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka chwil siedzieliśmy w milczeniu, ze zdumieniem przypatrując się oryginalnemu napisowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gorzej jednak zrobiło mu się po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się odwróciłem, ujrzałem przed sobą wspomnianego już małego księdza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Androidzie pójdzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez ciebie szumi mi w uszach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałem w mej kryjówce, co się stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieliśmy rozmaite ostrzeżenia, że na nie może być zrobiony zamach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komputery to dla mnie czarna magia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znaczy to wcale, żeby Cezarek był złym synem, a jego matka niedołężną ciapą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił, że ma lat siedemnaście - nie, chwila, osiemnaście - i że jest sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z przed dwóch miesięcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znalazłem nareszcie punkt zaczepienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłował się wszakże niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonowałem do niego pierwszy raz od wyjazdu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę państwa na czarną kawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżcie się teraz trochę do mnie! — rozkazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wtedy pociąg, zwolniwszy biegu, wjechał w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko musiałem starać się o własne utrzymanie, ale również zadbać o matkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz miał wolną drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak to możliwe! — wyszeptał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział do mnie z zamkniętymi oczami «Przynieś swój pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34970315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie, ponieważ te normy chronią pracowników przed dyskryminacją i dumpingiem społecznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34970316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są ku temu zasoby energetyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34970317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak właśnie jest w przypadku umowy o wolnym handlu, która jest negocjowana z Kanadą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34970318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zainteresowaniem wysłuchałem pana przemówienia wprowadzającego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34970319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgłoszone wnioski dotyczące opodatkowania transakcji rynku finansowego zostały odrzucone przez odpowiedzialnego komisarza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogłosiły także, że wkrótce ma nastąpić ukamienowanie innego mężczyzny w prowincji Gilan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zwrócić uwagę w szczególności na trzy elementy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwa komisja prowadzi rozmowy w ten sam sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwa Żywności i ministerstwa zdrowia państw członkowskich muszą współpracować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment ten uwiecznił rzeźbiarz w marmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała dużo koleżanek, nie miała przyjaciółek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżbym zostawił tam, w tej diabelskiej lepiance?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie doszedł mnie złowrogi trzask przepalonych belek pułapu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed moim domem zawsze było wiele gołębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekceważy ona jak najbardziej jawne skargi organizacji sportowych z obszaru całej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem, proszę Państwa, w moim kraju jest takie mądre powiedzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca dzieci jest często związana z wykorzystywaniem i ubóstwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwóch rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi innymi sprawami, a w szczególności opłatą wizową, zajmę się w moich uwagach końcowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardzo ważna rzecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponad połowę z wszystkich tych przypadków stanowią przypadki choroby Alzheimera\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, Unia na rzecz Regionu Morza Śródziemnego stanowi element ram polityki sąsiedztwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27266150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ratyfikacja parlamentarna jest nie mniej demokratyczna, niż referenda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uporać z tą sprawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani wśród Radziwiłłów książąt przepotężnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miło nam dodać, że obecnie cieszy się dobrem zdrowiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zjawiska tego rozchodził się mdły zapach drzewa sandałowego i wilgotnego łupku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Westchnął Maciuś: strasznie dużo ma do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Józia tu jest? Przecież Józia ma dziś wychodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela była rozdrażniona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chciałem wywiązać się z zadania i przybyłem do węglowych dolin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25323268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem już kiedyś podobne zarzuty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22031365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22031371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22031377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22031388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22065525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22065527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22065528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22065530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22065532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21354972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pan zaczekać przy piecu w frontowym pokoju, dopóki ojciec nie przyjdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21354973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęły dwa miesiące i sprawa powoli zatarła się w samej pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21354974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co uczyniwszy uczuł ulgę i ze swobodniejszym umysłem wracał do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21354975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisał się jako przybywający z Londynu, ale adresu nie podał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21354976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu Holmes powąchał usta zmarłego i obejrzał podeszwy jego butów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21355032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewodniczący jednego związku jest zawsze przewodniczącym drugiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21355034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie była to jakaś poważna robota, która wymagała większej liczby uczestników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21355035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym był równie obliczalnym jak chronometr, dreszczu tego nie byłoby jednak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21355036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ponura twarz jego świadczyła, że słowa przeciwnika nie odniosły skutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próżno chłopak namawiał i za uzdę ciągnął, i wózek popychał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosła potem drugą i trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jest rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachował dużo cech dziecinnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałaś moich skarpetek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że będą się spotykać, ale nie tak, jak do tychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i wierzę ci na słowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ja jestem tym wszystkim” — można było o niej powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to są wszystko dzieciństwa, najdroższa — uspokajałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymi ojcami byli: wielki pisarz, filozof Joachim i cielesny ojciec Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może weź parę dni urlopu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip nie miał nawet czasu zamachnąć się pałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, to niczego nie dowodzi — odrzekł Tom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogół kobiet, jeśli chodzi o miłość, jest przerażająco niesentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mój chłopcze, mama obiecała mi dzisiaj, że pojadę sama na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chodzili uśmiechnięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara boska, kara boska…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieczenie gorącej oliwy, ale nie bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął się mord i rabunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma głowę zanurzoną we krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest gryzoniem, ale gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okej, jaka jest pogoda dzisiaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał się kurczowo świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wszystkich ziemskich uczuć pozostało mu jeszcze jedno tylko: miłość do dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym wystosowałem do pana długie osobiste pismo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego te trzy kraje musiały prosić o pomoc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie rzecz biorąc jest to znaczny postęp, jeśli chodzi o ochronę konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co wcześniej wydawało się niemożliwe, teraz jest faktem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieczęsto się to zdarza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wtedy byłem jeńcem wojennym i chciałem uciec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym złożyć wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30370921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrożenie tych środków stanowi ogromne zagrożenie dla zatrudniania kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przykro, że ludzie przeze mnie cierpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się teraz Filip cieszył, że puścił się tymi śladami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za śmieszna dziewczynka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robili i dlaczego natychmiast nie wezwali służby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto są talerze — objaśniła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale popatrz pan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba sobie to wyobrazić — odpowiedziała Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W powrotnej drodze wstąpiłem tutaj, by się dowiedzieć, co słychać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż stanie się z dziewczyną, jeśli ja ją teraz opuszczę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za tę łaskę, że dałam ci dom i opiekę rodzinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — jęczał przewodnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po deszczu na ulice i chodniki wychodzą ślimaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz chcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekoladowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież sama uparłaś się, że z nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem okrążyć całą wyspę, ale za daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to jej i zrozumiała mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam dobry przepis na pomidorową, zaraz ci pokażę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem i spostrzegłem wysokiego, brodatego mężczyznę w niebieskim, podobnym do uniformu kubraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy syknął jak szatan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miło nam dodać, że obecnie cieszy się dobrem zdrowiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było nigdy moim zwyczajem przytwierdzać takim pochwałom, choć byłoby głupiem zaprzeczać im.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo dobrze był zasadzony i podzielony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wymyślą jeszcze coś lepszego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zaroślach rozległ się trzask gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była naprawdę wielce zakłopotana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tu mało zieleni! — rzekłem tonem skargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mogłem dopuścić do czegoś podobnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zabijają go na wiele sprytnych sposobów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ona uszła jeszcze kilka kroków, z uśmiechem zawróciła i znalazła go, bez szukania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarakiem go, widać, przegryzała… — domyślił się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszukam sobie innego gniazda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej było to wielkie i piękne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do stołu i — nie patrząc na pole operacyjne — ujął delikatnie jelita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy całej klasie, zamiast kaligrafii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wy kończony, dopasowany i martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22237551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie premierze, raz jeszcze bardzo dziękuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpraca i kolaboracja naukowa daje szansę przezwyciężenia tych ogromnych różnic w zakresie rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawy dotyczące środowiska i klimatu dotyczą nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek ten niesie ze sobą również zagrożenia w sensie chorób zakaźnych i infekcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebna nam wizja i zaangażowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po trzecie, przyczyny masowego napływu imigrantów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej będzie za późno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z żalem przyjmuję odejście od symboli Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37524082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozporządzenie musi ponadto obejmować pozarolnicze zastosowania środków ochrony roślin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to znaczyło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również nie było wody do mycia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwuch więźniów już się kilkakrotnie zmieniło, ale ja nie zwracałem na to uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeznaczona aby być rozkoszą dla wszystkich, napotkała człowieka, dla którego szczęściem się stała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla wszystkich dusz silnych lub organizacyj szczęśliwych, zastanowienie jest potężnym posiłkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałby tak niezawodnie do rana, gdyż rozpoczął już czwarty oddział swoich marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Com przeżył wczoraj, o tem dziś zapomniałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23727284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciw jego piekielnej chytrości nic nie był w stanie uczynić Aron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem znów będzie zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałoby mi się gadać o ich życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To francuska kapela — oznajmił trochę drwiąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmianę ekspozycji mamy w czerwcu, więc na pół roku można obejrzeć dwie wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż bardzo lubiła leżeć w łóżku, wstawała od razu i buch do łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszłość jest przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się i wyciągnąłem rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dać mu za żonę najpiękniejszą pannę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwariowałaś”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po jej odejściu uczułam nieokreślony lęk, którego nie mogę opanować dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w ogóle nie wiem, co on robi, jak żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakaś lekcja odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwieram z łomotem tylne drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbujemy zakrzyczeć prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziny naszej siostry świętowaliśmy całą rodziną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Eureka” — ryczał i tańczył biedaczek z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc baron miał poniekąd rację, przychodząc do ciebie ze słowem przebaczenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski opuścił rajtszulę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na to i odsunąłem liście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przerwałem jej nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciw jego piekielnej chytrości nic nie był w stanie uczynić Aron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć lub sześć dni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi prawie zamarło w piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głęboko wzruszony omal nie wypuściłem listu z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Felek się nie uspokoił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25029457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej pory zupełnie zmienił tryb życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzi mi o partie górne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się jeszcze ogolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak stało się i nic na świecie faktu nie odmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupa, do której należę, ma w tym względzie pewne doświadczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"prezydencja będzie sama, z bardzo niewielkim poparciem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotem tej debaty powinno być inne państwo członkowskie, mianowicie Rumunią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ubiegłych latach państwa członkowskie zbyt często dystansowały się od paktu stabilności i wzrostu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesienne zasiewy, ze względu na nieustający deszcz utrudniający dostęp do pól, były niemożliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to kwestia nie tyle polityki, ile fundamentalnej moralności, etyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dzisiejszych czasach Internet stał się podstawą wszystkich naszych stosunków osobistych i administracyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jedynie obiektywne i bezstronne wdrożenie nowych ustaw będzie gwarancją powodzenia reform konstytucyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38333244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To Irlandczycy mają zadecydować, czy chcą ratyfikować traktat czy nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała otwory w tej walizce, żeby się nie udusiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka takich pisemnych relacji udało się już zebrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jerzy, przytrzymaj chwilę prawe ramię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dotrzymam jej wiernie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowak nie robił nam żadnych wymówek po powrocie z cyrku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz — tłumaczył, zatrzymując się przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie udawał, że ma coś załatwić w gabinecie dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego duma nie pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad jej oczami zwisały pojedyncze kłosy trawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba przyznać, że raz na zawsze nauczył się dużo i dużym kosztem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pamiątki szanują nie tylko królowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upijała się tą swoją „wyższą” muzyką niczym pijak gorzałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś aportował jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają po kilkaset metrów długości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju Janka kasztan wsadzał głowę przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to zgoda…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież, u licha, mam prawo zajmować się kościołem świętego Barnaby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to jak starzy przyjaciele, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekoladowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeszcze szarpną, pchną, uderzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż i to zawodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy sam na sam — rzekł Podlasiak, do głębi wzruszony swym obecnym stanowiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Ewa była zazdrosna, że nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa wyjdzie ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zgodnym krokiem ruszyli w jednaką zawsze drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żywy, wesoły uśmiech przebiegł dokoła jak promień słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę pochodzić po pałacu, po parku, po mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy po pół godzinie srogich męczarni, przybył do tej bramy, znalazł ją zamkniętą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie to wszystko co my między sobą gadamy, jest to przecież takie głupstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proch znajduje się w pokoju przeoryszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Westchnął Maciuś: strasznie dużo ma do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz postanowiłeś tylko myśleć i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem też bynajmniej zdziwiony, gdyż tego właśnie oczekiwałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem nie do rozwiązania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Połączenie dokonane — rzekł opuszczając rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omiń korek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno takich rzeczy pamiętać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do włączenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem ile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkali się na korytarzu, Krystyna uśmiechnęła się, przedstawiła go narzeczonemu i powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś otworzył drzwi na platformę i szarpnął sygnał alarmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Malinowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza saniami biegło trzydziestu ludzi otulonych w filtra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba będzie samej wyjechać na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął kaganek ze stołu i oświetlił twarz Konrada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu się działo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjaśnię ci kiedyś później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ci już przyniósł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz, pokażę ci teraz króliki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już nie posiada ani grosza własnego majątku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To proszę cię, powiedz mi, że się przeprosiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20766245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż musi opustoszeć, a wówczas nikt nam nie będzie przeszkadzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20766246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o białego ogiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20766247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyjmij ode mnie sześć pensów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20766248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odkąd ich w ogóle zauważyła, zaczęła popiół i śmiecie zrzucać im na głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20766249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie lubił przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona czekała na to, aż się pożegna, i on wiedział o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20769029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nic sobie wtedy z niego nie robiłam, ale byłam zadowolona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy rozpoczyna się życie z kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna wstała, żeby dorobić herbaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To przecież śmieszne, żebyśmy się słuchali tego ordynarnego dzikusa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zuchwała wariatka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć nudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona jest tu zawsze, w dokładnie określonym miejscu, w dołku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma bezpiecznego rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę te pomniki przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zrobili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jak najszybciej zacząć nakładać sankcje gospodarcze na administrację irańską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Internet wszedł obecnie w nowy etap\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie głosy tam usłyszymy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednakże odnieść się do tematu Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plan naprawy wynika z dobrych intencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28041596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obowiązek ten dotyczy przede wszystkim naprawy gospodarczej i wzrostu zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem ile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faunie, mów, czego się żalisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę uratować tę odrobinę ziarna, jaka jeszcze pozostała pomiędzy kamieniami młyńskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz uciekajmy, dopóki zajęte zbieraniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można by udowodnić jego winę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, teraz mu wbiję igłę do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja zaś widzę, że jesteś lekarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen spełzał powoli z jej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i poczuł Maciuś pierwsze uderzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ty robisz, licho zatracone?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nigdy nie wiadomo, co jest potrzebne, a co zbyteczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo przygotowania do podpalenia gmach nie został zniszczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie jednak musiałem czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już nie posiada ani grosza własnego majątku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być woda z kranu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co znaczą argumenty wobec „nie sprawiło mi przyjemności”? Poczuł, że jest całkiem bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Erupcja wulkanu wywołała bardzo duże zniszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— tak Go zaklinał i prosił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to kocham cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest kurze jajko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie trudno ocenić koszty fiskalne powiązane z aktualnymi zawirowaniami finansowymi i odpowiednimi dostosowaniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustęp ósmy naszej rezolucji mówi wyraźnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to inny powód, dla którego nie mogą one zostać zamknięte\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię tu o szpitalach, z których każdy kosztuje dziesięć milionów dolarów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy również, aby Komisja skupiła się na uporządkowaniu rynku, co wyraźnie się nie udaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż przedstawiamy dzisiaj wnioski w oparciu o dwa zamknięte lata budżetowe z siedmioletniej perspektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólne stanowisko bierze także pod uwagę liczne poprawki zgłoszone w Parlamencie podczas pierwszego czytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jednak nie wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, by trzymać się w przyszłości tej procedury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37006660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiemy, jak będzie wyglądał poziom współfinansowania w ujęciu procentowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepiej, nie najlepiej! — odrzekł ze szczerym smutkiem w głosie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz spróbuję je sparaliżować choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko że ja znacznie ciężej od was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna dziura, ciemna materia, dylatacja czasu, zakrzywienie czasoprzestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słucha mnie ślepo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie był prawdziwy komunizm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do tego czarnego sługi miały dzieci szczerą sympatię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na poddaszu jednak było nad wyraz smutno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła więc przez chodnik i stanęła na stopniu wiodącym do sklepu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały niepokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złościło ją zwłaszcza to, że słyszy je od własnego męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I, przymrużywszy oczy, jął czytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze nas nie uczyli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście istnieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę z J.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zaświtał przed nami wylot sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gniewa się pan? — uśmiechnął się kapitan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecie dziw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oglądam telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta rozejrzała się nerwowo i zmrużyła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schował rewolwer do kieszeni i chwycił pałkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W któryś piękny, sierpniowy wieczór wracali znowu razem do Czerska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelano jak na manewrach, z zimną krwią i celnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz — ty sam zginiesz, a ja razem z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30800631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to przyczyną dodatkowych kosztów i zmniejszenia konkurencyjności Europy pod względem produkcji żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30800632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego jakiekolwiek zmiany w tej materii byłyby przedwczesne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30800639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w Unii Europejskiej istnieje system administracyjny, który mógłby wprowadzić tego typu podatek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30800644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ktoś z posłów chciałby sprzeciwić się tej prośbie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30800649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie wszystkie z nich mają znaczenie i zasługują na rozważenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30859635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogom nie pytał, gdziem nie był!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30859636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z oceną zielonej księgi i z analizą koncepcji spójności terytorialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30859637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowoczesna polityka surowcowa powinna mieć partnerski charakter\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30859639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązanie, o którym myślę, nie polega na konfrontacji różnych tożsamości, lecz na ich współdziałaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30859642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obu przypadkach konieczne jest jednakowe traktowanie wszystkich języków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nagromadzaj przeszkód! — ostrzegł ją zawczasu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto, witam cię łaskawie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkali się na korytarzu, Krystyna uśmiechnęła się, przedstawiła go narzeczonemu i powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ufaj też pięknej jasnowłosej osobie, która chwilowo zdołała cię opętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co z nich będzie? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bóg łaskaw — sypiam jak suseł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz niech sobie szukają wiatru w polu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdarza mi się ich nosić pod prysznicem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie chadzają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie nadeszła godzina wyruszenia w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, jakby mię ktoś pałką uderzył w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzeli na mnie zdziwieni, gdy się do nich zbliżałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepyszny, nieporównany widok dodał otuchy trojgu zbiegom i nową energią zasilił ich dusze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem jego znaku i odwróciwszy się, spojrzałem na obóz pod nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Łęcki kilka razy porachował stos nowych sturublówek i podpisał dokument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25113807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem na ścieżkę ogrodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi to patetycznie, brzmi to może trochę na wyrost, ale tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki przybiegł pośpiesznie, jakby się bał karygodnego w danym razie opóźnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie sądziłem że tak mi się to spodoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym z tobą trochę pogawędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie zauważyłeś tego, papo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy?” „W niedzielę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed moim domem zawsze było wiele gołębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepło, nie za gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli ulicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to był Krzyżak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki sobie zwyczajny kupiec!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostrzegamy, że właśnie tak jest, na podstawie tych propozycji dotyczących praw konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu, jak już się przekonaliśmy, krytyczne podejście tej komisji zapewnia nam postęp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak kiedy tam dotrzemy, może sie okazać, że powinniśmy zastanowić się dwa razy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej kwestii potrzebujemy również pańskiego aktywnego zaangażowania, panie komisarzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby debata miała solidne podstawy, państwa członkowskie powinny wprowadzić księgowość międzypokoleniową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Politycy i publicyści często ponoszą koszty krytykowania islamu w postaci gróźb ze strony fundamentalistów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej pory mamy sądny dzień w sklepie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38506573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy odpowiedź ze strony Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łażę wzdłuż bulwarów, ale nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to przy innej ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zabrzmieć żałośnie, ale to mnie uspokaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja się wobec niej czuję skrępowany i nieśmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizm żadną miarą nie da się pogodzić z personalizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożymy ognisko za namiotem, tego wilki się boją! — uspokoili mnie Mongołowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Powiesz mi podczas śniadania, czy mamusia ci pozwoliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tropiła go jak pies, chodziła za nim jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzenie firmy to nie bułka z masłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Palą tu zawsze lampę bez potrzeby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą można czasem śnić i na jawie — wtrącił niby od niechcenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam się potem dziwisz i wstydzisz, i żałujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23888290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podkreślić, że na całym świecie jest wielu laureatów i że popieramy ich wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to bardzo trudne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu osobom w Europie spodobał się ten zwrot i duch zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymano też ośmiu aktywistów z Komitetu na rzecz reporterów zajmujących się prawami człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele ciągłe pytają, co Unia Europejska dla nich robi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swobód Obywatelskich, Sprawiedliwości i Spraw Wewnętrznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną z podstawowych zasad jest swoboda przemieszczania się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duch współpracy pozwolił nam jednak znaleźć bardzo rozsądne rozwiązania w tych kwestiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem jednak w stanie wskazać w propozycji żadnych konkretnych rozwiązań w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28246458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam też za cenną inicjatywę dyskutowania o sprawach jednolitego rynku podczas corocznego forum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łóżko — sen, śmierć, miłość, narodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrazy leżą we mnie zastygłe, wyschnięte jak rośliny w zielniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce mi się z nikim wychodzić ani tańczyć, ani spacerować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okresy, kiedy się leży na samym dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pierwszy ten lepszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artysta nie stara się niczego udowadniać. Każda rzecz prawdziwa może być dowiedziona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, że mu tak lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekkie uczucie zgrozy zakradło się we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z oczekiwania zaledwie czuję grunt pod sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że tandeciarz musiał wskazać na mnie, to było oczywiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczem wolnym krokiem weszła do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on ma generałów, pułkowników, i w wojsku jest porządek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skóra wyschnięta była starannie, naciągnięta na kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wbrew rozsądkowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25278420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłano mnie, abym się dowiedział, co się z panem stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tego nie mogą powiedzieć niektóre tzw. „filary”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej towarzysze za jej przykładem zerwali po tataraku i gryząc wilgotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popołudniowe cienie z wolna gromadziły się pomiędzy drzewami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko nie bujasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania te spełniają wiele oczekiwań wyrażonych w sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ale nie tak prędko ustaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przetrwały zasady działania funduszy inwestycyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce pan trzymać się strategii lizbońskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określone w niej zostały niektóre szczegóły, ale decydującym czynnikiem będzie jej duch\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cóżeś ty zrobiła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jeżeli będziemy wszystko przyjmować w pierwszym czytaniu, to Parlament pozbawi się swoich praw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja myślę, że on naprawdę miał telegram od Suzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę powiedzieć, że niektórzy ludzie prowadzą pozornie skomplikowane życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40083940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niesprawiedliwość dopóty będzie władać światem, dopóki nowy Napoleon nie urośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, jakże się jasnemu panu wędrowało w powietrzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jutrzejszym kolokwium będzie pięć pytań otwartych i test wielokrotnego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A buteleczka od razu bęc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I wcale przez drzwi nie wchodziłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiesił jej płaszcz w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadarła ogonek i poleciała na płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przyznaj się — nastawał wodząc ustami po jej cudnej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba udajesz, moja kochana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kim lubisz być, zbójem czy policjantem? — Lubię być policjantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wy daje się, że już nigdy nie można się będzie stamtąd wydobyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę tego obłudnego frazesu, tego żargonu impotencji…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto mi zabroni wejść? — odparł chłopak stanowczym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile lat kończysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na morzu zaskoczyła ich taka sobie burza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne znaczenie ma szkolenie personelu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję, że poświęciliście się temu tematowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja siebie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego uważamy, że propozycja przyjęta przez Komisję Zatrudnienia i Spraw Socjalnych jest wyważona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podzielam wiele z obaw, jakie zostały wyrażone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbyliśmy rozmowy trójstronne z ekspertami z Europejskiego Banku Centralnego i Komisji Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza partia nigdy nie była przeciwna europejskiemu mechanizmowi wsparcia dla Grecji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Negocjacje prowadzą do podjęcia decyzji, którą są możliwe do zaakceptowania przez wszystkie zainteresowane strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak zazwyczaj Komisja zupełnie nie radzi sobie z egzekwowaniem obowiązującej już legislacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39564292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowicie popieram też postulaty autorki dotyczące zwiększenia bezpieczeństwa pracowników w tej branży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu dzieci z domu wybiegły do ogródka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi wyjść na jaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Kuba Bogu, tak Bóg Kubie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął pod drzewem, przed oczami miał oświet lony prostokąt: brama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tkniesz dziewczycy, bo nie z twego chlewu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo kaptur i czepiec to prawie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj odprawę i zbądź kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszał się, gdy weszła matka, pokojówka Janka i stróż Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno takich rzeczy pamiętać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powstałem z ławki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzili do jednego gimnazjum, do różnych oddziałów tej samej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył się w kolano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z drugiej strony… hm… co się tyczy twojego odejścia stąd…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziłam dwójkę dzieci, ale wraz z mężem chcielibyśmy mieć trójkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I podał Maciusiowi papier, wciąż stojąc na baczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była przyzwyczajona do ukrywania się nawet wtedy, gdy była sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja będę musiał powiedzieć: „Mama umarła”, chyba tak? Co? Ona milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że się dasz złapać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzież nie jest łatwym jury, a ocenia każdy krok i każdy ruch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co Stasiu? — dobrze? — że zgodził się na wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jeszcze miałem do zrobienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła się i stężała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie większy bałagan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czynił to z ciężkim sercem, myśląc o tym, co będzie później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pan kłamiesz, to pożegnaj się z życiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz spojrzał na nich z zadowoleniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jego oddech i ten mi zdradził, gdzie się znajdowała moja zwierzyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słucham cię z całą, uwagą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25425508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pozostaje mi tylko umrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jest to dość niekonwencjonalne, żeby zabierać głos po wypowiedzi pani komisarz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzi na te wszystkie pytania znalazły się obecnie w projekcie dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustne wyjaśnienia głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywamy do przyjęcia środków, które na szczęście zostały już przyjęte jakiś czas temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawy te mają też poważny wydźwięk w świetle projektu traktatu reformującemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już po raz drugi mnie pominięto, chociaż wielokrotnie prosiłem o możliwość zabrania głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodam, że dyrektywa pozostawia państwom członkowskim znaczną swobodę wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też czekam aż te postępowania zostaną zakończone, zanim ogłoszę nazwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne zna pan naszą przeszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28957741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też nie ma potrzeby, aby bezskutecznie czekali na możliwość zabrania głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem, by się obejrzeć za siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął oczy ze wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że niedawno do nas dołączył, ale wydaje mi się, że naprawdę ma potencjał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatkała mu usta ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby — sfora psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istne cacko! — unosił się w dalszym ciągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd poszły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przychodzi do mnie jak do kurwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy ciebie nie cierpią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż dystans do Warszawy będzie rósł…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskiej i niby na jeża ostrzyżonej murawie przyleśnej stał dąb ustronny i rozłożysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22382289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A drugie trochę starsze, ale też małe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A do tego to piekielne wprost wykończenie wykonania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samoloty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten nabożny wysiłek potwierdził w bacznych oczach kulawca wartość zdobyczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm — mruknął staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie pójdzie do niej żebrać o miłość po tamtym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyższe narkotyki dają wściekłe reakcje — zaraz widać ich szkodliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę nawet dużo pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak, ciepłotą poranka zagrzany, przeciągnął się i ziewnął w samo słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem mimowolny dreszcz grozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz istota przejawu pozostaje ta sama: zła, występna i tajemnicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej to też zatyka od dech, że nie można żyć wielu żywotami naraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę patologiczne, że siedzimy tu razem i udajemy, że to normalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy także stworzyć lepszą relację między sportem w szkole a sportem w czasie wolnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazują one ustawodawcom potencjalne konsekwencje ich wyborów politycznych i pomagają im podejmować decyzje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpracy pomiędzy Organami Regulacji Energetyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócimy do tej sprawy we właściwym czasie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden wyraz, nie żądam jak tylko jednego wyrazu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowym rezultatem tych wysiłków jest jednolita wspólna organizacja rynku obejmująca wszystkie sektory rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim przekonaniu istnieje tylko jedna grupa rasowa - rasa ludzka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37328999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale niestety tegoroczny projekt budżetu pozostawia pod tym względem wiele do życzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37329000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braki występują przede wszystkim w trzech obszarach i chciałabym je wyjaśnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37329001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam oficjalna politykę Chin w sprawie Tybetu za ludobójstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wszystkich coś szwankuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpuszczono mnie do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, puść już, puść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy myśleli, że jestem szalony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie mnie będą jeszcze prześladować, ale mój naczelnik mnie obroni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę więc w kącie na łóżku, jak osaczony kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zależą? Tyle możliwych żywotów, tyle różnorodnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kłótnie, przypominające sceny małżeńskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stara historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi się pomieszało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak i nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie wstał i nie spojrzawszy na mnie więcej, wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostry szum maszyny do strzyżenia trawników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże drogi, jak to czas płynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagali się od niego, by im wyjaśnił, co mają czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednak przedstawić szczegółowe zastrzeżenie dotyczące metody oceniania umowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj też zaproponowaliśmy już kraje pilotażowe z udziałem największej liczby państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam też nadzieję, że nie mają oni na myśli określonego segmentu elektoratu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją już platformy współpracy z krajami basenu Morza Czarnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzymy w to rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi obywatele będą mogli sprawdzić, na jakie cele wydatkujemy unijne pieniądze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym również podziękować tym, którzy wzięli udział w tej debacie, za przedstawienie swoich opinii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby uzyskać premię, samochody muszą być sprzedawane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że nigdy do tego nie dojdzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32139956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że wykonała doskonałą robotę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musimy sobie zadać kilka pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli międzynarodowa firma chce uruchomić działalność na terenie Węgier, obecnie sposób postępowania jest następujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będzie jednak powszechnego głosowania z udziałem wszystkich obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałabym, że w szczególności należy się dokładniej zająć płacami i innymi kosztami administracyjnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu musimy o tym mówić - nie tylko historycy, ale także politycy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co konkretnie będzie zawierał pakiet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład w moim kraju, w Czechach, przeludnienie więzień jest poważnym problemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To banki i instytucje podatkowe będą płaciły nowe podatki europejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie w pełni odzwierciedla szczególne zainteresowania Parlamentu dotyczące kwestii polityki rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27427545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Układy o stowarzyszeniu opierają się na poszanowaniu praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz pospieszył do sieni i niecierpliwie otwarł drzwi wiodące na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna z nich jest znacznie krótsza od drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak nie, to on jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju, gdzie nie było Ewy, duch unosił się nad wodami i niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy ona jest tu może u pana, w tym domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem, by się obejrzeć za siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chce mi się pisiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiły się nam humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poleciał wiatr w górę gonić obłoki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty robisz zresztą to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Psia morda” się nazywają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrzebuję twojej stalówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że ma być śliczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale lwy najwidoczniej nie dostrzegły go wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubiłaś jej, bo była dla ciebie zbyt inteligentna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tuląc się do męża cichutko zasnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określenia takiego korespondencja urzędowa nie uznaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamierzał jednak tylko, zanim przekreślono jego plan, przesłać mi w tej kopercie klucz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie spoczniemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21079907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A bębny powyrzucaj na środek bomy, ażeby wszyscy Wahimowie zobaczyli i zrozumieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyszczące ucho od filiżanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się to pisze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem sobie nową konsolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwała się z miejsca i nachyliła nad Cezarym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nim stał długi, długi szereg mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z rowów przydrożnych podniosły się stłumione brzęki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mieliśmy czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś spoza płóciennej ściany namiotu bardzo silnie trącał mnie w bok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ciekawością bezosobową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie cierpię czarnych rzeczy — zawołała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarak wkrótce zjedzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z prawdziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bieganina, szepty, słowo: „uciekł, uciekł”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero przekonał się, że początkowo szli oboje w złym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, moja droga, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powiedziałem coś zabawnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest dużo materiału do omówienia w debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim rozumieniu przewodniczący może uznać za nieważne wszystkie wnioski dotyczące głosowania imiennymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to Rada nie chce współpracować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie żaden dowcip!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Imigracja wymaga europejskiej odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby zaistniało społeczeństwo demokratyczne, konieczne jest wspieranie i obrona praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dzień dzisiejszy przypomina to raczej miraż niż realistyczny plan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie dzisiejsze propozycje Komisji atakują albo system płac, albo system emerytalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy stosowaniu środków realizacji polityki należy natomiast uwzględnić szczególne potrzeby każdego z państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27999478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dziś skorzystać z okazji i przyjąć prawdziwą reformę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie, bez sądu nawet ludzie nie oddają zbrodniarza katom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli i tacy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamią oboje, gdyż się tak umówili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanosi się na coś niedobrego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cewka, rezystor, opornik, tranzystor, kondensator w układach elektronicznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie koniec na tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes machnął ręką, nie odpowiadając na pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmietniki, dużo kotów, przemknął szczur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżniczka siedziała na białej skale i przyglądała się im…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„A Ewa by to zrobiła z przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wychodzi na złe albo na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robię po prostu bilans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nas ocali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma mowy o zjadaniu we właściwym znaczeniu! — odparł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechże matka ma rozum!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — potwierdził z głęboką zadumą jednoręki, pilnie i nabożnie zajęty niespodzianą wyżerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi z kolei kulawiec zauważył wszystko, co się stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cichutko podkradł się do dziewczynki i rzucił jej pierścionek na sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłem napisać coś więcej, skoro nic więcej nie wiedziałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczynają po południu, po pierwszym obfitszym jedzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za martwą ciszą równika….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna, dwie — powtarza Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co, mój drogi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając jak zwykle Polacy, nadzwyczająną zdolność do języków poznał wiele narzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaczekaj no pan troszkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym skończyło się zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21151978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w drodze do leśniczówki cichutko się przemknąłeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21152080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O! a jak się rozciągnął i jak się rozwija\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21152082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kodeks jego uznaje tylko jedną karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21152084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zupełnie słusznie, Jakubie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21152085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może Nieznany jest ich wrogiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21152086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustępstwa, negocjacje i pertraktacje w celu osiągnięcia konsensusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29139217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemoc wobec kobiet przybiera różne formy i ma miejsce wszędzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29139218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, może być źródłem niepokoju i konfliktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29139219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto, w przeciwieństwie do komisarzy, jesteśmy rozliczani lokalnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29139221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę odpowiedzieć, że nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29139222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórzmy oczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39716192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim jest to Macedonia, a następnie Czarnogóra\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39716193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam gdzie został właściwie wdrożony, przyniósł dobre rezultaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39716194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznaczają one wartość dodaną - czyli to, że mamy coś wspólnego z innymi Europejczykami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39716211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niezwykle ważne, jeżeli chcemy osiągnąć paneuropejską jedność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39716214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, oczywiście, że nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbyś spróbować naprawić mi komputer?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę na zupę szczawiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko od Janka pachniało lekko jakimś obcym zapachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dlatego, że teraz już jesteś rybakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z powodu grożącej burzy dyrektor mój wcześniej skończył naukę i zamknął szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wyłączyłem ten przełącznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególne były oczy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi guzik na trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Symbole siedmiu planet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżcie się teraz trochę do mnie! — rozkazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejnym krokiem zagłębiłem się pomiędzy zaułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak go lubią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już nie zobaczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechże matka ma rozum!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja twoich pieniędzy nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przeciwnej strony, zza rzeki, nadchodził wolnym krokiem jakiś mężczyzna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nim stał długi, długi szereg mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawiają się zjawy zwierzęce, morskie potwory, jakiś jakby znany mi brodacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tą trwogą można było wytłumaczyć jego zdenerwowanie i kłamstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za chwilę ktoś zbiegał po schodach i pędził prosto do mojej celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postać jego, chociaż nie zupełnie wyraźnie, odbiła się w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umieściłem wczoraj tę amebę pod mikroskopem, którego szkiełka zalepiłem hermetycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy promień przepuszczony przez pryzmat rozkłada się na te same kolory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie doktór dopiero powrócił, bo jeszcze stał powóz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hartmann tymczasem wszedł do pokoju i w najgorszym humorze usiadł na kanapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego uchwycił się sukni owej kobiety?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21866631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jego wprawiły mnie w drżenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inkasent rzucił mu się do nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi Handlowcy pozostają do Państwa dyspozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnam cię Blanko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce też Piotr, korzystając z tej bezbrzeżnej ciszy, pogrążył się w zadumę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była wielka burza na morzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A bo ja wiem, mogę sobie połazić po Krakowie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysięgam, że ten hultaj drogo przypłaci chwilę, jaką przepędziłem dzięki twej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panowie Klejn i Lisiecki pożegnali się i wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25166244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas powiem otwarcie, co wiem i co, zdaniem mojem, należy uczynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczeblu europejskim wynik takiej sytuacji jest jasny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może otrzyma pan, panie pośle, odpowiedź na piśmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba powiedzieć, że zmiana i aktualizacja istniejącego prawodawstwa są naprawdę ważnymi kwestiami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego więc brak jest zgodności w Radzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnym jest uzyskanie porozumienia w kwestii kwot połowowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W innych krajach próbuje się oddzielić państwo od sektora bankowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę dysponujemy zabezpieczeniami na wypadek sytuacji, w których rolnicy będą potrzebować wsparcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy pamiętać, że poza kilkoma wyjątkami, prawie wszystkie państwa członkowskie ratyfikowały najważniejsze z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosuję za odrzuceniem tego tekstu i kategorycznie go potępiam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27705215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś, po kilkunastu latach doświadczeń, partnerzy społeczni widzą potrzebę jej zmian i uściśleń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie przechodzi jeden dzień po drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan jedzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyłbyś, jakby cię ona przepraszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór, wybór! — przedrzeźniała go dziwożona, podrzucając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, raz się uda, wiele razy się nie udaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Władca Czarnego zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że padł jeden koń i kilkunastu pagazich zostało w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umyślne postarzanie w segmencie smartfonów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieduża dziewuszka wyrywała się swojej mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„One falują zadkami w sposób może interesujący, ale ja ziewam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsłaniając cycuszki, pępuszek i picę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była już późna noc, kiedy Holmes wrócił z swojej samotnej wycieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego nie zapalisz lampy, tylko siedzisz przy świecy? — Bo tak było na wsi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21710891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mów, skoro chcesz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co miałem widzieć? — odezwał się sennym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy od dawna tu leżę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął w progu, zajrzał w głąb i żachnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu należy zapewnić szczególną ochronę zarówno dziecku, jak i matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie nalegał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęli przed nią i zawahali się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że rzeczywistości nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzisz, mnie tak potrzebny scyzoryk, a tobie na nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dwie armaty stanęły twarz w twarz w straszliwej, niczem niezmąconej ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstała pewnie lewą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu bałagan, jeszcze sieci pajęczej brakuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawiałem się nad rozsądną odpowiedzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się pochwycić ręką lont, którego drugi koniec sięgał do magazynu prochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, gra jego była warta stawki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro się tylko znajdę w siodle, to już nie lada kto mi dojedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto tu wołał o pomoc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustaw na cichy, bo ci powiadomienia cały czas przychodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22767426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że nie lubisz Androida, ale ja po prostu mam inne gusta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wchodzi się dwa razy do tej samej rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wziął pocisk do ręki, wydał mu się on strasznie ciężki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak aleja śpiewnych drzew… śpiewnych drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę poznać się, wiedzieć z góry jakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizm żadną miarą nie da się pogodzić z personalizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu robisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest — brzmiała odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, daj Boże szczęście, niech panienka mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Major podał mu trochę „brandy” z wodą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trzeba było kupić, nie wiem, pierścionek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajo musi być rozbite, aby z niego można było zrobić omlet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miałem prawa szukać ulgi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę też nasennego środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze starcie było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25803753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie jesteś chyba chory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahała się, zakołysała na miejscu, nie mogąc iść dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z powodu grożącej burzy dyrektor mój wcześniej skończył naukę i zamknął szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś — musiałem cię zamienić wprost w piosenkę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co tam pojedzie z takimi nowinami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dziś nie ma na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież tu powód do wyrzutów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z obecnym kryzysem gospodarczym, jest to najważniejsze wyzwanie dla nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest ona dobrze skoordynowana, a koszty zarządzania nią są wysokie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może udało mu się już wrócić, gdyż chwilę temu opuścił to posiedzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja ta pozwala Moskwie wywierać szczególny wpływ, co wynika z możliwości kontrolowania tych zasobów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznam, że narzucił bardzo wysokie standardy swojemu następcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie dysponuje jednak bezpośrednią władzą w tej sferze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rola ta została lepiej zdefiniowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to rozważyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiste jest, że opt-out nie ma nic wspólnego z elastycznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38599796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten dokument pokazuje, że państwa członkowskie coraz lepiej radzą sobie z wdrażaniem prawa unijnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie zauważyłeś tego, papo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie zdecydowali się na ślub cywilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak trzaskasz drzwiami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy bardzo bolą cię ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że słyszy szmer w okolicy pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekło w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I od tego czasu ludzie przestali się odradzać i zaczęli umierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mówił zdrobniale: dziewulinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie, nie mówiąc wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wolę pójść na nogach niż autobusem pojechać, żeby się z ludźmi nie spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się bardzo dobrze uczyć, i to uczyć całymi wie czorami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ooo! — zapłakał chór mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamówiłam w sklepie internetowym chleb, ryż, kaszę, dżem wiśniowy i sok jabłkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mała jest biedna i potwornie ambitna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzeknij mi, że się nic nie zmieni, myślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten nosek, co się do góry zadzierał, był taki śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jestem bardzo zdenerwowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybrał jedno i zamienił z krzesłem ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjadł śniadanie i puścił się w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół czaszki oddziela się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wybrał się na polowanie, pozostawiając swym więźniom żywność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominał pilota, który dla marynarza jest wcieleniem tego, co zasługuje na najwyższe zaufanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz w górze, raz w dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sprawiało to jednak żadnego uszczerbku w moim zapale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrój w wartowni był błędny i niewyraźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nie kocham go, lecz nie chcę z nim zrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tamten jakby naumyślnie wystawiał się na wciąż nowe ciosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpiłem, że i ona poznała mnie także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja ci, Kazik, powiem, jak jestem katolik…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to przecież śmieszny zabobon, Halko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój, bo strzelę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza krąży jak jastrząb nad miastem; uderza skrzydłami o domy, o niebo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przychodzi do mnie jak do kurwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszność wisi pod sufitem i kładzie się na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schludnie ubrany pan zapraszał uroczą panią do tańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożegnali się i Emil wrócił nad rzekę i wrócił do Sokra tesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nacisnęło mu coś lekko oddech i serce, zęby zaczęły mu szczękać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś Narcyzem, ja też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskiej i niby na jeża ostrzyżonej murawie przyleśnej stał dąb ustronny i rozłożysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie robił z tego tajem nicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na ławce, zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królowie mieszkają w hotelu, ja wynająłem mały pokoik w rybackiej chacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy oto przysięgam i pierwszy będę dbał o wypełnienie umówionych warunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej jest przestać palić od samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To, co pan mówi, jest bardzo logiczne, ale w swojej logiczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bałwana ulepić, czy wskoczyć z rozmachu obiema nogami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wszystkimi wirował śnieg i ostre, podobne do cięcia, wrażenie: nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dała mi koc, powiedziała, że się wszystkim zajmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ta książka była rzadko spotykaną, byłby mi ją przysłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Będzie bal jutro w szkole!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedź do stolicy apostolskiej z tego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doba ma dwadzieścia cztery godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wozu meblowego wyjęto właśnie parę mebli i ustawiono na chodniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płacz, nie płacz, proszę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale nie będziemy jechali z powrotem na wielbłądach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jonaszem jest wszystko, co przynosi nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się tłumaczył, pani i tak nie uwierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc żeby się potem nie gniewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest Maciuś królem, bo nie chce, ale za rok może znów zechce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walenty umie robić sieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co było istotną prawdą, nie powiedzieliście bowiem do siebie ani jednego słóweczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Inny świat... inny świat!..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wykrzyknąłem po dwukrotnym przeczytaniu tego niezwykłego anonsu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Huryski, piękne jak w raju Mahometa, uśmiechają się do ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co też on mógł popełnić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świnie wam paść, psubraty!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno mają naprawić latarnię, bo gdyby dziś płynął okręt, latarnia mu bardzo potrzebna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24784195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjść za Rossiego?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie chcę ci wstydu narobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powiedziałem coś zabawnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W punktach kulminacyjnych robił diminuen- da, co było jego nowym odkryciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wszelka „twórczość” nie pochodzi z tych źródeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę zawiązać listy w ceratę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyłem na jego ruchy osłupiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja myślę, że czterdzieści dwie — rozległ się cienki głosik spoza burty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd poszły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Weź, Felku, ten pierścień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzi mi o partie górne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pomocnikiem nauczyciela w nędznej prowincjonalnej szkółce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzeknij mi, że się nic nie zmieni, myślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścian sączyła się strużkami woda i wsiąkała w grunt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja wiem, że ona nie lubi żadnego ruszania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba tu ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spełń ostatnią prośbę tego, który ci dał wszystko, co posiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja się nią zajmę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec burzy, piorunów, huraganu, dżdżu, ciemności i wobec lwów, czuł się bezbronny i bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz pamiętała na przyszłość!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech stara maszyna nie próżnuje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten temat interesował go, stawał się tedy wymownym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba chuja oszczędzać, pozwól mu odsapnąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dojechać ze Szczecina do Gdyni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21061129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie rad był i uszczęśliwiony z przybycia małego gościa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z politycznego punktu widzenia byłoby to działaniem słusznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz należy zresztą też porozmawiać o czymś innym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy oczekujemy zintegrowanego wniosku Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał się on możliwy dzięki zgłoszonym przez nich poprawkom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie walczcie z nią, nie zwalczajcie jej, lecz do niej przystąpcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Występuje rosnące ryzyko, że technologia nuklearna wpadnie w ręce organizacji przestępczych i terrorystycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lokalni radni wybrani w rosyjskojęzycznym mieście nie mogą używać ojczystego języka podczas posiedzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla nas to dość szczególny dzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić wymienić mi pokrótce kilka środków służących osiągnięciu tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28810723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne są wcześniejsze inspekcje i tam, gdzie to niezbędne, muszą one być również przymusowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładziono mu na czoło monetę: zawsze poznawał, którą stroną leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar nie jest nawet zabawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili do pokoju weszła jakaś Chinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc prawdopodobnie zamieszka w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz bandy arabskie zapuszczały się coraz dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasta wojewódzkiego, powiatu lub gminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągle tylko brzęczy i burczy, lub kwili i skamli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrzegali Nubara paszę, by mu nie ufał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Siostro, nie pytaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty naprawdę myślisz, że ja się o to obawiam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tę rudą widziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślad bierznika na grzbiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nic ją nie boli, odpowiedziała, smuci się tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic, niewielka strata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo go to obchodziło, ale można było na ten temat rozprawiać długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na tematy teoretyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem obróciłam się do ściany i chciałam spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas potopu, pogasły gwiazdy na niebie i znikły światła na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba, że tego nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz i ja zauważyłem zmiany u niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między dwoma miastami wyrósł kamienny mur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówi pan do mnie rzeczy tak dziwne i tak mnie obchodzące…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz się ścigać z tramwajem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było po dawnemu zwyczajne, codzienne i przeciętne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa lata temu z górą, koło Zielonych Świątek, sczezł bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazik na starość przestał myśleć samodzielnie i zajął się polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno oko tak zbielało, że aż zgasło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natknąłem się na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokojony nieco tą oczywistością, zaczął się rozbierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To tylko fason jej bucików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz, Felek, dlaczego taki jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zwracał na niego uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest granica powiatu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pojedziemy dalej gondolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno otrzymać takie wychowanie, które podnosi jego kulturę ogólną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to tak ohydne, że czym prędzej zapaliłem lampę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem ludzie siedzieli przed bramami domów, a pary leżały nad rzeką, na wyłysiałych łączkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się gdzieś podziała jego liberia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już po tym postępku od razu poznałbym Francuza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, nie znał słów pieśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotował się kretyn do tej nocy bohaterskiej jak toreador.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z ubraniami na wyrost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wolnym czasie uwielbiam chodzić z przyjaciółmi na spacery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za wykończenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich tam, zdaje się, mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schowali się na centralnej poczcie, w dużej hali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłanie było nadspodziewanie wygodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ta kobieta znała tak dokładnie pewne szczegóły z mego życia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś tchórz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam prawo się dowiedzieć, czy potrafi mnie pan wynagrodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nie chciałam, może, może, żebyś ty się zajmował brudną robotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sama, co u Emila na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie ginę bez zasługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się z sofy i zbliżyłem ku niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bo jasny pan lekki jak pióro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie używałabym takiego określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę cię mieć wyłącznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bierze dosłownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wszelki wypadek wziąłem z sobą broń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewa, krzewy i trawa służące za jedyne schronienie też nie ułatwiają przetrwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni na skrawku przestrzeni bez wyjścia wobec zalewającego żywiołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo chciałem wziąć łódkę i spróbować, czy będę mógł wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy mężczyzna zgubił się gdzieś w tłumie pasażerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan jest wybitnie samobójczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne zajęcie z jakimś boskim pierwiastkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem siadł nagi przy fortepianie i zaczął grać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do fortepianu dziwnie miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta z dobrodziejstw ubezpieczeń społecznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy się tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy zbudować drewniany barak dla Maciusia i straży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tu mało zieleni! — rzekłem tonem skargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę wiedzieć to, czego nie mogę wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był naprawdę pracowity rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powłóczy się, wygłodzi — i wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Eureka” — ryczał i tańczył biedaczek z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22450536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody nasz przyjaciel doskonały dał przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten bieg wciąż jeszcze wzmagał się od siarczystych razów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Damian nie był ani nieśmiały, ani zawstydzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szum chodził wierzchem lasu, nie przenikając do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszaj natychmiast! — brzmiała gniewna odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny indyk, nie ma co mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby uniknąć zatorów drogowych, Rada Miasta wprowadziła również dodatkowe, bezpłatne przejazdy autobusowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana była w prostą suknię dorastającej smarkuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko robi zwariowane zachowanie się Emila przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie nalegał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieża była z kamieni, u dołu szeroka, wyżej coraz węższa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci obiecać, że ten list będzie ostatni, ale gdybym mógł, obiecałbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem tylko człowiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dość dziwne powtórzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno dodatkowe pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poddajemy go kompleksowemu przeglądowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobry dzień dla Parlamentu i pokazuje, co możemy osiągnąć dzięki współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawiamy dziś wniosek ustawodawczy w sprawie nadzwyczajnych autonomicznych preferencji handlowych dla Pakistanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem przyjęcie takiej postawy nabiera coraz większego znaczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak mówimy o nowych zasadach podstawowych i rozwiązaniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"humanitarności, bezstronności, neutralności i niezależności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to grupa otwarta na zmiany, postęp technologiczny i innowacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mogłoby zachwiać naszą wiarygodność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38051281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd też chciałbym szczerze podziękować sprawozdawcy za jego wkład pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ale jeszcze nie jego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrowia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Składam z tego powodu serdeczne gratulacje wszystkim, którzy się przyczynili do realizacji tego projektu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba podkreślać te trzy podstawowe wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stają się one coraz pilniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosuję za przyjęciem sprawozdania naszego szanownego kolegi Giuseppe Castiglione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Populizm przyniósł politykę opartą na strachu, ale nadszedł czas, aby zrozumieć pewne fakty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie to proponujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stały mechanizm zachowania stabilności finansowej musi obejmować środki służące regulacji działalności rynków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37372147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy inteligentną politykę walutową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mary słuchała jak zahipnotyzowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto jak się te nieprzytomne marzenia ziściły w nieprzytomnym losie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne to, śmieszne, lecz prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taniec — to kręcenie się w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaspokoiła ona mej ciekawości — owszem, podnieciła ją tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hulaj dusza, piekła nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał, że będzie przysyłał pieniądze co miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy do nas! — zawyło echem ze wszech stron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapach unosił się z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to pierwsze nasze spotkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja z pewnością nigdy nie będę panną młodą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21074943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dna lejka wyskakuje trochę piasku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatni zeszedł ze schodów człek młody, średniego wzrostu, silnie zbudowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, mamy szal! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rączęta załamując gwałtownie krzyczała:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie moim, dzięki Bogu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś szarpnął mnie silnie za rękaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilowy zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko pozostała osoba: sześćdziesiąta i piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprzedziłem go, by rozświetlać drogę latarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi dopiero rozmach, co się zowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma głowę zanurzoną we krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20734345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowicie się z Panią zgadzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówić bardzo krótko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska Biblioteka Cyfrowa \\\"Europeana\\\" stoi obecnie przed wieloma wyzwaniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy jednak także, że jutro Parlament wyda oświadczenie dotyczące tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak relacje te mogą stanowić uzupełnienie w dwóch sferach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zacząć od czegoś pozytywnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywóz rtęci metalicznej powinien być zakazany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja także wstrzymałem się od głosowania nad tym sprawozdaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie moglibyśmy osiągnąć więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26778903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie jak wiele innych, program ten był współfinansowany przez Unię Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil dziwił się, że Janek tyle mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeszło dwa lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinno ono być przedmiotem handlu w żadnej formie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głębokie cienie kontrastują z jasnymi punktami kadrów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy się rozdzielić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut później pożegnaliśmy się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie swoje objaśniła rysunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można by udowodnić jego winę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czesała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarmistrz światła, karmelkowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wie, co lekarze…?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nam tu nie potrzeba farmerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ptaki nie śpiewały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce powraca! Lecz jak tylko znikła jego pozłota, Henry zatrzymał się, by rozłożyć obóz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomódl się, bym została synem twoim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Ziewnął w końcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy nadchodzi cierpienie, najlepiej nie unikać go wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20852178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała pani: „porywczy”, nie: „złośnik”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.972,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, to się stać nie powinno, dopóki mogłem temu przeszkodzić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starskiego już tam nie było, panna Izabela siedziała sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przerwał mu Wokulski zduszonym głosem, prostując się na kanapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie przyjadę, matka moja bardzo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto padło hasło racjonalizacji przemysłu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka moja nigdy mnie zbytnio nie absorbuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie była to jakaś poważna robota, która wymagała większej liczby uczestników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wszędzie bruki powyjmowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś ostatni dzień, który mogę z panem spędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25338784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grzmotnąłeś mnie zdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz miał wolną drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystąpienie Rosjan oburzyło władze chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przez długie lata byłem nieobliczalnie smutną ofiarą nieustannej i niestrudzonej wstydliwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąską uliczkę między dwoma rzędami bazarów wypełniał skłębiony malowniczo tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobiegli do rozstaju i znów przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiano ją przenieść do innej szkoły, bo w starej szkole „śmierdzi, śmierdzi”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę się przekonać, kto to taki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie ma już żadnych powodów, aby nadal utrzymywać jakiekolwiek sankcje wobec Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odniesieniu do dwóch ostatnich agencji chciałabym wskazać na następujące elementy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proponowana struktura sieciowa to dobre rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dobrze rozumiem uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czerwcu zeszłego roku rząd w Katmandu wydał władzom Chin uchodźców z Tybetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre nanomateriały są wyraźnie opisane jako szkodliwe dla zdrowia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zdaniem po spełnieniu kryteriów, sytuacja powinna ulec rozwiązaniu w tym roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to właściwa droga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy o niebagatelnych sumach wydatkowanych na podstawie regulacji pozostawiających spore pole manewru dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38248164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałabym ponownie zwrócić uwagę wszystkich na przedstawione wczoraj piąte sprawozdanie w sprawie spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracujcie z nami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie są w stanie wykarmić swych zwierząt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie przedstawić aktualne informacje na temat naszych prac\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjrzyjmy się teraz kontrolowanej migracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pierwszy budżet po wejściu w życie traktatu lizbońskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będziemy Komisją tymczasową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, aby te zadania były realizowane we właściwy sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, tak to nie działa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale producenci homara mogliby założyć organizacje producenckie w celu wzmocnienia swojej pozycji na rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32421212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzimy światełko na końcu tunelu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy nie znacie miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego wypluć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecinny jest człowiek dojrzały, dojrzałe jest dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec jęczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z radosnym i dzikim krzykiem uchodziła w głąb lasu — wolna, wyśmiewna, niedościgła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia skrzydełka, łebkiem śmiesznie kręci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś otworzył drzwi na platformę i szarpnął sygnał alarmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyja to transkrypcja? — To właściwie wcale nie jest transkrypcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy ulewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On trzyma, a ty zrzuciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale potem… będziemy mogli pogadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los czyli nie przychodzi ku nam mimo naszej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pod tym względem kokaina jest jeszcze większą złudą niż alkohol.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieźle, jest grochówka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam zatem milczenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy stracił przytomność umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce do góry, albo ci kulę wpakuję w łeb!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan tu siedzieć, albo straci pan posadę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mi się zdaje, że to raczej nie teges.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zawsze różnica, czy kogoś zamordują, czy też rozstrzelają go według prawa wojennego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jej jednak nie uratowało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że mnie uderzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22777112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce ktoś grzanki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem na nartach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ani to, ani tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc i dorosły czuje się sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zawsze, że on „to” skończy, nie Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad jej oczami zwisały pojedyncze kłosy trawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał mu do powiedzenia tysiące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jemu wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jakby pan Stanisław.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten mały nowy więzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię: bywałem, gdyż niekiedy zdawało mi się, że Nicość zwyciężyła Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotrzymała słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten mały nowy więzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierzaj mi, że ci zabalsamowani ludzie są mało podobni do żywych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona stropiła się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba śniłem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem znów będzie zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja je lubię i one mnie lubią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli oszczędni w gestach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojciec nic o tym nie wie jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przez trzy dni nie mieliśmy żadnych informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysnuł też cały szereg wniosków równie fałszywych, jak samo założenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, jak ona, nie tańczył z takim wdziękiem walca, oberka, mazura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konfederacja ma dobre zamiary i jest gotowa przystąpić do negocjacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomocy udziela się w razie śmierci, poważnego wypadku, poważnych obrażeń ciała, zatrzymania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bieg sprawy wniosku o skorzystanie z immunitetu parlamentarnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe jest funkcjonowanie Europy wyłącznie na zrównoważonych źródłach energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ratyfikacja traktatu lizbońskiego jest sama w sobie takim \\\"zielonym kiełkiem\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy w dalszym ciągu działać dla dobra naszych społeczeństw i przybliżyć im ten Traktat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jest to temat, który przykuwa uwagę wielu ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmocnienie sieci wewnętrznych jest równie ważne, jak utworzenie międzysieciowych połączeń, tworzących jednolite sieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego powinniśmy zmniejszać możliwości naszych jednostek do poziomu naszej kwoty?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28973996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Grecji robotnicy organizują duże zgromadzenia bezrobotnych z sektora prywatnego i publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza saniami biegło trzydziestu ludzi otulonych w filtra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goethe jest zdania, że chrześcijańskie słowo „Bóg” jest tylko inną odmianą słowa „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I na cóż potrzebna wam była woda? — pytano Nowaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje, kopalnie, tartaki i przedsiębiorstwa okrętowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się bardzo dobrze uczyć, i to uczyć całymi wie czorami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zające gonimy i szukamy lalek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napijcie się herbaty, jeszcze gorąca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil uczył ją grać na fortepianie, bo była muzykalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20687179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jeśli negocjacje stają w martwym punkcie, możliwości dialogu nie są wyczerpane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapobiegania i Kontroli Chorób, i obaj przedstawili kompletnie odmienne stanowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie, wykazujecie całkowity brak konsekwencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raport legalizuje produkcję pojazdów napędzanych wodorem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba za mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Europejska przyjęła również cały zakres środków podlegających jej kompetencjom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety stanowią doskonałą siłę roboczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że będziemy w stanie zrobić to wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie, to coś jest nie tak z integracją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35154297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym więc zadać trzy pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używa podstępu w miejsce rycerstwa, pióra w miejsce szpady, to wstyd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak z twoim katarem Małgosiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski uczuł, że z serca zsuwa się mu ogromny ciężar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym musiał podzielić pański los, gdybym się był chociaż chwilę zawahał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrętny zapach wystygłych węgli leżał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im dalej posuwaliśmy się w góry, tem surowszą i dzikszą stawała się droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanik ukłonił się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłożyłem do niego ogień i położyłem się na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan mi odsłonił najpiękniejszą rzecz, to czego jeszcze nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24768743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zachwytu zacząłem się tarzać po ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie coś pokrewnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W atelier zapadło głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę zostawiać tylko cyfr dla statystyki, chcę przyszłą historię wzbogacić w dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i przestałem się pytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkradała się jak kot tylnym wejściem, aby nie mówiono do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczęli przeskakiwać przez płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan wojenny bywał dla mnie zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszalałe w swej zawziętości pszczoły nie ominęły zbliżonej do nich lewicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne apeluje do rodziców i indywidualnie do mężczyzn i kobiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj Paweł zatrzymał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkradała się jak kot tylnym wejściem, aby nie mówiono do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również z tego powodu nie mogę głosować za przyjęciem sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie w ten sposób nasze argumenty będą najlepiej słyszalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ułatwi to życie zarówno nam samym, jak i uchodźcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istniało wsparcie dla niektórych projektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże cała Europa pozostaje w tej dziedzinie mocno w tyle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba chcemy, żeby tak się właśnie stało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa nie została zamknięta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przetrwaliśmy te cierpkie uwagi, które padły w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się zatem, że wspólny program poprowadziłby nas we właściwym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27211290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając już siedem lat pozostaje kluczowym instrumentem polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby się chciało trochę przesadzać, można by powiedzieć, że jego zdania mogą zabijać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty robisz zresztą to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykładam mu dziesięć razy dziennie, jak się ma zachowywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z rowów przydrożnych podniosły się stłumione brzęki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciwszy na mnie przelotne spojrzenie, skupił całą swą uwagę na Wieruszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wiedzie te hordy ku krwawemu dziełu zbrodni, zemsty lub kary?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem na nartach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy padł strzał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko upływały Maciusiowi godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko od Janka pachniało lekko jakimś obcym zapachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół czaszki oddziela się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złota nam brakło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą do sklepu i kupują gotowe masło, nie widziały nigdy jak ono powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił iść do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb? — zaśmiała się nagle dziwożona i napełniła wnętrze wora klaśnięciem drobnych dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna kobieta zniknęła bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najbliższa zginęła od bolszewików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho… on śpi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyjemnie Maciusiowi, choć nie wie dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próżno chłopak namawiał i za uzdę ciągnął, i wózek popychał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna stanęła nad jego łóżkiem i pochyliła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrzucała ruchami nonszalanckimi: królewna rzuca perły w morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym właśnie sęk! — zawołał Podlasiak, wstydliwie obmacując wybitną pozostałość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że wszedł do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze wszystkich praw w niniejszej Deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znała aż za dużo historyjek z małymi dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, na Boga!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to Staś przesunął usta do jej ucha i rzekł szepcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak kosztów licencyjnych Firm trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zbraknie, nie zbraknie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że nie tylko życie jest dobrem, ale także śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie chciał dodać Medinet leżało bliżej od krajów zajętych przez powstanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukłoniłem się sztywno, co wskazywało, jak sądzę, jakiego nabrałem o nich przekonania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chłopiec ręką machnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówiłaś, że masz okropny pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtąd jej serce przylgnęło do niego jeszcze mocniej niż poprzednio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ciekawością bezosobową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotykam ją czasami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… — chrząknąłem — mieliście się zejść na moście Św. Floriana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby znał ten dziwny język?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za medalion? — zapytała nagle, sięgając ręką ku mej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba śniłem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy przecież w ogólnikach: teoretyzujemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pa Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne dlatego organizatorzy postawili na jeszcze większą promocję wydarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaznaczę tylko wizje, nie wdając się w szczegółowe opisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz tatko coś dołożył i kupili rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęliśmy z niego siodło i ciężary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kozioł obrócił się do niej tyłem i podniósł kitę ogona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo trwało jej osłupienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem: Alaska… potem wilki, względnie psy… i sanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, tak — pamiętam — odpowiedział ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba użył pan tego wyrażenia w znaczeniu przenośnym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż pojaśniało od sztandarów i chorągwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo całej baczności nie spostrzegłem powrotu nieznajomego myśliwca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jest rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak się spóźniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była najpiękniejsza piosenka, jaką kiedykolwiek słyszałam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj twórcy odebrali nagrody z rąk prezydenta miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem obiecuję sobie, że go wyrzucę, że go w ogóle nie wpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pagórku stał żółty dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj Paweł zatrzymał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Depesza pewno gdzieś tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boby od razu poznali, bo się zrobiłem czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz ta nie żyła i nie myślała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą jej kochankowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie patrzył nawet, jak się koło niego zabawiał Hannibal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam również nadzieję, że dzięki tej prezydencji wzmocnione zostaną stosunki między Portugalią a Hiszpanią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy zgodzić się na nieuczciwe kompromisy w przypadkach, które dotyczą obywatelskiej swobody wypowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces akcesyjny Turcji zawsze obejmować będzie kroki naprzód i kroki wstecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspekcje są dobre, a prawa jeszcze lepsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta rezolucja i dzisiejsza debata są właśnie przykładami dobrej koordynacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponownie oznajmiam, że projekt dyrektywy w pełni hołduje zasadzie preferencji wspólnotowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie kraje muszą się otrząsnąć i dostrzec, że zmiany są niezbędne, ale i korzystne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy odsyłać tych ludzi, zanim jeszcze do nas trafią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie, chciałabym podziękować komisji, pracownikom grupy oraz asystentom posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28859221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu szczególną uwagę położono na znaczenie sportu oraz konieczność zachowania jego uczciwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ludzie, o których tu mówię, są żyjącem niebezpieczeństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że w przegłosowanym kształcie rozporządzenie przyczyni się do redukcji emisji dwutlenku węgla\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wobec tego mówicie w Europie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem umowy o partnerstwie gospodarczym działają w sposób zgodny z zasadami Światowej Organizacji Handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bal u Stokrotki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ważne jest, aby zastąpić zagraniczne podatki przez te pozyskiwane wewnętrznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona nie powinna jednak ograniczać się do fizycznej ochrony ofiary\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemal równie oczywistymi konsekwencjami tej debaty są dziwaczne propozycje legislacyjne naruszające te prawa podstawowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli nie podejmuje Pani inicjatyw, to przynajmniej proszę nie odrzucać tych, które zgłaszają inni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38332982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musimy zaprzestać retoryki i zacząć działać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boisz się siebie samej? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie oddałbym za nie wszystkie ani jednej z naszych nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, ile? Dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew na książkach i papierach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sama, co u Emila na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na chuju mógł podnieść pełne wiadro wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewam się, że pana zajmuje ta historia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z jakiegoś nieznanego zresztą powodu serce jej nagle bić ustało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż to za zachowanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kuchni krzątała się kucharka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Mieliśmy psów sześć - powtórzył z niezmąconym spokojem Bill. - Wyjąłem sześć ryb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlatego też nie zwracałem uwagi na jej kaprysy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedziała: — Pokaż mi go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jest czarodziejem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27824993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzona przez nas długa walka z problemem palenia przyniosła pewne rezultaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27824994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto dowód, że grupy interesu robią swoje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27824997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie dokładnie powinny być jej pierwsze zadania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27824998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Priorytety nie ulegną zmianie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27825028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy wspierać równość we wszystkich dziedzinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27825030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten kryzys to kryzys kultury politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27825031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o niepełnosprawnych, bezrobotnych i osoby w wieku emerytalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27825102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, nie jestem pewien\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27825103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym panu przypomnieć o wiedeńskiej Agencji Praw Podstawowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28703511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to, że zadania jeszcze nie zakończyliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak proste zagadnienia są zabawką dla inteligentnego umysłu i nie nużą go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy potoczyły się szybciej po jego drgającej twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było słychać plusku ni szumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to widocznie książka wydana w jakiejś określonej formie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lub też konno na chuju, na boku, na raka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą opowiadania jego i żony świadczyły jasno, że część życia spędził w Ameryce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ… to tyś się zmieniła! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza o osobny pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikogo nie ma w pobliżu — oznajmiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21097370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet gdybyś wyjechała, niewiele poniesie uszczerbku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko wam mogą wejść w drogę insi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z półotwartych ust wychylał się język długi, wąski, czarny jak węgiel…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — beczał rozbawiony naczelnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kruk, przelatujący nad lasem, zakrakał nagle na śmierć temu właśnie dębowi, pod którym siedzieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni używają redakcyjnego „my” — zaznaczył naraz Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dościgną pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczepić ją podczas pauzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki syknął z bólu i z rozkoszy, która się wraz z bólem narzuciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są twoje urodziny, więc zapraszam cię na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nagroda ufundowana przez nasze miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówią oni, że już obiecali zapewnić dostawy gazu pięciu innym stronom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrałem głos, aby powiedzieć, że naprawdę uważam, że jest to naruszenie naszego Regulaminu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spłoszyłem jeno wilka, który go obwąchiwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo skupiamy się na zadaniach społecznych, albo na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sceptycy zapewne mogą pytać, czy Unia będzie konkurencyjna bez innowacji czy badań nad innowacyjnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcielibyśmy także finansować zakrojone na dużą skalę środki poprzez programy tematyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszą powinnością jest osiągnięcie pełnej solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal jednak potrzebne są badania, które potwierdzą tego rodzaju potencjał obu typów komórek macierzystych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - To czwarty pakiet dotyczący ochrony praw pasażerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37409818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba przyznać, że te praktyki po prostu nie spełniają unijnych standardów bezpieczeństwa żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najbliższa zginęła od bolszewików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co niczyje, to i nasze być może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosiu, przestań gryźć mamę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to zapomnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarka nie nakręcisz, to stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile chodzi o Emila — nie wstydziła się niczego więcej; ani mówić, ani czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudna kobieta! — pomyślałem, przestępując próg sali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy grasz? — Trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Depesza pewno gdzieś tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja także — nalegał dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała czas dłuższy, utkwiwszy przerażone oczy w drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko narzuciłam ubranie i poszłam do pokoju Wilhelma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oglądam telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten sok mógłby zaszkodzić pannie Karolinie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Snadź powzięła nowe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu przyszedł z miną pokorną, zbyt pokorną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, teraz mu wbiję igłę do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenia obecnych skrzyżowały się na purpurowych wargach dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no by go spytał o paszport ten przechodzący patrol…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło mi się przewracać w głowie, patrzyłem poza nią, za okno, miałem półotwarte usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cienkie nóżki grzęzły w piachu, ledwo je mógł wyciągnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, takie okrągłe okienko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta druga dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak był dumny z siebie, że Staś zaledwie zdołał go skłonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widać, że na niby się broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, ale rachunki: to najważniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siedemnasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama zapytam męża i pewna jestem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli jednoręki trafem kulawca z oczu stracił, szukał go zawsze na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.355,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"widzę tu przynajmniej coś podobnego w zapiskach, które sobie poczyniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.93,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej okoliczności mogłem tylko być wdzięczny, gdyż każdy krok zbliżał mnie do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.579,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo oto spojrzyj ku wschodowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.291,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od kiedy on jest taki wypicowany?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.482,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się, jak oparzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.116,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.945,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służbę pełniliśmy na zmianę, dzień po dniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.505,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to przecież podczas zabójczej pogody, gdy musieliśmy uciekać przed Nelsonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, jak udali się po schodach na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.609,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kląłem, ściągałem cugle, rwałem, ale byłem bezsilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet nie wiesz, o co im idzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddać ją żołnierzom ku zabawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z widoczną troską o wniosek, a kulawiec z niedowierzaniem pogrążyli się w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto da się przeważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziliśmy od drzwi do drzwi z pustymi żołądkami i zbieraliśmy podpisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam z nią zawsze, mimo że miałam ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczach rosły niebieskawe jodły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miesiąc żeby flota była!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil siedział na kamieniu o dwadzieścia metrów dalej i obserwował ją od dziesięciu minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż to za nowy figiel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic, tylko lód i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd, jak i dokąd ma uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczemu on robi błędy, jak nas uczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel zasnęła zaraz po posiłku i spała przez kilka godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, psa nie mogę wcale zabierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się blisko Nilu i często nocami skręcali do rzeki, by napoić zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemuż boisz się mnie, siostro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20812490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie, biedak, co jeszcze go czeka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie pomyłki zdarzają się nieraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postaci kolejarza zaszła w tej chwili zagadkowa metamorfoza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dan wciąż popłakiwał przy sterze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa te rozciągają się na wszystkie dzieci, bez żadnego wyjątku i bez żadnej różnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oświadczyła nagle dziwożona, oblizując zwilgotniałe od tataraku wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robię po prostu bilans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Malinowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boisz się siebie samej? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtórny i głośniejszy jęk, wiosennie zgłuszony bujnymi ścianami dębu, wydobył się na\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż może mieć wspólnego z człowiekiem wolny naród wilków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli przez miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczy chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne proklamuje niniejszą Deklarację praw dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa wyjdzie ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ten tłum?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy jesteście za jedni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cichutko podkradł się do dziewczynki i rzucił jej pierścionek na sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie ona lepiej od nas, co czynić na oczach ludzkich, a co na stronie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyja to transkrypcja? — To właściwie wcale nie jest transkrypcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba, że tego nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrał się i wybiegł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jeźdźców rozproszyła się w różne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem trochę znużona przechadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to wywołać ogromne nieszczęście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i Panowie, w tej dziedzinie nadal pozostaje bardzo wiele do zrobienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka konkurencji leży w zakresie odpowiedzialności Komisji Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to rzeczywiste płatności za wykonane usługi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto nikt nie potrafi powiedzieć, jakie podjęto czynności ratunkowe po odebraniu wezwania pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu za pańską uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem należy zająć się tymi zagadnieniami, najlepiej w oparciu o dogłębne zrozumienie faktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto rzeczywistość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania Europy muszą być jasne, szybkie i skuteczne w krótkim i długim terminie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zadać Komisji kilka dodatkowych pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dorośli, i dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam, aż obrazy podniosą się przede mną, jak przed zaklinaczem wężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korytarze są puste, kroki rezonują, jakby szło dziesięciu łudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dojść do tego, by móc sobie pozwolić tym zakończyć koncert.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten dzień zapasy były skończone i zebrani rozeszli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podwórko już nie wychodzę, tylko czekam, żeby się pauza skończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż chce, abyś mu dał schronienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt chyba nie zaprzeczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję — odparł, pokrywając zdumienie wymuszonym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się ironicznie zakrwawionym pyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To naruszałoby przecież logikę i ekonomię natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cygaro żarzyło się powoli, rozpylając po przedziale obłoczki sinawego dymu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisałem je, odczytałem na trzeźwo — kompletna bzdura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie powinny nosić krótsze od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jej powiedział: — Chcę spotkać się z tobą, — odpowiedziała: — Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie oddałbym za nie wszystkie ani jednej z naszych nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan tylko zgłosić dopłatę konduktorowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie chciał wierzyć, ale uwierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co mam zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21927951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cha, cha, cha! — roześmiał się Wierusz, przerywając mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy?” „W niedzielę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20593980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kogoś ty się udał? — rzekł z niesmakiem po dość mitrężnym namyśle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20593983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20593985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden się wymawiał, że śpiący i woli się rano myć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20593986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20593988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka czyni mistrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hulaj dusza, piekła nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co robi twój papa? - zapytał, bo lubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20594014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpoczęła — zaczerpnęła powietrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem poczuł, że coś się niedostrzegalnie zmieniło w nim albo poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Czy widzisz te krowy tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem tylko stwierdzić prawdziwość swoich domysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko zdaje mi się, nosił pan do niedawna jeszcze inny mundur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc by tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, byłem zaślepiony i nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he! — szydził kolejarz — kochany pan zapewne poeta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś był uważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj ładni i mają takie czerwone usta, jakby ciągle się całowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokój! — wołał z uniesieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno otrzymać takie wychowanie, które podnosi jego kulturę ogólną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drugie danie tu ci przyniosą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara boska, kara boska…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jutra wystarczy — oświadczył jednoręki i po namyśle dodał: — Do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo tak chciałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko że ja ziarna przyjąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapukano do drzwi, wszedł stary lokaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja lubię być ostrożny w przypuszczeniach, panie Szuman...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzała się, skoro tak chce on, głowa domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszerne to, ale nie bardzo powabne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gmach ten należy do Waszej królewskiej mości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sędziowie ze swojego punktu widzenia mają zupełną słuszność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez przerwy niemal czekała na jego powrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie kule przeszyły mur i spłaszczyły się na ścianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24758770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie drzwi stawały otworem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni na skrawku przestrzeni bez wyjścia wobec zalewającego żywiołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niechże jasny pan jedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie chcę ci wstydu narobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od momentu powstania gimnazjum zdobyliśmy także wiele doświadczeń pracując z młodzieżą gimnazjalną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno wpadł do szuflady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona spojrzała na niego ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki wyciągnął z torby kubek blaszany, obejrzał go starannie i schował z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle odwróciła się i skierowała kroki ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahał się i zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądam i segreguję wiersze pisane dla tych, których nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno ci w torbie? — spytał ze współczuciem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda? Biedny Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, w piosenkę… żeby mieć cię blisko ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszycie, jak wołają „hura” w pracowniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle odwróciła się i skierowała kroki ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej duże piersi podnosiły się i opadały, podnosiły się i opadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jakby pan Stanisław.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona pytała: — Skąd się tu bierzesz? — i nie mogła tego zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie chcesz, żeby Sara była twoją mamusią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27786690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że proces ten zostanie wstrzymany w wyniku podjętych działań międzynarodowych i wewnętrznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27786693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak kiedy Irlandczycy zagłosowali \\\"przeciw\\\", postanowiliśmy kontynuować proces, a u nich przeprowadzić ponowne głosowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27786695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzyści związane z mobilnością studentów, wykładowców i naukowców trzeba promować i rozreklamować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27786696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oby nie uruchomiło to efektu spirali gwałtownego wzrostu wszystkich cen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27786698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy na dobrej drodze, by to osiągnąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27787219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłuchaliśmy wypowiedzi na temat ekologizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27787224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dla Europy niezwykle ważne zadanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27787230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz musi wysyłać swoją córkę, aby zbierała ryż na tych samych niebezpiecznych polach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27787244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tradycyjnie, pierwszy szczyt europejski w roku poświęcony jest sprawom gospodarczym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27787248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisji trochę trudno jest zgodzić się jedynie na dwa wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co pani zamówi? — zapytał, gdy przyszedł kelner.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wybrał się na polowanie, pozostawiając swym więźniom żywność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wieloma uprawiałem seks\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie do końca są w swoim środowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na tym nie koniec; posłuchaj rzeczy prawdziwej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż łaskawy pan może jej przeciwstawić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pies też lubi towarzystwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłyśmy dawniej tak osamotnione, zziębnięte i zgłodniałe, a teraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie Klementyna była królową balu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i ławka była jeszcze ciepła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boisz się siebie samej? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gimnazjum jest coraz bliżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była ani trochę ordynarna, ani trochę nieprzyzwoita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł do „Revue Philosophique”: „Analiza pojęcia przy padku”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Allach mnie ukarał, żem go wyzwał i kusił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie takiej fizycznej ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie stale wrzało życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszedł w nią całkiem i ona odczuwała go, jak psy chiczny płód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta umiejętność nie jest jeszcze gotowa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen pełen majaków, zmagań i widm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały ciąg owych daremnie straconych lat jaśniałeś w sercu moim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W „pańskiej” Polsce… — zaczął mówca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to bardziej oddalali się od śródmieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niczyja — odparł hardo Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zbyt wolno i dlatego był szczęśliwy, że umie pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli, a Darek wyciągnął z kieszeni niezgrabne zawiniątko w brązowym papierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak rozwiązujemy kwestię zakwaterowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymiotować się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojej, usta otworzył jak wrota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego neurologowi było nieco trudno pogłaskać go po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udawały mu się czasem cięte odpowiedzi, ponieważ dużo czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nagroda ufundowana przez nasze miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przebiegł go dreszczyk, jak mała mysz, wzdłuż kręgosłupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyła nas atmosfera hali targowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki spoważniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widzi ich też ktoś inny prócz mnie na moście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta błyskawica w jednej chwili ukazała jej całą głębię jej upadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że będą się spotykać, ale nie tak, jak do tychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzucał karty i odczytywał urywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy we wróżby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ooo! — zapłakał chór mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdy cię z torby na świat wynurzym, poznasz mnie po głosie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej bluzkę, a ona pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola, która to usłyszała: — Idę też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci obiecać, że ten list będzie ostatni, ale gdybym mógł, obiecałbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uszczelniliśmy je gałęziami, umocowawszy kamieniami i przysypawszy grubą warstwą śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę iść z jakimś gówniarzem na wodę sodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci są lekkomyślne i niedoświadczone…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni żyją dla demokracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stała Ela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybyliśmy za wcześnie i musieliśmy czekać w kolejce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyjemnie Maciusiowi, choć nie wie dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz — ty sam zginiesz, a ja razem z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci powiem, czego się boisz: Boisz się stężenia, śmierci — jak wosk tężeje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudno: nie jestem tak delikatny jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w dziedzinie matematyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za szybą ciągnęły się rzędy regałów z książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klementyna umarła od udaru sercowego, umarła z nadmiaru życia i radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy krytyk jest postacią niezwykłą i odmienną od wszystkich śmiertelników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż — dokończyła z dziwnym, nie znanym mi dotychczas uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co powie dyrektorowi? Ze chciałby kogoś zapisać do szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sięgało w samo dzieciństwo, ta niemożność urwania w środku, zatrzymania się, skończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybyliśmy za wcześnie i musieliśmy czekać w kolejce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba siedzieć całą noc z otwartymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Pierwszy raz słyszę od ciebie, że psy nie są mądre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i poklepał po pustym brzuszku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pochwycić linę, którą pan mi pokazał tam w tyle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnęła uciec od ludzi i jeszcze raz przyjrzeć się czarodziejskiemu pokoikowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę tedy szukać dalej, a ja się trochę prześpię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy właściwie w nim samym była jakaś złość piekielna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyganiasz? — zawołała, nie mogąc się powstrzymać dłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc ciemną nocą, kiedy mieszkańcy fortu posnęli, Biały Kieł zębami spróbował kij.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To będzie pierwsza i ostatnia rzecz, która będzie „nią”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20886034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Patrz! Lecą i czerwonaki! - zawołała nagle Nel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy pływały jak lilie na wodzie i drgały lekko; niebo było jak jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam go, jak miałam sześć lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewa, krzewy i trawa służące za jedyne schronienie też nie ułatwiają przetrwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jest rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Planowaliśmy w trójkę pojechać w Bieszczady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno się ruszać! — mówił ktoś pochylony nade mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się ironicznie zakrwawionym pyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli łagodnie i lekko pijani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona stropiła się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jest dzień wagarowicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan uległ zapewne pomyłce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec, milcząc, ssał swój tatarak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z najgłębszą wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk tego imienia, szept tego imienia, jego zapach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie otworzył oczu i udawał, że drzemie w dalszym ciągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczemu on robi błędy, jak nas uczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To znów zależy od okoliczności, które go wywołały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też pan mówi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Popatrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goethe jest zdania, że chrześcijańskie słowo „Bóg” jest tylko inną odmianą słowa „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siedzi delegat królów i drzemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli to był sen, można było jej wybaczyć te kuchenne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straciłem władzę zmieniania przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego pan jeszcze chce ode mnie? — zagadnął znów niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ooo! — zapłakał chór mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki gatunek filmu lubisz najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do stołu i — nie patrząc na pole operacyjne — ujął delikatnie jelita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty nie jesteś moją matką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu zaprosił Machalski mnie i Wokulskiego do siebie na wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niech pan sobie przypomni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mgnieniu oka chwycili mnie dwaj policjanci i nałożyli kajdanki na ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyprowadź ją tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy wejdziesz między wrony, musisz krakać jak i one.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy kto pójdzie po chirurga?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wybaczy mi pan, pewny jestem tego, że przedsięwezmę niezawodne środki ostrożności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl o odkryciu mnie wywietrzała mi zupełnie z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pułkownik Stefan Gerard umrze niezwykłą śmiercią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25189495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te zastanowiły mnie w przykry sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była za piękna, by nie przyznać jej racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ich Eskimosi bardzo obchodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny ułatwić korzystanie z tego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nasi klienci dowiedzą się, że współpracujemy z takimi ludźmi, mogą wyniknąć kłopoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za złudzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nachylić się nisko, do ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie wicher — przykrość, dla niego — uciecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz powiedz, dlaczego jesteś zły? — Bo on cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię filmy dokumentalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranek był jasny, majowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte są bramy domów i zgaszone światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wiesz, dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizatorzy starają się podkreślić przede wszystkim świąteczną i rodzinną atmosferę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgryźliwy i nieustępliwy kulawiec narzekał wówczas na wściubską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tulił głowę do jej kolan w pokorze uwielbienia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak gdyby nigdy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet kierownik, cała szkoła robi się od razu świąteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzi do mnie wtedy, gdy w domu są awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To też nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli wczoraj wieczorem w parku i trzymali się jak zakochani za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą przytacza on opinię cudzą, nie własną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hę? — intruz nastawił uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy tydzień upłynął niemal cały na przygotowaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czapki nie można znaleźć i w bek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze wówczas dębem, przykutym do miejsca i do własnego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu na chwilę zacisnęło oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki miły — podobny do doktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynieś no wiadro, Tomaszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i wierzę ci na słowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydał cichy syk, ujął jej dłoń, pociągnął ją w dół i upadła na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez pracy nie ma kołaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może pod wpływem skruchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idealna pogoda na rower!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak stało się i nic na świecie faktu nie odmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ozwij się, ozwij! — powtórzył z kolei Podlasiak, tym samym słowom nadając odcień modlitewny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc nie chcesz obiecać, że mu nie będziesz dokuczał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłużej tu dzisiaj pozostać nie możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie tylko ryzykuję tę podróż na północ, do twego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również będę mieć go na oku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten może będzie coś wiedział, może gdzieś zadzwoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę opowiadał o swojej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie jest to zbiorowy kompleks mniejszej war tości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Hoooo. Jak gwiazdy - uśmiechnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że nie zgodziłby się tak łatwo na utratę Stachy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Emil nigdy nie wybierał Zosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy ocknął się z zamyślenia i spojrzał nań przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie brzmi dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki temu nie patrzymy na to ciało jako na model anatomiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bo jasny pan lekki jak pióro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudowna celowość natury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stół Emila: maszyna do pisania, bałagan, papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto jest obecnym prezydentem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niski budynek był prawdopodobnie stajnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustaw termostat w dużym pokoju na maksimum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho być, nagrywam podcast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwaga zaczęła mnie opuszczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mierzył przynajmniej sześć stóp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał na sobie ciemny uniform i jakiś kapelusz z białem piórkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie przejrzałem natychmiast plan tego nędznego stworzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pułkownikowi towarzyszył jakiś kulas w czarnym ubiorze, w białym krawacie i białych mankietach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jego wprawiły mnie w drżenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22758376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz nie znał mnie jeszcze, to też skłoniłem się tylko i milczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu konstatuje fakt i zaznacza jego objawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spieszyło mi się do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzyłem dni i zrobiło mi się nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo! — pocieszył go Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo przyszło, łatwo poszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie mogę się tak mę czyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię spać przy otwartym oknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym elementem kształtującym człowieka jest genetyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wara ode mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy godzinę i spotkamy się w jadalni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcierać lekko na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21915605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się poinformować, czy można ją jeszcze zapisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do południa — powtórzył — do południa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chodzili uśmiechnięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów wiatr i deszcz prosto w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrał się i wybiegł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzę, kto weselszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był naprawdę pracowity rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los smutny odniósł walne zwycięstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysnuł też cały szereg wniosków równie fałszywych, jak samo założenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulokowali panią w okropnej dziurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem tylko rycerzem, ale nie dworakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zachwytu zacząłem się tarzać po ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zachodzi, niezadługo będzie ósma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mały i sprytnie unika ciosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pan go opuści, postrada pan całe stanowisko na zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mapy obliczyłem sobie odległość do szczytu góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz gra rozpoczęła się na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zależało mi bardzo na tem, abym wystąpił w stroju cywilnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie zadawał sobie takich pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22729125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu przeglądarka mi się zwiesiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat reformujący ma zasadnicze znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie posunięcie to pierwszy krok do odebrania spekulantom tego, czego pożądają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno nikogo zmuszać wbrew jego woli do pracy w nadgodzinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako sprawozdawczymi, czy mogę jeszcze coś powiedzieć na temat poprawek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa jest prosta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oparciu o trzy czynniki, chciałabym przedstawić trzy propozycje naprawcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście uważam, że przyjęcie ogólnego celu dla wszystkich państw członkowskich nie jest zbyt realistyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za pracę należy się odpowiednie wynagrodzenie - jest to podstawowa zasada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym bardzo podziękować komisarzowi i pani za informacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26346547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka jest konsekwencja tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy nie będziemy przyjaciółmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież nie był szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co zjesz, mała? — zapytał, a ona płakała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała otwory w tej walizce, żeby się nie udusiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meteor pędzi pode mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam cię, ale koperta jest zaklejona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkość działania nie była cechą natury młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytaj od trzeciego wiersza z góry!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby było inaczej, nie okazałby pan tej chwalebnej przezorności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pianista dlatego nie może grać, bo zdaje sobie sprawę, że może nie móc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałam się pomacać trochę fotografowi z przeciwka i zdjęcia już są.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak — tym dziwniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkość działania nie była cechą natury młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokój! — wołał z uniesieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże drogi, jak to czas płynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówi pan do mnie rzeczy tak dziwne i tak mnie obchodzące…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za szybą ciągnęły się rzędy regałów z książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel, która nad wszystko w świecie lubiła jeździć na wielbłądzie, otrzymała obietnicę od ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do pokoju powrócił, zaraz legł na łoże\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzeworyty, książki i ebooki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę mu odpowiedzieć na to pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, nawet tata nie wiedział, jak szła na operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień nadjeżdżały jedne za drugimi wozy pełne mebli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzibą gminy była Berezowica Wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie komisarzu, padło pytanie do pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie w świat, tylko z powrotem do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Podlasiak gdzie? — zapytał z niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem ani Podlasiak, ani jednoręki nie powitali nowej obietnicy radosnymi okrzykami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej radosnym kiwnięciem głowy stwierdzili w milczeniu obecność w dębie dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów uważam, że to było uczciwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witamy studentów z Europejskiego Uniwersytetu w Rzymie, którzy są obecni na balkonie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połowy sardeli w Zatoce Biskajskiej mają duże znaczenie społeczno-ekonomiczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezbędne jest uwzględnienie sieci lotnisk i zgadzam się na to\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blogi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólne korzyści gospodarcze znacznie przewyższą koszty, jakie poniosą producenci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska szanuje wysiłki Rady Europy na rzecz szerzenia i ochrony praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniósł wzrost bezrobocia, nierówności i wstrząsy społeczne na szczeblu krajowym i regionalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie powinno się pomijać pilnych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35965729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zrealizować zobowiązania podjęte w związku z milenijnymi celami rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg komnat, które zmieniają się w cyrk podziemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On by chciał, żebyśmy czekali tysiąc lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — odpowiedziała — spotkaliśmy ją oboje niedawno na ulicy w porze wieczornej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spod odrzuconego w tył kaptura wychyliła się twarzyczka zaczerwieniona ze zmęczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam uczucie, że tam byłaś w tym ogrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pieniędzy nie przyjęła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to jest Bernard? — Bernard to jest nakrapiany pies, który zdechł zeszłe go roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To szaleństwo i zabobon! — krzyknąłem wzburzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie można było rozróżnić zarysy dzbanka i miski na wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wlazłam na płot i rzuciłam psom zatrute mięso.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazajutrz po południu rozpętała się burza, a woda lała się strumieniami z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dama nie siadała, ale za to zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgosłup moralny nie pozwoliłby ani pani, ani mnie robić wspólnie interesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli czerwone uszy i byli nie bardzo przytomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę uratować tę odrobinę ziarna, jaka jeszcze pozostała pomiędzy kamieniami młyńskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewnego wieczora… — poddałem mu, ułatwiając wyznania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba wycierpieć i coś stracić, żeby zyskać więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I moja miłość do ciebie wplątana w to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec, milcząc, ssał swój tatarak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były to istotnie poruszające wydarzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszczędność energii rozwiązuje całą masę problemów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do ostatniej chwili nie widzieliśmy czy sesja się w ogóle odbędzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy baczyć na kumulatywne skutki środków, które przyjmujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli dobrze zrozumieliśmy, liderzy grup, którzy reprezentowali Parlament, obrazili prezydenta tego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego trzeba było odrzucić to sprawozdanie, ponieważ skala tej patologii jest nadmierna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś winnym kryzysu Unia daje pomoc z kieszeni obywateli, a ofiary likwiduje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znakowanie pomoże także chronić zdrowie publiczne oraz środowisko naturalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale brakuje całościowego planu rozwiązania problemu niedostatecznej kapitalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26995237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że w tym, co Pani tu powiedziała właśnie o to chodziło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ścisłym znaczeniu może być prawdziwe tylko zdanie, i to w sensie logistyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I moja miłość do ciebie wplątana w to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem obróciłam się do ściany i chciałam spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — jęczał przewodnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był barszcz zdrowy, zawiesisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiedzieli, że rabuś, a nikt mu nie mógł dowieść niczego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip na wpół nieprzytomny od dymu, kicha potężnie i budzi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszał się, gdy weszła matka, pokojówka Janka i stróż Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, mnie to dobrze robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwiła tylko Stasia jego uporczywość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po co ci znowu szybowiec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten rok uznaje się za początek ery samolotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdążyłem ją ukryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak razem dają trzecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To więzień z sąsiedniej celi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak okropnej wieści nie słyszała jeszcze w swym życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konie powinny dzisiaj wypocząć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synek szwagierki leżał chory w sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21201416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zaś, co cię w tak wielkie wprawiło zdumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z tego nie będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwiądłem jako siano i wyschło serce moje, — żem zapomniał pożywać chleba mojego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No racja, komu by się chciało nagrywać tyle zdań?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy egiptolog podniósł i obejrzał starannie pistolet barona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy w życiu drgnąłem ze strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie, zabiłem Bourbona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nabrałem odwagi, i zacząłem czynić przygotowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dwóch lub trzech podobnych próbach, posłał znowu po mechanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to się robi wynalazki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25109831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłużyli sobie na dzielnego dowódcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty mnie do tego zmusiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nachyliłem się i pocałowałem, a on oczy przymrużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On miał amerykański akcent, a Anna miała australijski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecie pies też boskie stworzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Allach mnie ukarał, żem go wyzwał i kusił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wszelka „twórczość” nie pochodzi z tych źródeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak sprawozdanie jest nieprzyjemne z więcej niż jednego powodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowy wniosek jest krokiem w dobrym kierunku, dlatego też zagłosowałem za jego przyjęciem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz jasna zasada pomocniczości oznacza, że nie należy to do kompetencji europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli tak, to czy Komisja podjęła próby inicjatyw publicznych w celu złagodzenia tego problemu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jednak ocena \\\"uśredniona\\\" i właśnie w tym leży cały problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeprowadzając reformy swoich systemów emerytalnych, wiele państw członkowskich dokonało drastycznych cięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto chciałabym częściej w tej izbie słyszeć głos Romów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo więzienia tak samo, jak szkoły, bywają różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o ustawiczną możność badania, czy Komisja przekroczyła swoje uprawnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31177610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszymy się, że ta reguła wygasa za sześć miesięcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi fantazja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem te dwa przełączniki i aktywowałem je wszystkie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może jest to strach o własny portfel, jak niektórzy próbują zauważyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał pan czytać, jak polują na foki, na morsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, czyje te paznokcie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę się przekonać, kto to taki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz o północy nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nic wspólnego pomiędzy wolnymi ludami puszczy, a tą bandą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w życiu bardzo zajęty kobietami i zagadnieniem przemiany gatunków bakterii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Psia krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i zawrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż nie zrozumiałem ani słówka z tego, co mi mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnął z pewną ulgą: Darek nie zabrał ze sobą strzelby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23872045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani, że to przede wszystkim osoby starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona oznajmiła gestem, że chciałaby także coś robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora wracać do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostowała się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustawodawstwo i inne środki stworzą mu wszelkie możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokornie panu profesorowi dziękuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, jak śmieszna jest ta nadęta buzia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po wirtuozowsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie były nogi żywej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale twój tato musi mieć kupę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszłoroczna zbiórka poszła naprawdę kiepsko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy napełniły oczy słuchaczy, a mury budynku zadrżały od okrzyków zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej, dotychczas przykucnięci, powstali nagle z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślałem nad tym, że społeczeństwo ludzkie to jedna ogromna sieć pomyłek i głupstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwią już liczne komentarze na temat jej najnowszego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy Emil zrobił nieokreśloną minę i rozbeczał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — odpowiedziała — spotkaliśmy ją oboje niedawno na ulicy w porze wieczornej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale przynajmniej ta pociecha, że nie spotkałam się z diabłami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pierwszy ten lepszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przełącznik wydaje się być już włączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po pokoju i udaję, że nie wiem, o co chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22233992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23679301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spiesz się, mamy czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieczenie gorącej oliwy, ale nie bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia! — pochwycił jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wszystkich coś szwankuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sama, co u Emila na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, a teraz, panienko, czas wstawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelano jak na manewrach, z zimną krwią i celnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Twoja mamusia powiedziała, że nie będzie cię więcej biła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już wpół do dziewiątej wieczorem, kiedy Wokulski wracał do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz Czerwonego Krzyża“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały tydzień razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bawisz się?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani jest za dobra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukam cię i oczekiwałem dość długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpi bitwa, szturm, może pożar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małgorzata, najstarsza z dziewcząt, miała lat szesnaście; była bardzo ładna, pulchna i biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24295896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czuję, iż ją zobaczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ciastka są wyborne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wilki zawyły z trwogi..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma innej rady, jak powiedzieć? — Nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dwie głowy, to nie jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała zmysł orientacyjny i wyczucie miejsc nieznanych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek Komisji nie rozwiewał tych wszystkich zastrzeżeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcemy, aby doszło do takich sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowaliśmy za odrzuceniem całego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie trzecie obywateli powiedziało \\\"tak\\\", frekwencja była wyższa niż w roku ubiegłym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Niemczech istnieje wymóg, aby służby specjalne i policja działały odrębnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uda nam się dzięki programowi sztokholmskiemu, który jest pięcioletnim programem prac\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest rozmową na temat odejścia od jakiegokolwiek traktowania sektorowego polityk europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwalimy państwa posiadające tradycję i kulturę silnego partnerstwa społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te elementy są niezmiernie ważne dla zapewnienia konkretnego charakteru i jakości samego znaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27433530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmniejszając zakres kompetencji Komisji w tym obszarze, nie przekażemy właściwego przesłania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś ty z nimi chodził i coście tam gadali tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była przyzwyczajona do ukrywania się nawet wtedy, gdy była sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po trafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyło się na gadach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddałby, oddał na pewno, bo chciałby pozostać uczciwym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, że właśnie postąpilibyście tak, a nie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na miarę lat siedemdziesiątych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W imieniu Boga i proroka jego Mahometa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam czytał po łacinie i grecku tak, jak Emil T.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał się kurczowo świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nalegaj, Kazik, dłużej, bo się pogniewamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda była chyba jeszcze gorsza niż w dniu poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A łydka? — pytałem niecierpliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzili do jednego gimnazjum, do różnych oddziałów tej samej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz słyszę już…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32309629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście będziemy nadal prowadzili ścisłe konsultacje z Parlamentem i państwami członkowskimi w tym względzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32309630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka jest strategia tej organizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32309631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachodzi zatem pytanie, co Rada Unii Europejskiej zrobi z tym sprawozdaniem z własnej inicjatywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32309632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostało ono przyjęte dużą większością głosów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32309633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to bardzo ważne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32316930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W państwach członkowskich musimy zmagać się z popytem i podażą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32316931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że obie strony chcą sfinalizować umowę przed najbliższymi czerwcowymi wyborami europejskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32316932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta wspólnota jest dzisiaj dyskryminowana, atakowana, w końcu mordowana tylko w jednym celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32316933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że w niektórych państwach członkowskich wykonalne zastosowania już są częścią istniejących strategii politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32316934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem, ciężar dowodu zostanie odwrócony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robi Unia Europejska?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza praca nie polega na codziennym zarządzaniu w skali mikro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aresztowano tysiące działaczy opozycji, a ponad sto osób straciło życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od strony praktycznej dane te trzeba przechowywać i przetwarzać zgodnie ze szczegółowym prawodawstwem europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy jeszcze mieć okazję, aby je kontynuować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że sprawozdawca także zgodzi się z tym wnioskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też chcę powtórzyć to, co pan sam powiedział\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palestyna jest terytorium islamskim, i to niezbywalnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zieloni cieszą się również z wagi przywiązywanej do wpływu kryzysu na kobiety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy bezkompromisowo sprzeciwiać się takiemu prawu i uciskowi kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy myśleli, że jestem szalony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wojna nareszcie się skończy?! — zawołałem głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysz rozpytywał ciekawie o stosunki w cukrowni i w okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął strzelbę z ramienia i podał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę więc w kącie na łóżku, jak osaczony kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka, kiedy zaczną znów rozpytywać, kim jest i skąd przybył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola, która to usłyszała: — Idę też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzili do jednego gimnazjum, do różnych oddziałów tej samej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech rozniesie to wszystko mnie też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z nich było dwóch żołnierzy, w drugiej — trzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już nie posiada ani grosza własnego majątku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bądź w gorącej wodzie kąpany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem następuje uzasadnienie, jak zwykle przekonujące, ale nieprawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W razie oporu z jego strony, można go zabić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydzę się poprostu spojrzeć na pana, panie kapitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następne trzy starcia przeszły jednakowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległy się bardziej groźne wymysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już teraz było widoczne, że wysokość nagrody przekroczy sto funtów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utrzymywanie psów leżało w zwyczaju miejscowej ludności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę iść i otworzyć nam drzwi natychmiast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz gospodarz był wielkim smakoszem i zawsze przekładał lepsze na potem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale lisa, na którego polowano teraz, nikt jakoś nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległy się śmiechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoniono na trzeci wyścig.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jakiej ziemi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz pozostając, czy nie przeszkodzę twojej przechadzce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król dotrzymał słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi biło ze wzruszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc znalazł on swoją drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mówię ci, bądź spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie pan nowinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23805784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To więc jest wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle głupstwo ich zajmie, ale tylko na krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedzcie sami na zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spod odrzuconego w tył kaptura wychyliła się twarzyczka zaczerwieniona ze zmęczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opracował zasady i zbiory idei, które ja dzisiaj noszę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Służę panu — odpowiedział grzecznie, strzepując popiół z cygara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedział: — Pogadamy o tym dokładnie wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz na tym nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pagórku stał żółty dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nago.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28195135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonana, że tak się stanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28195136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdarzyło się to nigdy wcześniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28195137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam się zatem również do Rady o odrzucenie wniosku Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28195138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest Europa podejmująca działania, a właśnie działań potrzebujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28195139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoże to również osobom cierpiącym na alergie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28204513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem wybór jest prosty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28204514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strategia dla Morza Bałtyckiego będzie jednym z priorytetów prezydencji szwedzkiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28204515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli komunikat jest następujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28204516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zaskakują mnie nieco stwierdzenia, jakie padły w tej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28204517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłem dużo notatek podczas różnych wypowiedzi, które tu wygłoszono\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe jej ciało drgało, wstrząsane falami cichego wewnętrznego śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, czy ona o czymś myśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok ten znów krew wzburzył w panu Tadeuszu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana w długi szlafrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden tylko Gerwazy za czasów młodości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamusia mi zawsze powie: „lustro”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta druga czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, gdzie jest postój taksówek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że nie okazujesz zapału do języka francuskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew spłynęła po twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca do kraju boso i na piechotę, tak jakoś wypada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też bardzo się Maciuś ucieszył, że Felek chce iść do fabryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też domyślił się, żeśmy tylko o nim mówili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzałem przez lunetę na księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień musiał nabrać woli, władzy, decyzji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie z tchórzostwa, lecz dla idei!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawy - zresztą niewinne - łazęgostwo i urwisostwo, pochłonęły go jak jakiś żywioł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejechawszy kilka metrów, dorożka się zatrzymała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można kochać, jeżeli się nie zna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25099779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety jeszcze się uczą tańczyć, ale mężczyźni wcale nie... Wcale nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba nie wymaga dalszych komentarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiadomości te poruszyły do żywego starego Krzyżaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie uważam tego za sprawę wyłącznie krajową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chodzi o to, że dopiero teraz odkryliśmy konieczność zareagowania na globalizację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dołożyć starań, by temu zapobiec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzią są inwestycje państwowe, które zapewnią darmowe kształcenie na wszystkich szczeblach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To uzupełnienie polityki sąsiedztwa, którą prowadzą organy wykonawcze Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tradycyjne drobne rybołówstwo przybrzeżne może czasem zapewnić zrównoważone zarządzanie zasobami rybnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niefortunnie jednak w przedmiotowym pakiecie pomija się Bośnię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36604821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto zanieczyszczenie mórz pochodzące z lądu stanowi znaczną część całkowitego zanieczyszczenia środowiska morskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy myślisz, że uda się to uczynić podczas jej snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżem niegodzien zaufania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też Hanna potrafiłaby przyrządzić filiżankę dobrej kawy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w tym wypadku mam wrażenie, że zwrócimy się o pomoc do Londynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Szczebrzeszynie chrząszcz brzmi w trzcinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” W przedpokoju okazało się, że jest zupełnie przemo czona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało się to jakąś upiorną bajką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ zbliżały się święta Bożego Narodzenia postanowili, że Staś i Nel pojadą z nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, jak stał na tem krześle i przybijał wielki obraz ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rękami Zosię z góry aż do dołu macał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24746385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadusisz się jeszcze, zrób se przerwę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24746386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej więc nie zaczepiać tych kwestyj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24746387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trefle były atutem, rozumiecie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24746388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on chyba był bardzo chorym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24746389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja nie jestem obłąkany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24750672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wściekłości byłbym się był tarzał po ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24750674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale trudno; nie można zawsze żyć jak w klasztorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24750675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im zrobisz pan to bezwzględniej, tem pewniej cię pokocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24750677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trasa przez Pojezierze Drawskie jest bardziej malownicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24750679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy umilkli, do uszu Wokulskiego doleciał szept barona i panny Eweliny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokuczamy jej czasem, ale dzielna z niej dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna rzecz, że to z Panem było całkiem na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając pokręcił się po podwórzu, ale psy z obu stron zachodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja wiem, że ona nie lubi żadnego ruszania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Termin dla mnie niezupełnie jasny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są twoje urodziny, więc zapraszam cię na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność, wiadomo, jest złym towarzyszem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężona ręka lewa wskazywała coś uparcie w dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda to na kieszonkowe złodziejstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty nie jesteś moją matką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdźmy z naszym problemem pomiędzy lud prymitywny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak myślę — tak wierzę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę w tym miejscu podkreślić dwa z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy być w stanie zatrzymać naszych najlepszych naukowców i innowatorów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy tolerować faktu, że niektórzy pracujący ludzie często są zależni od opieki społecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.188,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wielkim zainteresowaniem oczekuję zakończenia procesu ratyfikacji i niecierpliwie czekam na rozpoczęcie jego wdrażania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tematem jest sprzeciw wobec potępiania demonstracji w Bahrajnie oraz krytykowania ich przebiegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgowce oraz ssaki z rzędu naczelnych są objęte szczególną ochroną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W swoim sprawozdaniu Komisja koncentruje się jedynie na najlepszych sposobach wprowadzenia elektronicznej identyfikacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że sprawa ta jest dla Europy znacznie ważniejsza niż zmiany klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.26,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzymy panom udanego pobytu i owocnych dyskusji z przedstawicielami Parlamentu Europejskiego, Komisji i Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27759144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto nasza branża turystyczna działająca nad morzem ma ogromny potencjał wzrostu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojcze, ja swej żony nie opuszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka? — Ma dziś wychodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokażę wówczas, do czego zdolny jest mąż wielki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziesiąta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ zbliżały się święta Bożego Narodzenia postanowili, że Staś i Nel pojadą z nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła na niego, ale poprzez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała załoga krzątała się więc żwawo i wnet odzyskano dobre humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, była dosyć zadowolona z samej siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20868540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich miesiącach podróży, przybyli do jeziora, leżącego na południe od Abisynii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastanów się pan — podjął Filip.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar nie jest nawet zabawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obyśmy wszyscy żyli dobrze i zgodnie z sobą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec, milcząc, ssał swój tatarak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że morderca spełniał akt w stanie na pół przytomnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł żwawo głowę jak cebulkę i zobaczył mały wózek z jarzynami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzyliśmy też tymczasem swoje, na szczęście lekkie rany i trochę wypoczęliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieubłagana wola kierowała mnie w stronę Parkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz zasępił się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no by go spytał o paszport ten przechodzący patrol…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie słońce zsunęło się nisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dorośli nie lubią się sami schylać, bo ich kości bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Babunia nigdy w życiu nie chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Haczyk od okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brunatny księżyc pełzał po zboczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trafisz do dziupli? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak kiwnął mi: „To pan nic o tym nie wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka jego miała mnie zawiadomić natychmiast, gdy ojciec powróci z żydowskiego ratusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech cię szlag trafi i krew nagła zaleje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawie nic.“ Przerwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem było to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewidentnie zabrakło im chęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co myśli i co zamierza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściśle tego samego dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to na zakończenie mówił mi student o tandeciarzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wargi podniósł do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istotnie niemiła historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ściętych białkach zagrało poranne słońce okrutnym uśmiechem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie oczekuje od ciebie milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź zadzwoń po Łysego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20654999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj byłem u znajomego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mistrzynią w sztuce kochania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok naocznie sprawdzonego sęka napełnił ich jakąś nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za napój?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na trzeci dzień Noel zaczął kichać i kaszleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istotnie niemiła historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co się dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane głosem, który nie powstał w krtani; głosem brzuchomówcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W atelier zapadło głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekają panią w niedalekiej przyszłości zawody i niepowodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Darowanemu koniowi nie zagląda się w zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział szeptem: — Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęła ją zgroza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas śniadania zobaczył, że narzeczony Krystyny jest dziobaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schował rewolwer do kieszeni i chwycił pałkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę być w oknie pociągu w Rudawie, gdzie będę wsiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go niezdecydowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, co teraz się z nim stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mało panu jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę! — zawołał Krzysiek zarumieniony z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20809479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze szczególnej ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z tych ksiąg stanowiły rzadkie okazy i kosztowały olbrzymie pieniądze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trwało to ledwie parę sekund i oto wobec ustawy karnej staliśmy się włamywaczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem lubię książki i chętnie wśród nich przebywam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą rozpatrzmy się w całej tej sprawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozdzierającem serce było pożegnanie jego z ukochaną dziewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu z miejscowych komunistów czerwonymi są tylko z nazwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pochylił się i w zupełnej ciszy usłyszeliśmy plusk wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samemu w domu nudno...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojgu łzy się rzuciły z oczów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21561279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwi mnie to, że nie przedstawiłeś się dotąd mistrzowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta trzecia trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W ten sposób całość wypadłaby zbyt poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ty zapewne przystroiłaś stół tymi śmieciami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie byłoby to dziwnie… na Boga! — burknął czeladnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grunt jednak pod nią był czarny i nosił ślady ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Henry nie odrzekł nic, lecz przeżuwał dalej w milczeniu. Skończywszy fasolę, zapił ją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowała pilnie w porze, kiedy powinna była kłaść się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20829560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytknął równo kutasa, popchnął i uderzył\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22185496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierzaj mi, że ci zabalsamowani ludzie są mało podobni do żywych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho… on śpi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej, w czym mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja już nic nie chcę — nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi wyjść na jaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na twarzy jej zjawił się wyraz przestrachu i rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia usiłuje zapewnić sobie odpowiednie narzędzia polityki zagranicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Flagi i hymny są dla narodów, a nie dla stowarzyszeń współpracy gospodarczej między państwami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chodzi tutaj o zmianę o kilka setnych, kilka dziesiątych czy o kilka punktów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.188,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście dla mieszkańców Haiti duże znaczenie ma długoterminowe odbudowanie infrastruktury i instytucji państwowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem jak najszybciej to zróbmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcecie obdarować jeńca wolnością?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie to próbowaliśmy zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, czy te wysiłki będą owocne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po piąte, że zniesie karę śmierci lub ogłosi moratorium w sprawie kary śmierci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37239051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, chciałabym zwrócić państwa uwagę na wysiłki i zaangażowanie na całym świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półhalucynacje, które były zmieszane z drzewami w parku, z bawiącymi się dziećmi, z ulicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle strach i boi się do niej podejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten był znacznie wyższy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekł tylko jeden żołnierz, dwóch leżało z przestrzelonymi głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast zniechęcić, jeszcze bardziej rozpala się w Maciusiu niecierpliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie ma sensu przekonywać, tłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto miał rzeczywiście krzywo zapięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zechce ze mną zatańczyć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mamy zrobić? — odezwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25755705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Butelka jakaś leci na ścianę i pęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25755715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem gdy upadł, zemdlał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25755717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan wziął bambusową ramkę, do której arkusz był przytwierdzony, i czytał co następuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25755733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu znalazłem siebie, tak się wszystko zjednoczyło we mnie pod naciskiem woli nasłuchiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy nadchodzi cierpienie, najlepiej nie unikać go wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie… tobie nie wolno tam wchodzić — oznajmiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziś nie będzie lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszy pan jeszcze o mnie, gdyby panu przyszła ochota powrócić do starych sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bijesz więc medale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pomimo, to nadejdzie dzień, w którym my zobaczymy się z sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25796734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju wtedy działo się coś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął nóź kuchenny i podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dlatego, że teraz już jesteś rybakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z upiorem pogadam! — zawołała wesoło dziwożona i uśmiechnęła się ukradkiem do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy oto przysięgam i pierwszy będę dbał o wypełnienie umówionych warunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nicość jest nieskończonością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał dużo; szybko, często powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za rozpaczliwa posucha bieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczy chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy nie znacie miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam skierowaliśmy z Halszką swe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My tutaj byliśmy i jesteśmy na tym punkcie ułomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil połykał ciągle ślinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał pan czytać, jak polują na foki, na morsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyjmij ode mnie sześć pensów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze dzieckiem, ale wiedziałem, co to znaczy, wiedziałem doskonale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezmierzona siła elektryczna zastąpiła siłę koni i wołów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, nie powiesz mi o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąską uliczkę między dwoma rzędami bazarów wypełniał skłębiony malowniczo tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy musi robić to, co mnie się podoba — rzekł obojętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była w dalszym ciągu bardzo grzeczna, bardzo dziecinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dżonki chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę zawsze sama, albo z mężczyznami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mu położono złoty zegarek, zobaczył orła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, ale to nikt, nie może sobie zdać sprawy z czyjejś śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nacisnęło mu coś lekko oddech i serce, zęby zaczęły mu szczękać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zyskuje tylko na tem zarząd fabryki, który za czas przerw nie płaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale należy go odróżnić od mojego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli tego płomienia nie ugasi, to padnie trupem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy myślisz, że uda się to uczynić podczas jej snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem go wówczas nogą i przyłożyłem mu dłoń do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobry żołnierz w kraju nieprzyjacielskim powinien mieć się zawsze na baczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słusznie czynisz, pozostawiając jej majątek, ale co do uciech życia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starcie skończyło się dla niego niepochlebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrośni o siebie wzajemnie, jak dwie głośne piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś dla mnie jedyną w świecie kobietą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25822368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinność bronienia życia i mienia poddanych powołała go na granice kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jem na kolację sałatkę jarzynową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam, już chcę wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba nie jest sodomia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z najgłębszą wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze cmentarze muszą mieć wygląd zupełnie odmienny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ślepo! — upewnił Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Jarmark cieszył się olbrzymią popularnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nimi piętrzył się las bukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze delegat podpisał w księdze więziennej pokwitowanie, że odebrał Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak one wyglądają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak wam się udało zepsuć latarnię? — pyta się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miesiączka jest ciągłym memento vivere.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela wstrząsnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katarzyna uśmiechała się do niej; nigdy tak szczęśliwą nie była i rzecz dziwna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.548,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mogłaś uwierzyć, że to ja jestem mordercą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo następnego tygodnia i za dwa tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie palił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sumienie go ujęło podstępnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miło nam dodać, że obecnie cieszy się dobrem zdrowiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zniszczona, ale bardzo pańska fizjonomia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24796297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, co prawda, takich intercyz nie pisywałem, ha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat ten stawia przed nami nowe cele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawmy więc czoła wyzwaniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prace nad wdrożeniem traktatu lizbońskiego już się zaczęły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wystarczy, jeśli konsumenci są dobrze chronieni w jednym kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co próbuje powiedzieć Europa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im nawet nie powinno się pozwolić na ubieganie się o wizę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast odpowiedziałem, że my także będziemy pościć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Amerykanie doradzili szachowi budowę dwudziestu elektrowni jądrowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu proces ten jest otwarty, a Turcja ma status kraju kandydującego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego uważam, że spotka się to z pełnym poparciem naszej grupy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26676186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samo to jednak nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faunie, mów, czego się żalisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zależało jej na tym, a jednak nie istniał już poza nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyszło do tego niespodziewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale mnie potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem znów pozostali sami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodów przecież nigdy nie braknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, dezaktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztan zaczął z wolna wydzielać swój nocny zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed samą wieczerzą wrócili do obozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju ciekawie obejrzał bratanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ja jestem od niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On by chciał, żebyśmy czekali tysiąc lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieczenie gorącej oliwy, ale nie bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to jednak szczególne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja twojego starego bardzo lubię, i to jest w swoim rodzaju morowy typ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą do sklepu i kupują gotowe masło, nie widziały nigdy jak ono powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli człowiek nie czyta książek, nie może być świadomym i rozumującym obywatelem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną mi dłoń wypuśćcie na swobodę! — napierała się, zerkając błagalnie na Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On siedział, jej głowa leżała na jego kolanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam własne lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna rzecz, że to z Panem było całkiem na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko należy chronić przed wszelkiego rodzaju zaniedbaniem, okrucieństwem i wyzyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam widzę go każdego ranka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20679186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z góry obiecuję spełnić wszystko co do joty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wiesz, dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.646,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.836,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.489,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.515,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.463,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.358,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.698,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.802,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.541,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21935798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.097,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam widzę go każdego ranka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją na ramę i pojechali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc żeby się potem nie gniewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem też od lat dziecięcych, że ludzi tych zjednywać sobie trzeba podarkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies notorycznie mi ucieka goniąc zwierzynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co mi dasz? Tamten odpowiada na serio i poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło tlić się na mnie ubranie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma żal do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedny, biedny, biedny Maciuś!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym bardziej jestem w skórze innych, tym wyżej wznosi się moje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, Leo, mam wielką ochotę przytoczyć tu jeden wykład, ale boję się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie porwałem! — odrzekł z namaszczeniem — Sama wyrosła na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno oko tak zbielało, że aż zgasło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelano jak na manewrach, z zimną krwią i celnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo źle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski podał to klaczy, która bez namysłu zjadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka leżała na podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźmy szczere względem tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Proszę mi dać duży kawał papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co pan sądzi o tem?“ zapytałem „Zdaje się, że to nic ważnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowi też ona stałą ochronę wszystkich wybitniejszych dygnitarzy sowieckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby go te mniszki nie odkryły, musiał go Hubert ukryć starannie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy mi tego na parę lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gżegżółka jest cudowna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25314012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hanna z niechęcią wstrząsnęła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25314013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz prędko przysunął do mojej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz powiedz, dlaczego jesteś zły? — Bo on cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwię się wcale, że wywołuje taki popłoch wśród dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boby od razu poznali, bo się zrobiłem czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dniem i nocą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrząsnęli tylko głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chodziło o wygranie atutów, położyłem więc waleta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział, że mam słuszność, że lepiej książki czytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie obrażaj mojej inteligencji, dobrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, gra jego była warta stawki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwól, niechaj rzeczy płyną same przez się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak czy siak, misja się powiodła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi pan, że jest to ograniczone tylko na Londyńczyków i dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan może myśli, że nie wiem, kim jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, jak lżej odetchnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegnij do strumienia i przynieś mi wody w kapelusz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to grzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz pan! — przerwała mi, wskazując na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odkąd ich w ogóle zauważyła, zaczęła popiół i śmiecie zrzucać im na głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem naprzód, aby się dowiedzieć, czy skłonny jesteś go przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam prawo się dowiedzieć, czy potrafi mnie pan wynagrodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech zobaczą salę balową, wydeptaną przez słonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazimy do pokoju przez okienko z łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tych bram, i domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są, zdaje się, w jednym wie ku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z upiorem pogadam! — zawołała wesoło dziwożona i uśmiechnęła się ukradkiem do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż zamierzył się Felek na majstra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo leżało takie kółeczko, od zegarka czy czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przy sobie ucznia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tam przecie nie ma komfortu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie patrzył nawet, jak się koło niego zabawiał Hannibal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ślepo! — upewnił Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w głębi ducha postanowiłem zrezygnować z tego zaszczytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam mowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz nie chciał przestać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to jaka mistyfikacja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyższe narkotyki dają wściekłe reakcje — zaraz widać ich szkodliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyloty rynien — potwory z otwartymi paszczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owego ranka było coś tajemniczego w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zakotłowało się w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpuszczono mnie do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortecę zburzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie pomoże koordynować sporządzanie krajowych planów reform\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umarł w młodym wieku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, w sprawozdaniu podkreślono potrzebę dokładnie określonych działań i konkretnego harmonogramu ich wdrażania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie dlatego głosuję przeciw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa nie słucha już głosu swoich obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolna, niezaburzona konkurencja to mit niszczący miejsca pracy i życia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat zewnętrzny zadaje pytania o przyczyny kryzysów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podkreślić potrzebę działania na rzecz zapobiegania także przemocy psychicznej wobec kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę jednak uwzględnić jedną rzecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innymi słowy, tworzymy politykę korzystną dla firm, a nie dla konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie to konsumenci zadecydują, czy zechcą kupować produkty z fok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26985721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki rozwój nie jest dziełem przypadku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stole zastał dwa listy i dużą kopertę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki wyciągnął z torby kubek blaszany, obejrzał go starannie i schował z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem znów pozostali sami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliżej ona drapała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie traćmy czasu! — zatrwożył się nagle jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyszło do tego niespodziewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiły się nam humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak struchlał i zbladł, jak przyłapany na gorącym uczynku winowajca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechaliśmy jeszcze dość długo głębokim wąwozem lub brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy się umówić, będziemy walczyli przy świadkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20841120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Japonii jest bardzo klimatycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20841121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"-Tak, Kiche żyła z wilkami - stwierdził trzeci Indianin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20841122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś struchlał na chwilę i zapomniał o strzelbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20841123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl, że oboje są w porozumieniu, dręczyła go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20841124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli wiesz, co to znaczy... Lecz Zosiu kochana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później Janek przeprowadzi się do tego narożnego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Glen — rzekł — weź to, przeczytaj i upewnij mnie, żem nie dostał udaru słonecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nas innych nie zwracasz, oczywiście, uwagi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógł pół Polski pogrążyć w odmęty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuła, iż pozwoliła sobie na czyn karygodny!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko pytałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” — Ala, nie spodziewałam się ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkim czworgu zmroziło krew w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszyłam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Piwo — Ser — Masło”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20819320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozum, Aniu, że ja so bie sam wyjaśniam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to zgoda…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddać ją żołnierzom ku zabawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I one pewnie pierwsze odpadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszukam sobie innego gniazda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ooo! — zapłakał chór mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trafisz do dziupli? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wpadniemy do mojej siostry na spaghetti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się nad nimi zbierać czarne chmury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiał tę pozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem jeszcze tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię muzykę klasyczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Podlasiak gdzie? — zapytał z niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A widzę wyraźnie, jakby wczoraj dopiero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważną częścią podejścia Komisji jest jej poparcie dla międzynarodowych standardów pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka tygodni temu w Brukseli odbyła się konferencja ze społeczeństwem obywatelskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie pozostanie bez wpływu na sytuację gospodarczą kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym tygodniu rozpoczęły się rozmowy w Genewie, które stanowią kolejny ważny krok naprzód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że pozostają jeszcze dwie kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwa, że dzisiejszego wieczoru możemy w końcu powiedzieć obywatelom Albanii i Bośni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązanie to jest istotne, ponieważ po pierwsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że przeprowadzenie kampanii informacyjnej w tym zakresie jest konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to bardzo wyraźnie powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też w związku z tą strategią musimy traktować je poważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest właściwy ekwiwalent, ponieważ ludzie będą je rozumieć jako \\\"jednolity\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40714379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszarów wiejskich nie da się jednak utrzymać przy życiu samymi dotacjami rolnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrzucała ruchami nonszalanckimi: królewna rzuca perły w morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W latarniach, które były wmurowane do bram domów, syczały kaganki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden się wymawiał, że śpiący i woli się rano myć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał pan czytać, jak polują na foki, na morsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bądź w gorącej wodzie kąpany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Never more.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś prościej, szlachetniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla kogo dobry, dla tego dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zastępowali tego gwarą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co z nich będzie? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, będziemy spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary już nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obciąć mu ręce i nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczy, starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był człowiek, z którym miałem rozmawiać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posiadam to w swojej mocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Portret cesarza na ścianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może włóczyć się po ulicach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siądź na krzesełku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani chwili nie tracić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zszedłem na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się go naprawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie udawało mu się to bynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem pomieszanie zmysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukam cię i oczekiwałem dość długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzinę grać będzie na skrzypcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"muszę mieć nerwy dobrze rozbite.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj byłbym ci powiedział: kocham Blankę i jestem szczęśliwy!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejście do autobusu jest możliwe tylko środkowymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zostali we dwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dasz mi twoje oczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy się coś nie stanie?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I począł się znów taki sam ostry spór, jak wczorajszego dnia z Arnoldem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie, gdzie był, robił zdjęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy to tak chodzą, jakby się sami nieśli pod pachą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyszko też tam musi być.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24432403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za wykończenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki spoważniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głębokie cienie kontrastują z jasnymi punktami kadrów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — odrzekł po chwili — o to chodzi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj, że niezależnie od tego kim byłeś, zawsze możesz się zmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wpadniemy do mojej siostry na spaghetti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładzie się na łóżko i pyta półserio, ostrożnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W omawianym dokumencie podnoszonych jest bardzo wiele ważnych kwestii dotyczących zdrowia i opieki zdrowotnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem świadomy, że jest to problem, którym ta Izba zajmuje się od długiego czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli tego zaniechamy, przyjdzie nam zapłacić za to w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usunie to niepewności i niespójności prawne oraz wprowadzi definicję i środki wykonawcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego apeluję o poparcie dla rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To akrobatyka budżetowa i pozory\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwo naszych społeczeństw jest niepodważalną wartością, którą musimy pielęgnować z pełnym przekonaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdają sobie państwo sprawę, że ludzie na całym świecie wyśmiewają politykę azylu i imigracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i oczywiście podziękowania dla tłumaczy ustnych, do których kieruję moje najpokorniejsze przeprosiny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcale nie myślimy o przyłączeniu Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ważny krok, ale pozostało jeszcze wiele pracy do wykonania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinna mieć również miejsca sytuacja, w której pewne sektory mają zapewniony określony zysk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32671381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy te należy oczywiście regularnie przeglądać i uaktualniać zależnie od sytuacji w danym kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Buruburu, ten stary portier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A widzę wyraźnie, jakby wczoraj dopiero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrącam rękami natrętny pstrokaty łeb, bronię ciała mego od jej dotknięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczenie twoje — rzekł — ma dużo cech prawdopodobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy płonęły mu dziwnym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością oczekuję przyszłego poniedziałku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Proszę pana, czy ja mogę pana pocałować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem grupki schodzą się w mieszkaniach, ale bardzo wcześnie wszystko idzie spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dościgną pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwadzieścia, no, powiedzmy trzydzieści tysięcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęliśmy z niego siodło i ciężary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli oszczędni w gestach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojciec nic o tym nie wie jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, co postanowili moi wrogowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Macie tupet, żeby się tu pojawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś — musiałem cię zamienić wprost w piosenkę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli wczoraj wieczorem w parku i trzymali się jak zakochani za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy zbudować drewniany barak dla Maciusia i straży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapach łajna jest zapachem życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym się różni genialność życia od genial- ności twórczości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tak lubię, gdy tobie zaczynają drżeć usta przed płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pełnia winy może być tylko tam, gdzie istnieje premedytacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wepchnął mocniej i złamała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przestał, bo po co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest o rok spóźniona, bo chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie jest ważne, kto ma rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz mieć sen zdrowy, panie naczelniku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie zdecydowali się na ślub cywilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No… no jednego ogrodu, który twoja matka lubiła — jąkała Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym więcej euroentuzjazmu w sprawie budżetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stany Zjednoczone przygniatają Iran, który im nadskakuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Badając może o drogę i losy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja przedstawiła w ubiegłym tygodniu propozycję zintegrowanych wytycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsza klimatyzacja, lepsze drogi i zmiana zachowań kierowców - inaczej mówiąc, nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję także fakt, że mowa w nim o kwestii spekulacji towarami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska polityka sąsiedztwa nadal stoi przed wielkimi wyzwaniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament nie żartuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich skuteczność różnie bywa oceniana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc co musimy zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję zatem o jedność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście chciałbym podziękować wszystkim zainteresowanym za ciężką pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41655642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezmiernie ważne są kwestie instytucjonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytrzymaj mu nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze wówczas dębem, przykutym do miejsca i do własnego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załatwiłam bez pana wiedzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ziemi poniewierały się resztki potłuczonych naczyń, kawałki żelaza i szkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mało kto dzisiaj to robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gabinecie ojca paliło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwna rzecz, ta Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie gniewasz się, że on cię przy tym zastąpił? Teraz jest wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, muszę opisać, co działo się wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest przez chwilę naciągnięty jak struna, nim się ją puści, nim wyda dźwięk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co cię nie zabije, to cię wzmocni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony przychodzi refleksja, żeśmy się jednak trochę zagalopowali!!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślę, że to będzie możliwe, gdy przestanę cię ko chać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wiedzie te hordy ku krwawemu dziełu zbrodni, zemsty lub kary?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pociągu — zawsze tylko w pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę patologiczne, że siedzimy tu razem i udajemy, że to normalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze wówczas dębem, przykutym do miejsca i do własnego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowie się pan po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil tego już nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy musi robić to, co mnie się podoba — rzekł obojętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległo się uderzenie trąb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zabrzmieć żałośnie, ale to mnie uspokaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka osób rzuciło się nawet w pogoń za zbiegłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krys tyna powiedziała: Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak — tym dziwniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem mimowolny dreszcz grozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to włosy z warkocza mej narzeczonej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten drugi, co pociesznym basem gada, jak wygląda? — zaciekawiła się w torbie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukali innej planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być ciekawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I bawią się w zabijanie czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klementyna umarła od udaru sercowego, umarła z nadmiaru życia i radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się to pisze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytuliłem ją do siebie i tak szliśmy czas jakiś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, więc nie będę się wypowiadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właściwie cóż by nam przyszło z tego, gdybyśmy wreszcie go odnaleźli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cmentarz zamykają tu wcześnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę iść z jakimś gówniarzem na wodę sodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież, u licha, mam prawo zajmować się kościołem świętego Barnaby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdybym był dziewczyną, tobym na pewno był kurwą — pomyślał, ale zaraz wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, teraz jesteś dostatecznie zła, więc możemy roz mawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czuję tak samo wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem się usunąć, a on o walizkę zawadził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni nie przestają mówić o tym, ile kosztuje marmolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż może powiedzieć, ile biedny asceta w tych strasznych dniach wycierpiał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast „Harcerze podnieśli nosze”, napisane: „Harcerze podnieśli nos”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ją przywitał, nie miał już ochrypłego głosu i cały czar znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przylgnął do niego zły oddech dwóch tysiącleci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepyszna broń! — pochwalił ze szczerym uznaniem rywal, biorąc pistolet do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy rozumiecie w polityce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co niczyje, to i nasze być może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchajcie, dzieci, trzeba konie odsunąć od ognia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, cóż mi dacie za wyjawienie sekretu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochałem cię jak syna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łóżko — sen, śmierć, miłość, narodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na palcach podeszliśmy do sztalugi, by śledzić przebieg pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj czytała po raz pierwszy Rimbauda „Statek pijany” i Verlai- ne’a „Pieśń jesienną”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mordują waszego pułkownika!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże szybko pędziłem teraz bez ciężkiego płaszcza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to już po dziesiątej i najwyższy czas, abyśmy wyruszyli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie spostrzegłem, iż zbliża się do nas szybko jakaś latarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliłem sobie nareszcie zakaszlać lekko, aby mu przypomnieć, iż jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jednakowoż głupstwa te tyle obchodziły, co samego cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili zbiegłem po drabinie i byłem przy drzwiach w stajni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona w najwyższym stopniu interesująca i niezwykła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rozsądnych i dzielnych ludziach wcale mi zbywa... Urwał nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze ci iPhone potrzebny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich podniósł latarkę do twarzy nieszczęśliwego, poczem obydwaj wybuchnęli szatańskim śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znowu do biblioteki pojechać, bo mi się materiał kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22751998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby obejść tych łotrów, musieliśmy iść dokoła wzgórz i robić wielkie koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże okropnie jest przerażony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew nabiegła mi do piersi gorącym strumieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło znowu kilkanaście minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22113726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo wydał dziki okrzyk i jak szalony rzucił się ku stojącym kolumnom francuskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrenuję sobie cardio i może stracę pare kilo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O szóstej rano odsłoń rolety i zagraj \\\"Kiedy ranne wstają zorze\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się, gdyż zamiłowanie do hazardu poruszyło się w nim potężnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich wypadkach puszczam koniowi cugle i pozwalam mu samemu szukać sobie drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślałem o zamiłowaniu pomocnika do fotografowania i o ciągłem znikaniu jego w piwnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tymczasem zsunąłem się po linie i popędziłem co sił starczyło przez moczary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wybaczy mi pan, pewny jestem tego, że przedsięwezmę niezawodne środki ostrożności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowałem się w winnicy, tyki sterczały wprawdzie jeszcze, ale liści już nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dla najdzielniejszych z nas stało się jasnem, że nastała chwila odwrotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wydostałem się na dwór, byłbym ze zdumienia głośno krzyknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, nie mogłem zrozumieć, co te łotry zamierzają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale rozkazałem ci przecież, abyś swoje mądre rady schował dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czem nie marzyliśmy w tych cielęcych latach młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spytał Sherlock Holmes.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziałem co robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśliznąłem się do rowu i zacząłem się okolicy przypatrywać przez lunetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiedzieli nic, ale spojrzeli na mnie badawczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem pałasz z pochwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg służbowy nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zalogowała mi się na Twittera i wysłała jakieś głupoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie usłyszałem dzwonka telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czasem stał się impertynencki, drwiący, uszczypliwy, kłótliwy i napastliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co było począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22934408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapoznali się i odtąd szli już razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22934409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22934410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjmuj bilet, widzę kanara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał się kurczowo świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem trzeba wiedzieć kiedy się przebranżowić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzeknij mi, że się nic nie zmieni, myślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym był na środku tamy, nadbiegła druga fala powodzi i rozstrzaskała się o belkowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil siedział na kamieniu o dwadzieścia metrów dalej i obserwował ją od dziesięciu minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiamy się, że kapitał, który włożyliśmy w ten projekt może być zmarnowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobiegli do rozstaju i znów przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś kowalem swojego losu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie podwieczorku mówiliśmy mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — rzekł prawie surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś wie co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I balon za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nagromadzaj przeszkód! — ostrzegł ją zawczasu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął wydobywać pomału historię swoich wakacji, ale zauważył, że Janek jest zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź zadzwoń po Łysego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiamy się, że kapitał, który włożyliśmy w ten projekt może być zmarnowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek ma pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to kocham cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę! — zawołał Krzysiek zarumieniony z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek zwisał jak worek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paląca staje się kwestia realizacji projektów nakierowanych na walkę z tym niebezpiecznym zjawiskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpewniej uciekł z domu i nie chce się przyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi urzędnicy zajmą się tą sprawą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kilka propozycji w dziedzinie warunków pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego jestem zdania, że ważne jest dostarczenie informacji na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, żeby ich słowa znalazły swoje pokrycie, trzeba podjąć działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także ci, którzy wypowiadali się dwa miesiące temu, mieli mniejsze szanse\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem wszystkie są uzasadnione i dobrze umotywowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby tego dokonać, potrzebujemy pierwszego czytania w Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką postawę przyjmuje Rada w odniesieniu do takiej metody działań?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musi to być wniosek prawdziwie europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz znów w sektorze lotnictwa cywilnego uwidoczniła się skłonność do podziałów w ważnej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26590441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa człowieka i polityka Unii Europejskiej stoją na rozdrożu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem razem z nimi przeglądać ten tomik jako pamiętnik szczęśliwie przebytego koszmarnego okresu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jerzy, przytrzymaj chwilę prawe ramię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed tronem i zanucił pieśń ku chwale króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak potarł dłonią miejsce pozbawione kędziora i rzucił na zabrakowanego kulawca spojrzenie pełne politowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej ani drgnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaatakowała mnie brylantami swych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, gdybym nawet mógł znów się zamienić, wolałbym jeszcze spróbować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łażę wzdłuż bulwarów, ale nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tak ino z wielkiej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W biały dzień na jawie zdarzały się wypadki niepodobne do wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę stąd iść — powiedziała Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — zapytałem, ślizgając się spojrzeniem po rozlewisku wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było mnie cały dzień w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede mną płot jakiejś prywatnej posesji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź do szóstego oddziału i zobacz, czy tam jest globus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem przed willą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zaiste smutny jest ten świat aż do śmierci”…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drodze mrużył oczy, które wydawały się jak wprawione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli pani będzie w towarzystwie przez cały czas trwania podróży…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc byłam u niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak i nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie chciał wierzyć, ale uwierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich jak ty nie dręczy demon ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni temu budowałem schron z całym systemem sznurków zamykających prymitywne klapy i zasłony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma co martwić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jestem bardzo zdenerwowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed tronem i zanucił pieśń ku chwale króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeroko otwartymi oczami patrzała prosto w słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną jest tak samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boisz się siebie samej? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętał rozbawiony wyraz oczu ojca, gdy docierał do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pusty brzuszek pęczniał mu w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, zwariowałaś? W tej chwili pożałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem jeszcze tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki gatunek filmu lubisz najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tamten jakby naumyślnie wystawiał się na wciąż nowe ciosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chciał pozwolić mówić na siebie „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy Andrzeja nagle ożywiły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiaków dwóch znałem, a Żegnajty ani jednego — przypomniał sobie nagle jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam? Jakim — nam? — wycedził przez zęby kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezmierzona siła elektryczna zastąpiła siłę koni i wołów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie nalegał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ślepo! — upewnił Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, gdyż księżyc skrył się poza chmurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą lepiej się myśli w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, zwariowałaś? W tej chwili pożałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic wam, bracia i siostry, nie mogę powiedzieć, choć wiem wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam, że nie ruszę się z tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gubernator nie zważając na ten śmiech, odetchnął jak nurek, co nad wodę wypłynął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jego oddech i ten mi zdradził, gdzie się znajdowała moja zwierzyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dosłowna prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Teraz weźmiemy się do nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jednej jedynej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze trochę wina, proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka miła muszelka, taka jedyna na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubi Maciuś wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Do kogo należy ta kawiarnia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ulegało wątpliwości, iż to był on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dokuczaj ty Stefanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24808228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On go tak kochał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe, że moja filozofia okaże się w pewnych punktach błędna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często przerywam wizje, aby zapisywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyżarła — wyznał z westchnieniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór z wolna prostował swe drgające jeszcze rozpędnym pośpiechem przeobrażeń członki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wyrzuty sumienia, a taka tylko natrętna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę sobie w świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krys tyna powiedziała: Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ot, co wymyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z literatury rosyjskiej uznawał tylko Dostojewskiego i Babla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta nasze spotkały się, a ciała splotły w miłosnym szale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądał w milczeniu i niepewnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz w górze, raz w dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nacisnęło mu coś lekko oddech i serce, zęby zaczęły mu szczękać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Połączenie dokonane — rzekł opuszczając rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same przeszkody i nic ponadto!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie stale wrzało życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej uścisnął mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy we wróżby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg począł raptownie zwalniać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o oznaczeniu odpowiednich elementów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spij, smarkaczu! Zobaczył, że zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No i przypuszczam też, dzielny człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to może szkodzić, że dziś pojadę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zamówić pizzę z ananasem na ulicę Rolniczą dwanaście, mieszkania czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień stał się powtórzeniem poprzedniego. Ludzie brnęli bez słowa poprzez lodowaty kraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja Turka zastąpię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wraz z historią choroby, którą mi przysłałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szerokie rękawy, z których dłonie wystawały, jak pręciki z korony kwiatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła także, że nie leży na swej pościeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosła w dziobie jedną gałązkę i wplątała dziewczynce we włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powidła, pyszna rzecz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zaś, co cię w tak wielkie wprawiło zdumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłosierny ponad wszelkie rozumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzysta dolarów odrzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrawiam wszystkich z okazji dzisiejszego święta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20842437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płomień wstydu oblał mu czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne apeluje do rodziców i indywidualnie do mężczyzn i kobiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy się z czasem wyrabia — przerwałem, cały drżący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przystani onej nie masz rekina…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdą jest wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, przywiązujesz zbyt wielką wagę do tego krążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym właśnie twórcą przeznaczeń chcę być, chcę zrozumieć tajemnicę losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz, pokażę ci teraz króliki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co tam słychać u sąsiadów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miód jest słodki i zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz nas obejrzyj, dziewulinko płochliwa! — szepnął nieśmiało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj, że niezależnie od tego kim byłeś, zawsze możesz się zmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rygor, jaki zaprowadził, jest straszliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aleś ty wyczerpał to miłosierdzie Boże do dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prąd obrazów, przechodzący przez nią i porywający jak pociąg w marzeniach dzieciństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż mię chwycą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Doktorze — spytałam — czy pan potem będzie badał puls kobietom?”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykre myśli dręczyły go bezustannie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Park odchodzi w coraz głębszą ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chuja spoglądała z ciekawością wielką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrz, jak mi odstaje, spójrz no na moje spodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i nie chcę musieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię, siedź spokojnie, ja muszę oglądnąć pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na niego nieco śmielej i rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Po cóż byś miał do nich strzelać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21162329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powidła, pyszna rzecz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy interpretować ten zapis jedynie jako zabezpieczenie na wypadek wzrostu budżetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy unikać działań zwiększających cykliczność gospodarki zarówno w okresie prosperity, jak i recesji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego potrzebujemy jasnego procesu decyzyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy oczekujemy w przyszłości rozwoju technologicznego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, należy zapewnić istnienie drugiej szansy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę przyznać, że rozczarowała mnie ostatnia wizyta w Parlamencie prezydenta Zumy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy zatem ulepszyć ramy regulacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trakcie negocjacji nad traktatem lizbońskim z tych przyczyn właśnie zgodzono się je usunąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim przekonaniu sprawozdanie, które mamy przed sobą jest dobre\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30661262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przez inwestowanie w nowoczesne technologie w krajach o niskich kosztach produkcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30682180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taką samą ocenę wystawili eksperci Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30682182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze krótka uwaga na temat klonowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30682183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30682184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o sprawdzanie, czy istnieje rzeczywista potrzeba powództw zbiorowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna pyta z niedowierzaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie do końca są w swoim środowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ogólnego, nie wyłączając wora, milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęliby oboje, bez żadnej pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nie urągaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu po pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiątka rodzinna — objaśniał zadowolony z pochwał właściciel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gabinecie ojca paliło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zależało jej na tym, a jednak nie istniał już poza nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie ci niemiłe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego? — Nie gniewaj się, że będę przykry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mało kto dzisiaj to robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uśmiecha się raz jeszcze i znika w głębi mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście wiatru nie było, mróz zatem nie dokuczał zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielka jeszcze nie słyszała, ale my słyszymy — od pierwszego nieśmiałego razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili zdjął słuchawki z uszu i był zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia wyszła na podwórko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż zamierzył się Felek na majstra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmego roku życia nie płakałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich jak ty nie dręczy demon ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuję ci ciągle moje słabe i bezbronne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy do świątyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekł tylko jeden żołnierz, dwóch leżało z przestrzelonymi głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka trocha mi nie wystarcza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobyłam tu rzecz stokroć cenniejszą dla mnie od złota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci powiem, czego się boisz: Boisz się stężenia, śmierci — jak wosk tężeje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez kartki meldunkowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne dlatego organizatorzy postawili na jeszcze większą promocję wydarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc przyznaje pan, że w praktyce musi się uczynić wybór? — Jest się zmuszonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o wydajność energetyczną, jest to temat, do którego na pewno będziemy wracać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja krytyka jest również poparta aktualnym orzecznictwem w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram wniosek Trybunału Obrachunkowego dotyczący potrzeby ustanowienia przez Europejski Trybunał Sprawiedliwości lepszych procedur zamówień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczonym sprawozdaniu przyznaje się, że rozszerzenie nie było bezwarunkowym sukcesem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też wstrzymałem się od głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie wywołują obecnie poważne zakłócenia u swojego najważniejszego klienta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam przewodniczącego Komisji do przygotowania dla komisarzy i państw członkowskich ambitnego zestawu wymogów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia musimy w tym półroczu poczynić bardzo znaczące postępy w zakresie najważniejszych priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W treści tej rezolucji znajduje się wiele postulatów zasługujących na uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27250636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej dziedzinie nie powinniśmy się skarżyć z powodu braku funduszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27268018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzi na ożywienie gospodarki w państwach członkowskich Unii Europejskiej w Europie Środkowej i Wschodniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27268019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisują oni zestaw poprawek, których nawet nie potrafią zrozumieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27268021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o kim my tu mówimy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27268022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzi to do negatywnych skutków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panowie, strasznem naprawdę zjawiskiem był ten stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"myśl o mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty wychodzisz za tego śmiecia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem jakiegoś ciężkiego przedmiotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są bezczelnie zuchwali ludzie, ci Anglicy, panowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski włożył lekki paltot i opuścił mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawie nic.“ Przerwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprzeczę, naturalnie zaprzeczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można było myśleć, że rozpłacze się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czego ty taka dumna, hm?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ileż cierpieć musi, bo zapewne jest tak dobra jak piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem pojąć, że wciąż jeszcze żyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten z nosem hakowatym, stary; on zawsze tu mieszkał i wszystko panu powie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25198437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokonał tego przy pomocy nadzwyczaj surowej dyscypliny i pod groźbą najsurowszych kar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za mało się znamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze wszystkich praw w niniejszej Deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast zniechęcić, jeszcze bardziej rozpala się w Maciusiu niecierpliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za dowód mogą służyć gojące się ponad standardowy czas rany zadane jej ząbkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22109968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każecie odejść? — pyta się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ma ukryte zalety - pomyślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz te chwile buntu trwały krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej było to wielkie i piękne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było świństwo, że mu nie kupiono psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno kłamał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda ręki! — odpowiedziała z woru dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał mnóstwo wszelakich książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż chce, abyś mu dał schronienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko weszli do pokoju, usiadła na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wskazała mi miejsce w łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecież dawno miniona przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała zmęczonym głosem: — Muszę jeszcze powtórzyć łacinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stacja jest domkiem z małym ogródkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen spełzał powoli z jej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już jest prawie jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ty robisz, licho zatracone?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie tego nie warto mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie smoki i całe Indie stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło tylko o zobaczenie tego, co jest na dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wieloma uprawiałem seks\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my tylko na skargę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma co martwić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Emil znikł za rogiem, zaczął biec i biegł tak aż do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległo się uderzenie trąb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona czekała na to, aż się pożegna, i on wiedział o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mnie na to nie stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór, wybór! — przedrzeźniała go dziwożona, podrzucając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam są Anka i Rena i one go poznają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na przykład — Jędrek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bracia! — zawołał nagle Podlasiak, tkliwym spojrzeniem obdarzając obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli wszyscy, wszyscy, wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że słyszy szmer w okolicy pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się załamuje, pryska, rozwiewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, siadaj, bratku, za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabić go, czy co? Spytam małego k.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i dzwonek, i tak się skończyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam zegarek, wąsy, biurko z szufladami, wszystko mam jak dorośli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał zamknięte oczy, widziała długie, drgające rzęsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak aleja śpiewnych drzew… śpiewnych drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie zaczęło się od grania, bo u mnie w pokoju jest rozklekotane pianino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lipcowe słońce przypiekało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniję pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego, że to, dlatego, że tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrącam rękami natrętny pstrokaty łeb, bronię ciała mego od jej dotknięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzi, że wraca za trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w nędzy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Równocześnie wiruje wraz z całym globem dookoła Słońca…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst opracowany na podstawie: Antoni Lange, W czwartym wymiarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może chce pani przejść się tamtędy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi się pomieszało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak nie, to on jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama musiała je zdobyć w jakiś sprytny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I na cóż potrzebna wam była woda? — pytano Nowaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak wypuścił z ręki jej dłoń drobną i niemal dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchała z ociąganiem się i ostrożnie wyjrzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczęli przeskakiwać przez płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak urośniecie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna rzecz, że to z Panem było całkiem na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałaś jaru, masz jar — rzekł kulawiec, podejrzliwie i ukosem poglądając na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budził ją każdy ruch chłopca, jego chrapanie albo mowa przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i śpiew nieustanny, uczty i igrzyska zapełniały jego życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Ala da ołówek, bo trzeba narysować latarnię — będzie ładny obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan stać, jeśli tak jest wygodniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam Komisję do podjęcia działań także w tym obszarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie to byłoby życie moje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęte rozwiązanie zapewni przejrzystość finansowania przez państwo lub inne organy władzy publicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jeszcze możemy zrobić, aby przerwać zależność Europy od rosyjskich dostaw energii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci skrajni przeciwnicy mieli swe starcie w zeszły piątek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego uważam, że w tej sytuacji jest oczywiste, że nikt nie może narzucić żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowałem za odrzuceniem wniosku Komisji oraz sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj odbyła się debata w sprawie budżetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dalszym ciągu utrzymują się różnice w sytuacji gospodarczej w Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy do czynienia ze zwykłymi zmianami temperatur\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Regularnie poświęcamy wiele uwagi sytuacji i rozwojowi wydarzeń w regionie Południowego Kaukazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnośnie do polityki azylowej sprawozdanie podąża w szlachetnym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko negocjacje z pełnym zaangażowaniem stron mogą przynieść trwałe rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38400583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naród irlandzki podjął decyzję w interesie swoich spraw narodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to poniekąd ludzie i tak, i tak zgubieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owego ranka było coś tajemniczego w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc i dorosły czuje się sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna, dwie — powtarza Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zaprzeczam ich istnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz prawo zachować milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj byłem u znajomego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byle tylko jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mały pięcioletni Jano i jego świat magii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona spojrzała na niego ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden plus, że można z nim iść do kawiarni i pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, do jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba dużo czytałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczała, płakała, nie dawała się uczesać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudna kobieta! — pomyślałem, przestępując próg sali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wara ode mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz czas w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oświadczyła nagle dziwożona, oblizując zwilgotniałe od tataraku wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łóżko — sen, śmierć, miłość, narodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty się boisz ryzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chyba jakiś grzyb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci poza tym donieść, że za miesiąc wychodzi moja epidemiologia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam z nią zawsze, mimo że miałam ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po jałmużnę idę! — odparł zuchwale kulawiec i z powikłanym wysiłkiem powstał z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po lewej, nad brzegiem urwiska, zamajaczył dom — chata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza mną zapadły głucho w zamek ciężkie, dębowe drzwi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po co ci moja noga? I bez niej się obejdzie! — zgromił ją kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiły wrażenie zbytecznego dodatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przebiegł go dreszczyk, jak mała mysz, wzdłuż kręgosłupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że to zależy od kategorii, ale powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóc ci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się i ujrzałem Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu to nie było ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gówno, czy jest sprzeczna, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie obliczyłem się z siłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisałem je, odczytałem na trzeźwo — kompletna bzdura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zauważył, że dochodzi siódma, godzina spotkania z Jankiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Leżymy jeszcze na dnie morza? — Ja tak, a ty nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że byl park, przez który ona musiała przejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dofinansowano ze środków Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To znów zależy od okoliczności, które go wywołały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął oczy ze wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mnie! — szepnął jednoręki, który dotąd trwał w zupełnym milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę i nic nie rozu miem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duża, trójkątna głowa, biała czupryna w nieładzie, brązo we, błyszczące oczy, wąskie usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już po tym postępku od razu poznałbym Francuza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21980148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był blady, jak ściana, ale trzymał się dzielnie wobec otaczających go zbójów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powraca ta mała, nudna męka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może z uduszenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan stać, jeśli tak jest wygodniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj będzie wielkim wezyrem i niech zarządza moim królestwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmego roku życia nie płakałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był poza tym w najwyższym stopniu wstrętny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik zbladł jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — jęczał przewodnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy sam na sam — rzekł Podlasiak, do głębi wzruszony swym obecnym stanowiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy pływały jak lilie na wodzie i drgały lekko; niebo było jak jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W biały dzień na jawie zdarzały się wypadki niepodobne do wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno uwierzyć, że ktoś tam mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż nie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam byle robociarz wie więcej od naszego niejednego filaru krytyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede mną płot jakiejś prywatnej posesji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artyści, twórcy religii, ludzie niezadowoleni, nienasyceni, metafizycy, wielka różnorodność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój pan takiej wędliny nie robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napięcie w filmie tworzy się na wielu płaszczyznach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył mi przenikliwie w oczy i wyczytał resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisałem je, odczytałem na trzeźwo — kompletna bzdura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przeglądu europejskiej polityki sąsiedztwa - wymiar południowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto musimy wesprzeć ochronę statków i ludzi, którzy się na nich znajdują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy my naprawdę pragniemy konfliktu między dwoma antagonistycznymi blokami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zyskaliśmy na sile i wpływach, jesteśmy bogatsi i bardziej zróżnicowani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez poważnego kryzysu nigdy nie zdołacie zbudować prawdziwej demokracji europejskiej, prawdziwej wspólnoty politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równości Kobiet i Mężczyzn, aby zagwarantować jego pozytywne uruchomienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolność wyznania w Chinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoc jest potrzebna teraz, a nie za sześć miesięcy lub za rok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również w tej kwestii musimy uwzględnić wyniki takich działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy spójnej, zrównoważonej polityki w sektorze transportu, zgodnej z zasadami pomocniczości i proporcjonalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie chcę jeszcze raz podziękować Komisji, a także wszystkim kontrsprawozdawcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostaje też kwestia tamtejszego systemu proporcjonalnej lub indywidualnej reprezentacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu nie mogłem głosować za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26940941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto wszyscy lobbyści zobowiążą się w ten sposób do przestrzegania kodeksu postępowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepokoją nas informacje o licznych przypadkach łamania praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz kogóż to widzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęcie traktatu lizbońskiego przez czeski senat to kolejny krok ku ratyfikacji traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe przetwórstwo ryb odbywało się gdzie indziej, na przykład na Seszelach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy jednak zachować czujność, wykorzystując i realizując naszą politykę przemysłową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszliśmy do porozumienia nawet w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najlepsza droga do ochrony swojego bezpieczeństwa i promowania swoich wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejsze znaczenie ma zapewnienie dostępu do szybkiego Internetu wszystkim obywatelom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojęcie \\\"mafia energetyczna\\\" istnieje w kilku krajach świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy dysponowaliśmy zaledwie kompetencją konsultacyjną, nasze propozycje i pomysły nie były brane pod uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innym wątkiem, który chciałbym podkreślić jest pomysł walki z ubóstwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy listę mówców i staramy się, aby była wyważona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy jedynie wymagać, żeby ich środki miały skutek równoważny do naszych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32217053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kierujmy się osobistymi ambicjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno skończyć, gdy się zaczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś lalką, niczym więcej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20669089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał się pan jej twarzą, symbolem i adwokatem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się, że wypadków jest niewiele i zdarzają się rzadko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marokański minister spraw zagranicznych nie musi stawiać się przed Komisją Spraw Zagranicznych Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam zamiar jak najszybciej przyjąć wniosek prawodawczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wymaga to dyrektywy w sprawie usług portowych, czy prawodawstwa, ale wyraźnych wytycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona jednakże pełna samozadowolenia, jeśli chodzi o dalsze trwanie bieżącej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoduje to problemy przy zagospodarowaniu gruntów, ponownym zalesianiu i polityce zapobiegania pożarom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadam się też mocno i zdecydowanie za tym, aby układ był układem o stowarzyszeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26941985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bezludnej wyspie mieć będzie wszystko, co już dziś posiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26942056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie możemy stwarzać wrażenia, że nasza Izba mogłaby kiedykolwiek zajmować odmienne stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26942063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodem tego ataku były wysiłki zmierzające do zaprowadzenia trwałej stabilizacji w regionie Zachodnich Bałkanów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26942064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym w szczególności podkreślić następujące sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26942066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało mogę powiedzieć, iż dyrektywa usługowa jest kluczem do prawidłowo funkcjonującego wspólnego rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Władca świata” znikł nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właściwie cóż by nam przyszło z tego, gdybyśmy wreszcie go odnaleźli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ilu was tam jest? — ozwała się niespodzianie dziwożona z wnętrza torby żebraczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmrok już zapadał, gdy mijano jakiś ładny pałacyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głowę zawracasz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i dzwonek, i tak się skończyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty wobec rozwagi zawsze byłeś w opozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ranę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc padał śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą się wziąć nie dam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziłam dwójkę dzieci, ale wraz z mężem chcielibyśmy mieć trójkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien mądry człowiek o chrystianizmie: „Stal można złamać, guma jest niezwal- czona”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno, że takie rzeczy tylko na osobności się gada — stwierdził z nagłym przekonaniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdy cię z torby na świat wynurzym, poznasz mnie po głosie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci powiem, czego się boisz: Boisz się stężenia, śmierci — jak wosk tężeje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łąk, z rzeki, ze stawu dźwigały się mgły, znikające w wyżynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec każdego zestawu pytań, zadaliśmy w ramce pytania dotyczące roli Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wstrzymajmy negocjacje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dojrzała to w oparze, drżącym nad ziemią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wstyd, że tak długo opóźniano tę decyzję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym samym czasie floty państw trzecich rosną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam również nadzieję, że dostarczą one jeszcze bardziej szczegółowych informacji niż te poprzednie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie jutro ma się odbyć drugie czytanie budżetu Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego jestem bardzo wdzięczny szanownemu panu posłowi za to pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wyboru pomiędzy demokracją i stabilnością, obydwa elementy są niezbędne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często jest tak, że problemu nie da się rozwiązać z braku pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierając się na zniekształconych informacjach, stworzyliśmy rozwiązania na wypadek paniki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konie wstawić do obór, stodół i przynieść im siana z odryny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39817432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisarzu, dziękuję za wyczerpującą odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wilki zawyły z trwogi..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgłosy te i szmery nie uszły uwagi zaczajonych nasłuchiwaczy niedomówień leśnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Który kraj w Europie ma tak wysoką płacę minimalną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszorzędne miejsce w krajowych strategiach walki w ubóstwem powinny zajmować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz nadszedł czas, by wreszcie to uczynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona obecna we wszystkich dziedzinach, w tym rzecz jasna energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dbałość oznacza zapewnienie wykorzystywanym zwierzętom całego zestawu rzeczowych i innych warunków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy również poprawić stosunki transatlantyckie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę mi pozwolić na jeszcze jedną krótką uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal istnieje wiele grup, wobec których, pomimo dobrego ustawodawstwa, antydyskryminacja nie działa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo obecnego impasu w negocjacjach nie należy wyolbrzymiać tej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam za pożądane wprowadzenie dokładniejszych metod badania toksycznych skutków nanocząsteczek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza poprawka przyjęta przez Komisję Przemysłu, Badań Naukowych i Energii dotyczy podstawy prawnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że przeprojektowujemy naszą politykę sąsiedztwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traf chciał, że większość tych milionów ofiarowana została czterem najważniejszym gazetom lewicy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35772706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojedynczy zestaw przepisów dotyczących całego transportu towarów niebezpiecznych umożliwi zmniejszenie tego zagrożenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest granica powiatu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okresy, kiedy się leży na samym dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotykam ją czasami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy skończyłaś już robotę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale przynajmniej ta pociecha, że nie spotkałam się z diabłami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno uderzenie polanem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omiń korek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mogę to wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na leżaku i zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nic nie mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę razy przesiąkł jak mgła przez pnie drzew w alei lipowej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy w te bajeczki z „duchami”?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież takie były miękkie, jedwabiste, taki miały żywy połysk!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, nie bardzo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to, więc tak dużo tu czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na krótką chwilę zapanowała między nami kłopotliwa cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan jest wybitnie samobójczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizm żadną miarą nie da się pogodzić z personalizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość dużo czytałem w tej materii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju ciekawie obejrzał bratanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie czuję się dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci poza tym donieść, że za miesiąc wychodzi moja epidemiologia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, młodzi wieśniacy, nie umieliśmy jeszcze drwić sobie z wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kocham już inną; mam narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dorośli, i dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczył na jednym korzeniu, na drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystrzelił Maciuś w powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale potem… będziemy mogli pogadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hm… szczególne, szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie zaczęło świtać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor przechadzał się zamyślony po celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nigdy nie wiadomo, co jest potrzebne, a co zbyteczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym posyłali do siebie Józię, młodą pokojówkę Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę uszanować i moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale potem… będziemy mogli pogadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tłumaczyłam ci już sto razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil obmacał wszystkie krzesła, na których wierzchu siedziała skóra, a w środku mieszkały sprężyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchała z ociąganiem się i ostrożnie wyjrzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jej mama kazała w gnieździe posprzątać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A dlaczego się wykręcałaś od tego? — Nie wiem sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętała tylko jodły z tamtej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś z uczucia żegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiedziałem, że nie potrafisz! — rzekł Kowalski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było mnie cały dzień w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawiła go ta gra w ciuciubabkę z nie przeczuwającym nic przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miała zapewne nic do powiedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kłótnie, przypominające sceny małżeńskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydkich nóg nie da się ukryć całkowicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Moskwy! — powtórzyła, wszystko mieszcząc w tym słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisze się, oczywiście, rachunki, wykazy, a owszem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalał eteru na chustkę i wdychał go powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona się denerwuje widać, w sposób specyficzny, i zamknęła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślę, że to będzie możliwe, gdy przestanę cię ko chać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wziął pocisk do ręki, wydał mu się on strasznie ciężki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź spokojny; potrafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba zajrzę po drodze do księgarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż miałem mu powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć nudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co on mógł tam zobaczyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cios byłby zbyt nagły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko domu, w którym mieszkałem, nie mogłem sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I harfa wciąga w siebie swoje dźwięki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ból uczułem obłędny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spływały z nieba: pień ukrywał się za ścianą z mgły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chciałabyś być moją dziewczyną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trzech domów można się dostać niepostrzeżenie do pracowni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak on to robił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie starzec nie wytrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Drogi i szanowny mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23342999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan w to nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w sercu zrobiłem zastrzeżenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i coś ty zrobiła łazęgo zasmarkana?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza sesja przed nim, wsparcie mu się przyda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skwapliwie zboczyliśmy w sąsiedni zaułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To są stosy papierów i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pary z ust nie puszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do fortepianu dziwnie miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwariowany chodził za psami na ulicy, całował je i lizał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż musi opustoszeć, a wówczas nikt nam nie będzie przeszkadzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił: — Takie to porządki, że wszystko leży ułożone i niczego nie można znaleźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nie kocham go, lecz nie chcę z nim zrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stara historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mogę to wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo go to obchodziło, ale można było na ten temat rozprawiać długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokojony nieco tą oczywistością, zaczął się rozbierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebym miał pieniądze, tobym mu mleka kupił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest coś całkiem innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiesił jej płaszcz w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety rzeczy nie do zacytowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz o tym i wiesz też, że ona cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrestartuj router.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta miały odpowiednie swym latom rozrywki, upiększane żywą wyobraźnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pani Małgorzata ani zapytała o losy sklepu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłbym na cmentarz, na grób rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaż stąd dla niego pociecha?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Westchnął Maciuś: strasznie dużo ma do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tylko było mu trochę przykro, że Starski siedzi obok Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"oni nam sprzedawali winogrona, kiedy ja myślałam o bandytach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie jestem za mały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już i chłopcy się dziwią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dlatego, że się z nich często śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochyliłem się i podałem mu go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była wielka burza na morzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24919662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałem w mej kryjówce, co się stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w stadium jednej ze swych słynnych „ucieczek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem opowiadał jej, jak i co myśli o świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzem takim jak ja dałby rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O parę kroków przed nami zalśniła brylantowymi blaskami laguna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła, patrząc w ziemię, i wydawała się bardzo zasmucona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobista współpraca zbyteczna — recytował ogłoszenie, którego się nauczył na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jej mama kazała w gnieździe posprzątać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawozdanie niezwykle na czasie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego to miałoby być kryterium?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż mamy przed sobą bardzo dużo pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miejscach, w których tysiące mężczyzn i kobiet utraciły pracę, króluje ubóstwo i niedostatek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia energii oraz sieci energetycznej to jedno z kluczowych zagadnień dla przyszłości europejskiej gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Efektem tego są fatalne wyniki w zakresie zatrudnienia absolwentów uniwersytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będzie to pewnego rodzaju \\\"Wielki Brat\\\"?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym poprosić pana urzędującego przewodniczącego Rady o komentarz w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec tej debaty chciałabym podzielić sie dwiema uwagami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem w chwili obecnej nie mogę podać państwu więcej szczegółów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dokumencie wyrażono zaniepokojenie stosunkowo niskim wskaźnikiem udziału niektórych państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja ludności w Gazie jest tragiczna i musi zostać pilnie rozwiązana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosując na \\\"nie\\\", wyborcy zagłosowali za ochroną swoich miejsc pracy, swoich rodzin i konstytucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40088782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Euro nas ochroniło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę pana, tylko na parę godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jesteś silniejszy niż ci chłopcy, z którymi się bawisz? — Fredek jest słabszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczyli się na ganku, gdzie cuchnęło, ale oni nie zauważali tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to włosy z warkocza mej narzeczonej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kto ci bronił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym celem powinno być uproszczenie administracji, a jednocześnie zmiana ogólnego podejścia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy prawa pozostawać bezstronnymi, jeśli stajemy wobec barbarzyńskich nieludzkich zachowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyśmy byli, to tak zwana \\\"moda\\\" na populizm nie rozwijałaby się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz wkrótce zapłacą za nie sami zanieczyszczający\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Diana Wallis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę obawy wyrażane przez kolegów z tej Izby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznę od Chorwacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie może być odpowiedzialna za każdy przejaw biurokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była o tym dziś mowa na tej sali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Roczna praca poszła więc na marne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekujemy od państwa postępu w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"plan działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wyrazy zagłuszone zostały żarcikami i dobrym humorem króla, oraz całego dworu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32493824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak państwom europejskim też nie udało się poradzić sobie z wysoką zachorowalnością na gruźlicę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszą rolą powinno być zaprzestanie działań destabilizujących, które napędzają te wielkie ruchy ludnościowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz po chwili znowu inna myśl przyszła mu do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież psy to nasi stróże\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo ciekawe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo cieszę się, ponieważ liczba wystąpień odpowiada znaczeniu omawianych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż za niedorzeczność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to budzi i napędza konflikty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię tu o regionie śródziemnomorskim i o Azji Środkowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rynek sam się ureguluje, nie potrzebujemy tej całej regulacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zniszczenia spowodowane przez powódź stanowią największą klęskę żywiołową w historii Pakistanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym ze sposobów zwiększenia poziomu zaufania jest podniesienie poziomu wzajemnej wiedzy o systemach prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co z mobilnością pacjentów, która utknęła w Radzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co stało się z Paktem Stabilności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39623501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastąpienie funkcji spełnianych przez te rośliny i zwierzęta jest kosztowne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warczała jak pies, któremu zabierają kość; kością była jej zupełna samotność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś z uczucia żegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich staraniach uzyskałem miejsce drugiego nauczyciela w niższym zakładzie naukowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ty go chyba nie kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę możności powinno ono rosnąć pod ochroną i odpowiedzialnością rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za typy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech mnie ten wóz wiezie, gdzie chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go uczucie dziwnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to proroctwo się sprawdziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszedłem z uczuciem ulgi i wkrótce zasnąłem głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał zamknięte oczy, widziała długie, drgające rzęsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym mieć paniczów w swej kompanii! — westchnął sierżant z głębi duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebyście mi się nie ważyli słówka komukolwiek pisnąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był zły obraz, kicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korytarze są puste, kroki rezonują, jakby szło dziesięciu łudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzył na Emila z wielkim zdziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto służyć i wyładowywać siłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytuliłem ją do siebie i tak szliśmy czas jakiś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej więcej o jedenastej wieczorem Emil przynosił ciąg dalszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pa Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W uszach dzwoniła wciąż na alarm krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejnym krokiem zagłębiłem się pomiędzy zaułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się nad nimi zbierać czarne chmury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wszyscy razem nadzwyczajnie rozpuszczone łobuzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelano jak na manewrach, z zimną krwią i celnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten nosek, co się do góry zadzierał, był taki śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, posiada pan duży talent konwersacyjny, zwłaszcza w kierunku parowania pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to co słyszę, to są fakty, z których należy wyciągnąć wnioski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan jednak będzie pewien: to się stać musi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym zakresie mam doświadczenie i znam wszystkie sposoby, jak własne pięć palców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szwagierki jego były przystojne i dobrze wychowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie mamy się udać i co robić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem wyprostowany w środku pokoju i spoglądałem na wejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może panu wygodniej będzie na dole napisać recepty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boli mnie trochę głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wszedł przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci chore i głodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przeciwnicy byli rozproszeni i bezsilni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłonił się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do góry go uniosła, palcami ujęła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz przyjaciel jest podziwienia godnym człowiekiem w tropieniu zwierzyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25697978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stalking jest przestępstwem zagrożonym karą więzienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niemal na pewno pierwszy kościół chrześcijański w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, dziękuję panu za dzisiejszą dyskusję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraz ze wzmocnieniem Eurojustu zwiększą się również prerogatywy przedstawicieli krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże dumni byliby Węgrzy, gdyby węgierska prezydencja priorytetowo potraktowała rozwiązanie problemu spekulacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie powiedzieć najpierw kilka słów na temat wagi i znaczenia dialogu społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co może w tej sprawie zrobić Unia Europejska?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moglibyśmy promować czystą przyszłość dla nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi rok z rzędu Komisja zaleca rozpoczęcie rozmów o członkostwie z Macedonią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślmy na przykład o ich znaczeniu przy interpretacji aktów prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określenie \\\"zażegnany\\\" sugerowałoby uspokojenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym wyrazić swoje podziękowania dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze oceany zieją pustką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, nasze najbardziej burzliwe spory dotyczyły załączników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dużych europejskich pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29015175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Geograficzne uzasadnianie kierunków współczesnej polityki zagranicznej jest niewystarczające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też mówię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie cieszy mnie, że zachowane zostało pojęcie stref mieszania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem już dzisiaj możliwość krótko wspomnieć o procesie akcesyjnym Chorwacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie kwestionuje tego prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To kolejny rozdział długiej, trwającej od dwóch tysięcy lat historii dyskryminacji i męczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska dysponuje szeroko zakrojonym prawodawstwem w kwestii polityki migracyjnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można jednocześnie bojkotować i i włączać się do działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy znaleźć rozwiązanie wspólnie z naszymi irlandzkimi przyjaciółmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zmuszajcie swoich dzieci do wdychania zabójczego powietrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, kryzys humanitarny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgłaszając własne petycje europejscy obywatele mogą zabrać głos, a także rozliczyć swój rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam Węgry, by nie obawiały się wykorzystać rotacyjnej prezydencji w Radzie dla dobra kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plan działania na rzecz mobilności w mieście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego trzeba studzić nastroje, aby głosowanie mogło przebiegać w normalny sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28546839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko, jeżeli chodzi o pierwszą kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś tak długo siedział?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona jest tu zawsze, w dokładnie określonym miejscu, w dołku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy się tak dalej spotykać jak dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko szybowiec Witka wciąż spada, bo Witek nie umie rzucać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali nigdy po imieniu tego, co było między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, dogodził mu, jak się należało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedział do niej: — Istnieje jeszcze rzecz, którą zataiłem przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — zawołał znowu, życzliwie kiwając głową i uśmiechem popierając każde kiwnięcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilki ledwo dyszały; Bartek również gonił ostatkiem sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postęp w rolnictwie nie musi oznaczać koncentracji produkcji, w tym koncentracji produkcji pasz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tego typu praktyki skarżą się przedsiębiorcy do Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Juranda nie było przy tem, albowiem działy się z nim rzeczy dziwne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.108,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poparłem sprawozdanie Konrada Szymańskiego dotyczące przeglądu Instrumentu Europejskiej Polityki Sąsiedztwa i Partnerstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę jednak pokrótce wyjaśnić zasady przewodnie naszej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy konkretnych przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach klapa zamknęła się na nowo i nastało głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele osób już przesądziło, że konferencja w Kopenhadze zakończy się niepowodzeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy więc kontynuować nasze wysiłki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dotąd nie były one skoordynowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już niedługo będę mógł dopłynąć do latarni morskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby, które spędziły na morzu cale życie, nie mają możliwości znalezienia innej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zagłosowaliśmy za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to następne zadanie dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30620883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy są biali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten bieg wciąż jeszcze wzmagał się od siarczystych razów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebyście mi się nie ważyli słówka komukolwiek pisnąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzucał karty i odczytywał urywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór masz wolny… — szepnął głosem drżącym i spuściwszy głowę, znieruchomiał od wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powłóczy się, wygłodzi — i wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahała się, zakołysała na miejscu, nie mogąc iść dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może wojna, która nadchodzi, przyniesie tu jakieś zmiany na lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to być kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment ten uwiecznił rzeźbiarz w marmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowe koła ze światła i krwi toczyły się jak baletnice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, jeszcze jej stosunek do morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas rozmowy usłyszałem w sąsiednim pokoju lekkie kroki, szelest szat kobiecych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej nie zlezę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym całkiem cicho: — I nauczy się pan rezygnować z efektów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłaci pan za to karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem dojmujący chłód wilgoci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś podobnego jest możliwym? — wyszeptał przecierając drżącą dłonią czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty się boisz ryzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem do miłego widzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uczynię to z całą przyjemnością!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy nie czujesz się chora?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja teraz chcę, żeby tak, jak dawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięć razy tę zabawę radosną powtórzył\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie moglibyśmy poprosić na chwilę piwniczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże dobrą sławę wyrobiłeś sobie i swemu nazwisku wśród Anglików!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"no tam, jak mysz zdechnie, to jest, jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziesz? — pyta się konduktor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, i tam nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie ja wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potwór wyprowadził się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawierzyłam w życiu jednemu jedynemu mężczyźnie i oto takiego doznałam rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według jego zapatrywania świadczyła o tem niezbicie krwawa plama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posiedź przez chwilę spokojnie, opanuj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie tak przykro, że ja jedna będę spała, a wy się musicie męczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie jest to zagadnienie bardzo skomplikowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trakcie dzisiejszego głosowania poparłam sprawozdanie mojej koleżanki Edit Bauer\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również z poparciem wielu osób na tej sali doszło do zdemolowania ładu europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadano jednak szereg konkretnych pytań, na które chciałbym udzielić odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te środki bezpieczeństwa nie mogą jednak utrudniać płynnego przepływu ruchu pasażerskiego w portach lotniczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś był dumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim wymienia fundusze spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma poprawnego politycznie ludobójstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, kiedy do tej migracji dojdzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje służby rozpoczną więc badanie w celu oceny doświadczeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnim razem odwiedzałem swój okręg wyborczy w Castletownbere w ubiegłym roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"partnerstwo mające na celu promowanie stabilności, rozwoju gospodarczego i transformacji demokratycznych w regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie wymagany jest tu wspólny wysiłek wszystkich krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi tu o jedno z rozporządzeń Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36869218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ach tak, infrastruktura jest zniszczona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budzi moją nieufność i powoduje pewien sceptycyzm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki procedurze zapobiegania zaburzeniom równowagi makroekonomicznej możliwe są innowacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już powiedziałem, nic nie usprawiedliwia ograniczenia pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przestać traktować ofiary jako przestępców poprzez stygmatyzowanie nielegalnych imigrantów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy chronić ich prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, żebyśmy spotkali się także i z jej władzami, ponieważ to sąsiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może obowiązują inne właściwe ustalenia prawne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszą powinnością jest zapobieżenie nowemu kryzysowi gazowemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób postawa ta miałaby zostać zdefiniowana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy mówią, że Pakistan jest na skraju upadku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowienia wykonawcze nie są jeszcze znane, tak więc wytyczne polityki krajowej są kompletnie niejasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są również najlepsze sposoby walki z biedą i wykluczeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku działań antyterrorystycznych waga, jaką przywiązuje się do praw jest często nieodpowiednia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawię państwu kilka powodów, dlaczego tak sądzę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37508437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabieram głos, aby wyrazić sprzeciw mojej grupy wobec tej propozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech rozniesie to wszystko mnie też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie wstał i nie spojrzawszy na mnie więcej, wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłócą się starsze z młodszymi, chłopcy z dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem ramionami i umyślnie przeszedłem do innego tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj pan na przeciąg — powtórzył uparcie — można czasem kark skręcić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już strasznie znudzili mi się ci mężczyźni z forsą i szykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkradała się jak kot tylnym wejściem, aby nie mówiono do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna leży zdaje się w wyczerpaniu nerwowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tępym, automatycznym krokiem wywlokłem się z mieszkania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezmierzona siła elektryczna zastąpiła siłę koni i wołów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dniem i nocą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Macie tupet, żeby się tu pojawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zezowaty znów się przeżegnał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dochodziła jedenasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czosnku znieść nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz domyślasz się zamiarów tego łotra wicehrabio?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz nie znał mnie jeszcze, to też skłoniłem się tylko i milczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny król przysłał powinszowanie i lunetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasza książęca mość masz w swoim herbie salamandrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypadek w cudowny sposób przyszedł mi z pomocą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiego koloru były jego włosy, broda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem człowiek całe życie, sto lat myślał, potem napisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonałeś ją pan, że to hołota?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co oni robią na świecie i dla świata?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem góry na księżycu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobieństwo, żeby pana osądzono, nie zbadawszy stanu pańskiego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24789376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalibóg, dobry koncept!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygnąłem się jak pod ukąszeniem węża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem przestaje się nawet za tym tęsknić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zaległo milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za zagadkowy splot wydarzeń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O parę kroków przed nami zalśniła brylantowymi blaskami laguna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wcisnąwszy mi w rękę bilet wizytowy, przepadła w półmroku zarania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne stworzenie nie umie stawać dęba i wykonywać skoków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmrok już zapadał, gdy mijano jakiś ładny pałacyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby wiedziała, że umrze, to cię nie przeprosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygotowania skończone — rzekł, wstępując w obręb koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym właśnie twórcą przeznaczeń chcę być, chcę zrozumieć tajemnicę losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielka jeszcze nie słyszała, ale my słyszymy — od pierwszego nieśmiałego razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przebudziłem się… — powtórzył z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zakotłowało się w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłem to z niemałą dozą ostrożności, z długim wahaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszłość jest przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba to schować i odprowadzić bawoły! — powiedział — Pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zaakcentować tę kwestię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to jest Bernard? — Bernard to jest nakrapiany pies, który zdechł zeszłe go roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma jadących zaczęły rozwijać się pierwsze akordy gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ją przywitał, nie miał już ochrypłego głosu i cały czar znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec wziął jednego za uszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jednoręki zapewne w imieniu ślepca pięścią pogroził wszystkim rzeczonym przechodniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jak możesz żyć z nim pod jednym dachem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dofinansowano ze środków Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile się nie mylę, przeszedł pan dwukrotnie operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka mi się skarży, że wciąż jej coś ginie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi wyjść na jaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie przystąpiliśmy dotychczas do właściwej rzeczy, która mnie tu sprowadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejszą kwestią jest jednak reprezentowanie strefy euro na zewnątrz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy mogąc poinformować, że poprosiłem obie strony o dalszą współpracę w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywają pewne szczególne sytuacje, które wymagają po prostu rozwiązań po stronie podaży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiste jest, że większość w Parlamencie poprze także tę dyrektywę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel był już tak blisko, a zarazem tak daleko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie tego rodzaju rząd będzie w stanie zapewnić konieczną jedność narodu palestyńskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, pułapki przedstawiania konkurencji jako bezwzględnego i niepodważalnego dogmatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy za każdym razem czegoś wymagać, a następnie tego odmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiemy, wreszcie, dlaczego otwarcie sektora usług i sektorów sieciowych przebiega z oporami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysiłki zmierzające do zwiększenia produkcji na świecie nie wystarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzę temu kongresowi wszelkich sukcesów w pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walka ta wymaga dobrej, wspólnej koordynacji pomiędzy Parlamentem Europejskim, Radą i Komisją Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego rozporządzenie proponowane przez Komisję i zmienione przez Parlament szybko wejdzie w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Terroryzm jest zagrożeniem dla wszystkich państw i wszystkich narodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiednio oceniono również bezpieczne składowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak byłoby najciekawiej, najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham ciebie, jak nigdy nie kochałam nikogo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plaże nad Bałtykiem latem są pełne Polaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadomość opinii publicznej oczywiście pomaga reporterowi i sprawie, za którą walczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończeniu nauki nie mogłem wytrzymać w domu, a jednocześnie nieznośny był mi gość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są sytuacje w życiu, w których te towarzyskie dodatki winny odpaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie możemy iść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obyśmy wszyscy żyli dobrze i zgodnie z sobą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że przyjdzie za pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ja jestem tym wszystkim” — można było o niej powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to jak starzy przyjaciele, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mariola wraca jutro z Mazur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rozumiem i wynoszę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bracia! — zawołał nagle Podlasiak, tkliwym spojrzeniem obdarzając obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dla mężczyzn życie jest sztuką, gdzie większość z nich zaledwie istnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schizofreniczne rozszczepienie graniczące chwilami z lekkim bzikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy myśli tu nas trzymać cały rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie przypuszczasz, kto padł ofiarą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiesił jej płaszcz w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszło, minęło — myślmy o chwili obecnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko, mówię ci, albo nie uratuje go już żadna siła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja będę musiał powiedzieć: „Mama umarła”, chyba tak? Co? Ona milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to wszystko zaczyna mi się nie podobać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże opowiadania o pustyni, w której niema ani rzek, ani kałuży, przestraszyły Murzynów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do czego służy ta brudna belka? — zapytała Liza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Rawlison postanowił mu to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nel, co tobie jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczpospolita Polska. Polska Ludowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, oczywiście, gdyby nie była porządną i uczciwą dziewczyną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna dziura w centrum naszej galaktyki nazywa się Saggitarius A.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skalałeś naszą kastę! — zawołał drżącym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włożywszy ją do paszczy wypuścił zaraz na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypił łyk kawy i skrzywił się mimo woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda ono zupełnie jak kwadratowy skrawek światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, chłopcze, kiedy się uspokoisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21084413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźmy pod uwagę Whitaker Almanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętał rozbawiony wyraz oczu ojca, gdy docierał do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza mną zapadły głucho w zamek ciężkie, dębowe drzwi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza że tak długo mówił Emilowi prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wlazłam na płot i rzuciłam psom zatrute mięso.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedpokoju zauważył, że pada deszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znać od dawna już nikt nie używał tej ścieżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał przy mikroskopie, na biurku leżał stos otwartych książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on nie może, dlatego że ja go nie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaproponował, abyśmy spróbowali naśladować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — potwierdził z głęboką zadumą jednoręki, pilnie i nabożnie zajęty niespodzianą wyżerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na przykład — Jędrek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przetrzebiłoby się puszczy szmat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykolejona myśl poczęła układać się do równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, pragnę odnieść się do poprawek złożonych w Parlamencie Europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuje panu bardzo za pańskie uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu głosowałem za odrzuceniem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim skończę, chciałbym pokrótce wyjaśnić kilka nowości w programie prac\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie zostało w tym kierunku uczynione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmiankuje się o korzyściach, ale nie wskazując dokładnie w sprawozdaniu, skąd mogłyby one płynąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podoba mi się natomiast to, że państwa członkowskie mają same wytyczać sobie cele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba urządzać wycieczki, różne zabawy na boisku, muszą biegać i skakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od pewnego czasu nasze granice są gotowe do obrony granic Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości w obu tych przypadkach jako pierwsi wysłaliśmy specjalistów w obszary klęski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie organizacje społeczeństwa obywatelskiego borykają się z ogromnym niedostatkiem środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39596395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę twoim sekundantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie pójdzie do niej żebrać o miłość po tamtym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było sobie miasteczko nad rzeczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten może będzie coś wiedział, może gdzieś zadzwoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie trzeba mi było pozwalać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, jak żywi — idzie wszystko, jak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto mój, przyszłam do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opracował zasady i zbiory idei, które ja dzisiaj noszę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A widzi łaskawy pan, jak mu się język rozwiązał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los padł na Michała, prostodusznego i kochającego młodzież entuzjastę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnajdywała go wszędzie i ciągle, ze zwierzęcą, jasno widzącą pewnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, dokąd idzie, co niesie w koszyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodź — zawołał do Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I podał Maciusiowi papier, wciąż stojąc na baczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za rozpaczliwa posucha bieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mu położono złoty zegarek, zobaczył orła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie strony licytują się w obojętności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jesteś silniejszy niż ci chłopcy, z którymi się bawisz? — Fredek jest słabszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle lubię podróżować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nacisnęło mu coś lekko oddech i serce, zęby zaczęły mu szczękać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz rozmawiał najpierw z matką, a Emil siedział w poczekalni i miał tremę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę marnie zdechnąć w mej ciemnej norze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę głosić nowych zasad moralnych ani też obalać porządku społecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się odwlecze to nie uciecze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama wlepiła weń spojrzenie zionące gniewem i nienawiścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie, niesie koszyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam z nią zawsze, mimo że miałam ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37136290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli uda się nam to przerwać, będziemy bliżej celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37136291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówić krótko, ponieważ nie ma już czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37136292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego świątobliwość Dalajlama złoży jutro wizytę w naszym Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37136293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiałem się tego od początku i obawa ta urzeczywistniła się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37136294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może jest to najtrudniejszy problem wolnego społeczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażenie \\\"handel ludźmi\\\" jest nieco mylące, nie ma bowiem w tym niczego ludzkiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy swą żarłoczność, wilk położył się z powrotem i zaczął głośno chrapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy każde państwo członkowskie musi wprowadzić tę usługę prawidłowo i w całości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"refundacji wywozowych i prywatnego składowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza łódź nabiera wody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że musimy wziąć pod uwagę to, co myślą ci młodzi ludzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pannę Izabelę w przykry sposób dotknęła jego obojętność dla sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważnie przysłuchiwałam się komentarzom szanownych panów posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, owszem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38558412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz ten przymiot zdaje się wzmagać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest Pani bielsza niż biel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rezolucji Socjaldemokratów poruszyliśmy kilka problemów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy będą się dziwić, że trwało to tak długo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może mamy niewielkie opóźnienie w debacie na temat statutu Europejskiego Rzecznika Praw Obywatelskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu jego chybione działania doprowadziły gospodarkę jego kraju do całkowitej ruiny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została wprowadzona na rynek bez wystarczającego wyjaśnienia związanego z nią ryzyka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domniemany łoś okazał się jeleniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chciałbym przejść do problemu azbestu, który był już tutaj przedmiotem dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament sam nie może zmienić Statutu posła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po trzecie, jakie są ramy czasowe przewidziane na złagodzenie ograniczeń wizowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konserwatyści popierają zasadę wynagrodzeń minimalnych w Wielkiej Brytanii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy naprawdę wolnego wewnętrznego rynku energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, abyśmy jako wspólnota międzynarodowa domagali się położenia kresu tym potwornościom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mnie to tyle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35343604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym tu ponownie zwrócić uwagę na udane wyniki pracy belgijskiej prezydencji Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, dokąd idzie, co niesie w koszyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwnie ruch się wzmaga na namacalnie ciemnym podwórzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślałem nad tym, że społeczeństwo ludzkie to jedna ogromna sieć pomyłek i głupstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieliśmy go najpierw obudzić, żebyśmy mogli porozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkość działania nie była cechą natury młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem z zapalniczką?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas nam w drogę! — rzekł nagle kulawiec i zajął zwykłe po prawej stronie stanowisko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te trzy książki czytał na zmianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to jest ze zdaniami, powstałymi na podstawie indukcji, pytasz? To nie ma znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak one wyglądają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdawała sobie sprawy z tego, jak długo spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idealna pogoda na rower!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwy człowiek pracuje sprawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymia, „bezimienna paszcza”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo muszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwład i zniechęcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłyśmy dawniej tak osamotnione, zziębnięte i zgłodniałe, a teraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ci powiedzieć coś złego, jak tamtej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale twój tato musi mieć kupę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jesteś chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno kłamał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim — znikły wszelkie towary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób zmieniano swoje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne zajęcie z jakimś boskim pierwiastkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram, mając do pomocy swoje dzikie bestie, był pewny zwycięstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczam: Ja — się — na tym — nie — znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę tego znieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanisław.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnął się o krok i wytrzeszczył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idź sobie, ciociu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec wróci z roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęśliwi Murzyni odetchnęli, napada i grabieże ustały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lewoskrętny szampon wywołał prawoskrętną reakcję łańcuchową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiada, że ma zbyt wrażliwe serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale spieszyliśmy się i nie wzięliśmy z sobą tytoniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tom, gdzie się zatrzymamy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchaj, to jest głupia historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo! — odparłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy się tak odmienili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woń surowizny i krwi doszła aż do drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20877212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężar, temperatura, grawitacja, masa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie smoki i całe Indie stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj, aż on wróci na spoczynek… a potem: jeden celny strzał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spij, smarkaczu! Zobaczył, że zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielką zaletą onego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil musiał głęboko oddychać co parę mi nut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna będzie wielka, a może i nie tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za drzwiami matka krzyczaia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem zapomniał o swojej biedzie i niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co chwila, boję się zdradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili opanował go nowy atak podejrzliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie kule przeszyły mur i spłaszczyły się na ścianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można było wyraźnie spostrzec, ile zadawał sobie trudu, aby poprawnie mówić po niemiecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieszył się z depeszy Czerwonego Krzyża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powiedział pewien milicjant – smutek jest jak pochód – przemija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile to czarnych przez niego zginęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski opuścił rajtszulę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suzin westchnął, zmarszczył brwi i znowu wypił szampana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś pisze pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał za dozorcę księdza, który go pilnował\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż, dawniej, trzy czwarte małżeństw z miłości zawiązywało się przez taniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy kto pójdzie po chirurga?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli więc słabość do kobiet nie kompromituje Bonapartych, dlaczego miałaby uwłaczać Wokulskiemu?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24621985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on chyba był bardzo chorym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obecnej chwili europejskie ramy kwalifikacji są ładną, ale pustą skorupą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zatem zadać Komisji następujące pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.324,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim ma ono na celu uproszczenie procedury ustalania wierzytelności alimentacyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo dobrze ze sobą współpracowaliśmy nad sporządzeniem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zgadzam się z usłyszanymi tu uwagami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"System ten dotyczy wszystkich państw członkowskich, a także Norwegii, Islandii, Wysp Owczych i Rosji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi o zmniejszenie kosztów energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dziś dzień nie ma podstawy traktatowej dla polityki energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wraz z lordem Soamesem jednym z dwóch pierwszych komisarzy pochodzących z Wielkiej Brytanii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram propozycję sprawozdawcy, żeby uwzględnić zapewnianie pomocy w przesiedlaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zaangażuje się pani w działanie, które uniemożliwi supermarketom nadużywanie ich monopolistycznej pozycji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozporządzenie było przedmiotem długiej dyskusji pomiędzy Parlamentem Europejskim i Radą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak, Europa musi okazać Grecji solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instrumenty ochrony handlu muszą być efektywne i zapewniać uczciwe warunki konkurencji wszystkim naszym przedsiębiorcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyważone porozumienie w tym przedmiocie jest oczywistą koniecznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z największą chęcią radośnie rzuciłbym mu się na szyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwienia o mało nie upadłem z krzesła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mgnieniu oka chwycili mnie dwaj policjanci i nałożyli kajdanki na ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na miłość boską wysłuchaj mię pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestań, aż serce boli jak widzę ile tego marnujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się go naprawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strumienie wody spływały z dachów po fasadach domów, jak potoki łez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że Poznaniacy są pazerni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemy i nieruchomy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż miałem wejść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedłem okratowaniem przez wązką ścieżkę ogrodową, przysunąłem twarz do szyby: wszędzie ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zszedłem na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastukałem do bramy: nikt nie otwierał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zrobiła przekonywującą minę: Tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23558499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czyś już przeżyła jaki cud, że tak na cud oczekujesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bóg łaskaw — sypiam jak suseł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mrugnięcia nie zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka boska siła tworząca coś z niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamąciło się w głowie, mignęło przed oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurczowo zacisnął dłoń na kolbie rewolweru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był na pogrzebie i nie pokazał się trzy dni w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą się wziąć nie dam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma powodu do obaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matematyka to mój ulubiony przedmiot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powitał ich śmiech: wszyscy byli trochę podchmieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie chcę ci wstydu narobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tak ino z wielkiej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podróż była bardzo przyjemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, posiada pan duży talent konwersacyjny, zwłaszcza w kierunku parowania pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spiesz się, mamy czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żona nie powinna wiedzieć, że wieczór się nie odbył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi krzemień szurnął przez całe biurko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko są uczonymi albo wielkimi artystami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nalewał wody do wanny i robił okręty z papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warczała jak pies, któremu zabierają kość; kością była jej zupełna samotność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąską uliczkę między dwoma rzędami bazarów wypełniał skłębiony malowniczo tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak niespodzianie, tak znienacka, jak bywa nieraz ze szczęściem lub śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pies oparł się łapami o poręcz i głowa mu podskakiwała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie postanowiłem mu rzecz całą zakomunikować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona czekała na to, aż się pożegna, i on wiedział o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieniądze szczęścia nie dają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że się dasz złapać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to trwało może kwadrans: nie całując się, dotykali się nawzajem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właściwie cóż by nam przyszło z tego, gdybyśmy wreszcie go odnaleźli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, ale to nikt, nie może sobie zdać sprawy z czyjejś śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym był na środku tamy, nadbiegła druga fala powodzi i rozstrzaskała się o belkowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozgląda się dzikie wiejskie dziecko po ogromnym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli przodem do wnętrza koła, na złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Newton też ułożył swój systemik dedukcyjnie, chociaż powstał on niewątpliwie na podstawie indukcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekund kilka — jak wiek długich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w stadium jednej ze swych słynnych „ucieczek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa odskoczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przestał, bo po co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, moja droga, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź do szóstego oddziału i zobacz, czy tam jest globus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze królewskie mości, jeszcze nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiecień plecień, co przeplata, trochę zimy, trochę lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, ile w nim papierów i rupieci! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem opadł i zaczął się tlić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Malutka jest, paluszki ma malutkie i tak strasznie mało rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Kuba Bogu, tak Bóg Kubie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy czasu cze kać na wyniki laboratoryjnej socjologii czy ekonomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj twórcy odebrali nagrody z rąk prezydenta miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się nad nimi zbierać czarne chmury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas przystąpiłem do badania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą się czuć osamotnieni i pozbawieni przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im prędzej skończymy, tym lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo inaczej gniew bogów spadnie na was“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodźmy prędzej do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum był tak poruszony tą sceną, że nie mógł już krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21641878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udał się wyjątkowo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego Panowie wtargają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wązki korytarz był natłoczony po brzegi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim oświetleniu litery na obwódce stały się bardziej wyraźne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemiec pokręcił głową odmownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchnął serdecznym śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21663993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na drodze spotkał ich inspektor policyjny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21664017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tedy wędrująca na zachód karawana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21664018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dochód po potrąceniu wydatków przeznaczony był dla zwycięzcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie mówi u cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym być jakimś takim dzikim kotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brunatny księżyc pełzał po zboczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślę, że to będzie możliwe, gdy przestanę cię ko chać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem trochę znużona przechadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba jakieś nowe stanowisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech patrzy — powtórzył jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma żal do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22134997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22135144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież mi się wargi pokurczą od niechęci! — tłumaczyła się żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan może wiedzieć o tym wszystkim? — szeptał na pół przytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbujemy zakrzyczeć prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Erupcja wulkanu wywołała bardzo duże zniszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie w tym roku ma on szczególnie ważne przyczyny do obawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywiązał się spór, który został rozstrzygnięty przez samego Mistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygnął się konwulsyjnie kilka razy, ale wysiłki były daremne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na generale wywarły one straszliwe wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogromnie cieszę się pańskim widokiem, panie Wilson, słowo daję!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem wyradza się ono w ordynarność, czasem wydaje się śmieszne, ale to głupstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu właśnie chwycił się za nogę, symulując niedomaganie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznajmiono wszystkim okolicznym włościanom, że ten, kto wskaże przestępcę, otrzyma pięćset franków nagrody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostrzec je można dopiero z odległości kilku kroków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu jednak słońce zaszło i nastąpiła noc pełna tajemnic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom pogrążony był w milczącej poświacie księżyca, jakby we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą do wieczora dowie się o tem, że pan walczył z Mistrzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda z paczek była związana sznurkiem, opieczętowana i zaopatrzona napisem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może być wypadek, że on sprawę zepsuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja stawała się przykra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sługa nie dała zbić się z tropu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało mojej matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest granica powiatu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest nie do zniesienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gra świąteczna muzyka, mamy świeczki, jedzenie i fajnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący jest umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz, Felek, dlaczego taki jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę możności powinno ono rosnąć pod ochroną i odpowiedzialnością rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochałem cię jak syna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie trzeba na niego zaraz tak pomstować!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czymże to pan duma?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem uniosła i oglądała jądra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja myślę, Henry... - zaczął Bill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była tak blisko, że dość było wyciągnąć rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Zawsze był głupim psem - wtrącił Bill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wydostał się z pod ziemi i jął nasycać światłem ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym, czego ślepy kutas nie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urocza Świnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie smuci mnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mówiąc, zwrócił się ku izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to może być?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie pisnął słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawę rozstrzygnął wicher, który w chwilę później porwał dach namiotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólna teoria względności Alberta Einsteina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wszystkiemu kto był winien?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przkro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gaża jego wynosi siedemset funtów rocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady szły w stronę lasu, a potem skręcały ku wąwozowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kłamał dzień w dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale uśmiech zgasł szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc będziemy włazić przez okno? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nudził się tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zrobić wszystko, co zechcę? Przed rokiem mógłbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani słyszała wystrzał i zeszła od razu na dół?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rebeko, podziękuj pannie Sarze za jej wielką łaskawość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym ruchliwy język coraz głębiej wtykał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janusz Nosacz jako bohater memów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szas ostro sprzeciwił się tym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź go znowu do buzi, a na pewno stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21923537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21923538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21923539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
