      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22597655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22597656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22597657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22597658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22597659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno stoi na fortepianie Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, głupi ja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Park odchodzi w coraz głębszą ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina pierwsza trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też pośród wszystkich ludzi najbardziej nienawidzę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poruszył się na łóżku, gdy weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo zachowała się i teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe ciało Lizy zatrzęsło się wściekłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także w innych izbach niejedno nadawało się do zmiany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na swoją mamę wronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja nie śpię i muszę ją ratować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ nie mogłem okłamywać samego siebie, przeto musiałem czekać długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz wyniknął pomiędzy nimi spór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Baw się dobrze, synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo — krzywi się nosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20840102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważają wśród nich ludzie miejscowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed nią i powiedział: — Dalej nie pójdziesz, aż się nie wyplączemy z tej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak się spóźniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst opracowany na podstawie: Antoni Lange, W czwartym wymiarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas śniadania zobaczył, że narzeczony Krystyny jest dziobaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie przechodzi jeden dzień po drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłem w jego gabinecie, urągał mi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł ręką rozpalone czoło, nowy dreszcz go przeleciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie nie czuje się na siłach do otwartej walki ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było też dużo rzeczy do jedzenia, jakbyśmy mieli przez tydzień nie wychodzić z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem! — przypomniał z wyrzutem w głosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjechał Seweryn i wydano ją bez gadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz sobie o tym myślał, dopóki nie wrócisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego pan jeszcze chce ode mnie? — zagadnął znów niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym całkiem cicho: — I nauczy się pan rezygnować z efektów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sądziłem, że Ania wcale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak proste zagadnienia są zabawką dla inteligentnego umysłu i nie nużą go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko rzeka Jussef wiąże, rzekłbyś, niebieskim sznurkiem tę okolicę z doliną Nilu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekł Tadeusz z powagą: Zosiu, to są jaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina szesnasta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co słychać? — zapytuje go Zosia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Baw się dobrze, synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzą — nudzą — nie kupują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale gdyby się tak mogło wciąż mi wydawać… niechby tak było!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzynasta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Patrzył przez długi czas na nie istniejące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie poszedł do złożonych pod drzewem rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby to w tej porze roku raczej o wpół do piątej, niż szóstej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem w niełasce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21158156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umarła rok przedtem, zanim go poznałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci poza tym donieść, że za miesiąc wychodzi moja epidemiologia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źródłem wszelkiego zła jest świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jutra wystarczy — oświadczył jednoręki i po namyśle dodał: — Do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to stany poprzedzające omdlenie spowodowane nadmiarem narkotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor: Jan Baptysta Porta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiedzieli, że rabuś, a nikt mu nie mógł dowieść niczego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś lalką, niczym więcej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwadzieścia, no, powiedzmy trzydzieści tysięcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój pan takiej wędliny nie robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagali się od niego, by im wyjaśnił, co mają czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak studnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej, dotychczas przykucnięci, powstali nagle z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omiń korek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda to na kieszonkowe złodziejstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg, który go wiózł, wyjechał wczoraj nad ranem z Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty wobec rozwagi zawsze byłeś w opozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę zawsze sama, albo z mężczyznami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko robi zwariowane zachowanie się Emila przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię filmy dokumentalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi, szedł wolno w piżamie wzdłuż korytarza, wykładanego zielonym linoleum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy z uczuciem niewypowiedzianej trwogi i zdumienia „poznałem” moją narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie sprawozdanie odnosi się do różnych metod leczenia z wykorzystaniem dorosłych komórek macierzystych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to błędne koło, które powoduje katastrofy polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też wszystkie rozważania na temat nieodpowiedzialności Republiki Czeskiej są zupełnie zbędne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależy to od formy, jaką mu nadamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze by było, gdyby powiedziała nam Pani coś więcej na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też sądzę, że sprawozdanie, nad którym będziemy głosować jutro, zasługuje na poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc pragnę poprzeć przedmiotowy wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że należy to stwierdzić, ponieważ Unia Europejska nie może porzucać swoich zasad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo to należy z tym krajem rozmawiać i należy z tym krajem podpisać porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38179529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele mają prawo do ochrony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38185200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy poważnie przeanalizować i wyszczególnić konsekwencje niewprowadzenia traktatu lizbońskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38185201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie najlepiej wróży negocjacjom i dalszej współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38185202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsądne zastosowanie tych funduszy przyniesie wymierne efekty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38185203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To proceder, który pozwoli ograbić z elit kraje trzecie, pogarszając jeszcze bardziej ich sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38185204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie jest moje zalecenie na dzisiaj i na przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem tegoż wieczora dostałem zaproszenie na występ w prywatnym mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To, co pan mówi, jest bardzo logiczne, ale w swojej logiczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie jest ważne, kto ma rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim — znikły wszelkie towary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama musiała je zdobyć w jakiś sprytny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy?” „W niedzielę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Omijam ją z daleka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta nasze spotkały się, a ciała splotły w miłosnym szale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem na twoje rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta błyskawica w jednej chwili ukazała jej całą głębię jej upadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — odrzekł po chwili — o to chodzi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkość działania nie była cechą natury młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to bóg wojny, zjawiający się powtórnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie zadać następujące pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszą mnie Pana propozycje, ale nie wystarczą one do rozwiązania najważniejszego problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Globalny kryzys finansowy miał również wpływ na sektor transportu morskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram również determinację, z jaką zamierza pan, panie przewodniczący, podjąć to wyzwanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich latach oporność na antybiotyki u zwierząt gospodarskich i domowych stała się problemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię wyraźne \\\"tak\\\" podatkowi od transakcji finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego rodzaju system funkcjonuje już w Stanach Zjednoczonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy także wdzięczni Parlamentowi Europejskiemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnictwa i Rozwoju Obszarów Wiejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia ta jest priorytetem dla wszystkich państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowite wycofanie kwot będzie śmiertelnym ciosem dla wielu drobnych hodowców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale powinniśmy również chronić interesy naszych rolników i sektora rolno-spożywczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasada ta została zaakceptowania przez Ehuda Baraka in Tabę, oraz przez innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona uwarunkowana osiągnięciem ich własnych celów, wyznaczonych na mapie drogowej równości płci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33230793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podejrzewam, że nie wzrosną one ani o jedno euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłował się wszakże niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie Bartek używał ich do okrywania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akcent słów brzmiał trochę obco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mnie obchodzi logika natury…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak… — rzekł Hipolit.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A kryzys właśnie nastąpił\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowa wynegocjowana przez Komisję z władzami Szwajcarii jest całkowicie odpowiednia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odniósł się pan do włączenia niektórych danych pojawiających się w przedmiotowej decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi powód jest polityczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otuchy dodaje nam również fakt, że Rada Europejska wyraża poczucie nagłej potrzeby działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spośród-wniosków Rady chciałabym wyróżnić wagę zasady swobodnego przepływu wiedzy w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymają ją, jeżeli przyjęte zostaną nasze poprawki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym sposobem na odzyskanie konkurencyjności byłoby obniżenie stawek wynagrodzeń do tego poziomu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"podpisanie aktów prawnych przyjętych w trybie zwykłej procedury ustawodawczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Jezus miłosierny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa pokazała jedność i solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wówczas, że w imieniu mojej grupy zdecydowanie popieram cele polityki w obszarze środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja kontynuuje jednocześnie dwustronne i międzyregionalne negocjacje z licznymi partnerami handlowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie ta akcesja może nasilić zwalczanie zorganizowanej przestępczości wywodzącej się z rejonu Bałkanów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27332521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdajemy sobie wszyscy sprawę, że działalność nadawcza nie zna granic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22283621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro go tylko zobaczę, dziwnie mi się ściska gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść to jeszcze raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę w sprawie urzędowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpiłem, że i ona poznała mnie także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały ciąg owych daremnie straconych lat jaśniałeś w sercu moim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie stale wrzało życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi, szedł wolno w piżamie wzdłuż korytarza, wykładanego zielonym linoleum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, żem okaleczył tego łotra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pewien czas udawali, że nic nie czują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko paru obrazki narysowało i położyliśmy na stoliku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał w półmroku, bo bał się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd się tu wzięły skały pierwotne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa wyjdzie ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ani słowa, rozumiesz, bo tajemnica służbowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to podczas obiadu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej jest wiadomym, że monogamia stanowi podstawę własności osobistej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mu Bóg błogosławi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan najlepszą pozycję, by to czynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bezpieczeństwa dostaw energii oraz strategii na rzecz przejścia na niskoemisyjne źródła energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim regionie mamy w Bracknell światowej sławy średniego zasięgu centrum prognozowania pogody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kątach leżały stosy żelastwa, rzemieni, klepek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpraca między ośrodkami koordynacji pomocy na morzu bez wątpienia musi się poprawić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero teraz, niestety!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Interesujący będzie sposób, w jaki tego dokonają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu najbliższych dziesięciu lat wyborcy w innych krajach-płatnikach netto również powiedzą \\\"nie\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie powinniśmy się obawiać silnej, ale słabej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już dziś powiedziałem, mamy wszczęte procedury nadmiernego deficytu wobec Zjednoczonego Królestwa i Węgier\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed wyborami zaoferowałem swoim rodakom ratyfikację parlamentarną traktatu z Lizbony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólnie z Islandią utworzyły natomiast jednolity obszar gospodarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38754355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek zapewni również lepszą ochronę informacji niejawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli razem na łóżku i oparli głowy o ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie przechodzi jeden dzień po drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zbladł prawie tak bardzo, jak wtedy w klozecie, zrobiło mu się niedobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie spaliły się też dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złota nam brakło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak trzaskasz drzwiami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął jej usta pocałunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem i zdrętwiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan gotów jest przysiądz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa zasmolone czarne biurka z wysoką na metr nasadą stały naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro jedziemy na wycieczkę do safari.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W górze na estradzie: tuziny panów w czarnych frakach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi to jak komenda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie mdły, duszący zapach, pleśniowego grzyba i wilgotnej ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten krok było jeszcze dosyć czasu, gdy zawiodą wszystkie inne środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on wiedział, co się teraz stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ach, że ten szlachetny człowiek opuścić musiał nasz padół ziemski!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ramię drżało ledwo widocznie na mojej piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ból wcisnął mi się w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze to samo imię Rozyna; zawsze jedna jest zmartwychwstaniem drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla uczczenia dzisiejszego dnia pańskich urodzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażałem też sobie że każdej chwili drzwi się muszą otworzyć i nieznajomy wejdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drogo ceniłem życie, bom wierzył, że mały kapral powróci...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na kilka lat przynajmniej wyzwoli ją to od trosk życia codziennego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewoźnik się przeżegnał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka tak jakby mówiła, jakby radziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie mogę mówić nic więcej, niż to com powiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również nie było wody do mycia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce drętwego kurczu dotykały znów mego gardła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz prawdę mówiąc nie jestem nią, tylko przeznaczenie pchnęło mnie na złą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli na bok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25068230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakto, dla Boga, to brzmi głucho, powiedział podnosząc oczy z zadziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25253028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25253029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim gosposie wypoczęły, przybyli goście; musiały się więc gorączkowo spieszyć, żeby ich przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25253030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego niedbałe, powolne zachowanie się, spokój nie rokowały nadziei rychłego ukończenia naszego przedsięwzięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25253031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes machnął ręką, nie odpowiadając na pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25253032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadziwiłem cię stukaniem o bruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był nagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo ty nie leżysz na dnie morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i tak jest zaiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się pan woźny nie zgodzi, to niech sam go wyrzuci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkałem ją raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki mi opowiadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było stanąć w „ogonku” i poczekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi się trochę podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rzecz się ma z alkoholem w małych dawkach i nikotyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co tam pojedzie z takimi nowinami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj kota w worku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i śpiew nieustanny, uczty i igrzyska zapełniały jego życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział krótki, urwany śmiech kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tego śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie mogę tego teraz zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeszcze nie dowód!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ponownie dokonujemy oceny historycznych niedorzeczności i historycznych ograniczeń praktycznych, występujących dotychczas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja studiowałbym na przykład astronomię, inni mogliby studiować fizykę lub geografię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety skala problemu wzrasta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam się zatem z prośbą do Komisji o ponowne rozpatrzenie przedmiotowego tekstu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"decyzja w sprawie emisji z tak zwanych pojazdów składanych, czyli budowanych wieloetapowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować wszystkim mówcom za ich interesujące i pełne zaangażowania wystąpienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele zostało rannych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ważna część prawodawstwa w dziedzinie bezpieczeństwa i higieny pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też prowadzimy w tej sprawie ciągły dialog z administracją amerykańską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczas udało nam się uzgodnić dwanaście reguł i ustaliliśmy, że są one identyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzemy również przedłożoną dziś ustną poprawkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc trudno mu było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy otwarcie rozmawiać z Turcją, której integrację, co powtórzę na koniec, popieramy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt się nie bił, nie pchał, nie przezywał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30605680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owinął ręce koło szyi, bije brodą, kopie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ojciec wszakże pierwszy spostrzegł, że dziecko zamieniło się w dziewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo głoszenia przez Sowiety haseł antywojennych, należą one do rzędu państw najbardziej militarystycznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, odwagi, odwagi, człowieku; zdawałoby się, że życie z was ucieka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała miejscowość przedstawiała w tej chwili jedną przestrzeń błota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes roześmiał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchnął serdecznym śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu rozległy się oklaski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł ją i uspokoił, tuląc główkę jej do piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast pracownik zapobiegliwy jest bardzo ostrożny w zapełnianiu swego strychu mózgowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego do mnie przychodzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojcowski rząd pozwolił mi spędzić ten czas na usiłowaniach, zmierzających do odzyskania zdrowia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sali dał się słyszeć szmer zdumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłonił się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewa dowiedzieć się wszystkiego jeszcze dzisiejszej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21352954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz spojrzał na nich z zadowoleniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24566441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się pochwycić ręką lont, którego drugi koniec sięgał do magazynu prochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24566442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mojej siostry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24566443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym nie był powrócił, tobyś dziś jeszcze była panną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24566444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alfabet składa się z liter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24566445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katarzyno będę ciebie wiecznie kochał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deszcz lał strumieniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani jest za dobra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem ambasadorem cesarza chińskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo się pomyliłeś, albo jesteś pomylony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na schodki, wiodące do trybuny sędziów i oglądał się na wszystkie strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mikołaj zabrał kapelusz i zaniósł go do sypialni pana Tomasza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale konia, konia, konia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pilnik!“ usłyszałem szept w swej głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spełnię twoje życzenie, ale sama sobie gwałtem wpędzasz żądło do serca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24567391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szuman nie odpowiedział nic, tylko spojrzał zpod oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22306744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajęty był on właśnie tym strasznym eksperymentem tej nocy, gdy zemdlał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o potwierdzenie, czy dane są zgodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy muszą być szczęśliwi, nawet konie!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tylko go sobie zanotuję!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to lubię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz wróćmy do naszego interesu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzę na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce już zachodziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A od kiedy ty laptopa masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie mylił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co się ukazało moim oczom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panowie Klejn i Lisiecki pożegnali się i wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżył się do niego z wesołą twarzą, lecz wicehrabia czekał nań smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre matki, ciotki, albo ojcowie poprostu przyprowadzają do nas panny na wydaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie pamiętasz, jak brat jego w kościele obchodził się z nim niegodziwie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24683176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie to... Panu Motylkowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wakacje jego zaczynały się dopiero za kilka dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz to czytać, póki nie wrócę ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda chlusta wielką strugą, oczy chłopcu zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ej, tam kosmacz! Pójdź do nogi! - zawołał. - Chociaż wilk czy pies, czy ki diabeł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już powinna się wyrzec wszelkich strojów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rób tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kieł podszedł dość prędko, ale nie porywczo. Nieśmiały był i jakby obserwujący sam siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź, mówię ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazać go — krzyczy, a potem ryczy galeria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To matka mówiła litanię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na środę, na czwartą po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Idrys myślał teraz o czym innym i po chwili znów rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Denominacja, inflacja, popyt i podaż pieniądza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20885264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko pytałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tych bram, i domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle lubię podróżować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest kierowca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie mogą liczyć na pewną dyskrecję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mu było na imię? — spytał ciekawie jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To, co pan mówi, jest bardzo logiczne, ale w swojej logiczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy powitaniu wyczytałem w jej oczach utajoną obawę i niepewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dębowy… — szepnął porozumiewawczo do jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebył pan szczęśliwie nader poważną chorobę; wszelkie wzruszenia mogłyby panu zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22316889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mogę zapewnić, że ci ostatni przyjmowali nas „cokolwiek“ kwaśno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg, który go wiózł, wyjechał wczoraj nad ranem z Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział mi jej równy, głęboki oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślam się, czy miejsce wybuchu jest na Ukrainie czy na Pomorzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna rzecz, że to z Panem było całkiem na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór masz wolny… — szepnął głosem drżącym i spuściwszy głowę, znieruchomiał od wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło tylko o zobaczenie tego, co jest na dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz mieć sen zdrowy, panie naczelniku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaznaczę tylko wizje, nie wdając się w szczegółowe opisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest o rok spóźniona, bo chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pójdę spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jej to była wola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo dyskutowaliśmy nad tym tematem, ale większość była przeciwna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.476,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny wyżełek z wyzłacaną obrączką zeskakiwał ze schodów, zatrzymał się i powąchał zawiniątko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam do odczytania oświadczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, nadal wykonywane są egzekucje na młodocianych przestępcach pomimo protestów społeczności międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My jako Europa musimy mieć pewność, że podołamy zadaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysyłane do podpisu papiery są coraz dłuższe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś wieczorem nie mówimy o totalitaryzmie, nie posługujemy się eufemizmami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę spojrzeć na mapę Słowacji, którą mam tu przed sobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam widzisz teraz, że jesteś dumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie siedzieliśmy z założonymi rękami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie przypadek, że sprawa ta nabiera rangi kluczowego tematu w bieżącej kampanii wyborczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była opłacalna inwestycja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39925543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słychane to rzeczy na świecie?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłeś, że bez bójki się usuniesz! — krzyknął jednoręki, grożąc spuchniętą lewicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnęła, aby jak najprędzej ją zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujęty hojnymi napiwkami, ułatwiał kochankom schadzki w iście mistrzowski sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie tego nie warto mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień w klasztorze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli ulicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, przywiązujesz zbyt wielką wagę do tego krążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oni przeszli obok niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cmentarz zamykają tu wcześnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiem, ale szeptem i każdemu na osobności…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było też dużo rzeczy do jedzenia, jakbyśmy mieli przez tydzień nie wychodzić z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczył na jednym korzeniu, na drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po wirtuozowsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu potrzebna gimnastyka, musztra, one mogą być dobre albo złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile lat kończysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przypuszczałem, wychodziła ta szeroka ulica na główny plac, który mi opisał generał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to jest ze zdaniami, powstałymi na podstawie indukcji, pytasz? To nie ma znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienaturalne podniecenie wzrasta do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zbyt wolno i dlatego był szczęśliwy, że umie pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też tak myślę — powiedziała Pola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy niej, pojąc oczy harmonią jej ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz, raku zatracony, baw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy się tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bałwana ulepić, czy wskoczyć z rozmachu obiema nogami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam skierowaliśmy z Halszką swe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiadomo foki zapędza się po prostu do rzeźni niby barany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam? Jakim — nam? — wycedził przez zęby kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego za granicą nie ma tego podobno zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynieś no wiadro, Tomaszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale łazienki trzeba też umieć używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej się żyje w chałupie gajowego, a inaczej w młynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpoczęła — zaczerpnęła powietrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie mogę tego teraz zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile — myślisz — mogłabym zarabiać jako prostytutka? Żeby zarobić na podróż dokądkolwiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, przywiązujesz zbyt wielką wagę do tego krążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocucił nas dopiero jęk cichy, przeciągły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Proszę pana, czy ja mogę pana pocałować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źródłem wszelkiego zła jest świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rabusie widocznie zamierzali już odjechać, gdyż byli gotowi do drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metro było budowane odkrywkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U stóp tych wzgórz rozścielał się las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mi się zupełnie nieprawdopodobną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość tego życia na koszt ludu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi pan, że jest to ograniczone tylko na Londyńczyków i dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Globtroter nie musi objechać całego świata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas na przemoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niebyłe jaki człowiek ten młody John Clay.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą wątpił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcesz go podpalić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rondzie Giedroycia zjedź drugim zjazdem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez minutę, albo dłużej, sterczała ręka z podłogi, poruszając palcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siły mnie opuszczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdarza mi się ich nosić pod prysznicem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22828720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie zawrócił, zaklął i poszedł do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21717846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gdzież są ludzie, którzy mają spalić jej ciało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21717847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo Zosia chociaż młoda, ale dziewką była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21717848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to bowiem zwykłe przestępstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21717849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nim można zrobić interes!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21717850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes wydobył z szuflady małą, skórzaną torebkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że byłyby stosowne do czasu i okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uciekam od tej Kasi, gdzie pieprz rośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw lizał po wierzchu, rozpalał kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor w miarę rozmowy stawał się coraz poważniejszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja dzisiaj byłem na wywiadówce u syna w szkole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lejek był stosunkowo duży i mógł naraz pomieścić kwartę płynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem drzwi od pokoju generała otworzyły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— U pana z Indii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że mi też to wcześniej na myśl nie przyszło! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21724455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nilem do El-Wasta i do tatusia! — poczęła po wtarzać sennym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja na to pozwolić nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z pociągu nie wolno strzelać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W operacyjnej paliło się niebiesko-białe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujęty hojnymi napiwkami, ułatwiał kochankom schadzki w iście mistrzowski sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczała chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Newton też ułożył swój systemik dedukcyjnie, chociaż powstał on niewątpliwie na podstawie indukcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z moją skłonnością do pisania jest tak, jak z tubą pasty do zębów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to bardziej oddalali się od śródmieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil oparł się o poduszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Dzięki Bogu, cień ten nigdy nie padnie na ciebie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałam tylko ten dom i trochę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest zbyt niebezpieczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czternasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad równiną zamigotały roje gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchaj, słuchaj, ja byłam głupia, że ci to powiedzia łam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tego nie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam daleko stoi, kto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy nocleg wypadł im na lesistej wyżynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deszcz spływał jej strugami po twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sfrunął wiatr z drzewa i bawi się z chłopcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczęta ma otwarte, ni myśli o spaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to tajemne stowarzyszenie nie było stowarzyszeniem politycznem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21182322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z twarzy człowieka dużo można „wyczytać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi, pomiędzy filarami, przechadzało się kilku mnichów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem przerywa, aby podejść do fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tych wrażeń żadne nie robi specjalnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób ich dialogi stawały się coraz mniej zrozumiałe dla otoczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dużo jest jeszcze nie zbadanych rzeczy na świecie! — szepnął głosem przenikliwym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez te dwa lata mnie tu w tych stronach nie było…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza z wichrem szalała pod samotną chatką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechże matka ma rozum!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kto ci bronił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebracy leżeli w słoneczne dni na trotuarze i spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaś podasz mi kielich trucizny, działającej jak piorun.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwinął lewą rękę w trąbkę i podstawił pod oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj odprawę i zbądź kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to coś ważnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to w jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy trochę zaczekać, aż któraś podpłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzena zatrzymała się kilka metrów wcześniej i patrzyła w dal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo nie chcą słuchać dorośli, ten idzie do dzieciaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa odskoczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie mogę tego teraz zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże drogi, jak to czas płynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz stała się rzecz najsmutniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę w sprawie urzędowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się na człowieku: zostałem naczelnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20705966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka o historii Polski pana Zamoyskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie górnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto by był na jego miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokój się tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdy zasnę, to mi się może coś przyśni…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pranie brudnych pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest zdjęcie chomika jak je, tylko nie za dobrze widać, bo jest grube ziarno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszyscy do pomp!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mahdi pobił we wszystkich bitwa wojska rządowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rysach jej twarzy nie znalazł ani śladu zdziwienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydal z siebie dźwięk złego kota: ffff.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że burze podzwrotnikowe, im bardziej szaleją, tym trwają krócej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył się piękny sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21075465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciwie też słuchał Sudańczyków, zajętych przy kanale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawialiśmy z nim dosyć długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk tego imienia, szept tego imienia, jego zapach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu dzieci z domu wybiegły do ogródka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż nie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął oczy ze wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Powiesz mi podczas śniadania, czy mamusia ci pozwoliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet nie wiesz, o co im idzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z drugiej strony… hm… co się tyczy twojego odejścia stąd…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten stos musi być dzisiejszej nocy podpalony, Gerard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy razy w tym samym tygodniu miałem tam małą schadzkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi rosło na myśl o czynie, który mnie czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jedno spojrzenie w ciemną noc; nic się nie poruszało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajo musi być rozbite, aby z niego można było zrobić omlet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skok i siedziałem w siodle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im dalej szło, tem prędzej galopował mój ogier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby jego wołania nie usłyszano, z powodu silnego wycia wichru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny był ten świat, z którym miałem się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowałem się przecież w kraju nieprzyjacielskim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle w oczy moje uderzył błysk światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez przerwy niemal czekała na jego powrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach jego przyszła mi nowa myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył na to ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spokój, spokój, przecież to tylko gra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było też rytualne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wtedy blisko stolicy, widział, wiedział i rozumiał wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to znaczy? Nic nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mały pięcioletni Jano i jego świat magii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego wypluć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ci na imię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziłam dwójkę dzieci, ale wraz z mężem chcielibyśmy mieć trójkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpoczęła — zaczerpnęła powietrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwład i zniechęcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widzi ich też ktoś inny prócz mnie na moście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz musimy wybiegać myślą ku następnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończyło się ono fiaskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brakuje cywilnego i politycznego nadzoru nad armią, co jest po prostu niedopuszczalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest tylko wścibska komisja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie te sprawy znalazły się w sprawozdaniach, nad którymi obecnie debatuje Parlament\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli dobrze widzę, ma pani złamaną rękę - życzę szybkiego powrotu do zdrowia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowisko takie stanowi samo sedno naszej polityki na Bliskim Wschodzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję, że przekazanie tego projektu dalej to dobry pomysł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W efekcie osoby te nie korzystają z praw podstawowych gwarantowanych przez państwo pochodzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie, harmonizacja przepisów dotyczących rekompensaty za przedterminową spłatę nie jest konieczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich warunkach budujemy demokrację, będąc na celowniku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawa nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to najważniejsze wyzwanie stojące przed Europą w nadchodzących latach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to zwłaszcza dziedziny polityki globalnej, gdzie obecność Unii Europejskiej jest raczej nieśmiała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada zobowiązuje się to uczynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym nawiązać do nich i bardzo mocno poprzeć niektóre z przedstawionych propozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie uprościliśmy cały system\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety zbyt często prawa autorskie są przedstawiane jako przeszkoda dla powstania jednolitego rynku cyfrowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję reformy zainicjowane przez turecki rząd w ciągu ostatniego roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz są już gotowi i gratulujemy władzom Bośni i Albanii osiągnięć w realizacji reform\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, do czego dochodzi na południu, nie ma nic wspólnego z przyjemnym niedzielnym spacerem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciałbym, aby nasza debata była debatą na temat kinematografii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że zdołam przekrzyczeć ten gwar\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydarzenia w Afryce Północnej doprowadziły do nowych przepływów migracyjnych na południowej granicy Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewien, że państwo tego nie chcą tak samo jak ja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem nie zawsze otrzymujemy najlepsze usługi na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie, my posłowie reprezentujemy ludzi i ludzie żądają od nas zainteresowania się także bogatymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy dzielić się doświadczeniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest on już uzgodniony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27656732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Terroryzm musi być potępiony, a winni tej zbrodni muszą być, bez wyjątku, ukarani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25893884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wysłałem ten list dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25893886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości jednolity rynek wpływa na warunki życia każdego obywatela Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25893887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawór został zakręcony w Rosji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25893888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba się poważnie zająć problemami prześladowań z rąk tajskich urzędników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański program wskazuje zaś na zupełnie inną drogę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, którzy mnie znają, wiedzą, że w pochwałach i podziękowaniach jestem zwykle bardzo oszczędna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upadłe oświadczenia pisemne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zupełnie jakby rozmowa ze ślepym o kolorach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamierzamy ograniczyć pana wpływy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ponownie, będzie musiał być\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W innych przypadkach doszło tylko do zmiany podstawy prawnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, pragnę powtórzyć, co powiedziałem na początku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można teraz mówić, że nie jest to już nasz problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywa ta zasługuje na uznanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obowiązki sprzedawcy powinny być ograniczone do szczególnych testów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25894598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakładam, że Rada i pozostałe instytucje europejskie zastosują się do orzeczeń Trybunału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nas ocali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy rydz niż nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy się rozdzielić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nikt nie ma racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyją naturalnie i — być może — lepiej od mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jak woda, która przylega do ścian naczynia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim kulawiec zdążył powstać z upadku, znikła w rozbłyskanej słońcem zieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili bezładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to trwało może kwadrans: nie całując się, dotykali się nawzajem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobaw się z nami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia chrapie i dyszy przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisła, Odra, Warta i Bug to cztery najdłuższe rzeki w Polsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane takim tonem, że powinno jej się było wielu rzeczy odechcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam, już chcę wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puk, puk! — pukało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeleciał przez mur! — zawołała Maria, śledząca lot ptaszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do nich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtórny i głośniejszy jęk, wiosennie zgłuszony bujnymi ścianami dębu, wydobył się na\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła do grupy chłopców i dziewcząt, krzyknęła: — Twoja towarzyszka ma śliczną sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszycie, jak wołają „hura” w pracowniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dwie szyby w tym roku stłukli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej ani drgnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nic sobie wtedy z niego nie robiłam, ale byłam zadowolona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam ci do powiedzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolała go głowa i oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje myśli przeniosły się także i na inny przedmiot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czem nie marzyliśmy w tych cielęcych latach młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załóż kołnierzyk, przecież nie chcesz się przeziębić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgarbiła się, skuliła, zmalała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ej, Wera, fajny laptop.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to prawdziwy pech dla pana, żeś pan kawaler.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie no, znowu reklamy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O dziesiątej przy świerku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmej do dwunastej miałem cztery godziny czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę stałem u szczytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj mogłem się doskonale ukryć do wieczora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matko jedyna, co żeście porozrabiali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dość tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczy samej był to malowniczy widok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie rany, sierżancie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22707878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekaj, wybiła twoja ostatnia godzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak ludzie żyją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewolucja huczała rozpętana i zwycięska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci obiecać, że ten list będzie ostatni, ale gdybym mógł, obiecałbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz, teraz, wszystko to wydawało mi się dzieciństwem i marnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy w chłopskiej chałupie, był jeszcze taki słaby, że trudno mu było samemu chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, cóż mi dacie za wyjawienie sekretu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nią poszła druga, trzecia, czwarta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, od czego zacząć, gdzie jest droga i jak nią iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedługim był namysł więźniów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem ukradkowe spojrzenie do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"muszę nawet prawdę powiedzieć, że trudno by było znaleźć lepsze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim że więc pan chcesz mówić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wściekły pies widzi tylko ścieżkę przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuje wyłącznie potrzebę złapania czegoś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego ojciec, gorący patriota, dbał o to wielce, by chłopiec znał mowę ojczystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawało mi więc dokładne zastanowienie się nad pierwszą częścią wyprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem już świst jego oddechu i spostrzegłem jak się chwieje i potyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Bogu nadzieja, że mu wzrok przywróci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ptaki nie śpiewały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko stało się tak nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był głęboko zainteresowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli wam zimno, to chodźcie, siadajcie przy ogniu i grzejcie się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast zapanowałem nad sobą i rozejrzałem się w położeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie miałam z kim pojechać kajakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś był uważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tejże chwili stanął nad powierzchnią wysoki słup wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy można tą ścierką, to wytrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak zapominasz, to cała nauka z kary idzie w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszedłem z uczuciem ulgi i wkrótce zasnąłem głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność, wiadomo, jest złym towarzyszem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na żadne wołania, wrzaski nie zwracała uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie Boże itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem opowiadał jej, jak i co myśli o świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpiłem, że i ona poznała mnie także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po knajpach robił znajomości i podejmował się różnych niebezpiecznych spraw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oznajmił z kolei Podlasiak z taką stanowczością, jakby chciał stawić opór wszelkim zaprzeczeniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym elementem kształtującym człowieka jest genetyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo kaptur i czepiec to prawie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nasza sytuacja jest tam lepsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiano ją przenieść do innej szkoły, bo w starej szkole „śmierdzi, śmierdzi”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośrodku widniał obszerny i okazały pałac bez dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w głębi ducha postanowiłem zrezygnować z tego zaszczytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Babunia nigdy w życiu nie chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pary z ust nie puszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A widzę wyraźnie, jakby wczoraj dopiero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem siadł nagi przy fortepianie i zaczął grać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schizofreniczne rozszczepienie graniczące chwilami z lekkim bzikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że obecny Parlament jest w pełni zaangażowany w te prace\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem wspomniany obraz jest dalece niekompletny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu posłów skupia się na swoich ukochanych projektach i kosztownym pozyskiwaniu lokalnych wyborców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie głosowałem przeciwko umowie przejściowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy opracować bardziej odpowiedzialną politykę Unii dotyczącą energetyki oraz dostaw energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to jak najbardziej właściwy moment\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak można zapobiec brakowi mobilności?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nie chcemy dyrektywy za wszelką cenę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkich ludzi, których ty uzdrowisz, dobry lekarzu... Dobry lekarzu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce już zupełnie się ściemni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przede wszystkim musimy oczywiście dołożyć wszelkich starań, aby zagwarantować działania zapobiegające przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym powiedzieć rzecznikowi, że debata jest naprawdę interesująca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41621984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze prace jeszcze nie dobiegły końca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41622041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko kilka przykładów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41622042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sformować Komisję już teraz, bezzwłocznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41622043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczy samej, nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41622045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama poruszałam tę kwestię w wielu książkach i artykułach, które opublikowałam w ostatnich latach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Buruburu, ten stary portier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ta kobieta znała tak dokładnie pewne szczegóły z mego życia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotykam ją czasami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem te dwa przełączniki i aktywowałem je wszystkie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zróbmy tak: niech każdy doprowadzi do porządku fabrykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest kurze jajko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba śniłem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki nie wydawały złożonych kapitałów i nie wypłacały procentów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największą część dnia pochłaniało polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła w towarzystwie koleżanek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuś się! — pisnął kulawiec i pięścią powahał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem mieć wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie martw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20832587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20832588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeszcze przez sen gładzi się po pełnym brzuszku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20832589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Keenan podszedł posłusznie i mocno ujął buldoga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20832591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” — Ja też nie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20832593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sławomir, Zenek i sylwester marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20839683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że nie umiem pływać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20839684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa dodać dwa to cztery, co nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20839685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraz z nastaniem ciemności zapłonęło kilkadziesiąt ognisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20839686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelajć z karabinów małego kalibru - i tylko kulami, wyrobił sobie niechybn rękę i oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20839687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc pojedziemy wąwozem — rzekł — bo tam jest cień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajcie! — rozlegało się coraz wyżej i coraz ciszej w promiennych od słońca przestworach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie zawdzięczam wszystko, bo moja młodość, moje życie jest twoim dziełem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz powiedz, dlaczego jesteś zły? — Bo on cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało niech pani mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zwykle obieram samotny przedział i płacę za to gruby napiwek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo ty nie leżysz na dnie morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem grupki schodzą się w mieszkaniach, ale bardzo wcześnie wszystko idzie spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jesteś chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli to był sen, można było jej wybaczyć te kuchenne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się spełnią przeznaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokoło chodzą uważnie strażniczki cienia — prostytutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze współczuciem spojrzał na zabrakowanego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z nich było dwóch żołnierzy, w drugiej — trzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pojedziemy dalej gondolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona przebiegła obok niego, myśląc, że zajęty bójką nic nie widzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimne światło poranka przebija się przez mgłę spowijającą miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i kaszel są w pierwszych dniach wykluczone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę uszanować i moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zebrali się na tajną naradę bez króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia w sobotę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewno jej przyszedł do głowy jakiś pomysł — wyjaśnił Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara z wolna zaczęła uspokajać się w płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale mnie potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień przewalały się chmury, jakby gotując się do walnej rozprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta mają wargi zimne i mokre i oczy wyblakłe, jak na starych fotografiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala zrobiła sarenkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma to okresowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże „grupa pięciu” przycichła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę wiedzieć to, czego nie mogę wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza z wichrem szalała pod samotną chatką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałoby mi się gadać o ich życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem sobie nową konsolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była druga w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba to schować i odprowadzić bawoły! — powiedział — Pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny indyk, nie ma co mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortuna kołem się toczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle sygnał urwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za świństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci, Jerzy — szepnął ściskając mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczegółów nie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym — zapewnił tamten badając wylot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To znów zależy od okoliczności, które go wywołały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być na granicy normalności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się ponad śniegiem i miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny nie wpadłby na taki pomysł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero później ocenił, że to było bezczelnie sprytne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie zapytał, Ewa nie powiedziała mu nic o wyniku oględzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w ogóle nie wiem, co on robi, jak żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas! — powtórzył jednoręki i poprawił torbę na plecach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, mówiąc o życiu, obejmuję teorię życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne apeluje do rodziców i indywidualnie do mężczyzn i kobiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z konwencjonalno-fizjologicznego punktu widzenia to on mię miał pewną ilość razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zostawił po sobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciała rozstaju, ma rozstaj! Niech gada! — gorącował się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysiedliśmy i przekroczywszy bramę opactwa oo. Franciszkanów, weszliśmy w krużganek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pies oparł się łapami o poręcz i głowa mu podskakiwała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zabrzmieć żałośnie, ale to mnie uspokaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój kochanku, mój mężu najdroższy! — usłyszałem przerywany szlochaniem jej szept.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale burza nadeszła: gromadziła się wiekami i naraz wybuchła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matko jedyna, co żeście porozrabiali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jednakowoż głupstwa te tyle obchodziły, co samego cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsiedli się na meblach i zagarnęli wszystko, co było w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy to tak chodzą, jakby się sami nieśli pod pachą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na opowiadaniach tych upłynął czas do wieczora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W grę mogła wchodzić tylko owa drewniana ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kształt wazy jaki nowy i śmiały!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj no rogala...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle krew mi zastygła w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślenie jest moją rzeczą, zrozumiano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydzielał się z niej zapach pleśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo żadnej odpowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on ma generałów, pułkowników, i w wojsku jest porządek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostanę zjedzony przez twojego papę i ty też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok tego lisa wprawił mnie we wściekłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle usłyszałem tuż obok przeraźliwy krzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj twórcy odebrali nagrody z rąk prezydenta miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ruchem ręki wskazuję ruiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz: gdzie powiesiłeś, tam wisi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale sama wtedy nie spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok urodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oby wszystko było dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ja jestem od niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że jest martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona należy do niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjawy stają się coraz bardziej nieprzyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przemawiał do siebie: — Emil, uspokój się, głaskam cię po włosach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak… — rzekł Hipolit.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka robi mu okłady i ciepłą kąpiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier nie rozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kraj, to obyczaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspina się na górę, skąd można spaść i zabić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecie mówiłem, że ci daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owego ranka było coś tajemniczego w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na nim skupiłaś swą uwagę, gdy wchodziłem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś aportował jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego, że to, dlatego, że tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokończę jeden poziom i idę spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieokreślone, ale pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król odbywa dalekie wycieczki łodzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośliznąłeś się, więc wolniej, ostrożniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że przyjdzie za pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil płynie powoli po własnych zdaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jem na kolację sałatkę jarzynową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie doskonale, jak!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęliśmy mówić o tresowanych zwierzętach, co kto widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazik na starość przestał myśleć samodzielnie i zajął się polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc żeby się potem nie gniewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak gdybyśmy się zupełnie nie znali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co?! — zawołał pan Ryszard otwierając oczy szeroko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jej koleżanki opowiadały mu o jej pretensjach aktorskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby wiedziała, że umrze, to cię nie przeprosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy te sposoby rozumowania odróżnić od dedukcji naukowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród dzisiejszych słuchaczy mamy kilku muzyków, kilku producentów, a także niektóre zainteresowane strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie p\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tylko zastanawiam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalsza debata może jedynie utrudnić działania podejmowane na drodze dyplomatycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem całkiem zniknęli ludzie mówiący po polsku i wagon napełnił się samymi niemcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety jednak, nasz czas jest ograniczony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że jest to bardzo przekonywający powód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczy samej, niebawem uzgodnimy kalendarz prac nad utworzeniem tego rejestru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalibyście mu Jagienkę, czy nie dali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mówię tego ironicznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy przeczytać traktat lizboński i jego dodatkowe protokoły, aby się o tym przekonać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię tu także o transporcie koni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest zapewnienie finansowych rekompensat dla sektora\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubolewam nad tym, że tak mało państw członkowskich wprowadziło je u siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście należy chronić podstawową zasadę demokratycznego poszanowania wyników wyborów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"fundamentalnych wolności, statusu kobiet w życiu publicznym i ich dostępu do opieki zdrowotnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to jednak ogromne poświęcenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41644055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasny podział praw i obowiązków umożliwi jej sprawną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szło im trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde pismo istnieje w pewnym celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajko mądrzejsze od kury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zbyt wolno i dlatego był szczęśliwy, że umie pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sam wiem, czy mam się modlić, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko są uczonymi albo wielkimi artystami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała czuć dotyk rączki wiolonczeli na policzku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała czas dłuższy, utkwiwszy przerażone oczy w drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największy mój błąd, że byłem dumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"odpowiedział Zwak i wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce ktoś grzanki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miłości nie ma jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast poznałem, iż szczęście samo mi się pcha w ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi pomogła moja dobra ręka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stalking jest przestępstwem zagrożonym karą więzienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwuch więźniów już się kilkakrotnie zmieniło, ale ja nie zwracałem na to uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mój Boże, mistrzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie musiałem się dostać do klasztoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały dom należy do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są chwile, kiedy Maciuś nie na żarty się gniewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem wzrokiem po sali, gdy usłyszałem za sobą ciche metaliczne ćwierkanie, niby świerszcza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie drwa rąbią, tam wióry lecą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się pan przynajmniej?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprawdę, straszny to był widok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stach zaczepił nogą o podłogę i po chwili był już w pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem, że mógłbym tu zamieszkać, i widzę, że będzie mi odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dolinie zajdą dziwne zmiany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pobliżu nie ma żadnych innych mieszkań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mi zaufasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co cię skłoniło do przyjazdu w te strony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumowanie było ścisłe, ale wnioski, jak dla mnie, zbyt naciągane i przesadne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spędziłem w tym piekle trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dorywczy czytelnik rzadko kiedy zdoła uporządkować w umyśle to, czego się nauczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było jednak rzeczą pierwszorzędnej wagi abyśmy się przekonali, kto je wrzucił do wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie masz przypadkiem, tego wielkiego twojego parasola?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu robisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujechałem jeszcze kawałek drogi i zatrzymałem się nieopodal domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupcowi umożliwiono powrót do handlu, rękodzielnikowi do rzemiosła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kierownik chwycił rękami za ranę i zgiął się wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj rano wybrał się tutaj na rowerze z strzelbą ukrytą pod kurtką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inni weszli do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniewało mnie trochę to lekceważenie dwóch typów, które budziły we mnie podziw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Górnicy wciąż jeszcze szeptali ze sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pan kłamiesz, to pożegnaj się z życiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszał pan, że w naszej zatoce, rozbił się okręt?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdy bitwa się skończyła, kazałem odszukać ciało starca; zniknęło ono jednak bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie nauczki już otrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani mnie, ani pana nie będzie w aptece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie zapaśnicy rozeszli się i zajęli pozycje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan nadal trwa przy swojem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że można tu wędrować całą noc i nie spotkać żywej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21642777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na ogłoszenie to nie wpłynęła odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby pan wziął znaczną liczbę ludzi, wszyscy łatwo odgadliby nasze zamiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli zechcesz, to pisz do mnie do fabryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóżeście robili przez te wszystkie długie lata?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sto pięćdziesiąt jeden, dwa funty odliczymy, pozostaje sto czterdzieści dziewięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie, ujrzałem generała; prawdopodobnie zobaczył nas, lub usłyszał nasze głosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostaje nam jedynie polecić dusze nasze Bogu Najwyższemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O północy udaliśmy się na spoczynek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złe zrośnięcie się nogi spowodowało zgubne skutki w ciągu jego następnych sukcesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23914903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23914904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23914905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23914906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23914907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniesie ci co na pokazanie, moje dziecię, jeżeli chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bądź więc zdrów bracie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23926493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak, po nad ich głowami ptaszek śpiewał pomiędzy gałęźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak czy inaczej, nie ma konkretnego przepisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy zatem pozostawać obojętni wobec tego, co się dzieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisuje w książeczce, co potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godność ludzka jest nienaruszalna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest spokojny i chyba szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzecki czytał z uwagą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę niemieckie samochody i francuskie wino niż na odwrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31255682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nieznośnie wysoki poziom długu publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to wcale potrzebne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to rozwiązanie jest złe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nadzieja ogarniała go coraz potężniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nasi ministrowie udźwigną swoje obowiązki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zupełnie jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc jest naturalnym satelitą ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst ten brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz gdy jesteś mi wzajemną, mogę się uważać za uniewinnionego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konferencja w Kopenhadze pokazała, że musimy ponownie przemyśleć rolę Europy na scenie światowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31257937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Logika ultraglobalizmu i wymuszonej deregulacji na podłożu ideologicznym zdaje się nie mieć granic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nic sobie wtedy z niego nie robiłam, ale byłam zadowolona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś był uważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś ze mną na rybackim bacie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napijesz się czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wbijam okrągłym, niewygodnym i uderzyłem się w palec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyloty rynien — potwory z otwartymi paszczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane takim tonem, że powinno jej się było wielu rzeczy odechcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli nastawione zegarki dokładnie na tę samą godzinę i byli bardzo punktualni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kościół nie identyfikuje się z żadną specjalną formą rządów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy kobiety, jest to dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowy i żłobkowaty korzeń zabarwił się w słońcu soczystym połyskiem eterycznie wonnej błony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisła, Odra, Warta i Bug to cztery najdłuższe rzeki w Polsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziękowaliśmy i zamyśleni zeszliśmy do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem: Alaska… potem wilki, względnie psy… i sanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są narody czyste i są brudne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nawet rzecz przynosząca dochód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie przyszli punktualnie w oznaczonym czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że gdy opuszczę fotel przewodniczącego, będę mógł wskazać po nazwisku mego następcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy zatem już marynarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do tego celu prowadzą trzy drogi: pożyczki, kredyty, koncesje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21345457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, czego się mam lękać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pomysł trzeba było odłożyć, bo zdawał maturę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies notorycznie mi ucieka goniąc zwierzynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie mnie będą jeszcze prześladować, ale mój naczelnik mnie obroni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak chory, który po rocznym pobycie w łóżku, próbuje chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy w te bajeczki z „duchami”?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wszystkich coś szwankuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to na nic, bo on ucieknie drugim wylotem wąwozu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oświadczyła nagle dziwożona, oblizując zwilgotniałe od tataraku wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz ją tylko widziałem, raz jeden jedyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No — gospodarz, właściciel tej zagrody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiamy przynależeć dodatkowo do jakiejś mniejszej grupy kulturowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni wkrótce zaczną nas szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zająć chwilę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety dziś Kirgistan zbiera gorzkie owoce zmian, do których nie doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczas przyjazną dłoń wyciągnął jedynie rząd słowacki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba nam więcej produktów i usług opartych na wiedzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę z radością powiedzieć, że Komisja i Parlament zawsze zgadzały się w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz musi być przełożony na konkretne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych okolicznościach naciski, aby polepszyć sytuację praw człowieka w Chinach maleją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oparciu o szeroki konsensus polityczny i społeczny należy rozwiązać problem reformy ustrojowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosłoby to również skutki odwrotne do zamierzonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieliśmy i mamy do czynienia z wydarzeniem wyjątkowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gospodarki Morskiej i Rybołówstwa w zielonej księdze na temat reformy wspólnej polityki rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staramy się osiągnąć nasz cel jak najszybciej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to element walki przeciwko przestępczości zorganizowanej, w której musimy zwyciężyć wspólnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy uważniej wsłuchiwać się w głosy obywateli Europy i nie powinniśmy się tego bać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż jeszcze możecie pokazać, że jesteście zainteresowani opinią Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnioski te bardzo mnie niepokoiły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest zwycięstwem orędowników sprawy rolnictwa fińskiego i europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30486450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kilka lat później biorą rozwód, co zdarza się dość często\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak byłoby najciekawiej, najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaciągnąwszy się parę razy dymem z papierosa, wrócił do Stachy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie jeszcze? Wykrztusiła w końcu: — Poziomkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na tematy teoretyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym kapitanem i gospodarzem był dyrektor różnych towarzystw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"albo to ja gorszy od innych!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem muszą być kontrolowane przez Parlament w ramach Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednak przypomnieć państwu, że sytuacja ta nie ogranicza się tylko do przemysłu rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka prorodzinna w Europie jest istotnym zagadnieniem na przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza strategię realizowaną w Afganistanie pod przewodnictwem Stanów Zjednoczonych należy uznać za porażkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"każdy każdemu gratuluje, poklepuje po plecach, po prostu cudownie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba skoordynowanych wysiłków wszystkich państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, ponad tysiąc już obowiązujących umów musi zachować moc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.476,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszej służbie środowisku naturalnemu sfinansowaliśmy dotychczas siedem sympozjów naukowych gromadzących wiele dyscyplin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej sytuacji oczywiste jest, że plan powinien przewidywać możliwość dostosowania punktów odniesienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filipiny to kraj o dziedzictwie chrześcijańskim odwołującym się do kultury po części europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażam mój głęboki żal, że muszę to zrobić, ale niestety muszę jechać na lotnisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz po chwili zastanowienia zaniechał i tej myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi obywatele oczekują rzeczywistej pomocy w tych trudnych czasach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajduje to odzwierciedlenie również w spadku produkcji i inwestycji oraz zmniejszeniu możliwości wzrostu gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś musi połączyć jedno z drugim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Calais, Boulogne i Dunkierki, przeprowadzonej w ubiegłym tygodniu przez pracowników francuskiego sektora rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35113648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto powinien ocenić, czy ich skład jest zrównoważony, czy nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie rozumiem, co do mnie mówisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieliśmy go najpierw obudzić, żebyśmy mogli porozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież wiesz, że nie będziesz jej czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe zmiany nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy godzinę i spotkamy się w jadalni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały projekt i jego wykonalność należy rozważać właśnie w tym kontekście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam wielką nadzieję, że Republika Francuska utrzyma swoje stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wreszcie informacja numer cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyjemnością wysłuchałam pani wystąpienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"niewiele z tych misji jest w stanie przetrwać kontrolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowe okoliczności nie dotyczą wyłącznie zmian klimatycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już wspomniano, gatunki żyjące na dnie morza dojrzewają znacznie wolniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost cen żywności jest niedopuszczalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zła wiadomość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejną stroną są gangsterzy z mafii, którzy także czerpią z tego ogromne zyski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzmy na Grecję, Portugalię i Irlandię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka spójności powinna również promować przejrzystość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sposób alarmujący spadły składki na cele wojskowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26881419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie czynimy wyjątku dla żadnego z sektorów naszego przemysłu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27067351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy zatem projektu prawa umów, wspólnych ram odniesienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27067353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po marcowej decyzji Rady żadne z państw europejskich nie jest zagrożone bankructwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27067354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli o mnie chodzi, byłoby to już za wiele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27067467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież celem jest ochrona konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27067475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, składane krajowe deklaracje w sprawie zarządzania nie mają poparcia politycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyśmy wyszli na ulicę, to po kilku krokach zmoklibyśmy do suchej nitki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komuż mam teraz wierzyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten sam wyraz i ten sam owal twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan mi wierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kropelki łez żałoby dźwięki te zapadały w omdleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trafiła do celu: jeszcze zobaczyłem, jak błysnęła, między tańczącymi; tam nagle zniknęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co zgęstniało do formy, było przedtem istotą widmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gorączka mu widocznie podsuwa takie fantastyczne opowieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam połowa pochylonego domu z zapadającym się frontem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociażby wiedzieć jak był ubrany?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidziłem tego pilnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów: „Panie Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W górze na estradzie: tuziny panów w czarnych frakach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan o tem nie może mieć żadnego zdania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź się uspokój, dobra?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jej znów przyszło na myśl, aby tutaj zajeżdżać tak jawnie?“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My to obaj dobrze wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„No to, wielkie szczęście dla mnie.“ „Jakto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23062991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umywam swoje ręce w niewinności.“ Z trwogą probowałem czytać w jego twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądając, nie dostrzegłem nigdzie śladów zamieszania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spróbuj… o ile potrafisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca habilitacyjna: „Wędrówka pojęcia struktury od chemii i fizyki do psycholo gii i literatury”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach migają mi czerwone światełka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osioł to osioł, wiadomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naglony tak przez nas wszystkich, Holmes wahał się widocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za niewielkim wzgórzem ukryta była mała chatka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kilka minut później byliśmy w gabinecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ruszyli razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oko jej jakby z podziwem przebiegło po nagiej podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi szkoda chłopaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał odetchnął z widoczną ulgą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek porwał się z ławy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle twarz mu się zmieniła, ręce zadrżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bijesz więc medale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarumieniła się, usłyszawszy moje nazwisko...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby wiedział, jak mnie bolało jego współczucie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25769873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz śpiesz się, gdyż działanie płynu trwa tylko godzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortecę zburzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop szanuje zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — zauważył pośpiesznie kulawiec i palcem ostrzegawczo pogroził w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż chce, abyś mu dał schronienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przysięga uroczysta, to nic? — zapytała pantera, pokazując zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maksimum osiągnąłem jako uczeń ósmej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jednej chwili zamilkł tłum cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała filozofia religijna katolicyzmu i cała cywilizacja łacińska oparte są na personalizmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiłem wygarnąć po nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmrok już zapadał, gdy mijano jakiś ładny pałacyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie śpiący, ale się zmęczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno oznaczać w takiej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie umarłam, nie umarłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnalezienie tej zguby uradowało Stasia mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21021256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Koniecznie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczebrzeszyn to miasto w województwie lubelskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć ciocia Telimena już jej tłumaczyła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siedemnasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniszek pieniński uznano wówczas za wymarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiem ją panu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż bym dał za to!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim jest ów człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21023096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłoniło się jeszcze inne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21046811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli znów od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21046813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież nie sposób, by nie dopełniono obrzędów pogrzebowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21046815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziewicze opory zaraz odrzuciła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21046818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprawdy rozsądny z ciebie człowiek!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21046820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzednio nie chciało im się w głowie pomieścić, by dzieci mogły same przebyć puszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale robotnik nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyło na niego dwoje okrutnych oczu, błyskających złowrogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On jest tak powolny, że wszystka jego siła idzie na marne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterz i zaklęta dziewica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to był romans, czy zaręczyny odbyły się tajemnie, bez świadków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co ona tu z nią pocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej oburzało go to, że mój syn był hardy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie na kontuarze rozrzucone były kawałki laku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było przeskakiwać, albo, jak to mówią, paść u celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starcie stanowczo nie przemawiało za nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie lata upłynęły na troskach i ciężkiej prący, musiał więc sport zupełnie zarzucić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze, mam jeszcze trochę czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I starzec ze zmiętą gazetą w ręku wypadł z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, z jego punktu widzenia jakakolwiek nagła zmiana, zwróciłaby na niego uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce rzucało ukośne promienie na zielono-oliwkowe zbocza łożyska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przysięgam, że krew jego splami jeszcze moje ręce!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała pani: „porywczy”, nie: „złośnik”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stara się o nią ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21658875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemnym pokoju coś sunęło naprzód, zbliżając się ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczą ich tylko hemoroidy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy oczekiwałem go na stacji, gdy mnie zobaczył, trzeba było widzieć jego oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi rozwiązać tę zagadkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, siadaj, bratku, za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie cierpię czarnych rzeczy — zawołała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba iść do klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortuna kołem się toczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem zapomniał o swojej biedzie i niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dościgną pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylił się nad łóżkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie martw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie przez ciekawość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mariola wraca jutro z Mazur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś stół, ława, dwa zydle i łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oko widziało zawsze jej ciąg dalszy, zatracając w próżni niepochwytną resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno, spróbuję jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tejże chwili stanął nad powierzchnią wysoki słup wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zawsze, że on „to” skończy, nie Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słuchał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pocałuję nikogo! — odrzekła dziwożona ze stanowczością, potrząsając worem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjął mnie z chmurą na czole i wyrzutem w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jakby pan Stanisław.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiętam — odparł, biorąc skwapliwie do ręki woskowy odlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powiedziałem coś zabawnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To szeroki temat, ale nie tak trudny, jak się rodzicom wydaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? Janek uśmiechnął się i odpowiedział: — Nic się nie zmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Argumentacja godna stołowej nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próżno chłopak namawiał i za uzdę ciągnął, i wózek popychał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam go jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziła się jeszcze, gdy spała, to znaczy, nie chciała być widziana śpiącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jakim sposobem możesz każdego z nich rozpoznać i nazwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo nas niech diabli biorą, albo kapitalizm!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię z nikim dzielić się miłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic wam, bracia i siostry, nie mogę powiedzieć, choć wiem wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił powoli swoje przezroczyste oczy i jego usta stały się jeszcze bardziej wąskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gęstwinie bielały ściany kaplic i małych zabudowań mongolskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zapadniętej głęboko twarzy sterczały kości policzkowe ostro, niemiłosiernie, wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylone są ku ziemi te kształty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie ściany były pokryte literalnie od posadzki po strop książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno wpadł do szuflady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewa, krzewy i trawa służące za jedyne schronienie też nie ułatwiają przetrwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozjaśniły się ciemności od zimnego, migotliwego blasku gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo tak chciałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy rydz niż nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie plotkować na całą szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieć i nie móc albo nie chcieć i musieć, albo jedno i drugie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hę? — intruz nastawił uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile lat miała najstarsza osoba na świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytaj od trzeciego wiersza z góry!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nalegaj, Kazik, dłużej, bo się pogniewamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast zauważyła zmieniony wygląd Filipa, co sprawiło jej widoczną przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie, co jest najsmutniejsze w tej całej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekielna nuda tego obrazu przeraża mnie dotąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże drogi, jak to czas płynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się trochę odmóżdżyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż nas to wszystko obchodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie do końca są w swoim środowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest Anna, matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty się boisz ryzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy byś został, gdybym… gdybym zrobiła się lepsza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była najpiękniejsza piosenka, jaką kiedykolwiek słyszałam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc on się koło mnie położył i leżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bo jasny pan lekki jak pióro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co myśleć, czy zdrowa, czy się co złego nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jednoręki zapewne w imieniu ślepca pięścią pogroził wszystkim rzeczonym przechodniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posadził ją na kolanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten mały nowy więzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Impotent dlatego nie może, ponieważ boi się, że nie będzie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylone są ku ziemi te kształty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty nie jesteś moją matką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie zaczęło świtać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastanów się pan — podjął Filip.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może wojna, która nadchodzi, przyniesie tu jakieś zmiany na lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę tylko, ale zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno takich rzeczy pamiętać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alkohol był jedną z przyczyn kolizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bogiem, a bóg jest mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje mieli tę samą śmiertelną ranę, koło lewej pachy nad sercem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mogę to wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam, aż obrazy podniosą się przede mną, jak przed zaklinaczem wężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo ty nie leżysz na dnie morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rzecz się ma z alkoholem w małych dawkach i nikotyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortecę zburzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możecie wierzyć staremu, robaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspominałeś pan jednak, że przesyłałeś mu pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby nam mogli nasypać trucizny do pieczywa, uczyniliby to niezawodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam tę, właściwą Irlandczykom, cechę dostrzegania jakiejś zabawnej strony w najcięższych przejściach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22497802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranne wydanie gazet nie zawierało nic niepokojącego, obecnie zaś dochodziła zaledwie trzecia popołudniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz zasępił się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie badawczo i odpowiedział: „Teraz to już jest niepotrzebne”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zróbmy tak: niech każdy doprowadzi do porządku fabrykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz ze mną teraz rozmawiał czy też wolisz rozmyślać za kratami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No niechby sobie, ale lubi wyśmiewać — i buntuje na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój, bo strzelę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś prościej, szlachetniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie jest ważne, kto ma rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądam i segreguję wiersze pisane dla tych, których nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję i przepraszam za przerwanie toku rozmyślań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanalizowałem drogą alchemiczną wodę przepojoną fluidami tej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało rzec można, że w rewolucji francuskiej Pan się odrodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary jest uroczy i komiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już więcej miejsca we mnie na nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że Poznaniacy są pazerni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni, cztery dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłszy tam jednak nic smacznego, odleciała dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem mu natychmiast mowę i uspokoiłem go szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z tyłu głowy wyczuwałem jeszcze zimne ślady ich dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Sam nie wiem dla czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy spodziewał się z dnia na dzień spotkać Golema.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ażeby zabić wszelką myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam tego dosyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy twarz tego człowieka nie ma dziwnego podobieństwa z moją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby to miejsce stronicy, na którem się znajdowała litera było przedziurawione?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skrzypienia pod nogami doszedłem do wniosku, że stąpam po suchym piasku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starszy Pan...... czarno ubrany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od wzburzenia niezdolny mówić dalej, podbiegł do okna i zaczął przez nie wyglądać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23356981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego on chce od niego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekłbyś z jasnego nieba piorun w niego uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na policzkach studenta ukazały się okrągłe czerwone plamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem było to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet stojąc w miejscu, można zabłądzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz mnie nikt tam nie wchodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz miała miejsce w poniedziałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazała mężowi całą tajemnicę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janusz, Grażyna, Brajanek i Dżesika schowali się za parawanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewka coraz zdrowsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanał Sueski nie dość było przekopać, trzeba go jeszcze i utrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że tą drogą nigdy nie dojdziecie do prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt jestem przyzwyczajony do chłodu stali i świstu kul, aby się ich obawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co cię pchało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelba Stasia nie mogła przydać się na nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu Sara stała się przybraną matką swej małej towarzyszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dasz mi twoje oczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma miejsca w naszej zagrodzie na parszywe owce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największy mój błąd, że byłem dumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz co to jest, Izabello, dla czego nam przerywasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I temu nie przeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25448495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodziak z ciebie, wiesz o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność ta spada przede wszystkim na rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby odpowiedzialne za wychowanie dziecka i kierowanie nim powinny mieć na względzie jego dobro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnim razem był to chyba październik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżbym zostawił tam, w tej diabelskiej lepiance?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Psia krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwała się z miejsca i nachyliła nad Cezarym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób osłaniali się wzajemnie tarczami noszonymi na lewym przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20733258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wcisnęła go pomiędzy wargi i zanurzyła w jego miąższ swe białe, ostre zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aleś ty pierwszy trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to bóg wojny, zjawiający się powtórnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na jednej z ławek i utonąłem w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, jak łatwo zgubić śpiew swój w czarnym lesie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchylenie w tę czy inną stronę daje dekadentyzm lub prymitywizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim stała dama, bardzo gniewna, bardzo zirytowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzeniem moim byłoby to samo, nad czym pracowali alchemicy: — eliksir młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszysz, jesteś lalką z rozbitą głową!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na cóż tyle zachodów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polata, jak one, na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wpół obłąkany ze strachu Jano budzi Marysię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo nas niech diabli biorą, albo kapitalizm!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myszki nie robią takiego hałasu! — zauważyła Żaneta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak trzaskasz drzwiami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdźmy z naszym problemem pomiędzy lud prymitywny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czego zaczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20700738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dębowy… — szepnął porozumiewawczo do jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranek był jasny, majowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka nigdy nie była bliskim mi tematem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy te bezwiednie stroniły od przepychu zdziwienia, jak od niedostępnych bram zamkniętego pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo trwało jej osłupienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na salę operacyjną bez słowa, jakby jeszcze spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecie dziw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hę? — intruz nastawił uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Ala da ołówek, bo trzeba narysować latarnię — będzie ładny obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego, że to, dlatego, że tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma wisieć, nie utonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgouste ryby, strzelające zielonymi, neonowymi światłami, płynęły sennie przez granatową, gęstą wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście są choroby, na które nie ma ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to kocham cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważa członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hela, nie powiedziawszy ani słowa, zamknęła się w swoim pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten film odniesie sukces?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeść, ani uczyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieniądze szczęścia nie dają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwariowany chodził za psami na ulicy, całował je i lizał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, gdyż księżyc skrył się poza chmurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja myślę, że czterdzieści dwie — rozległ się cienki głosik spoza burty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Buruburu, ten stary portier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zaroślach rozległ się trzask gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była druga w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o Europę, to nie zwiedziłam tylko krajów skandynawskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deformacje rzeczywistości przy wpatrywaniu się w ciemnym pokoju bardzo znaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, czyje te paznokcie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawał się już nieraz chodzić tą drogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonowałem do niego pierwszy raz od wyjazdu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I może zabrzmi to pompatycznie, ale stwierdziłem, że chcę podjąć się wyzwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spodziewałam się tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem mi to niepotrzebne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną jest tak samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że przyjdzie za pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ściętych białkach zagrało poranne słońce okrutnym uśmiechem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy tam z samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam sam zostać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam daleko stoi, kto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to mała teczka, zawierająca papier, koperty, pióra i atrament.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20813207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztany stały wyprostowane, nadsłuchujące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miastem odbyło się wszystko według programu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco chorobliwie dokładne mycie genitaliów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas przestał płynąć, a świat istnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wpół obłąkany ze strachu Jano budzi Marysię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągał ramiona, mruczał, prychał, wyginał kręgosłup jak łuk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastanów się pan — podjął Filip.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno tylko niepokoi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może chce pani przejść się tamtędy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem! — przypomniał z wyrzutem w głosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak rozwiązujemy kwestię zakwaterowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś przemył i przewiązał ranę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pomocnikiem nauczyciela w nędznej prowincjonalnej szkółce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — przypominam sobie… złotą czarę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam własne lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszedł tedy do starego sklepikarza na Starym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, bo jakże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nicość jest nieskończonością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy niej, pojąc oczy harmonią jej ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli wczoraj wieczorem w parku i trzymali się jak zakochani za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko w jaki sposób? O mało nie wpadli pod taksówkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy dziś wiele punktów posiedzenia, więc prosiłabym o skrupulatne przestrzeganie limitów czasowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydała szereg oświadczeń w tej sprawie, prowadząc negocjacje poświęcone osobom prześladowanym za przekonania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie posiada żadnej władzy w tym obszarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety w tym przypadku tak się nie stało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę państwu tylko powiedzieć jak ważne jest to w przypadku mojego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony jaja i drób należą do najczęściej konsumowanych produktów spożywczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uda się nam to zrobić w Europie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włoski rząd niejednokrotnie zwracał się do Malty o zmniejszenie tego ogromnego obszaru wód terytorialnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachodnia część wyspy górzysta, nie tak znów bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga to pracochłonnego porównywania wielu różnych aktów w celu ustalenia obowiązujących norm prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handel i zmiany klimatyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz ruch należy do Prezydencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy ustanowić jasną politykę w stosunku do tych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza poruszona w sprawozdaniu kwestia budżetowa dotyczy źródeł finansowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierra Leone ustanowił oczywiście precedens, jak już zostało wspomniane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Priorytetem jest elastyczny, przystępny finansowo dostęp do wysokiej jakości szkoleń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie zwrócimy się w stronę Afryki subsaharyjskiej i w końcu każdy będzie tu przyjeżdżać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bezczynność Komisji jest karygodna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27113734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywa pana komisarza Piebalgsa w sprawie bezpieczeństwa jądrowego także okazała się sukcesem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo i prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instytucja oświatowa i organizacja pozarządowa posiadająca status organizacji pożytku publicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał jeszcze chwilkę, ściskając nerwowo pałkę w dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na autostradzie utworzył się długi korek, przez co wiele osób spóźniło się do pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek zwisał jak worek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wam podziękować i pobłogosławić… wam wszystkim…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to w jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z powodu grożącej burzy dyrektor mój wcześniej skończył naukę i zamknął szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdawała sobie sprawy z tego, jak długo spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtórny i głośniejszy jęk, wiosennie zgłuszony bujnymi ścianami dębu, wydobył się na\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłam usnąć, bo on musi leżeć pod pierzyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia nie wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie ściany były pokryte literalnie od posadzki po strop książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie? — pyta się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc byłem aresztowany!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak mucha na gumowym baloniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się ponad śniegiem i miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można by udowodnić jego winę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziwny przypadek — powiedział poprzez wiatr Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — potwierdził z głęboką zadumą jednoręki, pilnie i nabożnie zajęty niespodzianą wyżerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądam i segreguję wiersze pisane dla tych, których nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek ma pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te osoby potrzebują rozmowy, nie wywiadu czy przesłuchania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mistrzynią w sztuce kochania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanęli, aby się odsapać i uporządkować bezład uwięzłych w gardle oddechów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte są bramy domów i zgaszone światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ufaj też pięknej jasnowłosej osobie, która chwilowo zdołała cię opętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiadomo foki zapędza się po prostu do rzeźni niby barany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiłem wygarnąć po nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyraziłby się, że zachowała niezatarte ślady piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt ciężko względem niej zawiniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał, nie kręcił się, nie przeszkadzał, tylko był bardzo smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie odbiegajmy od tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzi do szkoły podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściliśmy nasz cienisty przytułek i niebawem znaleźliśmy się na łuku mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj pan na przeciąg — powtórzył uparcie — można czasem kark skręcić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deformacje rzeczywistości przy wpatrywaniu się w ciemnym pokoju bardzo znaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przylepiać się do niej, zdrabniać jej imię, nazwy części ciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora wracać do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tamten jakby naumyślnie wystawiał się na wciąż nowe ciosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno! — pochwyciła pośpiesznie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę! — odparła z dąsem dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W punktach kulminacyjnych robił diminuen- da, co było jego nowym odkryciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czego ty chcesz? — Ja nie wiem, mnie się nudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten głos nie był im obcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie pisali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo czyż nałogowy palacz ma w ogóle jakąś przyjemność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zależą? Tyle możliwych żywotów, tyle różnorodnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie robota była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dokuczaj ty Stefanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu dopiero była ciżba, jakby na jarmarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O przenajświętsza Matko Boża!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nigdy tego nie zapomnisz, co ci powiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecki schwycił się obu rękoma za głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do czego zmierzał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę odprowadzić panie do powozu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na honor, nie wiem nawet, gdzie uciec przed temi upałami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten zwyczajny kamyczek jest tylko jeden na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie trwało już tak długo, że zaczęło być nieprzyzwoitem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hrabia... bierze pieniądze za ułatwianie stosunków koniom, ja za ułatwianie znajomości ludziom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było widzieć minę, z jaką stanął we drzwiach i powiedział: pan prosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta miła i ulubiona kotka była pieszczochą wielkiego koła gorących wielbicieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o tem cicho!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkiego miałem tylko jednego melona i dwa arbuzy,“ rzekł Tomek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"z pięćdziesiąt rubli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suzin westchnął, zmarszczył brwi i znowu wypił szampana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24542961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zachowywał się całkiem zwyczajnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ty byłeś raczej predestynowany do mojej roli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic przeciwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznał wrażenia, że wrasta w kanapę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgouste ryby, strzelające zielonymi, neonowymi światłami, płynęły sennie przez granatową, gęstą wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zebrali się na tajną naradę bez króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta z dobrodziejstw ubezpieczeń społecznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracił całą ochotę na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zaprzeczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To są stosy papierów i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31911515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywa Komisji w pełni zasługiwała więc na poparcie, nawet przy przyjęciu poprawek Komisji Prawnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31911516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy sama go widziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31911517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na lekcji musiało być cicho, jak makiem zasiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31911518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewentualny deficyt w funduszu jest sprawą funduszu i jego członków, a nie europejskiego podatnika\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie popieramy kampanię \\\"Owoce w szkole\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powitajmy go serdecznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery statki, naładowane żywnością, są w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosowo to przypadek wyjątkowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeden z aktywów Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powinien zostać umorzony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sceptyk jednak zauważyłby, że ta szklanka wciąż do połowy była pusta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy być jednak w stanie podjąć decyzje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu sytuacja znacznie się zmieniła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszymy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Informacje podawane konsumentom w samych umowach są niewystarczające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chiny są strategicznym partnerem Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednakże przyjąć europejską politykę na rzecz rozwiązania kryzysu i musimy zrobić to natychmiast\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym zasady lobbingu są ostatecznie kwestią legitymacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31915401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mi się to uda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak by wyglądało, lecz to sprawy nie wyjaśnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nasza sytuacja jest tam lepsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie przyjemnie się wypróbować albo pokazać, że się nie boję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej towarzysze przykucnęli wokół niego, jak wokół ogniska dla bezpośredniej rozgrzewki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie je składam w ofierze, o piękny, połyskujący płomieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można by udowodnić jego winę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz zasępił się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ona uszła jeszcze kilka kroków, z uśmiechem zawróciła i znalazła go, bez szukania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce mi się z nikim wychodzić ani tańczyć, ani spacerować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na tym nie koniec; posłuchaj rzeczy prawdziwej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostry szum maszyny do strzyżenia trawników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo wysoko ubezpieczony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bądź w gorącej wodzie kąpany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest sprzeczne samo w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustawodawstwo i inne środki stworzą mu wszelkie możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciekam z siebie powoli, zostaje miękka skorupa, zdeformowany kształt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil: — Nosisz dzisiaj wstrętne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę nic słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, nie znał słów pieśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale żeby ośmielić się nocą wchodzić do mego domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pewnych rzeczy nie należy nazy wać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze znużenia i z ciągłego napięcia nerwów dostałem ataku nerwowej febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to lekkomyślne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nieoczekiwane zestawienia» i «potworna wyobraźnia», tak mówił Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałby Bóg, żeby z tej głupoty nareszcie wyrosła — westchnął tatuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno tylko niepokoi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortuna kołem się toczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc nie chcesz obiecać, że mu nie będziesz dokuczał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożymy ognisko za namiotem, tego wilki się boją! — uspokoili mnie Mongołowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olaf Anderson odsunął zaporę u drzwi i otworzył je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała najwyżej na lat dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiał tę pozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziwożona wskazała palcem ową stronę, gdzie się znajdował niezbędny dla jej namysłów rozstaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż Ewa odkleiła ten list wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jakim sposobem możesz każdego z nich rozpoznać i nazwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była własność cudza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośliznąłeś się, więc wolniej, ostrożniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz przystąpimy do rozerwania łańcucha z Moniką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie to piękne, seniora — rzekłem w zamyśleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz, raku zatracony, baw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik zbladł jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem przerywa, aby podejść do fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hela, nie powiedziawszy ani słowa, zamknęła się w swoim pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powraca ta mała, nudna męka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki potwierdzająco kiwnął dłonią, lecz słowem się nadal nie ozwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej towarzysze przykucnęli wokół niego, jak wokół ogniska dla bezpośredniej rozgrzewki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego tylko pożądał: wichru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam? Jakim — nam? — wycedził przez zęby kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi tam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zebrali się na tajną naradę bez króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy za sobą kilka lat zawiłej i niepełnej wolności politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ulega wątpliwości, że tym co stracili pracę we wspomnianych krajach należy pomóc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy prawo pytać i otrzymać odpowiedź, gdzie popełniono błąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rozwiązało by wiele problemów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Papo coraz słabszy...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi sobie popływać trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sługa boga wina Dionizosa wykradł wino, by dać go ludziom po raz pierwszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że jest bledsza, żółciejsza i jeszcze czarniej ubrana, niż wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęcie tych poprawek sprawiło, że sprawozdanie stało się bardziej wyważone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie rzecz biorąc, nie uważam euroobligacji za rozwiązanie, które sprawi cud\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcesz, bym cię zgniótł jak muchę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi w ten sposób o nich nawet sama administracja, państwo, rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie sekretarzu stanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było bardzo ważne sprawozdanie dla dalszego rozwoju jednolitego rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39878422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni upadli na duchu i pogrążyli się w smutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39900304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musicie zmienić wasze stanowisko w tym względzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39900305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz bierz po dwie sztuki tego szkaradzieństwa, i wyrzucaj przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39900306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawy idą w dobrym kierunku dla Romów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39900307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżam się do mojej konkluzji, która jest z tym problemem powiązana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39900308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nam żyje Rada Europejska!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez Chorwację przewozi się nielegalne substancje z krajów produkujących je do krajów będących konsumentami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Efektywność energetyczna jest środkiem numer jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagwarantuje to wzrost bezpieczeństwa drogowego w każdym państwie członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ile kosztuje usunięcie odpadów promieniotwórczych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę wszystkich Państwa o pomoc w realizacji tych działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozporządzenie w sprawie bezpieczeństwa dostaw gazu ziemnego weszło w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z wydarzeniami w Afganistanie niewątpliwie ryzykujemy naszą wiarygodność w społeczności międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie potrafimy bowiem zareagować na to poczucie nierówności, niesprawiedliwości i braku bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ja właśnie tak postąpiłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżna pełna gniewu i przerażenia, nie była dotąd w stanie przemówić słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję i popieram oba sprawozdania oraz gratuluję sprawozdawcom tych dokumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście łączą nas wspólne interesy i wspólne wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie o to teraz chodziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich dotychczasowe działania przeczą jednak tym zapewnieniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rumunia zajmuje ostatnie miejsce w europejskim rankingu jakości i liczby usług medycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak stwierdziło wiele przemawiających osób, Unia jest bardzo zainteresowana tym regionem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, musimy ograniczyć izolację Birmańczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy bezzwłocznie zareagować na szczeblu politycznym na tę nadzwyczajną sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczycie tym nie zdołamy uniknąć tematu otwartości wizowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38066163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne jest nam trzeźwe myślenie i kreatywne decyzje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchasz mnie w ogóle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam, pamiętam, posądzałem o złośliwość Pana Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecie dziw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam jego zwrotu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyjął z szafy swe rękopisy i rozrzucił po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział szeptem: — Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znalazłem nareszcie punkt zaczepienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skarbca królewskiego wypłacić mu sto tysięcy dukatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju Janka kasztan wsadzał głowę przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego tu szukasz? — zapytałem ostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz być tym i tym, albo tam i tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłem w jego gabinecie, urągał mi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj czytała po raz pierwszy Rimbauda „Statek pijany” i Verlai- ne’a „Pieśń jesienną”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po wirtuozowsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byliśmy nigdy w życiu tacy bogaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki miły — podobny do doktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mamy zrobić? — odezwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiem, bo nie chcę, żeby mieli przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwy człowiek pracuje sprawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być woda z kranu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy całej klasie, zamiast kaligrafii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg począł raptownie zwalniać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj pan na przeciąg — powtórzył uparcie — można czasem kark skręcić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oznajmił z kolei Podlasiak z taką stanowczością, jakby chciał stawić opór wszelkim zaprzeczeniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ranę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o głupstwach, ale on pomyślał, że będzie z nią bardzo trudna historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z widoczną troską o wniosek, a kulawiec z niedowierzaniem pogrążyli się w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj czytała po raz pierwszy Rimbauda „Statek pijany” i Verlai- ne’a „Pieśń jesienną”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Władca świata” znikł nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Emil nigdy nie wybierał Zosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę zawsze sama, albo z mężczyznami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, że właśnie postąpilibyście tak, a nie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem ramionami i umyślnie przeszedłem do innego tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto rozprysnęło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czy ja mogę się o coś zapytać? — Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem tego samego zdania! — zgodził się muł — Widocznie mamy wspólne upodobania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic przeciwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! Już! — zakrzyknął Podlasiak i wraz z kulawcem zbliżył się do dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie jest ważne, kto ma rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rany boskie! — wykrzyknął sierżant, siadając ciężko na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zaś wiąże się z określonymi konsekwencjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opublikowaliśmy materiały konsultacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym należy się zająć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Transgraniczne przenoszenie siedziby spółek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umożliwi to jej wejście w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doceniamy również sposobność przewodniczenia całej wspólnocie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musimy uczynić krok naprzód, nawet jeśli oznaczałoby to zawieranie umów tymczasowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip kopie nogami cmentarz Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam jednak do pana prośbę lub też pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam kilka ważnych pytań, które chciałem mu zadać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zatem problem suwerenności wszystkich krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz ufam, że nareszcie mamy to za sobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowym elementem jest monitorowanie i sprawdzanie danych, co należy robić z należytym poszanowaniem prywatności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również współpracować z władzami Tunezji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczyniono tu wiele uwag\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyważenie tych wszystkich elementów wymaga faktycznie magicznego wzoru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja popiera to porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmujemy uproszczenie i uważamy ponadto, że konieczne jest szybkie wdrożenie rozporządzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo ważna kwestia i w tej sprawie nie zrobiono wystarczająco dużo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34047779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kompromis ten oznacza, że istniejące obecnie kwoty będą wykorzystywane wydajniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak odchodzę na własnych warunkach\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle o panujących realiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest wszystko, co się tak naprawdę liczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje ostatnie pytanie brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zwiększyć te wysiłki, inaczej jedynie nabieramy siebie samych i te kraje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, również od Chorwacji zależy, w szczególności, czy podejmie zdecydowane działania w tej mierze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był to jednak przypadek Kampanii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że powinniśmy kontynuować prace nad kolejnymi ramami budżetowymi, które już poniekąd rozpoczęliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka spójności nie należy do polityk źródłowych, towarzyszących wspólnocie europejskiej od czasu jej narodzin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"takiej decyzji nie należy popierać ani ze względu na jej wartość ani na metodę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"układy o stabilizacji, preferencje handlowe oraz wsparcie techniczne i finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to coś, co mamy \\\"na tapecie\\\", co musimy teraz zmienić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod wieloma względami kwestia romska w Europie jest paradoksalna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie nie budzi jednak zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zniesienie barier dla swobodnego przemieszczania się może mieć ważny wkład w leczenie ran przeszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy byli znacznie głośniej o tym mówić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski powinien być dumny z dobrze wykonanej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niezbędne, ponieważ nie ma integracji społecznej bez integracji poprzez miejsce pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety jednak sytuacja zmieniła się w pewien sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27125477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europie brakuje jedności, zdecydowania i przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, na pewno forum tym nie jest to miejsce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony zmniejszy to konsekwencje kolizji między pieszymi a pojazdami silnikowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że zdołaliśmy wypracować rozsądne kompromisy, jeśli chodzi o ten trudny tekst\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"badania naukowe powinny służyć współczesnym potrzebom ludzi i dobrobytowi społecznemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem przeciwko przyjęciu sprawozdania w sprawie współpracy cywilno-wojskowej i rozwoju potencjału cywilno-wojskowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włochy to teraz kocioł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten sposób załatwienia sprawy byłby nieproporcjonalny i sprzeczny z celem lepszego stanowienia prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Unii Europejskiej istnieje pewna karta zwana kartą praw podstawowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety śmierć jest nieodwracalna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy również musieli stworzyć warunki, które umożliwią szybkie wdrożenie elementów stanowiących to porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli państwo pozwolą, istnieje szczególne zainteresowanie wyjaśnieniem celu w zakresie ubóstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zdaniem, nie należy stwarzać zagrożenia dla istniejących porozumień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, abyśmy zepchnęli do defensywy niektóre osoby atakujące Europę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ważne jest, by Unia Europejska pomagała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem zwiększenie poziomu błędów w dziedzinie rolnictwa to oczywisty krok wstecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wygląda nasze krytyczne stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka miesięcy temu debatowaliśmy na tej sali na temat sytuacji w polskim przemyśle stoczniowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym musi on zostać odrzucony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środowiska, na które składają się warunki zbierania i oczyszczania ścieków z ubojni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32898554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spowodowałoby to niekontrolowane spekulacje oraz koncentrację praw indywidualnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No… no jednego ogrodu, który twoja matka lubiła — jąkała Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, panie Andersen!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajko mądrzejsze od kury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się dzieje z naszą literaturą i teatrem — to skandal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię filmy dokumentalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest możliwe, żeby po dwudziestu rzutach monetą za każdym razem wyszedł orzeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędziły po niej auta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał ją z wyszukaną nonszalancją, oczywiście podnosząc ją momentalnie w dwójnasób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde pismo istnieje w pewnym celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi dopiero rozmach, co się zowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A młynarz stoi obok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ty go chyba nie kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kogoś ty się udał? — rzekł z niesmakiem po dość mitrężnym namyśle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Począł zapadać wczesny, zimowy wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bóg nierównowagi, w której wirują nieskończone byty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby nic się nie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo przygotowania do podpalenia gmach nie został zniszczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał, nie kręcił się, nie przeszkadzał, tylko był bardzo smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem tegoż wieczora dostałem zaproszenie na występ w prywatnym mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczenie twoje — rzekł — ma dużo cech prawdopodobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może pod wpływem skruchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była za piękna, by nie przyznać jej racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tego chyba nie myślisz na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głębokie cienie kontrastują z jasnymi punktami kadrów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoła była dużo lepiej zbudowana jak jej lekki domek letni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czego zaczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął nóź kuchenny i podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala zrobiła sarenkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sposób w jaki Ania opowiada o malowaniu zaintrygował nawet mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora jeszcze za wczesna na obiad, lecz stosowna na drugie śniadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieokreślone, ale pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy opuszczałem restaurację, była godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, jak ona, nie tańczył z takim wdziękiem walca, oberka, mazura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był naprawdę pracowity rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu i na dziedziniec osady zaczęły zalatywać kule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy pływały jak lilie na wodzie i drgały lekko; niebo było jak jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on spokojny! — snuł dalsze ogniwo myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wszelka „twórczość” nie pochodzi z tych źródeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Całuj! — ryknął dominując nad rechotem wyznawców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam byle robociarz wie więcej od naszego niejednego filaru krytyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strzelano jak na manewrach, z zimną krwią i celnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, puść już, puść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepiej, nie najlepiej! — odrzekł ze szczerym smutkiem w głosie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziwny przypadek — powiedział poprzez wiatr Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Papier jest bezczelnie biały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co znaczą argumenty wobec „nie sprawiło mi przyjemności”? Poczuł, że jest całkiem bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na chwilę pozwoliłem sobie, aby w głębokiej boleści uścisnąć rękę cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zbliżyliśmy się, spostrzegłem stojących tam dwóch mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan mi wierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tygodniu jednakże sztuczny ruch nanowo osłabnął i znowu były w sklepie pustki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznane dawniej nieszczęścia uczyniły teraz Franciszka I-go tak roztropnym, jak pierwej był nierozważnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że rosnę, ale nie mogę uwierzyć, że będę duży albo stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylił się tymczasem nad wielką księgą i zaczął w niej przewracać kartki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rano Maciuś wstaje, Felek leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sztuka jest bezużyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłapali jednak mój list i zadali mi takie straszne tortury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrabiam także dobre strzelby i narzędzia chirurgiczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie trzeba się tak rumienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczą skrycie przeciwko swoim chuciom bez końca i bez skutku, pełni trwogi nieprzerwanej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimne żelazne sztaby zapotniały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na karku czułem jego gorący oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zdrowie pani duszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć to zdumiewające, że dają je ludzie, którzy żadnych wrażeń nie posiadają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja miałabym nie poznać przyjaciółki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25233178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to lubię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamąciło się w głowie, mignęło przed oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko po to, aby nic nie słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie poradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ci na imię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, mówiąc o życiu, obejmuję teorię życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden się wymawiał, że śpiący i woli się rano myć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem i mechanicznie obracałem w palcach jakiś przedmiot leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowe koła ze światła i krwi toczyły się jak baletnice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominasz mi lalkę, którą miałam, gdy byłam mała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami czujemy przecie, więc po co zaraz robić awantury?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że tu w hotelu nie ma nocników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Twoja mamusia powiedziała, że nie będzie cię więcej biła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już zupełnie ciemno, gdy zbliżaliśmy się do budynków stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojga was było mi bardzo żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jął rozglądać się dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z tobą jest bardzo trudno mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Referendum w sprawie legalizacji marihuany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba połapać konie, złożyć namiot, urządzić inaczej juki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Technika rytmicznego betonu. Takie argentyńskie tango.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poślemy tego szala na wystawę paryską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawka, słoiki i w ogóle wszyscy życzliwi sobie obywatele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biblioteka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to straszne! — rzekła, biorąc do rąk książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdążył chwycić brzeg przeciwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden ciężarek, Watsonie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął wpychać... daremnie, chociaż ruszał zadem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie całkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mylił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła bez dalszego oporu, albowiem od czasu jak pozabijał Sudanczyków bała się go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy majster zauważył to wówczas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest — odpowiedziała Sara z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21269958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żołnierze egipscy zajmują dotychczas rozmaite miejscowości pobrzeżne w Nubii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik zbladł jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to włosy z warkocza mej narzeczonej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to w jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uchowaj Boże od takiej niedoli! — wtrącił z zadumą jednoręki i westchnął na wszelki przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wrzaskach i płaczu mocno jej się spało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic, tylko lód i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale któż to wykona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mefisto idzie cudownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zaprzeczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mongołowie uczynili to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieniądze szczęścia nie dają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toccata C-dur poszła niespodzie wanie łatwo; całuję codziennie adagio na dobranoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gimnazjum jest coraz bliżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale się wstydzę przeprosić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęliśmy mówić o tresowanych zwierzętach, co kto widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza jak makiem zasiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie mogę się tak mę czyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te środki wypróbował autor osobiście ze znakomitym skutkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co powiedziała, było prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, obawiam się, że nie mam pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pot z jej czoła lał się strumieniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotrzymała słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy raz jestem na żaglówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po jej odejściu uczułam nieokreślony lęk, którego nie mogę opanować dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak nie, to on jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przykro, że ludzie przeze mnie cierpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie walki z ofiarą lampa spadła i pokój zaczął się palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikaj zatem samic innego niż twój gatunku...“ Wokulski ocknął się i rozejrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądało to jak szeroka ciemna wolno rozwijająca się wstążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wolałbym zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta miały odpowiednie swym latom rozrywki, upiększane żywą wyobraźnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej nie mogłem już wymówić ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy rzuciłem się ku niemu, stanął i spojrzał na mnie z osłupieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czasy zmieniają się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ku mojej niespodziance i radości wszystko było jak najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaparło mi oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadu, gadu, przesiedzieliśmy do pierwszej w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani godziny, ani minuty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedz mój panie, że kobiety lubią rozmowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdążyłem przeczytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postąpiłem więc sobie krótko i węzłowato.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mogła zdać sobie sprawy z uczucia, które w nią to szczęście wlewało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział mi, że nazwisko to jest dla niego obce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo piękny okaz, nie chciałbym go utracić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25234759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale konia, konia, konia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropne rzeczy, ale raz trzeba powiedzieć je otwarcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogłam opierać się dłużej: przyszedłeś jak przeznaczenie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał jej mruczenie bulgocące cicho w gardle, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil — bo wstydził się za Janka; Janek — bo wiedział, co myśli Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje czekanie jest napięte i wytężone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd się pan teraz wybiera? — zagadnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy naprawdę jestem nieśmiertelna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli woli, niech się w torbie prześpi i sił dla nas nabierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę z J.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwią już liczne komentarze na temat jej najnowszego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłaby trzecia skrobanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednej jej szali leży góra złota, na drugiej męski członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki mi opowiadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczam: Ja — się — na tym — nie — znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nago, jestem pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było stanąć w „ogonku” i poczekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób osłaniali się wzajemnie tarczami noszonymi na lewym przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle głupstwo ich zajmie, ale tylko na krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś prościej, szlachetniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przykra misja — objaśnił po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzucał karty i odczytywał urywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie skrzydlaty, uważaj na przeciąg!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwieniem zauważyła, że w jej domu mieszka dwóch starszych chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, pobiegli we wskazanym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziękowaliśmy i zamyśleni zeszliśmy do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak, ciepłotą poranka zagrzany, przeciągnął się i ziewnął w samo słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mieliśmy czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cię wygnali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To szaleństwo i zabobon! — krzyknąłem wzburzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A drugie trochę starsze, ale też małe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszych latach życia nie wolno dziecka oddzielać od matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz piosenka mi została z ciebie dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan uległ zapewne pomyłce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do bardzo ciemnego parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W operacyjnej paliło się niebiesko-białe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba to schować i odprowadzić bawoły! — powiedział — Pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani nie przypuszcza, z kim jedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmęczenie po trzech seansach portretowych zniknęło zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pomocnikiem nauczyciela w nędznej prowincjonalnej szkółce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz ją tylko widziałem, raz jeden jedyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” To wszystko leżało w niej, jak kłębek nici — splątane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto chłopak, jakiego pragnął całym sercem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłać mi w dwójnasób, skoro przyjdą pieniądze! — odkrzyknął pisarz poza siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zrywają się od stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedział do niej: — Istnieje jeszcze rzecz, którą zataiłem przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili zdjął słuchawki z uszu i był zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze i niebo w oddali spajały się z sobą bez śladu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kiedy ją będę widział? — Za kilka dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosny, że nie wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał jeszcze za sobą zawstydzony głos Filipa: — Przepraszam kolegę na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten może będzie coś wiedział, może gdzieś zadzwoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas najwyższy uporządkować papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę opowiadał o swojej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle odwróciła się i skierowała kroki ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiaty jesienne rychło przemijają…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarne źrenice, czarne długie rzęsy, oczy spokojne, utkwione we mnie bez drgnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śmiech i groza — szczególne połączenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem dlaczego tak cię to bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zachowywał się całkiem zwyczajnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maksimum osiągnąłem jako uczeń ósmej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba siedzieć całą noc z otwartymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka robi mu okłady i ciepłą kąpiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przyznaj się — nastawał wodząc ustami po jej cudnej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto by je próbował ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie podwieczorku mówiliśmy mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto wronie gniazdo na głowie dziewczynki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli człowiek nie czyta książek, nie może być świadomym i rozumującym obywatelem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21978892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce ich podnosiły się i spadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21979233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale powtarzam wam, moi panowie, Łucja była wyszukanie piękną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21979237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj sierżant się zatrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21979239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się powtórzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21979241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak rażąc i kopiąc, posuwali go ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21979243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan masz na to do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polała się krew z ust moich, przeto odchodzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropna nuda nic nie robić, tylko wciąż chodzić do budy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzą, że ze mną też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to? — zawołał, wskazując na trawę o kilka kroków od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest córką ekonoma i kocha naczelnika stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nie urągaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd, jak i dokąd ma uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? Janek uśmiechnął się i odpowiedział: — Nic się nie zmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idę do domu, możesz mnie odprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie trzymacie mopa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic panienka nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo wyraźnie zezwala na to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż Ewa odkleiła ten list wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten nie zwracał na to żadnej uwagi, zatopiony w obserwacji krajobrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc przyznaje pan, że w praktyce musi się uczynić wybór? — Jest się zmuszonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, mieć dach nad głową jest rzeczą bardzo przyjemną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, to żegnam! — ozwał się Billy — Nie przepadam wcale za nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się zbliżył, aby zbadać jej puls, poznałem straszliwą prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła ze szkoły o jedenastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spiesz się, mamy czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później nastała noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ale nie mogłem znaleźć informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chodzi o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie żałuję trudu; wyniki przeszły moje oczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówi pan do mnie rzeczy tak dziwne i tak mnie obchodzące…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało jej to dużą przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie przystąpiliśmy dotychczas do właściwej rzeczy, która mnie tu sprowadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie chcę — rozpłakała się dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest stanowczo ktoś inny — uspokoił ją, wchodząc do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często przerywam wizje, aby zapisywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko, wezwij karetkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie brzmi dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pauzie bawiono się w zabawę, podczas której kawalerowie wybierali sobie damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowe koła ze światła i krwi toczyły się jak baletnice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł, że ktoś wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko wam mogą wejść w drogę insi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty robisz zresztą to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często nabawiała się kłopotu przez żywy temperament, ostry język i ruchliwy umysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela była rozdrażniona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjdę, papo, i zostawię panów samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pysznie gra ten facet i muszę zobaczyć go drugi raz...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na myśl o tem zdejmował go żal głęboki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie chadzają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"oni nam sprzedawali winogrona, kiedy ja myślałam o bandytach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek kulturalny w rzeczach pięknych widzi myśli piękne. Przyszłość jest jego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożył list i czytał: „Panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie moje pieniądze!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katarzyno ja ciebie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonałeś ją pan, że to hołota?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz bądź spokojny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy był tam jeszcze kto więcej w pokoju?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze stanowiska wrażenia wzorem jest sztuka aktorska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widać się wstydzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaś stary rycerz z Bogdańca jest tu z wami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pszenica ładnie wygląda, jak rośnie,“ odezwał się Alfred.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak cicho i dobrze płynąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24151871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski uśmiechnął się z finansowej naiwności pana Tomasza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jutrzejszym kolokwium będzie pięć pytań otwartych i test wielokrotnego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz ze mną teraz rozmawiał czy też wolisz rozmyślać za kratami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie sprawiało mu to przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz im całą historię, mości Ryszardzie — wtrącił się Puk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdźmy do ruchów ubocznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahał się i zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego pan nie kupił na stacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem przerywa, aby podejść do fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo zacznę płakać tak, że nikt mnie uspokoić nie zdoła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obciąć mu ręce i nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik zbladł jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodów przecież nigdy nie braknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyrażamy zgody na ingerowanie w politykę energetyczną państw członkowskich lub krajów trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szwecja sprawowała prezydencję w okresie zmian instytucjonalnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja obecnie rozpoczyna konsultacje dotyczące wyzwań, jakie stawiają przed ochroną danych nowe technologie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje ugrupowanie przedstawiło w związku z tym ośmiostronicowy tekst wyjaśniający szczegółowo nasze alternatywne podejście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta robota została przez Komisję bardzo poważnie sknocona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W grę wchodzą także zobowiązania podatkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto nie wprowadzono mechanizmów monitorowania przyjmowanych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę jednak też powiedzieć, że niezbędna jest współpraca z Serbią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za te miłe słowa solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi też jednak o to, aby inicjatywa sprawdziła się na poziomie pragmatycznym i operacyjnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowy te mogą wyrządzić ogromne szkody regionom peryferyjnym a także wszystkim innym regionom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dotyczy on zanieczyszczenia gleby i wód podziemnych niebezpiecznymi substancjami pochodzenia rolniczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z nimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeprowadzanie takich ocen instrumentów finansowania współpracy na rzecz rozwoju uważam za oczywiste\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, rzeczywiście, dokonajmy tego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ten odbywa już w więzieniu wyrok dożywocia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy przedstawiciele Rady Europejskiej, drodzy przedstawiciele Komisji Europejskiej, drodzy koledzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Amerykanie składają w Europejskim Urzędzie Patentowym o jedną trzecią wniosków więcej, niż sami Europejczycy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dlatego też uproszczeniem byłoby porównywanie władz regionów i władz lokalnych do lobbystów prywatnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27645796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje wiele przykładów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą go szukali, może już szukają cichaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni usiłowali prowadzić z nią rozmowy i udawało im się czasem objąć ją wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwy człowiek pracuje sprawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie jest to zbiorowy kompleks mniejszej war tości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier nie rozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłam usnąć, bo on musi leżeć pod pierzyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia! — pochwycił jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś ludzie mówili gwarą, nie tak jak teraz mówimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten nabożny wysiłek potwierdził w bacznych oczach kulawca wartość zdobyczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przecież feministą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gabinecie ojca paliło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to wrażenie tak silne, że medykowi ścisnęło się gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drżał ze wzruszenia i składał błagalnie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość pomiędzy obu wojskami topniała coraz prędzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielna kobietka zakrzątnęła się żwawo i wnet usłyszeliśmy szum maszynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie skończył jeszcze, kiedy rozległ się stępiony, głuchy huk dalekiej kanonady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22008474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko wyborni żołnierze, pułki gęsto okryte, dziesięciu przypada na jednego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczepiła go pierwsza pod jakimś błahym pozorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedźcie noga za nogą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utopił spojrzenie szalone od gniewu i męki w twarzy rywala…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd? Nie wiadomo! — odpowiedział Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie, co jest najsmutniejsze w tej całej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się ironicznie zakrwawionym pyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jej kuzynem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był nagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba ten niebieskooki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To w co gramy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna wstała, żeby dorobić herbaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ze śniegiem wolno robić, co się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj Paweł zatrzymał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas dłużył się okropnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój kochanku, mój mężu najdroższy! — usłyszałem przerywany szlochaniem jej szept.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, będziemy spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadspodziewanie okazuje się, że tkwi w Kościele sama geneza państwowości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyjął z szafy swe rękopisy i rozrzucił po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam określonego tytułu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby — sfora psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że się dasz złapać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak najbardziej uwagę przykuwają długie linki przymocowane do pleców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, to niczego nie dowodzi — odrzekł Tom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce krąży wokół Ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan jedzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co myśleć, czy zdrowa, czy się co złego nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec jęczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gabinecie ojca paliło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracował dla agencji, z którą mamy rozmawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś wyższa moc splata coraz zwarciej dotychczas rozbieżne tory naszych losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj na nogę, Tomasz! — krzyknął Dan z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Popatrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka mi się skarży, że wciąż jej coś ginie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy żywili dlań jak największą cześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia skrzydełka, łebkiem śmiesznie kręci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A chleba nie wyżarła? — spytał znowu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli pani będzie w towarzystwie przez cały czas trwania podróży…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie, jaką musiałem mieć minę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzenie firmy to nie bułka z masłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciągła pieszczota pocałunku, pożegnalne zwarcie się spojrzeń… i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są narody czyste i są brudne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wszelki wypadek wziąłem z sobą broń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki temu nie patrzymy na to ciało jako na model anatomiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posadził ją na kolanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok naocznie sprawdzonego sęka napełnił ich jakąś nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile energii na to idzie — strach pomyśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo po co pani ma mieć przeze mnie przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecku należy dać wszelkie możliwości do zabaw i rozrywek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecie pies też boskie stworzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są sytuacje w życiu, w których te towarzyskie dodatki winny odpaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko spojrzę na dziecko, zaraz wiem, co ono warte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podłodze też nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszłoroczna zbiórka poszła naprawdę kiepsko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślałem, że dzieci są dobre, tylko nieszczęśliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubisz kogoś? — Ale skąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy padł strzał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmrok już zapadał, gdy mijano jakiś ładny pałacyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, kogo znajdę w tym gronie, ale walka trwała krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg komnat, które zmieniają się w cyrk podziemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nic nie powiedział, jeno ukosem spojrzał na spuchniętą od żądeł lewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta błyskawica w jednej chwili ukazała jej całą głębię jej upadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzucał karty i odczytywał urywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po zamknięciu pogadanki zbliżył się do mnie pierwszy i przedstawił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to rzeczy zupełnie niewspółmierne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiaków dwóch znałem, a Żegnajty ani jednego — przypomniał sobie nagle jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zaprzeczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona łasa jest na miód i pszczołom go stale wyjada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja zaczęła być zajmującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wojna nareszcie się skończy?! — zawołałem głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sama, co u Emila na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mimo woli, pod wpływem zapewne dawnych upodobań, liznął dolną wargę językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciśnienie ustępowało, jak powietrze z dziurawego balo nu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci powitały go radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że on nie bardzo pragnie, bym żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupie smarkate.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem naprzód, aby się dowiedzieć, czy skłonny jesteś go przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary jest uroczy i komiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meteor pędzi pode mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Coo? W jaki sposób wiedziałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był barszcz zdrowy, zawiesisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak aleja śpiewnych drzew… śpiewnych drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schował rewolwer do kieszeni i chwycił pałkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzyczka jego nabrała dziwnego wyrazu — począł poruszać ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil — bo wstydził się za Janka; Janek — bo wiedział, co myśli Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet kierownik, cała szkoła robi się od razu świąteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nimi piętrzył się las bukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kobieta jest stokroć piękniejsza i bardziej wyrafinowana, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowita prawda została mu przezna czona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nieoczekiwane zestawienia» i «potworna wyobraźnia», tak mówił Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz rozmawiał najpierw z matką, a Emil siedział w poczekalni i miał tremę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32301979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Markiz Amary przykłada do głowy rewolwer i chce się zabić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32301980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dla mnie przyjemność być dzisiaj tutaj z Państwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32301981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że zdołamy to przedyskutować, a jutro zatwierdzić, wieszcząc dobrą nowinę dla Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32301982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Irlandii można by to osiągnąć poprzez wprowadzenie wspieranego przez rząd programu podnoszenia świadomości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32301983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gratulujemy i dziękujemy uczestnikom kampanii zachęcającej do głosowania za przyjęciem traktatu w Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Ala da ołówek, bo trzeba narysować latarnię — będzie ładny obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc nie chcesz obiecać, że mu nie będziesz dokuczał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to jest ze zdaniami, powstałymi na podstawie indukcji, pytasz? To nie ma znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, nie powiesz mi o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten tam — to twój ojciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego właściwie pan mi to wszystko przypomina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy powitaniu wyczytałem w jej oczach utajoną obawę i niepewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się dzieje z naszą literaturą i teatrem — to skandal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go uczucie dziwnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie tylko ryzykuję tę podróż na północ, do twego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim był Wierusz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyło się na gadach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ze swoimi mizernymi orgaźmikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tropiła go jak pies, chodziła za nim jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki syknął z bólu i z rozkoszy, która się wraz z bólem narzuciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budził ją każdy ruch chłopca, jego chrapanie albo mowa przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tam ładna ślizgawka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłaby trzecia skrobanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie panowała taka wesołość w dziecinnym pokoju Dużej Rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jednoręki zaniepokoił się pilnie i otarł usta rąbkiem rękawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten przyrząd do czego służy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niestety, człowiek ten nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uchowaj Boże od takiej niedoli! — wtrącił z zadumą jednoręki i westchnął na wszelki przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20803838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do nich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy przyszedł mi w pomoc szczęśliwy przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwie usiadł, ledwo pani weszła, nowe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ktoś zapytał mnie, czy jestem patriotą lokalnym, odpowiedziałbym, że tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy ogłosili strajk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem ludzie siedzieli przed bramami domów, a pary leżały nad rzeką, na wyłysiałych łączkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że byl park, przez który ona musiała przejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samoloty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się ciotka w końcu zorientowała, powiedziała: — Emilku, przyjdźcie do mnie z mamusią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególne były oczy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie Boże itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na żadne wołania, wrzaski nie zwracała uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z powodu grożącej burzy dyrektor mój wcześniej skończył naukę i zamknął szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia stała przy mamie, a mama ją czesała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na usta wybiegł uśmiech zadowolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem trzeba wiedzieć kiedy się przebranżowić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaleźli duży balon sylwestrowy na środku pustej jezdni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał zamknięte oczy, widziała długie, drgające rzęsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędziły po niej auta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązanie to zostało odrzucone przez niektóre państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jednak nie ma wątpliwości co do zaangażowania Unii Europejskiej w walkę z terroryzmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecia kwestia w ramach działań wynikających ze sprawozdania dotyczy systemów skupu w państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowanie popieram ten projekt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczy, które wyraźnie się różnią nie powinny być traktowane dokładnie tak samo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był to łatwy proces i otrzymaliśmy różnego rodzaju uwagi na temat naszych wysiłków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzę się z tym, że ostatnie zdanie w sprawie ma Rada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Penalizuje ono wydajnych rolników, faworyzując niewydajnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie prezydencie Adamkus\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za przyjęciem tej rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast w sferze politycznej działania te nie powinny prowadzić do zaniku narodowych tożsamości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak dziś ważne jest, abyśmy spojrzeli w przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie chcą europejskiej karty praw, takiej jak w federalnych Stanach Zjednoczonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy uwzględnić również już przedsięwzięte środki oraz zdolność przemysłu do przyszłych innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że zdanie to podziela również naród afgański\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za przykład możemy wziąć Palestynę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież jest to kontynent bogaty w zasoby naturalne, z których korzysta cały świat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślimy o historii tego obszaru, historii, której nie da się oddzielić od historii Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowe znaczenie będzie miał sposób dalszego uzupełniania tych uzgodnień w nadchodzących miesiącach i latach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34118237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że zadane pytanie ustne jest bardzo jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za dowód mogą służyć gojące się ponad standardowy czas rany zadane jej ząbkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za myśli, co za koncepty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeść, ani uczyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagroda przyznawana jest jedynie za tytuły przetłumaczone na język polski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam przy sobie gotówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego za granicą nie ma tego podobno zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz, raku zatracony, baw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani porównania z ospałą, gęstą i cuchnącą wodą kanałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi, pomiędzy filarami, przechadzało się kilku mnichów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież lekko cuchnąć nie jest rzeczą przykrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest trochę dzikich zwierząt, tylko trzeba wiedzieć, gdzie szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie widzę żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co powiedziała, było prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te środki wypróbował autor osobiście ze znakomitym skutkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spotykali się często.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane głosem, który nie powstał w krtani; głosem brzuchomówcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że go królowie oszukali, że port zabrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wyście to przysłali? — powtórzył staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podchodzi do niego właśnie ten rysownik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, przestrzegałem cię… ja z krwi twojej i kości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest twój ojciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Udzielam głosu młodemu królowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwiami trzaskają, krzyczą, wiercą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W atelier zapadło głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziła dotąd, że piękność była pierwszą na tym świecie potęgą; zapomniała o geniuszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobił pojednawczy wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczyłem ze zdumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim się to sposobem stało, dowie się czytelnik w rozdziale następującym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nocami nawet byłem czujny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi biło ze wzruszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan sobie o mnie myśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie trzeba się tak rumienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czasy zmieniają się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potwierdziłem jego domysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czują się złapani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się z roztargnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał po obecnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, pisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czego się spodziewał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chcę się uchylać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kupił sobie karnet i robił notatki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzeba dobrze uważać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy konie z miejsca ruszyły cwałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23792956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo żadnej odpowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — rzekł prawie surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to znaczy? Nic nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczyciel nigdy nie powie, czy lubi, ale się to czuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rwały naprzód konie, lekko bujała się kareta na gumowych obręczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wody! — zawołałem, rozglądając się bezradnie wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22442448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale która rzecz istniejąca nie jest sprzeczna sama w sobie? — Może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta z dobrodziejstw ubezpieczeń społecznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była własność cudza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzisz, mnie tak potrzebny scyzoryk, a tobie na nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gówno, czy jest sprzeczna, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łudź się, nie wezmą cię z sobą — rzekł Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętała tylko jodły z tamtej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Rozpoznał w nocy swoje mieszkanie, idąc boso wzdłuż korytarza, w stronę królików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32883976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Debata ta nie powinna tworzyć także możliwości jej niegodziwego wykorzystania w celach politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32883977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałam wyraźnie i raz jeszcze potwierdzam, że jestem otwarta na dialog\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32883978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są duże problemy spowodowane fragmentacją europejskiej przestrzeni powietrznej, co powoduje opóźnienia i nieskuteczność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32883979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada zorganizowała ocenę wymiany informacji pomiędzy Europolem a państwami członkowskimi i pomiędzy państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32883980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie oglądałem na komputerze w biurze wspaniałą ceremonię zaprzysiężenia na prezydenta Dimitrija Miedwiediewa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tworzenie nowych miejsc pracy, innowacje i konkurencja to klucze do europejskiego sukcesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak przedmiotowa dyrektywa wprowadza kategoryzację zgodną z tradycyjnym systemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie równe zasady gry rynkowej powinny być ściśle monitorowane przez Komisję Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym obowiązkiem jest wsparcie tej alternatywy i zapewnienie Libijczykom ochrony przed siłami reżimu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Międzynarodowe przepisy zdrowotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to ciekawe oraz właściwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kaszgar stanowi centrum ujgurskich muzułmanów - jednej z największych mniejszości etnicznych w Chinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyny tych wydarzeń są skomplikowane i głęboko zakorzenione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwiększa przejrzystość cen, wzmacnia handel i wspiera gospodarczą i finansową integrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Unia Europejska uczyniła ważny krok, podejmując tę polityczną decyzję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najprawdopodobniej pojawią się problemy w procesie przyznawania licencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie przesłanie dla ludzi płynie z Brukseli i Strasburga?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zadowolona, że ostatecznie przyjęliśmy rezolucję dotyczącą tej bardzo ważnej sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32884169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat nicejski nie jest wystarczającą podstawą udanego dalszego rozszerzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści niż gołąb na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urósł potężnie w siłę, odkąd nam uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kolega po zawodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili furtka już była otwarta na oścież.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bogiem, a bóg jest mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz, Felek, dlaczego taki jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziło się to na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O walce myśleć nawet nie było można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobyłam tu rzecz stokroć cenniejszą dla mnie od złota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten starzec jeszcze śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten głos nie był im obcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kolega Adama, Stach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sądzisz, ile mu płaci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest teraz po drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan za głupstwa wygaduje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten szal to kłamstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło dużo lat od tego czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak się nazywasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po za tym plotki: Saint-Simona, Eckermanna, Franka Harrisa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzą w twarz ze sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musimy zająć się tym niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem, że nie masz mamusi, biedna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bogini miłości Izyda-Hator karmi piersią króla młodzieńca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w znakomitym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, dopiero pod koniec spotkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do przedsionka, gdzie stała beczka pełna łoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, nadzieja to wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Magdalena.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miała już domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze, nie wspomnę o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciastka są po pensie sztuka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21109381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo elegancki bogaty pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie dawaj, bo jak będę musiał przerwać proces, wszystko zmarnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz myśli, które go zniechęcają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi Maciuś przeczytać wszystkie na świecie książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet Rzecki zwracał mi na nią uwagę i mówił, że ma śliczne nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo jest ładna i nieźle siedzi na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez ciebie szumi mi w uszach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czego się spodziewał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta moja rozmowa z Julią pociągnęła za sobą przykre następstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Do dzielnicy żydowskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszystko może Blanko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podobała się panu Warszawa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak wyglądało, gdy tu pana wnosiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ból uczułem obłędny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę znaleźć pomysł na nazwę dla mojej firmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro się tylko znajdę w siodle, to już nie lada kto mi dojedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto nas pozna, gdy będziemy unikali dzielnicy żydowskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uśmiechem głową potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24787639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyto jednak pewne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie, jaką musiałem mieć minę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten nabożny wysiłek potwierdził w bacznych oczach kulawca wartość zdobyczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wszyscy diabli…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wychodzi na złe albo na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość ze zbliżających się świąt wynagradza wszelkie straty w gotówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy człowiek powinien korzystać ze wszystkich praw i swobód wymienionych w deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On się urodził w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Człek i wygodę ma, i rozkurczenie wszelakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak go lubią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo zacznę płakać tak, że nikt mnie uspokoić nie zdoła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło tlić się na mnie ubranie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załatwiłam bez pana wiedzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna kobieta zniknęła bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochanie, wróciłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby ci było przyjemnie? — To bym była zadowolona, że poszłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożymy ognisko za namiotem, tego wilki się boją! — uspokoili mnie Mongołowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z prawdziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przemawiał do siebie: — Emil, uspokój się, głaskam cię po włosach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyłem na jego ruchy osłupiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem w swoim kącie i lekcje odrabiam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg byl czysty, nietknięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jutra wystarczy — oświadczył jednoręki i po namyśle dodał: — Do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów wywołuje, kto jest, kogo nie ma, kto się spóźnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ci już przyniósł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie chcę — rozpłakała się dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekoladowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś tam mamroczy od godziny, nie mogę się skoncentrować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wściekłości byłbym się był tarzał po ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie lubił myśleć o ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowałem się przecież w kraju nieprzyjacielskim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygrał asa pikowego, mogłem odrzucić tylko damę karową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Testament ściśle to określa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko, jak strzelec składał mi życzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma białą plamę na czole z kwasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czołgałem się na brzuchu, rękach i nogach, ale nie mogłem znaleźć ani śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie denerwuj mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym musiał podzielić pański los, gdybym się był chociaż chwilę zawahał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wpadałem w jakąś dziurę, to znowu w krzaki i ciernie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosy mi stanęły dębem na głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście mój towarzysz Beaumont był wysokim mężczyzną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężyłem się jak struna i salutowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błysnęli świetnością uzbrojenia i sprawnością ruchów i zajęli skrzydła i tyły swej armii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W marcu jak w garncu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, to się stać nie powinno, dopóki mogłem temu przeszkodzić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy obierze po pięć garstek, no i będzie z bani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22791999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie otuliłem się znowu w płaszcz i zacząłem się zastanawiać, co dalej począć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kozioł obrócił się do niej tyłem i podniósł kitę ogona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył się w kolano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczegóły oczywista nie wchodzą w zakres naszych rozważań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał się mniej więcej — cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jest rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W perspektywie wyłonił się biały kontur cmentarnego muru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani dietetyk kazała mi ograniczać spożywanie alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjadł śniadanie i puścił się w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona była wściekła i zmęczona poznawaniem tylu ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli, a Darek wyciągnął z kieszeni niezgrabne zawiniątko w brązowym papierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy byś został, gdybym… gdybym zrobiła się lepsza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunął ją miękko, aby rozciągnąć tę chwilę jak gumę i głaskał ustami własne ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo po co pani ma mieć przeze mnie przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bramy ciężko okute.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech! — odpowiedział kulawiec, ukazując bez potrzeby zresztą trzy palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogół kobiet, jeśli chodzi o miłość, jest przerażająco niesentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą go szukali, może już szukają cichaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był piękny w swej barwie, rozległości, ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizm żadną miarą nie da się pogodzić z personalizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś w pobliżu przejechał w tej chwili baron…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może drży wskutek zimna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie takiej fizycznej ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tkniesz dziewczycy, bo nie z twego chlewu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To szaleństwo i zabobon! — krzyknąłem wzburzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy Andrzeja nagle ożywiły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegli żwawo poprzez gąszczary i przesmyki leśne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziemy na toczącej się w przestrzeni kuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęła się samotna i naga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę tylko dostać tataraku! Lubię tatarak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego pan jeszcze chce ode mnie? — zagadnął znów niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po wirtuozowsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczegóły oczywista nie wchodzą w zakres naszych rozważań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ja jestem od niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona cię przecież kocha, mówisz, mimo że się do tego nie chce przyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zależy od treści myślowej odnośnego indywiduum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, musisz siedzieć przy mnie blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczegóż jednak dręczył mnie ukrywaniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w jakim celu człowiek ów pozostawił ten rower?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto rozpaliła się ta okropna wojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jakim względzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszyscy jesteśmy ulepieni z jednej gliny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam sam zostać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz od dziewek służebnych coś tam usłyszała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt jej nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O to chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracając spostrzegł przy świetle ognia Kalego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odwróć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz obraca kierownicę jak szaleniec — obraca tak jak wówczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się bardzo zmęczona, Saro — rzekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zadanie źle wypadło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo co komu może szkodzić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o więcej optymizmu w trakcie czytania tych zdań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całki, macierze, pochodne, granice i równania różniczkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo i piętno na przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pan tu już wisi od dwóch dni?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędzej prędzej na wroga...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem jeszcze przez pewien czas jego kroki na ulicy, aż wreszcie wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednak, abyście mieli nad czem myśleć do tego czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem najlepszym szermierzem, najdzikszym jeźdźcem bohaterem stu przygód i awantur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dwa tysiące szóstym roku Yamba Asha wyjechał do Szwecji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hulaj dusza, piekła nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz, teraz, wszystko to wydawało mi się dzieciństwem i marnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór z wolna prostował swe drgające jeszcze rozpędnym pośpiechem przeobrażeń członki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem jeszcze w stanie tego zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie takiej fizycznej ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rozstaju wszystko powie! — oświadczył w imieniu dziwożony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie chcę ci wstydu narobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można tu wyczuć pewne jakby stopniowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj twórcy odebrali nagrody z rąk prezydenta miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy ja się przy tobie rozpływam zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie uprzedzajmy wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafię panu tego dokładnie powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka praca, taka płaca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłownie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic, tylko lód i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obciąć mu ręce i nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz z tym wszystkim koniec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdźmy do ruchów ubocznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego za granicą nie ma tego podobno zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko weszli do pokoju, usiadła na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę tam iść? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególne były oczy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem tego dłużej wytrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem pojąć, że wciąż jeszcze żyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"panie Pernat!“ Obejrzałem się dokoła, do góry: Nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie przeszła minuta, gdy dały się znów słyszeć na schodach drepczące kroki kramarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedawno mówiliśmy o tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tu powiedzieć: to są bracia, albo ojciec i syn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już ręka żywota popychała mnie naprzód, w dół po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze to samo imię Rozyna; zawsze jedna jest zmartwychwstaniem drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjął okrągły kawałek drzewa i zaczął go wycinać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od wzburzenia niezdolny mówić dalej, podbiegł do okna i zaczął przez nie wyglądać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23441999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie myliłem się jednakże!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzuciłem karty: tak to był on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pani ma choćby najmniejsze zaufanie do mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam nawet nazwiska mego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem turkot kół powozu na bruku i wściekły galop podków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groźbą i siłą znalazł sobie drogę, aż do łoża chorego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak gdybym cały świat utracił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróble o zmokłem upierzeniu siedziały nieruchomo na rynnach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23442018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Naturalnym wynikiem tego rozgłosu były tłumy pacjentów, którzy u niego szukali pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Potrzebuję nareszcie umyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już chcę, mimo tego, że uważam to wszystko za rozpustę umysłową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cześć! Jak mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko szybowiec Witka wciąż spada, bo Witek nie umie rzucać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, czy pan jest Jakub? — powtórzył Ignacy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili wrócił ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie strzelam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył pod okno chałupy i nadstawił wielkich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócili na obiad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istotnie niemiła historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwariowany chodził za psami na ulicy, całował je i lizał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz przystąpimy do rozerwania łańcucha z Moniką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, jak długo jeszcze zdołam w pobok was przebywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy krytyk jest postacią niezwykłą i odmienną od wszystkich śmiertelników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana była w prostą suknię dorastającej smarkuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A do tego to piekielne wprost wykończenie wykonania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak nie, to on jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do łazienki i mył się zbyt długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i wierzę ci na słowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy żywili dlań jak największą cześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los czyli nie przychodzi ku nam mimo naszej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło pół roty wojska, otoczyło dwór i zabudowania i zrewidowano wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie badawczo i odpowiedział: „Teraz to już jest niepotrzebne”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to włączyć, ale było już włączone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimne światło poranka przebija się przez mgłę spowijającą miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzi do mnie wtedy, gdy w domu są awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na autostradzie utworzył się długi korek, przez co wiele osób spóźniło się do pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast „Harcerze podnieśli nosze”, napisane: „Harcerze podnieśli nos”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie panowała taka wesołość w dziecinnym pokoju Dużej Rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kwadransie była wyleczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewno jej przyszedł do głowy jakiś pomysł — wyjaśnił Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu przestałaś mnie kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to przypadki braku bezpieczeństwa energetycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto szczególny nacisk jest położony zagwarantowanie, aby informacje podane konsumentowi były dokładne i użyteczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy bezczynnie stać na naszych uprzywilejowanych pozycjach, kiedy wokoło roztacza się klęska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że Parlament poprze w swym głosowaniu redystrybucję środków budżetowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestie dotyczące imigracji, a zwłaszcza prawa do azylu, są szczególnie wrażliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować za tę, moim zdaniem, niezwykle ważną i pogłębioną debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg inicjatyw opracowywanych jest w sektorze prywatnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zwiększyć przejrzystość przydzielania i wykorzystywania środków oraz zmniejszyć koszty administracyjne i biurokrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinniśmy tworzyć przepisów, opierających się na myśleniu życzeniowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To władze kubańskie muszą pokazać, że dokonały konkretnego postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybrzeże Kanady jest dobrym przykładem tego, jak człowiek zdołał doszczętnie zniszczyć stada dorsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja jestem winien wszystkiemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kolei w Europie Wschodniej przyjmowanie dodatkowych imigrantów utrudnia liczebność oraz proporcja etniczna Romów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że przy wydawaniu środków z funduszy strukturalnych nie zawsze przestrzega się zasady partnerstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26967592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ich komentować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26968737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zamian za wasze wysiłki macie nasze poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26968739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Realizacja programu sztokholmskiego napotyka i nadal będzie napotykać na trudności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26968743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Edukacja i odpowiedzialność są same w sobie niewystarczające nawet w świecie zachodnim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26968746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja jest zdecydowana wzmacniać wymiar parlamentarny umowy z Kotonu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26968748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz należy zadbać o to, by wytyczne uwzględnione w sprawozdaniu zostały wdrożone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgarbiła się, skuliła, zmalała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział mi tylko, że jeśli poczekam, to dowiedziałbym się czegoś przez pocztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, długi budynek znajdował się tuż przede mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet „Woltyżer“ nie mógł wytrzymać porównania z tym wspaniałym ogierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22889122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ci kapusta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22889123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże ja zmykałem i z jakim pośpiechem, przez moczary wśród deszczu i burzy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22889124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś pisałem z rzecznikiem prasowym i to powiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22889126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po południu wyszedłem z obozu i minąłem nasze pikiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22889127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy będzie pan mógł objąć swoje nowe obowiązki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczny, bezmyślny huk bilardowych kul.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie to wymaga pewnych objaśnień i uzupełnień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deszcz nie ustaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz przejrzałem karty i zatopiłem się w myślach o ich ukrytem znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23368167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa płynęły z niewidzialnych ust, stawały się żywe i zbliżały się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdę teraz do chęci wykluczenia obowiązku ścigania prób popełnienia przestępstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, w dużym stopniu są one produktem podstawowej postawy neoliberalnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz dziękuję Państwu za styczniową debatę nad tym zagadnieniem, której przewodniczyłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym krokiem będzie ocena skutków opodatkowania sektora finansowego obejmująca przedstawione przez nas koncepcje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego że postrzegają to jako jedyną szansę, ostatnią szansę na przeżycie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26678173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo słuchamy na froncie naukowym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiała i ona, że niestety ich sytuacja znacznie się pogorszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mówię, że przyjdę, to przyjdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chciał pozwolić mówić na siebie „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień natychmiast zaczął szybko posuwać się wzdłuż kanału pomiędzy klocami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz mi, jakimi środkami osiągacie takie cuda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem do miłego widzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystrzelił Maciuś w powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy ulewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umył twarz i ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poślemy po was w razie potrzeby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili Starski w oczach hrabiny stracił wszelką wartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podałem mu szklankę, którą wypił duszkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchnął serdecznym śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś trafiło go w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz miał zupełnie zeszpeconą przez złego dozorcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno coś pilnego, bo kawaler palto ma krzywo zapięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan mię zaraz zrozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście mówię wedle monety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochyliłem się i podałem mu go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lektury szkolne. Patriotyzm, mesjanizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedtem, dziewicą będąc, tak strasznie się bała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak długo to trwa u ciebie? — Piętnaście minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie mówiąc, to chłopisko poczciwe; lubi tylko zaczepiać nieznajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znowu powstał szalony śmiech!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkie i łatwe wyszukiwanie informacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opieram się o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na lewej ręce miał zarzucony pęk cienkich sznurków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę jej przypomnieć rocznicę naszego ślubu, tak, by jutro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25821956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tylu latach wiernej służby?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, obecna sytuacja polityczna w Afganistanie jest niestabilna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani komisarz powiedziała, że środki będą przydzielane państwom członkowskim na podstawie wskaźnika historycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy sytuacja nie jest już wystarczająco zła?\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z tym w całej rozciągłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"komunikacji, kooperacji i kompromisu, podstawowych elementów europejskiej polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponownie wzywam Komisję do podjęcia działań w związku z tą sprawą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sedno problemu jest całkiem oczywiste\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że taką właśnie okazję tym raportem utraciliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Centrum Sytuacyjne ma zostać teraz włączone do struktur Służby Działań Wewnętrznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To kryzys, który obnażył trzy niedopuszczalne asymetrie, które należy zlikwidować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"projektodawca opinii Komisji Rynku Wewnętrznego i Ochrony Konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz federalnych deficytów publicznych istnieją ogromne deficyty prywatne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz kontynuowała moje wystąpienie mówiąc po angielsku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawiają się również rozważania dotyczące potrzeby ochrony, zabezpieczenia i przywrócenia europejskiego dziedzictwa kulturowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo dzieje się wciąż w Korei Północnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zgadzam się również z tym konkretnym zastosowaniem uproszczonej procedury zmiany Traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam za bardzo ważne kontynuowanie tego szczególnego dialogu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczucie dumy narodowej na tym nie ucierpi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż Parlament Europejski obowiązują dłuższe procedury parlamentarne, nie można jednak skazywać go na bezczynność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy bezpośrednio zmierzyć się z konsekwencjami społecznymi tego kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35292206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dochód ten wykorzystuje się do podsycania konfliktów w tym kraju i regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy prezydencja powie, czy te zobowiązania budżetowe zostaną podjęte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydatki na budynki stanowią znaczącą część budżetu instytucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej polityczna debata w Stanach Zjednoczonych znacznie się zmieniła i podąża w naszym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje silna pokusa, aby przeciwstawić sobie te dwa rodzaje solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy siedzieć z założonymi rękami i czekać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nasza analiza jest błędna, to nasze rozwiązania będą również błędne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przyjmiemy tę misję i w ten sposób zrobimy znaczny krok naprzód dla cywilizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego wprowadziliśmy proces wstępnej rejestracji a następnie proces autoryzacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrzask i krzyki wzbiły się aż ku niebiosom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży ona do rozpoczęcia przedmiotowej współpracy w marcu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę w tej chwili omawiać kwestii zasług\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda jest taka, że Rada opiera się niektórym środkom zmniejszania obciążeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego tworząc politykę antynikotynową musimy patrzeć na problem z wielu perspektyw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo dziękuję pani przewodniczącej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednym z najlepszych sposobów jest zachęcanie na skalę światową do tworzenia otwartych rynków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak musimy podjąć kolejne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero po realizacji traktatu lizbońskiego wiele jego aspektów będzie mogło zostać omówionych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugim poważnym zaniedbaniem jest kwestia euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, wspólna polityka zagraniczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, mają zazwyczaj wino takiej samej jakości, ale za dużo mniejszą cenę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38244601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o upolitycznienie tych spraw - jest ono niemal nieuniknione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jednoręki zaniepokoił się pilnie i otarł usta rąbkiem rękawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś dotknął lekko mego ramienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zauważyłem kolbę karabinu, ukrytego na łóżku pod stosem poduszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj teraz, gdzie się dziewka ukrywa? — zagadnął Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat przez nas poruszony i mnie nadzwyczajnie zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemni rozbrzmiewa stada wycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o białego ogiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem się usunąć, a on o walizkę zawadził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął w progu, zajrzał w głąb i żachnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołaliśmy przyjść z pomocą, nieszczęśliwy uległ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Haczyk od okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cierpliwie, żeby nie bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów wywołuje, kto jest, kogo nie ma, kto się spóźnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może drży wskutek zimna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież jest w naszych rękach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — potwierdził z głęboką zadumą jednoręki, pilnie i nabożnie zajęty niespodzianą wyżerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To szaleństwo i zabobon! — krzyknąłem wzburzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma żal do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam go, jak miałam sześć lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może zauważyłeś coś niezwykłego w czasie snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten nie zwracał na to żadnej uwagi, zatopiony w obserwacji krajobrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś ze mną na rybackim bacie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mógł wysunąć się na łóżko i wpaść w ręce męża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy to sobie w ten sposób komentują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzeństwo było oczarowane temi wycieczkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mikroskop jest dobrze naregulowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powrócili znowu do stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało nam się, żeśmy obaj dostali pomieszania zmysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu usłyszałem jęk, teraz już najwyraźniej nad moją głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22193943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziennikarz zdawał się bardziej jeszcze zdumionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała: — Jesteś komediant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę być w oknie pociągu w Rudawie, gdzie będę wsiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotrzymała słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed nią i powiedział: — Dalej nie pójdziesz, aż się nie wyplączemy z tej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz siną pręgę na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożałujecie tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że tu w hotelu nie ma nocników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchajcie, dzieci, trzeba konie odsunąć od ognia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20688059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy wyciągnąć stąd jakieś wnioski praktyczne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wy jesteście braćmi, tak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naraz osioł stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę laboratoryjne zakażone śmiertelnym wirusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezbyt zachęcający początek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"system operacyjny linuks jest najlepszym z możliwych wyborów dla każdego z nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Wojski zaganiaczem go nieraz przezywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sorry, nie to miałem na myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostosowanie listy funkcjonalności do roli operatora systemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jeden Wysiłek mózgu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno jest wyraźne i pewne, drugie zaledwie czytelne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Które to figle kształcą i piczę i pytę:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złoczyńcy kościół okradli? — pytał opat zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bateria rozładowała się w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że wyszedłem na gbura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż nie, trzeba przyznać, nie tak znowu dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnem słowem jest „szczotka do szorowania świń“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Transmisje są również nadawane przez satelitę dla całej Europy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śni mi się… że to wszystko nie znika… że jest prawdziwe…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zaraz, zaraz, już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"słoik pełen ogórków kiszonych - najlepszy deser na dobrej imprezie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20905766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja lub pan prześlizgnęlibyśmy się przez nie z łatwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed moim domem zawsze było wiele gołębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy się z czasem wyrabia — przerwałem, cały drżący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjaśnię ci kiedyś później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie wiadomo, czym jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzała poprzez podwórze ku piekarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko w jaki sposób? O mało nie wpadli pod taksówkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen pełen majaków, zmagań i widm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę — odparł po chwili, podając mu cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przewidziane są zniżki dla studentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym właśnie twórcą przeznaczeń chcę być, chcę zrozumieć tajemnicę losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę umrzeć, leżąc na tobie, tak, właśnie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip na wpół nieprzytomny od dymu, kicha potężnie i budzi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłanie było nadspodziewanie wygodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Serce ani drgnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziny naszej siostry świętowaliśmy całą rodziną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tego śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli to był sen, można było jej wybaczyć te kuchenne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dlatego, że teraz już jesteś rybakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten drugi — to Stanisław Krzemiński.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To szeroki temat, ale nie tak trudny, jak się rodzicom wydaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz teraz włożyła strój zgoła odmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co tam słychać u sąsiadów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to podczas obiadu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu on był jak przyrząd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć gdyż oczekują mnie towarzysze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczegółów nie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieża była z kamieni, u dołu szeroka, wyżej coraz węższa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem pewne myśli nadciągają nie wiadomo skąd i dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on śmieszny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, zwariowałaś? W tej chwili pożałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z pociągu nie wolno strzelać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie przypuszczasz, kto padł ofiarą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skarbca królewskiego wypłacić mu sto tysięcy dukatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, muszę opisać, co działo się wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz tatko coś dołożył i kupili rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko spojrzę na dziecko, zaraz wiem, co ono warte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oszczędź mi pan swych dowcipów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za świństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jakimś czasie ktoś otworzył drzwi przedziału i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyznałaby się do tego za Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — rzuciłem odruchowo pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew się tu poleje jeszcze dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrosła partyzantka na Uralu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że wielkie towarzystwa, na wzór towarzystw mniejszych, będą wolały zapłacić, niż walczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem już przy obiedzie, gdy się ukazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległ się szmer potwierdzenia i szereg cichych przekleństw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył ku niej jak tygrys i prawą ręką chwycił ją za gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niejednego zatłuczono kijami za niniejsze przewiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilę później na schody wybiegł siwowłosy mężczyzna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kącie pokoju stał ręczny kuferek, Holmes wydobył go i zaczął zapinać sprzączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególny to był widok, któremu przypatrywały się tylko sępy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż pięćdziesiąt morderstw, to mało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdemu niebezpieczeństwu wiadomemu umiał stawić czoło mężnie, ale niepewność przyprowadzała go do rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiejesz się, przyjacielu, Watsonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie posiadamy, jako punkt wyjścia, doskonalą podstawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi on: „Drogi Panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę jednak, że to wkrótce nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jego twarzy malował się granitowy spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pilnujcie więźnia, i strzelajcie, jeśli będzie próbował jakichś sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21318782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na strażników z miną warczącego psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21381428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Roześmiałem się na tę dziwną wiadomość, ale Holmes przyjął ją niezwykle poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21381429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł prawą rękę do prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21381431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesunąłem dłonią po czole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Emil komicznie się zachowywał, gdy mu powiedziałam o łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytała: — Idziesz też do miasta? — Czekam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem obiecuję sobie, że go wyrzucę, że go w ogóle nie wpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak potarł dłonią miejsce pozbawione kędziora i rzucił na zabrakowanego kulawca spojrzenie pełne politowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolina chodziła rankiem po tych alejach i odnalazła ślady kopyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie miałam z kim pojechać kajakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie ci niemiłe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam uczucie, że tam byłaś w tym ogrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A drugie trochę starsze, ale też małe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No niechby sobie, ale lubi wyśmiewać — i buntuje na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak zapominasz, to cała nauka z kary idzie w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym całkiem cicho: — I nauczy się pan rezygnować z efektów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, prawda, przypominam sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłosierny ponad wszelkie rozumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Około osiemdziesięciu czarnowłosych naszych przeciwników padło na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę iść i otworzyć nam drzwi natychmiast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dworze panowała cisza i spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wówczas z każdego wozu, z każdego otworu padły niezliczone strzały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając się zerwał, skoczył i zaczął uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś mi się widzi, jakby to on chciał nas zatopić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Es” był pierwszym asystentem i miał dyżur tej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obcoplemieńcy zawładnęli ich krajem i byli nieugięci w swym ogromie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna niezwykłego wypadku z czterema psami, znalezionymi w lesie, dotychczas nie wyjaśniona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po za tym plotki: Saint-Simona, Eckermanna, Franka Harrisa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Światła pełzają ostronie po jezdniach, jak ameby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie to wszystko wspaniałe i piękne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak jury uznało, że zwycięstwo było osiągnięte za pomocą niedopuszczalnych środków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tak kocham życie, że.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żołnierze bali się go, ale poszliby za nim w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te hekatomby ofiar rozpusty są przerażające...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierze więcej, niż pierwszy minister.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz pan, czy w takim wypadku, mogę liczyć na pańską pomoc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam reklamy w telewizji. Zwłaszcza te z zespołem muzycznym wiewiórek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21775776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak można zrobić siedem błędów ortograficznych w słowie, które ma cztery litery?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli przechodziły koło niego, jak duchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popołudniowe cienie z wolna gromadziły się pomiędzy drzewami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest sprzeczne samo w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeczuwał, jakie huragany zawiera w sobie to wezwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tańczyli, wprawdzie na palcach, po cichutku, lecz do upadłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjęła list z jego zaciśniętej pięści i natychmiast posłała po lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem uspokoiłem się trochę i spróbowałem rzecz rozważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiemy, jak bardzo Sudan ucierpiał pod jego rządami, opartymi na przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu nic szczególnego się nie wydarzyło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna handlowa jednak nie wybuchła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogrążyliśmy się w ogromnym kryzysie zaufania, a członkowie Rady mydlą oczy obywatelom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy przystać na mniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy rozwinąć tę technologię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja bowiem w obu przypadkach wygląda podobnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.828,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor tego obszernego sprawozdania słusznie oręduje za pogłębieniem stosunków między Europą a Stanami Zjednoczonymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako członek Komisji Petycji ja także chcę powiedzieć kilka słów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"problemu Wschodniej Jerozolimy, problemu wody, problemu bezpieczeństwa i problemu granic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ma to oznaczać praktyczny wymiar Europy trzech prędkości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczby są alarmujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejny obszar, w którym dostrzegamy potrzebę udoskonaleń, to głos Europy, który należy uwydatnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczność realizacji reform podyktowana jest również potrzebą umocnienia wolności i pluralizmu mediów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodzimy z błędnego założenia, tak jak gdybyśmy chcieli traktować Rosję jak wroga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę ich, aby reprezentowali interesy swoich społeczności, a nie interesy własne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przyznać zasługi tam gdzie należy je przyznać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W konsekwencji brakuje nadzoru nad stosowaniem przepisów prawa pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rola Parlamentu powinna być ograniczona do dwóch dziedzin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi to w sprzeczności z propozycją Komisji, aby wyłączyć rafinerie trzciny z procesu wycofywania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głównym tematem czerwcowego szczytu będzie bez wątpienia sytuacja gospodarcza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27634909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Platformy te mogą obejmować repertuar innych wydawców muzyki lub cały repertuar istniejących organizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bóg nierównowagi, w której wirują nieskończone byty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg, który go wiózł, wyjechał wczoraj nad ranem z Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny indyk, nie ma co mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór najwidoczniej siedział na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzenie, że w Polsce rządzi burżuazja, nie jest prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożegnali się i Emil wrócił nad rzekę i wrócił do Sokra tesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęła je bić po tyłku i biła je długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocalał guzik i część drutu rozpiętego na parkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za głośno targowali się z babcią o mycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byle tylko jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tutaj wieją dziwne wiatry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, no… niech się błąka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kup sobie z tamtych!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogląd na istoty żywe: witalizm z pewnymi zastrze żeniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaleźli duży balon sylwestrowy na środku pustej jezdni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę w kącie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ma złość do naszej panienki i rzucił uroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mnie! — szepnął jednoręki, który dotąd trwał w zupełnym milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20784999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedpokoju zauważył, że pada deszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy przyszedł mi w pomoc szczęśliwy przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskiej i niby na jeża ostrzyżonej murawie przyleśnej stał dąb ustronny i rozłożysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szło im trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko drgało w tym szczególnym rytmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20681833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto da się przeważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani nie przypuszcza, z kim jedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znajdowali się blisko gimnazjum, do którego chodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drogo to można okupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy się zobaczymy? Nie odpowiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam zegarek, wąsy, biurko z szufladami, wszystko mam jak dorośli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20683509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z rozpaczą załamała dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim kulawiec zdążył powstać z upadku, znikła w rozbłyskanej słońcem zieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przeciwnej strony, zza rzeki, nadchodził wolnym krokiem jakiś mężczyzna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny nie wpadłby na taki pomysł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle odwróciła się i skierowała kroki ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezczelność tego człowieka, który pozwalał się znieważać bezkarnie bez powodu, rozbrajała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leczenie: atropina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzi na swoim czółnie jak wicher.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do Sary i wpatrzyła się w nią z uwielbieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nic nie powiedział, jeno ukosem spojrzał na spuchniętą od żądeł lewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był barszcz zdrowy, zawiesisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właściwie cóż by nam przyszło z tego, gdybyśmy wreszcie go odnaleźli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszliśmy do niego i dziewczęta zaczęły go całować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak studnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym posyłali do siebie Józię, młodą pokojówkę Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siedzi delegat królów i drzemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otchłań płciowa z hipopotamem włochatym „na blond”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy żywili dlań jak największą cześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchał pokorny jak baranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los czyli nie przychodzi ku nam mimo naszej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg byl czysty, nietknięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W punktach kulminacyjnych robił diminuen- da, co było jego nowym odkryciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip nie miał nawet czasu zamachnąć się pałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno się ruszać! — mówił ktoś pochylony nade mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie ona lepiej od nas, co czynić na oczach ludzkich, a co na stronie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z moich ludzi padł trupem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on spokojny! — snuł dalsze ogniwo myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę na mnie spojrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostali wciągnięci w wiatr, który ciął w wirujące płatki śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wszystkimi wirował śnieg i ostre, podobne do cięcia, wrażenie: nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko głowa ciążyła okropnie, w skroniach pulsowały głośno tętna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzył na Emila z wielkim zdziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nikt nie ma racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawialiśmy się czy to mają być wystawy stałe, czy zmienne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrącam rękami natrętny pstrokaty łeb, bronię ciała mego od jej dotknięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz pendrive'a, którego ci dałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po jej odejściu uczułam nieokreślony lęk, którego nie mogę opanować dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to, więc tak dużo tu czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba nie jest sodomia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny dziewczak! — rzekł, pocmokując ze znawstwem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przychodzi do mnie jak do kurwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle obudził mnie szelest lekkich kroków poza mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cóż się właściwie z nami stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść to jeszcze raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tych bram, i domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnim razem był to chyba październik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klementyna umarła od udaru sercowego, umarła z nadmiaru życia i radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddać ją żołnierzom ku zabawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja także — nalegał dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, żem okaleczył tego łotra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On znał każdy labiryncik jej psychiki i rów nocześnie odkrywał coraz nowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Depesza pewno gdzieś tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawdziwie, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki nie wydawały złożonych kapitałów i nie wypłacały procentów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztan zaczął z wolna wydzielać swój nocny zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wam podziękować i pobłogosławić… wam wszystkim…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w rozpaczy i zdawało mu się, że spadnie na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ów woreczek był dla Filipa prawdziwym skarbem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam widzę go każdego ranka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil ma stosunkowo małego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam czytał po łacinie i grecku tak, jak Emil T.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja ci, Kazik, powiem, jak jestem katolik…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachory pisiały na jezdnię; były wyblakłe, złośliwe i mądre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dziś nie ma na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I to mnie właśnie boli, że tatuś odjechał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pełnia winy może być tylko tam, gdzie istnieje premedytacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę więc w kącie na łóżku, jak osaczony kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas nosi w sobie ziarno zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czapki nie można znaleźć i w bek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyślam się, że dokładny plan wyjazdu dostanę jeszcze przed końcem tygodnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W sklepie się woda zapaliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemawiał z reguły tylko wtedy, gdy zachodziła bezwzględna konieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to wcale nie bolało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy przenieśli wzrok na jego rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W klatce go posadzić i na rynku wystawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Udzielam głosu młodemu królowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkajmy się na piwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten film odniesie sukces?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodów przecież nigdy nie braknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się zdecyduję, dam ci jedną dobrą radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go niezdecydowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nagroda ufundowana przez nasze miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my i rozpłakaną połasuchować się potrafimy… — odpowiedział kulawiec, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielka jeszcze nie słyszała, ale my słyszymy — od pierwszego nieśmiałego razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on umie pieścić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie powinna na mnie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że rzeczywistości nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszłość jest przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Teraz ćwiczę mazurek Chopina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie Bartek używał ich do okrywania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będę pół bogiem, pół czarnoksiężniczkiem, aby mieszać, lepić i rozpalać ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bracia! — zawołał nagle Podlasiak, tkliwym spojrzeniem obdarzając obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adam czytał po łacinie i grecku tak, jak Emil T.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jednak zawsze już bliżej końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy przecież w ogólnikach: teoretyzujemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na miarę lat siedemdziesiątych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obronić się przed straszną koalicją wrogów — otóż pierwsza idea.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wskazała mi miejsce w łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dniem i nocą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od miasta do miasta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo leżało takie kółeczko, od zegarka czy czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeszło dwa lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie wicher — przykrość, dla niego — uciecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa odskoczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może u nich tylko taki już zwyczaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podbiegał do tego, kogo się bał, aby już szybko był z tym koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjechał Seweryn i wydano ją bez gadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś podobnego jest możliwym? — wyszeptał przecierając drżącą dłonią czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem jakiś czas temu popularnonaukową analizę czytelników fantastyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosiliśmy go na lunch w pobliskiej knajpie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby odpowiedzialne za wychowanie dziecka i kierowanie nim powinny mieć na względzie jego dobro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi dopiero rozmach, co się zowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy mogłabym się obyć bez niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wieloma uprawiałem seks\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziemy na toczącej się w przestrzeni kuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nic wspólnego pomiędzy wolnymi ludami puszczy, a tą bandą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak i nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz słyszę już…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną, dziewczyco, nie rób żadnych ceregieli — rzekł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i łopot serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to jest cudowna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nie! — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale straszne było przebudzenie z upojeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy we wróżby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób ich dialogi stawały się coraz mniej zrozumiałe dla otoczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz stała się rzecz najsmutniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak — tym dziwniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz muszę stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulokowali panią w okropnej dziurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnął go nudny zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie nam dobrze z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i łopot serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umie zachwalać swój towar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zobaczył go, jak spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni wkrótce zaczną nas szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja pozostanę tutaj; będę oczekiwał twego powrotu tu w tym fotelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W takim razie — odpowiedział cicho — poniósłbym porażkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, przypomniałem sobie to — bąknął Jakub.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupie smarkate.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast „Harcerze podnieśli nosze”, napisane: „Harcerze podnieśli nos”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona mówiła do niego: — Opowiem ci jak to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłaby trzecia skrobanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak rozwiązujemy kwestię zakwaterowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znajdowali się blisko gimnazjum, do którego chodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka jego miała mnie zawiadomić natychmiast, gdy ojciec powróci z żydowskiego ratusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzydziłem się jej natrętnego śmiechu i tej woskowej twarzy jakby drewnianego konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czyś już przeżyła jaki cud, że tak na cud oczekujesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko obrzydliwy patos działa na takie psie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak otulił mnie siłą w palto i zawołał: „Mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewidentnie zabrakło im chęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś ty za jeden?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grobowe milczenie w zakładzie staje się coraz bardziej dręczące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, zupełnie powoli, tak jak on, gdy wchodził do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy już tysiące razy nie udawało mi się coś cudownego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wybiegł na ulicę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dwie pary prycz z siennikami przy ścianach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekłbyś z jasnego nieba piorun w niego uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę sałatkę grecką z pomidorkami - nie, chwila, bez pomidorków - i sosem winegret.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak gdyby mogło być coś wspanialszego na ziemi, niż stracić grunt pod nogami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co też ja powiedziałem złego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Żartem lano wtedy ołów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padłem na fotel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękność jej była tak zdumiewająca, żem powstrzymał oddech i stałem jak zaklęty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W całym ghetto nikt nie mieszka, coby mógł się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musze kogoś obudzić, aby mi wskazał drogę: powiedziałem sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy rudowłosa Rozyna była jego córką czy siostrzenicą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I za każdym razem znajdowałam pieniądze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat przez nas poruszony i mnie nadzwyczajnie zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to mógł być? — spytałem zdumiony swego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bałwana ulepić, czy wskoczyć z rozmachu obiema nogami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baron żegnał każdego z osobna, poważnie i surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję i przepraszam za przerwanie toku rozmyślań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! Już! — zakrzyknął Podlasiak i wraz z kulawcem zbliżył się do dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona, która go zrozumiała zbyt wąsko: — Ooo, tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak struchlał i zbladł, jak przyłapany na gorącym uczynku winowajca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jesteś chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dziś nie ma na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego, co przyszedł z portu Churchill i którego wilki zagryzły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozgląda się dzikie wiejskie dziecko po ogromnym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadki szybko po sobie następują... jak się też skończy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem miejscu załamał mu się głos: Leon dostał spazmów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie co roku zdarzają się wyjątkowo dobre interesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarumieniła się, usłyszawszy moje nazwisko...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, gdyby chcieli wymieniać ze Starskim tkliwe spojrzenia, nie robiliby tego tak jawnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela była rozdrażniona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech każda kupi co jej potrzebne, żeby sobie zrobić przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O miłości się nie mówi. Miłość się wyraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się pan przynajmniej?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemia jęczała i gięła się pod niemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedz mój panie, że kobiety lubią rozmowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże... Wiem, że miał prawo...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś wszyscy huzia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały tydzień razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, że musi nauczycielce dopomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewiasty otaczały ją najtroskliwszą opieką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"byłam bardzo głupia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też domyślił się, żeśmy tylko o nim mówili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne, w dużem mieście same tylko święta i rozkosze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś mnie tknęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głowę dałbym sobie uciąć, że Stach niczem więcej nie zajmuje się tylko polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„O bardzo bolało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24473620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż ci to Blanko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komary latały dookoła nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to podczas obiadu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I myślały, że ich dary tak prędko dojechały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawił się na poduszkach, wyciągnął nogi przed siebie i zapalił cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano byle jaką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed nią i powiedział: — Dalej nie pójdziesz, aż się nie wyplączemy z tej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wiedzie te hordy ku krwawemu dziełu zbrodni, zemsty lub kary?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dlatego spóźniłeś się wtedy? Janek patrzył niebieskimi, niewinnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tzw. w magii „powrotne uderzenie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał i wyszedł z pokoju, omijając Elę szerokim lukiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz słyszę już…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce mi się z nikim wychodzić ani tańczyć, ani spacerować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta nasze spotkały się, a ciała splotły w miłosnym szale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypominam, że prosiłem, aby Maciusia nie nazywać królem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ich nie słyszała naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś lalką, niczym więcej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21570543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła je i ujrzała kryjówkę, lecz, niestety, zamkniętą na klucz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21570544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszeliście nigdy o przewodniczącym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21570545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korupcja i złodziejstwo ogarnęły wszystkich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21570546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moskiewska urzędowa „Prawda“ podaje następujący budżet robotników Sowieckiej Ukrainy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21570547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczem wolnym krokiem weszła do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22094436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ależ moje gazety muszą wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sok owocowy można zakupić w każdym supermarkecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że wiesz, iż jesteś sierotą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, tego Kasia nie chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się z niej nie wydostałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt mnie nie zatrzyma!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upłynął znów dzień, męki i trudów, po którym, na szczęście, noc przyszła chłodniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopcy okrętowi przyglądają mu się z podziwem i zazdrością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co się stało? On nie miał siły odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Homoseksualizm, transseksualizm, biseksualizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miliony uśmiechów zgasło w jednej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w jakiż sposób dostałaś się tutaj, siostro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drażnią mnie politycy i urzędnicy wtrącający się w moje życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chciałam, żebyś ty się przysłuchiwała — rzekła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka? — Ma dziś wychodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie chcę syna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kołdrę na grzbiet naciągnął, po jajach się podrapał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinała powoli, prawie pedantycznie szlafrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie główkę schyliła i do buzi wzięła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, czemu by miała być wygłodzona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz robi się jeszcze czerwieńszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wyszła z domu, znalazła wystawę, aby obejrzeć swoją twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Projekt czerwonej jaszczurki potrzebuje zdań w żywym języku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21312141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego powinieneś dzisiaj zasnąć wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wrażenia po przedwczorajszym filmie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To honor walczącego proletariatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem siadł nagi przy fortepianie i zaczął grać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawdziwie, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pomocnikiem nauczyciela w nędznej prowincjonalnej szkółce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłyszę! — odpowiedział radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas przestał płynąć, a świat istnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszliśmy do niego i dziewczęta zaczęły go całować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga propozycja okazała się nieco inna i, mówiąc dość optymistycznie, nieco lepsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie były czasy, że nie było to konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego ochrania się podwójne standardy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt często lekceważy się zasadę \\\"zanieczyszczający płaci\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne są nam nowe środki finansowe na nowe pomysły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za znakomitą odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwólcie państwo, że skorzystam z okazji, aby pogratulować prezydencji słoweńskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne jest to, żeby Europa mówiła jednym głosem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże wysuwa ona również cztery ważne żądania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że mogę uczestniczyć w dzisiejszej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że te kraje rzeczywiście dostaną jakieś pieniądze, a nie tylko puste obietnice\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo Panu dziękuję, że pozwolił mi Pan ponownie na krótkie wystąpienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, pragnę tutaj na moment przerwać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie powinno mieć miejsca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sojusz zdecydował się utrzymać broń jądrową jako ostateczny czynnik odstraszający\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak zawsze pamiętać, że wydawane tutaj środki to nie są pieniądze Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze to doceniam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już dzisiaj wspomniano, zidentyfikowaliśmy drugi problem, którym jest problem wylesiania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet Węgry mówią wszystkim, by nie wtrącali się w ich sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawiana teraz poprawka ostatecznie otrzymałaby brzmienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27676737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli przyjrzeć się celom polityki spójności, to najwyraźniej stanowi ona europejską wartość dodaną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27676738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie największym obszarem stosowania będzie leczenie innych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27676739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważne, że debatujemy nad nim w Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27676740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieszajmy tych dwóch spraw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żartować nie lubił! — dodał kulawiec, z uznaniem pokręcając głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma jadących zaczęły rozwijać się pierwsze akordy gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez Bibliotekę Narodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Gajowiec — dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwali protokół młodego króla — podpisali, że tak właśnie dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż może powiedzieć, ile biedny asceta w tych strasznych dniach wycierpiał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan uległ zapewne pomyłce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było też rytualne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary musiał przyznać, że jest sens w tych wywodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może przypomniały jej się lata miłości i szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kuj żelazo póki gorące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby kózka nie skakała, to by nóżki nie złamał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim obiedzie chyba podziękuję za deser.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzież nie jest łatwym jury, a ocenia każdy krok i każdy ruch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tam przecie nie ma komfortu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że szkoda mu było na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na naszą korzyść przemawiała jedna okoliczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Publicznie spotykamy się ponownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą przytacza on opinię cudzą, nie własną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiamy przynależeć dodatkowo do jakiejś mniejszej grupy kulturowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się jak ryba w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boby od razu poznali, bo się zrobiłem czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem naprzód, aby się dowiedzieć, czy skłonny jesteś go przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to włączyć, ale było już włączone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda? Biedny Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On się urodził w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „wnętrzności” boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co otrzymałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał i wyszedł z pokoju, omijając Elę szerokim lukiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie pięknie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"But się rozpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przykro, że ludzie przeze mnie cierpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna, dwie — powtarza Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz nie okazywał śladów zmęczenia, oddychając tylko głęboko i z przestankami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszysz: niezwłocznie, w tej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem ludzki mózg pracuje automatycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej cudzoziemcy szybko podążyli za nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmawia pan, no to jak się panu podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu rozpacz ogarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w takim razie wycofuję swój udział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodzenie pańskie będzie zagwarantowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu jednak słońce zaszło i nastąpiła noc pełna tajemnic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powóz szybko pomknął aleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj przynajmniej byliśmy wolni od ciekawych sąsiadów, którzy nas podpatrywali i obmawiali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pruski pułkownik ruchem ręki nakazał chłopu, aby zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili powziąłem postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopóki ona nie nadejdzie, nie mamy powodu obawiać się napaści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle poczułem, że ktoś trzęsie mną i rozpoznałem głos mego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21651753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprzyjająca chwila nadeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21651754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle w oczach jego zaświecił szczególny blask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21651755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosy mi się najeżyły ze zgrozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21651757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło się starcie dziewiąte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21651758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałem również młodych ludzi z takimi samymi siwymi włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz gospodarz był wielkim smakoszem i zawsze przekładał lepsze na potem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością pochwyciłem dziennik generała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie sprawa mogła mieć następujący przebieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21652042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś pan nam odmówił, to sprawa pańska przyjmie inny obrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — zauważył pośpiesznie kulawiec i palcem ostrzegawczo pogroził w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przyznaj się — nastawał wodząc ustami po jej cudnej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więcej nie wiemy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle jest marnych żywotów ludzi o wielkim dziele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas dłużył się okropnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olaf Anderson odsunął zaporę u drzwi i otworzył je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo! — pocieszył go Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno kłamał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słucha, lecz nie wierzy z pewnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściciel gospody zniżył głos instynktownie, jak każdy, kto mówił o straszliwym związku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobna sobie wyobrazić, żeby złączone razem nie dały badaczowi inteligentnemu pożądanych wyników“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, teraz, kochana żono, dowiedziałem się, co to jest strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włościanie są o wiele mądrzejsi i praktyczniejsi od władzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za chwilę usłyszeliśmy trzask drzwiczek jego powozu i oddalający się odgłos kopyt końskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój brat jest w niebie kowalem i ma kuźnię za tym obłokiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo mamy jeszcze cierpieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumieliśmy, że nikt nic nie słyszał i że my jedni byliśmy panami tajemnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21467857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiłem śledzić ich i szpiegować i czekać na odpowiednią sposobność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden bez drugiego nic nie zrobił, nie postanowił, zawsze musieli się wzajemnie naradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie im gorąco, jeżeli dostaną się w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisał: „Jakie to jest komiczne i wielokrotnie dziwne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzy długo, przenikliwie, sięga wzrokiem głęboko pod ziemię, do samej trumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyż to się skończy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnął długie, ciężkie nogi w botfortach i uderzał się w zęby rączką szpicruty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gapił się tępo w białą ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na kawałek chleba pracować w ten czy inny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszukam go przez urzędnika w biurze telegraficznem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem nastąpią męczące halucynacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kuracja w każdym razie jest nieunikniona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik jego stawał się coraz potężniejszy, wracały mu utracone siły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, że będziecie panowie sąsiadami, korzystam ze sposobności, aby panów ze sobą zapoznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21762403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą zaraz naprawimy tę niezręczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim sposobem zgadła, że młodzieniec powracał z ochmistrzynią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiądę na swoim kamieniu i będę grał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uroczyste obrazy dokoła wypłynęły w trzeźwej jasności, światło nagle mi się jawiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I biorąc piłkę obaj udali się do ogrodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj, mała pchło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co miałem począć w mych butach z cholewami, z ostrogami i pałaszem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezdolny, cośkolwiek myśleć lub czynić, runąłem prosto przed siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd idę? Do słońca. To chyba jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce do góry, albo ci kulę wpakuję w łeb!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mówiąc, pochwycił oboma rękami moje włosy i targnął, ażem zawył z bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie starzec nie wytrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki koniec, jaki sławny koniec dla pierwszego rycerza Francji!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczeli wszyscy ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew uderzyła ci do głowy?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz pan, co mówię, panie Gerard?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas na przemoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo widzisz, to się bez spacji wpisuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezesowa była wesoła, hrabina uśmiechnięta, pan Łęcki promieniejący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był Stach Wokulski i jego ojciec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książki nie wydobędą cię z upodlenia, w jakiem teraz jesteś, tylko proces.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tę czy wew tę, mi to wisi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam teraz na to pomysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment, w którym o nią lękać się musiałem, minął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25108433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brać się natychmiast do roboty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę opowiadał o swojej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili zdjął słuchawki z uszu i był zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Papier jest bezczelnie biały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócili na obiad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaatakowała mnie brylantami swych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On się urodził w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ci też nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umie zachwalać swój towar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna z nich jest znacznie krótsza od drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja je lubię i one mnie lubią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Marysi: — Profesora chyba nie ma w Sylwestra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczęli przeskakiwać przez płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia przyszedł policjant z wielkim niebieskim papierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co robi twój papa? - zapytał, bo lubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad rzeką włóczyli się ludzie, suszący siebie na słońcu, jak pieluchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich staraniach uzyskałem miejsce drugiego nauczyciela w niższym zakładzie naukowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyłapał go natychmiast i pacierz z radości odmówił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielki Pisarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Derkacz — rzekł chrapliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimne światło poranka przebija się przez mgłę spowijającą miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę z J.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak wypuścił z ręki jej dłoń drobną i niemal dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sam wiem, czy mam się modlić, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzbrojony w krótki i ciężki kij czekałem na zdobycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą się zbudziłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo przyzwoity chłopiec, nie sądzę, aby mu było można co zarzucić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwijam zwój po zwoju siatkę, okalającą ciężki tułów oszusta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężka praca, ale też sport nie lada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrałem nader prosty, lecz dobry środek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili miałem dla niej w sercu tylko gorycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące nowych uczuć zrywało się w duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale najboleśniejsze wrażenie wywierał widok dzieci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno z dużych szerokich okien wychodziło na balkon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22168568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wicher rzuciłem się na niego i ugodziłem bagnetem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozjaśniły się ciemności od zimnego, migotliwego blasku gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próżno chłopak namawiał i za uzdę ciągnął, i wózek popychał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybrał jedno i zamienił z krzesłem ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To, co pan mówi, jest bardzo logiczne, ale w swojej logiczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się trochę odmóżdżyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W perspektywie wyłonił się biały kontur cmentarnego muru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sklepach z ubraniami bywam rzadko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł do „Revue Philosophique”: „Analiza pojęcia przy padku”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast my jesteśmy inteligentnymi czytelnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia w sobotę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz najlepiej zrobisz, jak pójdziesz do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cha, cha, cha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór masz wolny… — szepnął głosem drżącym i spuściwszy głowę, znieruchomiał od wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycieczka w cudzy mózg i to w jaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośrodku widniał obszerny i okazały pałac bez dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zaświtał przed nami wylot sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pi, pi — pokaźna liczba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil obmacał wszystkie krzesła, na których wierzchu siedziała skóra, a w środku mieszkały sprężyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszła do nieba — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej radosnym kiwnięciem głowy stwierdzili w milczeniu obecność w dębie dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier drżał z niecierpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała czas dłuższy, utkwiwszy przerażone oczy w drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona łasa jest na miód i pszczołom go stale wyjada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam, aż obrazy podniosą się przede mną, jak przed zaklinaczem wężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są twoje urodziny, więc zapraszam cię na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W sklepie się woda zapaliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona pytała: — Skąd się tu bierzesz? — i nie mogła tego zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaspokoiła ona mej ciekawości — owszem, podnieciła ją tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I naraz śmiać się zaczęła srebrzystym, szczerym śmiechem dziewczęcym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale był jeden robotnik stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło mi się przewracać w głowie, patrzyłem poza nią, za okno, miałem półotwarte usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagroda przyznawana jest jedynie za tytuły przetłumaczone na język polski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie można było rozróżnić zarysy dzbanka i miski na wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pociągu — zawsze tylko w pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pokroić wędlinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta doskonale: kiedyś przeziębił się — przyszło zapalenie płuc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co mi dasz? Tamten odpowiada na serio i poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żal ścisnął go za serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież sama uparłaś się, że z nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jedenastej znowu poszedłem do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli nastawione zegarki dokładnie na tę samą godzinę i byli bardzo punktualni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli pani będzie w towarzystwie przez cały czas trwania podróży…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ojciec zawołał go i powiedział: — Wiesz Emil, będziesz miał brata albo siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam już wszystko w ręku, cała sprawa jasna, jak dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że zawiadomienie o tym, mającym nastąpić fakcie, będzie rzeczą wskazaną“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitał rosyjski, hojnie szafowany na cele agitacyjne zagranicą, wyczerpał się już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na drugi dzień morze wyrzuciło na brzeg szczątki rozbitej łodzi Piotra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujrzałem we śnie śmierć jej posiadacza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tak ważnej sprawie, jak ta, której się podjąłem, trzeba zaryzykować wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pozwolę sobię w miarę możności dokładnie opisać scenę, którą ujrzałem we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł zapałkę o podeszwę buta i oświetlił nią ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho, ostrożnie wkradaliśmy się do wielkiego domu, pogrążonego w ciemnościach nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, czy jest sprawiedliwość na ziemi, czy też rządzi nami tylko przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc to, chwycił koty za łapy, położył je na warsztacie i mocno przyśrubował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjmę pańską radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I, jakby odgadła myśl Staszka, dodała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryśce sił nie stawało, ale się krzepiła jak mogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skóra w tym miejscu jest poszarpana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyznaję, że nie widzę sposobu powiązania tych wszystkich faktów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schwycił go za ucho i jak nic wyciągnął na brzeg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nierychło kobieta w ręce plasnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedłem z lejkiem do światła i zacząłem go dokładnie oglądać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner stał skonfundowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omal nie zemdlał na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bogu więc dziękował, że odprawa nie wypadła zimą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale niech pan weźmie ten lejek do ręki i obejrzy go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21496562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobiegła uradowana do komory i poczęła odsuwać worki z mąką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazajutrz po południu rozpętała się burza, a woda lała się strumieniami z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż łaskawy pan może jej przeciwstawić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko zdaje mi się, nosił pan do niedawna jeszcze inny mundur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dan wciąż popłakiwał przy sterze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, że wiem, do której szkoły mam iść, na którą ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może bylibyśmy szczęśliwsi — kto wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliżej ona drapała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie brzmi dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona popatrzyła na jego twarz i przestraszyła się: była tak zmieniona, upiorna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam, o jutrzni we mgłach, odpływają małe statki rybackie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiaty jesienne rychło przemijają…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedno z podstawowych dzieł starszego okultyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bramy ciężko okute.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pewnie dorośli tak samo myślą, że dzieci nic nie wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To małe drogie uszko, które tyle razy całowałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciłem zatem do mojej celi i zasunąłem deski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez tereny ówczesnych Świętochłowic wiódł odwieczny szlak z Bytomia do Mikołowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałem zatem z bijącem sercem sposobności, która przecież nadarzyć mi się była powinna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo rzecz nie należała bynajmniej do łatwych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podałem mu ten kielich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mózgu roiły mi się krwawe, pełne trupów i jęku obrazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Białe, wełniste chmurki przelatywały po błękicie wieczornego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mamy żyć dalej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że tak nie było, ale, panowie, jakże jej to mogłem powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22311760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadłszy na brzegu łóżka, doktór wyprostował gazetę i zaczął czytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochałem cię jak syna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz powiedz hasło ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawy pan kpi sobie ze mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo powie, jak nad jarem i nad strumieniem! — gardłował kulawiec, podrygując niecałą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, czy nagle nie runie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie wygląda na paradoks?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech mnie ten wóz wiezie, gdzie chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za typy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdą jest wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego spotkania można było coś niecoś skorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zechce ze mną zatańczyć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie zauważyłeś tego, papo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wzięto nas za małżeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy od dawna tu leżę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę pana dowód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne dlatego organizatorzy postawili na jeszcze większą promocję wydarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stołu nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął z cicha, spuściwszy głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeszło dwa lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem trzeba wiedzieć kiedy się przebranżowić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyś lał o Klarze: z lekka obskurna, o wydatnych piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie śmiała się teraz wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna z nich jest znacznie krótsza od drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropna nuda nic nie robić, tylko wciąż chodzić do budy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspina się na górę, skąd można spaść i zabić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jeszcze bardziej je to zachęciło i jeszcze więcej zaczęły dawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, to żegnam! — ozwał się Billy — Nie przepadam wcale za nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wziął pocisk do ręki, wydał mu się on strasznie ciężki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymi ojcami byli: wielki pisarz, filozof Joachim i cielesny ojciec Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czymże właściwie było to młode dziewczę dla Brama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokarm wchodzi w nas, gdy jemy, i sprawia to nam przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być kimś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielki były jej mniej lub więcej obojętne, stary profesor łaciny był „słodki”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona się denerwuje widać, w sposób specyficzny, i zamknęła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liście nabaku nie dawały żadnej przed nim ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tu nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty przedstawisz mnie, a ja ciebie — rzekła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, kochany słoniu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazł pan coś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas odruchowo puściła linkę, a worek legł poprzecznie nad brzegiem zbiornika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił prócz tego biegle po angielsku, po francusku i po polsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem co noc ktoś ubywał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jest czarodziejem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już to samo powinno wzbudzić podejrzenie, że mamy do czynienia ze zmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największe miasta w Polsce to: Warszawa, Kraków, Łódź, Wrocław, Poznań, Gdańsk, Szczecin, Bydgoszcz, Lublin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to pana nie uderza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była tak blisko, że dość było wyciągnąć rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz spojrzawszy na nią posmutniał nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś bardzo chłodny wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowały się ziarna durry, dwie pentarki i wędzone paski polędwicy z gnu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś przypuszczał, że może i one schroniły się w pobliskim lesie przed nawałnicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było tam wyrażenia „okrutnie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po bezsennej nocy był zupełnie wyczerpany i wyglądał mizernie i nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sypią się na podłogę książki: buch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie poczuła ból w piersiach i skurcz w gardle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje dziesięciolatków obejmując się, idzie przez ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21154639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że otrzymał jakieś ostrzeżenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jak możesz żyć z nim pod jednym dachem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudno: nie jestem tak delikatny jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnij no sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stole zastał dwa listy i dużą kopertę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W klatce go posadzić i na rynku wystawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To naruszałoby przecież logikę i ekonomię natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak czasu sporo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest trochę dzikich zwierząt, tylko trzeba wiedzieć, gdzie szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął czarować, żeby choć odwrócić role.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz spróbuję je sparaliżować choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip nie miał nawet czasu zamachnąć się pałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Twoja dawna szkoła została zlikwidowana, możesz uzyskać zaświadczenie o przebiegu nauczania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Papier jest bezczelnie biały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieć i nie móc albo nie chcieć i musieć, albo jedno i drugie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach… widzę obłok… sunie ku księżycowi….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy się rozdzielić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycieczka w cudzy mózg i to w jaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem właśnie Twojego maila dotyczącego naszego wyjazdu służbowego do Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu na chwilę zacisnęło oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — zauważył pośpiesznie kulawiec i palcem ostrzegawczo pogroził w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy woda ciebie kąsa? — żartowała z niego Danusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półhalucynacje, które były zmieszane z drzewami w parku, z bawiącymi się dziećmi, z ulicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy do świątyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na nią z wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on śmieszny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucała się w oczy od razu oryginalna kompozycja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotarli wreszcie do pierwszego jaru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieliśmy mu, co nas do niego sprowadza i przedstawiliśmy naszą prośbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ust złodzieja wybiegły jakieś gniewne słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bylibyśmy wybuchnęli śmiechem, gdyby nie niepokój w jakim biedaczka czekała na odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze swoją tłustą, złą twarzą przypominał wielkiego pająka, snującego zatrutą siatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szarpał się na wszystkie strony, wymachując rękoma, byle się tylko uwolnić z uścisków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd mnie tak wleczecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem więc tylko ramionami i nie odpowiedziałem nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam panu jednak coś ważnego do powiedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jemu masz to pani do zawdzięczenia, ja nie ponoszę tutaj żadnej winy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogli zjawić się poto, aby na mojej ukochanej wykonać wyrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22246306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płomienie zasyczały, obejmując swym palącym uściskiem te suche, czarne szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiły wrażenie zbytecznego dodatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I może zabrzmi to pompatycznie, ale stwierdziłem, że chcę podjąć się wyzwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na nim skupiłaś swą uwagę, gdy wchodziłem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na Wyspę Cmentarną? — zapytałem, zajmując obok niej miejsce w gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojej, usta otworzył jak wrota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ze śniegiem wolno robić, co się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tutaj nic się nie zmieniło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiły się nam humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był sam, to by mu się nudziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, pobiegli we wskazanym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła, jakie to na nim robi wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kocham już inną; mam narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział krótki, urwany śmiech kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej bluzkę, a ona pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że gdy ją straci, umrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów wiatr i deszcz prosto w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może zauważyłeś coś niezwykłego w czasie snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wasza królewska mość raczy się pakować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma wisieć, nie utonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł żwawo głowę jak cebulkę i zobaczył mały wózek z jarzynami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległo się uderzenie trąb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszych latach życia nie wolno dziecka oddzielać od matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niechże jasny pan jedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tylko dziewką służebną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba lodówka nam się popsuła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możecie nas tu zamknąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pokroić wędlinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety o zbyt grubych nogach w kostce wyglądają na plaży całkiem dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja się wobec niej czuję skrępowany i nieśmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chwal dnia przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chodzenie na spacer było jeszcze nudniejsze niż siedzenie w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj na nogę, Tomasz! — krzyknął Dan z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunął ją miękko, aby rozciągnąć tę chwilę jak gumę i głaskał ustami własne ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani dietetyk kazała mi ograniczać spożywanie alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafię panu tego dokładnie powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie łatwość kombinacji znanych elementów daje niedoświadczonemu pijakowi to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stosunki meksykańskie utrudniają bardzo dostanie prawdziwego preparatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na palcach podeszliśmy do sztalugi, by śledzić przebieg pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy ani przedtem, ani potem nie widziałem jej tak rozrzewnionej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę chciał jej to wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nie urągaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ostrożnie odsunąwszy rąbek firanki, wyjrzała przez szparę na korytarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż Ewa odkleiła ten list wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuję, że sam nie wpadłem na tę myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawy jej zaczynają przybierać formy bardziej określone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali powinni się usunąć… — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generalnie osiągnęliśmy tutaj historycznie dobre rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę zapewnić szanowną panią poseł do dwóch kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nierozsądek z mojej strony, i nie chcę się nim powodować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te działania są mile widziane i nie będę ich dalej komentował\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta wojownicza ksenofilia i antypatriotyzm są bardzo męczące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On, Tomasz Judym, Tomek Judym z Ciepłej ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Który z waszmościów jest pan Jan Skrzetuski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy jego były jakby zezowate i zbielałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc to jest naszym kluczowym zadaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To skutek negatywny, który być może będziemy w stanie w przyszłości wyeliminować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary dwór odbijał się w wodzie; pozór z rzeczywistością tworzyły całość dziwnej piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem przecie, że w tym wypadku obaj mamy równe prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem mógłbym powiedzieć, że posiadam interes w ochronie konsumenta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"każdy człowiek z ulicy może ją kupić - przestępca także\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowią one też podwaliny dla prawa mojego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest zaangażowanie społeczeństwa obywatelskiego oraz lokalnych społecznych i regionalnych partnerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście dla Europy Rada zgodziła się na kontynuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toć ona przy Was, miłościwa Pani, nie przy mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepełnosprawni liczą na rzeczywiste zmiany, które wyrównają ich szanse\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten kraj może równie dobrze stać się polem bitwy między dwoma wielkimi potęgami regionu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowa o partnerstwie i współpracy jest podstawowym dokumentem umacniającym nasze związki z Rosją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła patrzeć w okno, uderzając nogą w podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego Unia Europejska jest punktem centralnym tego kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem przekonany, że wstępne wnioski sprawozdania spełniają ten wymóg\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41195695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrytykowali liderów i prezydenta kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładna, mała kobietka — każdy to przyzna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama żąda odpowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu kilku lat zajął wysokie stanowisko starszego inżyniera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to mam szczęście! — lamentował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona powinna móc leżeć na powierzchni wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie powinien wiedzieć, co posiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemń wdarła się do komnaty i wypełniła cały dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż, droga Aniu, czy dostałaś wiadomości od ojca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzy długo, przenikliwie, sięga wzrokiem głęboko pod ziemię, do samej trumny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś zauważył w trakcie poprzednich dni, że Kali umie rozniecić ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas to sierotka zdobyła sobie szybko serce siostry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo siedziała u twego wezgłowia i chłodziła cię wachlarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21160998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwość rozbudowy modułu wraz ze zwiększeniem zapotrzebowania na nowe funkcjonalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To brzmi jak bajka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczas znały miasta leżące wzdłuż kanału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama nie wiem — odpowiedziała Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Międzynarodowy projekt przelewania z pustego w próżne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż kamień młyński tak wygląda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Poczuł dla niej sympatię i pogłaskał ją po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, składam wniosek o utajnienie dalszej częsci i przesłuchiwanie za kulisami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec opadłszy w dół, począł się chwiać łagodnie na obie strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może się pomyliłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego szalik jest w sam raz dobry do wieczornej podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21161034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta druga zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27970981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgodnie z drugą polityczną zasadą musimy zagwarantować wysoki poziom ochrony praw konsumentów i pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27970982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasami bywa i tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27970983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wypadku w Czarnobylu musimy wyciągnąć wnioski dotyczące całkowitej przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27970984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podam państwu przykład, aby mogli sobie państwo lepiej wyobrazić sytuację i żeby ją naświetlić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27970985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy zatwierdzić pakietu o takim zakresie w ramach przyspieszonej procedury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem, źródłem problemu jest jeden konkretny fakt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego trendy ekonomiczne wytyczają kierunki przepływu energii w każdym społeczeństwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakty mówią za siebie - jednolity rynek działa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona konieczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym przekazać najszczersze wyrazy współczucia rodzinie i krewnym żołnierza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym omówić kilka punktów tego świetnego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak pojawiają się obawy związane z coraz większą opornością bakterii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Waszyngtonie odbędzie się tydzień energii zorganizowany przez Bank Światowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uwagą wysłuchałem wypowiedzi każdej z osób, które zabrały głos\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czynnych ośrodkach opieki zdrowotnej zabrakło szczepionek, a w zamkniętych istniały olbrzymie zapasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Wielkiej Brytanii lista osób kwalifikujących się do wydawania opinii stanowi całkiem interesującą lekturę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, panie ministrze, pani komisarz, panie i panowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powiedziałem wcześniej, ustawa mogła zostać przyjęta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed takim właśnie kryzysem wszyscy stoimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27971076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmuje próbę ograniczenia przypadków przedwczesnego kończenia nauki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27982553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy surowe reguły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27982554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby nie to, że jego podłoże nie jest gospodarcze czy finansowe, a polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27982555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziano nam, że odpowiada za nie straż pożarna i policja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27982556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie te kwestie stanowią podstawę europejskiego wzrostu gospodarczego i powinniśmy je należycie traktować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27982557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadek różnorodności biologicznej powoduje też zmniejszenie zdolności absorpcyjnych ekosystemu planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce przestało mi bić ze strachu, aby nie poczuł epoletów pod płaszczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uchyliłem drzwi jej dziewczęcego pokoiku i przystanąłem na progu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekłbyś iż życie jego zależy od szybkości biegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje życie nie znajduje się przynajmniej w niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak łatwo jednak schwytać mnie, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym mógł go zapomnieć choć na jedną chwilę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to wielka uroczystość, bo większa część uczonych z południowych Niemiec będzie przytomną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dajcie mu spokój, zaraz przyjdzie do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szydercza twarz Oliviera spoważniała i stała się prawie ponurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22298328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puścili się pędem wśród ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo po co pani ma mieć przeze mnie przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nic sobie wtedy z niego nie robiłam, ale byłam zadowolona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy dostrzegacie ten podwójny odblask?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty się mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłem sobie wtedy, że widzę ją po raz ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na jednej z ławek i utonąłem w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On cię bardzo polubił z mojego opowiadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawały się zielonym i spadzistym znijściem do nieskończenie dalekich i na opak wybujałych przeciwświatów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment operacyjny zaszedł znacznie wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cygaro żarzyło się powoli, rozpylając po przedziale obłoczki sinawego dymu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór zawahał się przez chwilę, jakby dla namysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili wrócił ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nas ocali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zaczęła powstawać przepaść między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położył się na brzegu lejka i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ci już przyniósł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ci na imię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tatko miał tam warsztat w narożnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ani to, ani tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgouste ryby, strzelające zielonymi, neonowymi światłami, płynęły sennie przez granatową, gęstą wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym pójść na studia plastyczne i zostać sławną malarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upijała się tą swoją „wyższą” muzyką niczym pijak gorzałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli człowiek nie czyta książek, nie może być świadomym i rozumującym obywatelem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym — zapewnił tamten badając wylot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalał eteru na chustkę i wdychał go powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłyśmy dawniej tak osamotnione, zziębnięte i zgłodniałe, a teraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż i to zawodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Potrzebuję nareszcie umyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natknąłem się na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytrzymaj mu nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu to nie było ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobry koniec dzida, usprawiedliwia środki ku niemu powzięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król przez kilka chwil w milczeniu te arcydzieła oglądał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"powróćcie do waszych niebios, gdyż piękność ziemianki zwyciężyła was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileż lat masz panie, że mówisz o śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz mniejsza o to, potrafię zachować to co zdobyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast ocknąć się, coraz głębiej zapadał w opętanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dwaj przyjaciele po raz ostatni uścisnąwszy dłonie, rozłączyli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to, jak się później przekonano, wyższym był od wszystkich otaczających.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zgodziłaby się okazać nieposłuszną swojemu ojcu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23864801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał nawet przed chwilą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szafach leżą tablice gliniane z asyryjskimi hieroglifami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umówiłem się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszysz, jesteś lalką z rozbitą głową!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczu jej najbardziej mi właśnie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła do grupy chłopców i dziewcząt, krzyknęła: — Twoja towarzyszka ma śliczną sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy żywili dlań jak największą cześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach! — krzyknęła płaczliwym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął oczy ze wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W biały dzień na jawie zdarzały się wypadki niepodobne do wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W atelier zapadło głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zaczęła się śmiać, niehisterycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, jak łatwo zgubić śpiew swój w czarnym lesie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyleczył pana człowiek bez doktorskiego dyplomu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisując się, kładł kropkę po podpisie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam Netflixa, jestem na to za biedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naród u nas mówi tym samym językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileż lat masz panie, że mówisz o śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa, które usłyszała przed chwilą, obudziły w niej silny niepokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła najgorsza rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przebacz mojemu ulubieńcowi, jeżeli mię kochasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawa natchnienia, nie roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kilku godzinach znów zazgrzytały rygle i dozorca zaprowadził mnie do sędziego śledczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten nagle skręcił i wpadł między gazony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25241636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Partyzanci wysadzili most kolejowy pod Złotoustem oraz pociąg z ładunkiem wojskowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie się wydało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwiać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieporozumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sztuka jest bezużyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już dalej nie szło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyż więc zaczynamy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nawiązali znowu przyjacielskie stosunki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to wąska, pusta uliczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę traktować rzecz na zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na drodze spotkał ich inspektor policyjny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kto może być ta piękność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina pierwsza piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Psalmie Dawida powiedziano: „Tedy rzekłem sam w sobie: teraz zaczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiąc pięćset złotych... tysiąc sztuk... dwadzieścia procent dopłata dla końcowego odbiorcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25290661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się i spojrzałem dokoła siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na święta Bożego Narodzenia miał do nas przyjechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu tak śmierdzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem telemarketerem, pracuję zdalnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie grałaby im po nosie, jak staremu... Gdzie moi przyjaciele?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogło być około drugiej, gdy na wolniejszem miejscu w lesie przystanęliśmy na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pysznie gra ten facet i muszę zobaczyć go drugi raz...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżył się do niego z wesołą twarzą, lecz wicehrabia czekał nań smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie siedziały w rogu pokoju, ale powstały, gdy wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Wokulski wszedł do pokoju pana Tomasza, lekarzy już nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz też kiedy iść z nami do tego szynku, mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nowego dekodera nie pominiesz reklam w telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż zeń prostaczek w szarej sukience.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mówi sam do siebie jakieś okropne rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatorką nadania nazwy była Halina Skibniewska, przewodnicząca Towarzystwa Przyjaźni Polsko-Francuskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz robić tylko to, co ci każę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobiegła uradowana do komory i poczęła odsuwać worki z mąką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synek szwagierki leżał chory w sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za rozkosz siedzieć na koniu i mieć broń w ręku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary mało co wiedział o tych matczynych wycieczkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór, widząc, że słowa jego odniosły pożądany skutek, jął go teraz pocieszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W około szarzały niezliczone sylwetki śpiących towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stuknąłem w szybę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapewne jaki wielki magnat zagraniczny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaraj się o to, abyś dziesiątemu pułkowi nie przyniósł wstydu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25240209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do sklepu, albo do piwnicy, nie bardzo...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie się to praktykowało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie wspominali ani słówkiem o czekającej ich w najbliższej przyszłości pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle wybucham śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dygotały mu palce w sposób skandaliczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na małą chwileczkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźmiemy oddział z dwustu żołnierzy i przekradniemy się na drugi koniec wąwozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starcie stanowczo nie przemawiało za nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, już jedzie! — zawołał jakiś chłopiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zresztą Ewa wszystko mi mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, babciu, taki śliczny, z czerwonym oczkiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawaj, dalej, bo nie mam czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i zarazem upadam na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem rękę wzdłuż ściany i pochwyciłem bosą nogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie pojmuję doskonale, że miałem sen, który został tutaj opisany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam zapłaciwszy za kurs, puściliśmy się pieszo przez błonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie mówiłem, że skończy się to morderstwem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosia łzy rzewne roni i za pierś się chwyta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek znakomity stoi wpośród promieni, lecz promienie palą go!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Od Sary? — wrzasnęły chórem dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używa podstępu w miejsce rycerstwa, pióra w miejsce szpady, to wstyd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujechałem jeszcze kawałek drogi i zatrzymałem się nieopodal domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To starcie musiało rozstrzygnąć sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl ta omal nie pognała jej w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropne i nie do uwierzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25596106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ drzwi nie były zamknięte, wsunąłem się tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na honor, moja klacz miała ciężką przeprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła przypadkiem, jak się chłop odlewa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał wypróbować, czy można na innego przelać swój czar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż by pan powiedział, gdybym na tym zakończyła mą opowieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Internet bezprzewodowy poprzez światłowód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mateusz nie lubił kobiet, prócz swej siostry Maryli i pani Małgorzaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie sobie Mozart a tu nagle Bach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przełknął ślinę i zaczął się bać trochę, bać pytania, które zada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy pisiała, a on przypadkowo mógł usłyszeć, np.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to spory młot, który leżał na dywanie przed ogniem, zwyczajny młot robotniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tu nie widać wejścia do mrowiska!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc zaopiekuj się mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przysłał cię tu Emil? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie będziesz miał intelektu człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale należy go odróżnić od mojego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ten jest dla mnie najbardziej niebezpieczny, dlatego muszę go znać na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nie, gotuje dla ciebie zupę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bodaj go ziemia żywcem pochłonęła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele miejsca zajmują materiały poświęconej rozwojowi oraz działalności gromady żydowskiej miasta Czerniowców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aborcja i eutanazja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz nie odpowiedziałem na jej pytające spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ty tam robisz i dokąd idziesz? zapytał Murzyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostały tylko oczy i czupryna, a twarzy wcale niema.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Modliłem się — brzmiały jego słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zawsze byłam chuda — odpowiedziała — i zawsze miałam duże oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim chciałbym pogratulować sprawozdawcy podkreślenia kilku wyzwań, jakie przed nami stoją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że to trzeba powiedzieć w końcu bardzo wyraźnie i wprost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie można dopuścić do naruszania fizycznej nietykalności osób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani to nie wzmocni konkurencyjności Unii, ani nie zwiększy zadowolenia konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to doprowadzi do znaczących zmian w zakresie wspólnotowego modelu produkcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby mieć jakąkolwiek szansę bycia skutecznym, pomocą tą należy zarządzać szybko i elastycznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osm jest najgęstszym ze znanych pierwiastków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy, kto nie chce zgodzić się na system, może być od początku podejrzany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety według Eurostatu co trzecie zamówienie transgraniczne jest odrzucane w ten sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero o tym się przekonamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wydać jasne przesłanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pragmatyczne rozwiązanie uwzględnia zróżnicowane potrzeby podmiotów gospodarczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proponowany rejestr na rzecz przejrzystości jest niczym innym niż tylko środkiem administracyjnej legitymizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Roboty podziemne były takie, że niby to jest kopalnia węgla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski plan, jak państwo wiedzą, niestety nie dorasta do planu amerykańskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz zobowiązuję się do kontynuowania działań, ponieważ jestem do nich przekonana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie - spostrzeżenie natury ogólniejszej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio, dodatkowe dwa podobno zostały zestrzelone przez abchaskie siły bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu Komisji Gospodarczej i Monetarnej zwracałem się o poświęcenie szczególnej uwagi temu aspektowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma sensu temu zaprzeczać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś jest nie tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie stanowisko przewidziane jest w prawie europejskim i tak stosujemy je w praktyce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie możemy zwalczać niektórych praktyk stosowanych poza naszym kontynentem, a tolerować je na własnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem przyjęcie mandatu negocjacyjnego jest optymalnym kompromisem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38398534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym punktem posiedzenia jest debata nad sześcioma projektami rezolucji w sprawie Gwinei\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy znosić wiz bez spełnienia bardzo surowych kryteriów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że akcent zostanie położony przede wszystkim na infrastrukturę i transport\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje zbyt wielki dumping płacowy i zbyt wiele prymitywnego wyzysku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie przedstawić uwagi na temat niektórych spośród tych obszarów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodałabym do tego chętnie kwestię wzajemności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być w stanie zmierzyć te skutki, należy opracować wskaźniki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, nie możemy zapominać, że konkurencyjność przemysłu jest teraz mierzona globalnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaliśmy zaskoczeni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy przyznawaniu kredytów liczą się przepływy pieniężne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zawsze nieodzowne, by przejść przez nie wszystkie w należytej kolejności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja zaprezentowała badania dotyczące sposobu propagowania społeczno-gospodarczego rozwoju Kosowa i jego zakotwiczenia w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy, że ich liczba wiązała się z działalnością służb bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określają je państwo mianem umów na czas nieokreślony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziś robimy dobry krok w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano karty do głosowania, na których pytano o to, czy popierają oni traktat lizboński\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, szwedzcy socjaldemokraci w Parlamencie Europejskim, głosowaliśmy za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy problemy są tam większe niż gdzie indziej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczenia pisemne, które straciły ważność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, że sprawa ta dotyczy w dużej mierze najmłodszej grupy naszego społeczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie zmusi Rosji do takiego czy innego wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuję bardzo rozważnej opinii ze strony Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiarem jest wzmocnienie dorobku Schengen, a nie odejście od dorobku Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizacja w zakresie dokumentów urzędowych i rejestrów publicznych różni się w wielu państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co uczyniono, jeżeli chodzi o przyszłe programowanie finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30510601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze, niestety, Parlament Europejski został wykorzystany jako forum do nagłośnienia spraw krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam takiego, a jednak widziałem go nagiego do pasa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba użył pan tego wyrażenia w znaczeniu przenośnym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz: gdzie powiesiłeś, tam wisi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś kiedyś tego człowieka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do poniedziałku może być koniec świata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież mi się wargi pokurczą od niechęci! — tłumaczyła się żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewa, krzewy i trawa służące za jedyne schronienie też nie ułatwiają przetrwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest córką ekonoma i kocha naczelnika stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To mi nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O matko, włącz klimę bo umrę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jej kuzynem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, bo jakże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto tu był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam widzę go każdego ranka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemni rozbrzmiewa stada wycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No niechby sobie, ale lubi wyśmiewać — i buntuje na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przerzuciwszy ten ciężar na ojca — uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Ewa była zazdrosna, że nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dębowy… — szepnął porozumiewawczo do jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zawrócił pomału i poszedł w stronę parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzbrojony w krótki i ciężki kij czekałem na zdobycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żona nie powinna wiedzieć, że wieczór się nie odbył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą więc uwagę skierowałem na konia, widocznie tracącego resztki sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co otrzymałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć piękne, duże lustro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam mowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała nas zaduma i byliśmy zdolni tylko do spokojnego patrzenia przed siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, teraz jesteś dostatecznie zła, więc możemy roz mawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wrażenia po przedwczorajszym filmie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co z nich będzie? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Podlasiak gdzie? — zapytał z niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy ocknął się z zamyślenia i spojrzał nań przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spij, smarkaczu! Zobaczył, że zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgoda! — zawołał z ponownym wybuchem radości Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zauważył, że dochodzi siódma, godzina spotkania z Jankiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeszcze szarpną, pchną, uderzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już spała, a on słuchał, czy oddycha, czy nie umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór, wybór! — przedrzeźniała go dziwożona, podrzucając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy czterej spoglądaliśmy ku niemu serdecznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynurzymy ją z torby! — rzekł Podlasiak troskliwie i stanowczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz nie możesz mieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad rzeką włóczyli się ludzie, suszący siebie na słońcu, jak pieluchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było też rytualne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś ty z nimi chodził i coście tam gadali tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak niespodzianie, tak znienacka, jak bywa nieraz ze szczęściem lub śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością oczekuję przyszłego poniedziałku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mógłbyś zagrać? Zagrał go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On przyszedł po ten nóż!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystarczyło, aby się Emil nią zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta z dobrodziejstw ubezpieczeń społecznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę mówić, żeby nie zapeszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jesteś silniejszy niż ci chłopcy, z którymi się bawisz? — Fredek jest słabszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety w moim wieku są coraz starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I wcale przez drzwi nie wchodziłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ma pan rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak najbardziej uwagę przykuwają długie linki przymocowane do pleców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahał się i zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadł, pił, spał i pracował od świtu do nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie sprawiało mu to przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek był tuż, jak gdyby na wierzchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęli przed nią i zawahali się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już drugi raz uderzyłem małym palcem o framugę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten kryzys istotnie uderzył w samo serce kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prace związane z zapewnieniem przejrzystości należy kontynuować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Statystyki europejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo zaproponowano uproszczenie procedur administracyjnych dotyczących wdrażania projektów i rozpowszechniania wyników badań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o tym zadecyduje przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przesłanie najczęściej dociera do nas w postaci znanego sloganu, że \\\"sport to zdrowie\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykłady można mnożyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa ta jest naprawdę bardzo istotna i Parlament Europejski stwierdza to bez ogródek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duże znaczenie ma również opracowanie i wdrożenie skuteczniejszego systemu praktycznych mechanizmów współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może sens ma koncepcja \\\"ojca lub matki\\\" Izby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę także podziękować mojemu biuru i personelowi, którego wysiłek znacznie ułatwił nam pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak stanowią one jedynie część europejskiej reakcji na kryzys\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za państwa wysiłki i za uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze życie przypominało jedną wielką niekończącą się kampanię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten wynik jest bardzo zły i można go było uniknąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomniał pan o Funduszu Solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie potrafią nieraz zrozumieć powagi i konsekwencji danej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewien poparcia ze strony prezydencji węgierskiej w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym głównymi źródłami emisji dwutlenku węgla po ociepleniu są oceany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam pomysł oczywiście w pełni popieram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy sprawdzić, jak rozporządzenie funkcjonowało dotychczas, a następnie je ulepszyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jesteśmy w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że ważne jest podkreślenie powiązania pomiędzy tymi dwoma faktami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim mam pytanie do pana komisarza Rehna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29072331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Susz, do działania na rzecz uzupełniania danych krajowych, regionalnych i lokalnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40860821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecne koncepcje Komisji dotyczące przyszłości polityki spójności są nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40860822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże my Europejczycy jesteśmy także otwarci na krytykę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40860824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekomo w Pakistanie obowiązują najsurowsze na świecie przepisy prawne przewidujące kary za bluźnierstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40860825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi uczynią, kogo ja się tu boję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, ale... Mam tu urzędowe papiery o śmierci Ludwika Stawskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanów Zjednoczonych, Chin i Indii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musimy przeciwdziałać sile rynków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przestańcie zagrażać tej dyrektywie, gdyż jest to szalenie ważny dokument\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może istnieć społeczeństwo klasowe, w którym zagraniczni pracownicy pracują za mniejsze wynagrodzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak najważniejszym zagadnieniem jest zmienna sytuacja bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już wspomniałam, mamy ogromne doświadczenie na tym polu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc czego bronimy w Kongu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto Parlament Europejski był w stanie zaznaczyć swój wkład w przedmiotowe rozporządzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rezultacie operatorzy telewizji kablowej zaprzestali nadawania siedmiu kanałów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązanie problemu kurdyjskiego ma podstawowe znaczenie dla procesu demokratyzacji i ochrony mniejszości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas głosowania w Komisji Rozwoju regionalnego znaczna większość zagłosowała za przyjęciem celu pośredniego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję, panie przewodniczący, za pańską odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40864999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już możemy powiedzieć, że Komisja podejmuje w tym kierunku widoczne starania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szwedzki przemysł samochodowy został, jak reszta przemysłu samochodowego, poważnie dotknięty kryzysem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki wniosek przedstawiliśmy Radzie podczas postępowania pojednawczego i ponowiliśmy go w przedmiotowym sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam gdzie wprowadzono rozdział, ceny energii spadają lub rosną wolniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek legislacyjny ujednolica istniejące teksty, tworząc łatwiejszy do zrozumienia i bardziej przystępny akt prawny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawka ustna jest na liście do głosowania, ale nikt nie wstał, aby ją poprzeć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze byłoby umieścić ostrzeżenia na etykietkach skierowane zwłaszcza do kobiet w ciąży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40865008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opłata będzie zniesiona w przypadku niektórych kategorii osób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem, że za chwilę przyjdę do niej na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pan widzi, woda pozostaje zupełnie czysta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były tam i szczegóły nowe dla mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta pójdzie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachowywał się jak człowiek, który ma dokonać wielkiego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21597371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciejowi jakoś raźniej się zrobiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21597373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło tak lat kilkanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21597375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrz na setki dymiących kominów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21597376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrzegaliśmy was dla waszego dobra, widząc, że jesteście tu zupełnie obcym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21597377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to jakoś w lecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chłopcu zdało się kipieć wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Boga przysięgam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżając się do farmy, zdziwił się na widok dwóch koni, przywiązanych do kraty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciałem cię obrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałeś pan teraz moje stanowisko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tym toaście, jak wiecie, winny zniknąć wszelkie wzajemne urazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O świcie ukazał się ich oczom krajobraz niebywale wspaniały w swej grozie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyczułem najlżejszego ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do karczmy nie zajrzał ani razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już niczego nie pragnę, niczego się nie spodziewam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie się to praktykowało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz, jak pracuje twój brat, ty zaś jesteś do niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podbródek, wystający i kwadratowy, był również cechą charakterystyczną człowieka silnej woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed domkiem widać było zielony staw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21600154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymy podeszli i trumnę wynieśli z komnaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyszczące ucho od filiżanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak stało się i nic na świecie faktu nie odmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jej koleżanki opowiadały mu o jej pretensjach aktorskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, że zapłaci — odpowiedział tymczasem ojciec nie znoszącym wątpliwości tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic — pocieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogłam opierać się dłużej: przyszedłeś jak przeznaczenie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest kierowca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd się pan teraz wybiera? — zagadnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od miasta do miasta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łżesz jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś ty nigdy nie udawała niczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyloty rynien — potwory z otwartymi paszczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął jej usta pocałunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednej jej szali leży góra złota, na drugiej męski członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — teraz kontakt częściowo osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo dziś jest pierwszy śnieg, a wy nie uważacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zobaczył go, jak spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczegóły oczywista nie wchodzą w zakres naszych rozważań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam z nią zawsze, mimo że miałam ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinno ono być przedmiotem handlu w żadnej formie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urósł potężnie w siłę, odkąd nam uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strachu i wściekłości bełkotał: — Tylko ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przerzuciwszy ten ciężar na ojca — uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mów hop, póki nie przeskoczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem tylko stwierdzić prawdziwość swoich domysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął ręką po piersi, które począł pieszczotliwie gładzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matematyka to mój ulubiony przedmiot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Całuj! — ryknął dominując nad rechotem wyznawców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym bardziej jestem w skórze innych, tym wyżej wznosi się moje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co tam pojedzie z takimi nowinami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie umrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pary z ust nie puszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy rozumiecie w polityce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz ode mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się poinformować, czy można ją jeszcze zapisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki syknął z bólu i z rozkoszy, która się wraz z bólem narzuciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto mi zabroni wejść? — odparł chłopak stanowczym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyś lał o Klarze: z lekka obskurna, o wydatnych piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z drugiej strony… hm… co się tyczy twojego odejścia stąd…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z nikotyną, alkoholem i wszelkimi «białymi obłędami».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy dostrzegacie ten podwójny odblask?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem coś, co mam do powiedzenia — obiecała tajemniczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobaw się z nami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20763053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli czerwone uszy i byli nie bardzo przytomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czuję tak samo wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wiedziała, nie lękałabym się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę tam iść? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ze swoimi mizernymi orgaźmikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani z tej, ani z żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia! — odparł, podnosząc ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadspodziewanie okazuje się, że tkwi w Kościele sama geneza państwowości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zauważyłem kolbę karabinu, ukrytego na łóżku pod stosem poduszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Macie tupet, żeby się tu pojawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy istnieje świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Kochasz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25316946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozkazano nam zebrać rzeczy, zjeść śniadanie i stawać w szeregach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25316947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie spytałam o twoje imię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25316948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśliwi i sfora psów pędziła za czmychającem zwierzęciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25316949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, że to słyszę od pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25316950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jedyna nadzieja pańskiego ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godziny ostatnich dni upłynęły mi jak na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdłuż ogrodów w powabnych liniach wiła się wązka ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób zsunął się aż na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz do naszej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz przecież, jak długo nie spałeś i rozmawiałeś wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej dla niego, gdy już nie wróci do przytomności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie smuci mnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przezywać tu od myszek tego rozbójnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam pojęcia, co się z nim stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pierwej na niewidziane przyrzecze, że nie odmówi jednego choćby pocałunku! — zaniepokoił się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwienia o mało nie upadłem z krzesła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli dziecko żyje, to musi się gdzieś znajdować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta są ciche i lubią doglądać chorych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost miała średni, twarz piękną, białą, oczy niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dwóch skokach był przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod płaszczem miałem lunetę, pistolet, no i naturalnie pałasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyszedłem do ciebie w sprawie Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że w duchu ogląda jakiś obraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25317981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej właśnie chwili usłyszeliśmy odgłos kopyt końskich i turkot kół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W operacyjnej paliło się niebiesko-białe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jakim sposobem możesz każdego z nich rozpoznać i nazwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz przystąpimy do rozerwania łańcucha z Moniką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łudź się, nie wezmą cię z sobą — rzekł Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległo się uderzenie trąb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemni rozbrzmiewa stada wycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za rudera wrzasnął mały chłopiec do dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim był Wierusz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam mowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwinął lewą rękę w trąbkę i podstawił pod oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie słyszał pan dotychczas o nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem nadmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz sobie o tym myślał, dopóki nie wrócisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam cię, ale koperta jest zaklejona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co zjesz, mała? — zapytał, a ona płakała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli tak i nie myśleli o niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, dogodził mu, jak się należało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewał dalej jak szalony, wydymając swą maleńką gardziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówi pan do mnie rzeczy tak dziwne i tak mnie obchodzące…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany zaszły również na nowej części cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięciu warty z jednej strony, pięciu z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał jeszcze za sobą zawstydzony głos Filipa: — Przepraszam kolegę na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane takim tonem, że powinno jej się było wielu rzeczy odechcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedna Katarzyna nie domyślała się, że pocałowanie Celliniego było początkiem jego zemsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili zadzwoniono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieliśmy mu, co nas do niego sprowadza i przedstawiliśmy naszą prośbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"biegałem za twoim interesem mistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów dawno nie pisałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pendolino dojadę tam w niecałe dwie godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagrywałeś coś na cmentarzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok ten wprawił mnie początkowo w takie osłupienie, iż skamieniałem prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama, on mi zabrał czekoladę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pieniądze ma się rozumieć, przyjąłem.“ Zakręciło mi się w głowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle nie odznaczasz się taką surowością sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie masz mi nic więcej do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że tak nie jest, ale nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dole napisał: „Mój pamiętnik na wyspie bezludnej Białego Szatana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam był koniec tego zawikłanego węzła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mojego obliczenia musiałem mieć więzienie o jakie dwadzieścia mil angielskich poza sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można kochać umarłych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wokulski nawet nie poruszył się, tylko utopił w nim jasne spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nic się nie stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak brat troszczył się o mój los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem to winien swoim dobroczyńcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co to ma znaczyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeszcze jakie... Jutro przedstawienie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25103704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy trzeba koniecznie mieć przed sobą twarz, aby uchwycić podobieństwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jednak w tych okolicznościach może zrobić Unia Europejska?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasady dotyczące swobody przemieszczania się nie zostały ustanowione na korzyść przestępców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równie ważna jest odpowiedź na następne pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada oczekuje, że Komisja przedstawi swoją następną ocenę jesienią tego roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fala prześladowań przechodząca przez Zimbabwe stanowi wyraźną oznakę problemów, które poprzedzą nadchodzące wybory\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzje w tym obszarze podejmuje państwo członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jednak mogłaby pani odnieść się do tej kwestii w swoich końcowych uwagach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żywność nie jest i nie będzie zwykłym towarem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim przejdę do kolejnych punktów, chcę bardzo dobitnie powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te problemy wskazują jeden kierunek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest to kwestia nadmiernej prywatyzacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla nich liczy się tylko \\\"dalej, dalej, dalej\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serdecznie dziękujemy sprawozdawczyni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ogromne sumy pieniędzy nie przyniosły jednak żadnego pożytku narodowi afgańskiemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałam za obowiązkiem oznaczania kraju pochodzenia niektórych produktów przywożonych z państw trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt często brakuje jakiejkolwiek realnej kontroli poboru ceł i odzyskiwania środków niewłaściwie wydatkowanych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie stoimy przed złożoną rzeczywistością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że dzięki temu powstał bardzo dobry projekt sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nieformalnym dialogu wszystkie ustalenia muszą być na koniec zatwierdzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy tak sobie myśli, ale czekają, co powie Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może być innego rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skutkiem jest, oprócz kryzysu finansowego, również kryzys wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W świetle tych faktów przedstawione sprawozdanie powinno się cieszyć naszym całkowitym poparciem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zwrócić uwagę, że faktycznie udało się nam mówić jednym głosem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37263099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy czekać, aż recesja się pogłębi i przekształci w poważną depresję gospodarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po deszczu na ulice i chodniki wychodzą ślimaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ja jestem tym wszystkim” — można było o niej powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miała ta przejażdżka pomiędzy kamienicami szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę razy przesiąkł jak mgła przez pnie drzew w alei lipowej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocaliłeś mi życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak potarł dłonią miejsce pozbawione kędziora i rzucił na zabrakowanego kulawca spojrzenie pełne politowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą jej kochankowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz ustąpił mu z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz pendrive'a, którego ci dałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem zajrzę tutaj znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jak ty się nie przeprosisz? — To trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ze śniegiem wolno robić, co się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc on się koło mnie położył i leżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ojciec zawołał go i powiedział: — Wiesz Emil, będziesz miał brata albo siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej we wszechświecie lubię dżem porzeczkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy musi robić to, co mnie się podoba — rzekł obojętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż może mieć wspólnego z człowiekiem wolny naród wilków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę coś na kaszel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic, tylko lód i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wie, że my chodzimy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to mógł być? — spytałem zdumiony swego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robię po prostu bilans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że morderca spełniał akt w stanie na pół przytomnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zabijają go na wiele sprytnych sposobów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie nie było mu źle — ale ciasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu konstatuje fakt i zaznacza jego objawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdziwiło go to zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był na pogrzebie i nie pokazał się trzy dni w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież tu powód do wyrzutów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą lepiej się myśli w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłanie było nadspodziewanie wygodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20720593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miesiąc żeby flota była!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20720594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20720595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mieli rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20720596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20720597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako zbieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy całej klasie, zamiast kaligrafii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapewne jedziecie zwiedzić skarbiec królewski? — zapytała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to nie wie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież wiesz, że nie będziesz jej czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle z jego włosów zaczęły się sypać iskry aż na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumiewało go jej wyrafinowanie erotyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z nich było dwóch żołnierzy, w drugiej — trzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem Paweł wykładał o nie istniejących stworzeniach, fąflach, których istotą jest — udowadniał — nicość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ich nie słyszała naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko wam mogą wejść w drogę insi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aleś ty pierwszy trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczyłoby sił na gonitwę, sanki, łyżwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Eter to kłamca, i to na krótką metę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy w domu chleb?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą — kiedyś nie było też alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni usiłowali prowadzić z nią rozmowy i udawało im się czasem objąć ją wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pracuję nad alternatywnym planem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie przechodzi jeden dzień po drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przecież feministą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w dziedzinie matematyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosiu, przestań gryźć mamę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20653179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciąża byłaby dla Stelli prawdziwą katastrofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisnąłeś — miękko uderzyła i rozpadła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyłapał go natychmiast i pacierz z radości odmówił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę dzisiaj do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczenie twoje — rzekł — ma dużo cech prawdopodobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie oczekuje od ciebie milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się jak ryba w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą przytacza on opinię cudzą, nie własną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem Paweł wykładał o nie istniejących stworzeniach, fąflach, których istotą jest — udowadniał — nicość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku niemiłemu zdumieniu zauważył, że nie jest sam: miał towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czy ja mogę się o coś zapytać? — Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotykam ją czasami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, bo jakże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Damian zauważył, że biegnie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, żeś mądry nad swe lata: tedy posłuchaj moich słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepiej, nie najlepiej! — odrzekł ze szczerym smutkiem w głosie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temu człowiekowi została tylko Biblia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam takiego, a jednak widziałem go nagiego do pasa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie ściany były pokryte literalnie od posadzki po strop książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co mi to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczę ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż nie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakiś instynkt ostrzegł Bartka, że grozi mu niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To się tylko tak mówi: „czytam”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież lekko cuchnąć nie jest rzeczą przykrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrąca go ze spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aboż natura jest piękną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej, tylko dla niej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również istoty czerwonawego koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Systematycznie szedłem wstecz przez moje życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem wzbudzić najmniejszego śladu wspomnienia co do jego postaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczuwałem; on znajdzie dla niej radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz może nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym miała o tem wątpić, wpadłabym w bezdenną przepaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze, które wdychałem rozrzedziło się i cięło, jak eter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko uczucie osobliwego, lodowatego szkieletu we mnie, trwało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Srebrne skrzyneczki z relikwiami leżały we śnie wiekuistym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten sam wyraz i ten sam owal twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby pan był roztropny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mam z nim porachunki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zupełnie inną była Angelina, niż dotychczas w mojej wyobraźni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżem przemarzył czas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedziałem im swoją wędrówkę wśród mgły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udowodniłbym to nawet, gdyby Rozyna była podobną do tandeciarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To będzie Babiński“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę trwonić swych najlepszych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się, otworzył okno i wyrzucił głowę na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23606118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szara istota znikła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko, wezwij karetkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, w piosenkę… żeby mieć cię blisko ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocie łby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby ci było przyjemnie? — To bym była zadowolona, że poszłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny nie wpadłby na taki pomysł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny był dziewczak — rzekł wreszcie kulawiec i spojrzał na przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To mi nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie mówi u cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów, Tereso, w dziewczynę się zmień!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten nie zwracał na to żadnej uwagi, zatopiony w obserwacji krajobrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I to mnie właśnie boli, że tatuś odjechał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach… widzę obłok… sunie ku księżycowi….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gimnazjum jest coraz bliżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba jakieś nowe stanowisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa lata temu z górą, koło Zielonych Świątek, sczezł bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła do grupy chłopców i dziewcząt, krzyknęła: — Twoja towarzyszka ma śliczną sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz kazał mi zmieniać pozycję, żeby nie zrobił się zakrzep\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się ciotka w końcu zorientowała, powiedziała: — Emilku, przyjdźcie do mnie z mamusią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmianę ekspozycji mamy w czerwcu, więc na pół roku można obejrzeć dwie wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położył się na brzegu lejka i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie obliczyłem się z siłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Emil znikł za rogiem, zaczął biec i biegł tak aż do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma żal do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z najgłębszą wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek nawet się wyspać nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wielkim przeciwnikiem rozwydrzenia sportowego, które się w ostatnich latach rozwinęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los padł na Michała, prostodusznego i kochającego młodzież entuzjastę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zaczęła powstawać przepaść między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądał, żebym tym razem przyszła na całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy grasz? — Trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie słyszał pan dotychczas o nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle z jego włosów zaczęły się sypać iskry aż na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko nie bujasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dlatego spóźniłeś się wtedy? Janek patrzył niebieskimi, niewinnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągał ramiona, mruczał, prychał, wyginał kręgosłup jak łuk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój ojciec oszczędził to na czas, gdy się obudziliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym się różni genialność życia od genial- ności twórczości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym dożyć spokojnej emerytury i móc na niej jeszcze dużo rzeczy zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu powiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierzaj mi, że ci zabalsamowani ludzie są mało podobni do żywych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc aż cały miesiąc leżałem w malignie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mary słuchała jak zahipnotyzowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawym tylko, co wiadomo — spytał kulawiec i splunął w stronę jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój, bo strzelę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem wegetarianinem, ale nie jem mięsa codziennie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale która rzecz istniejąca nie jest sprzeczna sama w sobie? — Może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to ciężka puszka z lanego żelaza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś stał przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to jest ze zdaniami, powstałymi na podstawie indukcji, pytasz? To nie ma znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A młynarz stoi obok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężona ręka lewa wskazywała coś uparcie w dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest możliwe, żeby po dwudziestu rzutach monetą za każdym razem wyszedł orzeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest dziewka, którą miałem przed chwilą tu, na kolanach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Emil nigdy nie wybierał Zosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No… no jednego ogrodu, który twoja matka lubiła — jąkała Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt ciężko względem niej zawiniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci są lekkomyślne i niedoświadczone…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Hoooo. Jak gwiazdy - uśmiechnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko oddech jej stał się szybszym i piersi zaczęły silnie falować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony przychodzi refleksja, żeśmy się jednak trochę zagalopowali!!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydencja hiszpańska nie osiągnęła porozumienia ani możliwości rozmów trójstronnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawianie tych aspektów jest przynajmniej tak samo ważne jak omawianie kosztów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za pani sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zwrócić uwagę na zagadnienie zmodyfikowanej genetycznie żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem jest to bardzo ważna sprawa, którą powinniśmy się zająć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skupia się ono na odpowiedzialności, a nie tylko na prawach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym punktem porządku dziennego są ustne wyjaśnienia dotyczące sposobu głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć zharmonizowania europejskiego sektora bankowego jest w Parlamencie z pewnością widoczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwarty handel musi być sprawiedliwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasne jest, że jeśli rynek wymaga większej produkcji, potrzebne są inwestycje w rolnictwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"poprzez szybką pomoc finansową, zniesienie wiz oraz zawarcie układu o stowarzyszeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety węgierska konstytucja nie spełnia tych kryteriów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to wyjaśnić, inaczej przerodzi się to w harmider wokół traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze, że ja również mogę przedstawić moje wstępne przemyślenia w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co najistotniejsze, jej celem będzie przyniesienie korzyści tym, którzy faktycznie tego potrzebują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaniem Europejskiej Agencji Bezpieczeństwa Transportu Lotniczego jest oczywiście zapewnienie najwyższego z możliwych poziomu bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawiałem to pytanie wielokrotnie i uzyskałem jedynie wymijające odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat jeśli chodzi o politykę sąsiedztwa, ta wspólna polityka jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy te dane są prawidłowe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chcemy zapobiegać katastrofom, w przemyśle wydobywczym nie powinno być miejsca dla substancji niebezpiecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie ważne, abyśmy wykorzystali tę okazję, aby zyskać pełniejszy ogląd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę państwu powiedzieć, że jestem gotów czynić wysiłki w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogrom ich przewyższał wszystko, co w życiu widzieli polscy rycerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej debacie chcę zwrócić uwagę na trzy kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35130852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lwia część tego pakietu przeznaczona jest właśnie na te bardzo potrzebne połączenia międzysieciowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie promieniał tak niepospolitą urodą, ani kostiumem ani dowcipem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłącz światło w dużym pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apetyt rośnie w miarę jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mych oczach, oczach małego barbarzyńcy, piękność niewiele znaczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy ulewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwnie ruch się wzmaga na namacalnie ciemnym podwórzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyły nań wary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten głos nie był im obcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to nowe fale ciemności opadały na nich, jak czarny śnieg; wolno prószyła ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w dziedzinie matematyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok urodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utopił spojrzenie szalone od gniewu i męki w twarzy rywala…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dziewczęta go znają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu się działo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko drgało w tym szczególnym rytmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20665895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20749427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20749428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20749429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20749430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temu człowiekowi została tylko Biblia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20749431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do każdej herbaty dodaję kilka kropel cytryny i miód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrażała się dziesięć razy na dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zaczęła się śmiać, niehisterycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Począł zapadać wczesny, zimowy wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sprawdza! — zaprzeczył odważnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy przecież w ogólnikach: teoretyzujemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może z uduszenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy istnieje świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, jakie spotkania miałam na dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie koniec na tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gigabajt pamięci to sporo na same zdjęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No racja, komu by się chciało nagrywać tyle zdań?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam pozostałem na ziemi, niepokojony nadzieją i oczekiwaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie zadawał sobie takich pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię rozwodzić się nad moją przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw była to tylko iskierka migocąca na kamiennej posadzce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech jeszcze raz tego nie usłyszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tak też jest we Wrocławiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Docelowo tramwaje będą zawracać za tym skrzyżowaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dochodzą do mnie powiadomienia z komunikatora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczę się animować w starym stylu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trefle były atutem, rozumiecie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A weź się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz wiedziałem, czem mu dojadę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wygląda profesjonalnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było teraz widzieć, jak skoczył z krzesła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to przecież podczas zabójczej pogody, gdy musieliśmy uciekać przed Nelsonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym tak zrudział, to byłby ładny kąsek dla mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jego oddech i ten mi zdradził, gdzie się znajdowała moja zwierzyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy w każdym języku z czasem zmieniają znaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, nie opuściłbym sprawy pana za nic w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielnemu człowiekowi udaje się wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22928150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszło do wycieku na platformie wiertniczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz ustąpił mu z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech no pani pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto wronie gniazdo na głowie dziewczynki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że słyszy szmer w okolicy pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Twoja dawna szkoła została zlikwidowana, możesz uzyskać zaświadczenie o przebiegu nauczania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To on! — zaświtała myśl pewna jak oczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę nosić okulary które mają aż dziesięć dioptrii dla prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Idź, przyprowadź mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi sprawia przykrość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ani to, ani tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ściętych białkach zagrało poranne słońce okrutnym uśmiechem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę nawet dużo pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wtedy pociąg, zwolniwszy biegu, wjechał w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd jeszcze, po rocznej przerwie, było w tym śmiechu coś poobiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To francuska kapela — oznajmił trochę drwiąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocucił nas dopiero jęk cichy, przeciągły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co?! — zawołał pan Ryszard otwierając oczy szeroko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na nim skupiłaś swą uwagę, gdy wchodziłem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A u żadnej z lalek nie spotkałam takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrzucała ruchami nonszalanckimi: królewna rzuca perły w morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczy chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jednej chwili zamilkł tłum cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego, co przyszedł z portu Churchill i którego wilki zagryzły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niebo nie może się kiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadamy z nią na osobności — rzekł kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrzy są moi gospodarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puk, puk! — pukało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani z tej, ani z żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gniewa się pan? — uśmiechnął się kapitan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś stał przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królowie mieszkają w hotelu, ja wynająłem mały pokoik w rybackiej chacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co cię nie zabije, to cię wzmocni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydencja wraz z Komisją wielokrotnie wzywała obie strony do zawarcia takiego kontraktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę skierować swoje wystąpienie do tych, którzy być może zadają sobie pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On tego nie dostrzegł niewdzięcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie ryzyko ponosimy, i ono jest dobrze określone w tym projekcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Państwo wiecie, musimy odbudować finanse publiczne w oparciu o trwałe fundamenty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele podróży samochodowych podejmowanych w europejskich miasteczkach i miastach nie przekracza pięciu kilometrów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz w złość wpadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym dodać kilka elementów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kroki te zapewnią przyzwoity zakres środków na finansowanie działań społeczeństwa obywatelskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż jednak było robić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obliczu problemów finansowych stanowi ono nowe ramy dla dyskusji o gospodarce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywołała dzieci i poszła za tą dorożką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem na gałęzi dębu usłyszał głos kruka, wzywający go po imieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podnoszenie standardu życia osób żyjących poniżej progu ubóstwa ma znaczenie priorytetowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Produktywność zależy głównie od czynników takich jak łączny kapitał podstawowy, który bardzo się różni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób można udowodnić, że nic mu się nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę mam na myśli wpływy polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze strony Stanów Zjednoczonych uzyskano zobowiązanie w zakresie negocjacji na drugim etapie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to godne ubolewania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mahmud Ahmadineżad jest zagrożeniem dla społeczeństwa globalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On, on, niezawodnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów ma to wiele wspólnego z przejrzystością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było stóp, które można byłoby podnieść\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwiedził Wokulskiego i gwałtem zachęcał go do przyjęcia udziału w dostawach dla wojska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie mówię, że jest nieskazitelny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38565537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Transportu i Turystyki, panu przewodniczącemu Coście, panu komisarzowi Tajaniemu i wszystkim członkom tej Izby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj zaś znalazłem obfite pole do rozmaitych, ciekawych dociekań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Medyk uczuł wyrzut sumienia, że tych książek dotychczas nie oddał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnijmy sobie wszystko od początku; wsiedliśmy do przedziału pierwszej klasy dla palących, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym mógł go zapomnieć choć na jedną chwilę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, że mu tak lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, Łucjo, powiedz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam jej szczupłą, wysoką sylwetkę, duże, czarne oczy, śmiałe ułożenie i dziwne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozkazano nam zebrać rzeczy, zjeść śniadanie i stawać w szeregach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiedział ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem słuchać ich nawet od najdawniejszego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem macać ostrożnie i namacałem wreszcie brzeg stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staram się jakoś spędzić te męczące chwile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22072889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory, ranny, czy nie żyje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękki! — zawołała, omal nie płacząc ze szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przypomniał sobie i zapragnął mieć blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jeźdźców rozproszyła się w różne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominującą religią w Polsce jest katolicyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zaprzeczam ich istnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo muszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sobie wyobrazić, że jest chory, który umrze, jeśli się czegoś nie postanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil musiał głęboko oddychać co parę mi nut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wszelka „twórczość” nie pochodzi z tych źródeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale się wstydzę przeprosić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaletą bycia twoim sąsiadem jest to, że mam do dyspozycji dwie kuchnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed snem zaglądał pod łóżko, czy tam ktoś nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz szedłem powoli, umyślnie zwolniwszy kroku, by się wewnętrznie opanować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na twarzy jej zjawił się wyraz przestrachu i rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tak lubię, gdy tobie zaczynają drżeć usta przed płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogrodnik oblewa je płynem dezynfekcyjnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce ich podnosiły się i spadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszałem jęk, ale żadnej odpowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radzę wam, abyście poszli za moim przykładem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22473975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się gorączkowo i wybiegłem na spotkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilę potem rozległ się straszliwy huk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo protestuję przeciwko takiemu nachodzeniu mojego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszeliśmy szelest sukni kobiecej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawały mi jeszcze dwie godziny czasu do działania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Medyk uczuł wyrzut sumienia, że tych książek dotychczas nie oddał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dziwacznymi nazwy. Sędzia nieraz zrzędzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Data jest w tym wypadku najważniejszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22474100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bij go dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec torbę swoją poklepał pieszczotliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił iść do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zło, zdaniem twoim, jest równie wiecznym jak dobro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie unoś się — przemówił miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! — zawołał w stronę obydwu towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego muszę rozumieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ta mnie drapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zwyczajny żart i tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak ludzie żyją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyj to nos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil uczył ją grać na fortepianie, bo była muzykalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadanie się miękkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było mnie cały dzień w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano byle jaką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak niespodzianie, tak znienacka, jak bywa nieraz ze szczęściem lub śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rozumiem i wynoszę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca i mówi: — To był telefon z kliniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bójcie się śmierci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz jest spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby kózka nie skakała, to by nóżki nie złamał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zamiast tych głupich żartów, przyślijcie mi ją tutaj na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość ze zbliżających się świąt wynagradza wszelkie straty w gotówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę nie przeszkadzać! — upomniał go któryś z gości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziła się jeszcze, gdy spała, to znaczy, nie chciała być widziana śpiącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wychodzi na złe albo na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbym prosić szanownego pana o ogień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma to okresowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam przy sobie gotówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny dziewczak! — rzekł, pocmokując ze znawstwem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byl zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pensjonatu, który nazywał się „Złocień”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem wegetarianinem, ale nie jem mięsa codziennie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil podszedł do Adama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróć się zaraz, to sama sprawdzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie doszedł mnie złowrogi trzask przepalonych belek pułapu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi oto w oknie wagonu, uśmiechnięta, szczęśliwa, młoda mężatka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kruk, przelatujący nad lasem, zakrakał nagle na śmierć temu właśnie dębowi, pod którym siedzieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zające gonimy i szukamy lalek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, muszę opisać, co działo się wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie je składam w ofierze, o piękny, połyskujący płomieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście istnieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieka przed tym duszącym dymem, wciąż kichając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaska pańska na pstrym koniu jeździ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzeniem moim byłoby to samo, nad czym pracowali alchemicy: — eliksir młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położył się na brzegu lejka i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czterech fortepianach, w czterech krańcach pensjona tu, ćwiczyli uczniowie Finsena.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byle tylko jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z dumą pokazał Pukowi ukończony rysunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne mi się wydało, że mam z chłopakami się gonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„My nimi jesteśmy” — brzmiała nasza odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem te dwa przełączniki i aktywowałem je wszystkie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26954331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postulat Parlamentu Europejskiego w sprawie kapitału wysokiego ryzyka musi jednak zasadniczo zostać odrzucony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś Rada przyznała, że rezultaty negocjacji mogłyby być lepsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że warto to podkreślić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były co najmniej dwa powody takiej decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uporządkujmy kilka faktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To od Irlandii zależy, czy będzie wprowadzać te działania, czy nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzi ludzie a rynek pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże pod tym względem jesteśmy krytyczni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszystko to mieści się w zakresie tego rozporządzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26961472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni popieram te działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny tego nie powiedział, ale ja to powiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z propozycją, ażeby umowa wspólnotowa zastąpiła niektóre postanowienia obecnie obowiązujących umów dwustronnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście popieramy ochronę praw człowieka, łącząc przy tym ten wymóg z rygorystyczną weryfikacją wymogów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdą jest, że nie możemy pozwolić na łamanie powszechnych reguł dotyczących handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zakończono wyjaśnienia dotyczące sposobu głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie komisarzu, mówił pan tu w Parlamencie Europejskim o działaniach lobbingowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno oszacować straty podatkowe wynikające z oszustw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako grupa socjaldemokratów mówimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księga miała na celu utorowanie drogi dla planu działania na rzecz mobilności w mieście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowanie tego rynku, powiem dalej, nie jest jeszcze zakończone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu znalazła pomoc w Niemczech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ocena daje mieszany obraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie tworzymy Unii dla państw i rządów, tworzymy ją dla obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o nas, to niezależny system sądownictwa stanowi kluczowy element każdego porządku demokratycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaostrzy to jedynie kryzys zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmowa przystąpienia do dialogu może tylko ograniczyć wymianę wiedzy na wzajemnie interesujące tematy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26962976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie, przyjęliśmy w tej sprawie rezolucję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może czyjeś inicjały?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc to była ta miłość!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w domu i nie wyjeżdżał wczoraj do żadnego chorego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za to przywrócił ją setkom tysięcy, a może i milionom ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy występy Czerwonej Maski”\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koledzy nie sypiali także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy lot z Warszawy do Londynu jest o godzinie dwunastej piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby pochodził z okolic Albert-Nianza byłby niewątpliwie słyszał coś o Eminie paszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaskółki, latające szerokimi łukami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuje, że się założył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się zdaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Programy o otwartych źródłach z reguły są darmowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dołu dochodził szum wody, jakby cała dżungla zmieniła się w jedno jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21085995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunkowo najmniej zapału okazywała do zamierzonej podróży pani Olivier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest tancerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyście wiedzieli! — powtarzała sobie w duchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie rozmowa urwała się, albowiem uwagę Stasia zwróciły ptaki lecące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to prawdziwa pustelnia! — odezwała się do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze zmieniło się w jedną wielką świetlistą topiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początkowy entuzjazm neofity wyczerpał się z biegiem czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem odeszła, by naprawić twą bieliznę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dać mu płaszcz, bo się zaziębi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leciał one dość nisko i w przezroczym powietrzu widać było wyraźnie kilka pelikanów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ jest siódmego stycznia, używamy już nowego almanachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mówisz serio?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ani trochę nie myślałabym umierać, ani tyle!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nawet nie próbowała jej uciszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jem przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchała z ociąganiem się i ostrożnie wyjrzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No niechby sobie, ale lubi wyśmiewać — i buntuje na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten sok mógłby zaszkodzić pannie Karolinie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz kazał mi zmieniać pozycję, żeby nie zrobił się zakrzep\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stało się chyba nic złego? — szepnęła Hanna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nietrudno domyślić się: jeden z nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie pięknie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście była zajęta wyłącznie sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jakim sposobem możesz każdego z nich rozpoznać i nazwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni usiłowali prowadzić z nią rozmowy i udawało im się czasem objąć ją wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał jeszcze za sobą zawstydzony głos Filipa: — Przepraszam kolegę na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20791669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tatko miał tam warsztat w narożnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadarła ogonek i poleciała na płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że rzeczywistości nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął wydobywać pomału historię swoich wakacji, ale zauważył, że Janek jest zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się jakby dopiero teraz dopatrzyli się że była piękną, roztropną i miłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż więc mi pozostawało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinąłem głową twierdząco i stanąłem przy drzwiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu omówił sprawę z swoim współlokatorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mając siły odpowiedzieć mu, przerażona Maryś z krzykiem się do niego rzuciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz oni siedzieli nieruchomo, tak, że ogień dotykał ich odzieży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka, chorowita, była przy matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnął ją niepokój wielki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21511201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie silcie się na schwytanie tajemniczego pana na rowerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się spełniło, wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na autostradzie utworzył się długi korek, przez co wiele osób spóźniło się do pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, przypomniałem sobie to — bąknął Jakub.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla kogo dobry, dla tego dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co innego jest fikcja w powieści, a co innego rzeczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę dnia, złego snu, gdy zanurzam się w noc, jak w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała czuć dotyk rączki wiolonczeli na policzku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój kochanku, mój mężu najdroższy! — usłyszałem przerywany szlochaniem jej szept.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i śpiew nieustanny, uczty i igrzyska zapełniały jego życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz mieszkam w nim ja i to niech ci wystarczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyło się na gadach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się i ujrzałem Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, ale to nikt, nie może sobie zdać sprawy z czyjejś śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rzecz się ma z alkoholem w małych dawkach i nikotyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest kurze jajko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawezwany lekarz oświadczył się za natychmiastową operacją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściliśmy nasz cienisty przytułek i niebawem znaleźliśmy się na łuku mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wszelki wypadek wziąłem z sobą broń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten starzec jeszcze śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten mały nowy więzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już zupełnie ciemno, gdy zbliżaliśmy się do budynków stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś kiedyś tego człowieka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc on się koło mnie położył i leżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tak ino z wielkiej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z ubraniami na wyrost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani dietetyk kazała mi ograniczać spożywanie alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39747802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak musimy zwrócić uwagę, w jaki sposób wodór będzie pozyskiwany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39747805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kochankiem... no, to byłoby poprostu śmieszne!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39747810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jest to także sposobność, aby obmyślić nowe rozwiązania na nowe problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39747812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za wyjaśnienie tych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym pogratulować sprawozdawcom ich niezwykle wnikliwej analizy tematu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego należy się zastanowić, jak poprawić wyniki działalności Funduszu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Razem poczyniliśmy postępy w demokracji parlamentarnej w Unii Europejskiej i poza nią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak państwo wiedzą, są takie miejsca pracy, których nikt nie chce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego należy jak najszybciej stworzyć europejski plan sponsorowania sztuki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Informacje muszą zostać zatwierdzone przed opublikowaniem i podlegają ścisłej kontroli jakości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faktem jest, że Unia Europejska jest importerem netto surowców i tak pozostanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bodaj się tacy ludzie na kamieniu rodzili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, wolałbym żebyś mnie przedstawiła jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do przemysłu włókienniczego - jestem pewna, że nie ma się czym przejmować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno mi zrozumieć, dlaczego nie możemy przyjąć tego rozwiązania na całym świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zechciałaby się pani wypowiedzieć na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Priorytet musi tu stanowić infrastruktura\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często musimy stawiać czoła trudnym zadaniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz miał ogromną, o rysach, z których biła pycha, powaga i potęga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"reformę zarówno jej procedur, jak i polityk, ponieważ sama reforma procesu to za mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrafiliśmy jednak uporać się z tym problemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzajemne stosunki charakteryzowała nieufność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy obszar to zdrowie publiczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadnych uczuć, żadnych nawet poruszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego Unia Europejska zajęła pozycję światowego lidera w ograniczeniu emisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy w dalszym ciągu udzielać jej wsparcia - takie jest stanowisko mojej grupy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale według niezależnych obserwatorów nie ma dowodów, że tak się dzieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39748196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzę teraz do drugiego komunikatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś z uczucia żegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto by je próbował ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie wicher — przykrość, dla niego — uciecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dała mi koc, powiedziała, że się wszystkim zajmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziliśmy od drzwi do drzwi z pustymi żołądkami i zbieraliśmy podpisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnął ognisko, aż skry posypały się wokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy rozpoczyna się życie z kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiła, że się od niego nie odczepi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba poszli grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tego nie wyrzucę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie do zniesienia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pilnik!“ usłyszałem szept w swej głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz gdzież ją znaleźć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno z dużych szerokich okien wychodziło na balkon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubi Maciuś wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dachem tego pokoju był sam taras.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedziałem im swoją wędrówkę wśród mgły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Winą to jest mego brata Cesarza, który mi ani chwili odpoczynku nie daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potykałem się w winnicy, przede mną coś ukazało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale z ciebie dzidzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nich palą się czerwone latarnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż on rozumiał pod tą „lalką woskową“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet pragnienie dalszych poszukiwań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skrzydła uderzyły dwa inne, bratnie pułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie szło mi jakoś, rzuciłem więc karty pod stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Normalnie reklama po reklamie na tym kanale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co to za człowiek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na własną odpowiedzialność odczytuje się symbol.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchaj, chrześcijanin a katolik to wcale nie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o tem nie wspomniała hrabina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczyłem czerwony, jak burak, ze wstydu i gniewu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem dziś w lesie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i oto leżałeś pan jak długi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alfabet składa się z liter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Ignacy otworzył i czytał: „Człowieku głupi, czy nikczemny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brek odjechał, Wokulski wstąpił na plebanią i w ciągu kwadransa skończył interes.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25157596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednemu z nich zwisał u pasa klucz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczył na jednym korzeniu, na drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz poślij no kogo, by mi kupił materiału na turban.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wolę pójść na nogach niż autobusem pojechać, żeby się z ludźmi nie spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz pospieszył do sieni i niecierpliwie otwarł drzwi wiodące na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drażniące, zbyt mocne było jego spoglądanie prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne stworzenie nie umie stawać dęba i wykonywać skoków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i dzwonek, i tak się skończyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hm… szczególne, szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem wysiadała już z pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy opuszczałem restaurację, była godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego spotkania można było coś niecoś skorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia stała przy mamie, a mama ją czesała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łudź się, nie wezmą cię z sobą — rzekł Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, co to nie chodzą po ulicy, co siedzą w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On powiada, że cię sprzątnie ze świata nożem lub trucizną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz, raku zatracony, baw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tańczyli, wprawdzie na palcach, po cichutku, lecz do upadłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niemym zachwycie pochylili głowy, by się przyjrzeć cudnemu kwieciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można tu wyczuć pewne jakby stopniowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te trzy książki czytał na zmianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytaj moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili do pokoju weszła jakaś Chinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Teresa — ta prawdziwa — jest w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg począł raptownie zwalniać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno skończyć, gdy się zaczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie — upierała się — to on, na pewno on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłużej tu dzisiaj pozostać nie możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28948030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze mówiąc, uważam, że musimy uczynić więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28948032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości dotyczy systemów gwarancji depozytów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28948034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie rozzłościło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28948035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wspomniałam przed chwilą, właśnie w tym zakresie prawodawstwo zostało znacznie usprawnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28948036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to winno być źródłem satysfakcji zarówno dla Europejczyków, jak i instytucji europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dobra robota\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, żeby było tak, że sprawy te są po prostu omawiane jedna po drugiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawne jest to, że zawsze twierdzimy, że mamy najlepszą ochronę konsumenta na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złożone mieszanki stanowią tajemnicę handlową będącą efektem prowadzenia wieloletnich badań i prób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, kiedy podjął działanie wojskowe w odpowiedzi na prowokację Hamasu, czuje ciężar międzynarodowej dezaprobaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie kampanie powinniśmy rozpoczynać od szkół\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popełniliśmy spektakularny błąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to jest tak ważne, że lekceważy się regulamin w taki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo z pewnością nie może być tym, co się określa mianem \\\"otwartej metody koordynacji\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej mądre korzystanie z energii doprowadziłoby do zmniejszenia zanieczyszczenia środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego procedura ta powinna być w przyszłości absolutnym wyjątkiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pilnie potrzebny jest nam europejski mechanizm stabilności finansowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powrót do demokracji jest równie trudny jak kiedyś\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby znaleźć wyjście z tej sytuacji, musi jednak nastąpić pewnego rodzaju porozumienie, pewien kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiąże ono ocenę naszych polityk z rzeczywistymi celami strategicznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym też podkreślić znaczenie zawartych w tej strategii konkretnych idei, takich jak agenda cyfrowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy odpowiedzieć sobie na pytanie, jaki jest nasz cel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje pytanie składa się z dwóch części\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29112848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może się mylę, lecz takie podejrzenie jest mimo wszystko uzasadnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29211500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niektórych aspektach mamy jednak odmienne zdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29211502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W interesie Unii Europejskiej jest utrzymanie politycznej stabilności na Ukrainie i rozwijanie jej gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29211504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewien, że zgodzą się z tym koledzy posłowie Zieloni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29211505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta wiara jest podstawą przyszłości, bo budować można tylko na prawdzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie uczyniłem szalonego kroku, aby ci jej dowieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast tego otworzyli drzwi przyległej celi i wyciągnęli z niej kogoś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o zatrzymanie tlenu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naraz głos Adriatyku ustał i cichym szeptem zaszemrała fala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce też zaprowadziłem go do przeznaczonego mu pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy teraz... czy teraz nie prowadzisz także gry podwójnej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie zawarto i zamknięto bramę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł zaciekawił niezmiernie cały świat naukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat drogo opłacił tą naukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł dokładnie rozróżnić co to takiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokój ten był zupełnie taki sam, jakim go widział poprzednim razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panowie, mogę zająć się końmi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przypuszczałam, żeś jest taki śmiały...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22082667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokoleniu naszemu niezwykłe przeznaczenie musi przypaść w udziale, skoro jesteśmy świadkami takich wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie rozumiał, każdy czekał jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na żadne wołania, wrzaski nie zwracała uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę na mnie spojrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wepchnął mocniej i złamała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominasz mi lalkę, którą miałam, gdy byłam mała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil uczył ją grać na fortepianie, bo była muzykalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór milczał uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na ile uzasadnione są te obawy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To krok w kierunku zmniejszenia istniejących różnic w wynagrodzeniach między płciami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowianie, co przynosicie nowego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"do osiągnięcia celu potrzeba jeszcze dużo pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosło to pozytywne wyniki, zwłaszcza w postaci potwierdzającej rezolucji w sprawie kary śmierci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy zamierzają Państwo wprowadzić zmiany w składzie tych grup ekspertów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto też wspierać wysiłki na rzecz zwiększenia możliwości magazynowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na ile poważnie podchodzimy w Unii Europejskiej do ograniczenia emisji pochodzących z transportu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"aby osiągnąć pokój, należy odstąpić od absolutnej suwerenności państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego propozycja sprecyzowania obowiązków państw członkowskich w tym zakresie jest słuszna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka ostatnich godzin rozmawialiśmy na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam widziałem skutki bombardowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obronić się przed straszną koalicją wrogów — otóż pierwsza idea.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze nie skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem siadł nagi przy fortepianie i zaczął grać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego mamy zazdrościć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt ciężko względem niej zawiniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dżonki chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na miarę lat siedemdziesiątych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o głupstwach, ale on pomyślał, że będzie z nią bardzo trudna historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora jeszcze za wczesna na obiad, lecz stosowna na drugie śniadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał jej mruczenie bulgocące cicho w gardle, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam wywołałem swój los, utajoną swą myśl wypisałem bezwiednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komnata, do której wpadłem, była wspaniale oświetlona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Własność jej zatem musiała być oznaczona herbami królewskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę to zrobić i zrobię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesień już się kończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowozaciężni, mieszczanie, dzierżawcy wiejscy, może nawet nie umiejący obchodzić się z bronią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie są nasze obrazy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siepacze powrócili i sądziłem, że teraz kolej przyjdzie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno nawet było zupełnie uwierzyć, lecz major pośpieszył rozproszyć resztę wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrodzony instynkt odezwał się we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam u siebie całą butelkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22087903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już minuta minęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22088444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki prawdziwy, mały mężczyzna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22088445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo wszystko nie zamieniłabyś mnie na innego męża, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22088446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz prędko przysunął do mojej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to? — zawołał, wskazując na trawę o kilka kroków od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało rzec można, że w rewolucji francuskiej Pan się odrodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapach łajna jest zapachem życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i poczuł Maciuś pierwsze uderzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I myślały, że ich dary tak prędko dojechały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na przykład — Jędrek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę nie przeszkadzać! — upomniał go któryś z gości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy człowiek powinien korzystać ze wszystkich praw i swobód wymienionych w deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na cóż tyle zachodów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałam go, który, czy ten Emil? Nie odpowiedział i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś nie żałuje, że uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecinny jest człowiek dojrzały, dojrzałe jest dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokój! — wołał z uniesieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście w tejże chwili nadszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba dużo czytałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła ją łagodnie i znikła w głębi domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrał się i wybiegł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielką zaletą onego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip był dużym chłopcem, ale nieprzyjemnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chciał pozwolić mówić na siebie „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska jest w czołówce krajów europejskich pod kątem segregowania śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszliśmy do niego i dziewczęta zaczęły go całować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale która rzecz istniejąca nie jest sprzeczna sama w sobie? — Może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dlatego, że teraz już jesteś rybakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawdziwie, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ładnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uścisnąłem mocno dłoń podaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaśniało ono, jak scena, na której rozgrywa się dramat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już chyba jest więcej aniżeli zwykły śmiertelnik znieść może!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podwójny poranek wstawał dla mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie pozostaliście we Francji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaśmiała się, rada z dowcipu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jęczącego złodzieja umieszczono na zerwanej okiennicy i zabrano pod silną eskortą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem rękę wzdłuż ściany i pochwyciłem bosą nogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z panem, panie majorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to mi przypomina pewną umiejętność, pospolitą lecz zabawną, którą niegdyś posiadałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem macać ostrożnie i namacałem wreszcie brzeg stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowimy wtedy, jaką śmiercią ma umrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwieniła się trochę, jakby powiedziała więcej, niż pragnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21953143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas jednej z przerw takich rzuciłem przypadkowo okiem na zwierciadło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam tylko na rozkaz, bym mogła zabrać tacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanapa, jeśli nie skakać, przetrwa dziesiątki lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszli szybko na „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się poinformować, czy można ją jeszcze zapisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybyliśmy za wcześnie i musieliśmy czekać w kolejce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosła potem drugą i trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedziemy na toczącej się w przestrzeni kuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie nam dobrze z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miód jest słodki i zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez kartki meldunkowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drażniące, zbyt mocne było jego spoglądanie prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec wręczył mu dziwożonę, a sam skocznie pomknął do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnęła, aby jak najprędzej ją zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwagi te mogą się wydać niektórym nie na czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do drugiej nad ranem posłyszałem nagle szum wody, nadchodziła fala powodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofujące się niemieckie oddziały prawdopodobnie planowały podpalenie budynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wchodzi się dwa razy do tej samej rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzyliśmy też tymczasem swoje, na szczęście lekkie rany i trochę wypoczęliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była moja ulubiona postać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nie znosiła dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że to zależy od kategorii, ale powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie badawczo i odpowiedział: „Teraz to już jest niepotrzebne”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymorski obszar Tamizy rozciągał się przed nami jak początek nieskończonego wodnego szlaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schizofreniczne rozszczepienie graniczące chwilami z lekkim bzikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeptać będę! — uprzedziła go z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni nie przestają mówić o tym, ile kosztuje marmolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Publicznie spotykamy się ponownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale która rzecz istniejąca nie jest sprzeczna sama w sobie? — Może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała nas zaduma i byliśmy zdolni tylko do spokojnego patrzenia przed siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner przyniósł lody i trzy grube, okrągłe wafle, we tknięte w usta lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy jednak zapewnić, by wprowadzić je w jednakowej mierze we wszystkich państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ważne jest, byśmy wysłali odpowiedni sygnał w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"oszczędności, które w przyszłości staną się kosztami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie działania będą przyczyniać się do powstawania miejsc pracy i pobudzać konsumpcję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim własnym kraju zakazano reklamy religijnej zawierającej cytat z Pisma Świętego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska wywiązała się ze swojego obowiązku i nadal to robi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwołał się do najbardziej haniebnych cech swojej dyktatury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To również pora, by położyć kres utrzymującej się nierówności płacowej pomiędzy mężczyznami a kobietami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ma tam miejsce przemoc, są trudności, ale sytuacja jest inna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowenia i Włochy wyraziły wobec tego swój sprzeciw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na finansowanie zasługiwałyby w szczególności różne projekty w dziedzinie energii słonecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zakończono pytania z sali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie wydarzenia jak te zawsze prowadziły do usprawnień technologicznych i środków bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inwestowanie w nie podnosi wydajność i obniża koszty zabezpieczenia społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie przejdziemy do porządku obrad na czwartek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj po raz kolejny debatujemy na temat łamania podstawowych praw człowieka na Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"edukacja,\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tutaj oczywiście do czynienia z przepisami, które zostały ustanowione w innej Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łączenie się spółek akcyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu niezaprzeczalny potencjał w zakresie finansowania i rozwoju naszych terytoriów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy im udzielić odpowiedzi już teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę powiedzieć, że zrzeka się pan immunitetu, a następnie znieważa posłów tego Parlamentu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu z zadowoleniem można by przyjąć prawodawstwo horyzontalne w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej głosowałem przeciwko sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy czas!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystąpimy teraz do wyboru Przewodniczącego Komisji zgodnie z postanowieniami Regulaminu Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy udowodnić, że Europa potrafi znaleźć konkretne odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego wynika też moje trzecie pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30529060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym odnieść się do dwóch punktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś do szkoły nie poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko krowy rodzą cielęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że gdy ją straci, umrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewać się nie wstydzi, i pierwsza powiedziała, że będzie tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, jak w ogóle przy każdym choćby tylko częściowym rozszczepieniu jaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość dużo czytałem w tej materii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukali innej planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak usunął jego dłoń natrętną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz — ty sam zginiesz, a ja razem z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem poczuł, że coś się niedostrzegalnie zmieniło w nim albo poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na tym nie koniec; posłuchaj rzeczy prawdziwej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko możliwym jest, by letarg trwał tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym dożyć spokojnej emerytury i móc na niej jeszcze dużo rzeczy zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Kuba Bogu, tak Bóg Kubie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ścisłym znaczeniu może być prawdziwe tylko zdanie, i to w sensie logistyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła z plaży w dziewczynkowatej sukni, którą nosiła, gdy miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sklepach z ubraniami bywam rzadko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy w domu chleb?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto mój, przyszłam do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona biła go za to bardzo, ale to nie pomagało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się tłumaczył, pani i tak nie uwierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tego chyba nie myślisz na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj odprawę i zbądź kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj czytała po raz pierwszy Rimbauda „Statek pijany” i Verlai- ne’a „Pieśń jesienną”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam zegarek, wąsy, biurko z szufladami, wszystko mam jak dorośli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nie kocham go, lecz nie chcę z nim zrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dokładnie opisywałeś, jak lubisz kiszkę kaszaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziny naszej siostry świętowaliśmy całą rodziną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień przewalały się chmury, jakby gotując się do walnej rozprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, czy nagle nie runie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w obecnej chwili był w stanie jakby zbliżonym do transu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby odpowiedzialne za wychowanie dziecka i kierowanie nim powinny mieć na względzie jego dobro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to ciężka puszka z lanego żelaza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zrobiło na mnie wielkie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem jej zaraz o tobie, ale wybuchnęła tylko śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to trudne do przetworzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokoło chodzą uważnie strażniczki cienia — prostytutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie był dobry znak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej po południu zapaliłem bez wielkiej przyjemności pierwszego papierosa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — przyznał towarzysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie wygląda na paradoks?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś szarpnął mnie silnie za rękaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wcisnąwszy mi w rękę bilet wizytowy, przepadła w półmroku zarania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąż istotnie ani się nie ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd się pan teraz wybiera? — zagadnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem tę piosenkę i mogę ją odtwarzać gdzie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po upływie trzech godzin cegła zaczęła się poddawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery promile i jeszcze po wódę sięgasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęście chciało, że tejże nocy zwaliła się do mieszkania rewizja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idę do Biedronki, chcesz bagietkę czy coś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewam się, żeś zrobił to, com ci mówił, Jonesie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, o gustach się nie dyskutuje, ale sukienka w kwiatki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego rozkazałem ci, abyś nie brał ze sobą pistoletów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak przepiękna melodia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi szkoda chłopaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczeli wszyscy ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jedziesz może kapkę za szybko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chodź, odprowadź mnie do zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość tego życia na koszt ludu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czasem stał się impertynencki, drwiący, uszczypliwy, kłótliwy i napastliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam jeszcze drona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było dokładnie obmyślone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To musiała być jego głowa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się zsikasz ze strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie, tego ryzykować nie można!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo widzisz, to się bez spacji wpisuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjął białą kartkę wielkości arkusza papieru listowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwienił się z gniewu, jak indyk i spojrzał na piłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z was są tacy nudni, aż spać mi się chce...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepsze to selfie, wszystko jest rozmyte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zachodzi, niezadługo będzie ósma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgrabniej on łazi po dziurach niż ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matko jedyna, co żeście porozrabiali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22770516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czego ty taka dumna, hm?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stanął nagle, tak, jak musi stawać serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przy lądowaniu samolotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam tylko na rozkaz, bym mogła zabrać tacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nasza wspólna, święta tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest by często nawadniać organizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe, że moja filozofia okaże się w pewnych punktach błędna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona spojrzała na niego ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak chcę i muszę, to nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechby choć zaczekali do jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wskazała mi miejsce w łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak wypuścił z ręki jej dłoń drobną i niemal dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyłapał go natychmiast i pacierz z radości odmówił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecie dziw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy tam z samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o głupstwach, ale on pomyślał, że będzie z nią bardzo trudna historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „wnętrzności” boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, jakie spotkania miałam na dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt by ode mnie nie przepisywał przykładów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tych bram, i domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20663028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikam wszelkich poprawek i przeróbek! — odpowiedział pośpiesznie i niespokojnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los padł na Michała, prostodusznego i kochającego młodzież entuzjastę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo źle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy mężczyzna zgubił się gdzieś w tłumie pasażerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądają jak dołki i rowki, powstałe od nakłucia szpilką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim będzie mój koniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to przy innej ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała zmysł orientacyjny i wyczucie miejsc nieznanych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak aleja śpiewnych drzew… śpiewnych drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z ubraniami na wyrost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozejrzałem się po blacie, który miał zastępować wigilijny stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas nam w drogę! — rzekł nagle kulawiec i zajął zwykłe po prawej stronie stanowisko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył mi przenikliwie w oczy i wyczytał resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cichutko podkradł się do dziewczynki i rzucił jej pierścionek na sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgoda! — zawołał z ponownym wybuchem radości Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej duże piersi podnosiły się i opadały, podnosiły się i opadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk tego imienia, szept tego imienia, jego zapach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę! — odparła z dąsem dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz chcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak to możliwe! — wyszeptał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowierzam cudzoziemcom, zarówno żywym jak i umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O co chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pogardzał tymi ludźmi, czasem nienawidził ich nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co mi to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropna nuda nic nie robić, tylko wciąż chodzić do budy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczu jej najbardziej mi właśnie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie promieniał tak niepospolitą urodą, ani kostiumem ani dowcipem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj! — krzyknął pierwszy kulawiec, niecierpliwie wychuchując z gęby zapach połkniętego tataraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno się ruszać! — mówił ktoś pochylony nade mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno wpadł do szuflady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop szanuje zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie postanowiłem mu rzecz całą zakomunikować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myć się nie chcieli, a w taką wielką wodę lecą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykała się na klucz w małym pokoju, który sobie wywalczyła po wielu awanturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz kazał mi zmieniać pozycję, żeby nie zrobił się zakrzep\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam czarną kawę o poranku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za ten tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia chrapie i dyszy przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nie znosiła dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawał się już nieraz chodzić tą drogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo nas niech diabli biorą, albo kapitalizm!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie oczekuje od ciebie milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schizofreniczne rozszczepienie graniczące chwilami z lekkim bzikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie tego cudu zaniedbało się obejrzeć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, już znamy, już wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie zawdzięczam wszystko, bo moja młodość, moje życie jest twoim dziełem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście im wiek późniejszy, tym bardziej charakter komórek jest inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jedno, co śpiewał poeta, było prawdą czystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisałem drugą książkę: Co lepsze: czy guziki blaszane, czy rogowe?.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrał się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym elementem kształtującym człowieka jest genetyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeśli mi wolno odgrzebać dawne wspomnienia, łączy nas niejaka znajomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta błyskawica w jednej chwili ukazała jej całą głębię jej upadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się często zdarza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Połączenie dokonane — rzekł opuszczając rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest możliwe, żeby po dwudziestu rzutach monetą za każdym razem wyszedł orzeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tego chyba nie myślisz na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O walce myśleć nawet nie było można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej, ruszaj się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i poczuł Maciuś pierwsze uderzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nas powiadomiono o wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale te nieszczęsne kopalnie wygnały nam z głowy inne sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwu ludzi znalazło się jeszcze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał zamknięte oczy, widziała długie, drgające rzęsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieubłagana wola kierowała mnie w stronę Parkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie przystąpiliśmy dotychczas do właściwej rzeczy, która mnie tu sprowadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spod odrzuconego w tył kaptura wychyliła się twarzyczka zaczerwieniona ze zmęczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak wyglądasz? — spytała dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toń wodna migotała spoza nich, jak spoza sztachet chwiejnych i nieustalonych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofając się, zostawiliśmy trzech zabitych przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej duże piersi podnosiły się i opadały, podnosiły się i opadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bramy ciężko okute.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum powstał z miejsc z okrzykiem: „Niech żyje król!”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział do mnie z zamkniętymi oczami «Przynieś swój pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z nikotyną, alkoholem i wszelkimi «białymi obłędami».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak to możliwe! — wyszeptał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20718650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Halszka wzbraniała się, prosząc o zwłokę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drobnostka, kochany panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kładziemy się… jest nas sto lub jeszcze więcej… i tworzymy czworobok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt by ode mnie nie przepisywał przykładów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musiał być chyba przyjemny, bo przed samym przebudzeniem uśmiechnęłaś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący jest umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta umiejętność nie jest jeszcze gotowa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zgodnym krokiem ruszyli w jednaką zawsze drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No — gospodarz, właściciel tej zagrody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tego nie wyrzucę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mu położono złoty zegarek, zobaczył orła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w stadium jednej ze swych słynnych „ucieczek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora jeszcze za wczesna na obiad, lecz stosowna na drugie śniadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę w sprawie urzędowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie ma różnych religii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego Komisja Spraw Konstytucyjnych zajęła się tym tematem, panie przewodniczący?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym sposobem jest tworzenie szans gospodarczych dla kobiet poprzez na przykład promocję przedsiębiorczości kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stany Zjednoczone Ameryki potrzebują silnych Stanów Zjednoczonych Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staram się w tej chwili wyjaśnić tę kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak, pamiętamy, co oznacza pozostawanie w \\\"poczekalni\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawców ataków w Hiszpanii także\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie - i nie mniej ważne - w czasach kryzysu musimy podtrzymać solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończyło się ono fiaskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie Europejska Agencja Obrony pracuje nad tym problemem, czyli nad długoterminowym rozwiązaniem kwestii helikopterów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kompromisowe porozumienie osiągnięte w sprawie wychwytywania i składowania dwutlenku węgla jest wysoce zadowalające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sytuacja na świecie wygląda trochę lepiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26950976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wyniku tego, zagrożenia dla zdrowia ludzi także mogą stać się liczniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc krótko, sprawa zmiany klimatu na konferencji na Bali to tylko fasada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osiągnęliśmy szeroki konsensus i sądzę, że zdołaliśmy sformułować zrównoważoną politykę dla dalekiej północy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski odrzucił ten wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwalają na identyfikację sprawcy bez względu na miejsce popełnienia przestępstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy nadzieję, że pan komisarz przedstawi kilka rozsądnych propozycji w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę przedstawić trzy uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu jednak powinniśmy znaleźć kompromis dla tych opinii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może mogłaby Pani skrócić swoje uwagi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzajemna pomoc przy odzyskiwaniu wierzytelności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego tylko od nas zależy, czy wypracujemy odpowiednią przewagę konkurencyjną nad resztą świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ubiegłym tygodniu poznaliśmy szczegóły dotyczące ważnego planu naprawy gospodarczej przedstawionego przez Komisję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgodnie z tekstem pojazdy ciężarowe ponoszą koszty zanieczyszczania powietrza i hałasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada zobowiązuje się to uczynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pani całkowitą rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26951321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W prawach reprodukcyjnych nie chodzi zatem o reprodukcję, chodzi o to, by ograniczyć reprodukcję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegał po ogródku wesoło podskakując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolelibyśmy obserwować, jak podejmuje się bardziej zdecydowane kroki w kierunku przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawa na komputerze nie zrównoważy godziny spędzonej z dziadkiem w garażu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiem najpierw na ostatnie pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dla partnerstwa, nie dla postaw paternalistycznych i neokolonializmu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wniosek niedorzeczny i całkowicie zbędny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz potrzebujemy zatwierdzenia przedmiotowego wniosku przez prawodawcę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to bardzo dobre przemówienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodam jeszcze inne argumenty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leży to w zakresie odpowiedzialności Komitetu Ochrony Socjalnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To konsekwentna odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoiwami tego związku są tutaj zarówno społeczeństwo obywatelskie, jak i debata na szczeblu parlamentarnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności widać to na przykładzie wypowiedzi członków tej Izby na temat osób homoseksualnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o łaskę dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka jest państwa opinia, jeśli chodzi o objęcie prezydencji przez \\\"Gazpromian\\\"?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby tylko ludzkość mogła dostrzec bezcelowość takich wojen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utrzymanie wzrostu jest ważniejsze od utrzymania wysokiego kursu waluty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontroli Chorób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"albo interweniujemy natychmiast albo to my będziemy odpowiedzialni za brak wystarczających działań!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka procedura bardziej przypomina legislację awaryjną niż prawodawstwo, którego chcemy dla postępowej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakich rdzennych ludów to dotyczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski powinien być miejscem rozwijania, dyskutowania i wymiany najlepszych praktyk pomiędzy państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym z nich jest kredyt na mobilność studentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinny one ponieść ogromne koszty tworzone obecnie przez nielegalną imigrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięć krajów nawet nie zadało sobie trudu, by złożyć sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były ofiary śmiertelne i wielomilionowe straty materialne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Rosji daleko jest do demokracji i daleko do tego, by być wiarygodnym partnerem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek dotyczący dyrektywy łączy cztery istniejące dyrektywy wspólnotowe w jeden instrument prawny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38383853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszary te są szczególnie podatne na konsekwencje zmian klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże „grupa pięciu” przycichła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wyrzuty sumienia, a taka tylko natrętna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył mi przenikliwie w oczy i wyczytał resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprzedziłem go, by rozświetlać drogę latarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko jedno — machnął obojętnie ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli to był sen, można było jej wybaczyć te kuchenne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To też nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy Emil zrobił nieokreśloną minę i rozbeczał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto skierował okręt ku niegościnnym wybrzeżom Alaski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na salę operacyjną bez słowa, jakby jeszcze spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu i na dziedziniec osady zaczęły zalatywać kule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy nie będziemy przyjaciółmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem pewny, że kłamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiła, że się od niego nie odczepi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien był się cieszyć, jak gdyby się po raz drugi urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łakomym ruchem zgarnął leżące pieniądze i prędko wsunął do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama wlepiła weń spojrzenie zionące gniewem i nienawiścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęliśmy z niego siodło i ciężary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolny rynek usług i mobilność pracowników trzeba wspierać, a nie zwalczać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upewnienie się, że na Bali będziemy podążać właściwą drogą, ma oczywiście podstawowe znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarówno Komisja, jak i Rada dostrzegają, jak ważny jest udział Parlamentu w tej procedurze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozmawiajmy teraz o rozdziale, który ma miejsce na polu polityki socjalnej w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, wysłuchajcie państwo uważnie i bez żadnych obaw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dać młodym umiejętności, których potrzebują do realizacji ich potencjału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbycie się wszystkich proaktywnych polityk rolnych jest czymś gorszym niż zbrodnia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym przypomnieć, że należały do nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potwierdza on także bardzo ważne europejskie kwalifikacje Słowenii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami powiewa właśnie ogromna flaga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę przyznać, że naprawdę nie mam uprawnień w tym względzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zapomnieliśmy już londyńskie metro, Niemcy, Holandię, Hiszpanię i dziesiątki udaremnionych zamachów terrorystycznych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakt, że dzięki temu strategia ta staje się dobrze widoczna, jest niezmiernie korzystny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kodyfikacja powinna być oparta na zasadzie skuteczności, wydajności, odpowiedzialności, przejrzystości i kontynuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie niczym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa jest dla nas - socjalistów - priorytetem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto odnotować przypadek Azorów, ponieważ istnieje tam największa w Unii Europejskiej wyłączna strefa ekonomiczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również głosowałem przeciw rezolucji w sprawie ekstremizmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety jest to dużo bardziej poważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego dziękuję panu za udzielnie tej odpowiedzi i z niecierpliwością oczekujemy dalszego rozwoju wydarzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy udzielić pomocy ofiarom oraz utorować drogę do szybkiej odbudowy na obszarach dotkniętych klęską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym nawet zwrócić się z zapytaniem do obecnego tu pana komisarza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poparłem jednak propozycje Rady w sprawie aktywnej i nieaktywnej części czasu dyżuru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one tylko nieludzkim i kosztownym rozwiązaniem złożonego problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowaliśmy właśnie nad dużą liczbą poprawek przedstawionych przez Europejską Partię Ludową oraz Grupę Socjalistów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam debatę nad tym punktem porządku dziennego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sprawdza się po prostu jego strategia komunikacyjna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie sytuacje są niedopuszczalne i powinny być przedmiotem zdecydowanego, rozmyślnego działania Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrowie i wysokiej jakości hodowla zwierząt gospodarskich mają też zasadnicze znaczenie dla zdrowia publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37277669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie za najważniejsze uznają czynniki, takie jak spójność społeczna oraz osiągnięcia Europy społecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię dorwę...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniłem się przytem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakie wyzwanie na pojedynek lub coś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powracając z moich wycieczek, nie ośmieliłem się spojrzeć na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, nędzny zuchwalec!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan to sobie przeczyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymawszy podobną usługę, brat zostaje moim przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci, pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez to pan nic nie straciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czemuż ty jesteś Romeo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ku mojej niespodziance i radości wszystko było jak najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głowę dałbym sobie uciąć, że Stach niczem więcej nie zajmuje się tylko polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pan chce czekać, do szóstej rano, to popłynę w dół Wełtawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa małe, niby zęby szczura wysuwały się z poza dolnej wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjąłem je ze skrzyni, w kasetce będą pewniej schowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co byłbyś począł w takich samych okolicznościach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tamto jest moje niebo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeździłam dziś rano na Jowiszu i nieźle mi poszło, jak mi się zdaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż mi przyszło z tego wszystkiego: z owych wieści z królestwa nadrzeczywistości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bronił się, jak dziki kot, ale co zdziałać mógł swą krótką bronią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę na mnie nie kichać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzi coraz więcej, a człowieka coraz mniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pisałem cały tydzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka kiwała głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakąż radość i jaką dumę odczuwało wtedy serce moje, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za porządek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźcie też dobrej myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdążyłem przeczytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Walenty powiedział, że nie pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24983496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nic zupełnie nie mogłem sobie wyobrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz o tym i wiesz też, że ona cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma ludzi i nikt nie wyciągnie strzały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie od razu postanowiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła ku mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotarli wreszcie do pierwszego jaru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła do grupy chłopców i dziewcząt, krzyknęła: — Twoja towarzyszka ma śliczną sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak schodzi mi noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszła, cofając się wolno, tyłem, jak teatralny paź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz w takim razie skąd się tu wzięła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ciastka są wyborne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jakim sposobem możesz każdego z nich rozpoznać i nazwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies notorycznie mi ucieka goniąc zwierzynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chwal dnia przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłać mi w dwójnasób, skoro przyjdą pieniądze! — odkrzyknął pisarz poza siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary musiał przyznać, że jest sens w tych wywodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarne źrenice, czarne długie rzęsy, oczy spokojne, utkwione we mnie bez drgnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jemu wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on wcale inaczej nie myślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocucił nas dopiero jęk cichy, przeciągły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Ewa była zazdrosna, że nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno takich rzeczy pamiętać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I bawią się w zabijanie czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen spełzał powoli z jej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodź — zawołał do Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są sytuacje w życiu, w których te towarzyskie dodatki winny odpaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gra świąteczna muzyka, mamy świeczki, jedzenie i fajnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile minut dziennie powinienem trenować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nosił wilk owce, ponieśli i wilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zło, zdaniem twoim, jest równie wiecznym jak dobro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze szczególnej ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mych oczach, oczach małego barbarzyńcy, piękność niewiele znaczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił: — Takie to porządki, że wszystko leży ułożone i niczego nie można znaleźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy napełniły oczy słuchaczy, a mury budynku zadrżały od okrzyków zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nigdy nie wiadomo, co jest potrzebne, a co zbyteczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mówiła jakimś językiem Filipowi zupełnie nie znanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo go to obchodziło, ale można było na ten temat rozprawiać długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzem takim jak ja dałby rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie możemy iść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg począł raptownie zwalniać…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyprowadziłem go przez ogród na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chowa się w bukiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwa zakresy uznane zostały za najbardziej adekwatne dla percepcji na tym etapie rozwoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmarnujesz sobie na nic swój tor wyścigowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zauważył pan obraz nad głową profesora?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapaliłem zatem stojącą na stole lampę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie wzbudza w tobie współczucia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani Tarkowska, rodem Francuzka, zmarła z chwilą przyjścia na świat Stasia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cyfry: zero, jeden, dwa, trzy, cztery, pięć, sześć, siedem, osiem, dziewięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołała odpowiedzieć, stała się rzecz straszna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem mama zaczęła wyciągać gałązki, które wrona wplotła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ja spadam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkoda, bardzo miłe jest nasze dzisiejsze spotkanie — zauważył leśniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle wstał i zadzwonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed hotelem przez dwa dni stały tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"u zasypiającego kota, szelest potrąconej kartki papieru; nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś się napił trochę soku z granatu, mój drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko już było i znowu kiedyś będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała zaiste, czy ma się całować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwonimy, jeśli będziecie potrzebni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekiwanie w szpitalu ciągnęło się godzinami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jej portret.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, daj Boże szczęście, niech panienka mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co sądzicie o moich zeznaniach?“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad ranem zjawili się ludzie z drzewem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między szklanym, jakby obumarłym niebem a bezmiarem pomarszczonych piasków nie było śladu żywej istoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaż ona piękna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakubie, jak to rozumiesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moją serdeczną przyjaciółką będzie Emilka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno oko tak zbielało, że aż zgasło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchylenie w tę czy inną stronę daje dekadentyzm lub prymitywizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahali się chwilę i potem poszli dalej, zostawiając głębokie ślady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę być w oknie pociągu w Rudawie, gdzie będę wsiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaletą bycia twoim sąsiadem jest to, że mam do dyspozycji dwie kuchnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drobnostka, kochany panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola docierała do molo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli, a Darek wyciągnął z kieszeni niezgrabne zawiniątko w brązowym papierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę stąd iść — powiedziała Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudowna celowość natury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia wprawy i nawyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona była wściekła i zmęczona poznawaniem tylu ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierzaj mi, że ci zabalsamowani ludzie są mało podobni do żywych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chowali go, chronili, by nie wpadł we wrogie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona jest tu zawsze, w dokładnie określonym miejscu, w dołku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mu coraz gorzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdyby pan przynajmniej nie przyznał się do tego zabójstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli mi pan dobrze odpowie, dostanie pan guldena, którego kładę tu na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyliż nie przeminęło, nie znikło wszystko, com niegdyś posiadał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie, panie, nikt nie zna jego nazwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wtedy nawet nie wyzwoliłem się od niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewoźnik się przeżegnał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak krew z niego wypłynęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powtórzył Jaromir swoją sztukę z zapałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadomość we mnie gaśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie z kolei co może zrobić dla mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież go mogę spotkać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem dla czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mówiłem spokojnie, choć czułem, jak mi serce się zamraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pytał zdziwiony markier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdumienia zasyczał mi w uszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmierzchać się zaczynało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale cóż ja mam panu powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie miałbym tego wiedzieć, będąc w uniwersytecie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo jest u wszystkich istot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Proszę o koniak, panienko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z oczekiwania zaledwie czuję grunt pod sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniono trzeciego szyldwacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Na gorącym uczynku go schwytano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli żółta, to mówi się: „dobry“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mój synku, przepyszna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dziwowisko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest więc tam gra w piłkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czemuż nie jestem malarzem, mój Boże!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak jest, pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23953896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sznur świszcze przy posunięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, muszę opisać, co działo się wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil wykładał spokojnie teorię absurdo- logii, jak zwykle — zbyt serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniła głowę na znak zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w głębi ducha postanowiłem zrezygnować z tego zaszczytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że to zależy od kategorii, ale powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie gniewasz się, że on cię przy tym zastąpił? Teraz jest wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miesiączka jest ciągłym memento vivere.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj mi odejść, daj mi odejść — prosiła go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemawiał z reguły tylko wtedy, gdy zachodziła bezwzględna konieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłać mi w dwójnasób, skoro przyjdą pieniądze! — odkrzyknął pisarz poza siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawał się już nieraz chodzić tą drogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała wciąż w głębokim uśpieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecież dawno miniona przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznał wrażenia, że wrasta w kanapę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś siedzi nad morzem, rzuca w wodę kamyki i myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam skierowaliśmy z Halszką swe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznałem, iż stanowisko to właśnie mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z dumą pokazał Pukowi ukończony rysunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd mam zatem wystawić bilet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy woda ciebie kąsa? — żartowała z niego Danusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani porównania z ospałą, gęstą i cuchnącą wodą kanałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedział: — Pogadamy o tym dokładnie wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka czyni mistrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest granica powiatu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemni rozbrzmiewa stada wycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie masz plany na dziś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca, spokój, zadowolenie wewnętrzne, wesołość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łakomym ruchem zgarnął leżące pieniądze i prędko wsunął do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzi na swoim czółnie jak wicher.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszych wierszy nie można było pochwycić uchem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chodzili uśmiechnięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nic nie powiedział, jeno ukosem spojrzał na spuchniętą od żądeł lewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnął go nudny zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy można tą ścierką, to wytrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kruk, przelatujący nad lasem, zakrakał nagle na śmierć temu właśnie dębowi, pod którym siedzieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niemym zachwycie pochylili głowy, by się przyjrzeć cudnemu kwieciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył się w kolano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ta mnie drapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omiń korek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jednak dobra wola i powinniśmy się z tego bardzo cieszyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dlaczego takie podejście dla Gdańska?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję wszystkim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również zapewnić udział zaawansowanych krajów rozwijających się, takich jak Chiny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem Unia Europejska jest filarem demokracji, co więcej, Europa stanowi kolebkę naszej cywilizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potępiamy przemoc i uważamy, że końcowe rozwiązanie należy wypracować przy pomocy pokojowych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opóźnienia w tym zakresie uważam za niewybaczalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak podczas pańskiej wypowiedzi pani komisarz ani razu nie wspomniała o zaleceniu rzecznika\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam w Wielkiej Brytanii obiecano referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako posłanka z Irlandii chciałabym podziękować rządowi i obywatelom Czech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dużo łatwiej byłoby też firmom działającym w obszarze handlu elektronicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obserwujemy także w wielu innych krajach, np\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka spójności jest najlepszym dowodem na solidarność, jaka istnieje w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większa obecność Europy stworzy także możliwość oszczędzania w państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielkie wyzwanie dla zarządzających Parlamentem Europejskim i dla nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przede wszystkim z solidarności i sprawiedliwości społecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówią one o sprawiedliwości, a roszczenia o naprawienie szkody stanowią uzupełnienie tej egzekucji prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan minister wie, do czego nawiązuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wielka obraza Boga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli wspomina się o Unii, to jedynie przy okazji, mimochodem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to skandal\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak nie ma on do zaoferowania żadnego postępu czy demokratyzacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma takiego odzewu ze strony klasy politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My cieszyliśmy się poparciem krajów demokratycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będziemy usatysfakcjonowani, dopóki ludzie nie przestaną ginąć na drogach w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poparłem tę inicjatywę głosując \\\"za\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec podam jasny przykład wartości takiej wymiany, o bardziej ogólnym wydźwięku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równie oczywiste jest, że nie stanie się to w jeden dzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwalam czeską prezydencję, jej priorytety oraz niezwłoczne i aktywne zaangażowanie w regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37109343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiemy, że wiele badań obaliło ten pogląd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20738417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20738418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20738419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20738420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20738422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, cóż mi dacie za wyjawienie sekretu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno zawsze mieć pierwszeństwo do ochrony i pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę możności powinno ono rosnąć pod ochroną i odpowiedzialnością rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — beczał rozbawiony naczelnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął kaganek ze stołu i oświetlił twarz Konrada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyła pierwszy rok chemii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chciałabyś usłyszeć resztę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20740513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobra oznaka, ale mnie to bardzo męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień jej na horyzoncie pańskiego życia już zaświtał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz sobie o tym myślał, dopóki nie wrócisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nasza wspólna, święta tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszedł w nią całkiem i ona odczuwała go, jak psy chiczny płód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham ciebie, jak nigdy nie kochałam nikogo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz cudowny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to być kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno uderzenie polanem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór najwidoczniej siedział na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy nie będziemy przyjaciółmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podnieśli się na nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy się z czasem wyrabia — przerwałem, cały drżący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech zobaczą salę balową, wydeptaną przez słonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że będą się spotykać, ale nie tak, jak do tychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęła je bić po tyłku i biła je długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbujemy zakrzyczeć prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy ja się przy tobie rozpływam zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnął z pewną ulgą: Darek nie zabrał ze sobą strzelby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę i nic nie rozu miem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli Komisja nie chce tego zrobić, chcemy poznać powody odmowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym teraz przejść do omówienia nowego rozporządzenia w sprawie statystyk europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno nam dopuścić, aby konkurencyjność osłabiała ochronę praw pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszyscy popieramy kompromisy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabezpieczenie dostaw metali ziem rzadkich dla Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym krótko odnieść się do trzech kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego powierzyliśmy mu to zadanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie takie przyznanie się i przeprosiny mogą przyspieszyć proces pogodzenia między Turcją a Armenią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy, by powołana służba była nowoczesna, także pod względem równości płci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością sposób reakcji władz na nią podważa tę swobodę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli sprawozdanie to ma tak negatywny przekaz, dlaczego uzyskało poparcie tak ogromnej większości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrowie to jeden z tych problemów, które musimy dopiero rozwiązać w walce z ubóstwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może do tego dojść\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkim wyzwaniem reformy jakościowej jest nadal wzmocnienie własnego wkładu i wzajemna rozliczalność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako członkowie Komisji Prawnej dogłębnie omówiliśmy kwestię przekształcenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ochrona naszych praw podstawowych może w praktyce różnić się w zależności od człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to konieczne i właściwie zajęliście się Państwo tą sprawą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chcielibyśmy, aby wciąż żył i nie padł ofiarą brutalnego morderstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mmm, naleśniki ze śmietanką i borówkami...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd też my, socjaliści żądamy, by żadna kategoria pracowników nie została pominięta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ufam, że państwa członkowskie zwrócą większą uwagę na zasadne żądania obywateli Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one podstawą każdej poważnej polityki w tym obszarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście jesteśmy głęboko zaniepokojeni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałbym raz jeszcze podziękować kontrsprawozdawcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszystko to składa się na totalitaryzm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc krótko, faktem jest, że mobilność wymaga zmian, a nie ograniczeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezolucja słusznie zwraca na to uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyszłam tu wyłącznie, by mówić, lecz również, by Państwa wysłuchać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holenderska Partia Wolności konstruktywnie współpracuje z pozostałymi w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32274317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja z kolei twierdzi, że wręcz przeciwnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cha, cha, cha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli razem na łóżku i oparli głowy o ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbiór przedstawiał wartość paru miliardów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiła, że się od niego nie odczepi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął w progu, zajrzał w głąb i żachnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko jedno — machnął obojętnie ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora jeszcze za wczesna na obiad, lecz stosowna na drugie śniadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem wysiadała już z pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powłóczy się, wygłodzi — i wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tam, tam, za biurkiem, w kącie, pod ścianą!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna będzie wielka, a może i nie tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest przez chwilę naciągnięty jak struna, nim się ją puści, nim wyda dźwięk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nas nie byłoby wojny…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mrówka myśli, że to wysoka góra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przychodzi do mnie jak do kurwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cmentarz zamykają tu wcześnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On by chciał, żebyśmy czekali tysiąc lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchajcie, dzieci, trzeba konie odsunąć od ognia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Teresa — ta prawdziwa — jest w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj przyjaciele, milcząc, spojrzeli wzajem po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napięcie w filmie tworzy się na wielu płaszczyznach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drażniące, zbyt mocne było jego spoglądanie prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — beczał rozbawiony naczelnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całował ją długo, podczas gdy ona patrzyła na niego uważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niemym zachwycie pochylili głowy, by się przyjrzeć cudnemu kwieciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jutro, chcę dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak nie poruszył on dotąd wcale portfelu... Dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc przyznaje pan, że w praktyce musi się uczynić wybór? — Jest się zmuszonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu cytaty z zeznań świadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciągła pieszczota pocałunku, pożegnalne zwarcie się spojrzeń… i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju ciekawie obejrzał bratanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ich twarzach malowały się głęboki szacunek i przestrach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz uczestniczy w spotkaniach, ale to było dużo, dużo wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Babunia nigdy w życiu nie chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jesteś silniejszy niż ci chłopcy, z którymi się bawisz? — Fredek jest słabszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie przyjemnie się wypróbować albo pokazać, że się nie boję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz zasępił się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ty byłeś raczej predestynowany do mojej roli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy bawisz się z chłopcami w parku? — Czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo daję, przynajmniej dobrze, żem ciebie spotkał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łżesz jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomyślą, że człowiekowi przykro i boi się, że panią rozgniewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z pociągu nie wolno strzelać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu starzec jednem uderzeniem młota wbił kowadło w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pogardą śmierci oczekiwałem teraz, co nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba żaden z was nie był jeszcze w Wenecji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim sposobem wpadłeś w ich ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast tego otworzyli drzwi przyległej celi i wyciągnęli z niej kogoś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko oględnie powiedz jej smutną wiadomość... nie wyobrazisz sobie, jak bardzo mnie kochała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jemu masz to pani do zawdzięczenia, ja nie ponoszę tutaj żadnej winy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łyknij porządnie z butelki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za temat dla niego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy porwał je zgłodniałym ruchem i połknął w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadki o niem krążyły długo pomiędzy ludem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież tu powód do wyrzutów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobną depeszę otrzymałem z Paryża, gdzie wypadki nie rozwinęły się jeszcze tak gwałtownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo rzecz nie należała bynajmniej do łatwych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz korespondent ocalony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21920109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mamy wierzyć w duchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary już nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko musiałem starać się o własne utrzymanie, ale również zadbać o matkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahał się i zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Symbole siedmiu planet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza nakrywa ją, jak dzwon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzyliśmy też tymczasem swoje, na szczęście lekkie rany i trochę wypoczęliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda? Biedny Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem te dwa przełączniki i aktywowałem je wszystkie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu na chwilę zacisnęło oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ma wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W takim razie — odpowiedział cicho — poniósłbym porażkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten był znacznie wyższy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ją przywitał, nie miał już ochrypłego głosu i cały czar znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam wywołałem swój los, utajoną swą myśl wypisałem bezwiednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby mi pan powiedział, co pana tak przeraża, wiedziałbym, jak należy postąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie oto snuł myśli biedny młodzieniec, leżąc w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, pójdę zająć się nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż, mimo dość prozaicznych okoliczności, dało się odczuć pierwiastek rycerski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan sobie życzy, prosimy o wolny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorami wypływałem za zwyczaj na morze, aby złowić nieco ryb na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z psów leżał niedbale pod krzewem, miał rozdarte gardło i broczył krwią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż wobec tego wszystkiego rodzinie twej może grozić jakiekolwiek niebezpieczeństwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili powziąłem postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce ich oczom ukazał się niezbyt przyjemny widok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał długo i bacznie wpatrywał się w twarz nieznajomego kaleki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mundur ów był zniszczony i wypłowiały; u boku generała wisiała prosta szabla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stał młody krępy górnik o szerokich ramionach i szyi byka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili Mistrz rzucił się na niego, jak tygrys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokoła nas żyje lud prosty i bogobojny, niezdolny nikomu wyrządzić krzywdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zastukał do okna końcem bagnetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to wezwanie zjawił się niezwłocznie stary sługa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sadzie powiewały sztandary o rozmaitych barwach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitana objęło przyjemne ciepło idące z kominka, i oczy zaczęły mu się przymykać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze starcie było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Masz ci los!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie kapitanie, pan ma okrwawione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łowczy, którego koń unosił kopyta, jak ciężary, pozostał w tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz potoczył się do swego kąta, podobny do rozjuszonego niedźwiedzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzowie mieli pewność, że mistrz zwycięży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pytania takie odpowiadałem zawsze przecząco bez najmniejszego wahania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądał się wzrokiem roztargnionym wokół siebie, szukając broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedtem jednak zbadałem puls chorego i zauważyłem, że spadł i że gorączka ustąpiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umarła w tydzień po tem, jak dowiedzieliśmy się o jego śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz żegnam pana; muszę jeszcze zniszczyć niektóre papiery i wszystko doprowadzić do porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21645292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wieczorem spojrzałem na barometr; ciśnienie było bardzo niskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy krytyk jest postacią niezwykłą i odmienną od wszystkich śmiertelników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofając się, zostawiliśmy trzech zabitych przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nietrudno domyślić się: jeden z nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadził ją do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są rady banalne dla zupełnych już prymitywów golenia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam jego zwrotu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto tu był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś ty nigdy nie udawała niczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pewnych rzeczy nie należy nazy wać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi oto w oknie wagonu, uśmiechnięta, szczęśliwa, młoda mężatka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taniec — to kręcenie się w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna „deformacja przestrzenna” przy otwartych oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pana dane będą przetwarzane w celu realizacji wybranych usług cyfrowych dostępnych w serwisie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20765699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Twoja mamusia powiedziała, że nie będzie cię więcej biła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem wrzód pękł sam bez przecinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w nędzy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili furtka już była otwarta na oścież.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to sprzyjać jedynie pracy mechanicznej, nie wymagającej twórczego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Ja wiem, co teraz będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mi przykro, gdy się wygłu piasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olsztyn to nie tylko jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety musiałem wyjechać nie zobaczywszy się z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Eter to kłamca, i to na krótką metę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czymże właściwie było to młode dziewczę dla Brama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola docierała do molo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy mężczyzna zgubił się gdzieś w tłumie pasażerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok naocznie sprawdzonego sęka napełnił ich jakąś nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bierze dosłownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiecień plecień, co przeplata, trochę zimy, trochę lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciśnienie ustępowało, jak powietrze z dziurawego balo nu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ten tłum?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dojść do tego, by móc sobie pozwolić tym zakończyć koncert.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nie! — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Kochasz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładę się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciebie już nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przystani onej nie masz rekina…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przed nocą dotarliśmy do niewysokiego grzbietu górskiego, porośniętego lasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni używają redakcyjnego „my” — zaznaczył naraz Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko paru obrazki narysowało i położyliśmy na stoliku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę umrzeć, leżąc na tobie, tak, właśnie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten dzień zapasy były skończone i zebrani rozeszli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe wygięte nozdrza odchylały się przy oddechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na fotelu, ona usiadła na poręczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie wicher — przykrość, dla niego — uciecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz uczestniczy w spotkaniach, ale to było dużo, dużo wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mógł prowadzić rozmowy, której przedtem nie obmyślił szczegółowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień w klasztorze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzież nie jest łatwym jury, a ocenia każdy krok i każdy ruch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek był tuż, jak gdyby na wierzchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Newton też ułożył swój systemik dedukcyjnie, chociaż powstał on niewątpliwie na podstawie indukcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już idę! — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oszczędź mi pan swych dowcipów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim — znikły wszelkie towary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jednoręki zaniepokoił się pilnie i otarł usta rąbkiem rękawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiesił jej płaszcz w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On znał każdy labiryncik jej psychiki i rów nocześnie odkrywał coraz nowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaś podasz mi kielich trucizny, działającej jak piorun.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskiej i niby na jeża ostrzyżonej murawie przyleśnej stał dąb ustronny i rozłożysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie mogę się tak mę czyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dżonki chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą przytacza on opinię cudzą, nie własną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna owych ucieczek pozostała nigdy nie wyjaśnioną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi fantazja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrazy leżą we mnie zastygłe, wyschnięte jak rośliny w zielniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle razy się to zdarzało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko upływały Maciusiowi godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem położył się i patrzył uporczywie w sufit, przez który było widać gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzem takim jak ja dałby rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drogo to można okupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za głośno targowali się z babcią o mycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz być tym i tym, albo tam i tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król odbywa dalekie wycieczki łodzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielką zaletą onego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet? — ziewnął niedbale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na pewno mi go wziąć nie pozwolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo przyszło, łatwo poszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był naprawdę pracowity rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A potem psa i krowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nie! — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O walce myśleć nawet nie było można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze - procedura przejściowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie charakteryzuje się wysoce wybiórczym podejściem do wyrażania krytyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza grupa przedyskutowała to zagadnienie bardzo dokładnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona jednolitą siłą gospodarczą, kulturową, a być może również i polityczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27671991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszliśmy do tego tematu ze śmiałością i z ostrożnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od jakiegoś czasu istnieją programy finansowania i są one gwarantowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak, wydaje mi się, że Unia Europejska na dzisiejszym posiedzeniu uzyskała poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukraina jest europejskim państwem, które musi mieć prawo do podejmowania decyzji w sprawie Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wreszcie, żeby zmobilizowano środki funduszu solidarności Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia pojawią się takie czy inne wyzwania, które będą wymagały analizy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo różnic kulturowych należy dążyć do rozwiązania tego problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób macie zamiar rozwiązać ten problem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego proponujemy odroczenie absolutorium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowałem za przyjęciem sprawozdania w sprawie Europejskiego Centrum Monitorowania Narkotyków i Narkomanii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy, że zawsze jest trudno ustalić budżet dla naszej instytucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trwający kryzys polityczny stanowi poważne zagrożenie dla stabilności kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy też uprościć codzienną współpracę między organami krajowymi w dziedzinie nadzoru granic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka lat temu opracowaliśmy reguły umożliwiające to maszynistom to do\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem skutek tego wszystkiego jest taki, że Parlament nie ma wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie będzie reklam w radio, ani w telewizji, ani w czasopismach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba dodawać, że owo sprawdzenie zgodności podlega całkowicie władzy rządu afgańskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczynią się one do zrównoważonego rozwoju oraz tworzenia miejsc pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Który raz z rzędu Europa biernie przygląda się aresztowaniu laureata jej nagrody?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, istnieje sposób umożliwiający osiągnięcie tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestię tę poruszyło już dwoje naszych kolegów posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje również Międzynarodowa Rada Parlamentarzystów Żydowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości pana komunikat stawia nieobecność Rady w jeszcze gorszym świetle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim przypadku także konsument musi za to zapłacić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele z ostatnich wypadków kolejowych i zdarzeń potencjalnie wypadkowych spowodowały właśnie braki w utrzymaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiem państwu pewną historię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"gdy byłem mały, nieomal nie zginąłem, wdychając opary wydzielane z winogron udeptywanych w kadzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27672092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki ośrodek wzmocni technologicznie Europę, w tym przemysł węglowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznawaliśmy ich po głosie, dzięki czemu mogliśmy sprawdzić ich liczbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mam to dobrze, proszę bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dawali listom nagłówków, aby nie używać pewnych słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro pójdziemy w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwagi te mogą się wydać niektórym nie na czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór milczał uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem następuje uzasadnienie, jak zwykle przekonujące, ale nieprawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami czujemy przecie, więc po co zaraz robić awantury?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już jem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są stłoczone i nie mają tla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaludnili więc sam widok lasu, jakby w celu uzupełnienia i ożywienia nieprzynależnego nikomu obrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co niczyje, to i nasze być może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało mojej matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę panu zrobić niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzenie firmy to nie bułka z masłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil: — Nosisz dzisiaj wstrętne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dlatego spóźniłeś się wtedy? Janek patrzył niebieskimi, niewinnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Kochasz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzyma się za tę cienką nić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiał tę pozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to znaczy? Nic nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy się tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zastępowali tego gwarą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam skierowaliśmy z Halszką swe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek i Danusia pękają ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie nalegał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment, kiedy ona powiedziała: — To w parku nie sprawiło mi przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtarzam: Niech polityką zajmują się przynajmniej specjaliści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniję pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię z nikim dzielić się miłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner przyniósł lody i trzy grube, okrągłe wafle, we tknięte w usta lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystrzelił Maciuś w powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanadto może szkoła pędzi, jakby kto poganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mam to dobrze, proszę bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed snem zaglądał pod łóżko, czy tam ktoś nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę poznać się, wiedzieć z góry jakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd? Nie wiadomo! — odpowiedział Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeszcze nie dowód!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo w usta, albo tak cię przyciśnie, że żebra bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to stany poprzedzające omdlenie spowodowane nadmiarem narkotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale sama wtedy nie spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej wierzę naukowcom niż politykom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle z jego włosów zaczęły się sypać iskry aż na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerka co chwilę na elegancki zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurczowo zacisnął dłoń na kolbie rewolweru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w dziedzinie matematyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panu dziękuję za wykonaną przez pana pracę i za pańskie sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie o to w tym chodzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojęcia takie jak \\\"granica ubóstwa\\\" i \\\"współczynnik zagrożenia ubóstwem\\\" przekraczają moje słabe możliwości zrozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostateczny wpływ zależeć będzie zasadniczo od trzech czynników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś wieczorem w Kościele św\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące ludzi zostało bez domów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że uda mi się przedstawić to sprawozdanie w październiku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostosowaliśmy odpowiednio nasze przepisy i włączyliśmy choroby przenoszone przez nosicieli do listy chorób priorytetowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się również bardzo z wezwania nas do zgłoszenia uwag w sprawie konsekwencji polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zainteresowaniem wysłuchałem wystąpień posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejrzystość w obrocie dokumentami musi istnieć na każdym szczeblu administracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal należy podjąć decyzję, czy linie lotnicze uzyskają odszkodowania finansowe, czy też nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszą z nich jest komunikacja z pasażerami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecna sytuacja bardzo nam sprzyja, ale równie dobrze mogłoby być na odwrót\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugim problemem w Afganistanie jest pilna potrzeba reformy rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzymy prezydencji węgierskiej wszelkich sukcesów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą Panie dobrze, że moja grupa parlamentarna jest przeciwna istnieniu Organizacji Traktatu Północnoatlantyckiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto mogłaby ona poważnie zagrozić ożywieniu gospodarczemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja już poczyniła znaczne postępy w tych pracach przygotowawczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiedział Pan o tym, czy też naprawdę wierzy Pan w to, co mówił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugą \\\"pieczenią\\\" jest duża zależność Europy od importu energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostępność i bezpieczeństwo tych szlaków transportowych jest zatem kwestią największej wagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, byśmy rozmawiali z Ameryką z równej pozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kończąc, życzę komisarzowi Dimasowi szybkiego powrotu do zdrowia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsza identyfikowalność wymaga lepszego systemu oznakowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postęp ten dokonywał się ze szczególną intensywnością zwłaszcza w nowych państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski nie oznacza jedynie prawodawstwa, ale jest samą duszą Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę po prostu coś zasugerować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowi to kolejny krok w kierunku centralizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawką w tym kontekście jest odpowiedzialność socjalna naszych firm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według szacunków wszystkie państwa członkowskie odnotują w tym roku ujemny wzrost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27622639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewniając stabilne ceny, a także przyglądając się kwestii kosztów produkcji żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy negocjować tygodniami, a potem w ostatniej chwili podważać osiągniętych kompromisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tego rodzaju wystąpienia, które atakują personalnie poszczególne osoby, są niedopuszczalne w Parlamencie Europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiej rady udzielić krajom rozważającym powierzenie prawa rozwodowego Unii Europejskiej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, panie komisarzu, koledzy posłowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że Komisja zważy wreszcie na bardzo mocne i jasne stanowisko tej Izby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają wizji, a gdy nie ma wizji, ludzie giną\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oferujemy im jednak podstawowe prawo każdego obywatela Europy - prawo do swobodnego podróżowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością nie chodzi tylko o różnice regulacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepływ osób posiadających wizy długoterminowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to, że impas w stosunkach unijno-rosyjskich trwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże ta substancja reprezentuje grupę około setki innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz moje trzy uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że Europa nie może decydować o strukturze tych krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocena i ewentualne zawieszenie układu z Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opodatkowanie transakcji finansowych nie utrudni zawierania takich transakcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam kilka uwag na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże najwyraźniej nie wyciągnęliśmy z tego wniosków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za tę pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pokazuje, jaką wagę wszyscy przykładamy do zbliżenia narodów Bałkanów Zachodnich do Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popieram tego traktatu ani jego wytworów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjednoczona Lewica Europejska chciałaby szczególnie podkreślić trzy główne aspekty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed Szwecją stoi teraz ogromna odpowiedzialność za przyszłość ludzkości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, wiele trzeba nadal wspólnie uczynić w kierunku stworzenia Europy obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc konkretniej, konieczna jest tu refleksja nad pytaniem fundamentalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obliczu powyższego wstrzymałem się od głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Normalnie powiedzielibyśmy, że nie działają nasze urządzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanowny panie przewodniczący, koleżanki, koledzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy położyć absolutny kres tej eskalacji przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecne przepisy są bardziej kompleksowe i kompletne, a więc zapewniają lepszą ochronę uczestników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi być siłą napędową demokratyzacji krajów, które powstały wskutek rozpadu byłego Związku Radzieckiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy zatem wziąć pod uwagę dalszy postęp technologiczny w przyszłych dziesięcioleciach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest w istocie właściwa droga, jaką należy obrać, panie premierze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30316264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak można ich zdymisjonować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wreszcie, musi zapewnić odpowiednią relację wartości do ceny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mołdawia znalazła się obecnie w najtrudniejszej sytuacji gospodarczej spośród wszystkich państw naszego kontynentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Pan wie, eksperci nie zawsze są zgodni, co do najlepszego sposobu reagowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich głowa w tem, żeby się nie spotkali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poparłem rezolucji z dwóch kluczowych powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inną ważną kwestią jest rola organizacji społecznych, w tym organizacji romskich w rozwiązanie problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ugrupowanie polityczne, które wprowadziło tę praktykę było tym, któremu przewodził Adolf Hitler\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym punktem porządku obrad są korekty do głosowania i zamiary głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że śliwki jednak nie rosną na sośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reasumując zatem - automatyczna wymiana informacji dokonywana na życzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja nie realizuje operacji pomocowych samodzielnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie ujmując, zalecam przyjęcie podejścia wypracowanego w ramach kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, pani komisarz, panie komisarzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32855652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nowy sposób na prowadzenie jałowych dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32856999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli można, będę kontynuowała w języku węgierskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawiono tu zaledwie propozycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowa dyrektywa bardzo dobrze reguluje także ochronę konsumenta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oba te kryteria stawiają kobiety w niekorzystnym położeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym w tym miejscu podziękować trzem osobom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Punktem wyjścia dla sprawozdawców były wnioski Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedemdziesiąt procent sprzedawanych zabawek znajduje się poniżej tych wartości granicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w Indiach, Chinach, a także w krajach Trzeciego Świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpady ulegające biodegradacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zatem zintensyfikować nasze wysiłki w zakresie europejskiej koordynacji i zarządzania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki wpływ miało przedłużenie ochrony praw autorskich w Stanach Zjednoczonych na zachodzące tam zmiany?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można regulować prasę bez zagrażania wolności słowa i wolności prasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję dzisiejsze głosy w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu przestrzegam Unię Europejską, aby w tym zakresie podejmowała ostrożne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto moim zdaniem bardzo ważne jest, że umowa zakazuje praktyk antykonurencyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie są zatem ograniczenia i gdzie są granice niezależności i odpowiedzialności w takiej strukturze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, nie wolno nam pod żadnym pozorem ograniczać szkoleń w sektorze kolejnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Projekt dyrektywy jest dokumentem potrzebnym, a wnioskowane zmiany nie zmieniają jego merytorycznej treści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32857042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osiedla nigdy nie powstawały tak szybko, jak po porozumieniu z Annapolis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zobaczył go, jak spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wolę pójść na nogach niż autobusem pojechać, żeby się z ludźmi nie spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właściwie cóż by nam przyszło z tego, gdybyśmy wreszcie go odnaleźli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan może wiedzieć o tym wszystkim? — szeptał na pół przytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz uśmiech zgubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeśli mi wolno odgrzebać dawne wspomnienia, łączy nas niejaka znajomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię: bywałem, gdyż niekiedy zdawało mi się, że Nicość zwyciężyła Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedźcie noga za nogą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty mnie do tego zmusiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być ciekawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest sprzeczne samo w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobra oznaka, ale mnie to bardzo męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest nie do zniesienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno drugiemu pomaga znakomicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do drugiej nad ranem posłyszałem nagle szum wody, nadchodziła fala powodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci obiecać, że ten list będzie ostatni, ale gdybym mógł, obiecałbym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, nie znał słów pieśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to jest cudowna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Echo rozlegało się po całej łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na miarę lat siedemdziesiątych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie rozmawialiśmy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przestał, bo po co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno róże miłości najchętniej przyjmują się na grobach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił się i poczuł Maciuś pierwsze uderzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytaliśmy o redaktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niemym zachwycie pochylili głowy, by się przyjrzeć cudnemu kwieciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem pewny, że kłamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy oto przysięgam i pierwszy będę dbał o wypełnienie umówionych warunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak i nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil dziwił się, że Janek tyle mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nalegaj, Kazik, dłużej, bo się pogniewamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ciebie nam było żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, nie powiesz mi o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekund kilka — jak wiek długich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źródłem wszelkiego zła jest świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież nie był szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część zginęła w boju, część siedzi w obozie dla jeńców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko krowy rodzą cielęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba iść do klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co pani zamówi? — zapytał, gdy przyszedł kelner.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wsunęła mu rękę pod ramię ruchem łagodnym i zdecydowanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze współczuciem spojrzał na zabrakowanego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisałem drugą książkę: Co lepsze: czy guziki blaszane, czy rogowe?.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego pan jeszcze chce ode mnie? — zagadnął znów niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kukułka przez sen kukała w głębinie leśnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona oznajmiła gestem, że chciałaby także coś robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru, ludzie dobrzy, do jaru! — zawołał z zapałem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plaże nad Bałtykiem latem są pełne Polaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy się tak dalej spotykać jak dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziło się to na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzyczka jego nabrała dziwnego wyrazu — począł poruszać ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak i nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryczę ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radio grało z daleka na pełnym głośniku łzawy szlagier, ohydnie sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bieganina, szepty, słowo: „uciekł, uciekł”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzebowała wyrazów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnajdywała go wszędzie i ciągle, ze zwierzęcą, jasno widzącą pewnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwolę na to! — wrzasnął Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę razy przesiąkł jak mgła przez pnie drzew w alei lipowej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kolega po zawodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie pod ciśnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe zmiany nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A brzuszek mu pęcznieje…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwiami trzaskają, krzyczą, wiercą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierś była jędrna i młoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20712717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowym głosem przemówiła natura; odezwało się serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jest dzień wagarowicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba nie pozostaną długo na lądzie, jak sądzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy ogłosili strajk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Służę panu — odpowiedział grzecznie, strzepując popiół z cygara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu pożegnali się, umówiła się z nim na jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Diabli was tu wezmą co do nogi, jak nas zgubicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikam wszelkich poprawek i przeróbek! — odpowiedział pośpiesznie i niespokojnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachował dużo cech dziecinnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć gdyż oczekują mnie towarzysze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyższe narkotyki dają wściekłe reakcje — zaraz widać ich szkodliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukali innej planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona napisała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwolę na to! — wrzasnął Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, jak ręka Andrzeja wpija mi się kurczowo w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan tylko zgłosić dopłatę konduktorowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do nich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ulega wątpliwości, że lisa osaczyły już psy tam w gąszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś jest głodny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawajcie i drugą połowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby tak skoczyć po niego i przynieść go tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrętną jest sama myśl, że ona ma stać się własnością tego bydlaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzałem się zaciekawiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O dziesiątej przy świerku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytać musieli wszyscy dlaczego tak daleko wędrował za chlebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina pierwsza czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bitwa pod Waterloo położyła kres tym wszystkim marzeniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domy ja deko racje teatralne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba być zepsutym i bez wdzięku, aby w pięknie dopatrywać się myśli brzydkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałbym się Walentego, ale się wstydzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pytał zdziwiony markier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to pogodne poddanie, które łączy w sobie wiedzę i religię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piwniczy wydał okrzyk zdziwienia i wskazał na wyciągniętą rękę zmarłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjdę, papo, i zostawię panów samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jozue Prokop wesoło mrugnął powiekami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcąc tymczasem pokazać, jak kutas pierdoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zamki łatwo się otwierają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc to, rozniecał ogień, żeby ukryć lekkie drganie ust, którego nie mógł opanować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy czytać to tylko, co się nam podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za cztery godziny bądź pan gotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczyłem na jutro, na wspólną przechadzkę więźniów po dziedzińcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten boss to kaszka z mleczkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonasz się najlepiej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto nas pozna, gdy będziemy unikali dzielnicy żydowskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź szczerą proszę cię, nieprawdaż, że mnie uważasz za kobietę pozbawioną uczciwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyjdzie po nią, gdy będzie skończona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądam na zegar: spałem zaledwie godzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25274218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, albo nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież się to wybierasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ee — mruknął — właściwie nie ma się z czego śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głową na dół, nogami do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może znajdzie się jakiś drobiazg, godny uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymaliśmy wiadomość o jakimś chłopcu, którego znaleziono w polu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor starał się okazać zaciekawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karawana ruszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest zbyt niebezpieczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady szły w stronę lasu, a potem skręcały ku wąwozowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy mu za nic nie podziękowano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz lepiej daj mu spocząć, później znów kochanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak brzmiało ewentualne jej zapytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką włożyłam? Nie wiem, w jaki sposób, ale na szczęście”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemuż zatrzymywać się tutaj na północy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź co bądź jednak ślady te są niezbyt wyraźne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dużo bym dała za to, by wiedzieć, czemu to ona uczyniła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy inspektora błądziły w próżni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jan zaczął się śmiać, ale śmiech przeszedł wkrótce w chrapanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina osiemnasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tato chce się zobaczyć z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znienawidziła od razu swój dom i życie dotychczasowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nilem do El-Wasta i do tatusia! — poczęła po wtarzać sennym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły więc skupiać się dokoła Sary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potok przynosi glinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wujaszku! — powiedziałem mu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziecięca niewinność jest niewątpliwie czymś bardzo pięknym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy wyciągnąć stąd jakieś wnioski praktyczne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad równiną zamigotały roje gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam was na chwilę — zawołał do wewnątrz — muszę pójść do młyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21180996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał niezdecydowany w drzwiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie chciałbyś, abym ja była jak każda młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: czarodziej tam już mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Któż to kracze tym razem? - odrzucił triumfalnie Bill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To człowiek bardzo chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pójdźmy dalej, może zobaczymy ich więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli dziecko żyje, to musi się gdzieś znajdować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepsze talerze tylko ze Słupska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaświecił nawet światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam reklamy w telewizji. Zwłaszcza te z zespołem muzycznym wiewiórek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona nie wiedziała o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nas innych nie zwracasz, oczywiście, uwagi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Henry nie odrzekł nic, lecz przeżuwał dalej w milczeniu. Skończywszy fasolę, zapił ją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Gerwazy na chłopskie dzieci nieraz woła:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten musiał odbiedz tak daleko, że na razie można go było uważać za straconego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włodzio już zdrów po odrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On jest miły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce jej biło mocno, gdy stanęła pod domem teścia swego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie tu i ówdzie jakiś mały władca rościł prawo do niektórych ziem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakrzywienie czasoprzestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Subiekci nie wiedzą, co robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęli ostrożnie uwięzionego latawca i oddali go w ręce doktora, który, spojrzawszy nań, rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie był głodny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą on tu nie może przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cię tam złapie kot bury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zacisnął znowu ogniwa, kiedy psy przycichły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zupełnie tak spełniają się czarnoksięskie zaklęcia — odezwała się do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Nie mógł się ruszyć ani wymówić żadnego słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płacz tak, Aniu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przezywać tu od myszek tego rozbójnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten popatrzał niedowierzająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten młody człowiek jest nie mniej od ciebie pogrążony w rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzynasta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20894499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym spojrzawszy na Arabów dodał w duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno, że takie rzeczy tylko na osobności się gada — stwierdził z nagłym przekonaniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór milczał uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam w niej trochę po staroświecku, lecz że tak sobie życzyłeś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała na łóżku i nie odrywała oczu od zakratowanego okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze na miejsce jednego powieszonego stawało do walki dziesięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak studnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie — upierała się — to on, na pewno on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip był dużym chłopcem, ale nieprzyjemnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszedł w nią całkiem i ona odczuwała go, jak psy chiczny płód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie nie czuje się na siłach do otwartej walki ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż i to zawodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby to zrobił, nie miałabym pretensji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie można było rozróżnić zarysy dzbanka i miski na wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że wszedł do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, cóż, zrozumiałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, no… niech się błąka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było sobie miasteczko nad rzeczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czapki nie można znaleźć i w bek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przeważa się obojętnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten drugi, co pociesznym basem gada, jak wygląda? — zaciekawiła się w torbie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pusty brzuszek pęczniał mu w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykładam mu dziesięć razy dziennie, jak się ma zachowywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec przyjdzie tu za jakieś pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można by tu zrobić dygresję do psychologii całości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nagroda ufundowana przez nasze miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam, już chcę wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł czoło, zmienił senną pozycję i spojrzał przytomnie po wagonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepiej, nie najlepiej! — odrzekł ze szczerym smutkiem w głosie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co otrzymałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żal ścisnął go za serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnął głowę rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za rudera wrzasnął mały chłopiec do dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziękowaliśmy i zamyśleni zeszliśmy do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pięć minut nie mógł znaleźć w szafie kapelusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż tam u ciebie słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciśnienie ustępowało, jak powietrze z dziurawego balo nu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola odbijała od brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowierzam cudzoziemcom, zarówno żywym jak i umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłam usnąć, bo on musi leżeć pod pierzyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie rozumiem, co do mnie mówisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Powiesz mi podczas śniadania, czy mamusia ci pozwoliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przykro, że ludzie przeze mnie cierpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ostrożnie odsunąwszy rąbek firanki, wyjrzała przez szparę na korytarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile chodzi o Emila — nie wstydziła się niczego więcej; ani mówić, ani czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłem sobie wtedy, że widzę ją po raz ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie ginę bez zasługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trąciła mnie wachlarzem w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero przekonał się, że początkowo szli oboje w złym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała skala uczuć, od najsubtelniejszych do najpotworniejszych, ale jakże dziko spotęgowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to jednak szczególne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak szła po schodach, jak otwierała drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz rozciąga się na długie lata — odpowiedział z mocniejszym rumieńcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale był jeden robotnik stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I myślały, że ich dary tak prędko dojechały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — zapytałem, ślizgając się spojrzeniem po rozlewisku wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi ulicami, zaułkami i placami sunęły barwne tłumy ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształty przesuwają się wolno, schodzą i rozchodzą w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżała nad rzeką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomość była zawarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, wszystko jedno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary już nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie śmiała się teraz wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek nawet się wyspać nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś kiedyś tego człowieka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę na mnie spojrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa potrafiła być nadzwyczajna tylko w sobie samej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy raz jestem na żaglówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie czuję się dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz muszę stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skóra wyschnięta była starannie, naciągnięta na kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za temat dla niego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te same słowa, które wymówił wtedy, na wybrzeżu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja znam inne prawo, które wymierzy sprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg jeden wie tylko, co działo się przez pierwsze kilka minut!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie niedopieczony doktór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie dureń mógłby tego nie uznawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek w zadziwiający sposób umiał mówić z kobietami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała moja egzystencja zależy może od tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewidzialne ręce zdarły mi oto zasłonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynam też widzieć postacie w głębi obrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jeszcze czego potrzeba?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokół niego i poza nim panował najzupełniejszy spokój i cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu starzec jednem uderzeniem młota wbił kowadło w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień odpoczynku zrobił swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się nam, że wszystko już skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w tej chwili niejako wcieleniem psiego przerażenia: drżał cały i żałośnie skowyczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobre to były czasy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwieniła się trochę, jakby powiedziała więcej, niż pragnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22192676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa bagnety francuskie tkwiły w jego piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz ten chłopak wpadnie w złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Tadeusz wszedł pierwszy, drżącymi rękami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam zamiaru pana obrażać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiowi jednak uśmiechały się głównie brzegi jeziora Karoun.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jego drużbą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy do ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest tak, jak znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle jej dobroduszna twarz rozpromieniła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czwarta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tuląc nos oraz usta w zawisłą piździochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wydarzyło się coś nowego od owej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie myślałem o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie poczęli żyć pod jakim takim prawem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była nie bardzo ubrana, i poruszała się tak, jak gdyby była na plaży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ekran pojemnościowy jest czuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał ją i był przekonany, że ja ją mam również.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem ktoś zadzwonił do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz jeszcze ujdzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21077983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc to dlatego!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21078013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez czas jakiś posuwali się południowym brzegiem jeziora po płaszczyźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21078014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, jak to jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21078015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadomie gnił, rozkładał się tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21078017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to bowiem jedyny sposób zmuszenia tych grabieżców do porzucenia obrzydliwego handlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21078019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkacy jak Korwin krytykował reformę języka polskiego w Pożegnaniu Jesieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23869790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego sprawozdanie z inicjatywy własnej w znakomity sposób obejmuje wszystkie kluczowe problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że potrzebujemy czegoś więcej niż tylko wzmocnienia współpracy pomiędzy krajowymi służbami straży przybrzeżnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże wierzę, że istnieje więcej niż jedna odpowiedź na te problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy poprze pan niższy dochód społeczny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd Zimbabwe musi podjąć działania zmierzające do przestrzegania międzynarodowych zobowiązań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni popieram te cele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd koncentracja na komunikacyjnych inwestycjach infrastrukturalnych ułatwiających funkcjonowanie wspólnego rynku oraz na ekologii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiając system, powinniśmy uważać, by nie pozbawiać dzieci tej szansy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby to być kluczowy czynnik otwarcia i oddziaływania na białoruską kulturę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawiany złożony pakiet to wynik dwuletnich wspólnych wysiłków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że wspólnie udało nam się zapoczątkować proces, który zaowocuje oszczędnościami w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"chciałabym podnieść kwestię możliwości stosowania sankcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Sri Lanka wciąż nie jest stroną Konwencji Ottawskiej o zakazie min przeciwpiechotnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy tacy zadowoleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie jednym ze środków jest wzmożenie współpracy z naszymi partnerami handlowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowaliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego domagam się jasnych odpowiedzi a nie pospiesznych reakcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rodzajem magicznej różdżki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, skąd przychodzą terroryści czy inne zagrożenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Składanie dokumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadczy o tym nie tylko przykład różnicy w wynagrodzeniach pomiędzy mężczyznami i kobietami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umożliwia to tym krajom wyznaczanie standardów gospodarowania lasami i korzystania z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że będziemy ją mieć do końca stycznia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłam to już wielokrotnie i powtórzę raz jeszcze dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że w rzeczywistości ma to zgubne skutki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, pani komisarz, drodzy państwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda jest natomiast zupełnie odwrotna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić, aby decyzje w sprawie Republiki Irlandii mogli podejmować obywatele Republiki Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27029896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślcie o tym i działajcie teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27068990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosowo to nie precedens\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27068992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc jaką pomoc jej oferujecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27068993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu zawarto też listę państw, które będą uprzywilejowanymi partnerami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27068994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony, nie można też pozwolić, aby zbankrutowały\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27068995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że zostały podważone awanturniczymi działaniami wobec Izraela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec, milcząc, ssał swój tatarak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na przykład — Jędrek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę w kącie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłyszę! — odpowiedział radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli razem na łóżku i oparli głowy o ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz mieć sen zdrowy, panie naczelniku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztan zaczął z wolna wydzielać swój nocny zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś przemył i przewiązał ranę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem przestaje się nawet za tym tęsknić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad nimi wiruje i unosi się „nigdy” i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas przestał płynąć, a świat istnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pora jeszcze za wczesna na obiad, lecz stosowna na drugie śniadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś prościej, szlachetniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten hałas mnie męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę tylko, ale zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym z tobą trochę pogawędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stosunki meksykańskie utrudniają bardzo dostanie prawdziwego preparatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiedział do niej przez cały czas ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chodzili uśmiechnięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem z zapalniczką?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kukułka przez sen kukała w głębinie leśnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciągła pieszczota pocałunku, pożegnalne zwarcie się spojrzeń… i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i zawrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pod tym względem kokaina jest jeszcze większą złudą niż alkohol.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja twojego starego bardzo lubię, i to jest w swoim rodzaju morowy typ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na człeka tak ledwo ledwo zakrawasz, jakbyś go naprędce i od biedy jeno zmałpował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego muszę rozumieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prześwietna sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na twarzy jej zjawił się wyraz przestrachu i rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On trzyma, a ty zrzuciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, dogodził mu, jak się należało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba dużo czytałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce ci się ruszać nogami?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż nas to wszystko obchodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20666980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Gajowiec o tym wszystkim mówił, Cezary zżymał się i protestował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żreć, ile wlezie, i spać, choćby co chwila — nic to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nienormalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem mieć wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę poznać się, wiedzieć z góry jakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Erupcja wulkanu wywołała bardzo duże zniszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niechże jasny pan jedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olsztyn to nie tylko jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Eter to kłamca, i to na krótką metę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, czy nagle nie runie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadła, otworzyła oczy i popatrzyła na niego po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrasta ze mnie powoli, jak roślina, żywię go, napycham go sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę już przyszłe losy mego dzieła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lśniła się od zgrzebnej, zrudziałej na słońcu czystości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I to mnie właśnie boli, że tatuś odjechał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się i wyciągnąłem rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież takie były miękkie, jedwabiste, taki miały żywy połysk!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini było widno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady nieznajomego wiodły właśnie przez wzgórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał się mniej więcej — cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt chyba nie zaprzeczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem on odwraca głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak słyszeli, jak nadchodziła bona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory zmarł jeszcze przed jego przybyciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie muszę im w tym pomagać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał mnóstwo wszelakich książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z moją skłonnością do pisania jest tak, jak z tubą pasty do zębów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie to piękne, seniora — rzekłem w zamyśleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku niemiłemu zdumieniu zauważył, że nie jest sam: miał towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysiedliśmy i przekroczywszy bramę opactwa oo. Franciszkanów, weszliśmy w krużganek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Ala da ołówek, bo trzeba narysować latarnię — będzie ładny obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał jak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz jest spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętała tylko jodły z tamtej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przerzuciwszy ten ciężar na ojca — uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale któż to wykona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę zdać sobie sprawy z odległości, z jakiej je oglądam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z władzami podkreśliliśmy pilny charakter przyjęcia ustawy o służbie cywilnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swoich uczuć dla Wokulskiego pani Stawska nie umiałaby określić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Furman zwrócił na niego białe oczy i coś wybełkotał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w Czechach stanowi potwierdzenie faktu, że rzeczywiście mamy problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowym zadaniem jest zwiększenie mocy wytwórczych europejskich elektrowni oraz rozwój sieci transgranicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to wyjątkowo dobra debata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ha; dobrzy sobie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połowy skorupiaków, mięczaków i innych bezkręgowców wodnych trzeba całkowicie włączyć do wspólnej polityki rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karta praw podstawowych, która uzyskuje moc wiążącą, potwierdza prawa podstawowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rosja jest bez wątpienia naszym niezwykle ważnym partnerem gospodarczym i strategicznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pamiętajmy o tym, wyrażając tę satysfakcję, która dzisiaj na tej sali panuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę potrzebny jest poważny kryzys\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto występują tu zagrożenia dla zdrowia, których nie da się oszacować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to właśnie jest sednem propozycji pobierania odcisków palców od Romów, również nieletnich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowaliście państwo, że głosowanie nad tym drugim wnioskiem nie odbędzie się w tym tygodniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musimy działać krok po kroku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja druga uwaga dotyczy krajów partnerskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Fundusz Dostosowania do Globalizacji został utworzony, aby reagować na takie sytuacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znudził mnie już Wokulski swoją rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następstwa są oczywiste\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to postęp w dziedzinie bezpieczeństwa jądrowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim odczuciu powtórne referendum w Irlandii stanowi niebezpieczny precedens dla całej społeczności europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U podstaw europejskiej polityki leży polityka spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy szerszej perspektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z większością twierdzeń zawartych w sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym względzie, intencja była jasna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opel ma kłopoty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To może być!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys gospodarczy temu sektorowi poważnie zaszkodził, a wielu pracowników straciło miejsca pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należycie uwzględniają one zatem interesy zarówno samych przedsiębiorstw, jak i innych zainteresowanych stron\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako przykład podała najpopularniejszy prawicowy portal informacyjny, http\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te przetrzymywane dzieci są szczególnie bezbronne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy firmy naftowe już uzyskały koncesje na taką działalność w Rumunii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu jeszcze inne czynniki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby chciała wziąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę z J.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak niespodzianie, tak znienacka, jak bywa nieraz ze szczęściem lub śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na śniegu spostrzegliśmy duże plamy czerwonej, rdzawej wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego za granicą nie ma tego podobno zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nimi piętrzył się las bukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa będzie z koleżankami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są stłoczone i nie mają tla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pełnia winy może być tylko tam, gdzie istnieje premedytacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam cię, ale koperta jest zaklejona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale się wstydzę przeprosić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie nam dobrze z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie idzie mi tu oczywiście o walkę z logiką…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadła, otworzyła oczy i popatrzyła na niego po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jutro, chcę dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26264388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich gospodarka legła w gruzach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26264391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam zostałem dotknięty klęska powodzi dziesięć lat temu, więc wiem, co to znaczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26264392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie jest dyskryminowany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26264394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy również przygotowani, by wspierać prowadzony pod kierownictwem Afgańczyków proces resocjalizacji byłych bojowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniłaś opony w samochodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — przyznał towarzysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I myślały, że ich dary tak prędko dojechały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj pan na przeciąg — powtórzył uparcie — można czasem kark skręcić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No i przypuszczam też, dzielny człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem pewny, że kłamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie składa się z samych niedziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to coś ważnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szepty zapełniły mały park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko trzeba po kolei powiedzieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszaj natychmiast! — brzmiała gniewna odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz uśmiech zgubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż nas to wszystko obchodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20968667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikomu nie będzie wadził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20968668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani nauczycielka zapytała, ile to pięć razy sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20968669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu człapanie pantofli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20968670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbiegłem na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20968671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona chyba nie jest głodna! — szepnęła Laura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.963,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.638,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.455,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.09,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.351,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.855,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.933,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.855,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.567,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.75,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.907,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.62,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.698,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.926,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wszystko potoczy się dawnym trybem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.926,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położyła swoją rękę na jego ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.963,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym się różni wróbelek? Tym, że ma lewą nóżkę bardziej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez jednego słowa wsiedliśmy do samochodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.687,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ból głowy, drgawki nerwowe, otumanienie, bicie w skroniach, słowem, wszystkie objawy poprzednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W ten sposób całość wypadłaby zbyt poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.105,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym właścicielem miejscowości był Iwan Hornostaj, podskarbi ziemski litewski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.605,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Procesja ta zajęła przynajmniej ćwierć kilometra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.821,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka smutno pokiwała głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.579,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym to wiedział, nie potrzebowałbym was, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fundatorem świątyni był Mikołaj Koniecpolski herbu Pobóg, sędzia ziemski sieradzki, ówczesny właściciel dóbr kaszewickich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak łatwo jednak schwytać mnie, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.638,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęli obaj i to z mojej ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.127,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeden za drugim zaczęli wylatywać z komina różni ludzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.023,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koń, żeby tam biegł najprędzej, zawsze patrzy, gdzie stawia kopyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22705171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.441,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych czasach było ogromnie modne w naszych okolicach pijaństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez minutę, albo dłużej, sterczała ręka z podłogi, poruszając palcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zobaczymy, panno Izabelo: kim ty jesteś i co jesteś warta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się ziemniaki, a nie kartofle!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mieście upał, tu przyjemny chłód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mu za to wdzięczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co miałbym uciekać z więzienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na chwilę pozwoliłem sobie, aby w głębokiej boleści uścisnąć rękę cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tylko go sobie zanotuję!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy wzięłyście ładne chusteczki do nosa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24719942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski z taką uwagą przeglądał album, że żyły nabrzmiały mu na czole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pysznie gra ten facet i muszę zobaczyć go drugi raz...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale należało by pana internować w zakładzie leczniczym dla chorych psychicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rano Maciuś wstaje, Felek leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak cicho i dobrze płynąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili mój przyjacielu, jest twoją i będziesz ją miał kiedy zechcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ono wisi na wstążce jedwabnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wynosi zasiłek opiekuńczy w czasie epidemii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto tu wołał o pomoc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwaczał chłop na swojem kiprostwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nowego dekodera nie pominiesz reklam w telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O trzy kwadranse na siódmą?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor nasunął kapelusz na głowę i szedł, zirytowany, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"moje złote marzenia, o!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im mocniej go przygniesz, tem ci lepiej odskoczy, jak leszczynowy kierz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jest w tem, jeżeli mi pan daruje, że tak powiem, trochę komizmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ależ to żywy Machalski, kiper od Hopfera!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tam chcesz, ważne, żeby działało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź no przerwę, chłopie, daj strunom głosowym odpocząć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz jego nagle spoważniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwiłem się, że niebo jest pełne ciągnących ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie opieraj się, tak doktór rozkazał i ja tak chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary mało co wiedział o tych matczynych wycieczkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dasz mi twoje oczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił, że ma lat siedemnaście - nie, chwila, osiemnaście - i że jest sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24727229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pozwolisz, że się roześmieję z szacunkiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się tłumaczył, pani i tak nie uwierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę dnia, złego snu, gdy zanurzam się w noc, jak w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej jest przestać palić od samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tego chyba nie myślisz na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rzecz się ma z alkoholem w małych dawkach i nikotyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczyli się na ganku, gdzie cuchnęło, ale oni nie zauważali tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo to nie moje — odparła Marta z godnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna „deformacja przestrzenna” przy otwartych oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze znużenia i z ciągłego napięcia nerwów dostałem ataku nerwowej febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko wszakże zamieszka taka się zdarzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A każdy inaczej opisał, jak Maciuś uciekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez szyby dojrzałem wkrótce białe czoło, brwi ciemne, wiśniowe usta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba poszli grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary jest uroczy i komiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając pokręcił się po podwórzu, ale psy z obu stron zachodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję i przepraszam za przerwanie toku rozmyślań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Newton też ułożył swój systemik dedukcyjnie, chociaż powstał on niewątpliwie na podstawie indukcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzbrojony w krótki i ciężki kij czekałem na zdobycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Ty wierzysz we wszystko co przeczytasz w internecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla kogo dobry, dla tego dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewno jej przyszedł do głowy jakiś pomysł — wyjaśnił Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nawet byłem zły i nie podobało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten sok mógłby zaszkodzić pannie Karolinie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On znał każdy labiryncik jej psychiki i rów nocześnie odkrywał coraz nowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko weszła w swój trans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech no pani pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok naocznie sprawdzonego sęka napełnił ich jakąś nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schowali się na centralnej poczcie, w dużej hali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się, idąc ulicą, jak mu się nudziło, w kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne mi się wydało, że mam z chłopakami się gonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On cię bardzo polubił z mojego opowiadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej ani drgnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co robi twój papa? - zapytał, bo lubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20762753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Włoch najlepiej dojechać przez Niemcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle lubię podróżować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu przyszedł z miną pokorną, zbyt pokorną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza nakrywa ją, jak dzwon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracił całą ochotę na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ona to przeczuwa i dlatego boi się stanowczego kroku?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20802533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi raz, leżąc w gaju rankiem, w cieniu drzewa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że to była dzieweczka z chłopcem nie obyta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć się dopiero spuścił, nabrał animuszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz go już włożyć z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostowała się i podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pruli spokojną gładź, a Marek wciąż postękiwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu trzeba dźwigni doradził Matt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czasem dostrzegł, iż chłopczyk i dziewczynka mieli ogromną wartość w oczach pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była widna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż za okrutny pomysł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A kiedyż to będzie? — zapytał, śmiejąc się, Jan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idę… już idę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawo zgoła nie wtrąca się do spraw tego rodzaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za to przywrócił ją setkom tysięcy, a może i milionom ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20814770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważając sanie za środek koła, które opisywać zamierza Jednouchy, Bill postanowił ruszyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są tu cytaty z zeznań świadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła jego wywrócone oczy i połyskujące białka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydał cichy syk, ujął jej dłoń, pociągnął ją w dół i upadła na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzi do szkoły podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko na proch starte, na biały, sypki, chrzęszczący pod stopą miał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie czuję się dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umie zachwalać swój towar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gra świąteczna muzyka, mamy świeczki, jedzenie i fajnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak szła po schodach, jak otwierała drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pomieszczeniu rozległ się lekki pomruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic innego nie zdążył powiedzieć na odlotnem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko trzeba po kolei powiedzieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stanął nagle, tak, jak musi stawać serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyła pierwszy rok chemii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewał dalej jak szalony, wydymając swą maleńką gardziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Króliki wymagają przywiązania, ale potrafią dać w zamian wiele szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — beczał rozbawiony naczelnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stłukę cię na kwaśne jabłko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to fraszka, bo i polityk może być zakochany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że mnie uderzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś jakby krzyknął i uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem, że dawniej czytałem i co mi z tego przyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się wznosiła w górę, to opadała, łącząc komizm z patetycznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewała go się, chociaż rozsądek jej mówił, że nie powinien był przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Test mikrofonu, raz dwa, raz dwa...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wycieńczony; na rękach i nogach całą skórę miał zdrapaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Tomasz aż poruszył się na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień, w którym pan będzie wolny, może jest niedaleki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobiegła do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruszyliśmy ku nim pędem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechby siedziała w morzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulskiemu wyjaśniła się twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie zechcesz ustanawiać całego królestwa żab za moim nieszczęsnym kołnierzem?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci Anglicy są wspaniałomyślnymi przeciwnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielny czyn na wojnie lub w jakimś sporcie zawsze rozpali ich serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj upiekła go mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znowu do biblioteki pojechać, bo mi się materiał kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy już tego dobrego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze tylko było, iż ci górale mieli zwyczaj owijania nóg szmatami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie to dziwne!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie pamiętasz, jak brat jego w kościele obchodził się z nim niegodziwie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jeszcze, czy będę mógł pana uratować, ale przynajmniej spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chcę się uchylać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jagienka znów przyłożyła palec do ust, i po chwili doszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tem gorzej dla niej; czekałem ja także przeszłej niedzieli, dziś na nią kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby pan mi pomagał wiosłować to byłoby dwa grajcary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Interesuję się nim tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze to lepiej, gdy się ma dokoła siebie odważnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, co rozkazać nieposłusznym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie dary zwykle bywają tylko połowiczne...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co rozkaże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25053954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co on myślał, mówiąc te słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałaś jaru, masz jar — rzekł kulawiec, podejrzliwie i ukosem poglądając na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ona sama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Buruburu, ten stary portier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważa członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To honor walczącego proletariatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oglądam telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem grupki schodzą się w mieszkaniach, ale bardzo wcześnie wszystko idzie spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żona nie powinna wiedzieć, że wieczór się nie odbył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo nie chcą słuchać dorośli, ten idzie do dzieciaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się pan woźny nie zgodzi, to niech sam go wyrzuci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spieszyło mi się do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również będę mieć go na oku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czego zaczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak zapominasz, to cała nauka z kary idzie w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mało panu jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżbym zostawił tam, w tej diabelskiej lepiance?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złota nam brakło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie była woda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można oddzielić polityki wobec Syrii od stanowiska wobec Libanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyśmy dopuścili do upadku sektora finansowego, przepadłyby także oszczędności i świadczenia milionów obywateli Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyne punkty, których nie możemy poprzeć, dotyczą granicy wieku dzieci przy pobieraniu odcisków palców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Airbus nie czerpie korzyści z żadnych ukrytych środków pomocowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Realizujemy projekt pilotażowy na Malcie i go oceniamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tworzą oni getta i nierzadko kończą jako członkowie grup terrorystycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy też jednak badać głęboko zakorzenione źródła ekstremizmu i przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia sytuacja greckiej gospodarki wzbudza wiele emocji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mottem pańskiej prezydencji jest \\\"Europa bez granic\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już powiedziałem, przedmiotowe rozporządzenie stanowi część naszego programu upraszczania przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zyski były przejmowane przez sektor prywatny, a straty - uspołeczniane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zobowiązujecie się osobiście włączyć tę sprawę do agendy najszybciej jak to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, musimy zwalczać raje podatkowe, czarne dziury globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to szczególnie ważne w zapobieganiu konfliktom społecznym oraz tworzeniu Służby Działań Zewnętrznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym chciałbym powitać przyjaciół z Japonii!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też powtarzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo licznych ustępstw i przeciwności losu przedłożony wniosek stanowi mały, ale ważny postęp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy przyznać, że Unia Europejska jest w tej kwestii całkowicie zgodna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatyw prezydencji słoweńskiej dotyczących nowego podejścia do polityki sąsiedztwa oraz energetyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy zachęcać do większej osobistej odpowiedzialności, i tym sposobem wszyscy uczynimy postęp jako społeczeństwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak państwo wiedzą, rozporządzenia w sprawie wyłączeń grupowych stanowią ważne instrumenty dla społeczności przedsiębiorców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padło pytanie, czy konstytucja przewidywała większość czterech piątych, czy też nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewien, że nie opowiedziałby się Pan za zjednoczonym europejskim państwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Treść można pozyskać i przechowywać dla potrzeb dochodzenia za pomocą instrumentu nazywanego przejmowaniem danych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym, abyśmy w jak najszerszym kontekście zastanowili się nad skuteczną polityką użytkowania gruntów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za pomocą tego rozporządzenia przyczynimy się również do powstania nowego, uczciwego rynku rolnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy pozwolić się sprowokować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podzielam wnioski wyciągnięte przez sprawozdawcę i dlatego postanowiłem głosować za przyjęciem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem nalegam, aby zebrani tu posłowie jednogłośnie poparli to sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki owadobójcze w wyniku rozpylania ich na rośliny wywierają bezpośredni wpływ na pszczoły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast Libertas mówiła jedno, a teraz odkrywamy, że jest zupełnie inaczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy odpowiednią zdolność polityczną i mamy potrzebę współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilku posłów Parlamentu Europejskiego zapytało, co można zrobić, aby rozwiązać omawiane problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak poprzez grupy międzywydziałowe wszyscy uczestniczymy w tym procesie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28058383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy zwyczaju myśleć, z jak powszechnym problemem mamy do czynienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzę się z uśmiechem na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że tego nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pełne możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście zabieg nie był mi obcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie chcesz, żeby Sara była twoją mamusią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to jest Bernard? — Bernard to jest nakrapiany pies, który zdechł zeszłe go roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wody! — zawołałem, rozglądając się bezradnie wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od kilku lat korzystanie z cmentarza było zabronione ze względu na podtopienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej w lasach przygodnej szukali przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądał, żebym tym razem przyszła na całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary musiał przyznać, że jest sens w tych wywodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cię wygnali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20790280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem naprzód, aby się dowiedzieć, czy skłonny jesteś go przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Damy sobie radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gówno, czy jest sprzeczna, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że niedawno do nas dołączył, ale wydaje mi się, że naprawdę ma potencjał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak go lubią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odkąd ich w ogóle zauważyła, zaczęła popiół i śmiecie zrzucać im na głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszał się, gdy weszła matka, pokojówka Janka i stróż Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dość dziwne powtórzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno tylko niepokoi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I na cóż potrzebna wam była woda? — pytano Nowaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do południa — powtórzył — do południa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie możemy iść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przypomniał sobie i zapragnął mieć blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostali wciągnięci w wiatr, który ciął w wirujące płatki śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utopił spojrzenie szalone od gniewu i męki w twarzy rywala…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil: — Nosisz dzisiaj wstrętne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba użył pan tego wyrażenia w znaczeniu przenośnym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz od początku… — powtórzył ciszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzono w wielu miastach kluby dla dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapewne jedziecie zwiedzić skarbiec królewski? — zapytała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudno: nie jestem tak delikatny jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sługa nie dała zbić się z tropu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą do sklepu i kupują gotowe masło, nie widziały nigdy jak ono powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia stała przy mamie, a mama ją czesała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad nimi wiruje i unosi się „nigdy” i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tylu, tylu latach cieszę się, że śnieg, że biało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kolega Adama, Stach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my, niestety, nie możemy czuwać nad nim w owych chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształty przesuwają się wolno, schodzą i rozchodzą w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła ją łagodnie i znikła w głębi domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaletą bycia twoim sąsiadem jest to, że mam do dyspozycji dwie kuchnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec wręczył mu dziwożonę, a sam skocznie pomknął do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawa jest pięknym miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosła potem drugą i trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyjemnie Maciusiowi, choć nie wie dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka takich pisemnych relacji udało się już zebrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę nic słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed snem zaglądał pod łóżko, czy tam ktoś nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł do „Revue Philosophique”: „Analiza pojęcia przy padku”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pusty brzuszek pęczniał mu w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pogardzał tymi ludźmi, czasem nienawidził ich nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To się tylko tak mówi: „czytam”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten może będzie coś wiedział, może gdzieś zadzwoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli nastawione zegarki dokładnie na tę samą godzinę i byli bardzo punktualni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W intensywnej czerni całują się dwa papierosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca i mówi: — To był telefon z kliniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nawet skończona z pointą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli znowu — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę w kącie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec przyjdzie tu za jakieś pół godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I balon za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w klasie, gdzie są okna, wiedziałem, że tylko do dzwonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zawsze, że on „to” skończy, nie Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, czy pan jest Jakub? — powtórzył Ignacy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to jak starzy przyjaciele, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nikt nie ma racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż by to zliczył!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowak nie robił nam żadnych wymówek po powrocie z cyrku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziłeś już do gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem płacząc, poszła do męża i opowiedziała mu wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontrapunkt Jana Sebastiana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy razem, żeby ją kupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręcili się jeden za drugim wśród suchych kęp, jakby czegoś poszukując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zgadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkole wszyscy ją lubią i nikt jej nie dokucza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie przyszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co mnie to obchodzi! — upierała się żona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi połyskiwały błękitne i czerwone oczy hien i szakali, czekających na swoją kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż wymknie się, pobiegnie na dachy innych kamienic i przepadnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało mi się zupełnie wyraźnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno zbadać, czemu wróciła do domu teściów, nie wiedziała tego sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdziwa pociecha usłyszeć takie słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wjechał kutas w pizdę, jak nóż wjeżdża w masło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr południowy wałęsał się w ciemnościach bez celu jak lunatyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ty nas drugi raz zapowiedziałeś jak my już byliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ściągnął na dół majteczki, śliczne, koronkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabierały sobie konie, wielbłądy, bydło rogate i przede wszystkim niewolników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko dotychczas było serią komedii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nachmurzył się, usta skrzywił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, to na nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bodaj z piekła nie wyjrzał przez wieki wieków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość bliźniego powinna cechować każdego Chrześcijanina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to fałszerz monet, oszust, względnie złodziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierny, mądry pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko nie płacz i nie rób hałasu — zaczęła ją błagać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Arnold Gubernator stanu Kalifornia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież każdy mógł spostrzec, że ona nie pociągnie już długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pozwól mi tylko działać!” — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg jest miłosierny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona jest wszystkim, co posiadam na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już raz to robił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Członek honorowy Polskiego Towarzystwa Akustycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21025844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja też chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło pół roty wojska, otoczyło dwór i zabudowania i zrewidowano wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiecień plecień, co przeplata, trochę zimy, trochę lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzekłem się jej dobrowolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego nie powiesiłeś, tego nie masz — mówi woźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł, że ktoś wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka mi się skarży, że wciąż jej coś ginie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej, w czym mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siadłszy na kubełku wapna, począł obmyślać fortele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to nowe fale ciemności opadały na nich, jak czarny śnieg; wolno prószyła ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wyście to przysłali? — powtórzył staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczynie cię chyba samo nie weźmie za rękę i nie zaprowadzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadanie się miękkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się ciotka w końcu zorientowała, powiedziała: — Emilku, przyjdźcie do mnie z mamusią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadła, chudła z dnia na dzień, a nie sypiała wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozwiązywać mały woreczek ze skóry renifera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr wieje między twoimi włosami, jak między gałęźmi nadmorskich krzaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe, że moja filozofia okaże się w pewnych punktach błędna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jeszcze bardziej je to zachęciło i jeszcze więcej zaczęły dawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach programu rozwoju bibliotek zakwalifikowaliśmy się do tego projektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W celu zdobycia dalszych wskazówek zachęcam do kontaktu telefonicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20999989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaklinanie rzeczywistości i myślenie życzeniowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20999990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uprzątnąć drogę, trupy do wody!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20999991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewka gotowa do samego cesarza lecieć po sprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20999992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dosłyszałem rozkazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20999993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupi osioł wyobrażał sobie, że całą tę cześć jemu się oddaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co ciekawego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się z niej nie wydostałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan pamięta nazwiska wszystkich fabrykantów broni na kuli ziemskiej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli przy tym miny przestraszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co z nimi zrobią współplemieńcy złowrogiego proroka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Koronujemy cię dziś na króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chcąc naukę poprzeć stosownym przykładem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał z fotela najstarszy z uczonych, chemik, siwy staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię taką rozmowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy usłyszałem pańskie zdanie o nim, postanowiłem go poznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spokojnie błyszczała woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie władcą najpotężniejszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żem się tej nocy spuścił równo sześć razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć zegar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie płakała, a potem nie chciała się odezwać ani słowem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zawsze przeczuwałam, że ona czegoś podobnego się doczeka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasne, każda bielizna jest erotyczna, dopóki ona jej nie założy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty musisz się Emilowi podobać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobry jurysta musi być zatem również wytrawnym językoznawcą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa lata awantur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lwy znikły, zanim pierwszy promień zabłysnął na widnokręgu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie miałam towarzyszki ni przyjaciółki — ciągnął dalej głos tajemniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, panienko! — zamruczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na jego uniewinnienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasownik, rzeczownik, spójnik a nie imiesłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólne nieszczęście zbliżyło ich jeszcze bardziej do siebie i umocniło zawartą poprzednio przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzynasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mocząc mu łzami policzki jęła zapewniać, że nie bardzo ją bolało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan nie mierzy wszytskich swoją miarą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę doń i załatwię się prędko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21000814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłeś wtenczas jeszcze mały i może nic o tym nie słyszałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, ale dotyczy to jedynie obecnych poziomów popytu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu podzielę się kilkoma swoimi komentarzami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla podróżujących Europejczyków korzystne może być także urzeczywistnienie jednolitego rynku transportu kolejowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W grę wchodzi przecież zdrowie naszej młodzieży, a koszt ten zwróciłby się z czasem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnia kwestia - dotycząca bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32385058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"podjęli próbę zbliżenia sprzecznych ze sobą opinii wewnątrz Komisji Transportu i Turystyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32871346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, polityka handlowa i polityka rolna mogą i muszą się wzajemnie wspierać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32871347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odniesiemy sukces czy porażkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32871348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza ze wspomnianych uwag dotyczących budżetu odnosi się do źródeł finansowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32871349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykładów jest wiele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32871350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minął rok, a my wciąż czekamy na Radę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem rozedniało zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.404,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęty dziś tekst odzwierciedla formalne stanowisko Parlamentu Europejskiego w pierwszym czytaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście euro jest stabilne zarówno wewnętrznie, jak i na zewnątrz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem mogę powiedzieć, że niewątpliwie powróciliśmy do podejścia wspólnotowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście tworzenie miejsc pracy w Europie jest możliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większa elastyczność nie oznacza większej niepewności - wręcz przeciwnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak również zwrócić uwagę na to, które obszary sprawozdania budzą nasze szczególne zadowolenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inną, pozytywną zmianą jest wzrost liczby przyjaznych rozwiązań, o czym już słyszeliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskutowaliśmy dzisiaj o zamknięciu Guantanamo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowym sprawozdaniu kładzie się nacisk na zapewnianie większych środków małym i średnim przedsiębiorstwom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest ponadto, by imigracja była kontrolowana i zorganizowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Razem natomiast powinniśmy mieć możliwość ochrony przed toksycznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę też podziękować organizacjom z przedmiotowego sektora za ich propozycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pakistan jest państwem, o który my w Europie powinniśmy głęboko się troszczyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie chciałbym wspomnieć o traktacie z Lizbony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre tematy są z punktu widzenia instytucji Unii Europejskiej istotne, inne zaś mniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa nie może należeć do przegranych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie są, ogólnie rzecz biorąc, cele tego wniosku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani z Caritasu sprzedawała świeczki na święta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33172951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"poczekajcie na prezydencję czeską\\t\\t2\\t0\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tpl\\t\\na5b07028cf17ce4ed53363a59819b0d8141ea02183c9f829860ddc00d65bd6587544285c63fd4d4e56791b982d09971572906c6c012423029e46cf13a7dd6c4e\\tcommon_voice_pl_33173075.mp3\\t173f34b6456d1c2fb9346a02cab3af6dad66f5fec9f11a422c494c8b0c044ef1\\tkwestię diety śródziemnomorskiej\\t\\t2\\t0\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tpl\\t\\na5b07028cf17ce4ed53363a59819b0d8141ea02183c9f829860ddc00d65bd6587544285c63fd4d4e56791b982d09971572906c6c012423029e46cf13a7dd6c4e\\tcommon_voice_pl_33173078.mp3\\t16ffe0f41c192ce3ebc808f18644feb07cca253d17189e4f9c024d19dff1d268\\tMyślę, że nie bez kozery nie wspomniał pan w swoim przemówieniu o polityce zagranicznej\\t\\t2\\t0\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tpl\\t\\na5b07028cf17ce4ed53363a59819b0d8141ea02183c9f829860ddc00d65bd6587544285c63fd4d4e56791b982d09971572906c6c012423029e46cf13a7dd6c4e\\tcommon_voice_pl_33173081.mp3\\t172c28a9d34b61871c25103fb4f1aa20e7852c5d957e3977df051a5e3c0b9aa0\\tPonownie wyjaśniam, że po pierwsze, regulamin stanowi, że przewodniczący może udzielić głosu\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33173082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piłka jest teraz wyraźnie po stronie Serbii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33173083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że pomoc finansowa skierowana jest przede wszystkim na sektory węgla i ropy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Armatki, małe samochody, małe wagony poruszane elektrycznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Słuchaj mnie, córko moja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siódma czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ich przyprowadzono, Kali przedstawił im za pomocą bambusa całą niewłaściwość ich postępku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Szwajcarii jest miasto Genewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oba były jednakie, żaden nazbyt długi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadła koło niego i, objąwszy ramieniem jego szyję, ozwała się cichym, melodyjnym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrze inteligencji tępiało i pokrywało się rdzą w chwili wytchnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpadła fala mokrego wiatru i lampa zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś za jeden? — zapytał ptaszek i kiwnął wielkim czubem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wie doskonale, czemu nie mam ochoty iść z panią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W naszym domu pewien staruszek popełnił samo bójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedoświadczonemu chłopcu nie przyszło to jednak na myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby mógł dorwać się do strzelby i ładunków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona myśli, że już śpię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podzielił się jednak pan Tarkowski tymi podejrzeniami z panem Rawlisonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale upokorzenie to powitał radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwo teoretyczne. Z dykty i kartonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach ten tłum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pięknie wyglądałby czerwony dywan na podłodze! — zawołała Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogła leżeć w każdym kuferku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisz list, wyślij pocztą, a wszystko się wyjaśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedtem, dziewicą będąc, tak strasznie się bała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powstrzymała się jednakże w porę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że jak się robi ciepło, to go kuśka swędzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed laty siadywałam tak obok ludzi i zabawiałam ich rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wszakże we wszystkim jest ci powolna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, mój Boże! — wzdychała przy tym w wielkim zachwycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od razu cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21082529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Ewa nie mogłaby tak żyć, jak żyła przed poznaniem Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drukowany jest w dwuch kolumnach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się przecie samo przez się rozumie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dopiero od ciebie zasięgać informacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21083995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on jeszcze wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyznałaby się do tego za Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę tego obłudnego frazesu, tego żargonu impotencji…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cha, cha, cha! — roześmiał się Wierusz, przerywając mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś do szkoły nie poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! — zawołał w stronę obydwu towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyciągnął rękę ku mej papierośnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go uczucie dziwnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był też nieprzytomny tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał się kurczowo świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz najlepiej zrobisz, jak pójdziesz do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznawaliśmy ich po głosie, dzięki czemu mogliśmy sprawdzić ich liczbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wolnym czasie uwielbiam chodzić z przyjaciółmi na spacery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór najwidoczniej siedział na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem pewny, że kłamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten hałas mnie męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goethe jest zdania, że chrześcijańskie słowo „Bóg” jest tylko inną odmianą słowa „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O walce myśleć nawet nie było można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam dla was trzy rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alkohol był jedną z przyczyn kolizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nasza wspólna, święta tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej towarzysze za jej przykładem zerwali po tataraku i gryząc wilgotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielką zaletą onego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnęłam? — zapytała rumieniąc się jak jutrzenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wrażenia po przedwczorajszym filmie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkałem ją raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to włączyć, ale było już włączone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z pociągu nie wolno strzelać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o Europę, to nie zwiedziłam tylko krajów skandynawskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byliśmy nigdy w życiu tacy bogaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i tak jest zaiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego, co przyszedł z portu Churchill i którego wilki zagryzły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie spaliły się też dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko są uczonymi albo wielkimi artystami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znajdowali się blisko gimnazjum, do którego chodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć piękne, duże lustro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może z uduszenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Halszka wzbraniała się, prosząc o zwłokę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze szczególnej ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie bardzo chętnie godzę się na to, ale ulegam prośbom córki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę się znów nareszcie cieszyć, zamknąć oczy: zanurzyć się w spienionej fali życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem korek z butelki, i musiałem teraz wypić wino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do drugiego, za chwilę dowiemy się kto on był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczając, że matki nie umarłyby przed tem ze zgrozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł sobie czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jedziesz może kapkę za szybko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ręka ta zniknęła tylko na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz mniej, raz więcej, ale zawsze tyle, że mogłam zakupić to co konieczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapach był straszny w tem mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy podoficera policji kryminalnej zawisły jak zaklęte na powolnie stąpających czarnych lakierowanych bucikach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy powrócę z życiem, do mego wieńca wawrzynowego przybędzie znowu jeden listek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy warsztacie i wyjąłem obcążki i rylce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wicher przepędzał burzę za burzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rzekł surowo, to w istocie jest bardzo ważna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Globtroter nie musi objechać całego świata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baron się uśmiechnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze więzienie posiadało jedno jedyne, małe okno, wychodzące na podwórze, otoczone podwójnym murem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, servus, dziś wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka mnie nie kocha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyłem, iż byli to chłopi, którzy ładowali na wózki próżne beczki od wina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie się podział człowiek, który mi przyniósł książkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosy mi stanęły dębem na głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny król przysłał powinszowanie i lunetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"że też my zawsze kogoś musimy posądzać o szelmostwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto zgłasza się na ochotnika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzywszy drzwi spostrzegłem, że w pokoju był zmrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i ono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech chłopów w czerwonych czapkach zajętych było ładowaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa, które mówił Zwak, przewiały jakoś ponad moją świadomością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakżebym jego nie miał znać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ale, żebyś dołączał do kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchaj zaś co mówi Tyrteusz: „O Sparto ruń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kiedy puszczę na nich światło, szybko ich schwytajcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poślizgnąłem się i mało co nie spadłem ze skały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął i zaczął się uważnie przysłuchiwać memu opowiadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miej na niego oko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25154244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ona mu powiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niemym zachwycie pochylili głowy, by się przyjrzeć cudnemu kwieciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór najwidoczniej siedział na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani ma wyjątkowe stanowisko, wyjątkowe przywileje na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto jak się te nieprzytomne marzenia ziściły w nieprzytomnym losie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram, mając do pomocy swoje dzikie bestie, był pewny zwycięstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on nie może, dlatego że ja go nie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko pozostała osoba: sześćdziesiąta i piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stała Ela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale czy książki mówią prawdę? — marszcząc brew zapytał pan Ryszard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem wysiadała już z pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie mogą liczyć na pewną dyskrecję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno zawsze mieć pierwszeństwo do ochrony i pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po trafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie ma sensu przekonywać, tłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno było sobie wyobrazić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz uczestniczy w spotkaniach, ale to było dużo, dużo wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiem, ale szeptem i każdemu na osobności…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stołu nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie unoś się — przemówił miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał dużo; szybko, często powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka praca, taka płaca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba iść do klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąż istotnie ani się nie ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tam, tam, za biurkiem, w kącie, pod ścianą!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi smakuje wyciskany sok z jabłek, kiwi i mango.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobra oznaka, ale mnie to bardzo męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawezwany lekarz oświadczył się za natychmiastową operacją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział mi jej równy, głęboki oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił iść do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na ławce, zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo słaby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęliśmy z niego siodło i ciężary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musiał być chyba przyjemny, bo przed samym przebudzeniem uśmiechnęłaś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od sprawy Małkowskiego wieża olsztyńskiego ratusza budzi mieszane skojarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg, który go wiózł, wyjechał wczoraj nad ranem z Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę go wpierw wystawić i obliczyć cenę wraz z karą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś jak pięknie kwitną wiśnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drobnostka, kochany panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ładnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem położył się i patrzył uporczywie w sufit, przez który było widać gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to zdecydowanie zbyt mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne zabawki zawierały małe części łatwo dające się od nich odłączyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznają, że działają wyłącznie w oparciu o intuicję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ceny mleka nałożone na producentów nie pokrywają kosztów produkcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zniwelowalibyśmy w ten sposób różnicę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początku pragnę pogratulować Komisji Europejskiej znakomitego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zwycięstwa dla Chorwacji, Słowenii oraz Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewien, że wspólnymi siłami zdołamy znaleźć rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy dodać trzeci punkt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wreszcie stworzyć wspólną, jednolitą politykę azylową i imigracyjną w oparciu o zasadę solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanujący się parlament nie rezygnuje z tradycyjnego systemu archiwizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże aby nasze działania były skuteczne, musimy wykorzystać wszystkie krajowe dźwignie w perspektywie europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba też podkreślić aktywną rolę regionów europejskich w promowaniu tej strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy złożyć narodowi kubańskiemu, a także rządzącemu tą wyspą reżimowi, realną ofertę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy potrafią pracować dostatecznie szybko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj widać zupełną pasywność wobec możliwości wykorzystania tego wielkiego potencjału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosiłem o udzielenie głosu zanim ogłoszono sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzję te należałoby ponownie rozpatrzyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie trzy instytucje mogą być zadowolone z porozumienia osiągniętego w ciągu zaledwie kilku miesięcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przerwać milczenie naszej Izby na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykład Serbii pokazuje, że skutkiem jest ogromny napływ osób ubiegających się o azyl\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego jest to ważna inicjatywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże w tym momencie istnieje wielkie ryzyko, że są one częścią problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto główne reformy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto bardzo doceniam pozytywną rolę, jaką Turcja odgrywa na Kaukazie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie przypadek Tarika Aziza jest ważny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Promieniowanie radioaktywne nie zatrzymuje się na granicy kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejczycy cenią sobie środowisko naturalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie mobilność zatrudnienia jest środkiem wzmocnienia gospodarczego i społecznego wymiaru strategii lizbońskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają to Państwo w tekście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cierpią one od momentu usłyszenia diagnozy dyspraksji, aż do jej wyleczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele Białorusi powinni być w Unii mile widziani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26320453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku gładkiego przejścia polegamy na współodpowiedzialności Chin\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26406222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że jest to bardzo istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26406223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w mojej opinii im szybciej, tym lepiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26406224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuje ona bowiem wniosek Komisji z września\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26406225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również kodeks karny Jemenu zakazuje karania śmiercią młodocianych przestępców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26406226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywistym problemem jest, jak zostało podkreślone w sprawozdaniu, fragmentaryzacja i niejednolita transpozycja prawa wspólnotowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzywił twarz w grymasie i zaczął się śmiać wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeroko otwartymi oczami patrzała prosto w słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy był ślub?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na przykład — Jędrek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znalazłem nareszcie punkt zaczepienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tylko to aby pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tych wrażeń żadne nie robi specjalnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę coś na kaszel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję dookoła siebie złe, wrogie mi wiry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” To wszystko leżało w niej, jak kłębek nici — splątane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołaliśmy przyjść z pomocą, nieszczęśliwy uległ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cię wygnali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmęczenie po trzech seansach portretowych zniknęło zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie ulęknę się ciebie, o smoku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę z J.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu obraz zaczyna wirować, już znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała najwyżej na lat dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że drzwi nie będą zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mefisto idzie cudownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, teraz jesteś dostatecznie zła, więc możemy roz mawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym poparłem sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzymy w inną stronę, odwracamy się plecami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straciliśmy setki i tysiące hektarów lasów, w szczególności w regionie śródziemnomorskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem jest to obszar, w którym Unia Europejska ma możliwość sprawdzenia się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są wyzwania dla silniejszej Europy i lepszego świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie jak w Pekinie, budynki mieszkalne stoją na drodze budowy olimpijskich obiektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejskie rolnictwo często obwiniane jest jako główne źródło globalnego ocieplenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrożone zostały trzy punkty, i to te najważniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nadeszła pora na naszą mocną reakcję, zanim będzie za późno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budzi moje obawy na chwilę obecną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety w Polsce trwa nagonka na opozycję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszy mnie perspektywa zdania Państwu relacji z oceny umowy o readmisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu ani jego rodzina, ani jego bliscy nie mieli o nim wiadomości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak prawdą jest również, że zupełnie niedopuszczalna jest globalna i zharmonizowana reakcja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, same szkoły chciałyby mieć większą autonomię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli je zainstalujemy, kto za to zapłaci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niechęcią zagłosuję za przyjęciem ostatecznego kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejsza wieczorna debata jest doprawdy interesująca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja powinna przedłożyć odpowiednie alternatywne propozycje zmierzające w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego konieczne jest podjęcie spójnych działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieje się tak zgodnie z wytycznymi strategii lizbońskiej, w celu maksymalizacji rentowności usług pocztowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesłanie to kierujemy do Komisji Europejskiej, by mogła podjąć konieczne inicjatywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postawię to pytanie wszystkim tu obecnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani minister, panie i panowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metody egzekwowania prawa do wycofania się z umowy także zostaną zharmonizowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oskarżona o szpiegostwo, skazana na osiem lat i uwięziona, rozpoczęła strajk głodowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostaje obserwować, w jakim zakresie zostaną wprowadzone w życie nowe środki monitorowania i nadzoru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Buławę trzyma w ręku; z liczby buńczuków można poznać, że to hetman wielki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to konieczne, by przezwyciężyć przeszkody istniejące na szczeblach krajowym i unijnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrożenie odnośnych rozwiązań zajęło państwom członkowskim pięć lat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest przecież Europol\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoczy nas solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A co z treścią nauczania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem to hańba\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem koncentrujemy się na monitorowaniu jej prawidłowego stosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym prosić Komisję, aby odpowiedziała na ten apel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, to kapitał jej jest winien wszystkie zrabowane bogactwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41679938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłem to z dwóch powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się spełnią przeznaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem podobny do mokrej szmaty, do psów po deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładziono mu na czoło monetę: zawsze poznawał, którą stroną leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być ciekawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję — odparł, pokrywając zdumienie wymuszonym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapewne jedziecie zwiedzić skarbiec królewski? — zapytała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe, że moja filozofia okaże się w pewnych punktach błędna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden plus, że można z nim iść do kawiarni i pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — zapytałem, ślizgając się spojrzeniem po rozlewisku wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie myśleć o tak błahym zdarzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok urodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te trzy książki czytał na zmianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił: — Takie to porządki, że wszystko leży ułożone i niczego nie można znaleźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytywana o to, odpowiadała wymijająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno uderzenie polanem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi przykro, że ludzie przeze mnie cierpią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst opracowany na podstawie: Antoni Lange, W czwartym wymiarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powitał ich śmiech: wszyscy byli trochę podchmieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa potrafiła być nadzwyczajna tylko w sobie samej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zbyt wolno i dlatego był szczęśliwy, że umie pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarka nie nakręcisz, to stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strachu i wściekłości bełkotał: — Tylko ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd, jak i dokąd ma uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sięgało w samo dzieciństwo, ta niemożność urwania w środku, zatrzymania się, skończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieważne, na ja kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero szacunku dla wykształconego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwinął lewą rękę w trąbkę i podstawił pod oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś jak pięknie kwitną wiśnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może to tylko robi zwariowane zachowanie się Emila przy niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież, u licha, mam prawo zajmować się kościołem świętego Barnaby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesięć po siódmej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam z nią zawsze, mimo że miałam ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle sygnał urwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W imieniu Boga i proroka jego Mahometa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z rozpaczą załamała dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem wysiadała już z pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Snadź powzięła nowe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do stołu i — nie patrząc na pole operacyjne — ujął delikatnie jelita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli ci wszyscy, którzy zaledwie tydzień temu słuchali moich wierszy i dziwnych przygód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko wszakże zamieszka taka się zdarzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę sobie w świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tłumaczyłam ci już sto razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie zaczęło świtać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiłem wygarnąć po nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chciałabyś być moją dziewczyną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękki, biały jak skóra olbrzymiego niedźwiedzia z pod bieguna lodowatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ciągu dnia wpadnie przez szpary w kamieniach jakikolwiek pobłysk światła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem książkę ze stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tylko tego nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są na świecie rzeczy, które nie mogą się wyzwolić same od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na policzkach studenta ukazały się okrągłe czerwone plamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przykucnąłem w przeciwległym kącie i czułem, że skóra moja powoli się rozgrzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego patrzy się pan we mnie taki zdumiony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrąca go ze spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To wszystko jest omyłka, straszliwa omyłka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy syknął jak szatan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręczę, że mu się to wszystko tylko śniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pani ma choćby najmniejsze zaufanie do mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysunęła się jeszcze mocniej i przytuliła się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tajemnicza trwoga powstrzymała mnie: nie zastukałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22984999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny, który przeciwnie głęboko był tem dotknięty, to był on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Angelina chciała się zerwać, zatrzymałem ją siłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo już ona tu siedzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieprzytomny prawie utkwiłem wzrok na jakiejś malowanej postaci mnicha w sąsiedniej kaplicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odrętwieniu zmysłów świadomość moja była zdolna pochwycić parę słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten krok było jeszcze dosyć czasu, gdy zawiodą wszystkie inne środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się wywołać w pamięci jego zjawę, lecz mi się nie udało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przez całe życie cierpią brutalne udręczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starzec probował dawać jej znaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż w świecie może być ważniejsze od wolnej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem naraz zmieniała postępowanie względem Jaromira, udając, że nagle znajduje w nim upodobanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ból wcisnął mi się w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sceny wydają mi się fantastyczne jak pod działaniem opium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może też przeczuwa w nim kabalistę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujrzałem, jak nieprzytomny spoglądał w próżnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego zegar ścienny nie cyka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzą jak plewy w wichrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"krew mi uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy dawała im również co jeść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem do koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zszedłem na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22985055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał na sobie czarny płaszcz i czarne rękawiczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się człowiek spieszy, to się diabeł cieszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby chciało mnie ostrzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jej koleżanki opowiadały mu o jej pretensjach aktorskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za medalion? — zapytała nagle, sięgając ręką ku mej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się jak ryba w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to wyłączyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gęstwinie bielały ściany kaplic i małych zabudowań mongolskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak by wyglądało, lecz to sprawy nie wyjaśnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, bo jakże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budził ją każdy ruch chłopca, jego chrapanie albo mowa przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do fortepianu dziwnie miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił pisać o morzu, o jechaniu okrętem, bo uważał, że to też była wycieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to bardziej oddalali się od śródmieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwą musiała być siła, która przeszła przez ten łachman człowieczy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie jednak musiałem czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanalizowałem drogą alchemiczną wodę przepojoną fluidami tej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja na to pozwolić nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złota nam brakło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli oszczędni w gestach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dżungla oddaje to, co zabrała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tam ładna ślizgawka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za martwą ciszą równika….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem, by się obejrzeć za siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wbrew zakazowi usiadłem na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nim pan przyjechał, ja zawsze wiedziałam, z którego miasta są goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą — kiedyś nie było też alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była parna, księżycowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła z plaży w dziewczynkowatej sukni, którą nosiła, gdy miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znać było, iż utrzymuje ją schludnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i podnieśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz w górze, raz w dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za wykończenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy Andrzeja nagle ożywiły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno róże miłości najchętniej przyjmują się na grobach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmaite mogłyby być sposoby rodzenia się, umierania i odradzania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź ze mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same przeszkody i nic ponadto!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już jest prawie jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mówił o sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spij, smarkaczu! Zobaczył, że zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obyśmy wszyscy żyli dobrze i zgodnie z sobą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polała się krew z ust moich, przeto odchodzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wojna nareszcie się skończy?! — zawołałem głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocie łby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, do jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Coo? W jaki sposób wiedziałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z nich było dwóch żołnierzy, w drugiej — trzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby ci było przyjemnie? — To bym była zadowolona, że poszłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie chcę — rozpłakała się dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była jedyna myśl, która mi tańczyła w głowie, wypierając wszystkie inne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy dopiero ludzie przyznają, żeś ty szlachcic, równy innym...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to mistrz zmarszczył brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Człowiek przechodzi tedy jak cień“ przypomniały mi się słowa, które kiedyś czytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się zgadza, no to dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu nie walisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walenty umie robić sieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapuję się na dach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przodzie nic nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"albo: chcesz mnie, czy nie chcesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodź pan natychmiast, aby nie powstało jakieś podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chciałabyś być moją dziewczyną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała mnie wściekłość nieprzytomna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kto może być ta piękność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jej nawet pośrednictwem Wokulski nabył weksle Łęckiego i srebra panny Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jeżeli mama nie żyje, więc jej fotografia też powinna być trochę wytarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszystko mi jedno w rezultacie, gdzie osiedli się ten młody człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to już było ich rzeczą, nie moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie wieleby nam z niego przyszło, gdybyśmy się sami protegować nie potrafili!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co bądź, zanim wpadnę w obłąkanie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta uprzejmość, do której nie nawykli warszawiacy, już w przysionku zrobiła wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję za to głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I od dzieciństwa mieszkał w Wilnie, wielkim mieście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie chodzi mi o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko przeciw niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to się z wami dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, to go nie minie...“ Po chwili ogarnął go jeszcze czarniejszy pesymizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan dobrodziej nie jest jego krewny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysięgnę, że pan jest chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest chyba ciężko umierać, kiedy się nie umiera samemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wreszcie wyszukał jej męża, odpowiedniego znakomitości domu Łęckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego tyle przewracania się i podnoszenia, tyle biegu i zmęczenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, że musi nauczycielce dopomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, co rozkazać nieposłusznym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drugi: „Różne plany, gdybym znów był królem“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego on chce od niego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów dawno nie pisałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marek często chodził na piesze wędrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co to panu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wierusz odprowadzał chorą materię już ku palcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Połączenie dokonane — rzekł opuszczając rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilowy zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze delegat podpisał w księdze więziennej pokwitowanie, że odebrał Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostowała się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem o parę kroków przed nim i zacząłem go usypiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje, kopalnie, tartaki i przedsiębiorstwa okrętowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był zły obraz, kicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głowę zawracasz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż nie zrozumiałem ani słówka z tego, co mi mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziecko teraz było ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straciłem władzę zmieniania przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepło, nie za gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O parę kroków przed nami zalśniła brylantowymi blaskami laguna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kim lubisz być, zbójem czy policjantem? — Lubię być policjantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Władca świata” znikł nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała dużo koleżanek, nie miała przyjaciółek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie rozumiem, co do mnie mówisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął kaganek ze stołu i oświetlił twarz Konrada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ilu was tam jest? — ozwała się niespodzianie dziwożona z wnętrza torby żebraczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobrze, bo chodzi przecież o zdrowie ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja przygotowała trzy projekty mandatów na potrzeby negocjacji ze Stanami Zjednoczonymi, Kanadą i Australią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na tym etapie możemy tylko spekulować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepaść pomiędzy naszymi kompetencjami a naszymi zasobami finansowymi nigdy nie była tak wielka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam uwagę na sytuację kobiet zatrudnionych w więziennictwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas tego wieczornego posiedzenia, centrolewica wydaje się właśnie to czynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem naprawdę zadowolony z reakcji, ale chciałbym dodać wyjaśnienie do jednego punktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa podstawowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprowadzimy do referendum i wykończymy ten nieszczęsny i haniebny traktat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26090916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy jeszcze bardziej zaangażować się w prowadzenie prac w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto jest za, zechce podnieść rękę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne działania nie mogą zagrażać danym osobowym poszczególnych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chodzi raczej o rozwiązanie polityczne, co już podkreślano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu zwiększanie świadomości w Grupie Socjalistycznej ma tym większe znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Póki co wciąż jednak temat ten powraca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy postępować uważnie, aby nie wpaść w tę pułapkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy to winni pszczołom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska i Europejczycy wiedzą, że ich głównym zmartwieniem jest kryzys\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważne informacje dla ochrony zdrowia i życia mieszkańców Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chrześcijaństwo i inne wyznania są ruchami pokojowymi, podobnie jak Unia Europejska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy badania tego rodzaju docierają do mass mediów, naturalnie budzą obawy konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem regularna ocena sytuacji na rynku wewnętrznym usprawni jego funkcjonowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W imię bezpieczeństwa musimy posiadać kilka niezależnych od siebie źródeł energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecia, zła wiadomość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sankcje nie wystarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jest wręcz przeciwnie - obywatele proszą o czyny zamiast słów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie utrzymujemy w mocy zabezpieczenia, aby zapobiec wszelkim nadużyciom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma innej drogi przyjęcia traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ustąp, skończ z rozlewem krwi, stań przed wymiarem sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy cokolwiek z tego jest konieczne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W swojej rezolucji Parlament Europejski wskaże metody, które uznaje za właściwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od jakiegoś czasu z uwagą śledzimy rozwój wydarzeń w Gruzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością nie mogę opowiedzieć się za tym ustępem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to je chcę wyrazić, wraz z innymi ofiarami wojny na Bałkanach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest nim rzeczywiste nieposłuszeństwo i opór, które doprowadzą do obalenia barbarzyńskiego wyzysku samego kapitalizmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy poprosić drugą stronę o wykonanie swoich zadań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiemy, połączenie świata biznesu i uczelni wyższych jest już od pewnego czasu faktem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"System został jest do naszej dyspozycji i możemy z niego oczywiście korzystać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26091356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, zostanie to poprawione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształty przesuwają się wolno, schodzą i rozchodzą w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy czasu cze kać na wyniki laboratoryjnej socjologii czy ekonomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc przyznaje pan, że w praktyce musi się uczynić wybór? — Jest się zmuszonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz od początku… — powtórzył ciszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedno z podstawowych dzieł starszego okultyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od momentu powstania gimnazjum zdobyliśmy także wiele doświadczeń pracując z młodzieżą gimnazjalną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już nie posiada ani grosza własnego majątku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr wieje między twoimi włosami, jak między gałęźmi nadmorskich krzaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczyłoby sił na gonitwę, sanki, łyżwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do włączenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sama, co u Emila na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciśnienie ustępowało, jak powietrze z dziurawego balo nu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy razy na dzień byłem świadkiem ceremoniału ablucji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siadłszy na kubełku wapna, począł obmyślać fortele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuś się! — pisnął kulawiec i pięścią powahał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie je składam w ofierze, o piękny, połyskujący płomieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ozwij się, ozwij! — powtórzył z kolei Podlasiak, tym samym słowom nadając odcień modlitewny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko weszli do pokoju, usiadła na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kobieta jest stokroć piękniejsza i bardziej wyrafinowana, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich staraniach uzyskałem miejsce drugiego nauczyciela w niższym zakładzie naukowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim obiedzie chyba podziękuję za deser.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja na to pozwolić nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanalizowałem drogą alchemiczną wodę przepojoną fluidami tej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień przeciął oświetlony prostokąt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z moich ludzi padł trupem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat zadania szkolnego: „Opisać wycieczkę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagroda przyznawana jest jedynie za tytuły przetłumaczone na język polski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech! — odpowiedział kulawiec, ukazując bez potrzeby zresztą trzy palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Samo się bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na Wyspę Cmentarną? — zapytałem, zajmując obok niej miejsce w gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko po to, aby nic nie słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię muzykę klasyczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dni rozłąki jakże gorzkie, jakie złe są!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była parna, księżycowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już koło piątej po południu, gdy otworzyłem ociężałe powieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powinieneś być w salonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kulawiec zaśmiał się ochryple stłumionym śmiechem, który podkreślił udatność i pożywność smakowitego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli wszyscy, wszyscy, wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To też nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia przyszedł policjant z wielkim niebieskim papierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To trup — oświadczyłem po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, jakie spotkania miałam na dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie nam dobrze z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie idzie mi tu oczywiście o walkę z logiką…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął się mord i rabunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór milczał uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sobie przechodzi jeden dzień po drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona przebiegła obok niego, myśląc, że zajęty bójką nic nie widzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popołudniowe cienie z wolna gromadziły się pomiędzy drzewami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła ją łagodnie i znikła w głębi domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umawiała się z różnymi chłopcami, dawała się czasami całować; bez przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystrzelił Maciuś w powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłaci pan za to karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj, aż on wróci na spoczynek… a potem: jeden celny strzał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałam się pomacać trochę fotografowi z przeciwka i zdjęcia już są.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zerwał się jak raniony jeleń, pełen rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groza położenia wytrzeźwiła go od razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyłem, iż pocierała bezustannie czoło dłonią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewo stało w cieniu domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś śmierć tu królowała, ruiny i zgliszcza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem to nieraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za wszystko można być wdzięcznym, gdy zbrodniarz wstrzymuje swój zbrodniczy cios.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedział nastroszony, jak stary, siwy kruk i trząsł się ze złośliwego śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale trudno to było ścierpieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam u siebie całą butelkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym to wiedział, nie potrzebowałbym was, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stara kramarka z placu targowego kroczyła ku nim z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki sam atak zdarzył się ubiegłej zimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam zaczyna się ulica Toledańska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeden ruch, ani jeden dźwięk nie był odpowiedzią naszemu wezwaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestże to smutne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do znanego producenta trafia trzech młodych: reżyser, scenarzysta i operator.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem przyszła mi myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mogę zapewnić, że ci ostatni przyjmowali nas „cokolwiek“ kwaśno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś blady, jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może kto nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy prosiliśmy was może, abyście przybyli do Wenecji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę cię też długo nudzić, puszczę sobie kilka razy dymek i uciekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stali wokół stołu z tępem, baraniem wejrzeniem, zdumieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22204261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie ocalał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośrodku widniał obszerny i okazały pałac bez dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział do mnie z zamkniętymi oczami «Przynieś swój pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrzy są moi gospodarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o białego ogiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa te rozciągają się na wszystkie dzieci, bez żadnego wyjątku i bez żadnej różnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gniewa się pan? — uśmiechnął się kapitan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś spoza płóciennej ściany namiotu bardzo silnie trącał mnie w bok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś ty nigdy nie udawała niczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego, co przyszedł z portu Churchill i którego wilki zagryzły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A skąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, jak ona, nie tańczył z takim wdziękiem walca, oberka, mazura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka praca, taka płaca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien był się cieszyć, jak gdyby się po raz drugi urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał jej mruczenie bulgocące cicho w gardle, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok inna tarcza z lwem rozkraczonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd się tu wzięły skały pierwotne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uszczelniliśmy je gałęziami, umocowawszy kamieniami i przysypawszy grubą warstwą śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko krowy rodzą cielęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na ławce, zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko jedno — machnął obojętnie ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byl zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nakazuje prawo puszczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś spojrzał smutnemu królowi prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o Europę, to nie zwiedziłam tylko krajów skandynawskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe wygięte nozdrza odchylały się przy oddechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W „pańskiej” Polsce… — zaczął mówca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech zobaczą salę balową, wydeptaną przez słonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekanie przyprawiało go zawsze o lekki bół brzucha i potrzebę oddania moczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest gryzoniem, ale gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka znowu na jego wyznanie — długo, tęsknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno tylko niepokoi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie strony licytują się w obojętności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — odparła dość krzykliwie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwinął lewą rękę w trąbkę i podstawił pod oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ciekawością bezosobową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z naszych nikt nie był zabity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu konstatuje fakt i zaznacza jego objawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko na proch starte, na biały, sypki, chrzęszczący pod stopą miał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli łagodnie i lekko pijani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękki! — zawołała, omal nie płacząc ze szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwy człowiek pracuje sprawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O co chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz z tym wszystkim koniec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed świtem mróz brał coraz większy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni na skrawku przestrzeni bez wyjścia wobec zalewającego żywiołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczu jej najbardziej mi właśnie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gniewa się, że się pomyliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego; jest pan wychowankiem miasta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są narody czyste i są brudne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lipcowe słońce przypiekało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczyłoby sił na gonitwę, sanki, łyżwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Allach mnie ukarał, żem go wyzwał i kusił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobyłam tu rzecz stokroć cenniejszą dla mnie od złota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wszystkich coś szwankuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się ciotka w końcu zorientowała, powiedziała: — Emilku, przyjdźcie do mnie z mamusią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brunatny księżyc pełzał po zboczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczynie cię chyba samo nie weźmie za rękę i nie zaprowadzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwagi te mogą się wydać niektórym nie na czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż z tym dzieckiem, adoptowanym przez Rosjan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie używałabym takiego określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój ojciec oszczędził to na czas, gdy się obudziliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że mineta o wiele przewyższa jebanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krztusił się, dławił, ślinę i włosy połykał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistycyzm, klasycyzm i romantyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścieżki wyszedł na szosę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamyślili się nad tym, co należy uczynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak się zdaje, jest czym chwycić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma większe Gerwazy, Scyzoryk czy wała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuścił tedy trochę z tonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21107091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21188548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara usiadła na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21188549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oho, potknął się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21188550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem oglądnął wyłożony kamieniami brzeg i trawnik poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21188551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż nie, trzeba przyznać, nie tak znowu dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21188552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwycił strzelbę i wypalił w kierunku odgłosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W krawacie szpilka z wielkim brylantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Które to figle kształcą i piczę i pytę:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Przysięgam, że mu nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Nel spojrzała na niego ze strachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczór robił się beznadziejny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina pierwsza czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Smainowi chodzi teraz o to, by wydostać z Egiptu żone i dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny był balet w kolorach ogni bengalskich i żywe obrazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Zdaje się, że o pokoju nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21277908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wbrew rozsądkowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21285742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zresztą sądzisz, że człowiek koniecznie musi być szczęśliwy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21285743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie pisnął słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21285744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należy nigdy ufać mężczyznom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21285745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie podniósł się z łoża, odszedł od Zosieńki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21285746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje ten batonik?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto skierował okręt ku niegościnnym wybrzeżom Alaski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru, ludzie dobrzy, do jaru! — zawołał z zapałem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój Boże, jak wąska jest via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem nadmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los smutny odniósł walne zwycięstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, że właśnie postąpilibyście tak, a nie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończeniu nauki nie mogłem wytrzymać w domu, a jednocześnie nieznośny był mi gość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za obraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile lat miała najstarsza osoba na świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda była chyba jeszcze gorsza niż w dniu poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On by chciał, żebyśmy czekali tysiąc lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjechali za granicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korytarze są puste, kroki rezonują, jakby szło dziesięciu łudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaś podasz mi kielich trucizny, działającej jak piorun.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym był na środku tamy, nadbiegła druga fala powodzi i rozstrzaskała się o belkowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zawsze jeździłem na nartach, ale może w tym roku spróbuję na snowboardzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieokreślone, ale pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu przestał dlatego, że Emil przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie Boże itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, zgniecie mu żebra, zdruzgoce klatkę piersiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po trafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj mi odejść, daj mi odejść — prosiła go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może jest to strach o własny portfel, jak niektórzy próbują zauważyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, muszę opisać, co działo się wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajko mądrzejsze od kury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kto ci bronił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt ciężko względem niej zawiniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto służyć i wyładowywać siłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomyślą, że człowiekowi przykro i boi się, że panią rozgniewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radek sam wyglądał jak obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie tylko ryzykuję tę podróż na północ, do twego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo to nie moje — odparła Marta z godnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór! — poprawił go niewczesny kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo dziś jest pierwszy śnieg, a wy nie uważacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek ma pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ją przywitał, nie miał już ochrypłego głosu i cały czar znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie przypuszczasz, kto padł ofiarą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nocy miał sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd się pan teraz wybiera? — zagadnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W takim razie — odpowiedział cicho — poniósłbym porażkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech zobaczą salę balową, wydeptaną przez słonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kładziemy się… jest nas sto lub jeszcze więcej… i tworzymy czworobok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał dużo; szybko, często powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie na tym polega demokracja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas rzeczywiście będzie można od nas żądać przedstawienia danych wchodzących w zakres kompetencji Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosimy o dokonywanie rozróżnienia między pustymi hasłami a rzeczywistością, między populizmem a odpowiedzialnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz proszę zacząć mierzyć czas mojej wypowiedzi w sprawie absolutorium w odniesienia do transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tunezja rozwija się gospodarczo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, dodatkowe zaostrzenie paktu stabilności i wzrostu nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli będą pływać tylko z połową dopuszczalnego ładunku, koszty transportu będą zbyt wysokie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już mówiłem, głosowałem przeciw i będę to robić dalej tu i teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto skorzysta na traktacie lizbońskim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce pan większej biurokracji, ale ja nie chcę żadnej biurokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"niewłaściwe wykorzystanie funduszy Europejskich, zacofanie i przemoc na ulicach, ksenofobia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia suwerenności nie pójdzie w niepamięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do przekazania tego typu wiedzy nie potrzeba dużych nakładów finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To publiczne złożenie podpisów uświadomi europejskim obywatelom znaczenie europejskich przepisów prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26153475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budżet dla regionów Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stoi w sprzeczności ze wszystkim, za czym opowiada się Belgijska Partia Socjalistyczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosowanie nanomateriałów zmusiło nas do zajęcia się tym zagadnieniem ponownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musi Pan kazać mnie wyprowadzić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem rodzi się wtedy, gdy tajemnice, zamiast pozostać wyjątkiem, stają się regułą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę, że na te kwestie zwróci się uwagę w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska i Rosja są partnerami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardzo odważna i niezależna kobieta i muszę przyznać, że przygotowała świetne sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, ten pomysł został odrzucony przez państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasta powinny być także inteligentne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ważne jest, by w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym krokiem musi być przyznanie również urlopu ojcowskiego, byśmy mogli zapewnić prawdziwe równouprawnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może wciąż będzie pani miała szansę zaradzenia temu problemowi w najbliższej przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie można wówczas połączyć oba wymogi i skorzysta na tym cały system danego państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wstępie chciałabym podziękować Parlamentowi za bardzo jasny sygnał, jaki wysłał tutaj dzisiejszego wieczora\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskazuję na tą generalną poprawność, ale także na obszary występowania istotnych błędów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to w szczególności akumulatorów, które nadal stanowią najdroższą część\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla Europejczyków, proszę o tym pamiętać, ważny jest każdy wymiar współpracy europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwrócę tu uwagę na niektóre z nich - na regulację i zrównoważony rozwój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze z nich dotyczy tego, że projekt i wytwarzanie produktu musi spełniać obowiązujące wymagania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Technika przekształcenia nie ogranicza prawodawcy bardziej niż tradycyjny sposób wprowadzania zmian do aktu prawnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest to, co mówi uczciwa Padania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast witać nas z radością, witano nas podejrzliwie, co było irytujące dla wiele osób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałabym skorzystać z tej okazji i pogratulować jej tej inicjatywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu mówców poruszyło dziś w tej Izbie bardzo poważne tematy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26175637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety nowoczesne technologie informacyjne i komunikacyjne odgrywają znaczącą rolę w szerzeniu groźby terroryzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze partie co śmielszych przechodzą przez murek i wsiąkają w miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę! — zawołał Krzysiek zarumieniony z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jedno, co śpiewał poeta, było prawdą czystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano krzyknął: — Marysiu! Otwarła oczy, zanurzone w śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje czekanie jest napięte i wytężone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego spotkania można było coś niecoś skorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ów woreczek był dla Filipa prawdziwym skarbem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzbrojony w krótki i ciężki kij czekałem na zdobycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani z tej, ani z żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Derkacz — rzekł chrapliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogłam opierać się dłużej: przyszedłeś jak przeznaczenie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Emil nigdy nie wybierał Zosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień w klasztorze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Widzę to, widzę to” — powtarzałem sobie w myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle strach i boi się do niej podejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stołu nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcierać lekko na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzenie firmy to nie bułka z masłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz okryła się rumieńcem, źrenice rozszerzyły się radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez kartki meldunkowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładziono mu na czoło monetę: zawsze poznawał, którą stroną leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł ręką rozpalone czoło, nowy dreszcz go przeleciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dotrzymam jej wiernie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja zaczęła być zajmującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygotowania skończone — rzekł, wstępując w obręb koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój pan takiej wędliny nie robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co tam słychać u sąsiadów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczotka jest na dole w izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę głosić nowych zasad moralnych ani też obalać porządku społecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę go wpierw wystawić i obliczyć cenę wraz z karą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na całe życie dość mam tej jednej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie do końca są w swoim środowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był sam, to by mu się nudziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie już nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wy daje się, że już nigdy nie można się będzie stamtąd wydobyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część zginęła w boju, część siedzi w obozie dla jeńców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram, mając do pomocy swoje dzikie bestie, był pewny zwycięstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to być kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner przyniósł lody i trzy grube, okrągłe wafle, we tknięte w usta lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na usta wybiegł uśmiech zadowolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno róże miłości najchętniej przyjmują się na grobach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz być tym i tym, albo tam i tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on wcale inaczej nie myślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał się kurczowo świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej, ruszaj się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź ze mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągał ramiona, mruczał, prychał, wyginał kręgosłup jak łuk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzena zatrzymała się kilka metrów wcześniej i patrzyła w dal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt by ode mnie nie przepisywał przykładów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same przeszkody i nic ponadto!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła, patrząc w ziemię, i wydawała się bardzo zasmucona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym słowem gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za rozpaczliwa posucha bieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczał przez chwilę wysokim falsetem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była od niego o dwa lata starsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcierać lekko na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy zwrócić się do trybunału konstytucyjnego lub komisji wyborczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w Strefie Gazy osiągnęła punkt krytyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję wszystkim mówcom za ich bardzo pozytywne wystąpienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna część przedmiotowego sprawozdania wyklucza możliwość podjęcia wspólnych decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne znaczenie ma także propozycja ustanowienia Europejskiego Roku Zdrowia Psychicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katastrofa w Czarnobylu pokazała nam znaczenie zaawansowanego systemu informacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak właśnie postrzegam działania chroniące dzieci korzystające z nowoczesnych technik informacyjnych, zwłaszcza Internetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.116,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować również za uregulowanie w trakcie tej prezydencji kwestii europejskich partii politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udało mu się uprościć nadmiernie skomplikowany i biurokratyczny wniosek Rady, poprzez wprowadzenie nowych poprawek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dysponujemy Centrum Technicznym i Naukowym, które prowadzi analizy i klasyfikację nowo wybitych sfałszowanych monet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Komorach nie wyładowywano ryb na ląd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udało nam się opracować dobry tekst\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konferencja ministerialna Euromed w sprawie migracji odbędzie się w listopadzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba wspomnieć, że jak dotąd przeciwko WikiLeaks nie wszczęto postępowania karnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większa pomoc rozwojowa w Afganistanie przełoży się przede wszystkim na bezpieczeństwo nas samych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadam się za przedłużeniem funkcjonowania wszystkich programów edukacyjnych dla młodzieży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"człowiek człowiekowi wilkiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rządy krajowe są silnymi instytucjami, posiadającymi wiele uprawnień, są władzą publiczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogą być też kontrproduktywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta Unia i ten Parlament zajmują zbyt ideologiczne stanowisko podczas rozważania różnych opcji energetycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraz z pogorszeniem się warunków gospodarczych musi utrzymywać się presja na bilanse bankowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmuje ona zniesienie wiz dla obywateli gruzińskich, przywrócenie połączeń pocztowych i inne pozytywne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś wiele krajów wstępuje na drogę procesu demokratyzacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo europejskie jest bardziej zjednoczone, zaś mobilność wyraźniejsza, niż się powszechnie sądzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dokładnie to samo powiedział nam pan w czerwcu zeszłego roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam jednak, że należy wyraźnie określić obowiązki i uprawnienia tej grupy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając to wszystko na uwadze, moja grupa zagłosuje oczywiście za przyjęciem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy pilnie dokonać identyfikacji obszarów, które są zbytecznie uregulowane i przepisy takie wyeliminowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja przywiązuje wielką wagę do pełnego i prawidłowego stosowania tej dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy ją definiować wciąż od nowa, mając zawsze na uwadze ostateczny cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy wspólnotą szanującą prawo jako jeden z fundamentów naszej tożsamości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęta rezolucja obejmuje dobre środki niezbędne w kontekście bieżącego poważnego kryzysu w tym sektorze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw pozwolę sobie wyrazić ubolewanie z powodu braku reprezentacji Rady w tej ważnej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona środowiska naturalnego jest jednym z priorytetów Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że będzie wiele inicjatyw i że Komisja udzieli im swojego poparcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze ostatnia uwaga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem moja odpowiedź będzie rzeczywiście bardzo krótka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić mi krótko przypomnieć państwu jedną rzecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działalność Komisji została przedłużona o kolejny rok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27960355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywileje i ciężary idą ze sobą w parze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamąciło się w głowie, mignęło przed oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił głowę, bo słońce świeciło mu w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak by wyglądało, lecz to sprawy nie wyjaśnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zastępowali tego gwarą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością oczekuję przyszłego poniedziałku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No mam nadzieję, że jest w dobrym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, teraz mu wbiję igłę do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A widzę wyraźnie, jakby wczoraj dopiero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz pan! — przerwała mi, wskazując na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziła się jeszcze, gdy spała, to znaczy, nie chciała być widziana śpiącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokornie panu profesorowi dziękuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieka przed tym duszącym dymem, wciąż kichając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, przestrzegałem cię… ja z krwi twojej i kości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną mi dłoń wypuśćcie na swobodę! — napierała się, zerkając błagalnie na Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był szybki, ale na pewno przemyślany i rozsądny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co z nich będzie? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdybym był dziewczyną, tobym na pewno był kurwą — pomyślał, ale zaraz wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym mieć paniczów w swej kompanii! — westchnął sierżant z głębi duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnęłam? — zapytała rumieniąc się jak jutrzenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli ci wszyscy, którzy zaledwie tydzień temu słuchali moich wierszy i dziwnych przygód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec i jednoręki usunęli się na ubocze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmożone uczucia metafizycznego nienasycenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Felek się nie uspokoił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nienormalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziłam dwójkę dzieci, ale wraz z mężem chcielibyśmy mieć trójkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być woda z kranu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzi do szkoły podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ja teraz zrobię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie powinny nosić krótsze od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem zajrzę tutaj znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam się potem dziwisz i wstydzisz, i żałujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojej, usta otworzył jak wrota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec wziął jednego za uszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położył się na brzegu lejka i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona popatrzyła na jego twarz i przestraszyła się: była tak zmieniona, upiorna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofujące się niemieckie oddziały prawdopodobnie planowały podpalenie budynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaspokoiła ona mej ciekawości — owszem, podnieciła ją tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Emil komicznie się zachowywał, gdy mu powiedziałam o łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26285989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę wycofać swój podpis złożony pod tą wspólną rezolucją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26285990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli uzyskam wsparcie Parlamentu, jestem pewna, że uda nam się to urzeczywistnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26285991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy koniecznie stworzyć interesujące i satysfakcjonujące kierunki studiów dające szanse znalezienia dobrej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26285992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak co racja to racja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26285993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamierzamy wprowadzić do nich radykalne zmiany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma zatem powodów, by dalej opóźniać rozmieszczenie wojsk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne mi będzie wyjaśnienie od przewodniczącej właściwej komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O to chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem sprawozdania z postępów Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy także przecież tak wiele potrzeb w innych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto chciałbym podnieść jeszcze jedną kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bezpieczeństwo, ekologiczność i bardziej inteligentne zastosowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnicy muszą wiedzieć, czym karmią zwierzęta, a konsumenci powinni również wiedzieć, skąd pochodzi pasza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, abyśmy rozmawiali o ludziach i stanowiskach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam się z prośbą o pomoc w zwróceniu Adama jego matce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie grozi nam strzelanie do własnej bramki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy się zastanowić, czy przypadkiem problem nie został wyolbrzymiony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gazownictwa, która wykazuje obecnie swoją wartość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mówi jednak tytuł amerykańskiego filmu \\\"Lepiej późno, niż później\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ wWizja ta dominuje również w komunikacie Komisji, jednakże nie jest to nasza wizja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście popieram bez zastrzeżeń całkowitą wolność prasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Procedury znacznie się od siebie różnią, w związku z czym sytuacja jest wysoce skomplikowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja nie sprzeciwia się wnioskowi o odroczenie głosowania nad rezolucją legislacyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie trudna według mnie jest kwestia wyboru spraw, o których rozmawiamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podróżowałam do Baku i z wielkimi trudnościami zdołałam stamtąd powrócić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wezwania, które kieruje Grupa Sojuszu Liberałów i Demokratów na rzecz Europy są jednoznaczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę również pana przewodniczącego o zainteresowanie się i interwencję w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było rzeczywiście kluczowe zagadnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet najlepsze europejskie statystyki turystyczne nie zmienią tego faktu, dlatego wstrzymałem się od głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawa z korzyścią dla kogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwi mnie jednak fałszywe poczucie bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chiny utracą szacunek w oczach świata, jeśli osoby te nie zostaną uwolnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie cenną pomoc dostarczyły Norwegia, Szwajcaria, Serbia, Rosja oraz Izrael\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kaukaz Południowy ma strategiczne znaczenie dla Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałabym przynajmniej wiedzieć, czy nasze zalecenia będą brane pod uwagę, czy też nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy położyć kres tym nadużyciom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich zdrowie i bezpieczeństwo są zagrożone przez pozbawionych skrupułów pracodawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz Komisja ma możliwość wycofać się z tak niezdrowego stanowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy w tej sprawie nadal działać i tego oczekują od nas nasi obywatele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26286221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie chciałbym odnieść się do uwag w sprawie Unii Śródziemnomorskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć on niby stary, lecz jary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tamten jakby naumyślnie wystawiał się na wciąż nowe ciosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem jej zaraz o tobie, ale wybuchnęła tylko śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślałem nad tym, że społeczeństwo ludzkie to jedna ogromna sieć pomyłek i głupstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie nie chciała, aby „on sobie coś myślał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się w konserwatorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdę mówiąc, nic nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, Liza? — spytała siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z konwencjonalno-fizjologicznego punktu widzenia to on mię miał pewną ilość razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie muszę im w tym pomagać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bądź śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ukrywali jej, ale nie mogli odejść od siebie, aby nienawiść minęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wskazała mi miejsce w łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła polnego świerszcza i na piersiach skryła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy od dawna tu leżę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw udał się do probostwa nie bez pewnej trwogi w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię filmy dokumentalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi krzemień szurnął przez całe biurko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na pewno mi go wziąć nie pozwolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Proszę pana, czy ja mogę pana pocałować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechaliśmy jeszcze dość długo głębokim wąwozem lub brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien był się cieszyć, jak gdyby się po raz drugi urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszliśmy do niego i dziewczęta zaczęły go całować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mi gorąco jak cholera, ale koniec końców usnęłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbym prosić szanownego pana o ogień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy się zobaczymy? Nie odpowiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do własnej torby ją złowię, jak niegdyś zająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obronić się przed straszną koalicją wrogów — otóż pierwsza idea.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie mogę się tak mę czyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym słowem gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zawsze jeździłem na nartach, ale może w tym roku spróbuję na snowboardzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy napełniły oczy słuchaczy, a mury budynku zadrżały od okrzyków zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, co to nie chodzą po ulicy, co siedzą w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pewien czas udawali, że nic nie czują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni żyją dla demokracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszła do nieba — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbyś spróbować naprawić mi komputer?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi do mnie dziecinko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli ci wszyscy, którzy zaledwie tydzień temu słuchali moich wierszy i dziwnych przygód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przylepiać się do niej, zdrabniać jej imię, nazwy części ciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział mi jej równy, głęboki oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skarbca królewskiego wypłacić mu sto tysięcy dukatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę marnie zdechnąć w mej ciemnej norze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zające gonimy i szukamy lalek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nie kocham go, lecz nie chcę z nim zrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wolno takich rzeczy pamiętać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczestniczę w obecnej debacie w imieniu mojego kolegi, pana komisarza Almunii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta dyrektywa jest nam potrzebna jak przysłowiowa dziura w moście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram pozytywny kierunek obrany przez wniosek w programie dotyczącym Afryki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest problem, którym musimy się zająć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że przedmiotowe sprawozdanie wskazuje we właściwym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że można tutaj poszukiwać dalszych oszczędności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kontekście tych negocjacji problemem jest oczywiście nadmierna tajność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmie on Białorusi niemało czasu, i na tej drodze pojawi się wiele przeszkód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec przypomnę państwu, że Unia Europejska wysłała na wybory misję obserwacyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27002773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejna sprawa pewnie wykracza poza zakres pana obowiązków i dzisiejszej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"By móc działać, potrzebują aby zaspokojone były ich ogromne potrzeby w zakresie praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje pytanie dotyczy następującej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że znaleźliśmy się w poważnej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostosowanie naszych wysiłków do naszego podejścia stanowi kluczowy aspekt tego planu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele tęgich głów z danego dnia staje się następnego dnia miernotami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustanowienie Europejskiej Fundacji Kształcenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, także my, w samym Parlamencie, nie spełniamy wymogu wielojęzyczności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja nie może jednak działać poza ramami prawnymi ustanowionymi traktatami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić, że zacytuję uwagi agencji pomocy, która dziś się ze mną skontaktowała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie było strasznie gorzkie i dawało się na wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniony tytuł brzmiałby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże propozycja rozszerzenia przepisów antydyskryminacyjnych na praktycznie wszystkie dziedziny życia jest całkowicie nierealna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu zaproponowano zawieszenie wszystkich projektów budowlanych, tak jakby to miało rozwiązać problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto konieczne są trzy rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jest to istotne zdanie, które ukazuje naszą powinność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również ja nie mogłabym się zgodzić na więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ustanowienie silnego i wiarygodnego banku centralnego, stworzenie stabilnej nowej waluty i zbudowanie zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgubne konsekwencje procederu podrabiania towarów dają się odczuć w nowych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka spójności ma swoich zwolenników, ale ma też i krytyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiana czasu na letni i zimowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli wprowadzimy dodatkowe zobowiązanie w odniesieniu do biogazu, ryzykujemy, że nie będziemy wystarczająco skoncentrowani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o wymiarze społecznym, gospodarczym i ekologicznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę przedstawić pewną informację uzupełniającą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada i Komisja powinny wygłosić oświadczenie na temat katastrofy na Morzu Czarnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo różnic, większość krajów sąsiedztwa ma wspólne cechy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prawdziwa droga do zmiany sytuacji na Białorusi, niekoniecznie są nią nasze rezolucje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27030826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Standardy jakościowe pozostaną we właściwościach państw członkowskich, podczas gdy standardy bezpieczeństwa będą ogólnoeuropejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przylgnął do niego zły oddech dwóch tysiącleci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się dzieje z naszą literaturą i teatrem — to skandal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do własnej torby ją złowię, jak niegdyś zająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczepić ją podczas pauzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczy chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zobaczyłem jak na dłoni cały klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc nie chcesz obiecać, że mu nie będziesz dokuczał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy zdawał się nie zwracać nań najmniejszej uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba wyrzeczenia się — tylko za tę cenę można pokonać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez szyby dojrzałem wkrótce białe czoło, brwi ciemne, wiśniowe usta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy?” „W niedzielę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pa Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebyście mi się nie ważyli słówka komukolwiek pisnąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sprawiało to jednak żadnego uszczerbku w moim zapale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze współczuciem spojrzał na zabrakowanego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz uczestniczy w spotkaniach, ale to było dużo, dużo wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko starannie schował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nieoczekiwane zestawienia» i «potworna wyobraźnia», tak mówił Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nic nie powiedział, jeno ukosem spojrzał na spuchniętą od żądeł lewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał trzech duchowych ojców i bibliotekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzyłem dni i zrobiło mi się nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co, do zobaczenia za miesiąc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mógł prowadzić rozmowy, której przedtem nie obmyślił szczegółowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś lalką, niczym więcej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdziesz się bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się gdzieś podziała jego liberia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mówił zdrobniale: dziewulinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdźmy z naszym problemem pomiędzy lud prymitywny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przez długie lata byłem nieobliczalnie smutną ofiarą nieustannej i niestrudzonej wstydliwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieokreślone, ale pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł żwawo głowę jak cebulkę i zobaczył mały wózek z jarzynami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłem napisać coś więcej, skoro nic więcej nie wiedziałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Objawy sercowe ustępują, jako też skłonność do torsji i osłabienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana była w prostą suknię dorastającej smarkuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam czasu na twoje wymówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobista współpraca zbyteczna — recytował ogłoszenie, którego się nauczył na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pomocnikiem nauczyciela w nędznej prowincjonalnej szkółce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba ten niebieskooki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeleciał przez mur! — zawołała Maria, śledząca lot ptaszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To w co gramy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykazanie mówi: „Czcij ojca”, a nie każdego, że się wcześniej urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz poczekaj tu na mnie chwilkę, drogi przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkałem ją raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Potrzebuję nareszcie umyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była tylko w koszuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęła ją zgroza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robię po prostu bilans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszła, cofając się wolno, tyłem, jak teatralny paź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś w oddali dudniły tramwaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na jednej z ławek i utonąłem w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ma złość do naszej panienki i rzucił uroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli znowu — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, tak — pamiętam — odpowiedział ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jedenastej znowu poszedłem do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samoloty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca i mówi: — To był telefon z kliniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Kuba Bogu, tak Bóg Kubie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyleczył pana człowiek bez doktorskiego dyplomu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem opadł i zaczął się tlić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomogę pamięci — ciągnąłem, poprawiając się na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można by udowodnić jego winę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy tu w tym pokoju, gdzie teraz stukot maszyny nasuwa skojarzenia ostatniej jazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną jest tak samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"But się rozpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jej dotknąć, podobnie jak lubię dotykać małe koty i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak szła po schodach, jak otwierała drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce krąży wokół Ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby to zrobił, nie miałabym pretensji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nim pan przyjechał, ja zawsze wiedziałam, z którego miasta są goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie boję się, tylko chcę wiedzieć, jak to będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dorosła, aby to zrozumieć, jak należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla bezpieczeństwa wysyłali zawsze naprzód na zwiady kilku ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka tygodni coś jakby odgradzało je od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie pójdziemy zwykłą drogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najweselsza rzecz, jaką znam, to historia mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile zostało nabojów? - spytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Funt brytyjski - jego kurs względem dolara i euro jest zmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało zaciśnięte piąstki, a ciałem jego wstrząsały dreszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To dobrze — oj, dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jakie, to już moja tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie było to niczym nadzwyczajnym, że sama przynosiła jedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzenie pierwsze i dziesiąte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopiec westchnął i rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego czeka coś gorszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam teraz jesteś winien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wesołość moja nie tylko wytrąciła go z równowagi, ale nawet dotknęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niszczyli przy tym wsie i osady, pustoszyli pola, przelewali rzeki krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wrócili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostował się dość szybko, by dostrzec jeszcze niewyraźny kształt zwierzęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ci myszkę pokażę, zaraz pożałujesz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to się trzęsie, stare próchno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przycisnął ją do piersi i ucałował parokrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się to dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samica wypełzła ostrożnie na szeroka polanę leśną. Długą chwilę stała tam sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miałeś już dość czasu, dłużej czekać nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Przyda ci się może! - zawołał Henry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tata jest człowiekiem sprawiedliwym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O… słyszysz hałas… kroki… ktoś nadchodzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mów tego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebo uczyniło się granatowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwie go smokiem lub bucem, i rzecz oczywista\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cicho mi zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobre rzeczy do jedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karol nie pokazywał się wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez podręcznego plecaka, nie dałby rady tego dokonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Henry obejrzał się troskliwie wokoło i potrząsnął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po prostu zatkany jak zlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aż mi jej żal… chociaż takie to ładne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy troje podbiegli ku oknu, by się przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20873733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc cóż z tego wyniknie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spostrzegł wielki kamień leżący pod bramą, wyrwał go i przeszedł tym otworem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włodzio już zdrów po odrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień, w którym pan będzie wolny, może jest niedaleki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tutaj porabiasz, młokosie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje Francja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem, że dawniej czytałem i co mi z tego przyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25458969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe życie nie zdejmę żałoby, choć w czarnym kolorze wyglądam jak istne straszydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nocy stary pan chodził po całym domu, wcale się spać nie kładąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawi mnie pan w spokoju i niebawem powrócę do równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Boga wspaniały to był widok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zaraz przystąpić do dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruperta wszedłszy do swego pokoju obejrzała łóżko, przetrzęsła szafy, jako też każdy kącik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była może godzina druga, gdy wyruszyli w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czarnego papieru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekaj, wybiła twoja ostatnia godzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy już tego dobrego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co też on mógł popełnić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego drzewa dojrzał wiatr trzech chłopców znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiedziałam, że mi nie zrobisz nic złego — powtórzyła dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś, lubo bez porównania silniejszy, z największym trudem utrzymywał się na nogach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy wszystko o Mistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"powinieneś wiedzieć przynajmniej moje nazwisko; nazywam się...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za delikatność i wykończenie w tych płasko-rzeźbach i wypukłościach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość w obozie kapitana Glena i doktora Clarego nie miała granic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem mama zaczęła wyciągać gałązki, które wrona wplotła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otrzymywał razy coraz częstsze i nie używał nawet ruchów obronnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja już za stary na naukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestraszyłem się sam własnego głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie usłyszałem ze wszystkich stron ludzkie głosy, krzyki, nawoływania i tupot wielu nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie płacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem to po tem, iż słyszałem bardzo blisko ich głosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie, że tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siedemnasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie nie poznajesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chętnie przyjmował mnie u siebie i zawsze po mnie posyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pod pewnym względem naprawdę się poprawił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałby kto, że podziwia obraz, albo jakiś słynny pomnik...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to jej i zrozumiała mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarłem zimny pot z czoła, i zacząłem na nowo kuć plany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25459185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprowadź mnie do tej swojej szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udawały mu się czasem cięte odpowiedzi, ponieważ dużo czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, chcę go obejrzeć dokładniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieubłagana wola kierowała mnie w stronę Parkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to znaczy? Nic nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w ogóle nie wiem, co on robi, jak żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba przyznać, że raz na zawsze nauczył się dużo i dużym kosztem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemności czuł się jak w dużej wodzie i bał się zanurzyć w sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz zasnął na przyrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz im całą historię, mości Ryszardzie — wtrącił się Puk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taniec — to kręcenie się w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało mojej matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrojem będzie rodzaj miłości, który nie daje żadnych objawów somatycznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytała: — Idziesz też do miasta? — Czekam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś aportował jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano krzyknął: — Marysiu! Otwarła oczy, zanurzone w śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi guzik na trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znała aż za dużo historyjek z małymi dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby uniknąć zatorów drogowych, Rada Miasta wprowadziła również dodatkowe, bezpłatne przejazdy autobusowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też zrobię świnkę! — zawołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można by tu zrobić dygresję do psychologii całości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drodze mrużył oczy, które wydawały się jak wprawione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzeczywistość, to straszliwa w swej prostocie rzeczywistość!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ma pan rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ci na imię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Litość brała patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suche zioła kruszyły się i ciemnym deszczem opadały na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosimy przygotować bilet odbioru bagażu do okazania przy opuszczaniu terminala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wziąłem tylko dwa obrazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan sam nie wiesz, co czynisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy więc obaj przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę to zresztą zrobić dla bezpieczeństwa mej własnej osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr porwał mi gdzieś czapkę, ale nawet tego nie zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzecz jedyna na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko stało się tak nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innych więźniów przecież nie było, aby ich można było zawlec przed trybunał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Występując na przód estrady, odezwał się głosem pełnym spokoju i godności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czegóż po takiej sensacji może się jeszcze spodziewać w życiu dziennikarz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznaję się do tego z całą skromnością, ale się przyznaję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że okrutnie boi się żab i ropuch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchnął śmiechem ujrzawszy dwa cylindry tlenu na wózku naszego tragarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale noc dzisiejsza będzie już ostatnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie, ten, na siwym koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż pułkownik na to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałbym nawet, że to umysł funkcjonował wadliwie i że wola go opanowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem, gwałtownym ruchem, twarz dźwignęła się wyżej i ukazała długą, obnażoną szyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, życie dla młodego, zdrowego mężczyzny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że wskutek upału czułem się oszołomiony przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd potem poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłano mnie, abym się dowiedział, co się z panem stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był zupełnie zatopiony w tem zajęciu, gdy dorożkarz wszedł do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waszem zadaniem będzie, bracie, uczyć go naszej świętej wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22160802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to cieszy mnie to, iż się smucisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25217984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już on będzie wiedział, co to za jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25217985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc niewiadomo, czem jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25217987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on naprawdę taki śpioch, czy tylko udaje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25217988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co oni widzieli w tej chudej, czarniawej dziewczynce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylądowałem z tamtej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszak ten człowiek publicznie mnie znieważył!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawołał go więc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak daleko zaszły moje przypuszczenia, kiedy przyszliśmy oglądnąć teren działania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważył nas, chyba mamy przerąbane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierścień na palcu mnicha jest niemożliwem zjawiskiem, gdyż przysięga on na bezwzględne ubóstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem to po nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już to nieraz tak zemną zrobiłaś!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto są talerze — objaśniła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich swatów dziesiątki przewijają się przez nasz sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten jeszcze kibel zajmuje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem ciekawy, co będzie dzisiaj na obiad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem piechota runęłaby w zwartych szeregach, i rozniosłaby to skrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz wróćmy do naszego interesu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jakże daleko jest mój Jowisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, jak na ulicy grad uderzył o szyby i głuchy grzmot przeciął powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zabrali ze sobą jego towarzyszów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wynosi zasiłek opiekuńczy w czasie epidemii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to ja ciebie namawiałem ażebyś wszedł do pokoju Katarzyny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"z braciszkiem, z matką i z dużym, czarnym pudlem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wszystko z rozmysłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi i wydał rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Miłość Boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy w każdym języku z czasem zmieniają znaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już mowy ani wzmianki o ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz to panom wyjaśnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to mogło być?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawimy się w szpiegów w kraju nieprzyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O mój Boże!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się, gdyż zamiłowanie do hazardu poruszyło się w nim potężnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kląłem, ściągałem cugle, rwałem, ale byłem bezsilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metro było budowane odkrywkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"więc to dlatego pan zachowywał się tak dziwnie w sygnałowej wieży!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą się słuchać i basta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak w nich profesorów najważniejszych przedmiotów, tak że wykłady skutkiem tego są wstrzymane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli wyruszyć nazajutrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie środki ochronne musi zapewnić pracodawca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25218117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym nie był powrócił, tobyś dziś jeszcze była panną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz muszę stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Teresa — ta prawdziwa — jest w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bogiem, a bóg jest mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na żadne wołania, wrzaski nie zwracała uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki pies chciał mnie ukąsić…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wybuchu śmiechu zaci nało się coś w niej: zegar, który przestał nagle chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem nadmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła jego wywrócone oczy i połyskujące białka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko krowy rodzą cielęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochał Indian, detektywów, włamywaczy i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpiłem, że i ona poznała mnie także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniłaś opony w samochodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nas powiadomiono o wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie zaczęło się od grania, bo u mnie w pokoju jest rozklekotane pianino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogrodnik oblewa je płynem dezynfekcyjnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemia skąpana blaskiem gwiazd wygląda jak cichy kraj z bajki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czegóż innego się lęka?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tłusta, nalana twarz drżała jakąś zła namiętnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyrzekasz uczynić to samo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaś słuchałem niestworzonych bredni z zapartym prawie oddechem, cały w pobożnem skupieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że okrutnie boi się żab i ropuch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ton jego głosu i wyraz twarzy były poważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i Mrucząc i wyrzekając potoczył się za mną, jak zirytowany, groźny brytan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziennikarz zdawał się bardziej jeszcze zdumionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pańska zapłata to trzynaście tysięcy czterysta pięćdziesiąt siedem dolarów i osiemnaście centów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał, jak nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Przed chwilą wróciliśmy z wyprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże, co za nieprzyzwoite zachowanie się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto organizuje odbiorców końcowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skrzydła uderzyły dwa inne, bratnie pułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, gdyż Francuzi podróżują rzadko po świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszałem nic i nic nie widziałem, ale wiem doskonale co to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi doprawdy, że musiałem pana deranżować z powodu takiego głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepszy miał iść, ale tego najlepszego nie chciał się wyrzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galopem przypadł ku nam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż za głupiec ze mnie, cóż za głupiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zdumiewające.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naraz głos Adriatyku ustał i cichym szeptem zaszemrała fala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodał nam odwagi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem go w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było najzupełniej ciemno, zwłaszcza, gdy zamknąłem drzwi za sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeznaczenie zsyła mi ciebie dziś rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22379696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie groźni, brodaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej towarzysze za jej przykładem zerwali po tataraku i gryząc wilgotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później nastała noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosiu, przestań gryźć mamę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do poniedziałku może być koniec świata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drugie danie tu ci przyniosą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wszyscy razem nadzwyczajnie rozpuszczone łobuzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siadłszy na kubełku wapna, począł obmyślać fortele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lipcowe słońce przypiekało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Planowaliśmy w trójkę pojechać w Bieszczady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku tu jestem i zawsze mi mało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak chcę i muszę, to nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile energii na to idzie — strach pomyśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sobie wyobrazić, że jest chory, który umrze, jeśli się czegoś nie postanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma co się namyślać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się tak wpatrujesz we mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w ogóle nie wiem, co on robi, jak żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę być w oknie pociągu w Rudawie, gdzie będę wsiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że jest martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — jęczał przewodnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może postawić pałki tym, którzy myśleli o lekcji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że tu w hotelu nie ma nocników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to wcale nie bolało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu kobiety nie zbuntują się przeciw tym strojom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królowie mieszkają w hotelu, ja wynająłem mały pokoik w rybackiej chacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musiał być chyba przyjemny, bo przed samym przebudzeniem uśmiechnęłaś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, kogo znajdę w tym gronie, ale walka trwała krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi rozwiązać tę zagadkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaciągnąwszy się parę razy dymem z papierosa, wrócił do Stachy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa wyjdzie ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają po kilkaset metrów długości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polata, jak one, na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokuczamy jej czasem, ale dzielna z niej dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dać się skusić tej „dobroci” i rżnąć dalej — oto zadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę iść z jakimś gówniarzem na wodę sodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł dwie ulice — znów to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka znowu na jego wyznanie — długo, tęsknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faunie, mów, czego się żalisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz za interes?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci są lekkomyślne i niedoświadczone…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pianista dlatego nie może grać, bo zdaje sobie sprawę, że może nie móc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj odprawę i zbądź kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest gryzoniem, ale gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na leżaku i zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto da się przeważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wierusz odprowadzał chorą materię już ku palcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił powoli swoje przezroczyste oczy i jego usta stały się jeszcze bardziej wąskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością oczekuję przyszłego poniedziałku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem znosiliśmy ławki i krzesła do sal prelekcyjnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zwykle obieram samotny przedział i płacę za to gruby napiwek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była naprawdę wielce zakłopotana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dla mężczyzn życie jest sztuką, gdzie większość z nich zaledwie istnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwią już liczne komentarze na temat jej najnowszego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i tak jest zaiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadał pomału, gdy nagle odczuł nienawiść wobec poko jówki Józi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jem przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, jakie spotkania miałam na dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — szepnął z uśmiechem i pogardliwie spojrzawszy na jednorękiego, przywołał go ruchem dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich staraniach uzyskałem miejsce drugiego nauczyciela w niższym zakładzie naukowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze partie co śmielszych przechodzą przez murek i wsiąkają w miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Derkacz — rzekł chrapliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć piękne, duże lustro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo to nie moje — odparła Marta z godnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna owych ucieczek pozostała nigdy nie wyjaśnioną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest błędne koło, z którego nie ma wyjścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Termin dla mnie niezupełnie jasny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała wtedy tak: cierpiała na zanik nosa na perkato.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli ulicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocalał guzik i część drutu rozpiętego na parkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinno ono być przedmiotem handlu w żadnej formie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem tylko człowiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wszyscy diabli…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — potwierdził z głęboką zadumą jednoręki, pilnie i nabożnie zajęty niespodzianą wyżerką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, obawiam się, że nie mam pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd jeszcze, po rocznej przerwie, było w tym śmiechu coś poobiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tzw. w magii „powrotne uderzenie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znać od dawna już nikt nie używał tej ścieżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie przystąpiliśmy dotychczas do właściwej rzeczy, która mnie tu sprowadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale mnie potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywołać go może zbytnie nasilenie myśli lub nadzwyczajne napięcie uczuciowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za napój?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda wyjdzie zawsze na jaw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie tego cudu zaniedbało się obejrzeć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest stanowczo ktoś inny — uspokoił ją, wchodząc do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurczowo zacisnął dłoń na kolbie rewolweru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwiami trzaskają, krzyczą, wiercą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za ten tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba szukać nowej gospody, póki jeszcze brzuszek pełen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc byłem aresztowany!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się tak, aby to mogło na wszelki wypadek wszystko oznaczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona wprost tyje… a niedawno wyglądała jak wygłodzony gawron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istne cacko! — unosił się w dalszym ciągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co znaczą argumenty wobec „nie sprawiło mi przyjemności”? Poczuł, że jest całkiem bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi zesłał tę nieznajomą kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem o parę kroków przed nim i zacząłem go usypiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20755738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął się mord i rabunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił: — Takie to porządki, że wszystko leży ułożone i niczego nie można znaleźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całował ją długo, podczas gdy ona patrzyła na niego uważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może chce pani przejść się tamtędy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej, ruszaj się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszli szybko na „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisałem drugą książkę: Co lepsze: czy guziki blaszane, czy rogowe?.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zwracał na niego uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ta mnie drapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że będą się spotykać, ale nie tak, jak do tychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy się zobaczymy? Nie odpowiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako zbieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głowę zawracasz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubię ten szum, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani, że to przede wszystkim osoby starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam zegarek, wąsy, biurko z szufladami, wszystko mam jak dorośli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan pójdzie tam ze mną, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polata, jak one, na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podłodze też nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tu sama gospodyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd panu przyszło to na myśl właśnie w tej chwili?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na morzu zaskoczyła ich taka sobie burza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już jest prawie jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wstydź się, ja też nie bardzo umiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na tym nie koniec; posłuchaj rzeczy prawdziwej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komary latały dookoła nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie Klementyna była królową balu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą kto wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj! — krzyknął pierwszy kulawiec, niecierpliwie wychuchując z gęby zapach połkniętego tataraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty mnie do tego zmusiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale dlaczego musiało być właśnie wtedy? — Nie martwisz się, że było wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie idzie mi tu oczywiście o walkę z logiką…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dotrzymam jej wiernie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zwracał na niego uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, młodzi wieśniacy, nie umieliśmy jeszcze drwić sobie z wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanapa, jeśli nie skakać, przetrwa dziesiątki lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewał dalej jak szalony, wydymając swą maleńką gardziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ja jestem od niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj przyjaciele, milcząc, spojrzeli wzajem po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko paru obrazki narysowało i położyliśmy na stoliku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On załatwił na mnie szybko swoje sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz pospieszył do sieni i niecierpliwie otwarł drzwi wiodące na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz stała się rzecz najsmutniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiar nasz mieliśmy zrealizować zaraz nazajutrz po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest interes pewny, tylko czy warto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ich twarzach malowały się głęboki szacunek i przestrach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien mądry człowiek o chrystianizmie: „Stal można złamać, guma jest niezwal- czona”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy ocknął się z zamyślenia i spojrzał nań przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz — ty sam zginiesz, a ja razem z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem następuje uzasadnienie, jak zwykle przekonujące, ale nieprawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, posiada pan duży talent konwersacyjny, zwłaszcza w kierunku parowania pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też tak myślę — powiedziała Pola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten bieg wciąż jeszcze wzmagał się od siarczystych razów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obyśmy wszyscy żyli dobrze i zgodnie z sobą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pagórku stał żółty dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile minut dziennie powinienem trenować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebracy leżeli w słoneczne dni na trotuarze i spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — przypominam sobie… złotą czarę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim byś był, gdybyś tego nie robił, nie dowiesz się nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż… mój mąż! — wrzasnęła mu w ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jutro, chcę dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko nie bujasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten starzec jeszcze śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano byle jaką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pojedziemy dalej gondolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej jest wiadomym, że monogamia stanowi podstawę własności osobistej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żreć, ile wlezie, i spać, choćby co chwila — nic to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta tłumaczą sobie owo prawo inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ogólnego, nie wyłączając wora, milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie pod ciśnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radio grało z daleka na pełnym głośniku łzawy szlagier, ohydnie sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tutaj wieją dziwne wiatry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu dopiero była ciżba, jakby na jarmarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"One to wykonywały ruchy, których nie chciałem i nie zamierzałem wykonywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No myślałby kto...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co za obrona konieczna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Margrabia chcąc jednak dowiedzieć się przyczyny tej wesołości, przerwał pierwszy jej wybuchy zapytaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze jest pełne słodkiej woni bzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzieliście kiedy Turków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawołaj go, gdyby ci czego było potrzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zaklęty jej pięknością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i taka żoneczka niewiele zostawiłaby mu chwil wolnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary także się zatrzymał, chwiejąc się na nogach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firanki czerwone, które powinny były w niem się odbijać, znikły zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniale to szelma robił!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najokropniejsze są armaty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale najboleśniejsze wrażenie wywierał widok dzieci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocknął się w panu sportsmen!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie miałem czas na posiłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustaw termostat w dużym pokoju na maksimum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj mogłem się doskonale ukryć do wieczora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupi był koncept.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak; tylko w ten sposób mogło się to odbyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za chwilę ktoś zbiegał po schodach i pędził prosto do mojej celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziś jeszcze żartując, szlachta się pytała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również żaden z jego towarzyszów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem pomieszanie zmysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz będziecie zdrowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby to miała być kobieta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zwalniał kroku i czuł, że niecierpliwość piersi mu rozsadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jednym z nich chcę właśnie mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziłem już dwie księgi i zagłębiłem się dobrze w trzeciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dole napisał: „Mój pamiętnik na wyspie bezludnej Białego Szatana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak jest, głuchoniemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy muszą być szczęśliwi, nawet konie!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli zaś nie nastąpi i bez niego wytrwam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszliśmy przez polankę i wprost do pnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka zaś dozwalała patrzeć na siebie z anielską ufnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służący wyszedł, Wokulski czuł się zupełnie otrzeźwionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klnę się na Mękę Zbawiciela!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani Wąsowska przygryzła usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie silcie się na schwytanie tajemniczego pana na rowerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ci są wybrani, dla kogo w rzeczach pięknych nic nie ma poza Pięknem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25245434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz jego nagle spoważniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pierwszy problem, zaś drugi dotyczy sygnałów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przyszłości ważny będzie gaz i ważna będzie ropa naftowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie mam racji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej wyborców podchodzi do mnie i mówi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemawiam w imieniu mojej grupy jako całości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sposób nie docenić znaczenia wody, jak również konieczności gospodarowania nią we właściwy sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kończąc, chcę powiedzieć, że musimy uważać na to, jak reformujemy naszą politykę rolną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczna, stabilna i adekwatna emerytura, która jest właśnie taką gwarancją, jakiej chcą obywatele Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że tak powinno być dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy wiedzy, jak podjąć profilaktyczne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani poseł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to uznać bez wątpienia za podstawową zasadę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie powinno to także obejmować firm poza Europą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócę teraz do Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to biorąc pod uwagę znaczenie dyskutowanego instrumentu będę głosować \\\"za\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem chciałabym przyjąć także inicjatywę Parlamentu Europejskiego, dotyczącą wysłania delegacji do Tunezji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem przeciwko przedmiotowemu wspólnemu wnioskowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy dopuścić do podobnej sytuacji tutaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Modelu społecznej gospodarki rynkowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27659139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku przy sporządzaniu programów prac prowadzimy konsultacje z odpowiednimi zainteresowanymi stronami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27664482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handel pomiędzy narodami jest rzeczą pozytywną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27664484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy czas, abyśmy ponownie nadali bieg sprawom związanym z obszarem handlu i inwestycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27664485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
